        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "s, m. <i>surplus, store,</i> Ver. 17, Dipl. v. 10, Fms. iv. 236, K. Þ. K. 163, in the phrase, með afgöngum, <i>to spare,</i> Fms. iii. 108; afgangs, gen. used adverbially, <i>over, to spare,</i> l. c., v. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
