          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alda-mót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the meeting of two cycles;</i> tveim vetrum síðar varð alda-mót, <i>two years after</i> (i. e. two years after A. D. 1118) <i>there was a change of cycles,</i> so that the year 1121 is the first in a new lunar cycle, see Rb. s.a.: mod. <i>the meeting of two centuries,</i> síðustu aldamót, <i>the last</i> aldamót (i. e. the time about A. D. 1800).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
