        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>garden, orchard,</i> Lat. <i>hortus;</i> víngarða, akra ok aldingarða, Stj. 441. 1 Sam. viii. 14, where aldingarða answers to <i>olive-yards</i>, Fms. iii. 194.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
