        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ar, m. <i>wood of fruit-trees,</i> Stj. Judg. xv. 5, where víngarðar, olivatré ok aldinskógar answer to the Engl. <i>vineyards and olives.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aldin-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aldin-tré
