          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>als,</strong> conj. [Ulf. <i>allis = γάρ;</i> Engl. <i>as</i>, contr. = <i>als;</i> cp. the consecutive <i>als</i> in Grimm D. W. sub voce, col. 257 sqq.], <i>as, while, since;</i> freq. in Lex. Poët. in old poets, less freq. in old prose writers, rare in the classics of the 13th century: used four times in the treatise of Thorodd,—alls hann sjálfr er hebreskr stafr, Skálda 167; alls vér erum einnar tungu, 161; alls engi grein er enn á gör, 162; alls þeir höfðu áðr allir eitt hljóð, 166,—and as often in the old Heiðarv. S.—alls þú ert góðr drengr kallaðr, Ísl. ii. 366; alls Barði var eigi bítr á fébætr, 386; alls þú rekr þitt erendi, 483; alls þú hefir þó hér til nokkorar ásjá ætlað, Ld. 42; alls þeir máttu ekki sínum vilja fram koma, Boll. 348; alls hann trúir mér til, Fs. (Hallfr. S.) 90: alls þú hefir þó áðr giptu til mín sótt, Fms. v. 254; alls þeir höfðu frítt lið, viii. 362 . With the addition of ‘er’ (at); en þó, alls er þú ert svá þráhaldr á þínu máli, Fms. i. 305; alls er ek reyni, at…, <i>as I …,</i> ii. 262, (Grág. i. 142 is a false reading = allt), Fas. ii. 283: with addition of ‘þó,’ alls þó hefir þetta með meirum fádæmum gengið, heldr en hvert annara, þá vil ek …, <i>but considering that…,</i> Band. 32 new Ed.; cp. Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-endis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-endis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": " or <strong>alls-hendis,</strong> adv.—scarcely to be derived from ‘hönd’—<i>in every respect, quite, thoroughly,</i> used almost exclusively in connection with a preceding negative, eigi, eingi, or the like, and giving additional force to the negation; er þat hugboð mitt, at vér berim eigi agæfu til um vár skipti, <i>it is my foreboding, that we shall not carry luck with us to the very end of our dealings,</i> Ld. 160; eigi til allsendis, id., Eg. 75; þat er reynt at eingi maðr heldr sínum þrifnaði til allsendis, <i>it is proved that no man holds his thriving thoroughly,</i> Fms. i. 295.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-hattar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-háttar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [háttr], <i>of every sort, kind;</i> a. kurteysi, <i>thoroughly good manners,</i> Fms. i. 17 (freq.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-herjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-herjar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "an old, obsolete gen. from herr; Drottinn Sabaoth is in the Icel. transl. of the Bible rendered by Drottinn Allsherjar, <i>the Lord of Hosts.</i> It is esp. used as an adv. in some political and legal terms, denoting something <i>general, public, common.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-konar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-konar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[Old Engl. <i>alkyn</i>], prop. an obsolete gen. from a masc. konr:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-kostar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-kostar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [kostr], <i>in all respects, quite, altogether;</i> a. illa, <i>bad altogether,</i> Ld. 232; þykjast nú a. hafa unninn mikinn sigr (<i>a full victory),</i> Fms. xi. 147; frjáls ok a. geymandi, <i>to be observed in every respect,</i> K. Á. 50; hann lofaði a., <i>made a full allowance,</i> Bs. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-kyns"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-kyns
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [kyn] = allskonar, Fms. x. 380. II. 2, 25, where it is spelt allskuns.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-stadar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-staðar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [staðr], freq. <strong>alstaðar</strong> or <strong>allstaðar</strong> in a single word, <i>everywhere, ubique;</i> cp. margstaðar, <i>in many places;</i> sumstaðar, <i>in</i> so <i>me places;</i> einhversstaðar, <i>somewhere;</i> nokkursstaðar, <i>anywhere;</i> allstaðar þar sem, Fms. ii. 81, x. 182. Metaph. <i>in every way</i> (rare); a. mun ek gera at þínu skapi, nema þar, <i>in everything, except that …,</i> Nj. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/alls-valdandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          alls-valdandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [A. S. <i>ealwalda</i>], <i>‘all-wielding,’</i> of God, <i>Almighty,</i> Dipl. iv. 8, Fms. i. 121, Bs. several times.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-bud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-búð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the booth in the parliament</i> (alþingi) <i>belonging to the</i> allsherjargoði. Its site is fixed, Sturl. ii. 44, 126 (referring to events in the year 1215).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a doom of the supreme court, a lawful public sentence, judgment of the full court;</i> þér rufuð allsherjardóm, <i>violated lawful judgment, the law of the land,</i> Fms. iv. 205.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>public property, a domain,</i> Íb. ch. 3, viz. the ground of the Icel. alþingi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-godi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-goði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (v. goði), <i>the supreme priest, pontifex maximus.</i> As the alþingi (q. v.) was within the jurisdiction of the great temple (hof) in Kjalarnes, the keeper or priest of that temple—the descendant of its founder Thorstein Ingolfsson—had the title of supreme priest, and opened the alþingi during the heathen age. At the introduction of Christianity this office remained with the supreme priest, who retained his name; and he, and not the bishop of Skalholt, opened the alþing every year; Þorsteinn Ingólfsson lét setja fyrstr manna þing á Kjalarnesi áðr alþingi var sett, ok fylgir þar enn (<i>still</i>, viz. in the 13th century) sökum þess því goðorði (viz. the priesthood of Kjalarnes, aliter allsherjar goðorð) alþingis helgun, Landn. 336 (the text as found in the Melabók), Landn. 39, Þórð. 94 (Ed. 1860), and Landn. Mantissa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-lid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-lið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>public troops, army</i> (Norse), Fms. x. 411.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-lydr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-lýðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pl. ir, m. <i>the people, commonalty,</i> Hkr. iii. 194.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-log"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-lög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>pl. public law, statute law of the land,</i> in the phrase, at alþingis máli ok allsherjar lögum, Nj. 14, 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/allsherjar-thing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          allsherjar-þing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>general assembly,</i> Fms. i. 224. In Icel. at present allsherjar- is prefixed to a great many other words in order to express what is <i>public, general, universal.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
