        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>common reckoning,</i> Íb. 18: β. (Norse), <i>general census,</i> with a view to making a levy, N. G. L. i. 98; Fr. = almannaþing.",
            }
