        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [cp. afi], <i>grandmother;</i> now in freq. use, but rarely in the Sagas, which use föður-móðir and móður-móðir, Hým. 7, Rm. 16, Edda 109, Nj. 119, Ld. 328. In compds, <strong>ömmu-bróðir, ömmu-systir,</strong> etc.; <strong>lang-amma,</strong> u, f. is <i>a great-grandmother.</i> [In Germ. <i>amme</i> means <i>a nurse</i>.]",
            }
