          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a prefixed prep. [Ulf. uses a separate prep. <i>and; A. S. and-;</i> Germ. <i>ant-, ent-, empf-;</i> it exists in Engl. in <i>an-swer;</i> Lat. <i>ante-;</i> Gr. <i>ἀντι-</i>], denoting whatever is <i>opposite, against, towards,</i> and metaph. <i>hostile, adverse;</i> freq. spelt and pronounced an- or ann-; it is used in a great many compds, v. below. If followed by <i>v,</i> the <i>a</i> changes into <i>ö</i>, e. g. öndverðr, <i>adversus;</i> in andvirði, <i>prize,</i> however, the <i>a</i> is unchanged.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
