              "__html": "and <strong>anndyri,</strong> n. [Lat. <i>atrium;</i> from önd, <i>atrium,</i> q. v.], <i>a porch;</i> hón dró hann fram yfir dyrnar ok svá í anddyrit, Grett. 140, Nj. 140, Fms. ii. 148, Bs. i. 804.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
