        >
          and-lit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. and <strong>annlit,</strong> [and-, <i>adversus,</i> and líta; Ulf. <i>andavleizns = πρύσωπον;</i> A. S. <i>andvlite;</i> Germ. <i>antlitz</i>], <i>a face, countenance;</i> á andliti þeirra, 623. 61; sá ek annlit þitt, id., Nj. 16; þangat horfi anlit er hnakki skyldi, N. G. L. i. 12; Hom. 7 renders <i>in faciem</i> by í andliti. Metaph. auglit is used as more dignified; í augliti Guðs (not andliti), <i>ενώπιον του Θεου, in the eyes</i> or <i>sight of God.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
