          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, and <strong>andróðr,</strong> rs, m. the later form more freq. [and-, <i>róa</i>], <i>pulling against stream and wind;</i> Einarr átti gildan andróða, <i>E. had a hard pull,</i> Fms. vi. 379, v. l. andróðr; róa andróða, vii. 310, (andróðr, Hkr. iii. 440); þeir tóku mikinn andróða, <i>they had a hard pull,</i> Fms. viii. 438, v. l. andróðr; ok er þá sem þeir hafi andróða, Greg. 31; taka andróðra (acc. pl.), Fms. viii. 131, Hkr. iii. 440: cp. the proverb bíðendr eigu byr en bráðir andróða, <i>those who bide have a fair wind, those who are hasty a foul, festina lente, ‘more haste worse speed;’</i> the last part is omitted in old writers when quoting this proverb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-saka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-saka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (<strong>annsaka,</strong> Bret. 162), [A. S. <i>andsäc</i>], <i>to accuse,</i> with acc., Al. 23; hann andsakaði (<i>reprimanded</i>) sveinana harðliga, Sturl. iii. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-skjol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-skjól
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the vane on a chimney-pot,</i> Ísl. Þjóðs. i. 133.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-skoti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-skoti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>annskoti,</strong> a, m. [and-, <i>adversus;</i> skjóta, skoti], prop. <i>an opponent, adversary,</i> one who ‘shoots from the opposite ranks;’ a. lýðs várs ok laga várra, 655 xvi. B; þeir höfðu heyrt at andskotar þeirra vildi verja þeim vígi þingvöllinn, <i>they had heard that their adversaries would keep them by a fight from the parliament field,</i> Íb. ch. 7; eigi mun ek vera í andskota flokki móti honum, Fms. v. 269. 2. metaph. <i>a fiend, devil,</i> transl. of <i>Satan,</i> now only used in that sense and in swearing; nú hefir a. fundit færi á at freista yðvar, Post. 656; far í brott a., <i>ϋπαγε Σατανα,</i> 146; a. ok þeir englar er eptir honumhurfu, Ver. I; dökvir þik, anskoti (voc.), 623. 31, Hom. 108, 109, K. Á. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-spilli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-spilli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>andspjall,</strong> n. <i>colloquy, discourse,</i> Skm. 11, 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-spaenis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-spænis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., a. móti <i>e-m, just opposite,</i> the metaph. being taken from a target (spánn), Snót 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-stefna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to stem against,</i> Fas. iii. 50 (rare).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-streymi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-streymi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. prop. <i>against the tide</i> or <i>current;</i> metaph. <i>adversity,</i> Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-streymr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-streymr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>running against stream;</i> metaph. <i>difficult, cross;</i> Sighvatr var heldr a. um eptirmálin, <i>hard to come to terms with,</i> Sturl. ii. 42; andstreym örlög, <i>ill-fate,</i> Al. 69; kvað Svein jafnan andstreyman verit hafa þeim frændum, <i>had always set his face against,</i> Orkn. 390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-stygd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-stygð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>disgust;</i> vera a. af e-u (now, at e-u), <i>dislike,</i> Róm. 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-styggiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-styggiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>odious, abominable,</i> Hkr. iii. 273.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-styggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-styggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. id., Hom. 102, 623. 31, Sks. 539.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-svar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-svar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>annsvar,</strong> n. [A. S. <i>andsvaru;</i> Hel. uses <i>andvordi</i> and <i>andvordian = respondere;</i> Ulf. <i>andavaurd</i>], <i>an ‘answer,’ response,</i> but in old writers esp. <i>a decision;</i> vera skjótr í andsvörum, <i>prompt in deciding,</i> Fms. i. 277; sagðist til hans hafa vikit um ansvarit, <i>put the case under his decision,</i> vi. 354; munu vit tala fleira áðr ek veita því andsvör, <i>before I decide,</i> Ld. 80; in N. G. L. i. 86 it seems to mean <i>protest, intervention:</i> used of <i>the echo</i> in Al. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-svara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-svara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>annsvara,</strong> að, <i>to answer;</i> þá annsvarar konungrinn, Fms. xi. 56, rare, and in a more formal sense than the simple verb svara.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-syptir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-syptir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [önd, <i>anima,</i> or and-?], <i>sobbing, sighing, hysterical fit,</i> Hom. 121; [Engl. <i>sob</i>; Germ. <i>seufzen</i>].",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-saelis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-sælis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in common talk andhælis, adv. [sól], <i>against the course of the sun</i> (cp. the Scot. ‘widdershins,’ that is, <i>going against the sunshine</i> or <i>the sun’s light,</i> a direction universally considered both in England and Scotland to be most unlucky; see the quot. in Jamieson sub voce), Ísl. ii. 154, Rb. 134; esp. used of witches and ‘uncanny’ appearances; þat gékk öfugt um húsit ok a., <i>it went backwards about the house and against the sun’s course,</i> Eb. 268, Gísl. 33, cp. Fs. (Vd.) 43, 59; hon gékk öfug a. um tréit, ok hafði þar yfir mörg röm ummæli, Grett. 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vaka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-vaka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>sleeplessness, ἀγρυπνία,</i> caused by care or grief, Fms. i. 82; mostly used in pl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vaki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-vaki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. ind. <i>sleepless,</i> now <strong>andvaka;</strong> liggja a., <i>to lie awake,</i> Al. 71, Barl. 10, Mag. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vana"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-vana
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>andvani,</strong> adj. ind., and now <strong>andvanr,</strong> adj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-varda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-varða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to hand over</i> [cp. Dan. <i>overantvorde</i>], rare, Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-vari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-varp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-varp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the act of heaving a sob, sigh,</i> 655 xx. 4, Sks. 39, 688. Freq. in theol. writers, Pass. 40. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-varpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-varpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sob, sigh, breathe deeply,</i> Fms. x. 338, Hom. 155, Sks. 225 (freq.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-varpan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-varpan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>sobbing,</i> Hom. 124, Stj. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vegi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-vegi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>throne,</i> v. öndvegi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vidri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-viðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [veðr], <i>head wind,</i> Fbr. 67, Eg. 87, Fms. i. 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-virdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-virði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [verð], <i>worth, equivalent, value, price;</i> þá skal þat kaup ganga aptr en hinn hafi a. sitt, Gþl. 491; haf þú nú allt saman, skikkjuna ok a., Lv. 50; allt a. hvalsins, <i>the whole value of,</i> Greg. ii. 375; hann tekr þar á móti ofdrykkjuna ok hennar a., <i>reward,</i> Fms. viii. 251.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-virki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-virki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>annvirki,</strong> n. [önn, <i>labour</i> (?); cp. old Germ, <i>antwerk</i> = <i>machina</i>].",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vitni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
