        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a law term.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-vigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-vígr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. in the phrase, vera e-m a., <i>a match for …, as good a swordsman as</i>…; hann var eigi meirr enn a. einum þeirra bræðra, Fms. ii. 165; sagði Gellir sik fleirum mönnum a. en einum, Bs. i. 649.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [v. andorða], <i>objection,</i> Sks. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-aefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-æfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [v. andóf; Ivar Aasen <i>andöva</i> and <i>andov</i>], a boating term, <i>to paddle against tide, current, and wind,</i> so as to prevent the boat from drifting astern; þá féll á stormr svá mikill, at þeir fengu eigi betr en andæft, <i>had nothing better than to lay to,</i> Sturl. ii. 121; the vellum MSS. wrongly andhætt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-aeris"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-æris
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [ár, <i>remus</i>], <i>crossly, perversely,</i> a figure taken from pulling, Lex. Poët.; freq. in the corrupt form andhælis.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/and-aerligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          and-ærligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>cross, odd,</i> Lex. Poët.; now <strong>andhælislegr.</strong>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/anda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          anda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. has <i>us-anan</i> = <i>ἐκπνειν</i>; cp. Gr. <i>ανεμος</i>, <i>wind,</i> and Lat. <i>animus, anima, spirit, breath:</i> the Germans say geist, <i>spirit</i>, and athmen, <i>spirare:</i> Ulf. translates <i>πνευμα</i> by <i>ahma, νους</i> by <i>aha</i>; Hel. <i>spiritus</i> by <i>gêst</i> and <i>athom,</i> whence Germ. <i>athmen:</i> cp. Swed. ånd, ånde, <i>spiritus, spirare.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/anda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          anda-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>andar-,</strong> the compds belonging to önd, <i>anima,</i> and önd, <i>a duck,</i> v. sub voce önd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/anda-gipt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          anda-gipt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>inspiration, gift of the Holy Ghost,</i> Fms. iv. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/anda-kast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          anda-kast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>breathing,</i> Fas. iii. 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
