      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/annall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          annáll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "s, m. [Lat. <i>annalis</i>], <i>an annal, record, chronological register,</i> Bs. i. 789, 415. 13. It sometimes, esp. in deeds, appears to mean <i>histories</i> in general (cp. Lat. <i>annales</i>); annálar á tólf bókum norrænir, Vm. in a deed of the 14th century, where it probably means <i>Sagas:</i> fróðir annálar ok vísindabækr, <i>histories,</i> Pr. 402, Al. 29. The true old Icel. annalists cease in the year 1430, and were again resumed in the middle of the 16th century.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
