        >
          aptr-kváma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and later form <strong>aptrkoma,</strong> u, f. <i>return, coming back,</i> Sks. 550 B; Fms. xi. 312, a vellum MS. of the end of the 15th century, has aptrkoma.",
            }
