        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aptr-kvaemt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aptr-kvæmt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>return from exile,</i> used substantively as a law term in the phrase, eiga (eigi) a., of a temporary or lifelong exile; þat varðar skóggang… eigi eigi a. nema lof biskupa ok lögréttumanna fáist framar, … <i>not to be suffered to return from exile unless the leave of the bishops and the legislature be first got,</i> Grág. i. 347: in a gener. sense, sýnist mér sem engum várum sé a., ef hans er eigi hefnt, <i>it seems to me that not one of us can shew his face again, if he be not revenged,</i> Glúm. 332.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aptr-lausn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aptr-lausn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>redemption, ransom,</i> Hom. 118; a law term, <i>right of redeeming,</i> Gþl. 304: hence COMPD <strong>aptrlausnar-jörð,</strong> f. <i>land which is redeemable,</i> N. G. L. i. 344.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aptr-mjor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aptr-mjór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>tapering behind,</i> Edda 40 (of the salmon’s tail).",
            }
