        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "s, m. [Ulf. <i>arbi,</i> neut.; A. S. <i>yrfe.</i>] It originally meant <i>cattle, pecus, pecunia,</i> as may be inferred from the A. S. <i>orf</i> = <i>pecus, cattle,</i> and <i>yrfe</i> = <i>opes;</i> Hel. <i>arf</i> and <i>urf;</i> Ormul. <i>errfe;</i> v. Ihre, Glossar., and Grimm R. A. p. 467. Edda (Gl.) also mentions an arfi or arfr, <i>bos,</i> v. above.",
            }
          }
        />
