          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arftöku-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an heir, successor to an inheritance,</i> Grág. i. 62, Sturl. i. 98, Fms. v. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arfuni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arfuni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [an old obsol. form], <i>an heir,</i> Edda 108 and in the compd skaporfoni (the vowel change is caused by the following <i>o</i>), <i>legal heir,</i> q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arg-hola"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arg-hola
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>scortum,</i> Hb. 31 (1865).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arg-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arg-skapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>cowardice, cowardliness,</i> Fas. i. 487 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arg-vitugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arg-vítugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>infamous,</i> (cant.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arga-fas"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arga-fas
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [argr, <i>craven,</i> and fas = flas by dropping the <i>l</i> (?); flas, n. means <i>praecipitatio,</i> and flasa, að, <i>precipitare,</i> which are common words; this etymology is confirmed by the spelling of the word in Gþl. 188, where some of the MSS. have <i>faas</i> or <i>fias,</i> the last is perh. a false reading = flas; fas, n. <i>gait, manner,</i> is a modern word: v. Pál Vídal. in Skýr.; his etymology, however, is doubtless bad], a law term, <i>a feint, a cowardly assault, an aiming at one’s body and drawing deadly weapons without carrying the threat into effect,</i> termed <i>‘a coward’s assault;’</i> in Icel. it was punishable by fjörbaugsgarðr, cp. Grág.; ef maðr mundar til manns ok stöðvar sjálfr, ok varðar fjörbaugsgarð, ok á hinn eigi vígt í gegn (<i>the injured party must not kill the offender on the spot</i>) skal stefna heiman ok kveðja til níu heimilisbúa þess á þingi er sóttr er, Vsl. ch. 90: ef maðr hleypr at manni, ok heldr hann sér sjálfr; þat er a. ok er þat sektalaust (<i>liable to no punishment,</i> only a dishonourable act; so the Norse law), N. G. L. i. 164, Gþl. 188.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arga-skattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arga-skattr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. an abusive word, <i>a dog’s tax,</i> Ölkofr. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/argr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          argr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Paul Diac. <i>inertem et inutilem et vulgari verbo ‘arga,’</i> 6. 24; A. S. earg, <i>ignavus;</i> the Scottish <i>arch</i> or <i>argh,</i> v. Jamieson sub voce; and the mod. Engl. <i>arch, archness;</i> Germ. <i>arg;</i> Gr. <i>αργός</i>], <i>emasculate, effeminate,</i> an abusive term; hefir þú börn borit, ok hugða ek þat args aðal, Ls. 24; mik munu æsir argan kalla, ef ek bindast læt brúðarlíni, Þkv. 17: it is more abusive than thrall, cp. the proverb, þrællinn hefnir en argr aldri, <i>a thrall takes revenge, but not the</i> a., Grett. 92; and, argr er sá sem engu verst (a proverb), <i>he is truly an ‘argr’ who does not defend himself;</i> argr and ragr are synonymous, vide the Grág.: þau eru orð þrjrú er skóggang varða öll, ef maðr kallar mann ragan eðr stroðinn eðr sorðinn, ii. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Ulf. <i>ara;</i> O. H. G. <i>aro;</i> cp. Germ. <i>adler</i> = <i>edel-aro;</i> cp. also the lengthened Icel. form <i>örn,</i> A. S. <i>earn,</i> Engl. <i>earn</i>], <i>an eagle,</i> rare and mostly in poetry; örn is the common word; Hom. 89, Stj. 71, Al. 160. In the Gloss. Royal Libr. Old Coll. Copenh. 1812 <i>aquila</i> is translated by <i>ari.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>gossip, ‘judgment at the hearth-side,’</i> Greg. 10; now palldómr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-eldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-eldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>hearth-fire,</i> Lat. <i>focus;</i> þeir eru a., <i>there are three hearths</i> (in a Norse dwelling), Gþl. 376.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-elja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-elja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a concubine</i> if kept at home, med. Lat. <i>focaria;</i> the sense defined in N. G. L. i. 356, 16 (Norse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-greypr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-greypr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. occurs thrice in poetry as an epithet of the benches in a hall and of a helmet, <i>encompassing the hearth,</i> or <i>shaped as an eagle’s bill,</i> Akv. 1, 3. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-haukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-haukr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a chimney-sitter,</i> an old man; in the phrase, áttræðr er a. ok eldaskári, <i>an octogenarian is an</i> a. <i>and a poker,</i> Lex. Run.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-hella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-hella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Norse aarhelle or aarstadhyll, <i>the pavement around the hearth</i>], <i>hearth-stone;</i> í a. þar í stofunni, Bs. i. 680. Now in Icel. used in nursery tales of treasures or the like hidden under the arinhella.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-kjoll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-kjóll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘hearth-keel,’ a house,</i> Yt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arin-nefja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arin-nefja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>eagle-nose,</i> name of an ogress, Rm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "s, m., dat. aarni = árni, Fs. 42, Rm. 2, [a word still freq. in Denmark and in Norway; Dan. <i>arne, arnested;</i> Norse <i>aarstad,</i> Ivar Aasen: in Icel. it is very rare]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arins-horn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arins-horn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>chimney-piece, chimney-corner;</i> hann á mold at taka sem í lögum er mælt, taka at arinshornum fjórum ok í öndvegis sæti, of an act of conveyance, N. G. L. i. 96, cp. Eb. ch. 4, Landn. 254: arinn is symbolical of the sacredness of home, just as stalli is of a temple, or an altar of a church: the phrase, at drekka at arinshorni, Hkr. i. 43, reminds one of the large chimney-corners in old English farms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arins-jarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arins-járn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>iron belonging to a hearth, a poker,</i> used in ordeals (járnburðr); karlmaðr skal ganga til arinsjárns en kona til ketiltaks, <i>the man shall betake him to the poker and the woman shall grasp the kettle,</i> N. G. L. i. 389.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to limp, hobble,</i> of a sluggish gait; láta arka at auðnu, <i>to let matters take their own course, slow and sure like fate,</i> Nj. 185. v. l., Am. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arka-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arka-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>arkar-,</strong> what belongs to <i>a chest,</i> v. örk.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arm-baugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arm-baugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an armlet,</i> Ls. 13.",
            }
