        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a wing</i> (armr) <i>of an army,</i> Fms. x. 403; more freq. fylkingar armr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arm-leggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arm-leggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "jar, and s, m. <i>the arm, lacertus;</i> hann fékk hvergi sveigt hans armleggi, Grett. 61; ofan eptir a. mjök at ölnboga, Sturl. i. 71, Symb. 25, Stj. 265. Exod. vi. 1 (<i>with a strong band</i>), Anecd. 4 (where it is opp. to handleggr, <i>the fore arm</i>). Sometimes armleggr and handleggr are used indifferently; ek mun bera þik á handlegg mér, <i>I will carry thee on my arm;</i> but below, ok bar þær í vinstra a. sér, Grett. ch. 67, Karl. 517.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arm-skapadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arm-skapaðr
        </a>
