              "__html": "adj. part. [A. S. <i>earmsceapen</i>], <i>poor, miserable, misshapen,</i> Hom. 114, 107 (Norse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arm-vitugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arm-vitugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (in Mart. 123 spelt harmv.), <i>charitable, compassionate;</i> Glúmr er a. ok vel skapi farinn, Rd. 308; er hann lítt a., <i>hard-hearted,</i> Sturl. iii. 209; a. við fátækja menn, Bs. i. 356.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/arma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          arma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>misery</i> (<i>απ. λεγ.</i>), Mart. 123; Martinus sá örmu á héranum; now, sjá aumr á e-m, <i>to feel pity for:</i> cp. Germ. <i>arm</i> (poor, wretched).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
