              "__html": "m. (an <i>απ. λεγ.</i>) periphr. from the poem Haustlöng, <i>the ‘sough’</i> (Scot.) or <i>rushing sound caused by the flight of an eagle</i> (örn), Edda 16.",
            }
          }
        />
