          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>atgerfi,</strong> <strong>atgjörfi,</strong> f.; neut., Fms. x. 293 C. [görr at sér, <i>accomplished</i>] <i>; endowments, accomplishments</i> derived from good training added to natural gifts; in olden times esp. those of an athletic or physical kind; fríðleik, vöxt, afl, ok alla a., <i>beauty, stature, strength, and all accomplishments whatever,</i> Eg. 29, Fbr. 56, Fms. vi. 5, 268, i. 30, viii 140, x. 293; at íþróttum, a. ok vinsæld, Hkr. i. 212: of spiritual qualities and character (rare in old writers), af Guðs góðgipt ok sjálfs sins a. göfgastr maðr á Íslandi, Bs. i. (Hv.) 70; at lærdómi, vitrleik ok a., 130. Páls S.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>constraint, coercion, restraint,</i> Fbr. 2, Fms. xi. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hjukan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hjúkan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(now <strong>aðhjúkrun</strong>), f. [hjuka at e-m], <i>heed, attention, care</i> in the most tender sense of that word, e. g. that of a mother to her sick child; <i>attention to a sick, frozen, shipwrecked,</i> or <i>destitute person,</i> Fms. viii. 444, Finnb. 234, v. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hlaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hlaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>onslaught, assault,</i> Fms. viii. 35, Bjarn. 37; í einu a., <i>in one rush</i> in a battle, Ld. 64; veita manni a. eðr sár, <i>violence or wound,</i> K. Á. 48; tókst nú þegar a., <i>a hand to hand fight,</i> Gullþ. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hlatr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hlátr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [hlægja at], <i>a laughing-stock,</i> Fms. ii. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hlaegi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hlægi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>ridicule, mockery;</i> með a. ok sköm, <i>ridicule and shame,</i> Fms. x. 279; ef a. er vert, <i>if it be ridicule,</i> vi. 208; a. eðr úmannan, <i>a laughing-stock and a wretch,</i> Sturl. iii. 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hlaegiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hlægiligr
