        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ridiculous,</i> Band. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-huga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-huga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to heed, bethink oneself, pay attention to, consider;</i> a. sik, <i>to t</i> a <i>ke heed</i>, Sturl. iv. 75 in a mod. MS.; cp. Bs. i. 744 (now freq.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hugall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hugall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>heedful, careful,</i> Sturl. iii. 125, Sks. 296.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/at-hugi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          at-hugi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>heed, care, attention, consideration,</i> Hom. 5 2; af öllum a., <i>carefully,</i> Post. 656 B; hið elzta (barn) hefir ekki a. hit minsta, <i>the eldest bairn has no head on his shoulders,</i> El. 19, Sks. 482; með a. ok áhyggju, <i>with care and concern,</i> Fms. x. 281.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
