              "__html": "Norse <strong>afvirð-,</strong> and mod. Icel. <strong>auðvirðil-,</strong> adv. <i>despicably,</i> Sturl. iii. 220, Fs. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
