        >
          auð-æfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "qs. <strong>auðöfi,</strong> n. pl. [‘auðr,’ <i>opes</i>, and ‘of;’ = ofa-fé, q. v.; Lat. <i>opes</i>], <i>opulence, abundance, wealth, riches,</i> in the Grág. freq. = <i>means of subsistence, emoluments,</i> i. 269, 277 (twice), ii. 213, cp. Íb. 16, where it means <i>emoluments:</i> in the proper sense <i>wealth,</i> Hkr. i. 13, where it means <i>gold and treasures,</i> Sks. 334, 442; veg ok a., <i>power and wealth,</i> Greg. 23; himnesk a., Joh. 21; jarðlig a., Greg. 32. Matth. vi. 19, 20; mörg a., Eluc. 53, Hom. 151, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
