        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "interj. [a for. word; Germ, <i>au weh</i>], <i>woe! alas!</i> used with dat., a. mér, Mar. 167; acc., a. mik, 175; absol., 147: after the Reformation ‘áví’ and ‘ó vei’ occur, or ‘vei’ alone.",
            }
