              "__html": "að, <i>to bewail, to complain,</i> esp. in the impers. phrase, a. sik, <i>to feel compassion for,</i> Bær. II, Al. 10, Róm. 182, Bret. 98, Fagrsk. ch. 34; now freq. used in reflex., aumkast yfir e-t, <i>to pity.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
