          className="link"
          href="/word/aumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aumr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. has <i>arms</i> = <i>miser;</i> Dan. and Swed. <i>öm</i>], seems with all its compounds to be a Scandin. word. It originally probably meant <i>sore, aching, touchy, tender.</i> In mod. Icel. it is sometimes used in this sense, in Dan. and Swed. only = <i>sore</i>, and metaph. <i>tender.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
