          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aur-skór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (prop. <i>‘mud-shoe’</i>), <i>a horse shoe</i>, an <i>απ. λεγ.</i> in the story Fms. iii. 210, each of the shoes weighing 1½ lb. The story is a pendant to that told of king Augustus of Poland and the blacksmith.",
            }
