        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>örriði,</strong> mod. <strong>urriði,</strong> a, m. <i>salmo trutta, salmon-trout,</i> Fél. i. II; <i>salmo squamis argenteis, maculis nigris brunneo cinctis, pinna pectorali punctulis sex notata,</i> Eggert Itin. p. 595: deriv. from örr, <i>celer,</i> and -riði, or from aurr (?); the Norse form <i>aure</i> indicates a diphthong, GÞl. 421, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
