          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-kylfir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>easterlings,</i> cp. Kylfingar, an old Russian population, Kolbiager, east of the Baltic; in a poem of Hornklofi, Fagrsk. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-laegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-lægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>easterly,</i> of the wind.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. austmenn, in Icel. and in the northern part of the British Islands a standing name of those who came from the Scandinavian continent, esp. Norse merchants, vide the old Irish chronicles, and the Sagas, passim. The English used ‘easterling’ in the same sense, and <i>sterling</i> is an abbreviation of the word from the coin which the ‘easterlings’ brought with them in trade. Eyvindr austmaðr, Landn., Nj. 81, Eg. 744, Ísl. ii. 192, 128, Sturl. ii. 47, Lv. 23, Valla L. 216, Landn. 36, 290, 305, Eb. 104, 196, etc. In the Norse GÞl. 450 it is used of Swedes in Norway: <strong>austmanna-skelfir,</strong> m. <i>‘skelper’ (conqueror, terror) of the east men,</i> a nickname, Landn. 305.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-marr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-marr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the east sea, the east Baltic</i> (Estmere of king Alfred, Oros. Ed. Bosworth, p. 22), Ýt. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = austrmál, N. G. L. i. 335.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-mork"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-mörk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the east mark,</i> i. e. <i>the east</i>, Ýt. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-roena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-rœna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>eastern breeze.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-roenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-rœnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Hel. <i>ostroni;</i> A. S. <i>easterne;</i> cp. norrænn, suðrænn], <i>eastern,</i> of the wind; a. gola, <i>eastern breeze,</i> Sturl. iii. 59; vindr, Orkn. (in a verse); viðr, <i>timber</i> from Norway or Scandinavia, Grág. i. 149, <i>the Eistland tymmer</i> of the old Scotch inventories (Jamieson, Suppl. s. v.); Austrænir menn, <i>Norsemen in Iceland,</i> Fms. ix. 276; as a nickname, Eb. 12, and Landn. The name denotes the inhabitants of the Scandinavian continent as opp. to the British Islands and Iceland.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aust-skota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          aust-skota
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = austrsker, Grág. ii. 171; Ísl. ii. 382 spelt ausskota.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [A. S. <i>eastan;</i> Hel. <i>ôstan</i>]<i>, from the east,</i> Eg. 183, Eb. 4: of the direction of the wind (cp. vestan, sunnan, norðan), used with a preceding prep. á, á vestan, austan …, <i>blowing from west, east …,</i> Bs. ii. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a journey from the east,</i> Fms. vii. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-fjardar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-fjarðar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen. <i>loci</i>, used as adverb, <i>in the east of the firth,</i> Hkr. ii. 295, Fms. i. 278, iv. 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-gola"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-gola
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a light breeze from the east,</i> Sturl. iii. 59 (Ed. austræn).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-kvama"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-kváma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>arrival from the east,</i> Fms. vi. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man from the east,</i> Old Engl. <i>easterling,</i> Sturl. iii. 248.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-sjor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-sjór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the east sea</i>, nickname of a man, Fms. ix. 316.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-vedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-veðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "rs, m. <i>an easterly gale,</i> Rb. 438.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-verdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-verðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>eastern</i> (cp. norðan-, sunnan-, vestan-verðr), Landn. 25, Stj. 75, A. A. 286.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austan-vindr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austan-vindr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an east wind,</i> Sks. 38, cp. norðan-, vestan-. sunnan-vindr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austarliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austarliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. and <strong>-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>easterly,</i> Fms. xi. 389.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "superl. <i>easternmost,</i> v. eystri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austfirdinga-bud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austfirðinga-búð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., v. búð.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austfirdinga-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austfirðinga-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the court for the east quarter,</i> v. dómr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austfirdinga-fjordungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austfirðinga-fjórðungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the east quarter of Iceland,</i> v. fjórðungr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austfirdingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austfirðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., esp. in pl. <i>an eastfirther, one from the east of Iceland,</i> Sturl. ii. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "rs and rar, m. [ausa], <i>the act of drawing water</i> in buckets, <i>pumping;</i> v. dæluaustr and byttuaustr, Grett. ch. 19; standa í austri, <i>to toil hard at the pump,</i> Fas. ii. 520, Sturl. iii. 68; til austrar, Grett. 94 B. β. <i>the water pumped</i> or <i>to be pumped, bilge water,</i> Gr. <i>αντλος,</i> Sturl. iii. 67, 68; skipið fullt af austri, <i>full of bilge water,</i> Fb. ii. 204 (Fbr.), Finnb. 234; standa í a., v. above.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "rs, m. [A. S. and Engl. <i>east;</i> Hel. <i>ôstar;</i> Germ, <i>ost, osten</i>], <i>the east;</i> sól í austri, Grág. ii. 224, Rb. 92, Landn. 276; ór austri, Sturl. ii. 25. 2. as adv. <i>towards east, eastward,</i> Nj. 151, Eg. 72, Grág. i. 96, 189.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-alfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-álfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "v. austrhálfa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-att"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-átt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>-ætt,</strong> f. <i>eastern region, east;</i> í austr., <i>towards east, in eastern direction,</i> Fms. ii. 49, x. 267, Sks. 38. 655 xiv. B. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-biti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-biti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a cross-beam nearest the pumping-place in a ship,</i> Fs. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>austr-för,</strong> f. <i>voyage to the east,</i> esp. to Russia or the east Baltic, Fb. i. 130, Ls. 60, the last passage in a mythical sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-halfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-hálfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Hel. <i>ôstarhalba</i> = <i>oriens</i>], often spelt <strong>-álfa</strong> by dropping the <i>h</i>; <i>the east</i>, in old writers freq. of the Austria of the peace of Verdun, A. D. 843, including the Baltic and the east of Europe; sometimes also of <i>the true east;</i> um Garðaríki (<i>Russia Minor</i>) ok víða um a. heims, Fms. i. 96; í Görðum austr ok austrhólfunni, x. 275; í a. heims eru Þrjú Indialönd, A. A. 283; Licinius lagði undir sik víða a., Blas. 37; Adam ok Eva bygðu síðan í a. Þar sem Hebron heitir, Ver. 5, Stj. 67, 43: now used in Icel. = <i>Asia</i>, Vestrhálfa = <i>America,</i> Suðrhálfa = <i>Africa,</i> Norðrhálfa = <i>Europe,</i> Eyjaálfa = <i>Australia.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-kendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-kendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. part. <i>eastern,</i> of wind, Bs. i. 388.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-konungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-konungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a king of the East,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-lond"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-lönd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the east, orient,</i> the eastern part of Europe, in old writers often synonymous to Austr-hálfa, and opp. to Norðrlönd, <i>Scandinavia;</i> Suðrlönd, <i>South Germany,</i> etc.; Vestrlönd, <i>the British Islands, Normandy, Bretagne,</i> etc., Post. 656 C. 39, Fms. ii. 183, Post. 645. 102, Hkr. i. 134 in a poem of the 10th century used of Russia; cp. Brocm. 101.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (navig.), <i>the pumping-watch,</i> the crew being told off two and two, to hand the buckets up, one of them standing in the <i>bilge</i> water down below and the other on deck, vide the Fbr. 131, Grett. ch. 19; en hverr Þeirra manna er síðar kemr en a. komi til hans, þá er hann sekr níu ertogum, N. G. L. i. 335 [ausmaal, <i>bilge water,</i> Ivar Aasen].",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-oka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-oka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [austr], <i>to lavish, squander,</i> with dat. an <i>απ. λεγ.</i> as it seems, Fas. iii. 198, 202, where a. fé sínu; cp. Gr. <i>αντλέω.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-riki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-ríki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the eastern empire,</i> esp. the east of Europe (Russia, Austria, sometimes also including Turkey of the present time); the term is often vague, and synonymous to Austrvegr, Austrlönd, or referring to the Germany of the year 843; (the mod. sense is = <i>Austria</i>); Ívarr víðfaðmi eignaðist allt Danaveldi, ok mikinn hluta Saxlands ok allt A., Hkr. Yngl. S. ch. 45, Fms. vi. 8; Constantinopolis er æðst borga í A., Ver. 49; Þeodosius inn mikli var sex vetr konungr í A., 50; Licinius hét konungr í A., Blas. 37, in these last passages = <i>the eastern empire</i> (of Rome); þá er ek (viz. king David) lifða ok vask konungr kallaðr í A. (<i>in the east</i>), Niðrst. 4, cp. Baut. nos. 780, 979.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-rum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-rúm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the part of a vessel’s hold near the stern where the pump is,</i> Hkr. i. 82, Stj. 57, Fbr. 158, Edda 35; an aft and fore pumping-place (eptra ok fremra austrrúm) is mentioned Fms. viii. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-trog"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-trog
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a scoop, bucket,</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "s, m. <i>the eastern way, east,</i> esp. Russia, Wenden, the east Baltic; fara í Austrveg is a standing phrase for trading or piratical expeditions in the Baltic, opp. to víking or vestr-víking, which only refer to expeditions to the British Islands, Normandy, Brittany, etc.; austr-víking, Landn. <i>221,</i> is a false reading; hann var farmaðr mikill (Hólmgarðs-fari) ok kaupmaðr; fór opt í Austrveg (Baltic), Landn. 169, Nj. 41, Eg. 228, Fms. freq., vide vol. xii, s. v. In the Edda fara í A. is a standing phrase for the expeditions of Thor against giants, Þórr var farinn í A. at berja tröll, 26, cp. Ls. 59, where a. means the eastern region of heaven. Sometimes it is used of <i>the east</i> in general, Ver. 9, Rb. 412, 623. 13, Baut. no. 813.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austr-aett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austr-ætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "v. austrátt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/austrfarar-knorr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          austrfarar-knörr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a vessel bound for the Baltic,</i> Fms. vii. 256.",
            }
          }
