      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/a-gaetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          á-gætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [v. the words above, from á- intens. and geta—gat—gátu, <i>to get</i> and <i>to record;</i> the old etymology in glossaries of the last century from the Greek αγαθός cannot be admitted], <i>famous, goodly, excellent;</i> á. maðr um allt land, Nj. 106; á. at afli, Edda 19; ágætir gimsteinar, <i>precious stones,</i> Fms. i. 15; á. skjöldr, Eg. 705; compar, mun hann verða ágætari (<i>more famous</i>) en allir þínir frændr, Fms. i. 256; superl., ágætaztr, Nj. 282, Eg. 311; ágæztr, contr., Edda 5, Íb. 14, Fms. vii. 95, Greg. 53. In the Landn. ‘maðr ágætr’ is freq. used in a peculiar sense, viz. <i>a noble man,</i> nearly synonymous to gæðingr in the Orkneys, or hersir in Norway, e. g. 143, 149, 169, 190, 198, 201, 203, 279, 281, 308, 312; hersir á., 173, etc.; cp. also Kristni S. ch. I.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/a-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          á-görð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>gain, profit,</i> = ávöxtr; til sölu ok á., <i>for sale and profit,</i> Bs. i. 426.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
