          className="link"
          href="/word/a-heit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          á-heit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. mostly or always in pl. <i>vows</i> to a god, saint, or the like, <i>invocations,</i> Hkr. i. 14, ii. 386; hón (the goddess Freyja) er nákvæmust mönnum til áheita, Edda 16, Bs. i. 134.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
