        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to lay hands upon, seize;</i> finna ok á., Grág. ii. 311: part. pass. <strong>áhendr,</strong> as adj. <i>within reach;</i> þeir vóru svá langt komnir at þeir urðu eigi áhendir, … <i>out of reach,</i> Sturl. ii. 185, Eg. 160; þau urðu á., <i>they were seized,</i> Ld. 152.",
            }
