        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>giving a willing ear, listening readily;</i> ekki á., <i>obstinate, self-willed,</i> Fms. vi. 431; á. um fjártökur, <i>greedy of gain,</i> vii. 209, where, however, the Morkinsk. (p. 337) reads, á. um fortölur, <i>easy to persuade,</i> which suits the context better; á. til grimleiks, Fms. x. 380, Thom. 28.",
            }
