        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. ind. in the phrase, verða á., of a chief on whose side most people are killed in a battle, in respect to the pairing off of the slain in the lawsuit that followed; þat vóru lög þá, þar at (<i>in the case that</i>) menn féllu jafnmargir, at þat skyldi kalla jamvegit (<i>they should be paired off,</i> no compensation, or ‘wergeld,’ should be paid, and no suit begun), þótt manna munr þætti vera; en þeir er á. urðu skyldi kjósa mann til eptir hvern mæli skyldi, Glúm. 383; vide Sir Edm. Head, p. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
