        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> prep. [Goth. <i>inuh;</i> Hel. and O. H. G. <i>ano;</i> Germ, <i>ohne;</i> Gr. ανευ], <i>without:</i> the oldest form in MSS. is <strong>ón,</strong> Eluc. 25, Greg. Dial, (freq.), 655 xxvii. 2, Fms. xi. in, 153; <strong>aon,</strong> Hom. 19 sqq.; the common form is án; with gen. dat. and acc.; at present only with gen.",
            }
