              "__html": "rs, m. [ár = <i>annona</i>], gener. <i>a year, season,</i> = árferð; also the produce of the earth brought forth in a year (season), which is at present in the east of Icel. called ársali, v. árferð; skapaðist árangrinn eptir spásögu Jóseps, 655 vii. 4; ok at liðnum þeim vetrum tók á. at spillast, Gþl. 77; mun batna á. sem várar, Þorf. Karl. (A. A.) 111: the mod. use is only metaph., <i>effect, result;</i> so e. g. <strong>árangrs-laust,</strong> n. adj. <i>without effect, to no effect.</i>",
