          baðast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. (rare), <i>to bathe,</i> Fms. iii. 171; in common Icel. act., baða höndum, <i>to gesticulate, fight with the arms,</i> as in bathing.",
            }
