              "__html": "rs, m. [A. S. baldor, <i>princeps,</i> seems to be a different root from the Goth. <i>balþs,</i> A. S. <i>bald,</i> which answers to the Icel. ball- or bald- without <i>r</i>], prop. = Lat. <i>princeps, the best, foremost;</i> in compds as mann-baldr, her-baldr, fólk-baldr.",
            }
