          className="link"
          href="/word/bastl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bastl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>turmoil;</i> <strong>bastla,</strong> að, <i>to turmoil.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
