          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [þekja baug], a law term, <i>‘baug-covering,’</i> i. e. <i>the supplemental payment</i> to be added in due proportion to the amount of weregild (baugr), defined, Grág. ii. 171, 172; hence ‘at baugþaki’ metaph. means <i>in addition, to boot;</i> þá kom at honum síðan at b. brotfallit, <i>he was taken with fits of epilepsy to boot,</i> Bs. i. 336.",
            }
          }
        />
