        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. pron. dual, gen. beggja, neut. bæði; rarely báði, gen. báðra, sometimes occur in MSS. of the 14th century, but both of them are Norse forms, [Goth. <i>bai, baioþs;</i> A. S. <i>ba</i>; Engl. <i>both</i>; Germ. <i>beide;</i> cp. also Gr. αμφω, Lat. <i>ambo</i>]:—<i>both,</i> Nj. 82, Sturl. iii. 314, Eg. 257, Grág. i. 368, N. G. L. i. 33, Ísl. ii. 348, Fms. x. 118, etc. etc.",
            }
