        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(or better <strong>balkr, bölkr</strong>), old form b́lkr, Grág., dat. bælki, N. G. L. i. 399, acc. pl. b́lku or bálku, Lex. Poët. [A. S. <i>bälc</i>], a <i>balk, partition</i> [cp. naval <i>bulk</i>-heads]; b. um þveran hellinn, of a <i>cross wall,</i> Fms. iii. 217, Fas. ii. 333, Grett. 140; sá studdi höndunum á bálkinn, of <i>a balk of wood</i> across the door, Orkn. 112.",
