        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, and <strong>beiskleikr,</strong> s, m. <i>bitterness, harshness, sourness;</i> Marat, þat er b., Stj. 290, Rb. 336 of sulphur: metaph. <i>acrimony,</i> b. i brjósti, Post. 656 C; hjartans b.; bitr b., Stj. 51, 421, Sks. 730 B, Magn. 502, Bs. i. 743.",
            }
          }
        />
