        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., esp. in the phrase, grata b., <i>to weep bitterly,</i> Fms. x. 367, Th. 6, the Icel. transl. of Luke xxii. 62; grenja (<i>to howl</i>) b., Fms. x. 256: <i>bitterly, grimly,</i> bera sik b. her í móti, Stj. 143.",
            }
