              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> jar, m. pl. ir, gen. pl. ja, dat. jum, [A. S. <i>benc;</i> Engl. <i>bench, bank;</i> Germ. <i>bank;</i> Dan. <i>bænk;</i> Icel. per assimil. <i>kk;</i> the Span. <i>banco</i> is of Teut. origin]",
