        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "barði, pres. berr; sup. bart, barzt, O. H. L. 24, Bret. 48, 64, Fms. viii. 214, 215, xi. 16, and later barit, barizt; part. fem. barið, Am. 84; barðr, fem. börð, Sturl. iii. 154; mod. barinn; either form may now be used: [Lat. <i>ferio.</i> The word is not found in Ulf., and seems to be unknown in Germ. and Engl.; it is lost in mod. Dan.]",
            }
