              "__html": "ð, [baugr], <i>to bend, bow,</i> Fms. ii. 108, iii. 210, x. 174: metaph., b. e-m krók, <i>to make it crooked for one,</i> the metaphor taken from a game or from wrestling, Ld. 40.",
            }
