          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bilt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "prob. an old n. part. from bila; only used in the phrase, e-m verðr bilt, <i>to be amazed, astonished;</i> en þá er sagt, at Þór (dat.) varð bilt einu sinni at slá hann, <i>the first time that Thor’s heart failed him,</i> Edda 29; varð þeim bilt, Korm. 40, Nj. 169.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bimbult"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bimbult
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(now proncd. <strong>bumbult</strong>), n. adj., only in the phrase, e-m verðr b., <i>to feel uneasy,</i> Gísl. 33, of a witch (freq., but regarded as a slang word), mér er hálf bumbult …",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/binda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          binda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "batt, 2nd pers. bazt, pl. bundu, bundit; pres. bind; 3rd pers. reflex. bizt; imperat. bind, bind þú; 2nd pers. bittú, bitt þú, Fm. 40; battú, Bret. 32; bitzt, Post. 154: [Goth., A. S., Hel. <i>bindan;</i> Engl. <i>bind;</i> Germ. <i>binden;</i> Swed. <i>binda,</i> 2nd pers. <i>bandt;</i> in Icel. by assimilation batt; bant, however, Hb. 20, 32 (1865)]:—<i>to bind</i>:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bindandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bindandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>bindendi,</strong> f. (now neut., Thom. 68), <i>abstinence,</i> Stj. 147, 625. 186, Fms. i. 226, Hom. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bindandis-lif"
