        >
          birgja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to furnish, provide;</i> skal ek víst b. hann at nökkuru, Nj. 73; segir Sigurðr, at hann mun b. þá með nökkuru móti, Fær. 237; hann birgði þá ok um búfé, Ld. 144; nú vil ek b. bú þitt at málnytu í sumar, Hrafn. 9. [In the Edd. sometimes wrongly spelt with <i>y,</i> as it is quite different from byrgja, <i>to enclose.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/birgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          birgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [O. H. G. birig, <i>fertilis;</i> unbirig, <i>sterilis:</i> sometimes in Edd. wrongly spelt byrgr: this form however occurs Bs. i. 868, MS. the end of the 15th century]:—<i>provided, well furnished;</i> b. at kosti, Grett. 127 A, Sd. 170; viltú selja mér augun? Þá er ek verr b. eptir, Fas. iii. 384.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/birki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          birki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. collect. = björk, <i>birch,</i> in COMPDS: birkiraptr, birkiviðr.",
            }
