        >
          birna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a she-bear,</i> Stj. 530, Fs. 26, Magn. 476: astron., Rb. 468; b. er vér köllum vagn, 1812. 16. <strong>birnu-gætir,</strong> m. the name of one of the constellations, 1812. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
