            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bjarg-hagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bjarg-hagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>a dexterous carpenter</i> or <i>smith for household work,</i> Glúm. 355; cp. Sturl. ii. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bjarg-hogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bjarg-högg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = <strong>berghögg,</strong> <i>hewing rocks to make a road,</i> Bárð. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bjarg-kvidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bjarg-kviðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a law term, <i>a verdict of acquittal given by five neighbours for the defendant,</i> proving an alibi or the like, and produced during the trial; the b. seems to be, in its strict sense, synonymous with heimiliskviðr or heimiskviðr, q. v., cp. Grág, i. 60, 61, where it is defined; fimm búar skulu skilja um bjargkviðu alla, heimilis-búar þess manns er sóttr er, nema …, vide also 48, 49, 53, 55, 56, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bjarg-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bjarg-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>starvation, destitution,</i> Grág. i. 238, Gþl. 272, Band. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bjarg-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bjarg-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. a law term, <i>help</i> or <i>shelter given to an outlaw,</i> in the phrase, úalandi, úráðandi öllum bjargráðum, Grág. ii. 162, etc., Nj. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bjarg-rifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bjarg-rifa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
