        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>soft-clad,</i> b. mann, a rendering of Matth. xi. 8, a man clothed in <i>soft raiment,</i> 625. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
