      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/blaudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          blauðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>bleâðe;</i> Scot. <i>blate</i> = <i>bashful, shy;</i> Hel. <i>blothi;</i> Germ. <i>blöde;</i> cp. Goth. <i>blauþjan</i> = ακυρουν, and Hel. <i>blôdan</i> = <i>infirmare</i>], it properly means <i>soft, weak,</i> Lat. <i>mollis,</i> Gr. μάλακος, and is opposed to hvatr, <i>brisk, vigorous;</i> hence the proverb, fár er hvatr er hrörask tekr, ef í barnæsku er blauðr, Fm. 6, cp. Fms. viii. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/blaut-barn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          blaut-barn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a baby,</i> in the phrase, frá blautbarns beini = blautu barns beini, Barl. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/blaut-fiskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
