      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/blaut-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          blaut-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. and <strong>-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>faintly, effeminate,</i> Stj. 362; b. kossar, 417; b. kvæði, <i>soft, amorous ditties,</i> Bs. i. 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/blautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          blautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>bleât</i> = <i>miser;</i> Germ. <i>blozs</i> = <i>nudus;</i> Scot. <i>blait</i> = <i>nudus</i> (Jamieson); Dan. <i>blöd;</i> Swed. <i>blödig</i> = <i>soft;</i> the Dan. and Swed. <i>blott, blotted,</i> = <i>stripped,</i> are borrowed from Germ.; Ivar Aasen distinguishes between <i>blaú</i> = <i>shy,</i> and <i>blaut</i> = <i>wet, damp;</i> blauðr and blautr are no doubt only variations of the same word].",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          blá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. blár, an απ. λεγ. in a verse Ísl. ii. 233, where it seems to mean <i>the billows, blue waves.</i> Ivar Aasen records <i>‘blaa’</i> a Norse term for <i>the blue horizon;</i> cp. the Icel. phrase, út í bláinn (as from blár, m.), <i>into the blue,</i> of what is <i>thrown away,</i> words spoken <i>without need</i> or <i>end.</i> In the east of Icel. blá means a meadow covered with snow half melted away, Erik Jonsson, Dict. s. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
