        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. indecl., mod. <strong>blindni,</strong> <i>blindness,</i> Stj. 620, Greg. 35: metaph., Blas. 47: snjó-blinda, u, f. <i>snow-blindness;</i> nátt-blinda, <i>nyctalopia;</i> dag-blinda, <i>hemeralopia,</i> Fél.",
            }
