              "__html": "[Germ. <i>bleiben;</i> akin to leifa, q. v.], <i>to remain;</i> this word was taken from Luther’s Bible into Icel., and is used by theol. writers; pret. sing. is never used, but pret. pl. blifu. Pass. 50. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
