          blómstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "rs, m. <i>bloom, blossom;</i> allan akrsins blómstr, Stj. 29; sætan b., Sks. 630 B, 499; ‘flos’ is rendered by b., Stj. (pref.): in writers since the Reformation always neut.; allt eins og blómstrið eina, and glóandi blómstrið frítt, Hallgrímr, Snót 45; blóm and blómstr are synonymous, but blómi in common usage is metaph. = <i>prosperity.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
