        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a Norse law term, <i>a stolen article</i> put into an innocent man’s house; even if officers ransacked a house without having their persons searched, and find something, þá er b. ok liggr ekki búanda við, <i>then it is</i> b. <i>and the farmer is free,</i> N. G. L. i. 255.",
            }
          }
        />
