        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Swed. <i>buss,</i> cp. Germ. <i>bursch</i>], <i>a boy, fellow;</i> occurs once in the Jomsv. S., Fms. xi. (in a verse), from A. D. 994. It is still in use in Icel. in the compd word <strong>hvata-buss,</strong> <i>a boyish fellow who is always in a bustle;</i> hence also <strong>hvatabuss-legr,</strong> adj. <i>hurried.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
