        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., old acc. pl. bógu, Nj. 95, Fms. v. 163, etc.: mod. bóga; old dat. bægi, Hlt., Vkv. 31, Stj. 249, [A. S. <i>bôg;</i> Dan. <i>boug;</i> Engl. <i>bow</i> of a ship; and in Old Engl. <i>bowres</i> are <i>the muscles of the shoulder</i>]:—<i>the shoulder</i> of an animal, (armr of a man); á hinum hægra bæginum, Stj. 249; ek hjó varginn í sundr fyrir aptan bóguna, Nj. l. c., Fms. l. c.; lær uxans tvau ok báða bógana, <i>the shoulder-piece of the ox</i> (the Ob. bóguna), Edda 45; cp. bœgsli or bæxli, <i>the shoulder</i> of a whale or dragon, v. Lex. Poët.:—<i>the bow</i> of a ship, v. bóglína above.",
            }
