      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/braut"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          braut
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. brautu, pl. ir, [a purely Scandin. word, formed from <i>brjóta, braut,</i> as Engl. <i>road</i> from Ital. <i>rotta, via rupta</i>]:—<i>a road cut through</i> rocks, forests, or the like, and distinguished from vegr, stigr, gata (<i>path, track</i>); Önundr konungr lét brjóta vegu um markir ok mýrar ok fjallvegu, fyrir því var hann Braut-Önundr kallaðr, Hkr. i. 46; ryðja b., <i>to cut a road,</i> Ísl. ii. 400; braut … eigi breiðari en götu breidd, Eg. 582.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
