          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brautingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a <i>beggar, tramp,</i> Hbl. 6, Fms. ii. 73: the proverb, bráð eru brautingja erindi, <i>the tramp cannot afford delay,</i> Fas. ii. 262, cp. Hm. 2; the poor had in old times to go from house to house; cp. göngu-maðr, föru-maðr; therefore <i>misery</i> and <i>tramping</i> are synonymous, e. g. válaðr, <i>miseria;</i> cp. A. S. <i>vædl</i> = <i>ambitus</i>:—not till the establishment of Christianity were poor-rates and other legal provisions made for the poor.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
