        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ulf. <i>braw;</i> A. S. <i>bræv;</i> Engl. <i>brow;</i> Germ. <i>brau</i>], <i>an eye-lid;</i> brár (gen. sing.), Edda 15; brár (nom. pl.), 6; brám (dat. pl.), Vþm. 41; brá (gen. pl.), Ad. 5; cp. Baldrs-brá, Gull-brá, Ísl. Þjóðs.: in poetry the eyes are called brú-tungl, -máni, -sól, -geisli, <i>moon-, sun-beam of the brow;</i> tears are brá-regn, -drift, <i>rain of the brow;</i> the head brá-völlr, <i>field of the brow,</i> etc., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
