          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brenna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "an old obsol. form <strong>brinna;</strong> pret. brann, 2nd pers. brant, mod. branst; pl. brunnu; sup. brunnit; pres. brenn, 3rd pers. brennr; old breðr, Grág. ii. 295, Fms. vii. 20 (in a verse); brenn (dropping the <i>r</i>), Hm. 56; with the neg. suffix, brennr-at (<i>non urit</i>), 153, [Ulf. <i>brinnan;</i> A. S. <i>byrnan;</i> Early Engl. <i>to ‘brenn;’</i> Germ. <i>brennen;</i> the strong form is almost obsolete in Germ.]:—<i>to burn:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/brennandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brennandi
