        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, [braut, <i>via</i>], <i>to alter, change:</i> bregða implies the notion of breach, breyta simply denotes change: with dat.; b. farveg (of a river), <i>to form a new channel,</i> Grág. i. 350, Nj. 4, Ld. 158, Fms. ii. 158, Fb. i. 292; flestar Þjóðir þurfa at b. (<i>transform</i>) nafni hans til sinnar tungu, Edda 14; þá vóru snjóvar miklir ok breyttir (<i>changed, become impassable</i>) vegir allir, Eg. 543, Rb. 262 (where the acc. is wrong;).",
            }
          }
        />
