        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, (mod. að), [bregða], a law term, <i>to escheat;</i> with acc., b. land, lönd, Grág. ii. 202 sqq.; b. e-m frelsi, <i>to abrogate,</i> i. 203; b. fé (of <i>the forfeiture of a deposit</i>), 183. In the Norse sense, vide Gþl. 295 sqq., Jb. 188 sqq., Dipl. v. 16.",
