        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (derived from brigð and bregða), <i>to upbraid,</i> with dat. of the person and thing; b. oss því, at vér …, Fms. ii. 227; honum sé því brigzlat, <i>that it be thrown in his teeth,</i> Fær. 100, Al. 2: with acc. of the thing (rare), Stj. 42, Anecd. 30: in mod. use, b. e-m um e-t, Mar. 153 (Fr.): absol., b. e-m ok hæða, Mar. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
