              "__html": "u, f. so in old writers, in mod. usage always <strong>bros,</strong> n.,—<i>a smile:</i> in the phrase, mæla, svara, með (við) brosu, <i>to reply with a smile;</i> við brosu, Sturl. ii. 195; með brosu, Orkn. 464.",
