      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/brynja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brynja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Ulf. <i>brynio;</i> A. S. <i>burn;</i> Hel. <i>bry-nio;</i> O. H. G. <i>brunja;</i> Swed. <i>brynja;</i> Dan. <i>brynie</i>]:—<i>a coat of mail,</i> in olden times woven of rings (hringa-brynja, <i>ring-mail</i>), hence in poetry called hring-skyrta, <i>a chain-mail sark</i> or <i>shirt,</i> with epithets such as ‘iron sewed, knit, woven,’ and the like, Lex. Poët.: the breast-plate, spanga-brynja (Fms. vii. 264, viii. 95, 388), is of later date, viz. of the time of the Crusades and the following ages, vide Fms. i. 43, ii. 309, iv. 65, vi. 410, 411, vii. 45, 46, viii. 403, xi. 137, v. 1. etc. etc., Bs. i. 526, 528, 624.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
