              "__html": "n. <i>a whetstone,</i> Ísl. ii. 348, Fas. iii. 43, 44.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bryning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brýning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a whetting,</i> <i>sharpening,</i> esp. metaph. <i>egging on,</i> <i>sharpening;</i> ek veit görst um yðr sonu mína, þurfi þér brýningina, Ld. 240; segir, at þá hefði þeir tekið brýningunni, Hkr. ii. 239.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/brynligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brýnligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = brýnn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/brynn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          brýnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [brún], prop. ‘<i>edged</i>’; but only used metaph. <i>prompt,</i> <i>ready;</i> ef brýn féföng lægi fyrir, <i>ready means,</i> Fms. iv. 298; brýn mála-efni, <i>an evident,</i> <i>plain case,</i> Ld. 66, Gísl. 119, 123; brýn sök, <i>a just,</i> <i>cogent cause,</i> Sturl. iii. 237; brýn vörn, <i>a clear case of defence,</i> Band. 15 new Ed.; brýnt erindi, <i>a pressing errand,</i> <i>business;</i> brýnn byrr, <i>a straight,</i> <i>fair wind,</i> Skúlda 163, Fagrsk. 173 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/braeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bræða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dd, [bráð], <i>to melt,</i> Sks. 145; b. jökul, snjó, ís, Fms. iii. 180, ix. 355, K. Á. 6; b. lýsi, <i>to make oil</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/braedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [bráðr], <i>anger,</i> <i>ire,</i> <i>temper,</i> Eluc. 41; í bræði, <i>in a passion,</i> Fms. vii. 130, Pass. 8. 14; með bræði, <i>with ire,</i> Stj. 153. <strong>brœði-mæli,</strong> n. pl. <i>angry language,</i> Sks. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/braedrunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bræðrunga
        </a>
        <p
