      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bulki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          búlki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., in mod. spelling <strong>bunki,</strong> <i>heap</i> [cp. a ship’s <i>bunks</i>]; this form occurs in the Hrokkinsk., a MS. of the 15th century, vide the references below; [cp. Engl. <i>bulk,</i> in the naut. phrase, <i>to break bulk</i> or <i>begin to land a cargo</i>]:—<i>the cargo</i> or <i>freight of a ship;</i> the allit. phrase, binda bulka, <i>to bind bulk, shut the hold,</i> just when the ship is bound for sea, and leysa b., <i>to break bulk,</i> when in harbour; fyrir framan or aptan búlka, the b. was, namely, in the middle of the ship, Fms. vi. 108, 378, 381, N. G. L. i. 340, 371, Eb. 196, Grág. i. 209, Nj. 134, Fms. ix. 145, 468, Bs. i. 422, Fbr. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bunadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
