        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. ar, [búa.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/bunask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          búnask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep., in the phrase, e-m b. vel, illa, <i>one has good, bad, luck in his business as</i> bóndi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/buningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          búningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [búa], <i>dress, clothing, attire;</i> hvers dags b., <i>every day dress,</i> K. Þ. K. 140; opp. to spari b., <i>Sunday dress;</i> karlmanns b., <i>a man’s dress;</i> kvennmanns b., <i>a woman’s dress,</i> etc., Nj. 190.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
