          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          bysja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[Dan. <i>buse</i>; Swed. <i>busa</i> = <i>to gush</i>], <i>to gush,</i> a defect, verb, occurs only twice or thrice, viz. in pres. sing. býss, Ó. H. (in a verse), busti (pret. sing.), <i>gushed,</i> of blood, Hkv. 2.8; of tears, Edda (append.) 217: the infin. never occurs, and the word is never used in prose.",
            }
