        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>bötte</i>], <i>a pail, small tub,</i> K. Þ. K. 82, Stj. 444, Fms. x. 54, Jm. 29, N. G. L. i. 3–27: of <i>the bucket</i> for baling a ship with, Fbr. 131, Grett. 95; hence <strong>byttu-austr,</strong> the old mode of <i>pumping</i> is defined, Fbr. and Grett. l. c.",
            }
