        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a day’s mowing,</i> an Icel. acre field, measuring 900 square fathoms (Icel. fathom = about 2 yards), to be mown by a single man in a day, Dipl. v. 28, Ísl. ii. 349.",
            }
