        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ulf. <i>dêds,</i> in <i>missdeds</i>. = παράβασις, Germ. <i>missethat,</i> Engl. <i>misdeed;</i> A. S. <i>dæd;</i> Engl. <i>deed;</i> O. H. G. <i>tat</i>; mod. Germ. <i>that;</i> Dan. <i>daad</i>]:—<i>deed;</i> allit. phrase, drýgja dáð, <i>to do a daring deed,</i> Sturl. iii. 7, 10; dáð ok drengskapr, Band, 10: cp. the compds ó-dæði, <i>a misdeed;</i> for-dæða, <i>an evil-doer;</i> the adverbial phrase, af sjálfs-dáðum, <i>of one’s own accord.</i>",
            }
