      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dalkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dálkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. mod. Germ. <i>dolch,</i> which word docs not appear in Germ. till the 16th century (Grimm); Bohem. and Pol. <i>tulich;</i> mod. Dan. <i>dolk</i>]:—<i>the pin</i> in the cloaks (feldr) of the ancients, whence also called feldar-dálkr, Glúm. ch. 8, Korm. ch. 25, Fms. i. 180, Gísl. 55, Hkr. Hák. S. Góða ch. 18; cp. also the verse l. c., where the poet calls it feldar-stingr, <i>cloak-pin,</i> cp. Tac. Germ. ch. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
