      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/damgast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dámgast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(proncd. <strong>dángast</strong>), að, <i>to get seasoned:</i> metaph. <i>to thrive;</i> hence, <strong>dámgan, döngun,</strong> f. <i>thriving;</i> <strong>dönguligr,</strong> adj., etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/damr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dámr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [perh. akin to the Germ. <i>dampf</i>], <i>flavour;</i> görði síðan af dám ekki góðan, Bs. i. 340; illr d., Konr. 57; the phrase, draga dám af e-u, <i>to take a (bad) flavour from a thing;</i> hver dregr dám af sínum sessunautum: Icel. also use a verb <strong>dáma,</strong> að, in the phrase, e-m dámar ekki e-t, i. e. <i>to dislike, to loathe;</i> a filthy person is called ó-dámr, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/danar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dánar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a gen. form from <strong>dá</strong> or <strong>dáinn,</strong> in <strong>dánar-arfr,</strong> m. a law term, <i>inheritance from one deceased,</i> Hkr. iii. 222: <strong>dánar-bú,</strong> n. <i>estate of one deceased;</i> <strong>dánar-dagr,</strong> m. or <strong>dánar-dœgr,</strong> n. <i>day, hour of death,</i> Fins, i. 219, Hs. verse 44 (where it nearly means <i>the manner of death</i>); <strong>dánar-fé,</strong> n. <i>property of a person deceased,</i> Grág. i. 209, Fms. vi. 392, cp. Dan. <i>dannefæ,</i> but in a different sense, <i>of property</i> which is claimed by no one, and therefore falls to the king; <i>‘dane-fee,’</i> i. e. hereditas illorum qui nullum post se heredem relinquunt, Thork. Dipl. i. 3; cp. early Swed. <i>Dana-arver,</i> Schlyter.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [dá], scarcely used except in the neut. dátt, in various phrases; e-m verð dátt (or dátt um e-t), <i>numbness comes to one, one is benumbed,</i> 623, 10; við þau tíðendi varð honum svá d. sem hanu væri steini lostinn, <i>at those tidings he was as ‘dumbfounded’ as if he had been struck by a stone,</i> Bs. i. 471.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dar-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>scoff;</i> in the allit. phrase, draga d. at e-m, <i>to make game of one,</i> Hkr. iii. 203; gys og dár, Pass. 14. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dára
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to mock, make sport of,</i> with acc., Fas. i. 9. Sti. <i>22,</i> 165, 199, Grett. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dári
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a. m. [Germ. <i>tor</i> or <i>thor;</i> Dan. <i>daare</i>], <i>a fool, buffoon.</i> Fms. ix. 272; <strong>dára-samlegr,</strong> adj. <i>foolish.</i> Stj. 269; <strong>dára-skapr</strong> and <strong>dáru-skapr,</strong> m. <i>mockery,</i> Fas. ii. 337. Grett. 108 A, 144.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dati"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dáti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [abbrev. from <i>soldat</i>], <i>a soldier,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/deging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          deging
