              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f., gen. desjar, pl. desjar, = Scot. and North. E. <i>dass</i> or <i>dess</i> (<i>a hay-rick</i>), cp. also Gael. <i>dais;</i> menn eru við heygarð þinn ok reyna desjarnar, Boll. 348; hey-des, <i>a hay-dass,</i> Bs. 54, Sturl. i. 83, 196: it exists in local names as Desjar-mýri in the cast, Des-ey in the west of Icel.",
