        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the sound of a heavy body falling;</i> heyra dett, Fms. iv. 168.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/deyda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          deyða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dd, [v. dauðr; Ulf. <i>dauþjan;</i> Germ. <i>töden;</i> Swed. <i>döda</i>]:—<i>to kill, put to death,</i> with acc., Ld. 54, Nj. 158, Fms. ii. 270: allit., deyða illum dauða, <i>to put to an ill death,</i> Clem. 57; dræpr ok deyðandi, a law term, Germ. <i>vogelfrei,</i> Gþl. 137; dræpr ok deyðr, N. G. L. i. 351: metaph. (theol.), Fms. ii. 238; d. sik, <i>to mortify one’s lusts,</i> Bs. i. 167.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/deyding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          deyðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a deadening,</i> Vídal., N. T.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/deyfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          deyfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [v. daufr; Ulf. <i>ga-daubjan;</i> Germ. <i>betäuben;</i> Dan. <i>döve;</i> Swed. <i>döfva</i>]:—<i>to make blunt;</i> d. sverð, vápn, eggjar (of weapons blunted by the look of a wizard), Korm. 220, Gísl. 80, Ísl. ii. 225; þær er d. sverð ok sefa, Sdm. 27, Eg. 509 (in a verse), Dropl. 36, Hm. 149, where this power is attributed to Odin himself.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/deyfd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          deyfð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (<strong>deyfa,</strong> u, f.), [Ulf. <i>daubiþa</i>], <i>deafness,</i> N. G. L. i. 228; <i>numbness, having no savour.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/deyfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
