          href="/word/djupr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          djúpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. djúpari, superl. djúpastr; djúpust, Greg. 62; djúpari (fem.), Eg. 99; djúpara, Ld. 78; djúpastan, Edda 34; djúpasti, Hom. 144; but in mod. use more freq. dýpri, dýpstr: [Goth. <i>djûps;</i> A. S. and Hel. <i>diôp;</i> Engl. <i>deep;</i> Germ. <i>tief;</i> Swed. <i>djup;</i> Dan. <i>dyb</i>]:—<i>deep, of</i> water; d. vatn, Grág. ii. 131; d. tjörn, Greg. 62; í hinn djúpa sæ, Edda 18, Sturl. ii. 202; djúp á, Eg. 99: of other things, a dale, pit, etc., djúpr dalr, Fms. i. 210, Edda 34; dökkva dala ok djúpa, 38; djúpar grafir (<i>pits),</i> Sks. 426; d. pyttr, Hom. 144: of a vessel (the ark), 625. 7; djúpt sár, <i>a deep sore,</i> i. e. <i>wound,</i> Dropl. 29; d. höttr, <i>a deep hat,</i> coming down over the eyes, Fms. viii. 368; d. hver, <i>a deep kettle,</i> Hým. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
