        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Goth. <i>daubnan;</i> Swed. <i>domna</i>], <i>to become dead,</i> of limbs; dofnaði höndin, Fms. vi. 203, Stj. 296, 297: of water, <i>flat,</i> Sks. 165: metaph. the phrase, dofnar yfir e-u, <i>the matter begins to die out,</i> people cease to talk about it, Fms. x. 301, Bs. i. 348, Band. 4; hugr dofnar, <i>the mind gets heavy,</i> Brandkr. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
