          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          draga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. dró, pl. drógu; part. dreginn; pres. dreg: pret. subj. drægi: [Lat. <i>trahere;</i> Ulf. <i>dragan,</i> but only once or twice, = επισωρεύειν in 2 Tim. iv. 3; Hel. <i>dragan</i> = <i>portare, ferre</i> (freq.); A. S. <i>dragan;</i> Germ. <i>tragen;</i> the Engl. distinguishes between <i>to drag</i> and <i>draw,</i> whence the derived words <i>to draggle, trail, drawl;</i> Swed. <i>draga;</i> the Danes have <i>drage,</i> but nearly obliterated except in the special sense <i>to travel,</i>—otherwise they have <i>trække,</i> formed from the mod. Germ. <i>tragen</i>]:<i>—to draw, drag, carry, pull.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
