          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          drangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a lonely up-standing rock,</i> Dipl. v. 23; kletta-drangr, fjall-drangr, etc., freq. in Icel., vide Eggert Itin. 497: many places take their names from these basalt rocks, Drangar (pl.), Drang-ey, Dranga-vík, Dranga-jökull, etc.; in popular lore these rocks were thought to be giants turned into clones, Ísl. Þjóðs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
