        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>‘adrift,’ scattered,</i> in the phrase, fara d., of troops, <i>to march in loose order,</i> Fms. i. 71, v. 56; dreifara, viii. 213.",
            }
