        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>brave, valiant,</i> Ld. 272, Fms. vii. 105, xi. 57: <i>generous,</i> vi. 96, Nj. 73, Boll. 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/drengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          drengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, a naut. term, <i>to bind fast, haul taut to a pole</i> (drengr); taka akkeri ok d. við ása, Fms. vii. 54; d. með köðlum, 82.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/drengja-modir"
          onClick={[Function]}
