          className="link"
          href="/word/drofn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dröfn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. drafnar, pl. drafnir, [akin to drefiar], <i>spots, spray-like spots;</i> hence <strong>dröfnóttr,</strong> adj. <i>spotted;</i> rauð-d., blá-d., etc., <i>red-, blue-spotted;</i> poët. <i>the foaming sea</i> is called drëfn, Fdda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/drosla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          drösla
