          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dugga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘dogger,’ small</i> (Dutch or Engl.) <i>fishing vessel,</i> Ann. 1413, where it is reported that thirty English ‘fiski-duggur’ came fishing about Icel. that summer; (hence the Engl. <i>Dogger-bank</i>):—<strong>duggari,</strong> a, m. <i>the crew of a</i> dugga, D. N. ii. 651.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dugnadar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dugnaðar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an aider, help in need,</i> 656 A, Fms. vi. 118, Fas. iii. 181: <i>a honest hard-working man</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dugnadar-stigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dugnaðar-stigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the path of virtue,</i> Hom. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dugnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dugnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ar, m. <i>doughtiness, valour, aid, assistance;</i> biðja e-n sér dugnaðar, <i>to ask one’s help</i>, 655 v. 1, Ísl. ii. 262, 293; veita e-m dugnað, <i>to give help to one,</i> Fms. v. 259: skyrtunnar d., <i>the virtue of the kirtle,</i> Fas. iii. 441: in pl., Greg.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. ir, [North. E. <i>dow</i>], <i>doughtiness, strength of soul and body,</i> Fms. viii. 411; aldri er d. í þér, <i>thou art good for nothing,</i> Grett. 24 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
