          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>dyrðill,</strong> m. a nickname, seems to mean <i>a tail,</i> = mod. dindill, Fms. i. 186, ii. 253, 279; cp. daðra, <i>to wheedle.</i>",
