          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dysja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>dysse</i> = <i>to hide</i>], <i>to bury in a cairn, heap stones over</i> a witch, criminal, or the like, never used of a proper burying, Eb. 172, Grett. 112, Fms. v. 222, Landn. 107.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dytta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dytta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, [Engl. <i>dint</i>], <i>to meddle:</i> recipr., þér höfðut til dytzt, Stj. 510: in mod. usage, dytta að e-u, <i>to varnish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dyttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dint,</i> a nickname, Fms. ii. 67; hnakka-d., <i>a ‘neck-dint,’</i> i. e. <i>a shot by a bolt in the nape of the neck,</i> Orkn. 416 (in a verse); the hnakka-dyz of the MS. is = dytts, as vaz = vatns, braz = bratts.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
