        >
          dýrð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Engl. <i>dearth</i>], <i>glory;</i> himinríkis d., <i>the glory of heaven,</i> Fms. v. 143, 230, Fær. 137, 625. 163, Fms. v. 216 (<i>a glorious miracle</i>): in pl., 623. 32, Eluc. 47; tóm d., <i>vain-glory,</i> 655 xxvi. 3: in N. T. and eccl. writers since the Reformation this word is much in use; the δόξα of the N. T. is usually rendered by dýrð.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrdar-dagr"
