              "__html": "m. <i>a song of glory.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>Deôr;</i> cp. <i>Deôra-by</i> = <i>Derby</i>]. a pr. name, Landn.: in local names, <strong>Dýra-fjörðr,</strong> in western Iceland, Landn., Gísl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>costly things;</i> dýrindis vefnaðr, <i>a costly stuff.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(and <strong>dýrðka</strong>), að, with acc. <i>to worship,</i> Stj. 103: <i>to glorify,</i> Ver. 6; d. Drottinn Guð þinn, Stj. 4. 58; d. Guðs orð, 655 C. 15; d. kenning postulanna, 14: <i>to celebrate,</i> d. þenna dag. Hom. 8: <i>to exalt,</i> nú er tíð Drottinn, sú er þú d. oss ambáttir þínar, Blas. 47; ek em Guð sá er þik dýrkaða’k, ok mun ek enn d. þik, 50: hann dýrkaði válaðan, Greg. 24; d. e-n með e-u, Fms. x. 315; d. e-n, <i>to pray one reverentially;</i> hón kastar sér fram á gólfit, dýrkaði hann, svá segjandi, Stj. 522. 2 Sam. xiv. 4; hence the common Icel. phrase, vertu ekki að d. hann, <i>don’t beg</i> (<i>coax</i>) <i>him.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrkan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrkan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>worship, adoration,</i> 623. 11: veita goðum d., 655. 1: in pl., Stj. 54: <i>glorifying,</i> dýrkan andar ok likama. 50; afguða-d., skurðgoða-d., <i>idolatry.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>dýrðlingr,</strong> Hom. 115. Bs. i. 202, Fms. i. 227). m. [A. S. <i>deôrling;</i> Engl. <i>darling</i>]:—<i>a saint, holy man;</i> Guðs d., Ver. 1. Fms. iv. 227, 232, v. 214, Bs. i. (freq.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. dýrri, superl. dýrstr, mod. more freq. dýrari, dýrastr; dyröztum, Fb. i. 211: [Ulf. does not use this word, but renders εντιμος etc. by <i>reiks</i> or <i>svêrs;</i> A. S. <i>deore;</i> Engl. <i>dear;</i> Dan. and Swed. <i>dyr;</i> O. H. G. <i>tiuri;</i> Germ. <i>theuer</i>]:—<i>dear:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrs-belgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrs-belgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a beast’s skin.</i> Fas. ii. 518 (of a bear).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrs-horn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrs-horn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a deer’s horn</i> used for a drinking cup, Eg. 306, 307, 551, Edda 82.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dyrs-hofud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dýrs-höfuð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the head of a deer,</i> Sturl. i. 106.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>deilig</i>], <i>fair,</i> (mod. and rare.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>dœgn</strong>), n. [Swed. <i>dygn;</i> Dan. <i>dögn</i>], = dægr, q. v., N. G. L. i. 335, Skálda 190; this form is very rare.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>dœgr</strong>), n. [dagr; in Dan. <i>dögn</i> means <i>the natural day</i> = 24 hours, and answers to Icel. sólar-hringr, whereas Icel. dægr usually means both <i>night</i> and <i>day</i>, so that one day makes two dægr]: hence <strong>dægra-mót</strong> or <strong>dægra-skipti,</strong> n., denotes the twilight in morning and evening, Hom. 41, Sks. 218; í degi dægr tvau, í dægri stundir tólf, <i>in a day two</i> dægr, <i>in a</i> dægr <i>twelve hours,</i> Rb. 6; þau (Day and Night) skulu ríða á hverjum tveim dægrum umhverfis jörðina, Edda 7; tuttugu ok fjórar stundir skulu vera í tveimr dægrum, Sks. 54: hann sigldi á átta dægrum til þess er hann tók Eyjar á Íslandi, and below, ek skildumk fyrir fjórum nóttum (viz. Sunday to Thursday) við Ólaf konung Haraldsson, Fms. iv. 280; þeir vóru þrjú dægr í leitinni, Nj. 265; á hverju dægri, Grág. ii. 169; á dægrinu, 360; tvau dægr, Fb. i. 539; þrjú d., 431; skipti þat mörgum dægrum, id.:—in all these passages the sense seems clearly to be as above.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegr-sigling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægr-sigling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a day’s sail,</i> Landn. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegra-far"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægra-far
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the division of day and night,</i> Sks. 26, Fms. iv. 381.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegra-stytting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægra-stytting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in the phrase, til dægra styttingar, <i>to shorten the time,</i> of pastime, Fas. iii. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daegra-tal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dægra-tal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘day-tale,’ calculation of time,</i> Rb. 488: sam-dægris (sam-dœgnis, O. H. L. 86), adv. <i>the same day;</i> also sam-dægrs: jafn-dægr or jafn-dægri, <i>equinoctial time.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dael"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dæl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>dœl</strong>), f. [dalr, dól], <i>a little dale,</i> Nj. 253. Sd. 173, Sturl. ii. 100 C: of fjalldala ok dælar, Greg. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dael-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dæl-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>-leiki,</strong> a, m.), <i>familiarity,</i> often with the notion of <i>over great freedom, easy dealing;</i> mjök kennir nú dælleika af várri hendi … er svá vándr dúkr er undir diski þínum, Bs. i. 475; fyrir dælleika sakir, Sks. 553; til þeirra dælleika, 482; gör allt í dælleikum við oss, <i>make no ceremony with us</i> (the king’s words to his host), Fms. vi. 390; hann (Moses) var svá í dælleikum við Guð, <i>M. was in such familiarity with God,</i> Ver. 23: <i>affability, condescension,</i> mildi ok dælleika, Fms. ix. 535, v. l. (of a duke): ú-dæll, <i>overbearing;</i> inn-dæll, <i>delightful.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/dael-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dæl-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [hence Dan. <i>deilig</i>], <i>genteel, fine to look at,</i> Edda 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daeld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dæld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. = dæl, Fms. x. 319.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daelir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dælir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>dæll,</strong> sing.), m. pl. <i>dales-men,</i> O. H. L. 23: mostly in compds, as Lax-dælir, Vatns-dælir, Sýr-dælir, Svarf-dælir, Fljóts-dælir, etc., <i>the men from Laxeydale, Waterdale,</i> etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dæll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>gentle, familiar, forbearing;</i> this word is no doubt akin to deila (qs. deill), i. e. one who is easy <i>‘to deal with;’</i> vertu nú dæl (i. e. <i>keep peace, be gentle</i>) meðan ek em brautu, Nj. 52; ekki þótta ek nú dæll heima, <i>I was not good to deal with at home,</i> Fms. xi. 51; ekki d. viðfangs, <i>not easy to deal with,</i> Grett. 127; dæll (<i>easy, affable</i>) öllu lands fólki, Orkn. 184: engum þótti dælt at segja konungi hersögu, Fms. i. 41; þat er eigi svá dælt (<i>easy</i>) at taka Sigurð jarl af lífdögum sem at drepa kið eðr kálf, 53; þótti þeim dælla at taka þat er flaut laust, vi. 262; þótti nú sem dælst mundi til at kalla, er ungr konungr réð fyrir ríki, Eg. 264: the phrases, göra sér dælt við e-n. <i>to put oneself on a free, familiar footing towards one;</i> Þórðr görði sér d. við þau Þorvald ok Guðrúnu, Ld. 134; ek mun nú gera mér dælt um ráðagörð við þik, <i>I will take the liberty to give thee straightforward advice,</i> Nj. 216; hann görði sér við þá dælt, Grett. 144; mun dælt við mik þykja, ef þú ert eigi í för, <i>they will pay me little heed, unless thou art with me,</i> Lv. 37; þótti vera spottsamr ok grár við alla þá er honum þótti sér dælt við, <i>rude and taunting against all whom he thought his match to deal with,</i> Bjarn. 3: proverb, dælt er heima hvat, <i>at home anything will do,</i> Hm. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/daellig-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          dællig-leikr
        </a>
        <p
