        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., akin to and derived from óðal, q. v.; old MSS. also always use the form <strong>øðli</strong> (eyðli, D. I. l. c.), Fms. x. 301, Hom. 47, 118, Greg. 48, O. H. L. 86, Eluc. 16, Hkr. i. 225, Hbl. 9, Bs. i. 335, 342; eðli is more modern, but öðli is still preserved:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
