          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(and <strong>ey-muni</strong>), a, m. <i>an ever-memorable thing;</i> þat er þeim eimuni, <i>they will never forget,</i> Fms. iv. 249; þat man þér eymuni, <i>thou wilt never forget it,</i> Bjarn. 25 (in a verse); eymuni hinn mikli (name of a very severe winter), Ann. 1291.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
