        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an isthmus, neck of land;</i> mjótt e., Eg. 129; rastarlangt eið, Fms. ix. 402; hence the names of places, Satíris-eið, <i>the Mull of Cantire,</i> Orkn. 152; Skalp-eið, <i>Scalpa</i> (in Orkney), 244; Eiðar (a farm), Eiða-skógr (in Sweden), Eiða-fjörðr, Eiðs-berg, Eiðs-vágr, Eiðs-völlr (in Norway), Eið = <i>Aith</i> (in Shetland).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
