        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an oath-brother, confederate,</i> Fms. ix. 294, Bær. 16: metaph., arnar e., <i>the oath-brother of the eagle, the raven</i> Fagrsk 4 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
