          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ein-angr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., Lat. <i>angustiae, a narrow passage:</i> metaph. <i>a great strait;</i> the proverb, margr verðr vaskr í einangrinum, þótt lítt sé vaskir þess á milli, <i>many a man is bold in perils, though …,</i> Eb. 60; útilleitinn (<i>unprovoking</i>) en öruggr i einangri, <i>but bold if put in a strait,</i> Grett. 120.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ein-angra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ein-angra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to put one in a strait, drive into a corner,</i> Stj. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ein-ardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ein-arðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
