        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/eining"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          eining
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>unity</i>, Hom. 55, Ver. 46, Fms. i. 281, Sks. 604.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Swed. <i>en</i>] <i>juniper,</i> Edda (Gl.), Stj. 396, Hjalt. <strong>einir-ber,</strong> n. <i>berries of the juniper,</i> Hjalt. <strong>einir-lauf,</strong> n. <i>leaves of the juniper,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to appoint for a peculiar use;</i> hann einkaði til þess eitt hús, Sks. 622; hlutr einkaðr kirkjunni, H. E. i. 258; ok var þar til einkaðr Guðmundr prestr, Bs. i. 452: <i>to dedicate,</i> Karl. 301.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einka-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einka-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(rarely <strong>einkar-</strong>), in COMPDS denoting,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einkan-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einkan-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>especially, particularly,</i> Fms. i. 20, 191, K. Á. 216, 230, Bs. i. 771.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einkan-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einkan-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>especial,</i> Stj. 6, H. E. i. 502, 655 xxxii. 8: <i>extraordinary,</i> Bs. ii. 18, 159, 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einkar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einkar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "prefixed to adjectives or adverbs = Scot. <i>unco</i> = <i>specially, greatly, very;</i> e. vel, <i>very well,</i> Fms. xi. 18; e. fagr, <i>very fine, beautiful,</i> ii. 300; e. skjótt, <i>with great speed,</i> Eg. 354; e. trauðr, <i>very unwilling,</i> Fms. xi. 98; e. mjök, <i>very much,</i> viii. 186; e. lítill, <i>very small,</i> Fbr. 99 new Ed.: cp. Lex. Poët., (very freq. in mod. use.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einkum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einkum
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dat. used as adv. <i>‘unco,’ chiefly, especially,</i> Landn. 282, Fms. xi. 25, viii. 102, Fs. 21, K. Þ. K. 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einmanadar-samkvama"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einmánaðar-samkváma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a meeting held</i> (in northern and eastern Icel.) <i>at the beginning of the Einmanad,</i> mentioned in Sturl. iii. 311, Lv. 65, Vápn. (Ný Fél. xxi. 124), Jb. 301, Fs. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., pl. einir, acc. sing. einn, but also einan, esp. in the sense al-einan etc.; [Gr. εἱς, εν; Lat. <i>ūnus,</i> and early Lat. <i>oinos</i>; Ulf. <i>ains;</i> A. S. <i>ân;</i> Engl. <i>one</i>, in E. Engl. proncd. like <i>stone, bone;</i> Scot. <i>ane;</i> Swed. <i>en;</i> Dan. <i>een</i>]:—<i>one.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einn-ig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          einn-ig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>einn-eg, einn-og, einn-ug</strong>), in mod. pronunciation and in MSS. of the 15th century <strong>einninn</strong> or <strong>einneginn</strong> (qs. einn veginn), adv. [from einn and vegr, qs. einn veg; cp. hvernig, <i>how</i>; þannig, <i>thus;</i> hinnig, <i>otherwise</i>]:—<i>in the same way, likewise, also;</i> the subst. notion is still seen in the phrase, á einneg, <i>in the same manner,</i> 686 B. 12, Hom. (St.) 64; ek vil sjá hvernog þú markar þinn hlut, at eigi markim vit einnog báðir, Hkr. iii. 59; eigi þótti öllum einnug, Ísl. ii. 352; Torfa Svartsson einnig (<i>likewise</i>), Sturl. i. 103; einneginn Ölver, <i>O. likewise,</i> Fas. iii. 470; fylgir honum ok einninn sá kappi, Fas. i. 419; létu þeir einninn syngja í kirkju, Bs. (Laur. S.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/eins-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          eins-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>alone, by oneself,</i> Sks. 2: <i>singly,</i> Fms. i. 139, Stj. 184: <i>especial,</i> Magn. 512: gramm. <i>singular,</i> Skálda 185, 191.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/einsetu-kona"
