          className="link"
          href="/word/ek"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ek
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pers. pron., mod. <strong>eg,</strong> proncd. <strong>ég</strong> or <strong>jeg;</strong> eg occurs as early as in MSS. of the 15th century, Arna-Magn. 556 A; <strong>jak,</strong> Fms. x. 287, cp. the mod. Swed. form and the mod. Icel. jeg; old poets make it rhyme with <i>ek,</i> as, Halldórr ok <i>ek</i> | höfum engi <i>þrek,</i> Korm. 154 (in a verse), cp. Ld. 108: [Ulf. <i>ïk</i>, but <i>ek</i> on the Golden horn and on the stone in Tune; A. S. <i>ic;</i> Engl. <i>I;</i> Germ. <i>ich;</i> old Swed. <i>jak,</i> mod. <i>jag;</i> Dan. <i>jeg;</i> cp. Lat. <i>ego</i>, Gr. ἐγώ]:—<i>I,</i> Nj. 10, 30, 132, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
