          className="link"
          href="/word/ekkju-sonr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ekkju-sonr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a widow’s son,</i> 656 A. ii. In Edda 108 there is a distinction between hæll, <i>a widow whose husband is slain,</i> and ekkja, <i>the widow of one who died a natural death;</i> hæll is merely a poët. word and obsolete, but ekkja is in full use. In old poetry ekkja is used = <i>a lass, girl,</i> cp. Lapp. <i>akka</i> = Lat. <i>mulier;</i> cp. also Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
