        >
          ellifu
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>ellefu,</strong> ord. numb., the Goth. <i>ainlif;</i> A. S. <i>ellefne;</i> Engl. <i>eleven;</i> Germ. <i>eilf;</i> Swed. <i>elfva;</i> Dan. <i>elleve:</i>—‘lif’ is an obsolete word, denoting <i>ten</i>, so that ‘<i>eleven, twelve’</i> are formed just like thirteen, fourteen, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
