        >
          elta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to chase,</i> with acc.; þeir eltu einn hjört, Flóv. 27 ; elta dýr á spori, Barl. 199; e. sauði, <i>to run after sheep, in order to fetch them back,</i> Nj. 27, Korm. 28 (in a verse); eltu Þjálfa, Hbl. 39; þeir höfðu elt af skipum Tryggva konung, <i>they had driven king T. from his ships,</i> Fms. i. 37; Styrkárr elti þá suðr í Karmsund, ix. 54; hljópu á land upp ok eltu þá, iv. 304, Gullþ. 21; e. öxn með vendi, <i>to drive cattle with a goad,</i> Karl. 471.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
