        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, mod. að, <i>to attend, wait upon,</i> with dat.; e. gestum, <i>to wait upon guests;</i> kann vera at Guð yðvarr sé á málstefnu, eðr eigi gestum at e., Stj. 593. I Kings xviii. 27; eigi samneytti hon, heldr e. hon, <i>she ate not with the people, but waited on them,</i> 655 xxxi A. 3; e. fé, <i>to serve the cattle, to milk,</i> Ísl. ii. 334, 482.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
