        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, with acc. <i>to honour with a funeral feast,</i> cp. the Irish phrase <i>to ‘wake’ him,</i> Eg. 606; síðan lét Egill e. sonu sína eptir fornri síðvenju, 644, Fms. i. 161, xi. 67. 2. <i>to inherit,</i> N. T. and mod. writers.",
            }
