        >
          erfið-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>with pain and toil;</i> er hann sótti e. til hans, <i>he strove hard to get up to him,</i> Edda 60; e-t horfir e., <i>looks hard,</i> Nj. 139; búa e. við e-n, <i>to treat one harshly,</i> Fas. ii. 96; at skipi þessu farisk e., <i>that his ship will fare ill, make a bad voyage,</i> vi. 376; varð mér þar erviðligast um, <i>there I met with the greatest difficulties,</i> Nj. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
