        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>toilsome, hard, difficult;</i> ok var af því honum erfitt búit, <i>a heavy, troublesome household,</i> Bs. i. 63; erfiða ferð hafa þeir fengit oss, <i>they have made a hard journey for us,</i> Fms. v. 22; Guðrún var erfið á gripa-kaupum, <i>G. was troublesome</i> (<i>extravagant</i>) <i>in buying finery,</i> Ld. 134; e-m verðr e-t erfitt, <i>one has a difficulty about the thing,</i> Fms. vi. 54.",
            }
