        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ja, m., (<strong>arfingi,</strong> Fms. ix. 328, Gþl. 287), pl. erfingjar, [<i>arbingjas</i> (pl.), Runic stone in Tune; Ulf. renders κληρονόμος by <i>arbja</i> or <i>arbinumja;</i> Dan. <i>arving;</i> Swed. <i>arfvinge</i>]:—<i>an heir,</i> Grág. i. 217, Eg. 25, Nj. 3, 656 C. 36, Fms. l. c., etc. etc. <strong>erfingja-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>without heirs,</i> Fms. v. 298, x. 307.",
            }
