        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [argr], <i>lewdness, lust;</i> ergi, æði ok óþola, Skm. 36, Fas. iii. 390; e. keisara dóttur, Bær. 15, El. 10; ílsku ok e. ok hórdóm, Barl. 138: <i>wickedness,</i> með e. ok skelmisskap, Gísl, 31, Yngl. S. ch. 7: in mod. usage <strong>ergja,</strong> f., means <i>greediness</i> for money or the like; the rare sense of <i>moodiness</i> is quite mod., and borrowed from Germ. through Dan.",
            }
          }
        />
