        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "atti; pres. et; part. att; but etjað, Andr. 625. 73; [it means probably <i>‘to make bite,’</i> a causal of eta]:—<i>to make fight,</i> with dat., esp. etja hestum, of horse fights, a favourite sport of the ancients; for a graphic description of this fight see Bs. i. 633. Arons S. ch. 18, Glúm. ch. 18, Rd. ch. 12, Nj. ch. 58, 59, Vígl. ch. 7, N. G. L. ii. 126; vide hesta-þing, hesta-at, víg-hestr, etc.",
