        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Goth. <i>faþa</i> = φραγμός; A. S. <i>fæðem</i>; Engl. <i>fathom</i>; O. H. G. <i>fadam</i>; Germ. <i>faden</i> or <i>fadem</i> = Lat. <i>filum</i>; Dan. <i>favn</i>; Swed. <i>famn</i>; the root is akin to that of Gr. πετάννυμι, cp. Lat. <i>patere, pandere</i>, prop. <i>to stretch out</i>]:—<i>a fathom</i>:",
            }
