        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a big gun,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fall-valtr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fall-valtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>reeling,</i> metaph. in eccl. writers, <i>faltering, changeable, uncertain,</i> of worldly things, opp. to heavenly; f. heimr, f. líf. Post. 656 B. 11, Magn. 504; f. hlutir, opp. to eilífr hlutir, Hom. 42; f. fagnaðr þessa lífs, Fms. i. 225; fallvaltan rikdóm, 1 Tim. vi. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
