        >
          falla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. féll, 2nd pers. féllt, mod. féllst, pl. féllu; pres. fell, pl. föllum; part. fallinn; reflex. féllsk, fallisk, etc., with the neg. suffix fellr-at, féll-at, féllsk-at, Am. 6, vide Lex. Poët. [Common to all Teut. languages except Goth. (Ulf. renders πίπτειν by <i>drjûsan</i>); A. S. <i>feallan;</i> Engl. <i>fall; Germ. fallen;</i> Dan. <i>falde;</i> Swed. <i>falla.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
