              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [<i>fal,</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>the socket of a spear’s head in which the handle is put,</i> often richly ornamented (spjóts-falr), Fas. iii. 388, Stj. 461, Eg. 285, 726, Edda 83, Ld. 98, Nj. 108, K. Þ. K. 96, Fms. iv. 278, 338, Fs. 127; vide Worsaae 344 sqq., 498.",
            }
