              "__html": "m. pl. [faðir], <i>father and son</i> (or <i>sons</i>), Eg. 18; Kveldúlfr ok þeir feðgar, <i>Kveldulf himself and his son,</i> 84; við feðgar, <i>we, father and son,</i> Nj. 8, Stj. 190; þeim feðgum, Fms. vii. 65, Fbr. 22; vin þeirra Sturlu feðga, <i>a friend of Sturla and his father,</i> Sturl. ii. 111; lang-feðgar, q. v., <i>lineage of agnates.</i>",
            }
