            {
              "__html": "adj. [Lat. <i>pinguis;</i> Gr. πίων; A. S. <i>fætt;</i> Engl. <i>fat</i>; Hel. <i>feit;</i> early High Germ. <i>feiss;</i> mod. but Low Germ. form <i>fett;</i> Dan. <i>feed;</i> Swed. <i>fet</i>]:—<i>fat,</i> Nj. 52, Eg. 137, Fbr. 19, Lv. 18, Fms. i. 36, v. 93, x. 303, Stj. 42; vide fita.",
