            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fell, wild hill,</i> Hrafn. 4, Ísl. ii. 76, passim: freq. in local names; Helga-fell, Mos-fell, Mið-fell, Meðal-fell, Þórólfs-fell, and Fell alone, vide Landn. In Icel. fell is <i>a single hill,</i> and in pl. <i>a range of hills;</i> fjall (= Lat. <i>mons</i>) is a general name.",
            }
          }
        />
