        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>frightened;</i> fara f., Njarð. 370: cp. the phrase, e-m verðr felmt, <i>to be terrified, panic-stricken,</i> Nj. 105, Fms. viii. 189, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
