        >
          felmtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [fálma], <i>alarm, fear;</i> f. eða flótti, Fms. i. 45, viii. 226. <strong>felms-fullr</strong> (or <strong>felmts-fullr</strong>), adj. <i>alarmed, frightened,</i> Fms. i. 217, Orkn. 16, Grett. 124.",
            }
