        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in old writers strong, pret. fat, pl. fátu; in mod. usage weak, fetaði, and so in paper MSS., Fas. iii. 492; fötuðu, Bs. i. 291, is undoubtedly an error for fátu:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
