          className="link"
          href="/word/fimr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fimr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>nimble, agile,</i> in bodily exercise; fimr við leika, Fms. ii. 91; fimr ok hverjum manni görvari at sér um alla hluti, viii. 343; sterkr ok fimr, Hkr. i. 290; fimr ok skjótr, Fms. x. 314; fimr í orrostum, ii. 106:—neut. as adv. <i>dexterously, speedily,</i> bændum fór eigi fimt at reka flóttann, viii. 407; nú lát við fimt at leita duranna, Hom. 120; víg-fimr, <i>skilled in fight;</i> orð-fimr, mál-fimr, <i>quick of tongue, eloquent:</i> the prop. noun <strong>Fima-fengr</strong> prob. means <i>nimble-fingered,</i> Ls.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fimt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fimt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>fimmt,</strong> f. <i>a number of five:</i> <strong>fimtar-tala,</strong> u, f. <i>a set of five</i> or <i>multiple of five</i> (as fifteen, fifty, etc.), Bs. i. 190.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fimtar-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fimtar-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the Fifth High Court in the Icel. Commonwealth,</i> vide dómr, Grág. Þ. Þ., etc.; the form of the word is irregular, as it means <i>the Fifth Court</i> (added to the four Quarter Courts) = dómr hinn fimmti, as it is also called in Grág. Þ. Þ. ch. 24 sqq.; the old Scandin. law term fimt seems to have floated before the mind of the founders, as fimtar-dómr etymologically answers to Swed. <i>femt,</i> i. e. a court before which one has to appear a ‘fimt’ from the citation.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fimtar-thing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fimtar-þing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a</i> (Norse) <i>meeting</i> called so, Js. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fimtardoms-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fimtardoms-stefna
        </a>
        <p
