        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the oath to be taken in the Fifth Court,</i> Grág. Þ. Þ. ch. 26. 27, Nj. 241; in Sturl. ii. 128 used of an oath worded as the oath in the Fifth Court.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
