              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘finger-gold’, a ring,</i> Nj. 16, Boll. 356, Bs. i. 641, Fms. iv. 130, Worsaae 243–246, 381–383, 433 sqq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
