        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>firnindi,</strong> n. pl. <i>a wilderness, desert,</i> in the phrase, fjöll ok f., Fms. viii. 432.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
