              "__html": "a, m. <i>a far distance;</i> vera, liggja, í fjarska, <i>to be afar off,</i> Fms. xi. 57, Sks. 183, Fas. iii. 459:—metaph. in mod. usage <i>immensity,</i> and in many COMPDS: fjarskalegr, fjarskaliga, fjarskamikill, etc.",
            }
