        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Goth. <i>fijan</i> = μισειν; A. S. <i>feon</i> or <i>fjan</i>], <i>to hate;</i> an obsolete word, but occurs in Hým. 22, Ls. 35: reflex., fjásk e-n, <i>to hate one</i>, Skm. 33. Its participle however remains in all Teut. dialects, vide fjándi below.",
            }
