        >
          fjálbr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>fjálfr,</strong> n. a dubious word, [akin to fela (?)], <i>the deep, an abyss,</i> Haustl. 18; undir-f., <i>the lower deep, the abyss</i>, Þd. 19.",
