        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [<i>feleg</i> = <i>safe</i> in Dan. ballads; <i>fjelg</i> = <i>comfortable,</i> Ivar Aasen; prob. from fela]:—<i>safe, well kept,</i> only in compds, glóð-fjálgr, <i>hid in embers,</i> of a fire, Ýt. 21; inn-f., <i>stifled,</i> of tears, Hkv. 2. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
