          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in many compds = fer-, q. v.: <strong>fjór-fættr,</strong> adj. <i>four-footed;</i> <strong>fjor-menningr,</strong> m. <i>a fourth cousin,</i> Js. 71, 96, Fms. i. 285, Gþl. 145; <strong>fjor-mynntr,</strong> part. <i>‘four-cloven,’</i> Sks. 394; <strong>fjór-nættingr,</strong> m., <strong>fjór-skeyttr,</strong> adj., vide fer-; <strong>fjór-skiptr,</strong> part. <i>quartered,</i> Stj. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-tan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjór-tán
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "card. numb., [older form <strong>fjögr-tán</strong> or <strong>fjugr-tán,</strong> B. K. 9, 60, 62, 125, Sks. 179 B]:—<i>fourteen</i> (passim). <strong>fjórtán-sessa,</strong> u, f. <i>a ship with fourteen oars,</i> Fms. ix. 408, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-tandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjór-tándi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ord. numb., [older form <strong>fjögr-tándi</strong> or <strong>fjugr-tándi,</strong> N. G. L. i. 49, 348, 350; <strong>fjogr-tándi,</strong> Fms. x. 398]:—<i>fourteenth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-tugti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjór-tugti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>the fortieth,</i> Dipl. ii. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Germ. <i>vierte</i>; Dan. <i>fjærde</i>], <i>the fourth,</i> Fms. i. 67 (passim).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordunga-mot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðunga-mót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the borders of the</i> f., Grág. ii. 323, Landn. 251 (v. l.), 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordunga-skipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðunga-skipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a division into quarters.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., generally <i>the fourth part, quarter,</i> D. I. i. 470, Grág. i. 144; f. héraðsmanna, N. G. L. i. 352; f. rastar, <i>the fourth part of a mile,</i> Fms. viii. 63; fjórðungr vísu, <i>the fourth part of a verse-system</i> or <i>stanza,</i> = <i>two lines,</i> Edda (Ht.); hence <strong>fjórðunga-lok,</strong> n. <i>the last quarter of a verse,</i> Fms. vi. 387: <i>a coin</i> (cp. Engl. <i>farthing</i>), N. G. L. iii. ch. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordungs-hofdingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðungs-höfðingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a Tetrarch,</i> N. T.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordungs-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðungs-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the inhabitants of a</i> fjórðungr, Grág. Þ. Þ., Landn. 98, Nj. 100.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordungs-sekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðungs-sekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>outlawry, exile from one of the quarters,</i> Bs. ii. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjordungs-umagi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórðungs-úmagi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a pauper charged to a</i> f., Grág. i. 445.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjorir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjórir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "num. adj., fem. fjórar, neut. fjögur (fjugur); gen. fjogurra or fjögurra (fjugurra, N. G. L. i. 77, Sks. 173 B), mod. fjögra; dat. fjórum; acc. masc. fjóra, fem. fjórar, neut. fjögur: [Goth. <i>fidvar;</i> A. S. <i>feover;</i> Engl. <i>four;</i> Hel. <i>fivar</i>; O. H. G. <i>fior;</i> Germ. <i>vier;</i> Swed. <i>fyra;</i> Dan. <i>fire;</i> cp. also Lat. <i>quatuor,</i> Gr. τέσσαρες, Aeol. πίσυρες]:—<i>four</i> (passim). <strong>fjögra-manna-far,</strong> n. <i>a four-oared boat.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjos"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjós
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n., contr. form = fé-hús = <i>‘cow-house,’</i> [Norse <i>fjös;</i> the contracted form is usual even in the earliest writers]:—<i>a cow-house, byre, stall,</i> Ld. 98, Gísl. 28 sqq., Dropl. 28, Njarð. 368, Sturl. ii. 43, iii. 54, Fms. ix. 508; vera í fjósi, or fara í fjós, <i>to attend to the cows.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjuk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjúk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. Engl. <i>fog</i>], <i>a snow-storm:</i> allit., frost ok fjúk, Fbr. 23; fjúk ok drifa, Bs. i. 158; fjúk var úti, 672; í fjúki, Landn. 235; stormr með fjúki, Fas. ii. 74: in swearing, fái þat fjúk, <i>a</i> ‘fjúk’ <i>upon it.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjuk-renningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjúk-renningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a snow-drift,</i> Sturl. i. 155 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjuk-saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjúk-saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a floating rumour,</i> Bret.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjuk-vidri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjúk-viðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a snow-storm,</i> Sturl. ii. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjuka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjúka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. fauk, 2nd pers. faukt, mod. faukst, pl. fuku; pres. fýk, pl. fjúkum; pret. subj. fyki; part. fokinn; sup. fokit: [Swed. <i>fyka;</i> Dan. <i>fyga</i>]:—<i>to be driven on, tossed by the wind,</i> of snow, dust, spray, or the like: allit., fjúka sem fys, <i>as chaff;</i> mold er fýkr, 623. 25; axhelmur þær sem fjúka … ef nokkut fýkr frá oss, Stj. 422: of snow, tók þá at f., <i>it began to snow,</i> Grett. 111; var fjúkanda veðr, <i>there was a snow-storm,</i> 144: hafði fokit yfir öndverðan vetr, <i>they had been buried</i> (<i>had perished</i>) <i>in the snow,</i> Glúm. 341; hence the metaph. phrase, nú er fokið í flest skjól, <i>now all places of shelter are filled with snow, no refuge left,</i> Gísl. 63, Nj. 258; útvegar Háreks eru foknir, <i>all H.’s outgoings are stopped,</i> Fms. xi. 423; sýndisk þeim sem eldr fyki um alla gluggana, of embers, Bs. i. 7; fauk svá sandrinn, at …, of the ashes from a volcano, 804, (sand-fok, <i>a drift of sand or ashes.</i>)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and compds, vide fjarri, <i>farther off.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjöðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen. fjaðrar; old pl. fjaðrar, later fjaðrir; dat. fjöðrum: [A. S. <i>feðer;</i> Engl. <i>feather;</i> Germ. <i>feder;</i> Gr. πτερόν]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjogur-tan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjögur-tán
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "fjogurtándi, older form, = fjórtan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjöl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. fjalar, old pl. fjalar, later fjalir, <i>a deal, thin board,</i> Fms. vi. 15, 281, x. 404: metaph. of <i>snow shoes,</i> Sks. 81 B: so in the proverb, það er ekki við eina fjöl fellt, <i>‘tis not joined with a single deal, ‘tis no plain matter,</i> Mag. 86; or, hann er ekki við eina fjöl felldr, i. e. <i>fit for many things;</i> fóta-fjöl, <i>a foot-board;</i> höfða-fjöl, <i>the head-board of a bed;</i> rúm-fjöl, <i>the side-board of a bed;</i> gafl-fjöl, <i>the barge-board</i> in a gable, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjol-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjöl-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[akin to Gr. πολύς; Ulf. <i>filu</i> = πολύς; A. S. <i>fela;</i> O. H. G. <i>filu;</i> Germ. <i>viel;</i> lost in Engl. and mod. Dan.; in Icel. freq., esp. as a prefix in poetry, but never used as an independent adj.]:—<i>much, manifold.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjol-modi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjöl-móði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the sea-snipe, tringa maritima,</i> so called from its wailing note, Edda (Gl.); hence <strong>fjölmóða-víl,</strong> n. <i>pitiful wailing,</i> vide Ísl. Þjóðs. pref. p. xi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjoldi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjöldi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>fjölði,</strong> a, m. <i>multitude,</i> Fms. i. 37, Eg. 74, 79, Nj. 8; fjöldi manna = fjölmenni, N. G. L. i. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjölð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = fjöldi, <i>a multitude,</i> Fms. ii. 199, Róm. 383: esp. in poetry, with gen. <i>a plenty of,</i> Höfuðl. 16, Am. 8. 92, Gs. 5, Þkv. 23, Skv. 3. 2, Gh. 18: used as adv. [Germ. <i>viel</i>], <i>much,</i> Vþm. 3, passim, Hm. 17, 73, Sdm. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjolga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjölga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to make to increase,</i> Sturl. iii. 242: impers., Fas. i. 73.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjolgan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjölgan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>increase in number,</i> Fms. v. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjollottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjöllóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mountainous,</i> Fb. i. 431, Stj. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., dat. fjörvi, mod. fjöri, [Ulf. renders κόσμος by <i>fairvus;</i> A. S. <i>feorh,</i> pl. <i>feoru</i> = <i>life;</i> Hel. <i>firah;</i> obsolete in Engl., Germ., Swed., and Dan.]:—<i>life,</i> Vsp. 33; með fjörvi, 623. 49: esp. freq. in allit. phrases, eiga fótum fjör at launa; fjör ok fé, Fms. iv. 77, Grág. ii. 21, Sl. 1; frekr er hver til fjörsins, Þorst. St. 54, Nj. 124; allt er fjörvi firr, Ld. 266.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-baugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-baugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘life-money,’</i> a law term, <i>a fee</i> amounting to a mark, to be paid by a convict of the lesser degree to the executive court (féránsdómr); and if this was not paid, the convict was henceforth a full outlaw::—hence the convict is called <strong>fjörbaugs-maðr</strong> and the lesser outlawry or conviction <strong>fjörbaugs-garðr,</strong> m., because within a fixed space (garðr), the convict was safe, having paid the life-money, vide esp. Grág. Þ. Þ. ch. 32 sqq., ch. 40, Nj. 240, and the Sagas and laws passim. In two passages, viz. Flóam. S. ch. 10 and Glúma ch. 24, fjörbaugsgarðr is used in the same sense as þing-helgi, q. v., viz. of <i>the sacred boundary</i> of a meeting, regarded by the heathens as <i>a sanctuary,</i> cp. Eb. ch. 4 fine; in the Edit. of Flóam. S. the passage ‘til Lóns’ is false, the probable reading being ‘til Lopz,’ i. e. Lopts; in the old MS. Vatnshyrna the shank of the <i>p</i> was prob. obliterated so as to make it look like <i>n,</i> and so one transcriber read ‘Lóns,’ another ‘Jóns;’ the reading ‘Lopts’ is born out by the historical context, cp. also Landn. 5, ch. 8; the word fjörbaugr is diffusely commented on in H. E. i. 137 sqq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-brosa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-brosa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n, f. <i>a lovely smile;</i> sumir menn mæla at móðir þín sé engi f., <i>some people say that thy mother is no</i> f., Mirm. 69.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-brot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-brot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the death-struggle,</i> esp. of wild beasts, Fær. 49, Fm. 21, Bs. i. 345: Norse, <i>a taking of life, manslaughter,</i> N. G. L. i. 156.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-gamall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-gamall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stone-old,</i> (mod.); cp. fjörðgamall.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-gjafi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-gjafi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>one who saves another’s life,</i> = lífgjafi, Al. 98, Mork. 109.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-grid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-grið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>truce for one’s life,</i> Grág. ii. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-lostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fjör-löstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>loss of life,</i> Grág. i. 187, Fms. xi. 135; used in the phrase, verða e-m að fjörlesti, <i>to cause one’s death,</i> Gísl. 62.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fjor-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
