          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flug-snarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = flugskjótr, Art. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flug-stigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flug-stigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a path of flight,</i> poët., Hkv. 2. 47: the popular phrase, eg var kominn á flugstig að fara, <i>I was just about to go</i> (or do a thing), but always with the notion that one is prevented at the last moment.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fluga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fluga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u. f., gen. pl. flugna, <i>a fly, gnat, moth,</i> Stj. 23, 91, Pr. 474, Edda 70, Ver. 20; gesta-fluga, <i>a moth;</i> mý-f., <i>a gnat;</i> bý-f., <i>a bee;</i> randa-f., <i>a wasp;</i> hunangs-f., <i>a honey-fly,</i> a kind of Icel. bee; mel-f., <i>a clothes-moth;</i> þev-f., a kind of <i>tipula:</i> myki-f., <i>a dung-fly:</i> maðka-f., <i>a maggot-fly,</i> all three <i>musca,</i> etc., vide Eggert Itin. ch. 688: the phrase, eins og fluga, <i>swift as a fly.</i> Wizards were said to bewitch flies and send them to kill their enemies (vide galdra-fluga, gand-fluga), hence the phrase, gína við flugu, or taka flugu, <i>to swallow the fly</i> or <i>to carry the fly,</i> i. e. <i>to be the tool of another man,</i> esp. in a wicked and fatal business, Eb. 164; ef Hallgerðr kemr annarri flugu í munn þér, <i>if H. puts another fly in thy mouth,</i> i. e. <i>makes thee to carry another lie,</i> Nj. 64; þeir gina við þessi flugu, Al. 9; era mínligt flugu at gína, <i>‘tis not ‘mine-like’ to open the mouth for flies,</i> i. e. <i>lies and slander,</i> Kristni S. (in a verse of the year 998); hann fær komit þeirri flugu í munn eins skiptings, Fms. xi. 445.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flugdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flugði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a pret. of a lost verb <strong>flygja,</strong> <i>to shudder;</i> hón flugði öll, <i>she shuddered all over</i> (from horror), Eb. 318.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flugu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flugu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘a man of flies,’ a wizard,</i> occurs in this sense in the old Swed. law (Verel.): hence metaph. <i>a hired bandit, an assassin,</i> Landn. 181, N. G. L. ii. 51, Fms. v. 45, 190, vi. 188, Glúm. 361, Rd. 307, Lv. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flugu-mannligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flugu-mannligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>looking assassin-like,</i> Fs. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flutning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flutning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., used as masc. (<strong>flutningr</strong>) in Norse writers, Gþl. 432, in mod. usage masc. throughout, [flytja]:—<i>transport, carriage of goods;</i> flutning hálfa, Pm. 122; f. öll, Vm. 150; allar flutningar, Grág. ii. 357, 359, Fms. iv. 121, viii. 179, Band. 2:—<i>conveyance of persons,</i> Eg. 75, 477: in mod. usage also = farmr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flúð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>low skerries</i> or <i>reefs flooded by the sea;</i> á flúð eða skeri, Mar.; flúð ok fall, Bs. ii. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flúr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [for. word; Lat. <i>flos</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flur-braud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flúr-brauð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>flour-bread,</i> Stj. 121, Fms. ix. 241.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flur-hleifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flúr-hleifr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a flour-loaf,</i> El. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fluradr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flúraðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>flowery,</i> esp. in a bad sense, of an affected style, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flurur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flúrur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. = flúð; hált er helzt á flúrum, Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flydra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flyðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a flounder,</i> Edda (Gl.), Bs. ii. 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flygill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flygill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Germ. <i>flügel</i>], <i>a wing,</i> Þiðr. 92, where it seems borrowed from German ballads.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flyka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flyka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(and <strong>flyksa</strong>), u, f. <i>a flake, rag,</i> metaph. <i>a phantom,</i> Grett. 111.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flykkjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flykkjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, dep. [flokkr], <i>to crowd,</i> Fms. viii. 81, 411, Hom. 65, Fas. ii. 80, Orkn. 372 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flysja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flysja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [flos], <i>to split</i> or <i>cut into slices,</i> Háv. 31 new Ed.; cp. flís.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flysjungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flysjungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a fop, charlatan.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flytja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flytja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. flyt: pret. flutti; sup. flutt:—<i>to cause to flit, carry,</i> Gísl. 133; flytja vöru til skips, Nj. 4, Skálda 163, Eg. 125, 194: of trade, <i>to export</i> or <i>import,</i> þenna fjárhlut f. menn þaðan, Sks. 184; kaupmenn er mest gæði flytja landi þessu, Fms. vii. 122; frillu þá er þú hefir flutt af Noregi, Ld. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flytjan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flytjan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a helping, promoting,</i> Stj. 111.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flyxa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flyxa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "v. flyka.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. flý; pret. flýði; sup. flýð; part. flýiðr: mod. <strong>flúa,</strong> pret. flúði, part. flúinn, pres. flý; an older form with <i>œ</i>—<strong>flœja,</strong> pres. flœ, pret. flœði—occurs in poetry and old prose; <i>skœðr</i> and <i>flœði</i> rhyme even in Pd. 47 (of the 12th century): this older form is rightly formed from the part. fló; sup. flýit, Fms. i. 26; flœr (pres.), 623. 26; flœðu (pret.), Bret. 74; but flýðu, 40; flyiðr (part.), Edda 154 (pref.): flœja (inf.), Sdm. 21, 677. 10, 655 xiv. A. 1, 623. 16; fleoði—flœði, Hom. (St.) 3; pret. indin. flœðu (<i>fugisse</i>), Ód. 9; pret. subj. flœðim (<i>fugeremus</i>) Fms. ii. 181 (in a verse): [cp. Ulf. <i>þljûhan;</i> A. S. <i>fleon;</i> O. H. G. <i>fliûhan,</i> mod. <i>fliehen;</i> Engl. <i>flee;</i> no strong verb corresponding to this occurs in the Scandin., except fljúga, which in very old times served for both <i>fugere</i> and <i>volare,</i> vide s. v.]:—<i>to flee,</i> Lat. <i>fugere;</i> þeir flýðu til Upplanda, Fms. i. 19; víst vil ek eigi flýja, x. 348; Kjötvi hinn auðgi flyði, Eg. 33, Sks. 716 B; þá er Eirekr hafði brott flýit, Fms. i. 26: landsmenn féllu ok flýðu, Bret. 40; Tyrkir vóru flyðir í borgina, 88; flýja undan, <i>to flee from one pursuing,</i> Eg. 269; or, flyja undan e-m, 623. 16; flýja undan banvænligu höggi, Edda 154.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, [hence fljótr], <i>to hasten, make haste,</i> with dat.; flýta ferðinni, <i>to hasten on one’s journey,</i> Grett. 99, Bs. i. 130; flýta sér, <i>to hasten, speed oneself,</i> Stj. 221, Þórð. 69.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flytir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flýtir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>fleetness, speed,</i> Stj. 172, Lv. 41, Fas. iii. 219. <strong>flýtis-verk,</strong> n. <i>hurried work.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dd, [flóð], <i>to flood over,</i> Stj. 56, 284, Ann. 1345: <i>to flow,</i> of the tide, Fms. vi. 163, ix. 44, x. 98: impers., fé ok skip (acc.) flæðir, <i>the flood-tide overtakes sheep and boats,</i> i. e. <i>they are lost by the tide,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-bakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-bakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = flæðibakki, Gísl. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>flood-mark,</i> i. e. <i>the space between low and high water,</i> N. G. L. i. 13, Landn. 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-mus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-mús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘flood-mouse,’</i> a fabulous animal in nursery tales, vide Ísl. Þjóðs. and Maurer’s Volksagen; the word is, however, probably only a corruption from Germ. <i>‘fleder-maus,’ the bat.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-pyttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-pyttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a pit on the beach,</i> Fs. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-sker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-sker
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = flæðisker, Edda 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-timi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-tími
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>flood-time, high water,</i> Stj. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedar-urd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðar-urð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rocks reached by high water,</i> Grett. 99. The word flæðr may be used as a test, to shew whether a MS. was written in the west of Icel. or not; but for authorship it is not sufficient, as copyists were apt to alter such things; thus the Gullþ. S. (a western Saga) uses flóð not flæðr; at the present day an Icel. from the west is ridiculed in other counties of Icel. for his flæðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæði-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in COMPDS: flæðibakki, flæðisker.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedi-bakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæði-bakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>‘flood-tide-banks,’ banks covered at high water,</i> Gísl. 138, cp. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedi-sker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæði-sker
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a skerry which is flooded at high water,</i> Fms. ii. 142: the phrase, hann er ekki á flæði-skeri staddr, <i>he is not on a</i> fl., i. e. <i>is in safety.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. flæðar, acc. and dat. flæði, pl. flæðar, <i>flood-tide, high water,</i> a word used in western Icel. instead of flóð, which is used in the south, north, and east; þá var flæðrin síð dags, Eg. 600; flæðr sævar, Sturl. ii. 70; í sandi þar er flæðr gékk yfir (í flæðar-máli, Landn. l. c.), Fms. i. 248; biðu þeir flæðar, Eg. 129; af nálægð tunglsins vaxa flæðar, Rb. 478; fyrir flæðarinnar skyld, Stj. 57; at flæðum, Orkn. 428; at flæði sævar, 422; stórstraums-f., hábakka-f., smástraums-f.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaekingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flækingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>vagrancy,</i> also <i>a stroller.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flækja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [flóki], <i>to entangle:</i> reflex., flækja fyrir e-m, <i>to cross one’s path,</i> Fas. iii. 380, Grett. 134.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaema"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to drive away ignominiously,</i> Mart. 119, Fms. v. 304, x. 262, Fær. 133: = slæma, q. v., Nj. 262, a bad reading: reflex. <i>to roam about, rove,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaemi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a waste, open place.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/flaemingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          flæmingr
        </a>
        <p
