          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [low Lat. <i>vocatus;</i> Germ. <i>vogt</i>], <i>a kind of bailiff,</i> D. N. from the 14th century:—the bailiff of Reykjavík in Icel. is called fógeti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
