          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [a Scandin. word; Swed.-Dan. and North. E. <i>foster;</i> but neither in Goth., A. S., nor Germ.]:—<i>the fostering</i> of a child, Fms. i. 1, Eg. 119, Nj. 40, Grág. i. 276, 277, Gþl. 531, Fs. 12, Ld. passim; for this see barn-fóstr, but cp. also Grág. Ó. Þ. ch. 21: the savings, fjórðungi bregðr til fóstrs, Nj. (vide bregda), and fé er fóstri líkt; ást-fóstr, q. v.",
            }
