        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the French,</i> Bær., Flóv., El. passim; <strong>Frankis-mál,</strong> n. <i>the Frankish</i> (<i>French</i>) <i>tongue,</i> Flóv. 22; <strong>Frankis-riddari,</strong> a, m. <i>a French knight,</i> Str. 39; <strong>Franz,</strong> f. <i>France;</i> <strong>Franziska,</strong> u, f. <i>the French tongue,</i> Bs. i. 799; <strong>Franzeis,</strong> m. [Fr. <i>Français</i>], <i>a Frenchman,</i> Bs. i. 239, in the romances passim.",
            }
          }
        />
