              "__html": "n. <i>the froth</i> as of roasted meat or of a roasted apple; frauðit ór hjartanu, Edda 74: in mod. usage frauð (or <strong>frauðr,</strong> m.) is <i>the dry, withered marrow</i> of lean and half-starved animals; þeir reikna það gras sem auki frauð, Bb. 3. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
