              "__html": "<strong>frán-lyndr,</strong> adj. <i>id.</i>:—hence as a subst. <strong>fránn,</strong> m., Edda (Gl.), Merl. 2. 17, or <strong>fræningr,</strong> m., Edda (Gl.), <i>a serpent,</i> (cp. Gr. δράκων from δέρκομαι.)",
