        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. <i>-friks,</i> in <i>faihu-friks</i> = φιλάργυρος; A. S. <i>fræc;</i> Germ. <i>frech</i> (<i>bold, impudent</i>), whence Dan. <i>fræk;</i> cp. Engl. <i>freak</i>]:—<i>greedy;</i> frekr til fjár, Sd. 140; frekr er hverr til fjörsins, a saying, Njarð. 374; frekir konungar, Fms. x. 416: <i>voracious, hungry,</i> fangs er ván at frekum úlfi, Eb. 250; svá f. at torsótt sé at fylla þik, Fs. 72: metaph. <i>exorbitant,</i> frek fégjöld, Gþl. 169; frek lög, <i>harsh, unfair law,</i> Hkr. ii. 384; frekr harðsteinn, <i>a rough whetstone,</i> Fms. xi. 223; frekr get ek at þeim þykki lokarr minn til frégjalda, <i>I guess they will find my plane rough</i> (<i>cutting thick chips</i>) <i>as to the bargain,</i> ii. 65; bora frekan atsúg at e-u, Orkn. 144; frekust orð ok umkvæði, Ísl. ii. 149: neut. frekt, as adv., frekt eru þá tekin orð mín, Fms. ii. 260; ganga frekt at e-u, Fs. 32; leita frekara eptir, Fms. x. 227.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frels-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frels-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. (and <strong>frjáls-borinn,</strong> Eg. 284, Grág. passim), <i>free-born,</i> Hom. 152.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, mod. að, <i>to free;</i> frelstr, Fms. i. 79; pret. frelsti, 225. 70, Sks. 660, Gullþ. 4; frelstisk, Fms. vii. 59, x. 404, 413; frelstusk, Sks. 587 (frjalsti B); pres. frelsir, 655 xxxii. 4; imperat. frels, Hom. 159; part. frelst, Sturl. iii. 139: in mod. usage always frelsa, að, e. g. heldr frelsa (imperat.) oss frá íllu, in the Lord’s Prayer; this form occurs even in MSS. of the 14th century, e. g. frelsaði, Bs. i. 269 (MS. Arna-Magn. 482); but frelsi, l. c., in the older recension, Bs. i. 95: an older form <strong>frjálsa,</strong> að (<strong>frealsa</strong>), freq. occurs in old MSS.; pres. frjálsar, Gþl. 91; frjálsaði, Dipl. i. 11; infin. frjálsa, Sks. 349, 594 B; subj. frjálsisk, 349 B; frealsaðisk, Stj. 26: [Dan. <i>frelse</i>; Swed. <i>frälsa</i>]:—<i>to free, deliver, rescue,</i> passim: the law phrase, frelsa e-m e-t, <i>to rescue a thing for one;</i> til at f. honum sína föðurleifð, Fms. ix. 329; Egill kvaðsk frelst hafa Þórði manna-forráð, Sturl. iii. 139; frelsa þeim jörð er á, Gþl. l. c.; ok frjálsaði jörðina honum til æfinlegrar eignar, Dipl. l. c.; hann frelsaði sér þann hlut frá, er eptir var, til forráða, Bs. i. 269; ok frelsti hón sveininum (veiðina), Gullþ. 4; frelsa þræl, <i>to set a bondsman free,</i> N. G. L. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (older obsolete form <strong>frjalsari</strong>), <i>a saviour,</i> Stj. passim, 655 xiii. 4: <i>the Saviour,</i> N. T., Pass., Vídal. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (older form <strong>frjálsi,</strong> Sks. 622 B), <i>freedom,</i> esp. of a bondsman set free, or generally, N. G. L. i. 32, Grág. i. 357, Fms. i. 33, 222, ix. 352, Fs. 70, 126, in the laws and Sagas passim:—metaph. <i>freedom, leisure,</i> Fms. x. 147, v. l., Bs. i. 518, Sks. 504; náðir ok f., <i>rest and leisure,</i> Háv. 57: <i>freedom, privilege, immunity,</i> e. g. of the church, Fms. x. 14; frelsi kirkjunnar, Bs. i. 720 and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (<strong>frelsingr,</strong> 677. i), <i>a freedman,</i> Eg. 42, 67, Landn. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsis-bref"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsis-bréf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a charter of privilege,</i> H. E. i. 386, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsis-giof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsis-giöf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a gift of freedom</i> to a bondsman, Fs. 126, N. G. L. i. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frelsis-ol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frelsis-öl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘freedom-ale,’ a carouse on occasion of a bondsman being set free,</i> N. G. L. i. 29, 32, 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fremd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fremd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [frami], <i>furtherance, honour,</i> Hkr. iii. 99, Rd. 310, Eg. 279, Fms. viii. 321, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fremdar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fremdar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>inglorious,</i> Fas. i. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fremdar-verk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fremdar-verk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a feat,</i> Fms. x. 230, Fas. i. 162, Stj. 509.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fremi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fremi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (often, esp. in the Grág., spelt <strong>fremmi</strong>), only in the phrase, svá fremi, <i>only so far, only in that case:</i> temp., seg þú svá fremi frá því er þessi dagr er allr, i. e. <i>wait just till this day is past,</i> Nj. 96, Al. 118; jarl hafði svá fremi frétt til Erlings, er hann var nær kominn, <i>he only heard of Erling when he was close up to him,</i> Fms. vii. 296; skildisk Hákon konungr svá fremi við er hverr maðr var drepinn, <i>king H. left</i> [<i>pursuing</i>] <i>only when every man was slain,</i> Hkr. i. 151; svá f. munt þú þetta hafa upp kveðit, er ekki mun tjóa letja þik, Ó. H. 32; en svá f. vil ek at vér berim þetta fyrir alþýðu, er ek sé, 33; svá f. er unnin væri borgin, Róm. 358; svá f. at …, <i>id.,</i> Pr. 406; svá fremi ef, <i>in case that,</i> Nj. 260; þá skulu þeir at dómi kveðja, ok svá f. er til varnar er boðit áðr, <i>but only when they have called on them for the defence,</i> i. e. <i>not before they have,</i> Grág. i. 256; þat er jamrétt at stefna svá fremmi hánum er hann missir hans þá er kviðarins þarf, <i>it is equally lawful to summon a neighbour-juror</i> in case he does not appear to deliver a verdict, 48: <i>so far,</i> svá fremi er upp komit, at …, Finnb. 226.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fremja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fremja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. framði, pres. frem, part. framiðr, framdr, mod. also framinn; [A. S. <i>fremman;</i> Dan. <i>fremme</i>]:—<i>to further, promote;</i> fremja Kristni, <i>to further Christianity,</i> Fms. x. 416; fremja sik, <i>to distinguish oneself,</i> Nj. 254; fremja sik á e-u, Sks. 25 B; þóttú þykisk hafa framit þik utan-lendis, Glúm. 342; sá er framiðr er framarr er settr, Edda 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fremr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fremr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>fremst,</strong> vide fram.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frenja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frenja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., poët. <i>a cow</i>, Edda (Gl.), Bb. 3. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frenju-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frenju-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hoydenish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frer
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl., also spelt <strong>freyr</strong> or better <strong>frör,</strong> (in mod. usage <strong>freðar,</strong> m. pl.), [Ulf. <i>frius</i>, 2 Cor. xi. 27; Old Engl. <i>frore</i> as an adj. or adv.]:—<i>frost, frosty soil;</i> fara at freyrum, <i>to travel when it begins to freeze;</i> bíða fröra, <i>to wait for frost,</i> Ó. H. 17; at frerum, 198; en er konungi þótti ván fröra, 122; frer ok snjóva, Bs. i. 872: in sing., frer var hart úti, <i>a hard frost,</i> ii. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frer-jaki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frer-jaki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a piece of ice,</i> Bárð. 9 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frer-manudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frer-mánuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the frost month,</i> answering to December, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frerinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frerinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>frörinn,</strong> part. of frjósa, = <i>frozen,</i> mod. <strong>freðinn.</strong>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fress"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fress
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tom-cat,</i> Edda 63, Grág. i. 501; also called <strong>fress-köttr,</strong> m., and steggr, q. v.:—<i>a bear,</i> Edda (Gl.), Korm. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frest"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frest
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "usually n. pl., but also f. sing. (in mod. usage <strong>frestr,</strong> m.), <i>delay;</i> löng frest, Fms. ii. 216: ok væri þar lögð frest á, Hkr. i. 292; þessi frest, Stj. 446; þó at frestin væri löng, Fms. v. 72; biðja sér fresta, ii. 114, Rb. 364; ljá e-m fresta um e-t, Fms. iv. 225, Hom. 33; Uni kvað sér ílla líka öll frestin, Fs. 32: the saying, frest eru ílls bezt, Fms. v. 294,—mod., frestr er á illu bestr: the phrase, selja á frest, <i>to sell on credit,</i> Vápn. 7, Sturl. 91, Gísl. 12; hence <strong>frest-skuld,</strong> f. <i>credit,</i> Snót 62.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fresta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fresta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to defer, put up,</i> with dat., Ld. 322, Ó. H. 95. Orkn. 48, Fms. viii. 327, Fb. iii. 408: absol. <i>to delay, tarry,</i> Lv. 52, Fms. ix. 355: reflex. <i>to be delayed, upset,</i> Fær. 93, Fs. 74, Korm. 134, Fbr. 185, Fms. v. 318.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frestan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frestan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>delay,</i> Fb. ii. 42, better frestin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fret-karl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fret-karl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘fart-churl,’ vagabond,</i> Lv. 59, Fs. 160, Ísl. ii. 483.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. frat, mod. að, <i>to fart,</i> Lat. <i>pedere,</i> Dropl. 31, Lv. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fretr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fretr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a fart,</i> Fms. vi. 280.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freyda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freyða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dd, [frauð], <i>to froth;</i> með freyðanda munni, Al. 168: of roasting, Fas. i. 163: of matter, freyddi ór upp blóð ok vágr, Ísl. ii. 218.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freyja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a lady,</i> in hús-freyja, q. v.; prop. <i>the goddess Freyja,</i> Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freyr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Goth. <i>frauja</i> = Gr. κύριος; A. S. <i>freâ</i>; Hel. <i>frô</i> = <i>a lord</i>], is in the Scandin. only used as the pr. name of <i>the god Freyr,</i> Edda, Vsp., etc.; for the worship of Frey cp., besides the Edda, Gísl. ch. 15, Hrafn. ch. 2, Glúm. ch. 9, the talc of Gunnar Helming in Fms. ii. ch. 173, 174, Vd. ch. 10, also Landn. 174, Fms. v. 239.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freys-godi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freys-goði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the priest of Frey,</i> a nickname, Hrafn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freys-gydlingar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freys-gyðlingar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>priests</i> or <i>worshippers of Frey,</i> the name of a family in the south-east of Icel., Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/freys-tafl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          freys-tafl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the game of Frey,</i> probably what is now called goða-tafl, Flóv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frétt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [akin to fregn, but contracted], <i>news, intelligence,</i> Fms. xi. 101, Nj. 175, Bs. i. 735, Grett. 122, Fs. 15, 27; very freq. in mod. usage, esp. in pl. fréttir, <i>news;</i> hvat er í fréttum, <i>what news?</i> in compds, frétta-blað, <i>a newspaper;</i> fregn and tíðindi (q. v.) are only used in a peculiar sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fretta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frétta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, <i>to hear, get intelligence,</i> Korm. 160, Am. 1, Nj. 5, Eg. 123, Ísl. ii. 164; very freq., whereas fregna is obsolete.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frettinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fréttinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>curious, eager for news,</i> Fms. i. 184, v. 299, Bs. i. 776.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frid-benda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
