          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-koss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a kiss of peace, osculum pacis,</i> Magn. 478, Bs. i. 175.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-mark"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-mark
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = friðmark, Þorf. Karl. 422, 625. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = friðmenn, Lv. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-skjoldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-skjöldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = friðskjöldr, Fas. i. 462.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-stefna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a peace meeting,</i> Fms. vi. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-stilli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-stilli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a peace settlement,</i> Pass. 21. 8, cp. Luke xxiii. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-takn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-tákn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a token of peace,</i> Al. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridar-timi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðar-tími
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a time of peace,</i> Bret. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridgin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðgin
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl.; this curious word is analogous to systkin, feðgin, mæðgin, and seems to mean <i>lovers;</i> it only occurs twice, viz. in Clem., þá varð hvárt þeirra friðgina öðru fegit, 37; and in the poem Pd. 53, but here the verse is in a fragmentary state.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a lover, gallant,</i> poët., Vkv. 27; cp. friðgin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., usually contr. <strong>frilla,</strong> [Dan. <i>frille</i>], prop. = Lat. <i>amica,</i> a fem. answering to friðill, q. v.; en fríða frilla, <i>the fair mistress,</i> Hým. 30; but in prose in a bad sense <i>a harlot, concubine,</i> Fms. i. 2, viii. 63, Sturl. ii. 73, Sks. 693.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. friðar, dat. friði, [Ulf. renders εἰρήνη by <i>gavairþi,</i> but uses the verb <i>gafriþon</i> = καταλλάττειν, and <i>gafriþons</i> = καταλλαγή; A. S. <i>frið</i> and <i>freoðo;</i> mod. Germ. <i>friede;</i> Dan. and Swed. <i>fred;</i> lost in Engl., and replaced from the Lat.]:—<i>peace,</i> but also <i>personal security, inviolability:</i> in the phrases, fyrirgöra fé ok friði, <i>to forfeit property and peace,</i> i. e. <i>be outlawed,</i> Gþl. 160; setja grið ok frið, <i>to ‘set,’</i> i. e. <i>make, truce and peace,</i> Grág. ii. 167: til árs ok friðar, Hkr. i. 16; friðr ok farsæla, Bs. i. 724; vera í friði, <i>to be in safe keeping,</i> Al. 17; biðja e-n friðar, <i>to sue for peace,</i> Hbl. 28; about the peace of Fróði cp. Edda 78–81, it is also mentioned in Hkv. 1. 13, and Vellekla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frigg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frigg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a pr. name, gen. friggjar, [cp. A. S. <i>frigu</i> = <i>love</i>], <i>the heathen goddess Frigg,</i> Edda, Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/friggjar-elda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friggjar-elda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a bird,</i> prob. = mod. Máriatla, <i>the wagtail, motacilla alba</i> Linn., Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/friggjar-gras"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friggjar-gras
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘Frigg’s herb,’ the mandrake,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/friggjar-stjarna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          friggjar-stjarna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., astron. <i>‘Frigg’s star,’ Venus,</i> Clem. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frilla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frilla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "v. friðla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-barn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-barn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a bastard child,</i> Landn. 174, Fms. xi. 212.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>bastard-born,</i> Fas. i. 354.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-dottir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-dóttir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an illegitimate daughter,</i> Gþl. 238, 239.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-lifnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-lifnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>fornication, whoredom,</i> Jb. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-lifi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-lífi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>id.,</i> K. Á. 218, H. E. i. 477; in the N. T. = the Gr. μοιχεία.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an adulterer,</i> = Gr. μοιχός, N. T.; in pl., Bs. i. 684.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-sonr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-sonr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an illegitimate son,</i> Gþl. 237, 238, Hkr. i. 100, 198, Landn. 260.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frillu-tak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frillu-tak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., in the phrase, taka frillutaki, <i>to take as concubine,</i> Eg. 343, Fms. ii. 291, vii. 110, Sturl. iii. 270.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fritt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fritt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>peaceful,</i> Eg. 572, Stj. 471, 475; in the phrase, e-m er fritt (or eiga fritt), <i>one’s person being safe;</i> hversu vel mun honum fritt at koma á yðvarn fund, <i>how safe will it be for him to come to you?</i> Fms. vii. 167; Högni spurði, hvárt þeim skyldi fritt vera, Sturl. ii. 144 C; eiga í flestum stöðum ílla fritt, Fbr. 48 new Ed.; ef eigi væri allt fritt (<i>safe</i>) af Steingríms hendi, Rd. 277; þá var ílla fritt, <i>things were ill at ease, uneasy,</i> Bs. i. 363; hvárt skal mér fritt at ganga á fund yðvarn, Fb. iii. 453.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frí
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a mod. college term, <i>vacation,</i> probably from Lat. <i>feria.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fri-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frí
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. = fráls, <i>free, released, vacant,</i> used in a less noble sense than frjáls, q. v.; frí is foreign, but freq. in mod. writers:—used as adv. <i>freely, truly,</i> in mod. poets, Pass. 7. 12, 18. 9, 19. 8, 38. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fria"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fría
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to deliver,</i> Lv. 94 better firrum: reflex. <i>to free oneself,</i> Fms. xi. 424.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frian"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frían
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (in Ó. H. 206 frion), <i>remission,</i> an απ. λεγ., Fms. v. 55, Pass. 13. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frid-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fríð-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>personal beauty,</i> Eg. 29, Fms. x. 234; fríðleikr, afl, ok fræknleikr, Hkr. i. 302; fríðleikinum samir hinn bezti búnaðr, iii. 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frida-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fríða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d (?), <i>to adorn,</i> Fms. vii. 276, Fas. ii. 196, Ld. 198.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridendi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fríðendi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>good things;</i> heita e-m fríðendum, <i>to make fair promises,</i> Gísl. 70, Fms. v. 157, Niðrst. 6; allir kostir ok öll f., Clem. 29; er nökkut þat er til fríðenda sé um mik, <i>is there anything good in me?</i> Fms. vi. 207; <i>revenue,</i> reki með öllum fríðendum, Ám. 12, 15; heimaland með öllum fríðendum, 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fríðka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>fríkka,</strong> að, <i>to grow fine and handsome.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fridr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fríðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., neut. frítt, compar. fríðari, superl. fríðastr, [a Scandin. word, not found either in A. S. or Germ.]:—<i>fair, beautiful, handsome,</i> chiefly of the face; fríðr sýnum, Eg. 22. 23, Nj. 2, Fas. i. 387, Fms. i. 2, 17: <i>fine,</i> lið mikit ok frítt, 32, vii. 231; mikit skip ok frítt, Fagrsk.; fríð veizla, Fb. ii. 120; með friðu föruneyti, Ld. 22: metaph. <i>specious, unfair,</i> Fms. x. 252.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frisir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frísir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the Frisians,</i> Fms., Eg. passim. <strong>Frís-land,</strong> n. <i>Frisia.</i> <strong>Frískr,</strong> adj. <i>Frisian,</i> Fms. vi. 362.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/friskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frískr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [O. H. G. <i>frisc;</i> mod. Germ. <i>frisch</i>], <i>frisky, brisk, vigorous,</i> (mod. word); <strong>frísk-leiki,</strong> a, m. <i>friskiness, briskness, vigour;</i> <strong>frísk-legr,</strong> adj. (<strong>-lega,</strong> adv.), <i>friskily, briskly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a sweetheart,</i> Skv. 3. 8, and perh. in Fsm. 5 for fán of the MS.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Ulf. renders ἀγαπαν and φιλειν by <i>frijon,</i> and ἀγάπη by <i>frjaþva;</i> akin to friðr, friðill; in Icel. this word has almost entirely disappeared, except in the part. frændi, which is found also in Engl. <i>friend,</i> Germ. <i>freund:</i> frjá has thus met with the same fate as its antagonist fjá (<i>to hate</i>); both have been lost as verbs, while the participles of each, fjándi and frændi, <i>fiend</i> and <i>friend,</i> remain:—<i>vrijen, to woo,</i> still remains in Dutch; and the mod. High Germ. <i>freien</i> and Dan. <i>frie</i> are borrowed from Low Germ.]:—<i>to pet,</i> an απ. λεγ. in Mkv. 5,—annars barn er sem úlf at frjá, <i>to pet another man’s bairn is like petting a wolf,</i> i. e. he will never return your love. The passage Ls. 19 is obscure and probably corrupt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in the COMPDS: Frjáaptan, Frjádagr, Frjádagsaptan, Frjádagskveld, Frjádagsnótt, Frjádagsþing, Frjádagafasta, Frjákveld, Frjámorginn, Frjánótt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-aptan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá-aptan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Friday evening,</i> Sturl. ii. 216.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Friday,</i> Rb. 112, 572, Jb. 200; langi F., <i>Good Friday,</i> K. Á. 68 passim:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-kveld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá-kveld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = frjáaptan, Hkr. iii. 277, Sturl. ii. 211 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-morginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá-morginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Friday morning,</i> Fms. viii. 35, Orkn. (in a verse, App.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/frja-nott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frjá-nótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = frjádagsnótt, Fms. viii. 35. It is remarked above, s. v. dagr, that this ‘frjá’ is derived from the A. S. form <i>Freâ,</i> answering to the northern <i>Freyr,</i> Goth. <i>Frauja,</i> and is a rendering of the eccl. Lat. <i>dies Veneris,</i> as in eccl. legends the Venus of the Lat. is usually rendered by <i>Freâ</i> (Freyja) of the Teutonic. This word is now obsolete in Icel., as <i>Friday</i> is now called Föstudagr, vide fasta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
