        >
          frost
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [frjósa; A. S. <i>fyrst;</i> Engl., Germ., Dan., and Swed. <i>frost</i>]:—<i>frost:</i> allit., frost ok funi, Sl. 18, Fas. iii. 613; frost veðrs, Fms. ix. 241: often used in pl., frost mikil ok kuldar, ii. 29; frosta vetr, <i>a frosty winter,</i> Ann. 1348; frost ok snjóar, <i>frost and snow;</i> hörku-f., <i>a sharp frost.</i> <strong>frosta-tól,</strong> n. <i>‘frosty tools’</i> i. e. frail tools or implements that crack as if frost-bitten.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
