      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fraenda-skomm"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          frænda-skömm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a shame to</i> (or <i>within</i>) <i>one’s family;</i> kallaði slíka menn helzt mega heita f., Sturl. i. 13; því at Kristnin var þá kölluð f., Bs. i. 11,—in the last interesting passage it seems to mean such a disgrace that one was thereby expelled out of the family, cp. Fms. i. 285.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
