          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a sheep;</i> in Swed.-Dan. <i>faar</i> and <i>fär</i> are the usual words for <i>sheep;</i> but in Icel. it is almost unknown; it occurs in Skálda 162; also now and then in the compd <strong>fær-sauðr,</strong> m., spelt <strong>fjar-sauðr,</strong> Tistr. 4 (prop. <i>a ‘sheep-sheep,’</i> sauðr being the common Icel. word for <i>sheep</i>), Stj. 45, 177, 235, N. G. L. i. 75, K. Þ. K. 130; from fær is also derived the name <strong>Fær-eyjar,</strong> f. pl. <i>the Faroe Islands</i> (<i>Sheep-islands</i>); <strong>Fær-eyskr,</strong> adj., and <strong>Fær-eyingar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the Faroe Islanders;</i> described by Dicuil as plenae innumerabilibus ovibus, p. 30 (Ed. 1807): fær is a South-Scandin. word, and seems to be formed from the gen. of fé (fjár).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faer-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fær-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>ability, strength,</i> esp. in bodily exercise, Fs. 3, Finnb. 242, Orkn. 114, Grett. 149 C, Fas. i. 331.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð, [from fár, n., different from the following word, having <i>á</i> as root vowel], <i>to slight, taunt one,</i> with dat.; ok færa þeim eigi í orðum né verkum, <i>offend them not in words nor acts,</i> Hom. 57: mod., færa at e-m, <i>id.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faerd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the condition of a road, passage,</i> from snow, rain, etc.; íll f., Sturl. iii. 22; þung f., Fms. ii. 75, freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. <i>a being within reach;</i> and as a shooting term, <i>a range,</i> Fms. i. 12, viii. 49, Nj. 63, Eg. 115, Ver. 26: <i>a match for one,</i> Ld. 116, Fms. ii. 27; ekki barna f., <i>no match for bairns,</i> Háv. 52: in pl. allit., fé eðr f., <i>money or means,</i> Grág. i. 62, 252: the phrase, vera í færum til e-s (mod. um e-t), <i>to be able to do a thing,</i> Grett. 110 C, Fms. xi. 265; með-fari, e. g. það er ekki mitt með-færi, <i>it is no match for me</i>:—söng-færi, hljóð-f., <i>a musical instrument;</i> veiðar-f., <i>fishing gear;</i> verk-f., <i>tools;</i> mál-f., <i>organs of speech;</i> tæki-f., <i>occasion.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri-kviar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi-kvíar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>movable pens</i> (of sheep).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>want of means,</i> Grág. (Kb.) ii. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>fær-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>practicable, easy to do,</i> Fms. vii. 335, viii. 33:—færiligr hestr, <i>a strong, serviceable horse,</i> Ld. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri-vandr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi-vandr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>cautious,</i> Rd. 294.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri-van"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi-ván
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>opportunity,</i> Gísl. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeri-vedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færi-veðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>weather fit for a journey,</i> Eb. 482, 485, Fms. xi. 374.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faering"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a freight,</i> Jb. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          færr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>able, capable;</i> færr til e-s. <i>capable of,</i> or with infin., <i>able to do a thing,</i> Nj. 215, Fms. i. 284, v. 71, xi. 24; vel færr, <i>doing well, strong,</i> Ísl. ii. 357; hress ok vel f., Eg. 84:—<i>able, strong,</i> in travelling, manna bezt færir bæði á fæti ok á skíðum, 73; færr hvert er þú vilt, Ld. 44; Sigmundr görisk færr (<i>able-bodied</i>) maðr mjök, Fær. 77; færr hestr, <i>a strong, serviceable horse,</i> Grág. i. 46, 328; búfé fært at mat sér, Gþl. 502.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faeta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fæta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, a dubious word, in the phrase, eiga um vandræði at f., <i>to have to grapple with hardships,</i> Glúm. 374; er hann svá í öllu sínu athæfi at trautt megu menn um hann fæta, <i>such in all his doings that people could hardly manage him,</i> Fb. i. 167; menn megu trautt heima um þik fæta, 173, (tæla, Fms. xi. 78, 92): Icel. now say, það verðr ekki við hann tætt, <i>there are no ways with him,</i> of an unruly person.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faetlingar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fætlingar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. [fótr], <i>the ends formed by the feet,</i> in a skin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/faetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          fætta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>fækka,</strong> which form occurs in MSS. of the 14th century, also <strong>fætka;</strong> but in a poem of 1246 tí-<i>rætt</i> and <i>fætta</i> are made to rhyme: [fár]:—<i>to make few, reduce in number,</i> in old writers with acc., in mod. with dat.; at fætta skyldi húskarla, Ó. H. 113 (Fms. iv. 255).; Hkr. ii. 183 fækka less correct; ok fætta svá lið þeirra, Fbr. 74 new Ed., but fæcka in Fb. ii. 164, l. c.: reflex. <i>to grow fewer, less,</i> en er Hákon jarl sá fættask liðit á skipum sínum, Fms. i. 174; þegar grjótið fættisk, xi. 95; þá er fattask tóku föng, Sturl. i. 135; at eldiviðrinn tæki at fættask, Orkn. 112; fækkuðusk skotvápnin, Eb. 248.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fodur-afi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          föður-afi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, m. <i>a grandfather on the father’s side.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/fodur-arfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          föður-arfr
        </a>
        <p
