              "__html": "a dubious word, perh. <i>costly;</i> in A. S. poetry <i>gamban</i> occurs twice or thrice in an allit. phrase, <i>gamban gyldan</i> = <i>to pay a fee</i> (Grein): <strong>gamban-reiði,</strong> f. <i>splendid gear</i> (?), Skm. 33; <strong>gamban-sumbl,</strong> n. a <i>sumptuous banquet,</i> Ls. 8; <strong>gamban-teinn,</strong> m. <i>a staff,</i> Skm. 32. These poems seem to be by one hand, and the word occurs nowhere else in the northern languages.",
