              "__html": "að, (and <strong>gauf,</strong> n., <strong>gaufari,</strong> a, m.), <i>to saunter, be sluggish,</i> freq. akin to gafi, cp. Goth. <i>gepanta</i> in a reference by Jornandes—nam <i>lingua</i> eorum <i>‘pigra’ gepanta</i> dicitur, whence ‘Gepidi,’ the name of an ancient Teut. people.",
