        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m.; fem. <strong>gaum</strong> also occurs, góða, litla gaum, Hom. 33. 69, and so sometimes in mod. writers; [A. S. <i>geâme</i> and <i>gymen,</i> Ormul. <i>gom</i>]:—<i>heed, attention;</i> only used in the phrase, gefa gaum at e-u, <i>to give heed to a thing,</i> Nj. 57, Eg. 551, Fms. viii. 18, Hom. 69; var engi gaumr gefinn at því, Ó. H. 71, 116; gefa góða, litla (fem.) g. at e-u, Hom. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
