        >
          gautar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. a Scandin. people in western Sweden, called in A. S. <i>Geâtes,</i> and to be distinguished from Gotar, <i>Goths;</i> hence <strong>Gaut-land,</strong> n. <i>the land of the Gauts;</i> <strong>Gaut-Elfr,</strong> f. <i>the river Gotha, the ‘Elbe of the Gauts;’</i> <strong>Gauta-sker,</strong> n. pl. <i>the Skerries</i> of the north-western coast of Sweden; cp. also the mod. Göteborg, Ó. H., Fms., passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
