        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., a poët. name of Odin, Vtkv., Edda; it seems to mean <i>father,</i> vide gjóta: poët. <i>a man,</i> sá ógæfunnar gautr, <i>that hapless man,</i> Hallgr.; váða-gautslegr, adj. <i>miscreant-like.</i>",
            }
          }
