              "__html": "n. [prob. a Fin. word; Lap. <i>galco</i> = <i>a beast</i>], <i>a monster;</i> in old poetry weapons are called hlífa-g.; randar-gálkn, <i>the beast of shield and armour,</i> Lex. Poët.; else in prose, finn-gálkn, q. v.; hrein-gálkn, a dub. word, Hým. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
