          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          geð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [a Scandin. word, neither found in Ulf., Saxon, nor Germ.; lost in mod. Dan. and Swed.; <i>gje,</i> Ivar Aasen]:—<i>mind, mood;</i> the old Hm. often uses the word almost = <i>wits, senses;</i> hann stelr geði guma, <i>he steals the wits of men, steeps them in lethargy,</i> 12; vita til síns geðs, <i>to be in one’s senses,</i> 11, 19; heimta aptr sitt geð, of a drunkard, <i>to come to one’s senses again, to awake,</i> 13; vera gætinn at geði, <i>to be on one’s guard,</i> 6; cp. gá (geyma) síns geðs, Fms. vii. 133, x. 10: in pl., lítil eru geð guma, <i>many men have little sense,</i> Hm. 52:—this meaning is obsolete.",
            }
          }
        />
