              "__html": "pret. gaf, 2nd pers. gaft, mod. gafst, pl. gáfu; pres. gef; pret. subj. gæfi; part. gefinn; with neg. suff. gef-at, gaft-attu, Fm. 7; mid. form gáfumk (<i>dabat</i> or <i>dabant mihi, nobis</i>), Stor. 23, Bragi, Edda: [Goth. <i>giban</i> = διδόναι; A. S. <i>gifan;</i> Engl. <i>give;</i> Dutch <i>geven;</i> O. H. G. <i>gepan;</i> Germ. <i>geben;</i> Swed. <i>gifva;</i> Dan. <i>give.</i>]",
