          className="link"
          href="/word/gikks-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gikks-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>pert, rude;</i> the saying, hver sem glettist við gikkinn fær af honum hnykkinn, <i>who meddles with a</i> ‘gik’ <i>will get a kick.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gil"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gil
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. gilja, dat. giljum, [<i>Ghyll</i> or <i>Gill</i> in North. E. and Scot., local names]:—<i>a deep narrow glen with a stream at bottom,</i> like the Gr. χαράδρα; brooks and tributary streams flowing through clefts in the fell side to the main river at the bottom of a vale are in Icel. called gil; very freq. in local names, Ísfirðinga-gil, Branda-gil, Hauka-gil, Hrafna-gil, Hellra-gil, Gilj-á, Þver-gil, vide Landn.; (a chasm without water or with stagnant water is not gil, but gjá; also gljúfr, a deep chasm forming the bed of a river), Valla L. 223, Hrafn. 7, Eg. 766, Ld. 218, Krók. 64, Fms. vii. 149, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gil-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gil-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a libertine,</i> Blanda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gild-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gild-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>strength, full size,</i> Grett. 148: mod. <i>stoutness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gild-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gild-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>stoutly,</i> metaph. <i>with a grand air,</i> Korm. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gilda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gilda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to be worth so and so,</i> only in mod. usage, esp. in metaph. and impers. phrases, mig gildir einu, <i>I do not mind;</i> láttu þig einu g., <i>never mind:</i> hvað sem gildir, <i>at any price;</i> hirt aldrei hvað sem gildir, at hætta á, ósatt mál, Pass. 13. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
