        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [gjalda; Ulf. <i>gild</i> = <i>tribute,</i> Luke xx. 22, Mark xii. 14; A. S. <i>gild;</i> Hel. <i>geld;</i> Frank. <i>chalta;</i> Germ. <i>geld</i> = <i>money;</i> it remains in Old Engl. <i>weregild</i>]:—<i>payment, tribute;</i> this sense is very rare, as gjald (q. v.) is the common word; chiefly used in compds, as nef-gildi, <i>head-tax;</i> baug-gildi, q. v.; skatt-gildi, <i>a tax;</i> skulda-gildi, <i>payment of debts,</i> Grág. i. 302.",
            }
