        >
          gista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [gestr], <i>to pass the night;</i> g. at e-s (etc.), Eb. 222, Nj. 15, 74, Ld. 130, Al. 40, Fs. 138: with acc. of the host, g. e-n, <i>to spend a night with one,</i> N. G. L. i. 51, 623. 14.",
            }
