            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. gjarnari; superl. gjarnastr; [Ulf. <i>gairns,</i> only once; A. S. <i>georn;</i> Germ. <i>gern;</i> lost as adj. both in Dan. and Swed.; cp. gerr above, which is only used in a limited sense]:—<i>eager, willing,</i> Fms. iv. 81, Dropl. 19; a saying, gjörn er hönd á venju, Grett. 130: with gen., gjarn e-s, 656 C. 24, passim; used in a great many poët. compds, but also freq. in prose, as in góð-g., <i>gentle;</i> íll-g., <i>malevolent;</i> öfund-g., <i>envious;</i> metorða-g., <i>ambitions;</i> væru-g., <i>loving rest;</i> á-gjarn, <i>avaricious;</i> fé-gjarn, <i>covetous;</i> sín-g. and eigin-g., <i>selfish;</i> óbil-g., <i>unyielding;</i> nám-g., <i>eager for learning;</i> háð-g., <i>scoffing;</i> ó-gjarn, <i>unwilling;</i> sátt-gjarn, <i>peaceful;</i> vide Lex. Poët. p. 246.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjarn-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjarn-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = gjarnliga, Sks. 221.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjarna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjarna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>gjarnan,</strong> adv. <i>willingly,</i> Nj. 57, Lv. 20, Eg. 234, Fms. i. 79, Ísl. ii. 441, Bret. 34, Sks. 241, Orkn. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjarnliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjarnliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>willingly,</i> Bs. i. 355.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. gjár, acc. and dat. gjá; pl. gjár, gen. gjá, dat. gjám, mod. gjáar; [a Scandin. word, akin to gína; found in the north of Scotland in the form <i>geo, geow:</i> cp. Gr. χάσμα]:—<i>a chasm, rift,</i> in fells or crags; hrinda þeim fyrir björg eðr í gjár, Fms. ii. 238; til þess er hann kemr at gjá einni, en sú gjá gengr um eyna þvera, fyrir annan enda gjárinnar, hinu-megin gjárinnar, yfir gjána, etc., Fær. 170, 171; kasta hringinum í gjár eða vötn, Bs. i. 329; milli gjá ok gljúfra, Stj. 90; at enni efri gjánni, Nj. 224: also freq. in local names, Ahnanna-gjá, the famous rift in Thingvalla, Nj. 113, 246, 247, Sturl. i. 206, Landn. 312, v. l.; Hrafna-gjá, Brímils-gjá, Kötlu-gjá; it often denotes a rift with a tarn or pool at bottom, whereas gil is a rift with running water.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gja-hamarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjá-hamarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the upper wall of the</i> Almanna-gjá, Grág. i. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gja-lifi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjá-lífi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = gjólífi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjalfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjálfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. rs, poët. <i>the din of the sea, the swelling waves,</i> Sks. 148:—<i>the sea,</i> freq. in poëtry and in poët. compds, vide Lex. Poët.; in prose Icel. say, orða-gjálfr, <i>‘word-din’ empty sounding wards, flood of phrases.</i> <strong>gjálfr-ligr, gjálfr-samr, gjálfrugr,</strong> adj. <i>noisy, roaring,</i> Sks. 192. Ships are <strong>gjálfr-dýr, gjálfr-marar, gjálfr-stóð,</strong> <i>steeds of the sea,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjalfra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gjálfra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to roar,</i> of the sea: <i>to chatter.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gjalgrun"
