      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gledi-vist"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gleði-vist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a <i>merry sojourn,</i> Lv. 75.—Gleði in the sense of Lat. <i>gaudium</i> is freq. in mod. use, but old writers prefer fögnuðr in the abstract sense; ó-gleði, <i>sadness, despondency,</i> Lv. 75: medic. <i>ailment,</i> cp. the phrase e-m er óglatt, <i>one is ailing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gledill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gleðill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gledja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gleðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. gladdi; pres. gleðr; part. gladdr; sup. glatt:—<i>to gladden, enliven, make glad,</i> Hom. 18, 159, Fms. v. 49, Fas. i. 122: reflex. <i>to be glad, rejoice,</i> Eg. 55, Ísl. ii. 360, Fms. i. 261, vi. 60, Sks. 551, Fb. i. 405: <i>to brighten,</i> sem dagrinn gladdisk, Verel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
