        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a grumbling, muttering,</i> Bjarn. 18, Fms. x. 342, Stj. 322, 326, 330, 453, Fbr. 27 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnadda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnadda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to murmur,</i> Stj. 327, Grett. 98 A (where nödduðu stands): <i>to vex,</i> hón gnaddar hit sama bæði dag ok dægr, <i>‘she pressed him daily with her words,’</i> Stj. 417. Judges xvi. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnaga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. <strong>naga,</strong> but in allit. and old writers with <i>g,</i> as ok um grjót gnaga, Hm. 106: it was originally a strong verb, pret. gnóg, as ala ól, and is still used so in some provincial dialects of Norway, vide Ivar Aasen; hence part. gnagit, Barl. 56 (Norse); in old Icel. writers it only remains in poetry, viz. pres. gnegr, Fms. vi. 310 (in a verse of the 11th century); gengr, i. e. gnegr, Edda (A. M.) i. 68, note 12: [Engl. <i>gnaw;</i> Swed. <i>gnaga;</i> Dan. <i>gnave</i>]:—<i>to gnaw;</i> en Níðhöggr gnagar neðan rótina, Edda 10, Gm. 33; hestar gnöguðu beizlin, Karl. 376; þeir gnöguðu skjaldar-rendr, Fas. i. 425; mýss tvær gnagaðu um rætr trésins, Barl. 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnap"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnap
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., poët. <i>high places, the high sea,</i> Edda (Gl.): in poët. compds, <strong>gnap-hjarl, -salr, -stóll, -turn,</strong> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnapa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnapa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to jut out, stoop forward;</i> hann (the ghost) gnapti innar yfir dyrnar, Grett. 114 A; fjallit sýnisk mjök yfir gnapa öðrum fjöllum, Fms. x. 313; ef hón sæi háska eðr skaða yfir gnapa (<i>impendere</i>) sínu ríki, 223: <i>to droop with the head,</i> snapa ok gnapa, <i>to be snubbed and droop the head,</i> Hm. 62; gnapir grár jór yfir gram dauðum, Bkv. 6; sköltar gnöpðu, Fms. ii. 259 (in a verse); hann gnapir með hettu, Fas. iii. 494 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., poët. <i>the sea</i>, Edda (Gl.); prop. <i>the ‘gnarrer,’ murmurer.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnastan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnastan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a gnashing,</i> Hom. 70.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnat
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a clash</i> (of weapons), Höfuðl.; the Engl. <i>gnat</i> is so called from the sound of its wings.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnata
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to clash,</i> Vsp. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnauð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>gnauðan,</strong> Bs. i. 206), f. <i>a rustling noise,</i> Fas. iii. 129, Ór. 56; metaph. <i>a murmur,</i> Grett. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnauda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnauða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. <strong>nauða,</strong> <i>to rustle, ring;</i> hann lætr g. broddinn í jöklinum, of the sound of a mountaineer’s staff, Bárð. 171; gnauðaði svá at skjálfa þóttu húsin, of troops riding over the ice, Sturl. iii. 147; hence mod. nauða á e-m, <i>to din in one’s ear.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnaust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., and <strong>gnaustan,</strong> f. <i>a clash, tinkling,</i> Hallfred, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gná
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. the name of a goddess, Edda: freq. in poetry, of women.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnegg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnegg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>hnegg,</strong> <i>neighing,</i> Hrafn. 7, Al. 67, Karl. 282.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gneggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gneggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. <strong>hneggja,</strong> <i>to neigh,</i> Hrafn. 8, Rd. 267, Stj. 78, Karl. 376, Hkv. Hjörv. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gneista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gneista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [mid. H. Germ. <i>ganeiste</i>], <i>to emit sparks,</i> Fms. viii. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gneisti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gneisti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., mod. <strong>neisti,</strong> [mid. H. Germ. <i>ganeist;</i> Dan. <i>gnist;</i> Swed. <i>gnista;</i> cp. the mineral <i>gneiss,</i> so called from its <i>sparkling particles</i>]:—<i>a spark,</i> Edda 4, Fms. iii. 193, v. 175, Sks. 204, Skálda 175: metaph., g. lífsins, Fms. x. 368. <strong>gneista-flaug,</strong> f. <i>a shower of sparks,</i> Bs. i. 44, Fms. iii. 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gnall, gnullu, <i>to scream;</i> haukar þeirra gnullu leiðiliga, Karl. 376.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnerr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Chaucer’s <i>gnarr</i>], <i>a knot</i> or <i>knob:</i> metaph., stóð við þann gnerr nokkra daga, <i>it stopped at that ‘gnarr,’</i> i. e. <i>it lasted, for some days,</i> Fms. viii. 263, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnesta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnesta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. gnast, pl. gnustu, [A. S. <i>gnæstan</i>], <i>to crack;</i> hlíf gnast við hlíf, Skálda (in a verse); viðir brotna eðr gnesta, 169; málmar gnustu, Hallfred; gnestr hann (the sword) hátt í þeirra hausum, Fas. i. 102: the phrase, g. í eyrum e-s, <i>to tinkle in one’s ears;</i> múgrinn æpti svá at gnast í eyrum borgar-manna, Stj. 360, 647. 2 Kings xxi. 12; þessi ódæmi sem öllum mönnum gnestr í eyrum, Mar.; gnustu þá saman vápnin, Sturl. iii. 174; ok gnestr í steininum, Bs. i. 601; gnast í brynjunni, Karl. 175.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gneypr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gneypr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>jutting, bent forward;</i> stóð höfuðit gneypt af bolnum, Eb. 244; Egill sat uppréttr ok var gneypr mjök, Eg. 304, Fas. iii. 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gniða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>niða,</strong> að, [Dan. <i>gnide</i>], <i>to rub;</i> þat var sem sviðit ok gniðat öðru-megin, hón lét telgja á lítinn flatveg þar sem gniðat var, Grett. 177 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnissa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnissa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a spectre,</i> Edda (Gl.); cp. Dan. <i>nisse</i> = <i>a hobgoblin.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., mod. <strong>nitr,</strong> f. pl. [Dan. <i>gnid;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>gnit</i>], <i>a nit,</i> Lat. <i>lens.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnipa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnípa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., not gnýpa, (<i>ríp</i> í bratta <i>gnípu,</i> Rekstefja 28), <i>a peak,</i> Fms. ii. 154, Sks. 171 C, Greg. 62, Bs. i. 360, Róm. 352.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnist"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gníst
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a <i>gnashing,</i> Nikulás-d. 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnísta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, mod. also <strong>nista,</strong> <i>to gnash the teeth;</i> g. tönnum, Mar. freq., Greg. 55, Mart. 118, Fas. iii. 629 (where nísta, paper MS.); ok þeir nístu tönnum yfir honum, Acts vii. 54:—trans. <i>to tease,</i> mundu þér eigi gníst hafa yðvarn biskup með svá skarpri meingörðar ör, Mar. 457.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnistan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnístan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>gnashing of teeth,</i> in the phrase, óp ok tanna g., Post. 656 C. 30; spelt gnístran, Matth. viii. 12, xiii. 42, 50, xxii. 13, xxiv. 51, xxv. 30, Luke xiii. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnistingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnístingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a creaking,</i> Stj. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnjodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnjóðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>seed</i>, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnjostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnjóstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., Tann-g., <i>Teeth-gnasher,</i> one of Thor’s he-goats, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnolla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnolla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to shiver;</i> impers., tekr þeim at gnolla, Fms. xi. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>Gnoð,</strong> f., poët. name of <i>a ship,</i> Edda (Gl.); properly a mythical ship like the Greek Argo, Fas. iii. 406, 407, (Eg. S. Einh. fine.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnog-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnóg-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>abundance,</i> Magn. 450, Rb. 110.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnog-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnóg-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (mod. <strong>nóg-liga,</strong> and so Stj. 30, Fms. vi. 15, MSS. of the 14th century), <i>abundantly,</i> Edda 9, Fms. i. 77, Hom. 37, Stj. 414.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnog-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnóg-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (mod. <strong>nóg-ligr,</strong> and so Fms. ii. 228, Sks. 134 B. new Ed., MSS. of the 13th century), <i>abundant,</i> Stj. 428, Mar. 474.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnógr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; in old alliterative poets <i>gn,</i> þess var grams und gömlum | <i>gn</i>óg rausn, Arnór, and so in very old MSS.; but even vellum MSS. as old as Hb., Stj., Arna-Magn. 66 (vide below), begin to drop the <i>g,</i> which was either lost or replaced by <i>í</i> (í-nógr) as in Engl. <i>e-nough:</i> the declension also is interesting; in old writers it has regular neut. gnógt or nógt, but later the <i>t</i> was dropped; an Icel. says, það er nóg rúm (<i>room enow</i>), the old form being gnógt rúm; the gen. has also been dropped, and so the word has become an irregular though not indeclinable adjective: again, an indeclinable nógu has been formed, nógu margr, mikill, etc., answering to Engl. <i>enough</i> after an adjective: [Ulf. <i>ganôhs,</i> = ἱκανός; A. S. <i>genôh;</i> Engl. <i>enough</i> and <i>enow;</i> O. H. G. <i>ganah;</i> Germ. <i>genug</i> and <i>genung;</i> Dan. <i>nok;</i> Swed. <i>nog</i> and <i>noga</i>]:—<i>enough, sufficient, plentiful,</i> of stores; þar er sæmðar ván er gnóg er til, Nj. 21; selveiðar gnógar ok fiski-fang mikit, Eg. 130; mundu þar fá gnógt lið, Fms. vii. 276; ok svá nógt er í fjöllum þeim gull sem grjót, Pr. 400; þat it fjórða er nógt var, <i>which was enough by itself,</i> Bret. (Hb.) 66; þeim með er hann hefir gnógastan til, Sks. 229 B; hafa gnógan liðs kost, Fms. viii. 220; því at þar var nógt búfé Dana til strandhöggva, i. 128; gaf hann öllum nóga skotpenninga, xi. 202; honum mun gefast svo hann gnóg hafi, Matth. xiii. 12; skógar-dýr er jafnan vóru gnóg, Stj. 560 (nóg and í nóg, v. l.); með svá nógum gný (<i>so great a din</i>) ok vápna-braki, at …, Stj. (MSS.) 127:—of persons (rare), nú var hann nógr orðinn um kvikfé, <i>now he was well stocked with cattle,</i> Bjarn. 39; nú muntú ok vera þér nógr einn (= einhlítr, q. v.) um þetta mál, Band. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [A. S. <i>geniht</i>], <i>abundance, plenty;</i> ærin gnótt vista, Fms. xi. 36; gnótt fjár, Band. 9; aura gnótt, <i>plenty of money,</i> Greg. 39; gnótt grunnýðgi (gen.), Am. 1; þau áttu gnótt í búi, Nj. 257; en svá mikil gnótt at sólunni um sumarit, <i>so great plenty of sun during the summer,</i> Sks. 71; hljóta sumir mikla gnótt af þessum gjöfum, 561; hann mun gefa þér gnótt allra hluta, Blas. 43; þar vóru gnóttir hvers-vetna, Fs. 65; en at ek gera gnótt spurning þinni, <i>that I give sufficient answer to thy question,</i> Fas. iii. 665.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnotta-brunnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnótta-brunnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the well of abundance,</i> Stj. 164. Gen. xxvi. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnotta-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnótta-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wealthy man,</i> Grett. 127 (MS. A. nótta-maðr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnurra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnurra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to gnarr, grate,</i> as a door moving on the hinges.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnua"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnúa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>núa,</strong> pres. gný; pret. gneri, gnöri, or neri; part. gnúit; [cp. Dan. <i>gnide</i>]:—<i>to rub;</i> hann tók til orða, ok gneri nefit, <i>and rubbed his nose,</i> Orkn. 394; gnera ek vátum höndum um augu mér, Ó. H. 224; gnera (gnöra, v. l.) ek í sundr öll málmhlið sterkra borga, Sks. 631 B, Mirm. 31: with dat., hón rakaði af honum allt hárit ok neri (paper MS.) í tjöru (dat.), <i>and rubbed it with tar,</i> Fas. i. 18; hann gnýr þar við bakinu þar til er boga-strengrinn skarsk, ii. 547; þó at þér sveinar haeði at því, at þú sitir mjótt ok gnúir saman lærum þínum, Band. 13, Mar. 539; nokkurrir fiskar gnúa sér svá fast við kviðinn, at …, Stj. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnúfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð, (qs. gnúpa), <i>to droop, stoop;</i> skalf hón öll af hræðslu ok gnúfði hón með höfði sínu, Str. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnup-leitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnúp-leitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = gnúfa, Edda 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnupa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnúpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = gnúfa, a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnupr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnúpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a peak</i> (= gnípa); þá gékk maðr út ór gnúpinum, Nj. 211; undir gnúpinum, Landn. 277, v. l.: freq. in local names, Lóma-g., Rita-g.; Gnúpar, pl., and Gnúpr, names of farms, Landn.: a pr. name, Bs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnydja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnyðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gnuddi, <i>to mutter, grumble;</i> herrinn gnuddi nú ílla, Fms. vi. 156 (nuddi, v. l.); en þó gnuddi þetta mest á Sturlu, <i>they grumbled most against Sturla,</i> Sturl. 157: <i>to scream, grunt,</i> gnyðja mundu nú grísir ef þeir vissi hvat hinn gamli þyldi, Fas. i. 282.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnydr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnyðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. ir, mod. <strong>nyðr,</strong> or even spelt <strong>niðr,</strong> <i>a murmur;</i> þykki mér íllt at heyra gnyð ykkar yfir mér, Fas. iii. 194; görðisk þá mikill gnýr ok gnyðr af ópi ok hlaupum, Stj. 452, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gny-fari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gný-fari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., poët. <i>the wind,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gny-mikit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gný-mikit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>stormy, windy,</i> Grett. 111 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. gnýr, pret. gnúði, <i>to sound,</i> of wind and sea; derived from gnúa, with the notion of <i>a grating sound,</i> as of a stream over pebbles, the tide against the beach, etc.; brím gnýr Kormak, vide Lex. Poët.; breki gnúði á stafni, Höfuðl. 11; gnýr allr Jötun-heimr, Vsp. 53; gnýjanda gjálfr, Sks.; útan gnýr á eyri Ýmis blóð, Edda (in a verse); vindar eru þá úkyrrir ok gnýja héðan ok handan, Edda 8; þar megu vér nú heyra gnýja bana Þorkels frænda, Ld. 326; gnúði á hallæri mikit ok veðrátta köld, Bs. i. 171; þá gnúði á hin snarpasta hríð, Fms. ii. 225; þótti honum görask mikit vandkvæði í þessu er á gnúði, iv. 145; hvat sem á gnýr, Thom. 114.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnypr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnýpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., mod. <strong>nýpr,</strong> = gnúpr, a local word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a clash, din,</i> as of wind, waves, weapons, etc., Nj. 272, Edda 41, Mag. 6, Skálda 169, Fms. vi. 156, x. 264, Sl. 57: esp. freq. in poët. compds referring to the din of war, Lex. Poët.: metaph., gnýr ok ótti, <i>alarm and fright,</i> Niðrst. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dd, mod. <strong>næða,</strong> <i>to feel a draught,</i> það næðir um þig.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaedingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnæðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., mod. <strong>næðingr,</strong> a <i>gust of wind,</i> Bárð. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnæfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð and að, <i>to project,</i> Lat. <i>eminere;</i> af Gnár nafni er svá kallat, at þat gnæfi sem hátt ferr, Edda. 22; merki mörg óðfluga ok gnæfðu fyrir ofan brekkuna, Hkr. i. 150; engi sá fyrr en þar gnæfaði merki yfir þeim, Fms. viii. 62; en er bændr sá þat í móti dags-brúninni at merki konungs gnævaði hátt, 126; ok gnæfar yfir liðinu sem einn hár turn, Al. 141; hans bust næfði (sic) náliga við limar uppi, Fb. ii. 27; g. við himin, Fas. i. 185 (in a verse); hann gnæfði ofarliga við ráfrinu, Grett.: metaph., Lat. <i>impendere,</i> hvílíkr háski at yfir gnæfir þeirra sálum, H. E. i. 514:—very freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnæfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>gnæpr,</strong> Fb. i. 258), adj. <i>floating high,</i> of a banner, Hd. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaegja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnægja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [gnógr], <i>to endow, bestow upon;</i> gnægð með góðum hlutum, Stj. 421; hve hann yrþjóð (acc.) auði gnegir, <i>how he endows men with bliss,</i> Ad. 18; and gnegðr at fjárafli, <i>endowed with wealth,</i> id. In mod. usage <strong>nægja,</strong> það nægir, <i>‘tis enough,</i> e. g. sá hefir nóg sér nægja lætr, a saying, freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., mod. <strong>nægr,</strong> = gnógr; þú hefir þat gnægara, er meira þarf við, Lv. 43; því at lands-folkit var gnægt til, i. e. <i>populous,</i> Hkr. i. 45; hann á nægri börn en kýr, <i>he is better stocked with bairns than kine,</i> Bs. ii. 141; skaupi gnegr, <i>full of contempt, scoffing,</i> Ad. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaegt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnægt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (<strong>nægt, nægð,</strong> Stj. 235, freq. in mod. usage), = gnótt, <i>abundance:</i> esp. in pl., eiga alls nægtir, <i>to have one’s fill of all good things,</i> freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnaegta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnægta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, = gnægja; Dróttinn mun þik g. öllum góðum hlutum, Stj. 421.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnollra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnöllra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (<strong>nöllra,</strong> Karl. l. c.; hence the mod. <strong>nöldra</strong> <i>to grumble,</i> <strong>nöldr</strong> <i>grumbling</i>):—<i>to howl, bark;</i> hundrinn hljóp upp gnöllrandi, Fas. iii. 545; haukar þeirra gnöllraðu, Karl. 376, v. l.; við þessi orð spratt hundrinn upp ok gnöllraði hátt, Fms. iii. 13; hjarta hans gnöllraði í honum innan-brjósts eins og greyhundr, rendering of Od. xx. 13, 14; þar eru tveir hundar ok nöllra þeir ok grenja, Þiðr. 245.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnollran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnöllran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>howling,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnotra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnötra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [gnat], <i>to clatter, rattle;</i> gnötrar (gnottir, Verel.) sverðit hvárt yfir annat, Bret. 55; menn þóttusk heyra at beinin gnötruðu við hræringarnar, <i>his bones clattered,</i> Bs. i. 69: esp. of the teeth, skelfr hann svá mjök at gnötrar í honum hver tönn, Háv. 54; tennr hans nötruðu, Fbr. 149: metaph., þar hlaut at nötra um, Sd. 169:—in mod. usage freq. <i>to shiver, shake,</i> as with cold.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gnotran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gnötran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a rattling,</i> Eluc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/goddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [cp. Germ. <i>götze</i>] a nickname, Ld.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/god"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [all the Teutonic languages have this word in common; Ulf. <i>guþa,</i> n. pl., Gal. iv. 8; <i>guda,</i> id., John x. 34, 35; and <i>Guþ,</i> m.; A. S. <i>godu,</i> n. pl., and <i>God,</i> m.; O. H. G. <i>Cot:</i> in mod. languages masc.; Engl. <i>God;</i> Germ. <i>Gott;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>Gud</i>].",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/god-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goð-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (seldom spelt <strong>guðorð,</strong> as in Grág. ii. 154); hann var maðr félítill en átti staðfestu góða í Skálholti ok goðorð, Bs. i. 54; for this word vide goði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/goda-kvidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goða-kviðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a law term, the verdict of a jury composed of twelve goðar, commonly called tylftar-kviðr, <i>a ‘twelver-verdict,’</i> fixed for some special cases, defined in Grág.; the goða-kviðr was opposed to the búa-kviðr, vide búi, Grág. i. 168, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/goda-lyrittr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goða-lýrittr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a law term, <i>a protest</i> or <i>interdict,</i> Grág. i. 112, ii. 97, passim; but it is uncertain whether it is derived from goði, i. e. <i>the protest of a</i> goði, or from goð, i. e. <i>the great ban,</i> a protest in the holy name of the gods.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/goda-thattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goða-þáttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a section of law</i> about the goðar, Grág. i. 73.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/godi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Ulf, renders ἱερεύς by <i>gudja</i> (<i>ufar-gudja, ahumista-gudja,</i> etc.), ἱερατεία by <i>gudjinassus,</i> ἱερατεύειν by <i>gudjinôn</i>; an Icel. gyði, gen. gyðja, would answer better to the Goth. form, but it never occurs, except that the fem. gyðja = <i>goddess</i> and <i>priestess</i> points not to goði, but to a masc. with a suppressed final <i>i</i>, gyði; a word <i>coting</i> occurs in O. H. G. glossaries, prob. meaning the same; and the form <i>guþi</i> twice occurs on Danish-Runic stones in Nura-guþi and Saulva-guþi, explained as goði by P. G. Thorsen, Danske Runem.; (Rafn’s explanation and reading of Nura-guþi qs. norðr á Gauði, is scarcely right): with this exception this word is nowhere recorded till it appears in Icel., where it got a wide historical bearing]:—prop. <i>a priest, sacerdos,</i> and hence <i>a liege-lord</i> or <i>chief of the Icel. Commonwealth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/godords-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goðorðs-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without a</i> godord, Nj. 149, Band. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/godords-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goðorðs-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘godord-man,’</i> = a goði, Hrafn. 13, 14, Fs. 67, Glúm. 324, Sturl., passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/godords-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goðorðs-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an action concerning a</i> godord, Sturl. ii. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/godords-tilkall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goðorðs-tilkall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a claim to a</i> godord, Sturl. ii. 88: erfða-goðorð (q. v.), Sturl. i. 198; fornt goðorð, vide above: forráðs-goðorð = manna-forrað, <i>a godord to which</i> forráð (<i>power</i>) <i>is attached,</i> an απ. λεγ. in Ísl. ii. 173 (Hænsa Þ. S.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/goggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          goggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
