        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>grêdus</i> = λιμός; Engl. <i>greed</i>], prop. <i>hunger,</i> freq. in Lex. Poët.; úlfa gráðr = úlfa sultr: <i>greed, gluttony,</i> Bs. ii. 137, Róm. 184, Sks. 113 B (gráði); hel-gráðr, <i>voracity presaging death;</i> ok er nú kominn á þik helgráðr er þú hyggsk öll ríki munu undir þik leggja (of insatiable ambition as presaging downfall), Fas. i. 372; cp. hel-fíkr, id., 385; (these passages are paraphrases from old lost poems.)",
            }
          }
        />
