              "__html": "n. <i>a grip, grasp;</i> upp-grip, <i>plenty to take, abundance;</i> á-grip, q. v.; yfir-grip, <i>compass:</i> medic. <i>spots</i> on the skin, believed to be the finger-prints or marks of goblins or demons, Fél.",
            }
