          href="/word/grylla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          grylla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to see dimly,</i> as through a cloud, það gryllir til lands: impers. <i>to recollect dimly,</i> mig gryllir til pess.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/grynna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          grynna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [grunnr], impers. <i>to become shallow;</i> grynnir dalinn (acc.), <i>the dale became shallow, less deep,</i> in advancing higher up in a dale, Bárð. 173: reflex., <i>id.,</i> Bs. i. 355; þá er grynntisk yfir at landinu, Fms. viii. 170: metaph., kostr okkarr grynnisk, Bs. ii. 133: in mod. usage freq. act. and absol., það grynnir, fer að grynna.",
            }
          }
        />
