        >
          gæi-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a gude-man</i> or <i>good-man, franklin,</i> perh. derived from gó- in góligr, Edda i. 536 (a απ. λεγ.); it is evidently the same as Engl. <i>yeoman,</i> <strong>gæi-brúðr,</strong> f. <i>a good-wife,</i> also a απ. λεγ. in a verse, Eb.",
