          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>enticement, soothing;</i> esp. in pl. gælur, <i>lullaby songs;</i> barna-gælur, <i>nursery songs;</i> hefir brag þenna ok barngælur, ort ófimliga Einar Fóstri, a ditty; frið-gælur, q. v.:—<i>a breeze</i> = gol, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gaela-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(gœla), d, [gala, gól; Ulf. <i>gôljan</i> = χαίρειν], <i>to comfort, soothe, appease;</i> verð ek mik gæla af grimmum hug, Skv. 3. 9; þat gælir mik, Band.; gæla gjöfum ok fagrmæli, MSS. 4. 6; eigi mun hann gæla mega með sáttar-boðum, Fms. x. 221; gæla grættan, Sl. 26, (better than gala.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gaeling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gæling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>fondling,</i> Barl. 55, 150; gaelingar-orð, Fms. viii. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., also spelt <strong>gör</strong> and <strong>gjar,</strong> esp. in Norse MSS., but also freq. in Fb., Stj., D. N. passim; [A. S. <i>gestran, gestran dag;</i> Engl. <i>yesterday;</i> O. H. G. <i>gestar;</i> Germ. <i>gestern;</i> Dan. <i>gaar;</i> Swed. <i>går;</i> Lat. <i>heri, hesternus;</i> Gr. χθές; cp. also Engl. <i>yore,</i> answering to the form gör]:—<i>yesterday;</i> only with the prep. <i>í,</i> í gær, Fms. vii, 168, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gaer-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gær-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
