          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [gangr], <i>a passage, lobby;</i> en ór kastala vóru göng upp í kirkju, Fms. ix. 523: freq. in mod. usage, of <i>a narrow passage,</i> baðstofu-göng, esp. when leading from the door to the sitting-room: metaph., gefa e-m göng, <i>to give one free passage,</i> xi. 283; kunna göng at orostu, <i>to know the ways of fighting,</i> vi. 387.",
