          className="link"
          href="/word/gor-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gör
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>ger,</strong> n. <i>a flock of birds of prey;</i> þar var hrafna gör, Höfuðl. 9; hræva gör, <i>carrion crows,</i> Merl. 2. 68, (in both passages rhyming with a word having ø for root vowel); opt er fiskr í fugla geri, <i>there are often fish where gulls gather,</i> Hallgr. in Snót 212 2nd Ed. (for the gulls guide the fishermen to the shoals of fish); þá fylgir því gör mikit ok áta, Sks. 140.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gor-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gör-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(also spelt <strong>gjör-, ger-, geyr-</strong>); the complete old form is <strong>görv-,</strong> which remains in görv-allr, q. v. [cp. görva below; mid. H. G. <i>gar, garwe;</i> O. H. G. <i>garo;</i> N. H. G. <i>gar</i>]:—as adverb. prefix, <i>quite, altogether:</i> <strong>gör-auðr,</strong> adj. <i>quite empty:</i> <strong>gör-bænn,</strong> adj. <i>begging hard, importunate,</i> Sighvat, Fb. ii. 80: <strong>gör-eyða,</strong> dd, <i>to lay quite waste:</i> <strong>gör-farinn,</strong> part. <i>quite gone, quite lost,</i> of a game, Fms. vii. 219: <strong>gör-hugall,</strong> adj. <i>very heedful, mindful,</i> Eg. 14: <strong>gör-kólfr,</strong> m. = for-kólfr, q. v.: <strong>gör-slokinn,</strong> part. <i>quite slaked,</i> Hólabók 103: <strong>gör-spiltr,</strong> part. <i>quite corrupt.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gor-ottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          gör-óttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>empoisoned,</i> Sæm. 118.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
