      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          görn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., old pl. garnar, Grág. ii. 361, 371, usually and mod. garnir, [akin to garn, <i>yarn</i>], <i>the guts,</i> Landn. 217, Grág. ii. 361, Jb. 320, Ls. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gorning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          görning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>gjörning, gerning</strong>), f. (in mod. usage masc. <strong>-ingr,</strong> Sturl. i. 217):—<i>a doing, deed, act,</i> Sturl. l. c., Hom. 106; góð-g., <i>well-doing, a good deed;</i> mis-g., <i>a mis-deed: a written deed,</i> freq.: in plur., Postulanna Görningar or Gjörninga bók, <i>the book of the Acts of the Apostles,</i> freq.; kirkja á messu-bók ok görninga, Ám. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gorninga-hrid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          görninga-hríð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., <strong>-veðr,</strong> n. <i>a witch storm,</i> Fs. 56, Fas. iii. 279.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/gorninga-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          görninga-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
