        >
          haka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Swed. <i>haka;</i> Dan. <i>hage</i>], <i>the chin,</i> Eg. 305; skeggit við hökuna, 564; höku ok kjálka, Fms. ii. 59, xi. 139, N. G. L. i. 339, Edda; undir-haka, <i>a double chin.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/haki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          haki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>hage;</i> Swed. <i>hake;</i> Germ. <i>haken;</i> Engl. <i>hook</i>], <i>a hook,</i> (rare): a mythical pr. name, Edda, Fas.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
