            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hala-rofa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hala-rófa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>‘tail-row,’</i> i. e. <i>a string one after another,</i> like geese; ganga í halarófu, <i>to walk in</i> h.; cp. Dan. <i>gaasegang,</i> Fr. <i>en queue.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hala-stjarna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hala-stjarna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘tail-star,’ comet,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hala-tafl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hala-tafl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a kind of <i>game,</i> used synonymous to hnef-tafl, q. v., prob. similar to the Engl. ‘fox and goose;’ hann tefldi hnet-tafl, þat var stórt hala-tafl (having a fox with a big tail), hann greip þá upp töfluna ok setti halann á kinnbein Þorbirni (prob. of the brick representing the fox), Grett. 144 A; vide Skýrsla um Forngripa-safn Íslands by Sigurd Gudmundsson, Reykjavík 1868, pp. 38, 39; cp. also hali á hnefa-töflu in Vilmundar S. Viðutan, ch. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (vide halda), <i>hold:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-godr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-góðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of good hold, durable,</i> of clothes, etc., Sks. 403.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-kvaemask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-kvæmask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>hall-</strong>), d, dep. <i>to avail, suit;</i> nægjask eðr h., Stj. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-kvaemd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-kvæmd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>convenience, comfort,</i> Sturl. i. 212.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-kvaemligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-kvæmligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>convenient, comfortable,</i> Sks. 377.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-kvaemr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-kvæmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and assimilated <strong>hall-kvæmr,</strong> Nj. 265, Fas. ii. 240, Sks. 505; or <strong>hall-kœmr,</strong> 380, 505 B, [cp. koma at haldi], adj. <i>fit, meet, convenient,</i> Hom. 141, Sturl. i. 45, Fms. ii. 261, Grett. 106 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>holding close,</i> Stj. 635; vera h. á e-u, <i>to keep it close,</i> Fms. vi. 440, x. 170; e-m verðr ekki haldsamt á e-u, <i>it slips out of one’s hands.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hald-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hald-semi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>closeness,</i> Greg. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = hadda, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. hélt (= Goth. <i>haihald</i>), 2nd pérs. hélt, mod. hélzt, pl. héldum; pres. held, pl. höldum; pret. subj. héldi; part. haldinn; imperat. hald and haltú: [Ulf. <i>haldan</i> = βόσκειν, ποιμαίνειν, whereas he renders <i>to keep, hold</i> by other words; Hel. <i>haldan</i> = <i>alere, fovere, colere,</i> which thus seems to be the primitive sense of the word, and to be akin to Lat. <i>cŏlo;</i> again, A. S. <i>healdan,</i> Engl. <i>hold,</i> O. H. G. <i>haltan,</i> Germ. <i>halten,</i> Swed. <i>hålla, halda,</i> Dan. <i>holde</i>, are all of them used in a more general sense]:—<i>to hold.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/haldin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          haldin-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. pass. in the compds, <strong>haldin-orðr,</strong> adj. <i>discreet, close,</i> Fms. ii. 18, x. 326, Eg. 51; <strong>haldin-yrði,</strong> n. <i>keeping close,</i> Sks. 361, Sd. 169: in mod. usage these words mean <i>the keeping one’s word.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hali
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>hale</i>, cp. Lat. <i>cauda</i>], <i>a tail;</i> kýr-hali, <i>a cow’s tail;</i> nauts-h., ljóns-h., etc.; skauf-hali, <i>reynard, a fox,</i> whence Skaufhala-bálkr, the name of an old poem, an Icel. Reineke Fuchs. Icel. use hali properly of cattle, and lions, wolves, bears; tagl of horses (of the hair, but stertr of a caudal vertebra); rófa of cats, dogs; skott of a fox; sporðr of a fish; stél or véli of birds; dyndill of seals. The old writers do not make these nice distinctions, and use hali of a horse and tagl of a cow, which a mod. Icel. would not do; hylr öll kykvendi hár eðr hali, Sks. 504: in Gþl. 398 of cattle, cp. N. G. L. i. 24; ef maðr höggr hala af hrossi svá at af rófu fylgir, Gþl. 399; ef maðr höggr hala af hrossi fyrir neðan rófu, id.; nú skerr maðr tagl af nautum, id.; eru þeir í málum mestir sem refr í halanum, Fms. viii. 350; ef maðr skerr af hrossi manns tögl, þá gjaldi aura þrjá; en ef hala höggr af, þá skal meta hross, N. G. L. i. 228; ok svá ef hann höggr hala af hrossi svá at rófa fylgir, id.: of a lion’s tail, Stj. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a hall</i>; vide höll.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-kvaemr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-kvæmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "etc., vide hald-.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-lendi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-lendi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a slope, declivity,</i> Orkn. 244.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-lendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-lendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sloping,</i> Sturl. i. 85.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-maela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-mæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to speak ill of one,</i> with dat., Nj. 53, Fms. iv. 81, xi. 260, Magn. 442, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-maeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-mæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>blame, reproof,</i> Fas. i. 106, Str. 71, Fs. 15, Edda 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-oki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-oki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-oka</strong>), adj. indecl. [aka höllu], <i>suffering defeat, worsted, overcome;</i> in the phrase, vera, fara, h. fyrir e-m, Ld. 146, Fær. 229, Bárð. 174, Karl. 91 (v. l.), Hsm. 18. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-sperra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-sperra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>stiffness in the limbs,</i> = harðsperra.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hall-aeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hall-æri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [ár], <i>a bad season, a famine, dearth,</i> Nj. 73, Fms. ix. 48, Bs. i. 200, Ísl. ii. 58, Ó. H. 102, Hkr. i. 21, 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>hælde;</i> Swed. <i>hälla</i>], <i>to lean</i> or <i>turn sideways,</i> with dat., esp. of a vessel, ship, or the like; halla keri, fötu, staupi, skipi; but also of anything else, h. borði, stóli; Icel. distinguish between halla and the derivative hella, <i>to pour out;</i> hann hallar skipinu á ymsa vega, Fbr. 100 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hallan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hallan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a swerving,</i> Stj. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hallandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hallandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = hall-lendi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hallarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hallarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Fr. <i>hallier;</i> Swed. and Norse <i>hyll;</i> Dan. <i>hyld</i>], a kind of <i>tree,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Ivar Aasen <i>hall;</i> cp. the Norse Fredriks-<i>’hald’</i>], <i>a sloping, brink, declivity,</i> Hem.; freq. in mod. usage: metaph. <i>a drawback, loss of right.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hallin-skidi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hallin-skíði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., poët. <i>a ram,</i> Edda (Gl.): name of the god Heimdal, Edda, vide Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj., fem. höll, <i>leaning to one side, swerving, sloping;</i> jakarnir vóru hallir út af skerinu, Eb. 238; jakarnir vóru bæði hálir ok hallir, 240; hann (the ship) ferr jafnan hallr, <i>it heeled over,</i> Fb. i. 520, Fms. x. 368; h. í göngu, <i>limping,</i> Vápn. 6; bera hallt höfuðit, <i>to bear the head on one side,</i> Fms. ii. 70; hallt ker, <i>a half-filled cup,</i> Hm. 51; standa höllum fæti, <i>to stand slanting,</i> Nj. 97; bar hallan skjöldinn, <i>the shield came aslant,</i> Eg. 378; láta verða hallt á e-n, <i>to overmatch one,</i> metaph. from rowing or from the balance, Fbr. 122:—hann lætr ekki á sik hallt, ok höggr í móti, <i>he allowed no inequality, but cut in return,</i> i. e. <i>he paid blow for blow,</i> O. H. L. 92; nú leikr mér þat eigi í hug, at á yðr verði hallt um vár skipti, Þorf. Karl. 404: so in the phrases, aka höllu fyrir e-m (halloki) or aka höllum fæti (MS.), <i>to be upset, to stoop</i> or <i>crouch before one,</i> metaph. from driving, Ld. 206; fara höllum fæti, <i>to he worsted,</i> Bs. i. 907; aka undan höllum (öllum MS.) fæti, Lv. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., vide hálmr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. halir, [no doubt an apocopated form, akin to A. S. <i>hæled,</i> Germ. <i>held</i> = <i>hero,</i> as also to hölðr or höldr, q. v.]:—<i>a man,</i> only used in poetry; halr er heima hverr, a saying, Hm. 36; gráðigr halr, 19; hnígra sá halr fyrir hjörum, 159; halr hugfullr, Hðm. 19; halr enn hugblauði, Hbl. 49; úkristinn halr, Sighvat: in plur. <i>men,</i> troða halir helveg, Vsp. 52, 56: used of <i>the dead inmates of Hel,</i> Alm. 29, cp. Vþm. 43, which seems to be a pun, as the word itself is not akin to Hel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hals"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hals
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>neck;</i> vide háls.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/haltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          haltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>halltr,</strong> adj. [A. S. <i>healt;</i> Engl. <i>halt;</i> O. H. G. <i>halz;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>halt;</i> cp. Lat. <i>claudus;</i> prob. akin to hallr]:—<i>halt, lame, limping,</i> Hm. 70, 89, Fms. vi. 322, Nj. 209, Landn. 100, Ísl. ii. 219, Edda 28; haltir ganga, Matth. xi. 5, xv. 31, xxi. 14, Luke vii. 22, xiv. 13, Acts iii. 2, viii. 7: haltr at máli, <i>halting in speech, stammering,</i> Barl. 15, (whence mál-haltr): as a nickname, Eyjólfr Halti, Lv.; Hrómundr H., Vd., Fs. 39, 48: metaph., h. í trúnni, <i>halting, unsound in faith,</i> Karl. 279; hand-haltr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/haltra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          haltra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to halt, limp,</i> Grett. 151, Fbr. 179, Bs. i. 321, Stj. 592, Hebr. xii. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/halzi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          halzi
