          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-bjalla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a hand-bell,</i> Pm. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-bjorg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-björg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘hand-supply;’</i> esp. in phrases, lifa við h. sína, <i>to live from hand to mouth,</i> Fas. iii. 538; eiga allt undir h. sinni, <i>id.,</i> Róm. 290; færa e-n fram með h. sinni, <i>to support a person by one’s labour,</i> Jb. 267; whence <strong>handbjargar-úmagi,</strong> a, m. (<strong>-maðr,</strong> m.), <i>a person supported by another’s labour,</i> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-bogi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-bogi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a hand-bow,</i> Landn. 288, Sks. 390, 626, Orkn. 148, Fms. vii. 45, Fb. i. 486; opp. to lásbogi, <i>a cross-bow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-bok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-bók
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a handbook,</i> Vm. 52, Hom. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-bragd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-bragð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>handicraft, manner of work,</i> gott, íllt h.: of needlework, það er handbragðið hennar á því, and the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-byndi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-byndi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>hand-bendi,</strong> n., prop. a <i>handcuff:</i> metaph. <i>a hindrance, bother,</i> e-m er (verðr) h. at e-u, <i>to be bothered with a thing,</i> Karl. 234; það er h. að honum; hann ekki nema til handbendis.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-baerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-bærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ready at hand</i>, Greg. 7, Hornklofi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-draga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-draga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dróg, <i>to pull,</i> Thom.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-fagr"
