            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-fara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-fara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "fór, <i>to touch with the hands,</i> Bs. i. 460.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-fatt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-fátt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>lack of hands, having too few hands,</i> Fb. i. 521.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-festa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-festa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, a law term, <i>to strike a bargain by shaking hands, to pledge;</i> h. heit sitt, Fms. vi. 145; Ásgrímr handfesti at greiða þriggja vetra skatta, Bs. i. 740; handfestir eiðar, Dipl. ii. 19; biskup handfesti (<i>betrothed</i>) jungfrú Ingilborg, Fms. x. 103, H. E. i. 248; handfest mér upp á trú þína, at …, Stj. 629. 2 Kings x. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-festr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-festr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>striking a bargain, the joining hands;</i> þá ferr handfestr um allt skipit þeirra í millum at þessu heiti, Bs. i. 421; áttu þeir at handfesti ok vápna-tak at þessu heiti, Fms. viii. 55; tóku þeir heit sitt með h., v. 138; sira Oddr tók þá ok þetta skilorð með h., Bs. i. 746; við vitni ok h., Fb. i. 366: it answers to the signing one’s name in mod. law. ☞ In the early Dan. and Swed. laws the stipulation to be given by the king at his coronation was called <i>haand-fæstning.</i> In Scotland marriage used often to be preceded by a preliminary union called <i>hand-fasting,</i> see Jamieson s. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-fjatla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-fjatla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = handvætta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-fyllr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-fyllr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a handful,</i> Ó. H. 211.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-faeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-færi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an angling line.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hand-ganga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hand-ganga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>surrender</i> (cp. ganga á hönd e-m), also <i>submission to one as liege-lord;</i> veita e-m handgöngu, Ó. H. 97; þá varð ekki af handgöngu við konunga, 163, Róm. 124, 134.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
