        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>heim-koma</strong>), u, f. <i>return home,</i> Fms. i. 290, Sturl. i. 213: the phrase, missa heimkvámu, <i>to miss one’s return, be slain in foreign parts,</i> answering to ἀπολέσαι νόστιμον ημαρ, Od.; misti þar margr maðr heimkvámu, Fas. i. 385, (Skjöld. S., which is a paraphrase from an old lost poem); at margr missi heimkvámu í þeima styr, Sighvat, Hkr. iii. 40 (in a verse). <strong>heimkvámu-dagr,</strong> m. <i>the day of coming home,</i> νόστιμον ημαρ, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
