              "__html": "(<strong>heinar-smjör,</strong> <i>hone-grease,</i> Fb. iii. 425), n. <i>the liquor in which mowers dip the whetstone,</i> Fms. vi. 374: in poetry the sword is called <strong>hein-flet, hein-land, hein-vandill,</strong> <i>the flat, land, rod of the hone,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
