            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a votive day;</i> heitdagr Eyfirðinga, <i>the first Tuesday in the month</i> Einmánuðr (<i>April</i>), <i>a ‘day of vow’</i> at the end of the winter when fodder and food began to run short, vide Rd. ch. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
