            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heit-strenging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heit-strenging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a solemn vow</i> of the heathen kind (cp. strengja heit), Fms. i. 4, Hrafn. 8, Ísl. ii. 42, Fms. xi. 26, 109–113, 152, Fs. 122. For descriptions of this heathen custom, esp. at festivals (at Yule time, at funerals), see esp. Hænsa Þ. S. ch. 12, Jómsv. S. ch. 8, 37, cp. Hkr. Ó. T. ch. 39, Hervar. S. ch. 4 (Fas. i. 417), Hkr. Har. S. Hárf. ch. 4, Yngl. S. ch. 40, Harð. S. ch. 14, Flóamanna S. ch. 2 (cp. Landn. 1. ch. 3), Hrafn. ch. 2, Hkv. Hjörv. (prose).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heit-strengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heit-strengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to vow,</i> Fms. xi. 110, Str.; (better in two words.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heit-songr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heit-söngr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a votive song,</i> Bs. i. 307, 354.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heit-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heit-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u. = heitorð.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> tt, [heitr], <i>to heat;</i> hón heitti steinana, Lv. 70; hann lét taka sement ok heita í katli, Fms. vi. 153; h. spjót í eldi, Fas. ii. 29; sólin heitir hafit, Rb. 444.,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heita-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. heit, heitr, and in A. II. heiti, heitir (bisyllabic), in mod. usage heiti through all significations; pret. hét, hétu, 2nd pers. hézt; part. heitinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heitan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heitan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a hooting, threatening,</i> Fms. vi. 371, 437, Sturl. ii. 57, Fs. 31. <strong>heitanar-orð,</strong> n. pl. <i>menaces,</i> Fms. vi. 118, Sturl. iii. 141.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heitask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heitask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep.; [in mod. usage this word is often used as a strong verb, as if it belonged to the great verb heita above; but wrongly, as they are widely different, the former referring to Goth. <i>haitjan,</i> the latter to Goth. <i>wôtjan,</i> answering to Icel. hóta, hœta, q. v., Old Engl. <i>to wite</i>]:—<i>to hoot, threaten, abuse one;</i> heitask við e-n, with infin. or absol., hann gerir reiðan mjök ok heitask við Odd, Korm. 142; aldrei hallmælti hann úvinum sínum ok aldri heitaðisk hann við þá, <i>and he never spoke evil of or abused his enemies,</i> Nj. 211; hann settisk í bú hans en heitaðisk við bónda, Fs. 157; hverr ert þú svá djarfr, at þú þorir at heitask við höfðingja várn? Fms. i. 75: with infin., heituðusk Danir mjök at fara með her í Noreg, 160; h. e-s, viii. 167; þeir heitaðusk at verja hann, vii. 290; Knútr heitaðisk jafnan at herja til Englands, Ísl. ii. 241; en hjónin heituðusk við í öðru lagi at hlaupa á brott, Bjarn. 27; hann heitask at brjóta þau, O. H. L. 23; h. til e-s, muntú ná goðorði þínu þó at þú heitisk eigi til, Þorst. Síðu H. 173: absol., segir at konungi mundi þat eigi duga at heitask eðr herja á innan-lands fólk, Hkr. i. 144. In mod. language heitast is chiefly used of those who shortly before death curse a man, and after death haunt him, see Ísl. Þjóðs. i. 222.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heiti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heiti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a name, denomination,</i> 623. 62, Fms. i. 23, Hkr. i. 320, Orkn. (begin.); úkennd heiti, <i>simple nouns,</i> opp. to kenningar, <i>circumlocutions</i> or <i>metaphors,</i> Edda (Sksm.); heiti and nafn are used almost synonymously, lands-heiti, staða-heiti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heitingar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heitingar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>threats, imprecations,</i> Lat. <i>dirae</i>, Fas. i. 39, iii. 533, Grett. 203 new Ed., cp. Ísl. Þjóðs; i. 222.",
            }
