            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heyrin-kunnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heyrin-kunnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>heyrum-kunnr,</strong> N. G. L. i. 232, Bjarn. 42, both paper MSS., as also in mod. usage), adj. <i>known, reported,</i> Fms. i. 103, Nj. 139, Stj. 421; frægt ok h., <i>famous and well known,</i> 87, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heyrin-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heyrin-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. an old law phrase, which is probably = heyringja-orð, <i>the word</i> or <i>verdict of a</i> heyringi (not from heyra, qs. <i>hearsay</i>); sækja við tylftar-kvið eða við heyrin-orð fimm landeiganda, Grág. ii. 146; skal sækja við váttorð ef hann heyrir á, en ella við fimm manna heyrinorð eða tylftar-kvið, Kb. (l. c.) ii. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heyringi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heyringi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to heyrum, q. v., and not to be derived from heyra; cp. Engl. <i>hireling;</i> A. S. <i>hyrigman, hyrling</i> = <i>domestic retainer</i>]:—a Norse law term, <i>a neighbour, a domestic;</i> it appears almost to answer to Icel. búi; þá skal hann á þing leiða heyringja sína (as witnesses), N. G. L. i. 21; settu þeir tólf manna dóm eptir ok tvá heyringja, ok létu dæma, D. N. ii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heyrn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heyrn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>hearing:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/heyrna-gnipur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          heyrna-gnípur
        </a>
