        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hidazk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          híðazk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dep. [híð], <i>to be in its lair,</i> of a wild beast; hann hafði híðz í þessu fjalli, … far nú ok hiðzt þar er þér líkar, Vitae Patrum (Unger).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          híma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to saunter, loiter;</i> hímir ok hangir … hvat hímir þú … hékk hann af ok hímdi … með himanda hug, Vitae Patrum (Unger).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/himaldi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hímaldi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a laggard,</i> almost like Germ. <i>aschbrödel,</i> Fas. iii. 18: a nickname, Fb. iii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hira"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          híra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [<i>hira,</i> Ivar Aasen, <i>statt ikje dar aa hir!</i> and <i>hiren</i> = <i>lazy</i>]:—híra við, <i>to stand idle, tarry, loiter,</i> Grág. i. 6, 65; öllu var honum betra á Stað, heima að híra, Jón Arason: in mod. usage a reflex., hírast, <i>to sit snug at home;</i> það er og vel að þú hírist (hýrist is a wrong spelling) hér eptir þar sem þú ert nú kominn og etir þar og drekkir, Od. x. 270, 271; hinir hírðu við … ek hírumk hér hjá í yðvarri þjónustu, Vitae Patrum (Unger).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hising"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hísing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. name of an island, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hít
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a scrip</i> or <i>bag made of the skin of a beast,</i> Sd. 157, Fb. i. 220, Grett.: as a nickname, Fb. iii: metaph. <i>a vast belly,</i> Ísl. Þjóðs. i. 612: the name of a giantess, Bárð.: the local names <strong>Hítar-dalr, Hítar-nes</strong> (Landn.) were still at the beginning of this century in that neighbourhood sounded <strong>Hitar-dalr, Hitar-nes,</strong> with a short <i>i</i>, the original form being <strong>Hitár-dalr, Hitár-nes,</strong> <i>the dale and ness of the Hot river</i> (a volcanic river), opp. to Kaldá, <i>the Cold river,</i> in the same county. The derivation from a giantess Hít is a mere fiction, and not older than the Bárðar S. <strong>Hítnesingr,</strong> m. <i>one from</i> Hitarnes, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjadna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjaðna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sink, dwindle,</i> of froth and the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjadningar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjaðningar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>Héðningar,</strong> Fb. i. 282), m. pl. [A. S. <i>Heodeningas, Hetelinge</i> or <i>Hegelinge</i> of the old German epos, Kudrun (Bartsch’s Edition)], <i>the champions</i> of the mythol. hero Héðinn, Edda 90; whence <strong>Hjaðninga-víg,</strong> n. <i>the battle of Hedin and his men,</i> supposed to go on for ever; see the tale in Edda 89, 90, and Fb. i. 278–282.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjakka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjakka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to hack;</i> akin to höggva, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>chatter, talk, tittle-tattle,</i> Edda 110, Fbr. 58, Fms. x. 333, xi. 19, Vápn. 16, Sturl. i. 22, Niðrst. 4: the saying, opt stendr íllt af kvenna hjali, Gísl. 15. <strong>hjals-kona,</strong> u, f. <i>a courtesan,</i> Dropl. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjal-drjugt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjal-drjúgt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>chattering;</i> verða h., <i>to be chattering all along,</i> Eb. 200, Vápn. 7, 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to chatter, talk,</i> Ísl. ii. 330, 332, Ld. 214, Sturl. i. 22; hjala við e-n, Nj. 203, Ísl. ii. 349, 378: recipr., hjalask við, <i>to talk together,</i> 321.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
