      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hjaldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjaldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. rs, [cp. hildr, hjala, as galdr from gala], poët. <i>a din,</i> whence <i>a fight, battle,</i> Lex. Poët. passim: as also in poët. compds, <strong>hjaldr-reifr, -gegninn, -móðr, -örr, -ríkr, -snjallr, -stríðr, -þorinn,</strong> adj. = <i>martial, warlike; the sword</i> is <strong>hjaldr-blik, -íss, -kyndill, -linnr, -skíð;</strong> <i>the battle,</i> <strong>hjaldr-el, -drif, -ganga;</strong> <i>the shield,</i> <strong>hjaldr-ský;</strong> <i>a raven,</i> <strong>hjaldr-gagl, -trani;</strong> <i>a warrior,</i> <strong>hjaldr-gegnir, -magnaðr, -remmir, -snerrandi, -týr, -viðurr: hjaldr-goð</strong> = Odin; vide Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
