          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hjalli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to hilla, Engl. <i>shelf;</i> cp. also Engl. <i>hill</i>]:—<i>a shelf</i> or <i>ledge in a mountain’s side,</i> Hrafn. 9, Gullþ. 19, Fb. iii. 408, Dropl. 33, Sturl. iii. 246, very freq.: as also in local names, Deildar-hjalli, Landn.; Víðir-hjalli, Þver-h., Litli-h., Langi-h.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
