        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. a local name in Norway, the seat of a noble family. <strong>Hlaða-jarl,</strong> m. <i>earl of H.,</i> surname of earl Hakon, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
