            {
              "__html": "n. [hlaða; Dan. <i>læss</i>], <i>a cart-load,</i> Ísl. ii. 182, Grág. ii. 337, Dropl. 10, Karl. 196, Fb. i. 522 (hey-h., viðar-h.): the saying, opt veltir lítil þúfa þungu hlassi, <i>a little mound often overturns a cart-load,</i> Sturl. ii. 100 C.",
