        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. hlátrar, Dropl. 31; mod. hlátrs: [A. S. <i>hlæhtor;</i> Engl. <i>laughter;</i> O. H. G. <i>hlahtar;</i> Germ. <i>lachter;</i> Dan. <i>latter;</i> Swed. <i>löje</i>]:—<i>laughter,</i> Nj. 16, Fbr. 137, Dropl. 31, Fms. iii. 182, passim; hafa (vera) at hlátri, <i>to be a laughing-stock</i> (at-hlátr), 623. 35, Hm. 41: sayings, opt kemr grátr eptir skelli-hlátr; skelli-h., <i>roaring laughter;</i> kalda-hlátr, <i>sardonic laughter:</i> for characteristic traits from the Sagas see esp. Glúm. ch. 7 (end), 18, Nj. ch. 12, 117, Dropl. 31, Hálfs. S. ch. 7, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
