        >
          hleifr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>hlaifs;</i> A. S. <i>hlâf;</i> Engl. <i>loaf;</i> O. H. G. <i>hlaib;</i> Germ. <i>laib;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>levse</i>]:—<i>a loaf,</i> Hm. 51, 140; af fimm hleifum brauðs ok tveimr fiskum, Mirm.; hleifar af Völsku brauði, Bev.; hleifa þunna, ökvinn hleif, Rm. 4, 28, N. G. L. i. 349, Fb. ii. 190, 334 (in a verse), D. I. i. 496; brauð-h., <i>a loaf of bread;</i> rúg-h., <i>a rye loaf:</i> of cheese, Nj. 76, ost-h.: <i>the disk</i> of the sun is called hleifr himins, <i>the loaf of heaven,</i> Bragi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlein"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlein
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. ar, [Goth. <i>hlains</i> = βουνός, Luke iii. 5; akin to Engl. <i>lean,</i> Gr. κλίνειν]:—<i>a rock projecting like a pier</i> into the sea (= hlaðberg), freq. in western Icel.; lenda við hleinina, festa skipið við hleinarnar. <strong>hleina-kræða,</strong> u, f. <i>a crust of moss on sea rocks,</i> Bb. 2. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleina
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to save, protect</i> (?) an απ. λεγ., [A. S. <i>hlænan;</i> Engl. <i>lean;</i> O. H. G. <i>hleinjan;</i> mid. H. G. <i>leinen;</i> Germ. <i>lehnen;</i> Gr. κλίνω]: þaðan af er þat orðtak at sá er forðask (forðar?) hleinir, Edda 21.",
            }
          }
        />
