        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. hlekks and hlekkjar, pl. hlekkir: [A. S. <i>hlenca</i> (thrice in Grein); Swed. <i>länk;</i> Dan. <i>lænke;</i> Engl. <i>link</i>]:—<i>a link, a chain of links,</i> Bs. i. 341; handur-hlekkr, <i>a ‘hand-link,’</i> i. e. <i>a bracelet,</i> Edda (Ht.): freq. in mod. usage, járn-h., <i>iron chains, fetters.</i>",
            }
