      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlemmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlemmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a lid, cover,</i> as of a pan, cauldron, as <i>an opening</i> in a floor, <i>a trap-door,</i> Eb. 96, 136, Rd. 315, Eg. 236, Sturl. ii. 124, Fas. iii. 415, Grett. 199 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlenni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlenni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [cp. Ulf. <i>hlifan</i> = κλέπτειν, <i>hliftus</i> = κλέπτης; perh. also Scot. <i>to lift,</i> = <i>to steal cattle,</i> belongs to this root, and is not the same as <i>lift</i> = <i>tollere</i>]:—<i>a thief;</i> hlennar ok hvinnar, <i>thieves and pilferers,</i> Sighvat: a king is in poetry called the foe and destroyer of hlennar, hlenna dólgr, etc., see Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlenni-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlenni-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘lifter;’</i> hlennimenn ok hrossa-þjófar, Hbl. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hler"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hler
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see hleri below.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hler-tjold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hler-tjöld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>‘ear-lids,’</i> poët. <i>the ears,</i> Ad. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>hlöra,</strong> að, prop. <i>to stand eaves-dropping,</i> (putting one’s ear close to the hleri), Bjarn. 24: <i>to listen,</i> hón lagði eyra sitt við andlit honum ok hlöraði hvárt lífs-andi væri í nösum hans, Greg. 74; hann hlörar við hliðskjáinn er á var stofunni, Bs. i. 628; at hlýða eðr hlera til þess máls sem hann er eigi til kallaðr, N. G. L. i. 438.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. or <strong>hlöri,</strong> but <strong>hleði</strong> in Korm. 10, Ísl. ii. 113; that hleri or hlöri is the better form is borne out by the mod. usage as well as by the derived hler and hlera:—<i>a shutter</i> or <i>door</i> for bedrooms and closets in old dwellings, which moved up and down in a groove or rabbet, like windows in Engl. dwellings, and locked into the threshold: the passage in Korm. S. is esp. decisive, where Kormak sees Steingerda’s feet outside between the half-shut door (hleri) and the threshold,—hann rak kerli fyrir hleðann svá at eigi gékk aptr, viz. <i>between the threshold and the shutter,</i> Ísl. ii. 113; hence comes the law phrase, standa á hleri (hlera?), <i>to stand at the shutter,</i> i. e. <i>to stand listening, eaves-dropping,</i> Bjarn. 43: freq. in mod. usage, as also standa of hleðum, <i>id.,</i> Hðm. 23: in mod. usage <i>a shutter for a window</i> is called hleri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlersi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlersi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., mod. hlessa, q. v.; sló á hann ótta miklum svá sem hann yrði hlersi (hleyrsi, v. l.), Post. (Unger) 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlessa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlessa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. indecl. [hlass], prop. <i>‘loaded,’</i> i. e. <i>amazed, wondering.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlessing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlessing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a freight, loading,</i> N. G. L. i. 410.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [causal of hlaupa], <i>to make one leap, make one rush</i> or <i>burst forth, to start</i> or <i>put into motion,</i> Fms. vi. 145; þeir skáru böndin ok hleyptu á braut fólki því öllu, Ó. H. 168; Önundr hleypti njósnarmönnum á land upp, <i>to put them ashore,</i> Fb. ii. 280; hleypti (<i>pulled, made sink</i>) hann annarri brúninni ofan á kinnina, Eg. 305; h. brúnum, <i>to knit the brows;</i> h. hurð í lás, <i>to shut a door,</i> Fms. ix. 364; var hleypt fyrir hliðit stórum járnhurðum, i. 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in COMPDS: hleypidómr, hleypifífl, hleypiflokkr, hleypiför, hleypihvel, hleypikjóll, hleypiklumbr, hleypimaðr, hleypipiltr, hleypiskip, hleypiskúta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>prejudice, hasty judgment,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-fifl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-fífl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a headlong fool,</i> Nj. 224.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-flokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-flokkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a band of rovers,</i> Sturl. iii. 171, 269.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-for"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-för
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ramble, roving,</i> Sturl. i. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-hvel"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-hvel
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘roll-wheel,’ war engine,</i> Sks. 420.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-kjoll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-kjóll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = hleypiskúta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-klumbr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-klumbr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ram on wheels</i> (war engine), Sks. 419.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a rover, landlouper,</i> Lv. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-piltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-piltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a landlouper boy,</i> Finnb. 322.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-skip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-skip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a swift boat,</i> Hkr. iii. 388.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypi-skuta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypi-skúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a swift boat,</i> Fms. i. 167, vi. 177.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleyping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleyping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a galloping,</i> Fms. ix. 357, Gullþ. 31; um-h., <i>a sudden turn of wind.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleypingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleypingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a landlouper,</i> Grett. 106; cp. hlaupingi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleyt-bolli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleyt-bolli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>hleyt-teinn,</strong> m. = hlaut-bolli, hlaut-teinn, see hlaut.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleyta-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleyta-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>kinsmen;</i> mágar, sifjungar, hleytamenn, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleyti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleyti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., <strong>hleti,</strong> or <strong>hlœti,</strong> in Norse MSS. spelt <strong>leyti,</strong> whence in mod. Icel. usage <strong>leiti</strong>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hleytis-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hleytis-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a disciple, apprentice,</i> a rendering of Lat. <i>vicarius,</i> Post. 36, opp. to meistari, analogous to Goth. <i>siponeis,</i> from sifjar, Skálda 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlezla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlezla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>hleðsla,</strong> u, f. <i>a freight,</i> Jb. 379: <i>a building</i> (of a wall).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hle"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. <i>hlija</i> = σκηνή, Mark ix. 5; A. S. <i>hleô;</i> Hel. <i>hlea;</i> Engl. <i>lee;</i> Dan. <i>læ</i>]:—<i>lee,</i> used (as in Engl.) only by seamen; sigla á hlé, <i>to stand to leeward,</i> Jb. 400: <i>shelter,</i> standa í hlé, fara í hlé, <i>to seek shelter:</i> mod. <i>a pause,</i> það varð hlé á því. <strong>hlé-borð,</strong> n. <i>the lee side,</i> freq., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hle-bardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlé-barðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a leopard</i> (Old Engl. <i>libbard</i>), from the Greek, but used indiscriminately of a bear, wolf, etc., Edda (Gl.), Fas. i. (Skjöld. S.) 367; the word occurs as early as Hbl., of a giant.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hler-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlér
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. Hlés, [hlé; cp. Welsh <i>Llyr</i> = <i>sea</i>], a mythol. name of a giant of the sea, Ώκεανός, Fb. i. 21. <strong>Hlés-dætr,</strong> f. pl. <i>the daughters of H., the Nereids,</i> Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f., pl. hliðar (hliðu dat. obsolete, Gm. 35):—<i>a side,</i> Lat. <i>latus;</i> standa á hlið e-m, <i>to stand beside one,</i> Stor.; komask á hlið e-m, Nj. 262; á hlið hvára, <i>on each side</i>, Rm. 5; á aðra hlið, <i>at one’s other side,</i> Ísl. ii. 363, Ad. 10; á báðar hliðar, á tvær hliðar, <i>on both sides,</i> Fb. ii. 351; á vinstri hlið, <i>on the left hand,</i> Eg. 213, Fms. i. 16; á hægri hlið, <i>on the right hand;</i> snúask á hlið, <i>to turn oneself</i> (in sleep), Fs. 6; skjöldr, sverð á hlið, Gullþ. 64; á allar hliðar, <i>on all sides;</i> veltask á ymsar hliðar, <i>to toss to and fro,</i> Bs. ii. 171, Od. xx. 24; leggja e-t fyrir hlið, <i>to lay beside,</i> Al. 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘gateless,’ without a gate,</i> Bret. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-maeltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-mæltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. a kind <i>of metre,</i> Edda (Ht.) 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-rum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-rúm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>open space, free passage,</i> Fsm. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-sjon"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-sjón
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a side glance;</i> hafa h. af e-u, <i>to take a look at.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-skjalf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-skjálf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., old dat. hliðskjálfu, Gm. (prose): [prob. rather to be derived from hlið, <i>gate,</i> than hlið, <i>side</i>; the initial <i>h</i> is borne out by alliteration, Sagði <i>h</i>itt er <i>h</i>ugði | <i>H</i>liðskjálfar gramr …, Edda (in a verse); in Akv. 14 the sense and alliteration alike require höll, <i>hall</i>, instead of ‘land’]:—<i>a shelf, bench,</i> a name for the seat of Odin, whence he looked out over all the worlds, Edda 6, 12, 22, 30, Gm. l. c.; Óðinn ok Frigg sátu í Hliðskjálfu ok sá um heima alla, Gm. l. c. The heathen Hlið-skjálf brings to mind the legend in Grimm’s Märchen of the Tailor in Heaven.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-skjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-skjár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a side window,</i> originally a window or opening from which to keep a look out, Sturl. ii. 85, Bs. i. 628.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-veggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-veggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a <i>side wall,</i> Nj. 202, Orkn. 244, Fb. i. 413.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlid-vordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlið-vörðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a porter,</i> Stj. 622, Gkv. 2, 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hliða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to give way, go aside, recede,</i> Fas. i. 106, 338, Bs. ii. 132, Karl. 233.",
