        >
          hlíf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. hlífar, <i>a cover, shelter, protection</i> (esp. of a shield, armour), Ld. 244, Eg. 507, Bxarð. 165, Hm. 81, passim: esp. in pl. hlífar, Nj. 262, Fms. ii. 319, Eb. 230, Rm. 39. <strong>hlífar-lauss</strong> (<strong>hlífa-lauss</strong>), adj. <i>‘coverless,’ uncovered,</i> Fms. ii. 205, vi. 70, vii. 192, Ísl. ii. 226.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
