          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. <i>hliuþ</i> = ἡσυχία, 1 Tim. ii. 11, in Uppström’s edition; cp. A. S. <i>hleoðor</i> = <i>sound;</i> mid. H. G. <i>lût;</i> cp. O. H. G. <i>hliodar;</i> Germ. <i>laut;</i> Dan. <i>lyd</i>; Swed. <i>ljud;</i> akin to it are several Gr. and Lat. words with an initial κλ, <i>cl;</i> the original meaning is <i>hearing</i> or <i>the thing heard,</i> like Gr. ἀκοή and hljóð, hljómr, hlust (q. v.) are kindred words; hence comes the double sense of this word in Icel., <i>sound</i> and <i>silence.</i>]",
            }
