          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóðna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become silent, dumb,</i> from surprise, Sturl. ii. 151 (v. l.), Fas. iii. 311: impers., þá hljóðnar um hann, <i>he became silent,</i> ii. 433; þar til hljóðnar um mál þessi, <i>till the noise about it subsides,</i> Grett. 125 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [cp. A. S. <i>hlûde,</i> Engl. <i>aloud,</i> mid. H. G. <i>lûte,</i> Germ. <i>laut,</i> but all in the opp. sense of <i>aloud;</i> cp. hljóð]:—<i>silent, taciturn,</i> 677. 12, Sks. 367, 370, Hom. 129; menn prúða ok hljóða, Fb. ii. 288.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljods-grein"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóðs-grein
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>hljóða-grein,</strong> f. <i>distinction of sound</i> or a kind of <i>sound,</i> Edda 120, Skálda 160, 170, 175, 179, Stj. 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljom-fagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóm-fagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sweet sounding;</i> h. harpa, Bs. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljoma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sound,</i> of a musical voice, Pass. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljoman"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóman
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>sound, tune,</i> Skálda 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljomr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>hliuma</i> = ἀκοή; cp. A. S. <i>hlymman</i> = <i>sonare;</i> Lat. <i>clāmor</i>], <i>a sound, tune, voice,</i> Gs. 2, Hkr. ii. 393; h. engla Guðs, Post. 645. 73; h. ok rödd, Ísl. ii. 170, Rb. 380: chiefly of <i>tunes</i> in music, as in the ditty, Held eg sem helgan dóm | hörpunnar sætan róm | þann til að heyra hljóm | hlypi eg suðr í Róm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hljota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hljóta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. hlýt, pl. hljótum; pret. hlaut, hlauzt, hlaut, pl. hlutum; subj. hlyti; part. hlotinn, neut. hlotið: [A. S. <i>hleôtan;</i> O. H. G. <i>hliuzan;</i> mid. H. G. <i>liuze;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>liota</i>]:—<i>to get by lot, have allotted to oneself;</i> þeir tóku at herfangi Álöfu konu hans ok Arneiði dóttur hans, ok hlaut Hólmfastr hana, Landn. 314; hón hlaut at sitja hjá Björgölfi, Eg. 23; þeir lögðu hluti á ok hlaut Þrándr, Fær. 3; var svá til sýst at Sighvatr skáld hlaut at segja konungi, Fms. vi. 38; (Loki) hlaut blása at helgum skutli, Haustl. 4; skal sá reifa mál hans er hlýtr, <i>who gets the lot, whom the lot falls on,</i> Grág. i. 63.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlotnask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlotnask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. <i>to fall to one’s lot,</i> with dat.; en ef honum hlotnuðusk herteknir menn, Fms. i. 258: freq. in mod. usage, Pass. 36. 10; ok þá honum hlotnaðist að hann skyldi veifa reykelsinu, Luke i. 9; hlotuask til, <i>to turn out;</i> hlotnaðisk svá til, Vígl. 57 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlotr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see hlutr, Fms. xi. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hloa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlóa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [A. S. <i>hlowan;</i> Engl. <i>low</i>], <i>to bellow, roar,</i> of streams or cascades, Gm. 29, an απ. λεγ., but no doubt to be thus explained, and not as in Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [hlaða], <i>a hearth, chimney-place,</i> freq. in mod. usage (it can only be by chance that no old reference is on record); setja pott á hlóðir, <i>to set the pot on the fire.</i> <strong>hlóða-karl,</strong> m. = hadda, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlodyn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlóðyn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. hlóðynjar, the mythical name of the Earth, prop. <i>hearth</i> (?), <i>homestead</i> (?), and akin to hlóð, Edda, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlóra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. the mythical name of the foster mother or nurse of Thor, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hloridi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlóriði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [hlóa and reið = <i>thunder</i>], one of the names of Thor, <i>the Bellowing Thunderer,</i> Edda, Hým., Þkv., Ls., Vellekla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlumr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. ir, proncd. <strong>hlummr,</strong> <i>the handle of an oar,</i> Fas. i. 215 (hlumir), ii. 355 (where hlummar pl.), Edda (Ht., where hlumr and sumri are rhymed), Sturl. iii. 68, Glúm. 395.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlunka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
