            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlunkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlunkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dull sound, a thump.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlunn-rod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlunn-roð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>reddening the</i> h., so called when a person was killed in launching a ship (in the spring), Fas. i. 264, N. G. L. i. 65: this was taken to be a bad augury, see Ragn. S. ch. 9 (Fas. i. 259, 260).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlunnindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlunnindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [hlunnr], prop. <i>‘launching,’</i> but only used metaph., <i>emoluments,</i> esp. attached to an estate or possession, Gþl. 68, 293, Vm. 55, Eb. 40, Fms. ix. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlunnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlunnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Shetl. <i>linn;</i> cp. Engl. <i>to launch,</i> which is derived from the Scandin. word]:—<i>a roller for launching ships,</i> Edda 38, Fms. vii. 19, viii. 45: also of <i>the pieces of wood put under the keel of ships</i> when ashore (during the winter ships used to be dragged ashore, called ráða skipi til hlunns), Grág. i. 92, 209, N. G. L. i. 26, Eg. 515, Nj. 10, Lex. Poët. passim: in poetry <i>a ship</i> is called <strong>hlunn-dýr, -fákr, -goti, -jór, -vigg, -vitnir, -vísundr,</strong> = <i>the deer, steed, bison of</i> h., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [A. S. <i>hlyst;</i> Hel. <i>hlust</i> = <i>hearing;</i> cp. Gr. κλύω], <i>the ear,</i> prop. <i>the inner part of the ear, cochlea auris,</i> Ad. 6, 9, Nj. 210 (v. l.), Fms. ii. 100, Edda 109, Band. 36 new Ed., Sturl. ii. 85, Eg. 758 (in a verse), passim: the ears of beasts, e. g. seals, bears, birds, or the like are usually called hlust, not eyra, Merl. 1. 38, Fb. i. 133, Eb. 99 new Ed. (v. l.), Fas. ii. 237, Fs. 149, 179. <strong>hlustar-verkr,</strong> m. <i>ear-ache, otalgia,</i> Fél.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlusta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlusta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>hlystan;</i> Engl. <i>listen;</i> cp. hlust], <i>to listen</i>; h. til e-s, 623. 34: in mod. usage, h. á e-ð, freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-burdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlut-burðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a chance, lot,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-deila"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlut-deila
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to meddle,</i> Sturl. i. 196, ii. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-deilinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
