        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>hlut-hending,</strong> f. a kind of <i>metre</i> or <i>rhyme,</i> see hending and henda, Edda 121, 123, 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-kesti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlut-kesti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a casting of lots,</i> N. T.; but does not occur in old writers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlut-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘lot-less,’ not partaking in,</i> Lat. <i>expers;</i> at yður bók skyldi þeirra umbóta eigi h. vera, Gþl. iv: <i>having taken no part in,</i> h. eðr sýkn af manndrápi, Fms. ii. 225; h. ok afskiptr e-u (<i>void of</i>), Stj. 155; h. allrar undir-hyggju, Bs. i. 723: neut., veiða hlutlaust, <i>to fish without getting a share,</i> D. I. i. 497; ríða hlutlaust, <i>to pass free, unmolested,</i> Sturl. i. 39. In mod. usage, hlutlauss means <i>passive, neutral,</i> of a person; and láta e-ð hlutlaust, <i>to leave a thing alone, not meddle with it.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-raeningi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlut-ræningi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>one robbed of his share;</i> verða h. e-s, or fyrir e-m, <i>to be unfairly dealt with,</i> Eg. 525 (v. l.), Fb. ii. 379, Gullþ. 12; göra e-n h., Orkn. 306, 318.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hlut-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
