          className="link"
          href="/word/hlyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hlýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. <i>warm, mild;</i> hlýtt veðr, <i>mild weather;</i> hlý húsa-kynni, <i>warm, snug rooms:</i> metaph., e-m er hlýtt til e-s, <i>to have a warm heart, affection, for a person;</i> see hlær below.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
