        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>hlægi-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>ridiculous, laughable,</i> Am. 53, Hkv. Hjörv. 30, Glúm. 351 (hlꜹgligr), Band. 38 new Ed. (see note).",
            }
