        >
          hneitir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [hneita, the verb], <i>Cutter,</i> name of the sword of St. Olave, Lex. Poët. passim, but only after St. Olave’s time; neither can the verse in Gísl. 65 have been composed before that time: <i>a vanquisher,</i> Þd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
