        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (older form <strong>hnöri</strong> or <strong>hneri,</strong> with a single <i>r,</i> Edda. ii. 430; <strong>hneyri,</strong> Thom. 308), <i>a sneeze,</i> Orkn. 448. A plague is said to have set in once upon a time with sneezing, therefore when a person sneezes an Icel. says, Guð hjálpi þér! cp. Germ. <i>helf Gott!</i> Engl. <i>Bless you !</i> see Ísl. Þjóðs. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
