          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hniplingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>bird, a pelican,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnipna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnipna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. <i>ga-nipnan,</i> Mark x. 22; A. S. <i>hnipian</i>], <i>to droop, despond,</i> Gkv. 2. 5, 7, Skv. 3. 13: in Shetl. <i>neebin</i> is <i>nodding drowsily.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnippa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnippa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to poke one in the side:</i> in the phrase, hnippa kolli hver at öðrum, <i>to nod with the head one to another, nod significantly,</i> Grett. 147; hnippa í e-n, <i>to poke a person in the side,</i> so as to wake him from a doze, hnippask, <i>to elbow one another,</i> Gullþ. 61, Fs. 152, 153; h. við e-n, <i>id.,</i> Fms. vii. 243; lengi hafa vórir frændr við hnippsk, Valla L. 210.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnipping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnipping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>puny quarrels,</i> Fas. i. 92; orða-h., <i>a bandying of words.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnipr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnipr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a crouching position;</i> í hnipri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnipra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnipra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, h. sig, <i>to crouch.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnissa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnissa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [cp. Gr. κνισα], <i>steam</i> or <i>smell from cooking,</i> esp. <i>an ill flavour.</i> <strong>hnissu-bragð,</strong> n. <i>disflavour.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>forging:</i> poët. <i>the clash</i> of battle, Höfuðl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnit-bjorg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnit-björg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the ‘clinched crags,’</i> the mythol. name of the crags where the poetical mead was kept, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnit-brodir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnit-bróðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘clasp-brother,’ an adversary,</i> Hým. 23, (poët.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnit-mida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnit-miða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to take near aim at.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [cp. Dan. <i>nitte sammen;</i> akin to hníta], <i>to clasp</i> or <i>weld together</i> with a hammer, Gísl. 14, Fas. i. 316.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnitan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnitan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the act of welding.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnitlast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnitlast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. <i>to quarrel, kick one another,</i> Rb. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnittinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnittinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hitting, facetious:</i> <strong>hnittni,</strong> f. <i>a hit, piece of wit,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hniga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hníga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. hníg; pret. hné, hnétt, hné, pl. hnigu; sing. hneig is very rare in old vellum, e. g. Sks. 112, Fms. vi. 280, viii. 21, Mork. 60, Fb. i. 106, Ó. H. 89, else always hné, as also in mod. poets—Jesú blóð hér til jarða <i>hné</i> | jörðin aptur svo blessuð <i>sé,</i> Pass. 3. 10; part. hniginn: with neg. suff., pret. hnék-at, Og. 11; pres. hnígr-a, Hm. 159, Eg. (in a verse); [Ulf. <i>hneivan</i> = κλίνειν, Luke ix. 12; A. S. <i>hnîgan,</i> pret. <i>hnâh;</i> O. H. G. <i>hnîgan;</i> cp. hneig-ja]:—<i>to bow down, sink, fall gently;</i> of a stream, the sun, a felled tree, a dying man, etc., heilög vötn hnigu af fjöllum, Hkv. 1. 1; fóru þar til er vötn hnigu til vestr-ættar af fjöllum, Orkn. 4; tré tekr at hníga ef höggr tág undan, Am. 56: <i>to sink, fall dead,</i> h. at velli, Hkv. 2. 8; Baldr er hné við bana-þúfu, Hdl.; Hamðir hné at húsbaki, Hðm. 32; hnígra sá halr fyrir hjörum, Hm. 159, Skm. 25, Hkm., Nj. 191; hniginn fyrir oddum, Darr.; hniginn í hadd jarðar, Bm.; hné hans um dólgr til hluta tveggja, hendr ok höfuð hné á annan veg, Skv. 3. 23; ok kvað annan-hvárn verða at h. fyrir öðrum, Ísl. ii. 263; sinn veg hné hvárr þeirra af húsmæninum, 195; síðan hné hann aptr ok var þá dauðr, Ó. H. 223; þá hné (hneig Ed.) hann á bak aptr ok var þá andaðr, Lv. 70; Hjálmarr hnígr at (þúfunni) upp, Fas. ii. 216; þá hné hann aptr ok sprakk af harmi, i. 357 (Fb. i. 106); hné margr maðr fyrir honum ok lét sitt líf, Fb. i. 193: the phrase, hníga at velli, h. í gras, h. at grasi, <i>to sink to the ground, bite the grass,</i> Hkv. 2. 8; áðr en ek hníga í gras, Ísl. ii. 366; mann mun ek hafa fyrir mik áðr ek hníg at grasi, Njarð. 378; mannfólkit greipsk í bráða-sótt, svá at innan fárra nátta hnigu (<i>died</i>) sjau menn, Bs. ii. 35; Einarr sat svá at hann hneig upp at dýnunum, ok var þá sofnaðr, Fms. vi. 280, (hneg, Mork. 60, l. c.); hann hné niðr höfði sínu, <i>he drooped with his head,</i> Karl. 489; þá hné Guðrún höll við bólstri, <i>G. sank back in the bed,</i> Gkv. 1. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnipa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnípa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [in Ulf. <i>ganipnan</i> = στυγνάζειν, Mark x. 22; A. S. <i>hnipian</i> = <i>to bow</i>]:—<i>to be downcast, droop;</i> hnípði drótt ok drúpði, <i>people were downcast and drooping,</i> Ód. 25: haukar þínir hnípa, Fas. i. 175; hann (the horse) hnípti í jörðina, 205; hnipaði, pret., 197, (better hnipnaði or hnípandi, part.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnisa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnísa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. pl. hnísna, Pm. 69:—<i>a dolphin, delphinus phocaena,</i> Grág. ii. 337, 358, Gþl. 456, Sks. 121, Hkr. iii. 279, Fms. vii. 161.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnita-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hníta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. hnít, pret. hneit, pl. hnitu, a defect. verb: [akin to hnita; A. S. <i>hnîtan</i> = <i>tundere;</i> Dan. <i>nitte</i>]:—<i>to strike, wound to the death;</i> lér (<i>the scythe</i>) hneit við Hrungnis fóta-stalli (<i>his shield</i>), Kormak; but chiefly used in emphatic phrases, of a heart-wound, hneit þar! við hneit þarna! Gísl. 22, 106; en er hón þreifaði um síðuna þá mælti hón, þar hneit viðna! Fms. iii. 73; hón kvað hvergi stórum við hníta, Korm. 6; hvergi þykki mér við hníta, Ísl. ii. 343; the last three passages refer to a superstition that the touch of a wise woman made one’s body ‘wound-proof;’ in Rd. ch. 5 (at end) the words ‘ok þótti henni þar við hníta,’ or the like, have been dropped by the transcriber: in poetry the allit. phrase, hjörr hneit við hjarta, <i>the steel touched the heart,</i> Korm. ch. 17 (in a verse); or, egg hneit við fjör seggja, Fms. vii. 71; hneit mér við hjarta hjörr Angantýs, Fas. i. 427; hvast hneit (beit MS.) hjarta ið næsta hættligt járn, Fbr. (fine); þar hneit við, sem …, <i>it cut him to the quick, that …,</i> Thom. 397; hnitu reyr saman, <i>the weapons clashed together,</i> Ísl. ii. 353 (in a verse), Fms. ii. 318 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjod-hamarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjóð-hamarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>hnoð-h.</strong>), m. <i>a rivetting hammer,</i> Fb. iii. 446.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjoda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjóða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. hnýð, pret. hnauð, pl. hnuðu, part. hnoðinn; [cp. Ulf. <i>hnuþo</i> = σκόλοψ, 2 Cor. xii. 7]:—<i>to rivet, clinch;</i> Helgi hnauð hjalt á sverð, Nj. 66; hann þrífr upp nefsteðja einn mikinn, þar hafði Vigfúss áðr hnoðit við sverðs-hjölt sín, Fms. xi. 133; hnjóða rauða, <i>to forge iron,</i> Fs. 177 (in a verse), cp. Fms. i. 177; spjót ok tveir geirnaglar í, eða sá einn er í gegnum stendr, ok hnoðit (noðin, v. l.) at báða vega, N. G. L. ii. 42; ási hnauð hjarta (acc.) við síðu, <i>the yard has clinched ribs and heart together,</i> Fs. 113 (in a-verse); marr hnauð mínum (munar?) knerri, <i>id.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjóðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., prop. <i>rivetting:</i> metaph. <i>blame, censure.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjosa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjósa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a different word, <i>to stumble,</i> of a horse against a ‘hnauss’ (q. v.); hann hnýs um hverja þúfu, Snót 157; perh. akin to A. S. <i>hnossian</i> = <i>tundere.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjosa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjósa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "hnýs, hnaus; the noun hnöri or hneri (q. v.) refers to a lost pret. hnöri, analogous to fröri from frjósa, köri from kjósa; [Germ. <i>niesen;</i> Dan. <i>nyse;</i> Swed. <i>nysa</i>]:—<i>to sneeze,</i> Orkn. 448, Hbl. 26: now obsolete in Icel., see hnerra.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjoskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjóskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [akin to A. S. <i>hnysc</i> or <i>hnesc,</i> Old and North. E. <i>nesh,</i> = <i>soft, tender;</i> whence prob. Engl. <i>nice</i>]:—<i>touchwood,</i> = fnjóskr (q. v.), Fms. vii. 225, v. l.; hnjósk-þurr = fnjósk-þurr: in local names, <strong>Hnjóska-dalr,</strong> m., Landn.; <strong>Hnjósk-dælir,</strong> m. pl. <i>the men from H.;</i> <strong>Hnjósk-dælskr,</strong> adj., Rd. 259.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjosku-lindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjósku-lindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a. m., dub. <i>a belt</i> worn by a wise woman, Þorf. Karl. 374.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjóta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "hnaut, <i>to stumble;</i> hestrinn hnaut þá á fram, Bs. ii. 449 (16th century); no doubt corrupt for hnjósa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjótr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a knob</i> in turf or a field, það sér ekki á hæstu hnjóta, when the ground is covered all over with snow.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnjukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnjúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>hnúkr,</strong> m. <i>a knoll, peak.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnod-saumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoð-saumr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a clinching nail, rivet,</i> Sks. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnoda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [hnjóða], <i>a clew,</i> Ó. H. 152, Pr. 422.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnodri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a fleece</i> or <i>flock of wool;</i> ullar-h., freq.: metaph., ský-h., <i>a fleecy cloud,</i> boding a rising gale: botan., hellu-h., see hella.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnokki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnokki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the small metal hooks</i> holding the thread in a distaff: metaph., strák-hnokki, <i>an urchin.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnokkinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnokkinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [hnúka], <i>bowed, curved.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnoss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [prob. from A. S. <i>hnossian</i> = <i>to hammer,</i> as smíð from smíða], <i>a costly thing,</i> esp. in plur. of a lady’s <i>ornaments,</i> Hkr. i. 16, Edda 21, Fms. xi. 428 (hnossa-smíði), Am. 53, Gh. 6, 18, Gkv. 2. 20, Harms. 40, Líknarb. 13, Orkn. 154 (in a verse): mythol. the goddess Hnoss, a daughter of Freyja and sister to Gersemi, Edda 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnoss-fjold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoss-fjöld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a number of costly things,</i> Sighvat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnoss-gaeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoss-gæti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a dainty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnoss-gaetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnoss-gætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dainty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hnot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. hnetr, or better hnötr, mod. hnotir; [A. S. <i>hnyt</i>; Engl. <i>nut;</i> O. H. G. <i>hnuz;</i> Germ. <i>nuss;</i> Dan. <i>nöd;</i> Swed. <i>nöt;</i> Lat. <i>nux</i>]:—<i>a nut,</i> Str. 20, Fms. v. 175, Edda 46. <strong>hnotar-skurn,</strong> f. <i>a nut-shell,</i> 625. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hnot-skogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
