        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. hnykli, [Dan. <i>nögle;</i> Swed. <i>nyckel;</i> prob. a dimin. derived from hnoða]:—<i>a clew</i> of yarn: metaph. <i>a clew-like thing;</i> þoku-hnyklar, ský-h., <i>wreaths of fog and clouds:</i> of a <i>tumor,</i> Fas. ii. 453.",
            }
