        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to pull violently</i> by the hair or the like, with dat., Eg. 560; h. e-m til sín, Grág. i. 132; h. e-n af e-m, <i>to snatch at a thing,</i> Nj. 32, Orkn. 182; h. e-u upp, <i>to pull up a thing.</i> Glúm. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
