          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          holr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>hol;</i> O. H. G. <i>holi;</i> Engl. <i>hollow;</i> Dan. <i>huul;</i> Swed. <i>hol;</i> Gr. κοιλός]:—<i>hollow;</i> var leikit undan bökkunum svá at holt var með landinu, Grett. 131 A; holr steinn, Str. 32; holr innan, <i>hollow within,</i> Ó. H. 108, Njarð. 378; klappa eigi holan baug um e-t, <i>not to hammer a hollow ring,</i> i. e. <i>to be quite in earnest,</i> Fb. iii. 404; cp. hulda.",
            }
