          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘raw-skin:’</i>—but used (it is hard to say why) in the sense of <i>a shelter, refuge;</i> höfðu þeir hráskinn hjá feðrum sínum (v. l. hald ok traust), Fbr. 8; Guð, drottinn er minn styrkr ok stuðning, ok mitt ráskinn ok frjálsari, Stj. 51. <strong>hráskinns-leikr,</strong> m. a kind of game, ‘<i>hide and seek</i> (?),’ Bárð. 174.",
