        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. [Ulf. <i>hrains</i> = καθαρός; A. S. <i>hrân;</i> lost in Engl., except in the verb <i>to rinse;</i> O. H. G. <i>hreini;</i> Germ. <i>rein;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>ren</i>]:—<i>clean;</i> h. líndúkr, Hom. 138, Fs. 1; hrein klæði, Fms. vi. 207; gott korn ok hreint, Sks. 326; hreint vatn, Gd. 22; h. lögr, Alm. 35; hrein munnlaug, H. E. i. 489; h. mjöll, <i>fresh snow,</i> Rm. 26.",
            }
