        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [hrammr; Ulf. <i>hramjan</i> = σταυρουν, i. e. <i>to nail to the cross;</i> cp. O. H. G. <i>ramen;</i> Dan. <i>ramme</i> = <i>to hit</i>]:—<i>to clutch,</i> Bjarn. 12, Sturl. ii. 203, Fas. ii. 231, Or. 35: part. hremmdr, Sturl. iii. 90, 103.",
