      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrepp-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrepp-stefna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = hreppsfundr, Sturl. i. 185.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrepp-stjori"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrepp-stjóri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘Rape-steerer,’ overseer,</i> Jb. 186, Vm. 116: in each Rape in Icel. the best yeoman is chosen as hreppstjóri by the sheriff (amtmaðr) or, as in former days, by the parishioners, but he is not paid; he has, jointly with the parish priest, to manage the business of the Rape, esp. to see to the maintenance of the poor, fix the poor-rate of each franklin, and, as there are no poor-houses, to arrange the distribution of the poor (úmagar) among the parishioners. In the days of the Commonwealth there was a committee of five members, called hreppstjórnarmenn (q. v.), which discharged the duties of the present hreppstjóri; með ráði heima-prests ok hreppstjóra, Vm. 116. This word does not occur in the Grágás, but only after A. D. 1281; for the reading hreppstjóri in the D. I. i. 199 (in a deed supposed to be of A. D. 1150) is only found in a mod. transcript, and the original prob. had hreppstjórnarmenn (pl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrepp-stjorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrepp-stjórn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the office of a</i> hreppstjóri, Jb. 184: <i>the management of a Rape,</i> K. Á. 96, Jb. 178. <strong>hreppstjórnar-þing,</strong> n. = hreppa-skil or hreppsfundr, Jb. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hreppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hreppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [A. S. <i>hreppan</i> = <i>tangere</i>], <i>to catch, obtain;</i> nú fæ ek eigi þat af þér tekit er þú hefir hreppt, Grett. 114 A; þá hét hann á hinn sæla Þorlák biskup at hann skyldi skipit hreppa, <i>that he might catch up the lost boat,</i> Bs. i. 338; en er hann hreppti áverkann, <i>when he caught the blow, was hit,</i> Gullþ. 51; margr veit hverju hann sleppir en ekki hvað hann hreppir, a saying.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hreppa-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hreppa-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a Rape court,</i> Grág. i. 245, 448.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
