      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hress"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hress
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [cp. A. S. and Hel. <i>hrôr,</i> and prob. akin to hraustr, qs. ‘hrers;’ cp. Germ. <i>rührig, rüstig</i>]:—<i>hale, hearty, in good spirits;</i> hann var af æsku-aldri ok þó maðr inn hressasti, Eg. 202; en þó var Kveldúlfr hress maðr ok vel færr, 84; hraustr ok vel hress, Ld. 56; en er allr herrinn hafði drukkit, þá vórum vér hressir, Al. 167; hann var hinn hressasti, <i>he was quite well</i> (after a sickness), Sturl. ii. 182; ú-hress, <i>low, sickly</i>, Stj. 374.",
            }
          }
        />
