              "__html": "m. pl. <i>‘Rime-giants;’</i> the Titans of the Scandin. mythology were so called, as opposed to and older than the common Jötnar (<i>Giants</i>), Vþm. 33, Hm. 109, Gm. 31, Skm. 34; hrímþursar ok bergrisar, Edda 10, 15, 25, 38.",
