      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrisungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrísungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a law term, a kind of <i>bastard, one begotten in the woods, but of a free mother,</i> N. G. L. i. 48, 228: in the Grágás, <i>a son born of a free woman, but begotten whilst she was a bondwoman;</i> he could not inherit, and, though called free born, had to be declared free personally (<i>pro formâ</i>), Grág. i. 178; cp. <i>rishöfde</i> in the old Swed. law. The heipt hrísungs = <i>stones,</i> Ýt. 19, refers to the tale of the Sons of Jormunrek, of which one (Erp) is in Hðm. called hornungr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a rout,</i> (cp. slang Engl. <i>row</i>), <i>struggle,</i> Fms. vi. 212, Fas. ii. 505.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to vex, distress, harass a person,</i> Fms. vi. 204 (v. l.), viii. 78, Th. 77: neut. <i>to struggle, wrestle,</i> hann kvaðsk af hafa lagt at rjá (sic), Grett. 146 A: freq. in mod. usage and with the <i>h</i>, Pass. 9. 9; hrjáð er holdið líka, Stef. Ól.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjoda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjóða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. hrauð, pl. hruðu, part. hroðinn:—<i>to strip, disable,</i> esp. a ship in a sea-fight; hann hrauð öll víkinga-skipin, Fms. i. 27; var þá hroðit þat skip stafna á meðal, 178; þau skip er þeir sjálfir ynni ok hryði af Ólafi konungi, ii. 303; hruðu þeir öll Dana skip þau er þeir fengu haldit, 314; hrauð Magnús konungr þat skip ok síðan hvárt at öðru, vi. 78, 84; þeir hruðu sum skipin Birkibeina, viii. 290; léttu þeir feðgar eigi fyrr en hroðit var skipit, Eg. 122.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjóðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [A. S. <i>hroder</i>], poët. one of <i>the heavens,</i> Edda (Gl.); whence <strong>hrjóðr-leika,</strong> u, f. <i>the sun,</i> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Old Engl. <i>royne</i> = <i>a scab; roynous, roynish</i> = <i>scabby</i> (Chaucer and Shaksp.); cp. also <i>ronyon</i>]:—<i>roughness,</i> Edda (Lauf.), and <strong>hrjónungr,</strong> m. <i>id.,</i> esp. from flaws in ice. The word, which is old, although not recorded in ancient writers, is interesting on account of its being akin to hraun, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjonn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjónn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>rough;</i> h. íshrufa, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjosa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjósa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "hraus, hrusu. subj. hrysi, a defect. strong verb: [A. S. <i>hreosan</i> = <i>to shake;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>rysja;</i> Swed. <i>rysa;</i> akin to hrista, q. v.]:—<i>to shudder;</i> ok hraus þeim mjök hugr við hánum, Grett. 78 new Ed.; ávallt hrýs mér hugr við er ek sé þik, Krók. 7 new Ed. (1866).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjóstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a rough place, barren rocky place,</i> Grág. ii. 282, Jb. 242.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjostugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjóstugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., mod. <strong>hrjóstrugr,</strong> <i>rough, barren,</i> Bs. i. 674.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrjóta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. hrýt, pl. hrjóta; pret. hraut, 2nd pers. hrauzt, pl. hrutu; subj. hryti; part. hrotinn:—<i>to rebound, fall, fly, be flung,</i> with the notion of shaking or violence; öxin hraut ór hendi honum, Nj. 28, Fs. 101; björg hrutu ór stað, Rb. 318; hrutu fyrir borð höfuð ok limir, Fms. i. 171; hraut upp hurðin, vi. 121; annarr hraut í sundr, <i>rent asunder,</i> Hkr. ii. 143; barrarnar hrutu í sundr, <i>were crushed,</i> Sturl. ii. 49; hamrar sprungu en hrutu steinar, Krosskv. 13; vápnin hrutu af upp af skallanum, <i>the swords rebounded from his skull,</i> without hurting him, Fms. xi. 132; förunautar hans hrutu frá, <i>they started back,</i> Fbr. 40; hann blæss í nafars-raufina ok hrjóta spænirnir upp móti honum, Edda 49; en þó hraut þat upp fyrir Þorgrími, at …, <i>that</i> (<i>word</i>) <i>broke forth from Th., he was heard to say, that …,</i> Grett. 120 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hrjufr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
