            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>hreof</i> = <i>scabby;</i> Engl. <i>rough</i>], <i>rough, rugged to the touch;</i> hrjúfr háls, Fas. iii. 37 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
