        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>hroðit,</strong> part. of a lost verb [= A. S. <i>hreôdan, to paint</i>], <i>painted, stained,</i> only found once, hroðit sigli, Skv. 3. 47; and in the compd gull-roðinn, q. v.",
            }
