        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [Engl. <i>roe;</i> Dan. <i>rogn;</i> Swed. <i>row</i>], <i>roe, spawn,</i> Sks. 48, Landn. 117 (as a nickname), freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
