          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hrogn-kelsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., proncd. <strong>hrokkelsi,</strong> <i>the cyclopterus, lump-sucker,</i> collectively; but the male fish is called rauðmagi, the female grámagi or grásleppa, Bjarn. (in a verse), freq. <strong>hrokkelsa-fjara,</strong> u, f. <i>catching lump-suckers on the beach.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
