        >
          hrolla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to shiver,</i> and metaph. <i>to shudder;</i> hrollir hugr minn, Fb. i. (in a verse); hroldi hotvetna, Am. 95; hrolla á hríslu, Fas. i. (in a verse), cp. Sól. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
