        >
          hroptr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a mythical name of Odin, perh. <i>the crier, prophet</i> (from hrópa), Gm. 8, Kormak, Vsp. 61, Ls. 45, Eb. 78 (in a verse), Hd. (Edda); prop. an appellative, as seen from the compds Rögna-hroptr, m. <i>the crier of the gods, the prophet</i> = <i>Odin,</i> Hm. 143; <strong>Hropta-týr,</strong> m. <i>the crying god</i> = <i>Odin,</i> Hm. 161, Gm. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
