        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., spelt <strong>hors,</strong> Stj. 178: [A. S. <i>hors;</i> Engl. <i>horse;</i> O. H. G. <i>hros;</i> Germ. <i>ross</i>]:—<i>a horse</i>, Hm. 70, Grág. i. 194, 432, 433, 599, Nj. 69, Sturl. iii. 227, Gþl. 190, Eb. 106, Fb. ii. 184, 313; stóð-h., <i>a stud-horse, steed;</i> mer-h., <i>a mare;</i> áburðar-h., <i>a hackney.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
