        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>hrôf;</i> Engl. <i>roof;</i> Dutch <i>roef</i>], <i>a shed under which ships are built</i> or <i>kept</i>, Ld. 34, 112, Grág. ii. 400, Landn. 30, Krók. 10 new Ed.; Þangbrands-hróf, Bs. i. 14; Stíganda-hróf, Fs. 28: in local names, <strong>Hróf-á, Hróf-berg</strong> (proncd. <strong>Hró-berg</strong>), Landn.",
            }
