        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. <i>hrôps</i> = κραυγή; North. E. and Scot. <i>roup,</i> a public auction, from <i>the calling out</i> of the articles]:—<i>cavilling, scurrility,</i> Korm. 162, Fms. iii. 154; hróp ok háðung, Band. 31 new Ed.; hróp ok róg, Ls. 4; þú ert allra manna hróp (<i>a laughing-stock</i>) ok reklingr, MS. 4. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
