        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. <i>hrôt</i> = στέγη, Matth. viii. 8, etc., = δωμα, ib. x. 27, Luke v. 19, xvii. 31]:—<i>a roof,</i> only in poetry; hjarta hrót, poët. <i>the ‘heart’s-roof,’ the breast,</i> Landn. (in a verse); hreggs hrót, <i>the ‘gale’s-roof,’ the sky;</i> leiptra hrót, <i>the ‘lightning-roof,’ the sky;</i> heims hrót, <i>the ‘world’s-roof,’ the heaven,</i> Lex. Poët. <strong>hrót-gandr,</strong> m. <i>‘roof-wolf,’ fire;</i> or <strong>hrót-garmr,</strong> m. <i>id.,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
