        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m., gen. hryggjar, pl. hryggir, [A. S. <i>hrycg;</i> Engl. <i>rigg, ridge</i> (but only in the metaph. sense); O. H. G. <i>hrucki;</i> Germ. <i>rücken;</i> Dan. <i>ryg;</i> Swed. <i>rygg</i>]:—<i>the back, spine, vertebrae dorsi,</i> in men and beasts, the spine of a fish being called dálkr, q. v.; and even used of serpents, orma-h., Vsp. 44, Fms. v. 157, vii. 208, Nj. 129, 155, Gþl. 459, Karl. 426, Bs. i. 354, ii. 167, Grett. 90, 112.",
            }
          }
