      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., proncd. húa, [Scot. <i>how;</i> O. H. G. <i>hûba;</i> Germ. <i>haube;</i> Dan. <i>hue</i>]:—<i>a hood, cap, bonnet;</i> húfa hlaðbúin, Fms. vii. 225; höttr né húfa, Sks. 290; bar kona vatn í húfu sinni, Bs. i. 461, Gísl. 24, Bs. ii. 21, Dipl. v. 18 (belonging to a priest’s dress), passim; stál-húfa, <i>a steel hood;</i> skott-húfa, <i>a tasseled cap;</i> koll-húfa, <i>a cowl</i> or <i>skull-cap;</i> nátt-húfa, <i>a night cap.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hufr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., an older form <strong>hófr,</strong> Fms. i. 176 (in a verse), as also in hófregin (q. v.), and in the phrase, eiga mikið í hófi (below):—<i>the hulk</i> or <i>hull</i> of a ship; hann þrífr upp fork ok rekr út í húfinn á skipi þeirra, hann færði forkinn í þann húf skipsins er seglit hafði ofan farit ok seglit hallaðisk áðr, Fær. 165; upp í naustið ok settu undir húfinn á skipi Orms, Ísl. ii. 81; kjöl eða stafna, húf eða hálsa, N. G. L. i. 100, freq. in Lex. Poët.; skeiðar-húfr, <i>a ship’s hull,</i> Arnór; stíga fyrir húf, <i>to go overboard,</i> Jd.; hafskips húfar, Fms. vi. (in a verse); héldir húfar, <i>the frosted ships,</i> Jd.; skörum hveldr húfr, Arnór; svelldr húfr; breið-húfaðr, <i>broad-hulled.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/huka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to sit on one’s hams,</i> Sturl. ii. 220, Mag. 64, Art.; see hokra.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fb. iii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., poët. <i>the sea,</i> from its dusky colour; salt húm, <i>the salt sea,</i> Lex. Poët., Edda (Gl.), also in poët. compds.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/huma-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to grow dusk;</i> var nú mjök húmat, Fas. iii. 223, 545; meðan lífs ei húmar húm, a ditty; see hýma.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hun-bogi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hún-bogi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a kind of <i>bow,</i> Sks. 408: a pr. name, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hun-bora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hún-bora
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the hole in the mast-head through which the halyard went;</i> vinda segl við húnboru, <i>to hoist the sail,</i> Fær. 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hun-dreginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hún-dreginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>hoisted to the top,</i> Sks. 394.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hun-kastali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hún-kastali
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the crow’s nest</i> or <i>‘castle’ at the mast-head,</i> Sks. 393, Fms. vii. 256, 262.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hun-spaenir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hún-spænir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>ornaments at the mast-head,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
