      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/huna-kappi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húna-kappi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the champion of the Huns,</i> the nickname of the mythical hero Hildebrand, Fas. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hunar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húnar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. (but also <strong>Hýnir</strong>), <i>the Huns,</i> and <strong>Húna-land, Hún-mörk,</strong> f. <i>the land of the Huns;</i> <strong>Húnlenzkr</strong> and <strong>Húnskr,</strong> adj. <i>Hunnish:</i> the words occur in several of the old poems, esp. Kormak, Akv., Hðm., Og., Gkv. 1, Hornklofi, but only in mythical songs or tales, Fas. passim; the word is derived from the Tartar Huns.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hunn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          húnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [Gr. κωνος], <i>a knob:</i> naut. <i>the knob at the top of the mast-head;</i> draga segl við hún, or í hún upp, or vinda upp segl við húna, <i>to hoist a sail to the top,</i> Ó. H. 17, Tríst. 8, Fas. iii. 410.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. renders οἰκία by <i>gards</i> and <i>razn,</i> and δωμα by <i>hrôt,</i> whereas <i>hûs</i> only occurs once in the compd gudhus = ἱερόν, John xviii. 20; in all other Teut. languages, old and new, <i>hûs</i> is the general word; A. S., O. H. G., Dan., and Swed. <i>hûs;</i> Engl. <i>house;</i> Germ. <i>haus;</i> Dutch <i>huys</i>]:—<i>a house;</i> hús eru þrjú í hvers manns híbýlum, … eitt er stofa, annat eldhús, þriðja búr, Grág. i. 459; leita nú um hvert hús á þeim bæ, 215, x. 270; þeir fara til bæjarins ok hlaupa þar inn í hús, Eg. 385; í næsta húsi, Ld. 318; af hverju húsi, <i>from every house,</i> Fms. x. 226; eitthvert mikit hús, Sks. 62; eitt fagrt hús, Fb. i. 467; at húsinu, nær dyrrum hússins, id.; bæn-hús, <i>a prayer-house, chapel;</i> söng-hús, <i>a choir;</i> eld-hús, fjós (fé-hús), hest-hús (qq. v.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-bak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-bak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = húsabak, Hðm. 32, Nj. 28, Sturl. i. 63.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-bondi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-bóndi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., pl. húsbændr; in mod. usage the æ is kept throughout the plural, but not so in old writers; húsbóndi is prop. a participle contracted from <strong>húsbóandi</strong> or <strong>húsbúandi;</strong> [see bóndi, p. 74, and búa, of which the older form is bóa, Dan. <i>boe,</i> p. 86; Engl. <i>husband;</i> Swed. <i>husbonde</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-bot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-bót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>house repairs,</i> Am. 110.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-brenna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-brenna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>house-burning, arson,</i> Grett. 103 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-brot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-brot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a law term, <i>house-breaking, burglary,</i> N. G. L. i. 38, Gþl. 345, H. E. i. 496: in pl. <i>ruins,</i> Ann. 1390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-bruni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-bruni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>house-burning,</i> Bs. i. 78, Rb. 572.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-bust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-bust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a house front.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-bunadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-búnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>hús-búningr,</strong> m. <i>house furniture,</i> esp. <i>hangings, tapestry,</i> Js. 78, Fms. vii. 148, Ó. H. 175, Eg. 94, Sturl. ii. 35, Fbr. 138, Vm. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hus-drapa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hús-drápa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. name of an old poem describing the mythical representation on the wall of an old hall, Ld. 114, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
