        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., <strong>hórvetna,</strong> Grág. ii. 282, Post. 686 B. 2, Fms. ii. 269; but usually, as also in mod. usage, though less correctly, <strong>hver-vetna,</strong> Nj. 32, Fms. vi. 16. 296, Karl. 534, and passim; [from hvar and vetna, a gen. pl. from an obsolete vetta = <i>wight</i>]:—<i>everywhere;</i> tók herr hans hvarvetna at láta undan siga, Fms. i. 174; hvarvetna milli steinanna, 230.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
