          href="/word/hvat-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>quick,</i> Fms. ix. 489, v. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>boldness, energy, alacrity, presence of mind,</i> Sturl. iii. 42, Fms. vi. 166, Sks. 59 new Ed.; h. ok áræði, Nj. 271; vitsmunir ok h., 262.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>quickly;</i> ríða h., Nj. 192, Sd. 156; búask h., Ísl. ii. 338; fara h., Rd. 277, Th. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>quick, brisk;</i> hvatlegt lið, <i>active troops,</i> Fms. xi. 33; verjask et hvatligsta, 142; hvatligt verk, <i>a manly feat</i>, x. 391.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-radr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-ráðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>headlong,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-raedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-ræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>quick action,</i> Glúm. 377.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-skeyti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-skeyti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>precipitancy,</i> Karl. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-skeytliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-skeytliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>precipitately,</i> Stj. 4, K. Á. 202, Fms. ii. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-skeytligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-skeytligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hurried, headlong,</i> K. Á. 202.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-vetna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-vetna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>hvat-vitna,</strong> pron. used as subst. (hvetvetna is a false form), in old MSS. often spelt <strong>hótvitna,</strong> Hm. 47, Am. 67, 95, Skm. 28, Niðrst. 6, Fms. xi. 36, 68, 78, 122; [from hvat and vetna, q. v.]:—<i>anything whatever;</i> vex þér hvatvetna í augu, Nj. 53; h. íllt, Fms. vi. 283; þér látið honum h. hlýða, Eg. 71; hann kvaðsk h. mundu til vinna, Fs. 59; eigi eru búar skyldir at bera um hvatvetna, Grág. i. 167; h. var upp brotið, Fms. vi. 381; hvatvetna þar nokkvat es, Greg. 12; Guð leysir hótvetna, Niðrst. 6; fyr hótvetna fram, <i>above all,</i> Fms. xi. 68.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-visi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-vísi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>temerity,</i> Fms. vi. 8, vii. 124, xi. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-visliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-vísliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>recklessly, rashly,</i> Fms. ii. 33, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvat-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvat-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>headlong, reckless, foolhardy,</i> Hkr. iii. 225, Fms. ii. 211, xi. 12, 75, Bjarn. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvata
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to make speed, hasten</i> with a thing, with dat.; hvata för sinni, h. ferðinni, <i>to hasten one’s journey,</i> 655 iii. 3, Fms. iv. 144; hvata göngunni, <i>to quicken one’s pace,</i> Edda 7; h. þessu, Lv. 20; h. báli, <i>make speed with the bale-fire,</i> Fms. x. 379: absol. <i>to hasten, speed,</i> hann eggjar at menn skulu hvata, Fær. 262; hvata til skipa, Eg. 357; hvata heim, Ísl. ii. 387; h. í brott, Rd. 16: with prep., hvata at e-u, <i>to make haste with a thing,</i> Hkr. i. 103.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvata-buss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvata-buss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-bussi</strong>), m. <i>a busybody,</i> Fbr. 191, v. 1.; gættú hans þá, Þórarinn, at hann komizk eigi í brott, ok ertú jafnan hvatabuss mikill, Fms. iv. 266.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvata-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvata-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an instigator,</i> Ld. 240, Fms. xi. 263.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvatan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvatan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an urging on, pushing on,</i> Skv. I. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvati"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvati
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>hurry,</i> Mork. 110.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvatki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvatki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pron. indef. [see -gi, p. 199]:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvatr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvatr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., fem. hvöt, neut. hvatt, <i>bold, active, vigorous;</i> in the saying, engi er einna hvatastr, Hm. 63; h. maðr, Fms. vii. 160, Fm. 6. 24, 30, 31; ef engi hefði verit hvatari höfðingi í her þessum en þú, Fms. vi. 160; hvatr hugr, Fm. 26: acc. as adv., ríða hvatan, <i>to ride at a quick pace,</i> Ld. 260: neut. hvatt, <i>id</i>.; ríða hvatt, Fb. ii. 125, Sighvat; hann bað menn sína fara sem hvatast, Eg. 217.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvatt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvatt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [hvetja], a c <i>ut</i> or <i>mark</i> on a sheep’s ear, a slice cut off one side of the ear; hvatt framan, aptan hægra, vinstra; whence <strong>hvat-rifað,</strong> n. adj. a hvat <i>with a rift:</i> when the slice is cut on both sides of the ear so as to make it like a spear’s point, it is called fjöður, <i>a feather.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvatta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvattá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. or interj. = hvatþá, <i>what! what then!</i> Fms. xi. 118; hvattá! láttú góðra gjalda vert ef þú kömsk með fjörvi á braut, Mork. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvaz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvaz
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pron. = hvat es, <i>whatsoever;</i> see hvat (II), and er, p. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to say what!</i> (<strong>há,</strong> q. v., <i>eh</i>), of one not hearing; eins og ganti roðið hvert við hváði, Snót 214.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvada-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hváða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., not kváða, [Ulf. <i>hwaþo</i> = ἀφρός, Luke ix. 39, and <i>hwaþjan</i> = <i>to froth</i>]:<i>—glue, lime, resin,</i> esp. from trees, freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvalf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hválf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. form <strong>hólf,</strong> [A. S. <i>hwealf</i>], <i>a vault</i>, Bs. i. 177, Sks. 633, Al. 89; gufu-hvolf, or dampa-h., ‘<i>steam-vault</i>,’ <i>the atmosphere</i>, (mod.): of <i>the concavity</i> of a shield, Boll. 340; vera á hválfi, <i>keel uppermost,</i> of a boat or vessel; see hólf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvalfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hválfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, in old writers spelt <strong>hólfa</strong> or <strong>hölfa;</strong> but <strong>hvolfa</strong> is the mod. form:—<i>to turn vpside down,</i> keel uppermost; sjá at þar hólfir skip á sjónum, Fb. ii. 223, as also Hb. l. c., Fbr. 103 new Ed.; þar hvolfði skip, Njarð. 376 (paper MS.); hóf upp knörr ok sneri á lopti ok kom hólfandi niðr, Bs. i. 30; ok hugðu nú mundu fullkomlega yfir hólfa, <i>it would be overwhelmed,</i> 769.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hváll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., mod. <strong>hvoll,</strong> [akin to Gr. κύκλος; also akin to hvel, hválf, prop. denoting what is <i>convex,</i> cp. Germ. <i>hägel</i>]:<i>—a hill;</i> not much used, hóll (q. v.) being the common word; but it is still used of a ‘dome-shaped’ hill; and in local names of farms lying under such hills, as Hváll in Saurbær in the west, Berg-þórs-hváll and Stórólfs-hváll in the south, Beigaðar-hváll in the north, Landn.; Kálfs-hváll in the east, Dropl.; Orrostu-hváll, Eg.: <strong>Hváls-maðr,</strong> m. a <i>man from H.,</i> Sturl.; þeir stefna upp á hválinn, Nj. 69; dalr var í hválinum ok riðu þeir þangat, 197; vér vildum á hválinn ok kómumk ekki, Dropl. 22; hvála eðr hálsa, Róm. 315.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvama"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hváma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>hvoma</strong>), að, <i>to swallow, devour.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvamr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvámr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>hvomr</strong>), m. <i>a glutton.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvaptr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hváptr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., mod. <strong>hvoptr,</strong> <i>the cheek,</i> Lat. <i>bucca;</i> kemr á kinnina ok í hváptinn, Ísl. ii. 399; mér renna hróðrmál um hvápta, Húsd.; úrakaða hváptana, Orkn. 288, Fb. i. 395: <i>the mouth</i>, <i>gape</i>, Lat. <i>rictus</i>, of a beast, 416, 417, 530, Sks. 52, 53 new Ed.: the phrase, gott er at hafa tvá hváptana ok sitt með hverjum mæla, Fas. ii. 429, Þorst. S. St. 51; cp. kjaptr or kjöptr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvargin-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárgin-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>neuter,</i> Skálda 185.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvarigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., mod. <strong>hvorugr,</strong> <i>either</i>, <i>each</i>; see hvárrgi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvarki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see hvárrgi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pron. interrog. and indef., contr. from <strong>hvaðarr,</strong> which is obsolete, but occurs thrice in poets of the 10th century, Kormak, Fas. i. 297 (in a verse), Hkr. i. 205 (in a verse): mod. form <strong>hvorr,</strong> still so proncd. in the south of Icel.: [Goth. <i>hwaþar;</i> A. S. <i>hwæðer,</i> cp. Engl. <i>whether;</i> Hel. <i>hweðar,</i> cp. Germ. <i>weder</i>]:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvarr-tveggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárr-tveggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>hvárr-tveggja</strong>; an older form, <strong>hvaðar-tveggi,</strong> occurs in Hkr. i. 205 (in a verse), and acc. m. hvaðran-tveggja, Korm. 224 (middle of the 10th century).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvarrgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárrgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>hvárgi,</strong> pron. indef.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvarz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvárz
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= hvárts, = hvárt es, = hvárt er, pron. neut. from hvarr, q. v., either, used adverbially; hvárz … eðr, <i>either … or;</i> hvártz hann hefir farit til þessa eðr eigi, Grág. i. 48; h. er til sóknar eða varnar, 56; hvárz þeir eru bændr eðr griðmenn, 57; hvárz hverfa til lofs eðr löstnnar, Greg. 10; hvárz verit hafa góð eðr íll; hvárz hann er lærðr eðr úlærðr, h. hann svimr á sjó eðr vatni, Hom. (St.) passim: adding a superfluous sem, hvártz sem maðr verðr sekr at sátt eðr á várþingi, Grág. i. 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hve"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hve
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., <strong>hvei,</strong> Gþl. 495 A; the vowel was prob., as in all similar monosyllables, sounded long, qs. hvé; prop. an old instrumental case from hvat: [Ulf. <i>hwaiva</i>; A. S. <i>hwu</i>; Engl. <i>how</i>; Germ. <i>wie</i>; Swed. <i>huru</i>; Dan. <i>hvor-ledes</i>]:—<i>how</i>, interrog.; ok freista hve þá hlýddi, Ib. 7; bera vætti, hve fyrir sekð hans var mælt, Grág. i. 83; hve for með þeim, Ísl. ii. 341; kveða á, hve þing heitir, Grág. i. 100 (see heita A. II); hve þú heitir, <i>how art thou named?</i> hve margir, <i>how many?</i> Ld. 74; hve mjök, <i>how much?</i> Nj. 24; hve mikill? Fms. vi. 286, Þiðr. 273, Hom. 35; þeir vissu eigi, hve fram var (mod. hvað framorðið var), <i>they knew not the time</i>, of the day, K. Þ. K. 90; spurði, hve gamall maðr hann væri, Ld. 74; þat var með miklum úlíkindum hve (<i>how violent</i>) stormr var eðr snæfall, Finnb. 312: hve nær, <i>when?</i>; Stj. 339, Fb. ii. 394, Nj. 142, Hom. 9, passim; but see hvenar below.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
