          hvelja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [hvalr, cp. Engl. wheal], the skin of a cyclopterus or whale, etc.: in pl. the metaph. súpa hveljur, <i>to sup on</i> hveljur, i. e. <i>to lose the breath</i>, <i>to gasp as when about half drowned</i>; ekki þurfti hann Oddr staup, hann ýmist sökk eða hveljur saup, Stef. 01.",
            }
