          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>hvenær,</strong> spelt <strong>hvenar</strong> in Dropl. 20, 21, and proncd. so at the present day; [hvenar seems to be the true form, as the word is prob. derived not from hve and nær, but is like Engl. <i>when-e’er</i>, from Goth. hwan = ποτέ; A. S. <i>hwænne</i>; Engl. <i>when</i>; Hel. <i>huan</i>; Germ. <i>wann</i>]:—<i>when</i>, Nj. 142, Ld. 204, Grág. i. 103, 350, passim.",
            }
