          href="/word/hverfa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. hvarf, pl. hurfu; subj. hyrfi; part, horfinn; in mod. pronunciation inserting the v throughout, hvurfu, hvyrfi, hvorfinn; akin to horfa, q. v.: [Ulf. <i>hwairban</i> = περιπατειν; A. S. <i>hweorfan</i>; O. H. G. <i>hwerban</i>; Germ. <i>werben</i>]:—<i>to turn round</i>; hverfanda hvel, Hm. 73 (see hvel); nú mátt þú engi veg þess hverfa (<i>thou canst turn to no side</i>) at Guðs miskunn sé ekki fyrir þér, Hom. 156; h. í móðurátt, föðurátt, <i>to devolve upon</i>, <i>of right or duty</i>, Grág. i. 177, 237; hafa horfit í Guðdóm, 625. 59; hverfa af lífi, <i>to depart from life, die</i>, Stor. 10: with acc. of place, himin hverfa þau skulu hverjan dag, <i>they shall pass round the heaven every day</i>, of the sun and moon, Vþm. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cluster of farms,</i> such as almost to form <i>a village,</i> freq. in Icel. local names, Fiskilækjar-hverfi, Skóga-h., Rangár-h., Ingólfshöfða-h., Fljóts-h., Landn.: metaph., vizku-h., <i>the abode of wisdom</i> = <i>the breast,</i> Fbr. (in a verse); tanna-h., <i>the</i> ‘<i>tooth-abode</i>,’ i. e. <i>the mouth,</i> Kristni S. (in a verse): <i>a shelter,</i> verða e-m at hverfi, Sturl. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfi-legr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfi-legr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ugly,</i> Nj. 147, v. 1.; whence mod. herfilegr (-liga), q. v., <i>wretched, miserable.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfi-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfi-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a grindstone,</i> Vm. 177.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>turning,</i> in sjón-h., <i>eye-deceit, glamour.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a froward person,</i> Post. 201.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shifty</i>; hverf haustgríma, Hm. 73; hverfr hugr, <i>a shifty mind</i>, Sol. 31: <i>crank,</i> of a ship, freq. in mod. usage: also in the phrase, stýra hverft, <i>to steer wrong.</i> Fas. ii. 178.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverfull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverfull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shifty, changeable,</i> of things, Barl. 32, 97; ú-hverfull, <i>not shifty, abiding firm,</i> <strong>hverfull-leiki,</strong> a, m. <i>shiftiness,</i> freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvergi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvergi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> pron., see hverrgi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., see hverrgi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvern"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvern
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>hvörn,</strong> f. [proncd. <strong>kvörn</strong> or <strong>kvern,</strong> but distinction is to be made between kvern, <i>mola</i>, and hvern, <i>cerebrum;</i> for in the latter word <i>h</i> is the true initial, as is shewn by comparison with Ulf. <i>hwairnei</i> = κρανίον, Mark xv. 22; Scot. <i>harns;</i> Germ. <i>hirn;</i> Swed. <i>hjerna;</i> Dan. <i>hjerne,</i> which stand in the same relation to hvern as hjól to hvel]:—<i>the two boat-formed white bones</i> embedded in a fish’s brains. These bones, as well as shells, are in Icel. collected and used by children in the game of guessing, as nuts etc. are in England; hann lauk þá upp höfuðskeljum mannanna, og tók hnefa-fylli úr hverju höfði og hugði vandliga að; eintómar hvarnir, og ekki nema tvær í þorsk-kindinni, Fjölnir (1845) 52. <strong>hvarnar-skeljar,</strong> f. pl. = hvarnir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [hverr, m.], a <i>pan, basin,</i> Nikd. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvernig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvernig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "qs. hvernveg, [see hverr], interrog. direct and indirect; the forms vary, <strong>hverneg</strong> or <strong>hvernig,</strong> Eg. 19 A, 106, 123, 292, 394, Hkr. i. 170, 287, Korm. 130, 148, Glúm. 327, Band. 18 new Ed., passim: <strong>hvernog</strong> or <strong>hvernug,</strong> Orkn. 83 (v. 1.), Hkr. i. 120, 347, Al. 63, 65, and passim in old MSS.: the mod. form is <strong>hvernin,</strong> proncd. <strong>hvurinn</strong> or kvurninn, qs. hvernveginn, from vegr with the article, which form is also now and then found in old MSS., Fs. 105 (MS. Arna-Magn. 132), Bs. Hungrv. passim, as also later MSS.:—<i>how</i>? <i>in what way?</i> the references passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m., pl. hverar:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hverrgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hverrgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>hvergi,</strong> indef. pron. <i>each, every,</i> Lat. <i>unusquisque.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvers-dagliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvers-dagliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>every day,</i> Fms. ix. 267, 384, Skálda 199, Eb. 32, 258, Gullþ. 20, Jb. 33, Eg. 598, Ld. 22, of week days.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvers-dagligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvers-dagligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>daily, every day,</i> Gþl. 42, Greg. 42, 625. 178; h. hættir, Bs. i. 164; h. búningr, <i>a dress to be used on week days,</i> K. Þ. K. 82, Vm. 46; h. maðr, Nj. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvers-dags"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvers-dags-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. pronunciation <strong>hvundags,</strong> <i>every day</i>: in compds, <strong>hversdags-búningr,</strong> m. (<strong>-föt,</strong> n. pl.), <i>one’s every-day dress, work-a-day clothes,</i> K. Þ. K. 140: <strong>hversdags-hökull,</strong> m., -<strong>klæði,</strong> n., Vm. 52, Grág. i. 323: <strong>-leika,</strong> n., Sturl. iii. 127; <strong>-maðr,</strong> m., Nj.: in mod. usage, <strong>hvundags,</strong> <strong>-búningr,</strong> <strong>-föt,</strong> etc., Vm. 38; opp. to spari-föt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvers-konar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvers-konar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>of every kind,</i> Hom. 87, 91, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvers-kyndis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvers-kyndis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= hverskyns, Thom. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvers-kyns"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvers-kyns
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= hverskonar, Fms. x. 379, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hversu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hversu
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., proncd. hvursu, (<strong>hversug,</strong> N. G. L. i. 27, 91, qs. hvers-veg, <i>what way</i>, = hve):—<i>how</i>, Nj. 2, 68, Al. 10, Fms. x. 404, Ísl. ii. 364, N. G. L. i. 91, Hom. 103, passim; for hversu is the common word, whereas hve is obsolete.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hversu-gi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hversu-gi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>howsoever,</i> = hvegi, q. v.; with the particle sem or er, Fms. viii. 59; h. mikit fé er þeir gefa með sér, Grág. i. 223; h. margar sem fígúrur eru, Alg. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvert"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvert
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "proncd. hvurt, neut. sing. of hverr, used as adv. <i>whither,</i> Germ. <i>wohin</i>, interrog.; Gunnarr sagði þeim hvert hann ætlaði, Nj. 76; Jarl spurði hvert hann færi þaðan, 132; gera ráð hvert hann sneri þaðan, Fms. v. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvertki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvertki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>whithersoever;</i> h. sem hann fór, Greg. 53, Þjal. 351.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvessa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvessa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [hvass], <i>to sharpen;</i> hvessa ok hvetja, Fms. vii. 37; hvessa sýn, Pr. 474; h. augu, <i>to look with a piercing glance,</i> Hkv. I. 6, Edda 36, Eg. 44, 457, Fms. ii. 174, vii. 172: <i>to make keen for a thing, encourage,</i> Al. 33, Fms. vii. 37, Bs. i. 750: of weather, <i>to blow keenly, blow up a gale,</i> impers., veðr (acc.) tók at hvessa mjök, Ld. 326; hvesti veðrit, Fms. ix. 21; þá hvessti svá, at …, 387, freq.; það er farit að hvessa, það fer að hvessa, <i>it ‘fares to blow sharp.’</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvessir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvessir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wbetter, sharpener,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvesta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvesta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = þvesti (q. v.), Vm. 79.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvet-vetna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvet-vetna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = hvatvetna, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvetja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvetja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "hvatti, hvatt, pres. hvet, part. hvattr, Gh. 6; a middle form hvöttomc, Hom. 29; [A. S. <i>hwettgan;</i> Engl. <i>whet;</i> Germ. <i>wetzen;</i> cp. hvass]:—<i>to whet, sharpen</i> a cutting instrument; h. sverð, Kormak; h. spjót, Fb. i. 189; Skarphéðinn hvatti öxi, Nj. 66, Fs. 72, Landn. 293; h. gadd, Stj. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hviða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [A. S. <i>hwiða</i>], <i>a squall</i> of wind, Ld. 326, freq.: medic. <i>a fit;</i> hósta-h., <i>a fit of coughing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvidudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hviðuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘squatter,’</i> poët. <i>the wind,</i> Aim. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvik"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvik
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>hik,</strong> <i>a quaking, wavering.</i>",
