          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvirfings-drykkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a drinking bout,</i> a kind of <i>club</i> in Norway in olden times as opposed to the later gildi, q. v.; hann kvað þá engar veizlur hafa haft þat haust nema gildi sín ok hvirfings-drykkjur, Hkr. ii. 165; Ólafr konungr (who died A. D. 1193) lét setja Mikla-gildi í Níðarósi, en áðr vóru þar hvirfingsdrykkjur, Fms. vi. 440.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
