        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. interrog. [Ulf. <i>hweileiks</i>; A. <i>S. hwylc; Engl. which;</i> Early Engl. and Scot. <i>while, whilk</i>]:<i>—what like?</i> (as still used in North. E. for <i>of what kind?</i>), Lat. <i>qualis,</i> Fms. ii. 220, v. 302, Nj. 269, passim in old and mod. usage.",
            }
