        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rest</i>, <i>repose,</i> Nj. 43, Eg. 492, Fms. v. 307, vi. 420, vii. 193, Sks. 235, Stj. 613, passim: <i>pause,</i> Nj. 248; í hvíld, <i>in baiting, in rest,</i> Hbl. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
