        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a day of rest,</i> Magn. 502: esp. eccl. <i>the Sabbath,</i> halda skaltú helgan hvíldar-daginn Drottins Guðs þíns, the Fourth Commandment, Stj., Vidal. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvildar-hestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
