      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvonn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvönn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. hvannar, pl. hvannir, [Norse <i>kvanne</i>], <i>angelica, archangelica L.,</i> Grág. ii. 348, Fms. ii. 244, Fbr. 87, 88: wild angelica being common in Icel., the word is freq. in local names, <strong>Hvann-á,</strong> <strong>Hvann-eyri,</strong> <strong>Hvann-dalr,</strong> Landn. In olden times the angelica seems to have been much used to give flavour to ale; see jóll.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvöt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. hvatar, pl. hvatir, <i>instigation, impulse,</i> Al. 119, passim, as also in mod. usage, fram-hvöt, q. v.: <i>alacrity,</i> Lex. Poët.: names of poems, Guðrunar-hvöt, Sæm.; <strong>Húskarla-hvöt,</strong> Ó. H.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvotudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvötuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an instigator, author,</i> Lex. Poët. chiefly in poët. compds.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/hvotun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hvötun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = hvatan.",
            }
