        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [<i>hykjel,</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>a ‘hough,’</i> or <i>hind-leg,</i> of a hide; flá af heming fyrir ofan hækilinn, N. G. L. i. 209: freq. in mod. usage, but only of a skin: a nickname, Fms. ix.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
