        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>hœna</strong>), u, f. [hani, formed on the same analogy as dal and dæl, hag and hóg]:—<i>a hen,</i> Al. 160, Fms. vii. 116, Fs. 156, Stj. 3, passim: in pr. names, Lopt-hana, Skálp-h., Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
