        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., older and better <strong>hæingr,</strong> m. <i>a male salmon,</i> called <i>hungell</i> in Shetl., Edda (Gl.), Fb. ii. 520 (in a verse) spelt hængs, Fas. ii. 112, freq. in mod. usage: a nickname, Landn.",
            }
