      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/haens"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          hæns
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>hœns</strong>), n. pl., mod. <strong>hænsn</strong> or <strong>hænsni,</strong> also spelt <strong>hæsn,</strong> K. Þ. K. 34 new Ed., Hkr. iii. 62; [Dan.-Swed. <i>höns</i>]:—<i>hens, fowls, poultry,</i> Bret. 32, K. Á. 196, Ísl. ii. 124, Karl. 472, Rétt. 70, passim; Hænsa-Þórir, <i>Thorir the poulterer,</i> a nickname, Ísl. ii, whence the name of the Saga.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
