        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a hoary man;</i> svá öttum vér hæringinum nú at hann lá eptir, referring to the death of earl Erling, Fms. viii. 104, v. l.:—a pr. name, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
