        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dangerous, serious,</i> Fær. 263, Fms. viii. 98, ix. 291, xi. 367, Bs. i. 536, 766, Edda 36, Stj. 604; þá er ok hættligt, <i>‘tis to be feared,</i> 686 B. 5; í hættligra lagi, <i>in a dangerous case,</i> Lv. 86:—medic. = hættr, kölluðu hættligan mátt hans, <i>they said that he was sinking fast,</i> Fms. ix. 390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
