          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., poët. <i>‘kid’s food,’ a withe</i> or <i>switch,</i> used as <i>a halter</i> (?), Ýt. 12 (from goats feeding on branches and withes?)",
            }
