        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/id"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. <i>a restless motion;</i> vera allr á iði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/id-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., the gen. iðjar, Hkr. ii. 227, points to a root <i>iði;</i> [this root word with derivatives, which in cognate languages is of rare occurrence, seems prop. to mean <i>a perpetual motion,</i> cp. Swed. and poët. Dan. <i>id</i>]:—<i>a doing;</i> orð ok iðir, <i>words and deeds,</i> Nj. (in a verse); ymissar iðir, Sighvat; leyfð ið, id.; tregnar iðir, <i>sorrows, tears,</i> Hðm. 1; þjóð veit þínar iðir, <i>thy feats,</i> Edda (in a verse); því verðr eigi til iðjar né verðs haldit, <i>it can neither be worked nor sold,</i> Hkr. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/id-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ið-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>iðja-,</strong> Vsp. 58), a particle only used in compds, chiefly poetical, answering to Goth. <i>iþ-,</i> = Lat. <i>contra,</i> O. H. G. <i>id-</i> and <i>ida-,</i> A. S. <i>ed-,</i> = Lat. <i>re-;</i> but in Icel. esp. in an intensive sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/id-gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ið-gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>eager for.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/id-gjold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ið-gjöld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>recompense;</i> íll iðgjöld, Hm. 106; sonar iðgjöld, Stor. 16; iðgjöld e-s, of one dead, Fs. 13, 61; en þat kom ásamt með mönnum, at hans þóttusk aldrei iðgjöld fá, Bs. i. 70; höfum vér þá nokkut svá iðgjöld föður þíns, Ísl. ii. 175.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
