          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          iðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl.; [this word cannot be derived from inn (<i>ð</i> = <i>nn</i>), for even the Gothic <i>idreiga</i> and <i>idreigon</i> have the <i>d;</i> O. H. G. <i>in-adiri;</i> the word is prob., as suggested by Grimm, akin to Germ. <i>ader,</i> Icel. æðr (<i>a vein</i>)]:—<i>the bowels, entrails</i> (see <i>innyfli</i>), Grág. ii. 371, Bs. i. 346, Orkn. 458, Landn. 217, Ld. 222, Gullþ. 23, Fbr. 208, Fms. iii. 77, viii. 326; iðr ok innyfli, Stj. 280, Post. 238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
