        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, usually dep. <strong>iðrask,</strong> [Ulf. <i>idreigon</i> = μετανοειν]:—<i>to be moved inwardly</i> (from iðr), but only used metaph. like Gr. σπλαγχνίζομαι, <i>to repent:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
