        >
          ilma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, (<strong>irma,</strong> Sks. 633 B), <i>to smell sweet;</i> þú ilmir alla, Hom. 153; ilmdi allskonar sætum grösum, Str. 69: <i>to scent,</i> þeir megu eigi ilma af aldininu, Rb. 346; þefja ok ilma, Anecd. 4: part. <strong>ilmandi,</strong> <i>sweet-smelling,</i> ilma grös, Sks. 48, 633, passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
