          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          inni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adv. <i>in-doors,</i> denoting remaining in a place; bæinn ok lið þat allt er inni var, Fms. i. 12, Fs. 42; úti eðr inni, Grág. ii. 19, Eg. 407; brenna inni, <i>to be burnt to death in a house,</i> Nj. 285: <i>in one’s house,</i> ef göngumaðr verðr dauðr inni at manns, Grág. i. 191; hafa brullaup, veizlu inni, <i>to hold a wedding, a feast at one’s home,</i> 333; hafa boð inni, <i>id.,</i> Nj. 24, 152.",
            }
          }
        />
