            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ithrotta-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          íþrótta-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man skilled in exercises,</i> Fms. i. 17, Eg. 199, Finnb. 336; í. ok vitr, Bret. 8; haun görðisk enn mesti íðróttamaðr (<i>master</i>) í þess-konar námi (viz. in grammar), Bs. i. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jadar-flar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaðar-flár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>loose in the edge,</i> of stuff, Grág. i. 498.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jadar-skegg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaðar-skegg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>whiskers,</i> Sks. 288, (recorded as a German fashion.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jadarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaðarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. jaðri, pl. jaðrar; a form <strong>jöðurr</strong> (as vaðall and vöðull) occurs in Vsp. 5: [A. S. and Hel. <i>edor</i> = <i>septum;</i> provinc. Bavarian <i>ettor,</i> Schmeller]:—<i>the edge, selvage,</i> of cloth, Grág. i. 408, Nj. 176, v. l.; of a tent, Stj. 307, Str. 40: of a sail, Mag.: of <i>the limb</i> of the moon, Rb. 34: <i>the edge-beam</i> or <i>rail</i> of a paling, sá garðr er gildr, er öln er á meðal staurs hvers, en hjástaurr enn þriði, ok jaðarr er yfir, N. G. L. i. 246: poët., himin-jöður, <i>the ‘sky-border,’ horizon,</i> Vsp.; ský-jaðarr, <i>‘cloud-border,’ the heaven,</i> Geisli 2; sólar-jaðarr, <i>id.: the edge</i> of the hand (handar-jaðarr), Edda 110: <i>the border</i> along the shore, með Blálands jaðri, Lex. Poët.; fróns jaðarr, id.; Eylands jaðarr = <i>ora maritima,</i> Merl. 2. 5: whence a local name of the Norse district, <strong>Jaðarr,</strong> m. <i>Jæderen;</i> also <strong>Jaðar-byggð,</strong> f., and <strong>Jaðar-byggjar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the men of the country J.,</i> Fb., Fms. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jadra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to brim, border;</i> jaðraðr, part. <i>bordered,</i> Gþl. 308.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jadrakan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaðrakan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a kind of Icel. <i>bird, numenius:</i> mod. <strong>jarðreka,</strong> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., also spelt jamn, f. jöfn, neut. jafnt, often spelt as well as proncd. jamt; compar. jafnari, superl. jafnastr: [Ulf. <i>ibns,</i> Luke vi. 17; A. S. <i>efen;</i> Engl. and Dutch <i>even;</i> old Fr. <i>ivin;</i> O. H. G. <i>eban;</i> mod. Germ. <i>eben;</i> Dan. <i>jevn;</i> Swed. <i>jemn;</i> akin to Lat. <i>aequus</i> by interchange of palatal and labial, see Grimm’s Dict. s. v. eben]:—<i>even, equal,</i> but, like Lat. <i>aequus,</i> mostly in a metaph. sense, for sléttr (q. v.) answers to Lat. <i>planus;</i> often followed by a dat., jafn e-u, <i>equal to a thing,</i> in comparison:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [O. H. G. <i>epani;</i> Germ. <i>ebene</i>], <i>level ground, a plain,</i> Lat. <i>planities;</i> hann flýði af hálsinum ofan á jöfnu, Hkr. i. 151; er þar þriggja mílna för af jöfnu til þorpsins, Greg. 80; koma niðr á jöfnu, Stj. 380, Róm. 272.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafna-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <strong>jamna,</strong> [Ulf. <i>ga-ibnjan:</i> cp. jafn], <i>to make even,</i> but seldom in its original sense, see slétta: <i>to cut even,</i> Katla lék at hafri sínum ok jafnaði topp hans ok skegg, Eb. 94; mörum sínum mön jafnaði, Þkv. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafna-brodir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafna-bróðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = jafni, Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafna-kollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafna-kollr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, from hair as dyed (?), Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-bod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-boð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fair offer,</i> Fas. ii. 444.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a law term, <i>arbitrium;</i> leggja mál til jafnaðardóms, <i>to put a case for an umpire,</i> Nj. 101; tvennir kostir …, bjóða Þórgilsi jafnaðardóm, ok mundi hann svara fégjöldum eptir því sem dómr félli á, sá annarr at unna Þorgils sjálfdæmis, Sturl. iii. 170 (where jafnaðardómr is opp. to sjálfdæmi), Sks. 736.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-eidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-eiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a law term, Gþl. 199; for this word see eiðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-fundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-fundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a meeting for making an agreement,</i> Sturl. ii. 134.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-ged"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-geð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an even temper,</i> Sks. 448.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-gjof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-gjöf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a law term, <i>an equal gift, equal portion;</i> gaf hann henni tuttugu hundruð af sínu gózi, ok reiknaði þat j. við Halldóru dóttur sína, Dipl. iv. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-hlutskipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-hlutskipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an equal share, equal portion,</i> Dipl. v. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-hond"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-hönd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f.; leggja e-t undir jafnaðarhönd, <i>to share a thing in common,</i> N. G. L. i. 220.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-kaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-kaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an equal bargain,</i> Ld. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-leiga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-leiga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a fair rent,</i> Jb. 392.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an equal match;</i> taka sér jafnaðarmenn, Fms. vii. 119, Band. 37 new Ed.: as a law term, <i>an umpire,</i> Fms. ix. 327: <i>a fair, forbearing man,</i> vizkumaðr mikill ok jafnaðarmaðr, x. 170; ofsa-maðr mikill ok ekki j. (<i>overbearing</i>), Sturl. ii. 143; lítill j., Fb. i. 520; jarl þótti engi j., Orkn. 44.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-mali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-máli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a law term, <i>an agreement,</i> Dipl. iv. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-semi,</strong> f.), <i>fair,</i> Sturl. ii. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-skipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-skipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>fair dealing,</i> Grett. 105 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadar-thokki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðar-þokki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>mutual affection;</i> j. er á með ykkr, <i>ye love one another,</i> Korm. 26, Grett. 162 A, Fas. i. 176.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. and <strong>jöfnuðr,</strong> gen. ar, [Ulf. <i>ibnassus</i> = ισότης], <i>an equal share;</i> en þaðan af höfum vit jafnað af báðir, Hrafn, 17; slíkt sem honum sýndisk jöfnuðr milli þeirra, Fms. xi. 87; skyldi fimm tigir hundraða í jafnað Sigríðar, Dipl. v. 3; í jafnað við þat góz, sem …, id.; at jafnaði, <i>in equal proportion;</i> eiga e-t at jafnaði, Grág. ii. 72; skipta e-u at jafnaði, i. 442, Fms. xi. 401, Fb. ii. 55, 256: in temp. sense, <i>usually,</i> ekki að jafnaði, Fas. iii. 226, Mar.; með jafnaði, <i>id.,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>jamnan,</strong> adv. <i>constantly, always,</i> Fms. ii. 37, Barl. 78; sem þú sagðir jafnan, <i>as thou didst say always,</i> Nj. 17; næsta jafnan, Sks. 18; æ jamnan, <i>ever and ever,</i> Sks. 193 B, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> a, m. <i>an equal, a match for one:</i> of a thing, mæl til jafna (= til jafna) við e-n, Fb. i. 250: mathem. <i>an even number,</i> í odda en eigi í jafna, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafnindr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafnindr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>jamyndir menn</strong>), prop. a part. pl., a law term, <i>‘day’s men,’ umpires;</i> in Norse law, these day’s men served as a kind of neighbours or jurors in matter of compensation; bæta … sem jamyndir menn (as adj.) meta, N. G. L. i. 75; en ef hins verðr lóð, er lög festi fyrir, þá skolu jamnyndir menn meta, hve mikit hann neytti til laga stefnu, 248; bæta munda-baugi, sem jafnendr unno, þeir er okkr vilja sætta, Hbl. 42, analogous to the Icel. law phrases, sem búar meta, of the Grágás.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jafningi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jafningi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an equal, a match,</i> Nj. 29, Fms. vi. 104, xi. 76: the saying, æ kemr maðr manns í stað, en ei jafningi jafnan, passim: in Þiðr. and Karl. <i>the peers</i> of Charlemagne are called jafningjar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a quarrel, squabble,</i> Lat. <i>rixa.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jaga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [O. H. G. <i>jagon;</i> mid. H. G. <i>jage;</i> Germ. <i>jagen;</i> whence mod. Dan. <i>jagen,</i> pret. <i>jog</i> = <i>to drive,</i> whence <i>to hunt,</i> but in Icel. only in a particular sense]:—<i>to move to and fro,</i> e. g. as a door on its hinges.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jagt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jagt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>jakt,</strong> n. [jaga], <i>a yacht,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jaki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jaki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [cp. A. S. <i>gicel</i>], <i>a piece of ice, broken ice,</i> Fas. i. 472, Eb. 236–240, Grett. 140, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jakob"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jakob
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>James:</i> <strong>Jakobs-land,</strong> n. <i>St. James’ land, Compostella</i> in Spain: <strong>Jakobs-messa, -vaka,</strong> <i>St. James’ mass, vigil,</i> Fms.: botan., <strong>Jakobs-fífill,</strong> m. <i>erigeron Alpinus, Alpine flea-bane,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jalda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jalda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [provinc. Swed. <i>jälda</i>], <i>a mare,</i> only in poetry, gömul jalda í stóði, Kormak (twice); í jöldu líki, Fms. xi. 42 (in a verse); ríða jöldu, Grett. (in a verse). Jöldu-hlaup, n. <i>Mare’s-leap,</i> a local name in the north of Ireland, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jam"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jam-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>jamn-,</strong> see jafn-.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jamla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jamla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to grumble,</i> (slang.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jamtr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jamtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>men from Jamtaland</i> in Sweden, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/japla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          japla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to mumble,</i> as with a toothless mouth.",
