              "__html": "m. [prob. identical with A. S. <i>geomor;</i> Hel. <i>jamar;</i> North. E. <i>yammer;</i> O. H. G. <i>jamar;</i> Germ. <i>jammer,</i> which words are else alien to the Scandin.]:—<i>a bleating,</i> Gullþ. 19; sauða-jarmr, <i>the bleating of sheep,</i> Hrafn. 7; fugls-jarmr, <i>the ‘bleating,’ crying of birds,</i> as the giantess calls the birds’ song, poët., Edda (in a verse), passim.",
            }
