        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a county in Pomerania, where the Danes had an ancient colony and stronghold called <strong>Jóms-borg,</strong> f. and <strong>Jóms-víkingar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the Vikings of Jom:</i> <strong>Jómvíkinga-bardagi,</strong> a, m. <i>the battle of J.</i> (in the year 994), Fms. passim: <strong>Jómvíkinga-saga,</strong> u, f. <i>the Saga of J.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/jom-fru"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          jóm-frú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
