        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the Jutes,</i> a Dan. tribe. <strong>Jótland,</strong> n. <i>Jutland:</i> <strong>Jótlands-haf,</strong> n. <i>the Cattegat:</i> <strong>Jótlands-síða,</strong> u, f. <i>the west coast of Jutland,</i> Fms., Eg.",
            }
