              "__html": "n. <i>coffee;</i> kaffe-kvern, kaffe-bolli, kaffe-ketill, <i>a coffee-mill, coffee-cup, coffee-pot;</i> derived from the Fr. <i>café</i> through Dan. <i>caffe,</i> and not older than the 18th century, for the satirical poem Þagnarmál of 1728 and Eggert Ólafsson (died 1768) mention tea and tobacco, but not coffee, which came into use in Icel. as a popular beverage not earlier than the end of the 18th century.",
            }
          }
        />
