              "__html": "u, f. [Engl. <i>cake;</i> Dan. <i>kage;</i> Swed. <i>kaka;</i> Germ. <i>kuchen</i>]:—<i>a cake;</i> eitt köku-korn, <i>a little cake,</i> Vitae Patrum (Unger); freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
