        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to become cold,</i> Bs. ii. 148: <i>to blow cold,</i> án dvöl kaldar af boða-fallinu, <i>a gust of cold air arose,</i> Bs. ii. 49; en þar kaldar í mót af Sighvati, 112.",
            }
