        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kambr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kambr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>camb;</i> Engl. <i>comb;</i> O. H. G. <i>champ;</i> Germ. <i>kamm;</i> Dan. <i>kam</i>]:—<i>a comb,</i> Dipl. iii. 4; ladies used to wear costly combs of walrus-tusk or gold, whence the place in Icel. at which Auda lost her comb was called <i>Kambsnes;</i> þau lendu við nes þat er Auðr tapaði kambi sínum; þat kallaði hón Kambsnes, Landn. III; eigi berr hann kamb í höfuð sér, Þiðr. 127; see Worsaae, No. 365.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
