        >
          karmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>karm</i> = <i>a frame; vindues-karm, dör-karm</i> = <i>a window-frame, door-frame</i>]:—<i>a closet;</i> slæðu-karmr = <i>vestiarium,</i> Hallfred; öl-karmr, <i>an ale cask,</i> Landn. (in a verse); mjöð-k., <i>a mead cask,</i> Lex. Poët.; bekk-k., <i>a bench frame, couch</i> = Lat. <i>triclinium,</i> id.; kastalar ok karmar, Fms. iv. 49.",
            }
