        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., fem. körsk, karskt, proncd. kaskr; [from karl or karr, qs. kariskr; Germ. <i>karsch,</i> a north Germ., word, Grimm’s Dict. by Hildebrand; Dan.-Swed. <i>karsk</i>]:—<i>brisk, bold,</i> Nj, 120, v. l.: <i>hale, hearty,</i> era karskr maðr sá er …, <i>he is not a hale man,</i> i. e. <i>he suffers much who …,</i> Stor. 4: freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
