      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kati"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kati
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a kind of <i>small ship, a ‘cat,’</i> Edda (Gl.); þá gaf Hörðr nafn nesinu ok kallaði Katanes, því at honum þótti þar margr kati fyrir fara, Ísl. ii. 85:—ketíll (<i>kettle</i>) seems to be a diminutive from this old word.",
            }
