      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kaun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kaun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a sore,</i> of wounds and scabs, Bs. ii. 20 (in a verse), Mar.; fullr kauna, Luke xvi. 26: freq. in mod. usage is the phrase, blása í kaunin, <i>to blow on one’s sores,</i> of fingers burnt, sore, or cold, Grönd. 46, = ὁ δ ἄλγεε και χέρ ἐφύση of Theocr. 19. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bargain;</i> íllt kaup, <i>a bad bargain,</i> Þorst. St. 54; daprt kaup, <i>a sad bargain,</i> Sighvat; kröpp kaup, Grett. (in a verse); gott or góð kaup, <i>a good bargain;</i> af-kaup, q. v.; hón gaf fyrir heklu flekkótta, ok vildi kaup kalla, <i>she paid a spotted frock for it, thus making it a bargain,</i> Landn. 319; öll skulu kaup haldask með mönnum váttlaus, nema fjögr, Grág. ii. 406; kona á at ráða fyrir hálfs-eyris kaupi, <i>a woman has a right to make a bargain amounting to half an ounce,</i> i. 333: phrases, slá kaupi við e-n, and slá kaupi saman, <i>to strike a bargain,</i> Fms. ii. 80, Fb. ii. 79; slyngja kaupi, <i>to strike a bargain,</i> Ld. 96; kaup ok sölur, <i>buying and selling;</i> ganga kaupum ok sölum, <i>to go into trade;</i> eiga kaup við e-n, Fms. vi. 103; verða at kaupi, <i>to come to a bargain,</i> Ld. 96; semja kaup, Fb. i. 124; kaupa smám kaupum sem stórum, ii. 75; eiga kaup við e-n, <i>to exchange, bargain, trade with one,</i> Nj. 157, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kaup-angr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kaup-angr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [kaup and vangr, dropping the <i>v,</i> rather than angr, q. v.]:—<i>a market-place, village, town;</i> ef maðr á hús í kaupangi en bú í héraði, Gþl. 93; í kaupangi sem í héraði, N. G. L. i. 303; allt þat sem í kaupangri er gört, þat skal at kaupangrs-rétti skipta, 53; þá skal hann fara til kaupangrs með föt sín, 304.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kaup-bref"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kaup-bréf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a deed of purchase,</i> Dipl. v. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kaup-brigdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kaup-brigði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a breach of contract,</i> Þorst. hv. 40.",
            }
