              "__html": "u, f. [through Fr. <i>carême,</i> from Lat. <i>quadragesima</i>], <i>a fast of forty days,</i> ordered as a penance in the old eccl. law, H. E. i. 521, ii. 189, 191. <strong>kárínu-fasta,</strong> u, f. = kárína, Sturl. ii. 231.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
