          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kelpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a trap</i> for otters, Fms. vii. 21; see kilpr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kemba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kemba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a skein of carded wool.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kemba-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kemba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [kambr], <i>to comb;</i> skera hár silt né k., Eg. 6; k. höfuð, Vsp. 38, Vtkv. 11; kembdr ok þveginn, Skv. 2. 25; laug skal göra hveim er liðinn er, hendr þvá ok höfuð, kemba ok þerra áðr í kistu fari, Sdm. 34 (Bugge); k. sik, Stj. 138; usually k. sér, Karl. 409, Sturl. i. 168, Bs. i. 560; megi þér k. þeim eigi hagligar tjaldkúlur, Fas. ii. 448; k. hærur, <i>to comb gray hairs,</i> see hæra.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kembir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kembir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a comber,</i> a nickname, Fb. iii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kempa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kempa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., spelt kenpa:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/keng-boginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          keng-boginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>crooked.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kengr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kengr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Shell. <i>keeng</i> = <i>a brook;</i> North. E. and Dutch <i>kink</i> = <i>a creek, fold;</i> mod. Engl. <i>kink</i> or <i>twist</i> in a rope]:—<i>a horseshoe-formed crook</i> of metal, Safn 67, 84, Munk. 103, hurðar kengr; Vm. 56 (of a bell): <i>a bend, bight,</i> en köttrinn beygði kenginn, Edda (Ub.) ii. 285; beygja sik í keng, <i>to crouch;</i> þó var upp ór kryppu kengr, Skíða R. 8: a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenjar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>freaks, whims:</i> <strong>kenjóttr,</strong> adj. <i>whimsical.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, kennig, Hm. 164; part. kennandisk, Bs. i. 322, H. E. i. 499, Dipl. iv. 8; [Goth. <i>kunnan;</i> A. S. <i>knáwan;</i> Old Engl. and Scot. <i>ken;</i> Dan. <i>kjende;</i> Swed. <i>känna</i>]:—<i>to ken, know, recognise;</i> þú kennir konu þá er heitir Oddný, Fms. vii. 103, Hkv. 2. 12; hann kenndi hann þegar, Nj. 9; Flosi kenndi Kára er hann kom í stofuna, 282; hann kenndi skipit, því at hann hafði þat skip séð fyrr, Eg. 120; þar kenndi Ingimundr lönd þau er honum var til vísat, Landn. 175, Sd. 186; þóttisk hann kenna sitt mark á vísu þessari, Fms. iii. 20: with infin., þeir kenndu at þat var Eirekr viðsjá, Ísl. ii. 335; er þetta hann Skalla-grímr? Grímr sagði at hann kenndi rétt, Eg. 112; kennir þú nökkut til gripa þessara! Nj. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kennandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a teacher,</i> Greg., Post., passim: as a law term, <i>a witness</i> for recovering and identifying a lost thing; sá maðr er kennendr vill færa til fjár síns, hann skal vinna eið at því at hann átti fé þat, Grág. i. 424; þá á sá, er fé átti, allt þat er hann kennir …, nema kennendr komi til, N. G. L. ii. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennanligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kennanligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>to be felt, tangible,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kennari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a teacher, tutor, master,</i> Bs. i. 733, 625. 79, Greg. 23; barna-k., skóla-k., passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a mark,</i> Germ. <i>kennzeichen;</i> þeir mörkuðu kennum Orms þetta fé, Bs. i. 748; ein-kenni, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenni-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>doctrine,</i> Stj. 2, 671. 22: mod. <i>a body of learned men, the clergy.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni-fadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenni-faðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a teacher,</i> Stj. 5: esp. <i>patres ecclesiae;</i> heilagra manna ok kennifeðra, Mar.; kennifeðr Kristninnar, 671. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenni-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a teacher,</i> but only used of <i>a cleric</i> or <i>priest,</i> opp. to leikmenn (<i>laymen</i>), Rb. 396; biskup ok aðrir kennimenn, Fms. i. 32; þriðja hlut (of the tithe) skyldu hafa kennimenn, Bs. i. 68; ok sagt upp í lögréttu af kennimönnum sumarit eptir, Íb. 17; ganga til skriptar við kennimann, K. Þ. K. 33, Bs. i. (e. g. Arna S.) passim; kennimanns-búningr, -klæði, <i>a priest’s dress,</i> 655 xiv, Stj. 110; kennimanna fundr, <i>an œcumenical council,</i> Ann. 485, Mar.; kennimanna setr, skyld, vist, <i>a priest’s maintenance, residence,</i> Fms. x. 317, Vm. 5, 108, Stj. passim; kennimanna kór, <i>the choir,</i> Bs. i. <strong>kennimanns-dómr,</strong> m. <i>priesthood,</i> Anecd. 12, Th. 52, Fms. viii. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni-mark"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenni-mark
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a mark</i> (= kenni), Fas. ii. 300, Sd. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni-nafn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kenni-nafn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a surname,</i> Ýt. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kenni-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
