        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a natural son</i> (see kenna A. 111. 1); Freysteinn var fóstri Þorbrands ok k., því at þat var flestra manna sögn at hann væri hans son, en ambátt var móðir hans, Eb. 156, Fms. xi. 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kennir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a knower,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kennsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl., in the phrase, bera kennsl á e-t, <i>to recognise, identify,</i> Ó. H. 72, Fms. xi. 85, Mag. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennsla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kennsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>teaching</i> (kenning is properly <i>preaching,</i> kennsla <i>teaching</i>), Dipl. v. 3, Sturl. i. 126, iii. 242, Bs. i. 431, 846, passim; barna-k., <i>teaching children;</i> skóla-k., <i>school-teaching.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kennslu-laun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
