            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a handle</i> of a vessel (= hadda); mösurbolli ok yfir gylltr kilpr, Fagrsk. 115; ok yfir kilpr gyldr af silfri, Mork. 19: in mod. usage kilpr is <i>a loop</i> of whalebone fastening the handle to the bucket.",
            }
