          className="link"
          href="/word/kimbill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kimbill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [kumbl], <i>a little trunk, a bundle</i> (= auka-pinkill); kimbill næfra, N. G. L. i. 101. <strong>kimla-bönd,</strong> n., prop. <i>trusses,</i> a metrical term, in which a foot is added (trussed) to the end of each line, Edda 135, 136; brands hnigþili randa stranda, where ‘stranda’ is the additional foot (kimbill).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
