        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>cheek-bones.</i> Bárð. 176, Fms. iii. 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kinn-bjorg"
