      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. klái, pret. kló, klótt, kló, pret. kleginn, [Scot. <i>claw</i>]:—<i>to scratch</i> or <i>rub an itching spot;</i> var fengin kona at klá honum fót sinn, Sturl. i. 189; hann kallaði á mik ok bað mik klá fótinn, Fms. ii. 187; síðan gekk konungr til svefns, ok kló ek fótinn, x. 331; ok vænti ek at nokkurir klái sárt síður, áðr vit Aron látimk báðir, Bs. i. 538; var þar fengin til kona um aptaninn er hann var kominn í rekkju, at klá fót hans, en er honum þótti of kyrt klegit, 462; ok þá er fótr minn hafði kleginn verit, Fb. i. 400,—the ancients seem to have had their feet rubbed in bed in order to bring on sleep.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klad-sjukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kláð-sjúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>scabby,</i> 655 xi. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kladi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kláði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the itch,</i> Fms. ii. 187, x. 331; brá kláða á hvarmana, Fb. ii. 367; augna-k., fóta-k.: <i>a scab,</i> fjár-k., <i>scab on sheep.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kladugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kláðugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>scabby.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klafr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kláfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>rough box</i> carried on horseback, Lv. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klam"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klám
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [akin to A. S. <i>clæmian</i> = <i>to daub</i>], <i>filthy, obscene language;</i> in mod. usage only in that sense, klám ok níð, Skáld H. 5. 24; vísur fullar af fúlu klámi, 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klam-fenginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klám-fenginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-fengni,</strong> f.), <i>foul-mouthed.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klam-hogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klám-högg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘stroke of shame,’</i> a law term, a wound or stroke behind, Bjarn. 66, Grág. ii. 12, Fas. iii. 102.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klam-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klám-orð
