        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klára
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., or <strong>klárr,</strong> m. a kind of <i>coarse rake</i> used to spread dung.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klárr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [like Germ. <i>klar,</i> Engl. <i>clear,</i> etc., from Lat. <i>clarus</i>], <i>clear, bright;</i> klár kenning, Pass. 10. 12; blóminn fagr kvenna klár, Fkv.; ú-klárr, Sks. 135.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klarr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klárr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a hack, cart-horse;</i> þat er újamligt, hestr sá ok klárr þinn, Glúm. 356; klárr úkostuligr, Fs. 128, Nj. 55, Fas. ii. 252; hest-klárr, húðar-k., <i>a hack.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klefi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klefi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (klifi, Greg. 49, Mart. 120), [A. S. <i>cleofa</i>], <i>a closet;</i> heimulegr k., Stj. 205; hón var lukt í litlum klefa, Clem. 51; hann fór eptir brauðdiski í klefa, 656 B. 4; útar af elda-skálanum vóru klefar tveir, sinn á hönd hvára, ok hlaðit skreið í annan en mjölvi í annan, Eb. 268, 272; litla-stofa ok klefi are distinguished, Sturl. iii. 187; var sét opt ljós til klifa þess er inn ungi maðr var í, Mart. 120; þá skalf klifi sá allr, Greg. 49; svefn-k., <i>a sleeping closet, bedroom,</i> Stj. 204.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [<i>klegg,</i> Ivar Aasen; cp. North. E. and Scot. <i>cleg</i> = <i>a horse-fly</i>]:—<i>a cleg</i> or <i>horse-fly,</i> Stj. 481. 1 Sam. xxiv. 14; mý eða kleggja, Eluc. 22; flugur þær er kallask af alþýðu kleggjar, Best. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., plur. kleifar, [from klífa, <i>to climb</i>], <i>a ridge of cliffs</i> or <i>shelves</i> in a mountain side; hljópu sjau menn ór skóginum ok upp í kleifina, Eg. 581; skógar-kjörr ok kleifar nökkurar, Fms. vii. 56; þeir kösuðu hann þar við kleifina, Eb. 166 (klifit, v. l.); þar sem helzt vóru kleifar ok skógar þröngvastir, Fms. ix. 359; suðr undir kleifarnar, Gísl. 67, 70: poët. <i>the head</i> is called hjarna kleif, <i>‘harn-cliff,’</i> Km.: <strong>Kleifar,</strong> f. pl. a local name in western Iceland, Sturl., Landn., Ann. 1238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleima
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, [<i>kleima,</i> Ivar Aasen; akin to klám], <i>to daub, smear, dabble;</i> þó at ek gæta kleimt einhvern þeirra, Fas. iii. 544, (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleisask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleisask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to become inarticulate;</i> tunga kleisisk, Anecd. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleiss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleiss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., kleiss í máli, <i>inarticulate in one’s speech,</i> Fms. x. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klekja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. klek, pret. klakði, part. klakinn, klaktr, [Ulf. <i>niu-klahs</i> = νήπιος; Dan. <i>klække;</i> Swed. <i>kläcka</i>]:—<i>to hatch;</i> klekja út, <i>to hatch out;</i> klekr þau út, Stj. 78; ungar út klaktir, id.; sem hann liggr á eggjunum ok hann skal út klekja, id.; hæna klakði dreka, Al. 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klekking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klekking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in the compd klekkingar-maðr, see klektan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klekkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klekkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, in Icel. only used in the phrase, klekkja á e-m, <i>to make one smart, punish;</i> eg skal k. á honum, (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klektan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klektan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = klekking; [klektan and klekking are prob. akin to Goth. <i>-klahs</i> in <i>niu-klahs;</i> cp. also <i>klekkjen</i> = <i>brittle,</i> Ivar Aasen]:—<i>chicken-heartedness;</i> so in the phrase, hann er engi klektunar maðr, i. e. <i>he is no chicken, he is a daring, dangerous man,</i> Sturl. iii. 282; ok sé þú svá fyrir at hann er engi klektunar maðr, Eb. 90 new Ed., Nj. 105; for the various readings (klectun, kleckun, klecting, klektun) see Nj. Johnson. 214.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klembra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klembra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Germ. <i>klemmen</i>], <i>to jam</i> or <i>pinch in a smith’s vice,</i> klömbr, q. v.; klýptir ok klembraðir, Stj. 285.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klement"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klement
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod., proncd. <strong>Klémus,</strong> m. a pr. name, <i>Clement;</i> Klemens kirkja, messa, dagr, saga, <i>the church, mass, day, Saga of St. Clement,</i> Clem. 48, K. Á. 18, Vm. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klengi-sok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klengi-sök
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a law term, <i>picking up a quarrel;</i> þykkir honum þetta klengisök vera, Ölk. 35; eigi vilju vér at þegnar várir sé taksettir eða stefndir fyrir fépretta sakir eðr nokkura klengisaka, <i>for the sake of cheating</i> or <i>chicane,</i> N. G. L. ii. 482.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klenging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klenging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the picking up a quarrel;</i> þó hann tæki af mönnum slíkar klengingar, Sturl. i. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klengjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klengjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dep. [perh. akin to A. S. <i>clingan,</i> Engl. <i>cling</i> = <i>to cleave to</i>]:—<i>to pick up a quarrel;</i> ok varð Áskatli ílla við, ok þótti hann mjök klengst (MS. kleins) hafa til þessa máls, Rd. 272; ok á þat með engu móti í erfð at ganga. þóat sumir hafi ranglega við klengzt, N. G. L. ii. 402.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Dan. <i>klippa</i> = <i>a rock;</i> Germ. <i>klumpen;</i> A. S. <i>clympre</i>]:—<i>a plummet, lump,</i> Bs. i. 806 (of a comet’s tail), Konr. 31; blý-kleppr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klepra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klepra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u. f. or <strong>klepr,</strong> m., pl. kleprar, <i>a clot,</i> icicle-like, of fat, ice, hair, wool, Jónas.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleprottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
