              "__html": "m. <i>learning,</i> Bs. i. 793, Sturl. i. 125, Al. 42, Barl. 12; nema klerkdóm, Fms. vii. 327: <i>the clergy,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
