        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>church music,</i> Fms. i. 260.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klerkliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klerkliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>learnedly;</i> prédika k., Bs. i. 846.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klerkligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klerkligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>clerkly, scholarlike,</i> Th. 79; klerkligar listir, Bs. i. 680; klerkligar bækr, Skálda (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klerkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klerkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [from Lat. <i>clericus</i>], <i>a cleric, clerk, scholar;</i> góðr klerkr (<i>beau-clerk</i>), Fms. ix. 531, x. 111; Rikini var klerkr góðr (<i>a good clerk</i>), bæði diktaði hann vel ok versaði, Bs. i. 239; Aristoteles með klerka-sveit sína, Al. 8; hann skildi görla Völsku þvíat hann var góðr k., El.; Paris klerkr, <i>a Paris clerk, one who has studied in Paris,</i> Fb. ii. 475; vitr ok góðgjarn ok k. mikill, Fms. i. 229; Eiríkr konungr var vitr maðr ok góðr k. ok kunni margar tungur, xi. 298; svá görir ok inn skilningslausi, ef hann kemr frá skóla, þá hyggsk hann þegar vera góðr k., Sks. 247.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kless-maeltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kless-mæltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>talking thick,</i> Fms. x. 39, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klessa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klessa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, <i>to clot, daub:</i> reflex. klessast, <i>to talk thick,</i> Anecd. 10: part. <strong>klesstr</strong> = kleiss (q. v.), Fms. x. 39, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kletta-belti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kletta-belti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a belt of crags.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kletta-fru"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kletta-frú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., botan. <i>the saxifrage.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kletta-skora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kletta-skora
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a scaur.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kletta-snos"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kletta-snös
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a jutting crag,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kletti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kletti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a lump of fat</i> in the loins of meat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klettr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>klint</i>], <i>a rock, cliff,</i> Fær. 29; þar stendr skógar-klettr við Hafslæk, Þorsteinn gékk upp á klettinn, Eg. 717, Bs. ii. 111, Sturl. iii. 104, Gísl. 147; hár k., Grett. 101; þeir sjá hvar klettar tveir koma upp ór hafinu, Fas. ii. 248: in plur. <i>a range of crags:</i> poët., herða k., <i>‘shoulder rock,’</i> i. e. <i>the head,</i> Ls.; hjarna k., <i>‘harn rock,’</i> i. e. <i>the head;</i> hjálma-k., <i>helmet crag,</i> cp. <i>Helm-crag</i> in Westmoreland, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleykiliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleykiliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv.; vera k. kominn, <i>to have got into bad scrapes,</i> Th. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kleykir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kleykir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kle"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. kljá (kléa), pl. kljár, qs. kléar; [cp. Gr. λσία or λεία, qs. γλαία?]:—<i>one of the stones to keep the warp straight in the old upright loom;</i> þá er ek sló vefinn, þá féll af einn kléinn af miðjum vefnum ok tók ek upp, ok þá sá ek at kljár þeir vóru ekki nema manna-höfuð, Fms. xi. 49; manna-höfuð vóru fyrir kljána, Nj. 275. <strong>kljá-grjót,</strong> n. <i>a weaver’s stones,</i> Nj. 275, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klénn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [for. word; from A. S. <i>clæn;</i> Engl. <i>clean;</i> Germ. <i>klein</i>]:—<i>snug;</i> klénn koss, Fas. iii. (in a verse of the 15th century); k. sæng, Úlf. 4. 44: <i>little, puny,</i> klén tign, Pass. The word first occurs in the 15th century, but it never took root.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kliða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to murmur inarticulately.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kliðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a din, the murmur</i> in a great assembly when no articulate sound is to be heard; þyss eða k., Gísl. 56; k. ok háreysti, Fms. vi. 374, Bs. ii. 129; skilr þú hér nokkuð mál manna? eigi heldr en fuglaklið, Fas. ii. 175; í einum klið = í einum duni,—allt var senn í einum klið | upp vatt trúss meðal herða, Skíð. R. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>clif;</i> Engl. <i>cliff</i>], <i>a cliff;</i> klif and kleif are used indiscriminately in Eb. and Eg. l. c.; þeir fengu tekit hann út við klif er upp ríðr ór fjörunni, Eb. 166; ok kösuðu hann þar við klifit, id. v. l.; klif bratt ok einstigi yfir at fara, Eg. 576; þá var þar undir niðri skógr en skóglaust uppi á klifinu, 580; ok er Egill kom upp ór klifinu, id.; í klifi nokkuru, Bs. i. 200; var í brattasta einstigi upp at ganga ok í harða há klif (plur.), Stj. 452. 1 Sam. xiv. 4 (<i>eminentes petrae</i> of the Vulgate); síðan gékk hann til klifs þess er þjóðgata lá yfir, þeir stefndu hit gegnsta til klifsins, Korm. 146: poët., hauka klif, <i>hawk’s cliff</i> = <i>the hand,</i> Hallfred; há klif, <i>a high cliff,</i> Sighvat: local names, <strong>Klifs-jörfi, Klifs-sandr, Klifs-dalr,</strong> Bjarn.; <strong>Klifs-lönd,</strong> <i>Cliffland</i> or <i>Cleveland,</i> in England, Fms. vi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klif-gata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klif-gata
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘cliff-gate,’ way along a cliff,</i> Ísl. ii. 176.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klifa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, prop. <i>to climb,</i> but only used metaph.:—<i>to repeat, to harp on the same thing;</i> bað þá eigi klifa svá ey ok ey, Ísl. ii. 349; klifar þú nakkvat jafnan, mannfýla þín, Nj. 85; kerling klifaði allt sumarit um arfa-sátuna at inn skyldi bera, 194; vér kumpánar lærðum þik eitt vers, ok er þat nú þegar þér svá kært sem þú kunnir engan hlut annan, klifandi þat jafnan æ fram, Mar.; klifar sá margr kvæðin lin, Skáld H. 3. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klifad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klifað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. part. a kind of <i>metre,</i> where the same rhyme-syllable is repeated throughout the half of a verse, a specimen of which is Edda (Ht.) 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klifra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klifra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to climb,</i> Rb. 102, Fagrsk. 125; usually as dep. <strong>klifrask,</strong> <i>id.,</i> Fas. iii. 443.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klingja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klingja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [Germ. <i>klingen;</i> Dan. <i>klinge;</i> cp. Engl. <i>clink</i>]:—<i>to ring, tinkle;</i> hugsar at hér muni k. til upphafs, Fms. xi. 434; hlýtr að klingja dalanna dyngja dúkinn á, Snót 99; klingir mér fyrir eyrum ómr, Bjarni 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kling-kling-kling-kling!"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kling, kling, kling, kling!
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "interj., of bells or a tinkling sound, Jónas.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klippa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klippa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a clipping, sample;</i> af-klippa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klippa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klippa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to clip;</i> k. með söxum, Str. 9; klipti negl hans ok hár, Fms. vi. 204; k. hár, <i>to clip, cut the hair,</i> Stj. 202; k. sauði, hjörð, <i>to clip, shear sheep,</i> K. Þ. K. 104, Stj. 482, 484.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klippari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klippari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a hair-cutter,</i> Stj. 524:—<i>a dealer, monger,</i> Rétt. 2. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klipping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klipping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a clipping, shearing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klippingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klippingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shorn sheepskin,</i> Grág. i. 501, Bs. i. 834, H. E. iv. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klifa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klífa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. klíf, pret. kleif, pl. klifu; [A. S. <i>clîfian;</i> Engl. <i>cleave to;</i> Dutch <i>kleven;</i> Germ. <i>kleben</i>]:—<i>to climb;</i> Jónathan kleif ekki síðr með höndum en fótum um einstigit, Stj. 452; konungr kleif upp í einn bakka, Fms. viii. 75; en sumir klifu svá bratta brekku, 401; þá kom jarl at hlaupandi ok kleif upp yfir köstinn ok þaðan upp yfir húsin, ix. 225; svá at hann mátti klífa upp í virkit af skildinum, Sturl. ii. 33; ok kleif einn í höku mér, Dropl. 22; því er kænlegra at k. skemra, ok falla lægra, Al. 145; þeim er áðr höfðu klifit, Hkr. i. 290; klífa á kjöl, Sturl. ii. 224 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kligja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klígja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., mod. <strong>klía,</strong> <i>nausea,</i> Mag. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kligja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klígja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, mod. <strong>klía,</strong> að, [provinc. Norse <i>klia,</i> pret. <i>klidde</i> and <i>kligta,</i> pres. <i>klir,</i> see notes to Al. 186]:—<i>to feel nausea;</i> hón klígir mjök, Al. 153; þeirra önd klígir í mót inum himneska mat, Mar.:—mod. impers., mig klíar, or mig klíar við því.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klína
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to smear;</i> klína brauð, <i>to butter bread,</i> Fms. ix. 241; klínask leiri, Best. 673. 53: mod. <i>to daub,</i> esp. with ordure.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kliningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klíningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [<i>klining,</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>buttered bread;</i> kasta klíningnum ok könnunni, cp. the Engl. proverb ‘to throw the helve after the hatchet,’ Fms. viii. 413, v. l.: as a nickname, Orkn.: the word is still used in the old sense in Norway.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klistra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klístra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að. <i>to glue, paste.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kljá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [klé, pl. kljár], <i>to fix the weights to a loom</i> (see klé); mér þótti kljáðr vera vefrinn, Fms. xi. 49; harðkljáðr, <i>hard stretched,</i> Darr.: metaph., vera á enda kljáðr, <i>to be finished, done;</i> það er ekki á enda kljáð, <i>there is no end of it as yet;</i> vera út kljáðr, <i>done;</i> það er út kljáð um þau mál: kljá á enda, <i>to wind up, to have done;</i> er ek á enda kljáðr at þola þat lengr, Ísl. ii. 420.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kljufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kljúfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "prts. klýf; pret. klauf, klauft (klaufst), klauf, pl. klufu; subj. klyfi; part. klofinn; [A. S. <i>cleôfan;</i> Engl <i>cleave;</i> O. H. G. <i>chlioban;</i> mid. H. G. <i>klieben;</i> Dan. <i>klöve;</i> Swed. <i>klyfva</i>]:—<i>to cleave, split;</i> hann hjó á skjöld Rúts ok klauf allan niðr, Nj. 95; elda er rétt at göra ok k. torf til, K. Þ. K. 88; ætluðu at flá hann kvikan ok klufu svörðinn í höfðinu, Fms. vii. 227; era sem kolvið kljúfi, karl sá er vegr at jarli, viii. (in a verse); eða ek klyf þik í herðar niðr, Nj. 185; kom í höfuðit ok klauf ofan í jaxlana, 144; skildir ‘ro klofnir, <i>cloven, cleft,</i> Vsp. 46: metaph. <i>to split,</i> ek klýf ór þessum sex greinir ins fjórða tigar, Skálda 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klof
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the cleft between the legs, the fork,</i> Fas. ii. 346.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klof-langr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klof-langr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>long-forked, long-legged.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klof-snjor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klof-snjór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
