      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klukka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klukka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. pl. klukkna, older form <strong>klocka,</strong> Fms. vi. 147, Hom. 9, 68, 69, Bs. i. 38; [A. S. <i>clucge;</i> Engl. <i>clock;</i> Germ. <i>glocke;</i> Dan. <i>klokke</i>]:—<i>a bell,</i> Grág. i. 460, Bs. i. 65, K. Þ. K. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klukkari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klukkari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., old form <strong>klokkari,</strong> Str. 18, Fms. iv. 171, [Dan. <i>klokker</i>]:—<i>a belman,</i> Fms. xi. 256, Ó. H. 72, D. N. passim; klukkara-hús, -stofa, <i>a belman’s room,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klumba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klumba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. and <strong>klubba,</strong> Fagrsk. 49, O. H. L. 70, Hkr. ii. 175, Rb. 1812. 18: <i>a club,</i> Fms. iv. 246, xi. 129, Sd. 147, Bév., El. (Fr.); klumbu-fótr, <i>a club foot;</i> klumbu-nef, <i>a snub nose.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klumsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klumsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>lock-jaw,</i> Germ. <i>maulklemme,</i> a disease of horses.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., the <i>r</i> is radical, [<i>klungr,</i> Ivar Aasen]:—<i>a bramble;</i> millum klungra ok hagþyrna, Barl. 18, 139; þorn ok klungr, Stj. 38; milli þorna ok klungra, 47; með klungrum ok hvössum hagþornum, 395, (‘spinis tribulisque’ of the Vulgate); þyrni, klungr, ok allt annat íllgresi, Fms. v. 159; rósan vex upp á milli klungra ok þyrna, Hom. (St.); sem rós hjá klungrum, Gd. 6: poët., hræ-k., <i>carrion-thorn,</i> poët. for <i>a weapon,</i> Merl. 1. 36, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klungrottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klungróttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>grown with bramble,</i> Stj. 45, Art.:—<i>stony, rough.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klunna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klunna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to cling to,</i> in a rude sense; hann sitr ok klunnir á skógartrjám, Stj. 80, v. l.; en hin klunna viðr bakit, of an ape and her young, 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klunni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klunni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a clumsy, boorish fellow.</i> <strong>klunna-legr,</strong> adj. (<strong>-lega,</strong> adv.), <i>clumsy in shape.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kluka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klúka
