        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a local name in the west of Icel., see Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klúrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>coarse,</i> esp. in language and manners; the word is now freq., and although not recorded in old writers, it must be old, as one of the thralls in Rm. is called Klúrr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klus-petrus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klús-petrús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>St. Peter with his keys, ‘Key-Peter,’</i> Ó. H. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klusa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klúsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [for. word], <i>to make intricate:</i> <strong>klúsaðr,</strong> part. <i>intricate;</i> ú-klúsaðr, <i>unhampered,</i> Fær. 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klútr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [for. word; A. S. <i>clût;</i> Engl. <i>clout;</i> Dan. <i>klud;</i> it appears in writers of the 14th century]:—<i>a kerchief,</i> Bs. i. 791; ok þar um vafit einum hreinum klút, 829, ii. 170; lín-klútr, i. 790; vasa-klútr, <i>a pocket-handkerchief,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klyf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klyf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. sing. and nom. pl. klyfjar; [Dan. <i>klöv</i>]:—<i>a pack</i> or <i>trunk on a pack-horse;</i> leggja upp klyf, <i>to pack a horse,</i> N. G. L. i. 349; ef maðr ekr eða berr klyfjar, … þótt eigi sé klyfjar á hrossi manns, Grág. i. 441; taka af klyfjar af hesti, Grett. 119 A; þat var nóg klyf, <i>it was a full weight for a horse,</i> Fas. iii. 401; hrindr ofan reiðinginum með klyfjunum, Sturl. iii. 114; hrossum með klyfjum, Ó. H. 187.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klyf-beri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klyf-beri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., proncd. <strong>klybberi,</strong> and spelt thus, Grág. (Kb.) ii. 109, l. 21:—<i>a pack-saddle,</i> K. Þ. K. 86, Sturl. iii. 114. <strong>klyfbera-band,</strong> n. and <strong>klyfbera-gjörð,</strong> f. <i>a pack-saddle girth,</i> Lv. 91.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klyf-baerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klyf-bærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fit to carry a burden,</i> of a pack-horse; sjau kaplar klyfbærir, Vm. 177; fola klyfbærrar ösnu, Matth. xxi. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klyfja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klyfja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to load a pack-horse,</i> Nj. 74, Eg. 593, Stj. 460, 483, Ó. H. 170, Ver. 124, Fbr. 17 new Ed., passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klyfja-band"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klyfja-band
