        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klypa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klýpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a bit pinched out of another;</i> smjör-k., <i>a bit of butter.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klypa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klýpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "klýpði, later klýpti, but pres. klýpr, mod. klýpir; in mod. usage this word has (except in pres.) been turned into a strong verb, klípa, kleip, klipu, klipinn; [Engl. <i>to clip</i> = <i>to clasp</i>]:—<i>to clip, pinch;</i> þá tók Laurentius í síðu Stephani ok klýpti fast, Sks. 652; ef maðr bítr mann eða hrífr eða klýpr, Grág. ii. 133; síðan klýpðo þeir tungu-stúfinn með töng, Ó. H. 250: <i>to squeeze in,</i> klýptir ok klembraðir, Stj. 285; hefir eyðimörkin svá klypt þá, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klypi-tong"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klýpi-töng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a smith’s tongs</i> or <i>clippers, nail pincers.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klyping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klýping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a clipping, pinching,</i> Grág. ii. 133, Sks. 652.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-far"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-fár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘few-clad,’ thinly clad,</i> Bs. i. 442, Bret. ch. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-haefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-hæfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fit for clothes, fit for wear,</i> Grág. ii. 247.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘clothes-less,’ naked,</i> Stj., Fms. ii. 174, vi. 302.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>nakedness,</i> Barl. 61.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-margr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-margr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>having many clothes,</i> opp. to klæðfár, Sturl. iii. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-sekkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-sekkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a clothes-bag, knapsack,</i> Fms. iii. 178, Grett. 134 A, Stj. 214, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaed-ylr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæð-ylr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>clothes-warmth,</i> of bedclothes, Sks. 758. 1 Kings i. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to clothe;</i> klæða sik, <i>to dress oneself,</i> Nj. 171; klæða nökðan, kalna, Hom., O. H. L. 22; afklæddi hann sik (<i>he put off</i>) sínum kyrtli, Stj. 466; í óttu fyrir dag stóð hann upp ok klæddi sik, Edda 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., irreg. gen. pl. klæðna, Barl. 80, 83, Str. 21; [A. S. <i>clæð;</i> Engl. <i>cloth;</i> O. H. G. <i>chleit;</i> Germ. <i>kleid;</i> Dutch <i>kleed;</i> Swed. and Dan. <i>klæde</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaednadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæðnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>clothing, apparel;</i> húsbúnaðr, borðbúnaðr ok klæðnaðr, Eg. 94; k. Þóru ok gripir, 158, Grág. i. 299, 460, Karl. 545.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaeingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., contr. <strong>klængr,</strong> a name of a raven, poët., Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaeja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to itch;</i> nú klæja oss lófarnir, <i>our palms itch,</i> Sturl. i. 42; gnú þú um háls mér þerrunni þvíat mér klæjar mjök, iii. 111; þeim mun í brún bregða ok ofarliga klæja (<i>it will itch sorely</i>) þá er ek berr fram vörnina, Nj. 239.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaeki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (in mod. usage <strong>klækr,</strong> m.), [perh. akin to klekja and Goth. <i>klahei</i> = <i>pusillanimity</i>]:—<i>disgrace, cowardice;</i> kvað mönnum klæki í vera, ef einn Víkverskr maðr skal yfir oss ganga hér í frændhaga várum, Hkr. iii. 395; oss er þat klæki, segir hann, ef …, Fms. vii. 269; at honum væri hvárki at síðan skömm né klæki, Sturl. iii. 150; allir verðum vér þá at klækjum, Fms. v. 204; haf nú þetta, ok með bæði skömm ok klæki, Gísl. 63; en nú hafit ér ánauð ok þrælkon ok þar með stórklæki ok níðingsskap, Ó. H. 227; bera æfinlegt klækisnafn at þora eigi at hefna þín, Fms. ii. 69; klækis högg, <i>a dastardly blow,</i> Bjarn. 66, (a pun.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaeki-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæki-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>in a dastardly way,</i> Fs. 41, Vápn. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaeki-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæki-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
