        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klaema"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klæma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [klám], <i>to fall foul of;</i> klæmdu mjök í orðum sínum Maumet ok Terrogant, (as Spenser, <i>‘Maumet and Termagaunt’</i>), Flóv. 42:—mod., reflex. <strong>klæmast,</strong> <i>to use obscene, filthy language.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
