        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., with a characteristic <i>v,</i> acc. klökkvan, etc., prop. <i>bending, pliable,</i> as of a reed; klökkr kjölr, Bs. i. 483 (in a verse); varð Mariusúðin klökk mjök ok skaut lykkjunum. Fms. viii. 199; klökk stál, of a ship, Edda (Ht.); á klökkva saumför, Orkn. 104 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klokkva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klökkva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. klökkr, pret. klökk, pl. klukku, also spelt with <i>ey,</i> kleyqva, Kb. of the Sæm.; [A. S. <i>cloccan</i> and Engl. <i>cluck,</i> limited in sense, like Lat. <i>glocire;</i> Dan. <i>klynke</i>]:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klokkving"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klökkving
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
