            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klombr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klömbr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [akin to a well-known root word common to all Teut. languages, cp. Germ. <i>klam, klemmen</i>]:—<i>a smith’s vice,</i> of which a drawing is given in the old edition of Glúm. (1786).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/klopp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klöpp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. klappir, [klappa], <i>a pier-like rock</i> projecting into the sea, and looking as if shaped by art; lenda við klöppina, or klappirnar, freq. in western Icel.; as also of <i>stepping stones</i> over a stream, leiðin lá yfir mýrar ok fen, ok vóru þar höggnar yfir klappir, Fms. vii. 68; <strong>klappar-nef,</strong> n. <i>a projecting rock.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kloppur-nes"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          klöppur-nes
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>jutting rocks,</i> Ó. H. 182 (Fb. ii. 309); lítið klöppurnes gékk fram fyrir utan hjá skipum þeirra, ok sá þeir því nær ekki út á fjörðinn, Fms. viii. 217; gékk klepparnes fyrir útan þá, Ó. H. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knafa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knafa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>stuprare,</i> only occurring in the form knafat, as a various reading to sorðit, Nj. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knakkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knakkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., different from hnakkr and hnakki, q. v., [cp. Engl. <i>knick-knack</i> = <i>trifle</i>]:—<i>a kind of little chair, high stool;</i> skaltú gera kistu at móður þinni ok undir knakka, <i>make a coffin and a hearse,</i> Fs. 132; hann settisk niðr á einn knakk, Bs. ii. 186; stólar fjórir, knakkr, lectari, Pm. 17; lang-knakkr, <i>an oblong bench;</i> eldar vóru stórir í elda-skálanum, ok sátu þar nokkurir menn á langknökkum, Finnb. 310; hand-knakkr (q. v.), a kind <i>of crutches.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knapi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knapi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>cnapa;</i> Engl. <i>knave;</i> Germ. <i>knabe</i>]:—<i>a servant boy, the valet of a king or great man,</i> Js. 14, N. G. L. ii. 434, O. H. 70, 71, Karl. 331, Þiðr. 141.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knapp-hofdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
