          className="link"
          href="/word/knappi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knappi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Landn.; whence <strong>Knappa-dalr,</strong> m. a local name, id.",
            }
