          href="/word/knatt-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knatt-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>playing at ball,</i> a kind of <i>cricket</i> or <i>trap-ball,</i> a favourite game with the old Scandinavians, Sturl. ii. 190; described in the Sagas, Grett. ch. 17, Gísl. pp. 26, 32, Eg. ch. 40, Vígl. ch. 11 (13 new Ed.), Hallfr. S. ch. 2 (Fs. 86), Þorst. S. Vík. ch. 10, Gullþ. ch. 2, Harð. ch. 22; the ice in winter was a favourite play-ground, see Gullþ. etc. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knatt-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knatt-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bat-trap,</i> Eg. 188, Fas. ii. 407, Gísl. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knatta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knatta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to lift to the level of one’s head;</i> also járn-knatta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>a knoll, crag,</i> D. N. v. 620; whence the mod. Dan. <i>knös</i> and <i>bonde-knös</i> = <i>a ‘boor knoll,’ a boorish youth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kná
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a defect. verb, for the conjugation of which see Gramm. p. xxxiii; the pres. infin. knegu nowhere occurs, whereas a pret. infin. knáttu occurs in Sighvat (Fms. vi. 40); a subj. pres. knega, knegi, knegim, Hkv. 2. 34, Fsm. 22, 25, 41, Stor. 15, N. G. L. i. 89; pret. knáði for knátti, Fms. xi. 296 (in a verse), Rekst.; with a suff. neg. kná-at, <i>non potest,</i> Gm. 25; knák-a, <i>non possum,</i> Hým. 32, Am. 52; knegu-t, plur. <i>non possunt,</i> Hkv. Hjörv. 13: [A. S. <i>cnáwan;</i> Engl. <i>know</i>]:—<i>I know how to do a thing, I can,</i> or quite paraphrastically like Engl. <i>do;</i> ek kná sja, <i>I can see,</i> i. e. <i>I do see,</i> freq. in poetry, always followed by an infinitive, but very rare in prose:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kna-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kná-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>prowess, pithiness,</i> Sd. 138, Bjarn. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knaliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knáliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>deftly, doughtily:</i> þeir sækja k. ferðina, Ld. 226; stöndum mót þeim k., Fms. i. 303; skipaði jarl Orminn sem knáligast, iii. 12; hann keyrði nautin k., Glúm. 342.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knaligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knáligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>deft, brisk-looking;</i> þeir vóru knáligir menn ok vóru mjök grjótpálar fyrir búi Ósvífrs, Ld. 122; miðaldra menn ok inir knáligustu, Sturl. i. 99.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., fem. kná (knó, Bs. i. 345), neut. knátt, [cp. Lat. <i>gnavus</i>]:—<i>pithy, vigorous;</i> hann var mikill maðr vexti ok knár, ok inn vaskasti um alla hluti, Sturl. ii. 38; Þorbjörn var knástr maðr, Lv. 27; þá var gott til knárra manna í Miðfirði, Þórð. 15; var Karl knástr, Sd. 138; varð síðan til kona vel tvítog, en knó, Bs. i. 345; knáir menn ok úlatir, Fbr. 50 new Ed.; ok óæð óknóm mönnum, Bs. i. 349; skal ek fá til kná menn at fylgja þér, Þorst. Síðu H. 181; vita mátti þó þat, segir Grettir, at ek munda eigi slíku til leiðar koma, sem ek hefi unnit, ef ek væra eigi all-knár, Grett. 97 new Ed.; margr er knár þó hann sé smár, a saying; eigi matti hann styrkvan kalla at afli en þó var hann hinn knásti ok inn fimasti, Sturl. iii. 221; í þessi skriðu týndisk Markús, en sá komsk í brott heill er óknástr var, Bs. i. 640; líkar þeim vel við Brand, þvíat hann var bæði knár ok liðvaskr, Lv. 24; Þórarinn var knástr maðr annarr en Þorgils, Fs. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knefa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to determine;</i> er þar nú knefat um annat ráð, Sturl. ii. 181; er þat nú knefat at ek vil hafa Skagafjörð, iii. 232.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knefan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knefan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>determination</i> (?); má eigi þat þú mæla at þér takit knefanar kost, Sturl. iii. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knefill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knefill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a post, pole;</i> búð með fjórum kneflum, Gþl. 499.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kneif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kneif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [cp. Engl. <i>nip</i>], a kind of <i>nippers</i> or <i>pincers,</i> Björn; hreifa kneif, <i>‘palm-pincers,’</i> poët. for <i>the hand, grasp,</i> Gísl. (in a verse): a nickname, Landn. 278.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kneiking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kneiking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a grasping, embrace;</i> kossa ok kneikingar, Fb. i. 411.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kneikja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kneikja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Dan. <i>knække</i>], <i>to bend backwards with force;</i> hann kneikti hann aptr á bak, Eg. 397; tók í axlir honum ok kneikti hann upp at stöfum, 552; síðan þú kneiktir hann Kallrana, Fas. ii. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>courage;</i> kjark ok knell, 655 xvii. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kneppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kneppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [knappr], <i>to stud;</i> hettu knepta niðr millum fóta sér, Bárð. 179, Þorf. Karl. 412; kneppta skúa, <i>nailed shoes,</i> Fas. i. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knerra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knerra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
