        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. knésbætr, (but knésfótum, Sæm. 91), <i>the houghs,</i> Lat. <i>poplites,</i> Fms. iii. 188, Fbr. 159, 179, Al. 43, Fas. ii. 354, Edda 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
