      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knifs-skapt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knífs-skapt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-skepti</strong>), n. = knífskepti, Fms. iii. 358, 391, Landn. 248.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knja-dukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knjá-dúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a knee-cloth, cushion,</i> Vm. 52, Dipl. iii. 4, v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knja-lidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knjá-liðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the knee-joint,</i> Fas. iii. 329.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knjukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knjúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a crag, knoll;</i> the mod. form is hnjúkr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knoda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knoða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. hnoða. [A. S. <i>cnêdan</i>], <i>to knead;</i> knoða saman mjöl ok smjör, Landn. 34; þeir höfðu knoðat saman deig við snjó, Ann. 1337; mólu þeir þat í sundr sem smæst, knoðaðu síðan saman, Stj. 293; þá bað Sigmundr hann knoða ór mjölvi því … í mjölinu, er ek tók at knoða, ok hér hefi ek með knoðat þat er í var, Fas. i. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knoka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knoka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ad, [A. S. <i>cnucian</i>], <i>to knock, thump;</i> þeir höfðu áðr bart höfuðit allt á honum ok knokat, Hom. 120; Þorvaldr knokaði (<i>forced</i>) sína menn til ljúgvitna, Bs. i. 665; ok hygg ek at menn mínir hefði hann mest knokat, Karl. 399.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knosa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knosa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. <i>knusian</i> = <i>to kneel;</i> A. S. <i>cnysian;</i> Dan. <i>knuse</i>]:—<i>to bruise, beat;</i> þeir höfðu áðr barit höfuð hans ok knosat, Fms. v. 148; senda mun Drottinn yfir þik hungr þar til er hann knosar þik, Stj. 344, 345; skal ek með miklum ok margföldum kvölum knosa yðra líkami, Fb. i. 404; tekr hann at knosa hjarta Theophili, Th. 14; knosuð bönd, Líkn. 30: <strong>knosaðr,</strong> often eccl., in the sense of <i>bruised, contrite;</i> sundrknosað hjarta, <i>a contrite heart,</i> Vídal. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knui"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knúi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a knuckle,</i> Rm. 8; hann herði hendrnar at hamarskaptinu svá at hvítnuðu knúarnir, Edda 28, Fms. vi. 106; á knjám ok knúum, v. 140.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knuska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knúska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to knock, ill-treat,</i> Fms. vii. 269, ix. 468, Fas. iii. 497.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knuskan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knúskan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>knocking.</i> Fms. ii. 87, viii. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knuta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., mod. hnúta:—<i>a knuckle-bone, joint-bone, head of a bone</i> (lær-knúta, <i>the hip joint</i>); blóð hljóp milli leggjarins ok knútunnar, Bs. i. 179, 253; hann tekr svá við knútunni, þar fylgir leggrinn með, Fas 67. <strong>knútu-kast,</strong> n. <i>a throwing with knuckle-bones,</i> a game, Bárð. 176.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knutottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knútóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>knotted,</i> Berl. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knútr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Engl. <i>knot;</i> Dan. <i>knud;</i> Swed. <i>knut</i>], <i>a knot,</i> Stj. 96, Bs. ii. 170; leysa knút, Edda 29, Fms. i. 112; ríða knút, <i>to tie a knot,</i> iii. 97, vii. 123; knýta knút, <i>to knit a knot,</i> Fb. i. 97; ef knútr losnar, gjaldi sá er knút knýtti, N. G. L. ii. 281: metaph., reið Nichulás knút á því, at hann mundi aldri lausar láta þær eignir, Sturl. iii. 144; rembi-knútr, a kind of <i>knot;</i> reipa-k.,—some of these references, esp. Fms. vii. l. c., as also several phrases, refer to a tale akin to that told in Arrian Anab. 2. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knykr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knykr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = fnykr (q. v.), Barl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knylla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knylla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [A. S. <i>cnyllan;</i> Engl. <i>knell</i>], <i>to beat with a blunt weapon;</i> þeir knylltu harm með keyrinu, Sturl. iii. 212.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knypri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knypri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cowering;</i> vefja sik í knypri, <i>to crouch together,</i> Konr.; see hnipr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knysking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knysking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = knúskan, Háv. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knytja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knytja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. hnytja, [knútr], <i>to knit together, truss;</i> nú knytja þau saman yxnina, Bret. 26; á sumri hey hnytja, Haligr., Snót.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knytlingar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knytlingar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the descendants of Cnut,</i> the old royal family of Denmark. <strong>Knytlinga-Saga,</strong> u, f. <i>the Saga of the</i> K.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knyttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., see úknyttr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyfill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýfill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., mod. hnýfill, <i>a short horn,</i> Hkr. i. 72, Fms. x. 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyflottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýflóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>short-horned,</i> Fms. viii. 243, Thom. 473.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. knýr, pl. knýjum; pret. knýði and knúði; part. pass. knúinn: [Scot. <i>know, knusc,</i> = <i>to press down with the fists and knees;</i> Swed. <i>knoga;</i> Dan. <i>knuge</i>]:—<i>to knock, press;</i> tvær kistur fullar af gulli, svá at eigi máttu tveir menn meira k. (<i>carry?</i>), Fms. xi. 24; knýið á, ok mun fyrir yðr upp lokið verða, Matth. vii. 7; hann knúði hurðina, <i>he knocked at the door,</i> Fms. vi. 122; knýr hausmagi hurð, bróðir, ok knýr heldr fast, Grett. 154; eptir þat knýja þeir þar á ofan stórt grjót, Fas. ii. 508:—<i>to press,</i> knýr hann þá þar til er þeir segja, Bs. ii. 227; páfinn knýr hann at eiðstafnum, 52; þeir knúðu fast árar með stórum bakföllum, Fas. i. 214; hann staðfestisk fyrir hellis-dyrum, knýði fast ok kallaði, Barl. 199; kný hann fast ok mæl þetta, … ok í því er Einarr var knúinn, Fms. vi. 280.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [knútr; A. S. <i>cnytan;</i> Engl. <i>knit;</i> Dan. <i>knytte</i>]:—<i>to knit, fasten by a knot, bind, tie;</i> ek knýtt silki-dregli um höfuð barninu, <i>id.,</i> Fms. xi. 2; leggr á ok knýtir við vagn, Bret. 26; knýta saman, <i>to knit together,</i> Skálda 180; hann knýtir saman halana í nautunum, Gísl. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bag, purse;</i> hón tekr upp grösin ok leggr knýtið undir höfuð sér, Fas. iii. 580, Bs. ii. 170; see knýti-skauti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knyti-skauti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýti-skauti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., prop. <i>a knotted sheet</i> or <i>kerchief, a bag, purse;</i> for the ancients used to keep money and precious things in kerchiefs knotted up and used as a purse, Bs. i. 337, 340, Ó. H. 148. Gísl. 19:—so also <strong>knýtil-skauti,</strong> a, m.; tók einn knýtilskauta ok leysir til, Ölk. 37; leysa til knýtilskauta, Fas. iii. 580: see knýti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knytir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knýtir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>knitter,</i> a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knorr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knörr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. knarrar, dat. knerri, n. pl. knerrir, acc. knörru; [A. S. <i>cnear</i>]:—<i>a ship,</i> esp. a kind of <i>merchant-ship,</i> opp. to langskip; hann hafði tvá knorru ok sextigu hermanna á hverjum, Fms. iii. 36; öll stórskip bæði knörru ok önnur, ix. 167; er betra at halda langskipum til hafnar en knörrum, Fas. i. 278; eptir þat kom Hængr með knörru tvá, Eg. 71, 79. 98, Lv. 100.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/knottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          knöttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. knattar, dat. knetti. pl. knettir, acc. knöttu:—<i>a ball,</i> Þorf. Karl. 426, Fms. iii. 186: þá var sullrinn sprunginn ok hlaupinn í þrjá knöttu, Bs. i. 178, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kobbi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kobbi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. popular name for <i>a seal,</i> kópr: a nickname, Fas. ii. 439.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/koddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          koddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Scot. and North. E. <i>cod;</i> Swed. <i>kudde</i>]:—<i>a pillow,</i> Str. 5, Dipl. iii. 4, v. 18, Vm. 109; kodda-ver, <i>a pillow-case,</i> freq. in mod. usage; silki-k., <i>a silk pillow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kodri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
