          className="link"
          href="/word/kofa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kofa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a young puffin;</i> teisti-k., lunda-k.: <strong>kofna-far,</strong> n., <strong>-tekja,</strong> u, f. <i>catching young puffins.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kofan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kofan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>kofarn,</strong> n. and <strong>kofarn-rakki,</strong> a, m. [cp. early Dan. <i>kofæn-rakkæ</i>]:—<i>a lap-dog,</i> N. G. L. i. 234 (spelt kofan): metaph. <i>a snappish person,</i> hann var et mesta kofarn í skapi, Finnb. 280.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/koffort"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
