        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>cofa</i>], used of <i>a convent cell,</i> 673. 55, Bs. i. 204, Landn. 50, Stj. 227, 471, D. N. passim, Mar.: <i>a hut, shed,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
