      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kok
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the gullet,</i> esp. of birds; ok víðka kokin vesallig, víandi láta mata sig, Bb. 2. 25, freq. in mod. usage. <strong>kok-mæltr,</strong> adj. <i>speaking in the gullet.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/koka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          koka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to gulp</i> like a gull.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kokkall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kokkáll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = Dan. <i>hanrej,</i> from Lat. <i>cuculus, a cuckold.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kokkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [for. word], <i>a cook;</i> kokks-hnífa grélur, Hallgr., (rare.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [A. S. <i>côl;</i> Engl. <i>coal;</i> O. H. G. and Germ. <i>kohlen;</i> Dan. <i>kul</i>]:—<i>coals, charcoal;</i> kurla, kvista, svíða kol, brenna kol, Grág. i. 200, ii. 295, Nj. 57, Ölk. 34; göra kol, Grág. ii. 297; leiri ok kolum, Fms. ii. 59; elda viði ok hafa til kola, Grág. ii. 211; brenna at köldum kolum (see kaldr), Fms. iii. 92, passim; kalda-kol (see kaldr), <i>cold ashes.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-bitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-bítr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘coal-biter,’ coal-eater,</i> a popular name of an idle youth sitting always at the fireside, cp. Dan. <i>askefis,</i> as also <i>aschbrödel</i> in the German legends; Starkaðr var hímaldi ok kolbítr ok lá í fleti við eld, Fas. iii. 18; hann hefir upp vaxit við eld ok verit kolbítr, ii. 114; Beigaldi var kolbítr, Eg. 109.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-blar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-blár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘coal-blue,’ dark blue, livid,</i> Eb. 172, Bs. i. 354, (from a blow): esp. of the sea, sjór kolblár, Nj. 19, Ld. 118, Fms. iv. 309.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-brenna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-brenna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>hot charcoal,</i> Eb. 120, Ölk. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-brun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-brún
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘Coal-brow,’</i> nickname of a lady, Fbr.; whence <strong>Kolbrúnar-skáld,</strong> n. nickname of a poet, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-dimmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-dimmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dark as coal,</i> of a dark night.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-fella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-fella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, (and <strong>kol-fellir,</strong> m.), <i>to lose utterly,</i> of a man who loses all his live stock from cold or hunger; hann kolfeldi, <i>he lost his all;</i> það varð kolfellir: it may be a metaph. from cutting wood for charcoal; or perhaps a remnant of an ancient Scandin. law term, preserved in early Swed., viz. <i>kull-svarf</i> = <i>the death of mother and child in childbirth,</i> and <i>kjöl-svarf</i> = <i>of husband, wife, and child, all perishing at sea,</i> see Schlyter. cp. Ld. ch. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-grof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kol-gröf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a charcoal pit,</i> Grág, ii. 333, Nj. 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kol-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
