          className="link"
          href="/word/koss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          koss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Ulf. <i>kukjan;</i> A. S. <i>cyss;</i> Engl. <i>kiss;</i> Germ. <i>kuss;</i> Dan. <i>kys;</i> Swed. <i>kyss</i>]:—<i>a kiss;</i> fylgja skal kveðju koss, a saying, Fsm. 48; eptir tárblandinn koss skilja þau, Fms. xi. 425; eigi tjáðu eiðar oss eða margir kossar, Vígl. (in a verse); hann sveigir hana at sér ok verða þá einstaka kossar, Fs. 88; með ástsamlegum kossi, Barl. 186; gefa e-m koss, Greg. 46; friðar-koss, <i>a kiss of peace,</i> Nd. 59; Júdas-koss, <i>a Judas-kiss;</i> ekki, Lafranz, vill ek kyssa þik, þvíat þat má vera, ef stundir líða, at þat kallir þú Júdas-koss, Bs. i. 842: in Hm. 81 kossa is corrupt for kosta (see kostr I. 4), for in law, kissing a maiden by stealth was a finable offence,—as in the case of the poet Kormak, Korm. ch. 24,—and if against her will it was liable to fjörbaugs-garðr, Grág. i. 337; cp. teygjattu þér at kossi konur, Sdm. 28; laun-koss, Grág. (Kb.) ii. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/koss-mildr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          koss-mildr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
