          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kostr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. kostar, pl. kostir, old acc. pl. kostu, which is used in old poets as Sighvat (Ó. H. 39), Arnór (Edda 50); but the usual form in the MSS. as well as in mod. usage is kosti; [Ulf. <i>kustus</i> = δοκιμή, 2 Cor. ii. 9, xiii. 3; Germ. and Dan. <i>kost</i> = <i>fare, food</i>]:—<i>a choice,</i> the fundamental notion being <i>trial;</i>",
            }
