              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to paw</i> or <i>scrabble with the hands;</i> ok kraflaði fyrir (frá?) nösunum, <i>he</i> (an exposed infant) <i>had pawed</i> (<i>the snow</i>) <i>from his face,</i> Fs. 60; still used, krafla fram úr e-u, <i>to crawl out of a strait.</i>",
