      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kredo"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kredo
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[for. word], indecl. = kredda, Fær. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [perh. akin to A. S. <i>cradel;</i> Engl. <i>cradle</i>], <i>a fondled person,</i> <strong>kreðu-legr,</strong> adj., Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krefda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krefða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., medic. <i>crusta lactea,</i> an infant’s disease, Ann. 1428, Fél. x. 8, passim in mod. usage, <strong>krefðu-sótt,</strong> f. = krefða, Ann. 1389.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krefja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krefja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. kref, krefjum; pret. krafði, subj. krefði; part. krafðr, krafinn; [A. S. <i>crafjan;</i> Engl. <i>crave;</i> Dan. <i>kræve</i>]:—<i>to crave, demand, to call on one,</i> with acc. of the person, gen. of the thing; or also, krefja e-n til e-s, krefja hann til utanferðar, Sturl. i. 214; verða sumir krafðir til at stýra, Sks. 263; ek em kominn at krefja þik at þú látir laust, Eg. 501; ok krafði síra Bjarna, at lúka sér þau átján hundruð, Dipl. iii. 13; ella krefi Guð hann andar sinnar, Sks. 720: at neita því er ek vil kraft hafa, Fms. xi. 225; ok kref ek ok bind ek álögum þriggja marka útlegð, Grág. i. 384; krefja e-n máls, Fms. vii. 162; engi þorði at krefja hann orða, <i>no one durst speak to him,</i> Edda 22: krefja fjár, Sturl. i. 48; krefi hann manna, K. Á. 70; konungr krafði þá leiðangrs, Fms. viii. 419; k. búendr liðs, Ó. H. 205; sá þótti mér ungr at krefja eiðsins, Edda 37; hann krafði dura, <i>he knocked at the door,</i> Fms. viii. 332, v. l.; krefja lukla, Vkv. 19, 21: with subj., kröfðu þeir at sveinninn færi með þeim, Fms. i. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kregd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kregð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. or <strong>kregða,</strong> u, f. <i>a wasting, pining,</i> of infants:—a nickname, Hrólfs S. Gaut. (Ed. 1664), p. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreik"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreik
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>walking, hobbling;</i> vera á kreiki.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreika"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreika
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Engl. <i>crouch,</i> cp. <i>crutch;</i> Germ. <i>kriechen</i>], <i>to walk</i> in a bent posture, <i>hobble;</i> kreikaðu réttr sonr minn, a ditty; freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreima
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [kröm], <i>a weak person;</i> hann er engin k.! (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, betttr <strong>kreysta,</strong> [cp. Ulf. <i>kriustan</i> = τρίζειν; Dan. <i>kryste;</i> Swed. <i>krysta</i>]:—<i>to squeeze, pinch, press,</i> Eb. 242, Fas. i. 285, Bær. 10, Bret. 10, Al. 2. 30, Fas. i. (in a verse, Bm.); hann kreisti sik undir vegginn, <i>he pressed himself, crouched under the wall,</i> Þórð. 75; kyssa ok k., <i>to kiss and hug,</i> Al. 44, Þiðr. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreisting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreisting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>pinching, squeezing,</i> Fas. iii. 502.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreklottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreklóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>crooked.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krellr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krellr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Germ. <i>kralle</i> = <i>a claw</i>], <i>spirit;</i> k. né dugr, Fas. i. 71; enginn k. er í yðr, <i>there is no spirit in you,</i> 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kremja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kremja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. kom, pl. kremjum; pret. kramði; part. kramiðr, kramdr, kraminn; [mid. H. G. <i>krimme;</i> see kröm, kramr]:—<i>to squeeze, bruise;</i> hann kramði hold af beinum, Fas. iii. 348, passim,—esp. of berries, grapes, or juicy things:—reflex. <i>to be pinched, to pine,</i> from a wasting sickness, margir krömðusk lengi þeir er lifðu, Fms. viii. 443; eitt sinn kom þar sótt mikil á bæ þeirra, ok krömðust margir lengi, Ísl. ii. 274.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krenkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krenkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [krankr; mid. H. G. <i>krenke;</i> Germ. <i>kränken</i>], prop. <i>to make sick, to hurt,</i> H. E. i. 434, 737; erinda-fjöldinn aldrei dvín | allmart vill það krenkja, Pál Vídal.; hjartað vill hræðslan krenkja, Pass.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krepja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krepja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>sleet,</i> = krap.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krepp-hendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krepp-hendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>cripple-handed,</i> a nickname, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a strait:</i> medic. <i>a being crippled: a scrape,</i> koma í slíkar kreppur, Ld. 264. <strong>kreppu-sótt,</strong> f. a kind of <i>scorbutic disease,</i> Fél. x. 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreppa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Engl. <i>cramp, crimp;</i> mid. H. G. <i>krimpfe;</i> cf. krappr, Germ. <i>krampf,</i> etc.], <i>to clench;</i> Grettir hafði kreppt fingrna at saxinu, Grett. 154 A; þá bindr hann ok kreppir, Stj. 96; kreppandi þá saman með sterkum knútum, id.; í hvers landi er hann kreppir (<i>catches</i>) eða merkir, Jb. 309; k. at e-m, <i>to pinch, press hard on one;</i> krepptu þeir svá at Þorgrími, at …, Sd. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krepping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krepping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a scrape,</i> Fms. iv. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kreppingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kreppingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>a handful,</i> Eg. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kretta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kretta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. kratt, a def. strong verb, <i>to maunder, murmur;</i> engi þorði um at kretta, Grett. 140 A, B; Uxi kratt jafnan um, Finnb. 280 C; þeir þoldu ílla, en krittu (kruttu?) um, Fas. i. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kriki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kriki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Engl. <i>creek</i>], <i>a ‘crack,’ nook,</i> freq. in mod. usage; handar-k., <i>the armpit.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krikt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krikt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. = krökt (q. v.), <i>swarming;</i> mjöl var krikt, <i>the flour was swarming,</i> as if with grubs and vermin, Völs. R. 229.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krikta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krikta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, = kretta; hann kvað þat skamsamlegt at k. um smáhluti, Fs. 31; þeir kriktu um, Fas. i. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krimta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krimta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to utter a sound;</i> láta ekki á sér k., <i>not to stir,</i> (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kring"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>kringum,</strong> adv. [akin or a twin word to kringr, with an initial tenuis]:—<i>round;</i> ganga í krók og í kring, <i>all around, round and round,</i> Fms. ii. 141; hringinn-í-kring, <i>all around;</i> skoða e-ð í krók og í kring:—í kringum, <i>around,</i> with acc.; hann gengr þrysvar rangsælis kringurn valinn, Fas. iii. 337; í kringum hann, Bárð. 180; á alla vega í kringum sik, Fas. i. 105; þú skalt róa í kringum skútuna, Háv. 46; í kringum hallina, Fb. ii. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kring-solast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kring-sólast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. [sól = <i>sun</i>], <i>to walk all round the dial,</i> as if bewildered.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the pullies</i> of a drag net; þar til er kringar koma á land, Gþl. 427.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>adroitness,</i> in orð-kringi, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>comical, funny,</i> (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, usually with prep. um, kringja um e-t, <i>to encircle, surround,</i> or, kringja umhverfis, <i>id.;</i> but also singly, with acc., þeir höfðu kringt svá um konung, Fms. viii. 67; þeir kringðu um kirkjuna, ix. 469; at eldr kringi umhverfis höfin, Sks. 205; kringdr umhverfis, id.; kappar Heinreks höfðu kringt um mik, Bær. 16; kringði Haraldr konungr með sinni fylking á bak jarli, Fms. vi. 407; Birkibeinar kringðu (<i>surrounded</i>) bæinn þegar, ix. 311: milit. <i>to outflank,</i> vér skulum hafa fylking langa svá at þeir kringi eigi um oss, Hkr. i. 150, Fms. vii. 178.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a disk, circle, orb;</i> hjólanna kringlur, Stj. 288; kringla heims, kringla jarðar, <i>the disk of the eartb,</i> Sks. 194, 200, 626, Hkr. (init.); með hvelum ok kringlum, Str. 17: the name of a MS., from its initial word, given to it by Torfæus, whence the mod. Heimskringla, <i>the Globe,</i> = the Book of the Kings of Norway, commonly ascribed to Snorri; the name first occurs in the Ed. of Peringsköld (A. D. 1697), and was unknown before that time: skoppara-k., <i>a top</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringlottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringlóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>round, circular;</i> hón (the earth) er kringlótt, Edda (pref.); tún kringlótt, Fms. vii. 97; hver kringlóttan, Stj. 564; k. gluggr, Sturl. iii. 186, Vm. 98; kringlótt hásæti, Bær. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringlu-auga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringlu-auga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a nickname, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringlu-leitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringlu-leitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>round-faced.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringlu-skurdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringlu-skurðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shaving the crown;</i> k. sem klerkar, Fb. ii. 196.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringlu-sott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringlu-sótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (mod. höfuðsótt), <i>the turning sickness</i> in sheep, Bs. i. 465.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>easy;</i> svá var honum kringr skáldskapr sem öðrum mönnum mál sitt, <i>verse-making was as easy to him as speaking to other men,</i> Fb. ii. 135: neut., e-m er e-t kringt, <i>a thing is easy to him, he is adroit in it;</i> mun þér kringra at hafa ljósa-verk at búi þínu, enn …, Nj. 185; jafn-kringt, <i>equally smooth,</i> Karl. 108, Sks. 381.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krisma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krisma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to anoint,</i> Rb. 82, Mar., Bs. i. 575.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krisma-ker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krisma-ker
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a chrism box,</i> Pm. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krisma-klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krisma-klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>chrism,</i> Dipl. iii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krisma-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krisma-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘chrism-spot,’</i> on the breast of infants, N. G. L. i. 339.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krismi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krismi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., <strong>krisma,</strong> u, f., H. E. i. 480, 482, ii. 137, [for. word; Gr. χρισμα]:—<i>chrism,</i> Fms. viii. 26, x. 372, K. Þ. K. 20, 72, Bs. i. 135.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krist-bu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krist-bú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘Christ-estate,’</i> i. e. <i>glebe-land</i> given for the support of the poor, Vm. 169; some deeds of the 12th century referring to such lands are published in D. I., Nos. 30–34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krist-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krist-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘Christ-fee,’</i> old Icel. eccl. name of property given for the support of the poor,—‘<i>Christfé</i> apud nos communiter dicitur quod pauperibus legatum est,’ H. E. iii. 98; gaf Sira Þórarinn fátækum frændum sínum mikit góz, ok setti mörg Kristfé í mörgum jörðum um Svarfaðardal, ok svá annars-staðar, Bs. i. 790, H. E. i. 430, Vm. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krist-kirkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krist-kirkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>Christ Church,</i> seems to have been a general name for cathedrals; a Kristkirkja is mentioned in Bergen, Drontheim, Borgund (Norway), Fb. iii, Boldt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krist-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krist-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘Christ-man,’ champion of Christ,</i> Ó. H. 204, 216; er nokkurr sá í þínu föruneyti, Kristmaðrinn, er meira hafi á degi vaxit, en vit braeðr, 202.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. a nickname, Fms. viii. 254.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristfjar-jord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristfjár-jörð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>glebe-land for the poor,</i> Vm. 152.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristfjar-umagi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristfjár-úmagi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a pauper maintained on Christfé,</i> Pm. 21, 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristiliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristiliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>in a Christian-like way,</i> Fs. 80, Bs. ii. 81, passim; ó-kristiliga, <i>cruelly, wickedly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>Christian;</i> Kristilig trú, K. Á. 74; Kristileg fræði, Kristilegt lögmál, Fms. x. 288, passim: <i>Christian-like,</i> ú-kristiligr, <i>unchristian-like, cruel, wicked.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristin-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristin-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Christendom, Christianity,</i> Sturl. i. 127, N. G. L. i. 203, passim: <i>matters ecclesiastical,</i> Gþl. 487. In old writers often in two words, see Kristinn. <strong>Kristindóms-bálkr,</strong> m. <i>the section containing the ecclesiastical law,</i> N. G. L. i. 339, Jb. 5, Bs. i. 697, 698.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristin-log"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristin-lög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the ecclesiastical law,</i> H. E. i. 437.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>Christian,</i> K. Þ. K. (init.), Nj. 158, Eg. 265, Bs. passim; vel Kristinn, <i>a good Christian,</i> observing the Christian rites, Eg. 265, Fms. i. 17; ílla Kristinn, <i>a bad Christian,</i> Mork. 227 (in a verse); enn Kristnasti maðr í Antiochia, <i>the best Christian in Antioch,</i> Clem. 38; Kristið morð, <i>the murder of a christened child,</i> opp. to heiðit morð, N. G. L. i. 340.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristinn-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristinn-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Christendom,</i> Sturl. i. 127 C; Kristins dóms, Hom. 99.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristinn-rettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristinn-réttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ecclesiastical law,</i> N. G. L. i. 352, H. E. i. 541 (note), passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristinnalaga-thattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristinnalaga-þáttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the section containing the</i> (Icel.) <i>ecclesiastical law,</i> Grág. (Kb.) 3; svá settu þeir Þorlákr biskup ok Ketill biskup, at ráði Özurar Erkibyskups ok Sæmundar ok margra kennimanna annarra, Kristinna laga þátt sem nú var tínt ok upp sagt, K. Þ. K. 140.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristinsdoms-rettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristinsdóms-réttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ecclesiastical law,</i> Jb. 5 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristín
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a pr. name, <i>Christina,</i> Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to Christianise,</i> Nj. 156, the Sagas passim: <i>to christen, baptize,</i> fæða skal barn hvert er borit verðr í penna heim, Kristna ok til Kirkju bera, N. G. L. i. 339: in mod. usage <i>to confirm.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>Christianity,</i> Nj. 157, Fms. i. 31, passim: <i>Christendom,</i> Guðs K., 655 xi. 1, Greg. 44, Bs. i. 575, ii. 105: <i>christening,</i> Hom. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristni-bod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristni-boð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (<strong>-boðan,</strong> f., Fms. i. 142), <i>preaching the Gospel,</i> Fms. i. 32, x. 393, Eb. 254.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristni-hald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristni-hald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>keeping Christianity,</i> Fms. ii. 236, Fb. ii. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristni-log"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristni-lög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. = kristinlög, Fb. ii. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristni-saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristni-saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. the name of <i>the Saga</i> of the introduction of Christianity into Iceland, Bs. i. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristni-spell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristni-spell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>breach, profanation of Christianity,</i> Valla L. 209, Fms. i. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>christening,</i> Stat. 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kristr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kristr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Christ,</i> see p. 93; cp. Hvíta-Kristr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krists-kirkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krists-kirkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = Kristkirkja.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krists-minni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krists-minni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>Christ’s toast,</i> a toast given in great banquets, probably answering to the grace in mod. times, Fms. vii. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krists-musteri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krists-musteri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘Christ-minster,’</i> = <i>Christ Church,</i> Rb. 368.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kria"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kría
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to cry</i> or <i>beg;</i> kría sér e-ð út, (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kria-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kría
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [this word does not occur in old writers, and may be derived from Swed. <i>kry,</i> from the brisk and lively temper of this bird]:—<i>a sea-bird, the tern,</i> Lat. <i>sterna;</i> from this restless and noisy bird comes the saying, vera einsog kriá á steini, or, einsog kría verpi, <i>to be restless and unsteady.</i> <strong>kríu-egg,</strong> n. <i>the egg of a</i> k. For an account of this bird, which abounds in Icel., see Eggert Itin. ch. 675; and for the curious lawsuit called Kríu-mál, see Espol. Árb. 1692, 1693.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kriari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kríari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a crier,</i> = Lat. <i>praeco,</i> Mar. (pref. p. xvii).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krikar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kríkar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. [kríki], <i>the thighs,</i> Fas. ii. 256.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krili"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kríli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [North. E. <i>creel</i>], <i>a small basket, creel.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krím
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>sod, grime;</i> augna-krím, <i>xerophthalmia,</i> Fél. ix.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krimugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krímugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>krímóttr,</strong> adj. <i>grimy,</i> of sheep with black cheeks.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krista-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krísta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to chirp,</i> onomatop.; það krístir í honum, of suppressed laughter.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krít
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Lat. <i>creta;</i> Germ. <i>kreide;</i> Dan. <i>kridt</i>], <i>chalk.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krjupa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krjúpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. krýp; pret. kraup. pl. krupu, subj. krypi; part. kropinn; [A. S. <i>creôpan;</i> Engl. <i>creep;</i> Swed. <i>krypa;</i> Dan. <i>krybe</i>]:—<i>to creep, crouch;</i> vóru dyrnar svá lágar at nær varð at k. inn, Hkr. ii. 379; hann kraup til fóta þeim, Ölk. 35; þóat ek krypa í neðstu smugur helvítis fylgsna, Sks. 605; gaf Sverrir konungr þeim mikit skak fyrir þat, er þeir höfðu kropit þar um hris at nokkrum silfrpenningum, Fms. viii. 143; vér krjúpum eigi í bug skjaldi, vi. 416 (in a verse); hann kvað konung hölzti lengi hafa kropit þar um lyng, Hkr. iii. 376; fékk hann nauðula kropit til at höggva virgulinn í sundr, Hom. 117; mátti hón eigi áðr krjúpa þangat áðr sem nú gékk hón, 115.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/krof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          krof
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. kryfja, and a lost strong verb krjúfa, krauf, krofinn, <i>to embowel</i>]:—<i>the cut-up carcase</i> of a slaughtered animal; nauts-k., sauðar-k., Dipl. v. 18, Sturl. iii. 262, Fas. ii. 114.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kropna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kropna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be crippled,</i> Hom. 114, O. H. L. 84: <i>to be clenched, stiffened,</i> var höndin kropnað at bréfinu, Róm. 248.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kropning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kropning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a kneeling,</i> Sturl. ii. 178.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kroppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kroppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to crop, pick;</i> þá settisk fluga ein á hönd honum ok kroppaði, Edda 69; kroppa gras, <i>to crop grass, graze.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kroppin-bakr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kroppin-bakr
        </a>
        <p
