          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunn-göra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to make known, publish,</i> Dipl. iii. 5, 9, Fas. i. 28, iii. 189.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunn-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunn-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a female acquaintance,</i> Ó. H. 196, Greg. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunn-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunn-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>-leiki,</strong> a, m.), <i>knowledge, intelligence;</i> göra e-m e-t í kunnleika, <i>to inform a person of,</i> Fms. vi. 400, vii. 33, Ísl. ii. 182, Bs. i. 717, Fs. 21; e-m er k. á e-n, <i>to know, be informed of,</i> Grág. ii. 343; var honum allr k. á Brynjólfi, <i>he knew B. very well,</i> Eg. 162, Rd. 285; ef þeir eru hér sumir, er eigi er þat í kunnleika, <i>who does not know,</i> Fms. viii. 313; ok má þat opt annarr vita er öðrum er eigi í kunnleika, Bret. 99.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunn-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunn-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>intimately, as an old acquaintance;</i> kveðjask k., Fb. i. 272; þessi maðr kvaddi Þorgils kunnliga, Ld. 276; vitja mín k., Fs. 131; Þorgils skyldi k. senda menn til Sigurðar, Fms. vii. 220; vitja þú k. Þorkels Geysu, hvenar sem þú þykisk þess við þurfa, vi. 223; þá leita þú k. á fund þess manns er …, 224; látask k. við, Fs. 88; kunnliga ríða þeir þó, 105.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunn-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunn-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a friend, acquaintance,</i> Hkr. ii. 3, Fms. viii. 15, MS. 732. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunn-mid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunn-mið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a word of unknown sense in Orkn. 386; prob. corrupt from some Gaelic local name.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. (in pret. form) kann, kannt (kanntú), kann; pl. kunnum, kunnut, kunnu (mod. kunnum, kunnit, kunna); pret. kunni; subj. kynni; imperat. kunn; part. neut. kunnat; the pres. infin. kunnu for kunna is obsolete, whereas a pret. infin. kunnu, <i>potuisse,</i> occurs, Ísldr. 9: with neg. suff. kann-at, Hm. 147; kann-k-a ek, <i>I know not,</i> Skálda (Thorodd) 167, Hallfred; see Gramm. p. xxiii: [Ulf. <i>kunnan</i> = γιγνώσκειν, εἰδέναι; A. S. and Hel. <i>cunnan;</i> O. H. G. <i>kunnan;</i> in these old languages, the two senses of <i>knowing how to do</i> and <i>being able to do</i> are expressed by the same form, and this remains in Dan. <i>kunde,</i> Swed. <i>kunna:</i> in others, a distinction is made: Old Engl. and Scot. <i>ken, know</i> and <i>can;</i> Germ. <i>kennen</i> and <i>können.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnand-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnand-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>want of knowledge,</i> N. G. L. i. 346, 361.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>knowledge,</i> Edda 31, Bær. 19, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnasta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnasta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>kunnusta,</strong> u, f. [Germ. <i>kunst</i>], <i>knowledge, knowing,</i> Jb. 353 B, Fms. vi. 95, Edda (pref.), H. E. ii. 59: with the notion of <i>witchcraft,</i> Fms. i. 8, Stj. 101, Landn. 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnatta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnátta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>knowledge,</i> Edda (pref.), Fms. iii. 184, freq. in mod. usage: as also of knowing by heart, þetta er engin kunnátta!—<i>magical knowledge,</i> Eb. 44, Landn. 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnig-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnig-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>information, knowledge,</i> of a thing, Fas. i. 9: <i>familiarity, acquaintance.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., mod. <strong>kunnugr: I.</strong> [kunna],",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunningi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunningi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a friend, acquaintance,</i> but less than vinr; vinir ok kunningjar, Eg. 116, Fms. ii. 5, 308, iv. 379, vi. 329, xi. 262, Fs. 8, Sks. 447; forn-k., <i>an old acquaintance.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., older <strong>kuðr,</strong> which form is freq. in poets, Hm. 56, and in old MSS.; dat. fem. sing. kuðri (<i>notae</i>) rhymed with Súðvík (<i>Southwark</i>), Ó. H. (in a verse), as in the compds ú-kuðr etc.; [Goth. <i>kunþs;</i> A. S. <i>cuð,</i> whence Engl. <i>un-couth,</i> prop. = <i>strange;</i> Germ. <i>kund</i>]:—<i>known;</i> vil ek göra þér kunnt, hvat vera skal um þínn hag, 655 ix. A. 2; var mér kunnara um Bárð. Eg. 39; þér munu kunnar leiðir, Fms. i. 71; jókk því es mér varð síðan kunnara, Íb. (pref.); jafn-kunnr; Björn var frægr maðr ok mörgum kuðr (kunnr, Ó. H. 53, l. c.) at sýn ok at máli, Hkr. ii. 78: <i>familiar,</i> grannar þínir ok kunnir menn, <i>neighbours and friends,</i> Hom. 151; vinir hans ok kunnir menn, Sks. 109; þeir vóru mjök kunnir áðr, <i>intimate friends,</i> Ld. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnug-lega"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnug-lega
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., mod. for kunnlega, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnug-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnug-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., mod. for kunnleikr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnustu-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnustu-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ignorant,</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunnustu-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunnustu-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>ignorance,</i> N. G. L. i. 346.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kunta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kunta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>cunnus.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurfaldi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurfaldi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a coal cutter</i> (?), <i>a mean churl,</i> cp. Dan. <i>kulsvier,</i> Fms. vi. 363 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurfl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurfl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., proncd. <strong>kurl,</strong> <i>cuttings of wood for charcoal.</i> Fas. iii. 356, freq. in mod. usage: the saying, það koma ekki öll kurl til grafar, <i>not all the cuttings come into the coalpit,</i> of waste.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurfla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurfla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. <strong>kurla,</strong> <i>to chop</i> kurfl; kurflaðr viðr, Jb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a chip, a cut-off piece;</i> hann hafði í hendi af spjótbroti lítinn kurf, Karl. 329: flugu kurfarnir yfir höfuð þeim, Art. 82.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>kuðr,</strong> Skíða R. 34, for the sake of rhyme):—<i>a murmur, grumbling, uproar;</i> staðnaði þá kurr búandanna, Ó. H. 69, Hkr. i. 142; þá varð þegar kurr mikill af bóndum, Fms. i. 33; hann lét þá eigi heyra íllan kurr kaupmanna, Nj. 124; kurr nokkurr hafði verit í herinum, Fms. ix. 497, v. l.; engi þorði þenna kurr djarflega upp at kveða, Ó. H. 51; sögðu þeir honum kurr bónda um fjár-drátt, Fms. vi. 191.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurr-hugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurr-hugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. or <strong>kúr-hugr,</strong> <i>low spirits;</i> vera í kúrhuga, <i>to be concerned, anxious,</i> Fms. ix. 462; hann bað menn eigi vera í kurrhuga um þetta, 478, Thom. 400.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>kurre,</i> of the <i>whirr</i> of birds of the grouse kind], <i>to murmur, grumble;</i> hvat sem ér Danir kurrit, Fms. xi. 246; kurraði þat hverr í sínum híbýlum, Sturl. iii. 127; vinnumenn ok þrælar kurruðu um þat, at …, Fms. i. 33; bændr kurruðu ílla, Orkn. 40; kurruðu bændr mjök, Fms. vi. 191; hví sitja bændr eigi niðr ok hlýða eyrendi, en kurra eigi svá, Fb. ii. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [for. word], <i>courtesy, chivalry, good manners;</i> þá kurt (<i>chivalrous feat</i>) nam ek í Húnalandi, Þiðr, 57, Konr. 9; með kurt ok hævesku. Fas.: freq. in poets of the 15th to the 17th centuries, enga ber kurt, Hallgr.; hjartað mitt er hlaðit með kurt, a ditty, Ísl. Þjóðs. ii. 303.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurteisi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurteisi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (<strong>korteisi,</strong> Fms. x. 381, 393), <i>courtesy, feat of chivalry, fine manners, grace;</i> yfirlit ok k., Nj. 17, of a lady; góðra siða ok k., Sks. 242; görum þá k. (<i>good manners</i>), segir Hrafn at vit færum þetta eigi í kappmæli, ok látum konung ráða, Ísl. ii. 236; kurteisis-kona, Fms. ii. 21: <i>chivalry,</i> hann lét kenna honum alls-konar k., i. 17; riddaraskap ok k., x. 381; manna bezt at sér görr í allri k., 393: <i>pomp,</i> með svá miklu drambi ok k., 232.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kurteisliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kurteisliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>courteously, gracefully;</i> heilsa k., Fms. i. 78: <i>splendidly, stately,</i> tjalda þeir búð sína vel ok k., Ld. 104; en er svá k. var komit ráða-hag Dagfinns, Odd. 32: <i>gently, with dignity,</i> bar hann svá k. sinn harm, Ld. 228.",
