      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kveld-ulfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kveld-úlfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Eg.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kveld-vaka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kveld-vaka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>eve-wake,</i> the time between twilight (rökkr) and bed-time, when people sit and work by candle-light, also simply called vaka.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kveld-verdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kveld-verðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a supper.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kvelda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kvelda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. <strong>kvölda,</strong> <i>to draw towards evening;</i> er kveldaði, Fms. iii. 114, vi. 156, Hkr. i. 24, Fs. 14; nú tekr at k., Al. 81; þá var svá kveldat, at …, Fms. xi. 63; vert þú hjá oss, þvíat kvölda tekr og á daginn líðr, Luke xxiv. 29: absol., áðr en þessi dagr kveldi, MS. 4. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kveldmaltidar-sacramenti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kveldmáltíðar-sacramenti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the Holy Communion.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kvelja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kvelja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. kvel, pret. kvaldi, part. kvalðr, kvaliðr, kvalinn; with neg. suff., imperat. kvelj-at, Vkv. 31; [A. S. <i>cweljan;</i> Engl. <i>to quell, kill;</i> Hel. <i>quellian</i> = <i>cruciare;</i> Germ. <i>quälen;</i> Dan. <i>quæle;</i> Swed. <i>quälja</i>]:—<i>to torment;</i> mátti enga skemtan af hafa at kvelja þá, Eg. 232; at hann mundi svá vilja kvelja hana, Fms. vi. 352; ek skal alla vega láta k. Markvarð, Mag. 2; at eigi kveli bruna-þefr bókanna þá menn er …, 656 B. 1; ekki má verra vera en öfund sú, er kvelr af anuars góðu, Hom. 21; hann barðisk allan dag í gegn mér ok kvaldi mik, Fms. viii. 240; kvelit mik ekki lengr, Anal. 186; Grímhildr kvelr bræðr sína, Þiðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kveljari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kveljari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘killer,’ tormenter,</i> 656 B. 5, Al. 78.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kvelli-sjukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kvelli-sjúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ailing;</i> ekki hefi ek verit k., Ld, 54, Eg. 126.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/kvelli-sott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          kvelli-sótt
        </a>
        <p
