            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to fill a bag, to fill one’s belly</i> with a thing; kýla vömb sína á miði ok mungáti, Fs. 4, Fms. i. 493; kemba lömb | kýla fulla þeirra vömb, Jón Þorl.; kýla öl, <i>to tipple ale, drink hard,</i> Fms. vii. 190.",
            }
