        >
          kögur-barn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Norse <i>koggebarn</i>], prop. <i>a ‘swaddled-bairn,’ a bantling, infant,</i> as a term of abuse, Fas. ii. 232.",
            }
