        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>latrún,</strong> m. [from Lat. <i>latro, -nis</i>], <i>a robber,</i> Al. 68, Stj. 91.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          laf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a lap;</i> kjól-laf, hempu-laf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laf-hraeddr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          laf-hræddr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>quivering, quaking from fear,</i> Gísl. 60, Hem.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laf-skeggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          laf-skeggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘wag-beard,’</i> a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lafa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lafa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. lafi, pret. lafði, pass. pret. neut. lafað:—<i>to hang, dangle,</i> as a flap; loddi köggullinn á sinunum—þá mælti Oddi, lát lafa, muna þeir mein er þiggja, Lv. 86; kom á fótinn við öklat, ok tók af svá at lafði við, Sturl. ii. 70; þat it litla ok vesalliga (höfuð) sem lafir á þínum hálsi, Bjarn. 68: metaph. <i>to dangle,</i> ok þykki mér sem ekki torfæri sé á leið minni þóttú lafir á stigum, Fs. 32; lengi hefi ek lifat í haugi mínum ok lafat á fé, Fas. ii. 271.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lafdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lafði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [from Early Engl. <i>lefdye;</i> Engl. <i>lady;</i> A. S. <i>hlæfdige;</i> but borrowed at a time when the initial aspirate had already been lost in the Engl.]:—<i>a lady,</i> Sks. 455, 457, MS. 4. 7, and now and then in mod. poetry, but the word never took root.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lafranz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lafranz
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a pr. name = <i>Lawrence,</i> Bs.: <strong>Lafranz-dagr,</strong> m., <strong>-messa,</strong> u, f., <strong>-vaka,</strong> u, f. <i>the day, mass, vigil of St. Lawrence,</i> Bs., Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
