            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the taking land, landing,</i> Korm. 228, Eb. 332, Nj. 267, Eg. 159, Fas. ii. 231: mod. also <i>a landing-place,</i> þar er góð, íll landtaka, etc.",
            }
          }
