        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a land tent,</i> originally a naut. term, a tent pitched ashore when in harbour, opp. to the tents on board, often in plur., Nj. 157, Hkr. i. 26, Stj. 45; landtjald Drottins, <i>the Lord’s Tabernacle,</i> Sks. 146, 780.",
            }
          }
