        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj.; eiga landvært, <i>to have residence in the country open to one,</i> opp. to the being outlawed or under ban, Bs. i. 675, Grág. i. 209, Glúm. 382, Fms. v. 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/land-vaettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          land-vættr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the guardian spirits of a country,</i> abiding in mountains, rivers, etc., in the shape of giants, fairies, animals, see the interesting story in Hkr. Ó. T. ch. 37, as also Landn. 258, (for the references see höfuð A. V); sný ek þessu níði á landvættir þær er land þetta byggja, Eg. 389; þat sá úfreskir menn, at landvættir allar fylgðu Hafrbirni til þings en þeim Þorsteini til veiða ok fiskjar, Landn. 271.",
            }
          }
        />
