      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/launa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          launa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to reward,</i> with dat. of the person, acc. of the thing for which the reward is given, but dat. of the gift itself; þeir hafa yðr (dat.) þat (acc.) engu launat nema íllu, Fms. i. 84; íllum huga launaðir þú þá góðar gjafir, Hbl. 21; hví mundi hann oss (dat.) þat eigi góðu launa, Fb. ii. 38; íllu mun þér launat verða, Nj. 38; ok skal ek þat vel launa þér, Edda 23; þat þarf eigi at launa sem eigi er gört, a saying, Grett.; ú-launaðr, <i>unrewarded;</i> var-launaðr, <i>scantily rewarded;</i> eiga e-m varlaunat, <i>to be indebted, be under an obligation to one,</i> Karl. 198: <i>to pay,</i> fyrir penning hvern er smiðar skolu launa, N. G. L. i. 101; launa e-t af sér, <i>to work out, pay in work done,</i> Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/launung"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          launung
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>concealment, secrecy;</i> esp. in adverb. phrases, af (á, með) launungu, <i>secretly,</i> Nj. 103, v. l.; mjök á launungu, Fms. i. 66, viii. 368; með launungu, Bs. i. 622: in mod. usage singly, mér er engin launung á því, <i>‘tis no matter of secrecy for me.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
