          className="link"
          href="/word/laupr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          laupr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. and Old Engl. <i>leap</i>; still used in Lancashire for <i>a weel</i> or <i>fishing-basket</i>]:<i>—a box</i> or <i>basket,</i> in Icel. of lattice-work, to carry on the back, also called meiss, q. v.; lauprinn er hann bar sveininn, Fms. x. 217, Vápn. 16, Vm. 98; selja salt í laupum, N. G. L. ii. 254: in Norway esp. of <i>a measure of butter,</i> Gþl. 491, 493, 524 (smjör-laupr), D. N. passim; kol-laupr, q. v.; ef munda þik hafa upp fætt í ull-laupi mínum (<i>my wool basket</i>) ef ek vissa at þú mundir einatt lifa, Orkn. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
