              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘low-chant’</i> in the Roman Catholic mass when the host was elevated, Bs., Hom., H. E. passim; lágasöngva bók, kver, skrá, <i>the book (scroll) containing the low-chants,</i> Vm., Ám., Pm.",
