        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>‘lode-saying,’ guidance,</i> Ld. 74, Fms. viii. 52, Bs. ii. 96, Stj. 286: esp. <i>piloting.</i> <strong>leiðsögu-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a ‘lode-sayer,’ guide,</i> Fs. 105, Gullþ. 5, Fms. vii. 52: esp. <i>a lodesman, pilot,</i> Gþl. 96, Jb. 386, Nj. 122, Rétt. 6. 3.",
            }
