      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lektor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lektor
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Lat. word], <i>a reader,</i> Ver. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lem-heyrdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lem-heyrðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>deaf,</i> Anecd. 2 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [lamb], <i>to lamb;</i> lembd ær, <i>a ewe with lamb,</i> Stj. 185, Grág. i. 502.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>lameness,</i> from a blow, N. G. L. i. 30, 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. lem; pret. lamði; part. lamiðr, Glúm. 342; imperat. lem, lemdu, Skíða R. 131; lamdr, and mod. also laminn, Mar. 637: [A. S. <i>læman;</i> provinc. Engl. <i>lam</i> = <i>to thrash;</i> Germ. <i>lähmen</i>]:—<i>to thrash, flog, beat,</i> so as <i>to lame</i> or <i>disable;</i> urðu þar áttján menn sárir en margir lamðir, Fms. ix. 355; lemja mun ek bogann fyrir honum ef ek má, x. 362; Þorbjörn bað hann starfa betr, ella kvaðsk hann mundu lemja hann, Grett. í 20; þeir lömðu hann náliga til bótleysis, 154; lamðan til heljar, Am. 41; ok lemða (subj.) alla í liðu, Ls. 43; ok ætt jötuns alla lamði, Þkv. 31; munu eigi öll úlamið (neut. pl.), Glúm. 340; lemja í smátt, <i>to smash,</i> Mar.; lamða (<i>lame</i>), halta ok blinda, Greg. 28; fugli með lamðum vængjum, Hom. 142: lemja á e-m, <i>to ‘lam into one,’ give one a thrashing,</i> Skíða R. 135.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lempa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lempa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ad, [a mod. for. word borrowed from the Dan. <i>læmpe;</i> cp. A. S. <i>limpan</i>]:—<i>to temper, accommodate;</i> lempa sig eptir e-u.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lempinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lempinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>lempiligr,</strong> adj. <i>pliable, gentle.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemstr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. lemstrar, <i>a severe contusion;</i> lemstr málhelti minnar, Hom. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemstr-hogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemstr-högg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a blow causing contusion,</i> D. N. iv. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemstra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemstra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to contuse.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lemstrar-sar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lemstrar-sár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a disabling wound,</i> Gþl. 180, Ann. 1398.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lend"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lend
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. lendir, mod. also lendar; [A. S. <i>lenden;</i> Old Engl. <i>lendes;</i> Scot. <i>lendis;</i> Engl. <i>loins;</i> O. H. G. <i>lenti; Germ. lende</i>]:—<i>the loin;</i> the mod. usage distinguishes between the sing., <i>the loin</i> or <i>croup</i> of a horse and pl. lendar of the human <i>loins;</i> lendir yðrar skulu þér gyrða, Hom. 84 (Luke xii. 35); munu konungar út af þínum lendum fæðask, Stj., Sks. 404; undir herðum, lendum, knés-botum, Edda 40; lenda-kláði, Fas. iii. 102:—of a horse, hann flær af henni alla baklengjuna aptr á lend, Grett. 91; á lend hestinum, Nj. 91; hann klappar á lend hestinum, Bs. i. 633; um höfuð, lend, brjóst ok kvið ok allan hest, Sks. 404. <strong>lenda-verkr,</strong> m. <i>‘loin-work,’ lumbago,</i> Pr. 471, Ld. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lend-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lend-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘land-born,’ of the landed gentry,</i> Eg. 342, Fms. viii. 155.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lend-van"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lend-ván
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>expectance of a fief,</i> N. G. L. i. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lenda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lenda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>land, fields;</i> hann átti hundruð kúgilda á leigu-stöðum ok tíu lendur, Sturl. i. 97; víðar lendur ok fagrar, Ld. 96; lendur ok lausa-fé, Fms. i. 289.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lenda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lenda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, mod. t, [land], <i>to land,</i> Fms. vii. 31, viii. 33, ix. 23, Eb. 234, Ld. 32, passim: lenda skipi, Fbr. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lendi-stod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lendi-stöð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a landing-place,</i> N. G. L. i. 243, 380, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lending"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lending
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a landing, landing-place,</i> Lv. 93, Fms. ii. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>landed,</i> esp. as a law term; lendr maðr, lendir menn, = <i>‘landed-men’</i> or <i>the barons</i> of ancient Scandinavia, <i>holding land</i> or <i>emoluments</i> (veizlur) <i>from the king,</i> and answering to hersir (q. v.) of a still earlier time; heita þeir hersar eða lendir menn í Danskri tungu, Edda 93; gjörði konungr þá Þórólf lendan mann, ok veitir honum þá allar veizlur þær er áðr hafði Bárðr haft, Eg. 35, Sks. 5, Fms. i. 60, ix. 496, Gþl. 12, and passim in the Laws and Sagas, but never referring to the Icel. Commonwealth.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lengd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lengd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [langr], <i>length</i> of space and time, Bret. 32, Stj. 74, Fms. viii. 88, Eg. 318, Alg. 372, Barl. 165:—gramm., Skálda 175: <i>lengthening,</i> Sks. 119.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lengi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lengi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., the compar. <strong>lengr</strong> is used in a temp. sense, <strong>lengra</strong> in a local sense, see langr; [Dan. <i>længe</i>]:<i>—long, for a long time;</i> lengi hefir mér þat í hug verit, Nj. 2; hversu lengi? 141; eigi lengi, Ld. 168; of lengi, <i>too long;</i> svá lengi sem, <i>as long as,</i> Rb. 64; ok eru þeir þá miklu lengst niðri, <i>by far the longest time,</i> id.; ok þolir eigi inni lengr, <i>could no longer ‘thole’</i> or <i>endure it,</i> Fær. 269, passim; lengr en skemr, <i>rather long than short, for a good while,</i> Bs. i. 155; til þess at lengr en skemr frestaðisk þat níðingsverk, Al. 105: á-lengr (q. v.), <i>hereafter:</i> lengr er, <i>until;</i> lengr er lyriti er varit at lögbergi, K. Þ. K. (Kb.) i. 18; lengr er þeir hafa sýnt biskupi, 22: with gen., lengi vetrar, <i>for a long part of the winter,</i> Fbr. i. 334; lengi æfi, <i>during a long part of one’s life,</i> 224; lengi dags, lengi nætr, and so on.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lenging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lenging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>lengthening,</i> Fms. iii. 12; mála-lenging, <i>prolongation.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, [langr], <i>to lengthen;</i> var lengt nafn hans, <i>there was added to his name,</i> Fms. vi. 16; lengja líf sitt, i. 126; þarf eigi at lengja sögu um þat mál, <i>it boots not to tell a long tale,</i> xi. 9; lengja leið sína, Eg. 742; orð-lengja, <i>to lengthen out words;</i> hvat þarf þat lengja, <i>what need to make a long story?</i> Karl. 374, 427.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lengrum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lengrum
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see langr III. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lengstum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lengstum
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., see langr III. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lent"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lent
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>Lent,</i> in the words of John the Fleming, Nú er komin Lentin …, Ekki skilr fólkit hvat Lentin er, Bs. i. 801.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lenz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lenz
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [for. word; Lat. <i>lancea</i>], <i>a lance,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leo"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          leó
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [for. word; Lat. <i>leo</i>], <i>a lion,</i> Fms. vii. 69, Fbr. 34, Nj. 143, Þiðr. 190, Stj. 71, 411, Plac.; this Lat. form is freq. in old writers; the prop. Icel. form is ljón, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leon"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          león
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a lion</i>, Fb. i. 165, Fms. vii. 69, Stj. 71, 231, 459; <i>ljóns</i> í hvassar <i>sjónir,</i> Sighvat; yet the vellums hardly ever use the mod. spelling ljón, but léon:—the word is masc., Þiðr. 190, Pr. 402, 434. <strong>leóns-hvelpr,</strong> m. <i>a lion’s whelp,</i> Stj. 231.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          leóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a lioness,</i> Stj. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lepardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          leparðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>leoparðr,</strong> m. [for. word], <i>a leopard,</i> Al. 167, Art.; the Icel. form is hlébarðr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lepja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lepja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. lep, lapti; part. lapit; [A. S. <i>lapian;</i> Engl. <i>lap</i>]:—<i>to lap</i> like a dog; this word seems not to occur in old writers, but is freq. in mod. usage and undoubtedly old.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leppa-klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          leppa-klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>slashed clothes,</i> Rétt. 40, 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leppa-ludi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          leppa-lúði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a monster,</i> the husband of the ogress Grýla (q. v.), Maurer’s Volks.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          leppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Engl. <i>lump</i>], <i>a lock of hair;</i> fá mér leppa tvá ór hári þínu, Nj. 116; hann skar ór lepp ór hári þess manns, Fas. i. 528; hann hafði ljósan lepp í hari sínu hinum vinstra megin, Hrafn. 13: ok tók ek einn lepp ór tagli hans, Fb. i. 354; miðla mér í mót lepp ór maga-skeggi þínu, Fms. vi. 141; the word is obsolete in this sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lepra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lepra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [a Lat. word], <i>leprosy,</i> Fas. ii. 390; in mod. vulg. usage <i>diarrhœa.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lepsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lepsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a rag, piece of cloth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[cp. lara], in compds, sótt-lera, ætt-leri, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lerka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lerka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Scot. <i>lerk</i>], <i>to lace tight;</i> var höttrinn lerkaðr um hálsinn, Landn. 147; lerka ermar at öxl … drambhostir lerkaðar at beini, Fms. vi. 440: metaph. <i>to chastise</i> [cp. North. E. <i>to lace</i>], lerkandi sína sál, Mar.; hann lerkaði sinn líkam með föstum, Thom.:—part. lerkaðr, <i>bruised, contused;</i> blár ok lerkaðr af stórum höggum, Fas. iii. 357: in mod. usage <i>feeling</i> as if sore all over the body.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/les"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          les
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
