              "__html": "t, [Lat. <i>laedere,</i> by Grimm’s law, <i>t</i> for <i>d</i>], <i>to break up, injure, wreck;</i> lesta skip, <i>to wreck one’s ship,</i> Eg. 159; lesta hús at lásum eða viði, Grág. ii. 110: impers. <i>to be wrecked,</i> ok lesti þar skipit, Fms. x. 158; þá er bæði (<i>both ships</i>) lesti Hjálp ok Fífu, Orkn. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
