        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in., gen. leygjar and leygs, [akin to logi], <i>a lowe, fire, flame,</i> freq. in old poetry, singly as well as in compds, but never used in prose; esp. freq. in poët. circumlocutions of <i>gold</i> and <i>weapons;</i> báru-leygr, <i>the waves’ beam</i> = <i>gold;</i> arm-leygr, <i>the flasb of the arm</i> = <i>a bracelet;</i> und-leygr, <i>the flash of a wound,</i> of blood, of Odin, etc. = <i>a weapon,</i> see Lex. Poët. <strong>leyg-för,</strong> f. <i>a fire</i> (Lat. <i>incendium),</i> Fms. ix. 533 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
