        >
          leynd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>secrecy, hiding;</i> til leyndar, Fms. x. 383, Sks. 365; með leynd, <i>secretly,</i> Stj. 200, Rd. 235, Ísl. ii. 199, Fms. x. 380, passim; leyndar-bréf, -erendi, <i>a secret letter, secret errand,</i> viii. 128, ix. 341, Stj. 383.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/leyndar-domr"
