        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., with the article léinn, Fms. vii. 264; acc. sing. lia, Korm. 38; ljáinn, Fb. i. 522; plur. learnir, Edda 48; dat. lianum (ljánum), id.; acc. pl. lia (= ljá), id.: the mod. form is nom. <strong>ljár,</strong> gen. ljás, dat. and acc. ljá; the nom. ljár occurs in Fb. i. 522: [North. E. <i>ley, lea;</i> Dan. <i>lee</i>; Swed. <i>lia</i>]:—<i>a scythe;</i> hinn deigi lé, Mkv.; hvass lé, Flóv. 25; stæltr lé, Grág. i. 501; dengja ljá, ii. 211; orb ok nýjan ljá, Fb. i. 522; ljá í langorfi, Korm. 38; stafn-ljá (dat.), <i>an entering hook,</i> Fms. vii. 264.",
