          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liðs-þurfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>in need of help,</i> Fms. vii. 265, xi. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lids-thurft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liðs-þurft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>need of help,</i> Fms. viii. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lidsmanna-konungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liðsmanna-konungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(cp. A. S. <i>lið-man</i> = <i>a sailor),</i> the surname of a mythical king, Sturl. i. 23, Fas. ii. 154.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lidugliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liðugliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>willingly, readily,</i> Fms. iii. 119.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lidugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liðugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Germ. <i>ledig</i>], <i>ready, willing,</i> 655 xxxii. 2: <i>free, unhindered,</i> lauss ok liðugr, Stj. 59; skal Grettir fara liðugr þangat sem hann vill, Grett. 147; lofið mér liðugan gang! Safn i. 69: <i>unoccupied, disengaged,</i> Fs. ii. 80, Sturl. iii. 244, H. E. i. 422: <i>free of payment,</i> B. K. 119, Jb. 256; kvittr ok liðugr, Dipl. iii. 1, v. 21: <i>easy, flowing</i> (of language), með liðugri Norrænu, Bs. ii. 121: <i>yielding,</i> Fms. v. 299: <i>agile, alert,</i> in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lidungar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liðungar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men from Lið</i> in Norway, in the county Vík, near to Oslo (Christiania), Ann. 1308; cp. <i>Lið-vicingas</i> in the old Anglo-Saxon poem Widsith.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., see lyf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lif-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lif-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., see lyfsteinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. lifi; pret. lifði; imperat. lif, lifðú, an older form lifi, 655 iv. 1, Stj. 445; neut. part. lifat, masc. lifðr, Hm. 69: there was a strong verb lifa, leif, lifu, lifinn, of which leifa is the causal, but of this word nothing now remains except the part. acc. lifna (<i>vivos</i>), Hkv. 2. 27, and dat. lifnum (<i>vivo</i>), 45: [Ulf. <i>lifan</i> = ζην; A. S. <i>lifan;</i> Engl. <i>live</i>; O. H. G. <i>leban;</i> Germ. <i>leben;</i> Swed. <i>lefva;</i> Dan. <i>leve;</i> a word common to all Teut. languages, the original sense of which was <i>to be left,</i> and so akin to leifa, = Lat. <i>superstes esse,</i> which sense still remains in some Icel. phrases; cp. also lifna.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. <i>af-lifnan</i> = περιλείπεσθαι; Swed. <i>lämna;</i> Dan. <i>levne</i>]:—<i>to be left;</i> en þeir er lifnuðu (<i>those who were left alive</i>) iðruðusk lögbrota, Sks. 675 B; engir afkvistir munu þar af lifna (<i>to be left</i>) í þessu landi, Fb. ii. 299; en þóat einn leifr lifni eptir, N. G. L. i. 371.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>life, conduct of life,</i> Stj. 55, 223, freq. in mod. usage: ó-lifnaðr, <i>a wicked life.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. sing. and nom. pl. lifrar: [A. S. <i>lifer;</i> Engl. <i>liver;</i> Germ. <i>leber</i>]:—<i>the liver</i>, Fbr. 137, Edda 76, Stj. 309, Grett. 137, passim: blóð-lifr, <i>coagulated blood.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifr-raudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifr-rauðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>liver coloured, dark red.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., poët. <i>a sister,</i> Bragi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifradr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifraðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>stewed with liver,</i> Snót.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lifri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lifri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., poët. <i>a brother,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/liggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          liggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. ligg, pl. liggja; pret. lá, 2nd pers. látt, mod. lást; subj. lægi; imperat. ligg and liggðú; part. leginn: [Ulf. <i>ligan</i> = κεισθαι; A. S. <i>licgan;</i> Chauc. <i>to ligge;</i> North. E. and Scot. <i>to lig;</i> Engl. <i>to lie</i>; Germ. <i>liegen;</i> Dan. <i>ligge</i>]:—<i>to lie;</i> ör liggr þar úti á vegginum, Nj. 115, Fas. i. 284; þeir vógu at honum liggjanda ok úvörum, 332; hann liggr á hauginum, Fb. i. 215; lá hann inni meðan þeir börðusk, Nj. 85; legsk hann niðr í runna nokkura ok liggr þar um stund, 132; Rafn lá í bekk, Sturl. i. 140; sveinar tveir er lengi höfðu úti legit á fjöllum, <i>to lie out in the cold,</i> Fms. ii. 98; sumir lágu úti á fjöllum með bú sín, <i>lay out on the fells with their cattle,</i> Sturl. iii. 75: of robbers, cp. úti-legu-maðr, <i>an ‘outlying-man,’ outlaw;</i> l. úti á fjöllum, Ld. 250: of freebooters, víkingar tveir, ok lágu úti bæði vetr ok sumar, Grett. 83; l. í hernaði, víkingu, <i>to be out on a raid,</i> Fs. 120, Eg. 1, Fms. xi. 44:—<i>to lie, rest,</i> þú skalt liggja í lopti hjá mér í nótt, Nj. 6; lágu þau þar tvau ein í loptinu, 7; þú skalt ríða um nætr en liggja (<i>but lie abed</i>) um daga, 34; Gunnarr lá mjök langa hríð, 94; þeir lágu úti um nóttina, <i>lay out by night,</i> Fms. ix. 364: the phrase, liggja á gólfi, <i>to lie on the floor, to lie in labour,</i> Fb. ii. 263: of carnal intercourse, <i>to lie with,</i> hefir Guðrún dóttir mín legit hjá þér, Nj. 94; lá ek hjá dóttur þinni, 130: liggja með e-m, id., Grág. i. 128; hón hefir legit sekt í garð konungs, N. G. L. i. 358: with acc., liggja konu, <i>stuprare,</i> Gþl. 203, N. G. L. i. 20; at þú hafir legit dóttur Ísólfs, Lv. 78: of animals (rare), en veðrarnir ok bukkarnir lágu þær, Stj. 178:—<i>to lie sick,</i> hann liggr sjúkr heima at búð …, lá hann sjúkr um allt þingit, Nj. 80; Þórólfr ok Bárðr lágu í sárum, <i>lay sick of their wounds,</i> Eg. 34; Helga tók þá ok þyngd ok lá þó eigi, <i>H. lay sick, but not bedridden,</i> Ísl. ii. 274; ef griðmaðr liggr af verkum sínum, <i>lies sick from his work,</i> Grág. i. 154; ef hann liggr í helsótt, 201:—<i>to lie, be buried,</i> Björn liggr í Farmanns-haugi, Fms. i. 12; hér liggr skald, Fb. i. 215 (in a verse):—<i>to lie at anchor,</i> Bs. i. 713; þar lagði hann til hafnar ok lá þar um hríð, Fms. i. 145; lágu langskip konungs með endilöngum bryggjum, ix. 478; þeir lágu þar nokkura hríð undir nesi einu, Nj. 43; hann lá í Gautelfi austr, 122; þar lá fyrir í höfninni knörr einn mikill, Eg. 79; en er hann kom fyrir Elfina þá lágu þeir þar ok biðu nætr, 80; Haraldr konungr lá liði sínu út fyrir Hreinsléttu, Fms. i. 12; liggja til byrjar, <i>to lie by for a fair wind,</i> 135; liggja til hafs, id., Bs. i. 66, Bjarn. 4, Gísl. 7, Landn. 223: l. veðr-fastr, <i>to lie weather-bound:</i>—lágu hvelpar í hundunum, <i>they were big with whelps,</i> Fms. xi. 10: l. í kafi, <i>to sink deep;</i> þá liggr í hestrinn undir þeim, <i>sank in a quagmire,</i> Fs. 65; Gregorius lá í ísinum, Fms. vii. 273; also, lágu hestarnir á (í) kafi, Eg. 546.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lilja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lilja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Lat. <i>lilium</i>], <i>a lily,</i> Stj. 562, Barl. 44, Trist. 7, Mag. 9: name of a poem, whence the saying, öll skáld vildu Lilju kveðit hafa, H. E. ii. 398:—metaph. of a lady, mín liljan fríð! Fkv. ii. 52: cp. <i>den lillie-vaand</i> (qs. <i>lily-hand</i>), epithet of a lady in the Danish Ballads.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lilju-gros"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lilju-grös
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>lily flowers,</i> Matth. vi. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lilju-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lilju-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the metre of the Lilja,</i> the mod. name for the ancient hrynhenda (q. v.), in which metre the Lilja was composed, whence the name.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lim
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., this word is heterogene, neut. in sing., fem. in plur.:—<i>the foliage, limbs, crown</i> of a tree, opp. to the stem; hann lætr snúa liminu hvers trés út af borginni, Fb. ii. 124; neðarliga af furunni stóð einn kvistr mjór, ok tók í limit upp, Fas. iii. 33:—<i>fagots,</i> festi brátt í liminu er þeir höfðu borit undir virkit, Fms. i. 128; eldr kveyktr í þurru limi, vii. 37; ef maðr vill sér nýta lim þat, Grág. ii. 297.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lim-byrdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lim-byrðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a burden of fagots,</i> Fms. i. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lim-heill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lim-heill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sound-limbed,</i> N. G. L. i. 85.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lim-hlaupa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lim-hlaupa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., prop. of a horse = bógsiga, <i>wrung in the withers:</i> metaph. <i>cowed, prostrate,</i> þér látið mikilliga, en þegar ríkra manna orð koma til yðar, þá eru þér þegar limhlaupa, Sturl. i. 14; þeir Hörgdælir vóru orðnir svá limhlaupa fyrir Guðmundi, at …, 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lim-lesta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lim-lesta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to maim,</i> Geisli.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lim-lesting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lim-lesting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>mutilation.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, limðir, poët., Edda (in a verse), [limr], <i>to dismember,</i> El. 1, Sturl. ii. 11, Fas. iii. 126; af-lima (q. v.), Bs. ii. 75; lima upp, <i>to rip up,</i> N. G. L. i. 381.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima-burdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima-burðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>gait, bearing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., <strong>limafalls-sýki,</strong> f., medic. <i>paralysis,</i> Fél.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima-grid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima-grið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>safety of limbs</i> (lífs grið ok lima), K. Á. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima-lat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima-lát
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>mutilation,</i> Fms. iii. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima-ljotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima-ljótr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ugly limbed,</i> Bárð. 165.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lima-voxtr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lima-vöxtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the frame of the body,</i> Fms. x. 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/limadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          limaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [limr], <i>limbed,</i> esp. of the feet, hands; vel, ílla limaðr, Bs. i. 127, Ld. 20, Fms. v. 238, Ó. H. 74; limaðr mjök, <i>with long limbs,</i> Fms. vi. 206.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/limi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          limi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., proncd. <strong>lími,</strong> [lim], <i>a broom</i> or <i>rod of twigs, rod;</i> barðr ok með lima húðstrokinn, Bær. 20; hann lætr ganga limann um bak honum ok báðar síður, Grett. 135; lét taka þá Svein alla, ok leggja fast lima á bak þeim, <i>and lay the rod stoutly on their backs,</i> Fms. vi. 189; limi söng harðan prima, <i>the rod sang a harsh time</i> (<i>on his back</i>), Mork. 227, cp. Orkn. 188, (in the verse in the note) = ‘<i>the waves did beat the ship:’</i> the mod. phrase, leggja sig í líma, prop. <i>to lay oneself under the rod, to take great pains in a thing, work hard;</i> sóp-limi, <i>a sweeping besom.</i> <strong>lima-högg,</strong> n. <i>a flogging,</i> Hkr. iii. 216.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/limpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          limpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>limpness, weakness,</i> Fél. xv; það er limpa í mér, (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/limr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          limr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. limar, pl. limir, acc. limu, limi, Sks. 107 new Ed., as also mod.; [A. S. <i>lim;</i> Engl. <i>limb;</i> Swed.-Dan. <i>lem</i>]:—<i>a limb;</i> á sínum limum, Hom. 126; um nasar eða aðra limu, Bs. i. 522; manna-höfuð ok af höggnir limir, Fms. i. 171; limuna, Bs. ii. 158, 168; leysa limu sína, Sturl. ii. 90: allit., líf ok limu, <i>life and limb,</i> Eg. 89; er viðr liggr líf eða limir, Gþl. 550; lífs grið ok lima, Eb. 310.",
            }
