              "__html": "f. <i>a well, spring, brook,</i> freq. in mod. usage, but seems not to occur in old writers unless it be in Skv. 2. 1, (lindar-logi, <i>‘well-lowe’</i> = <i>gold</i>): compds, vatns-lind, uppsprettu-lind.",
