        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Germ. <i>lind-wurm</i>], <i>a serpent,</i> only in poetry, see Lex. Poët. passim; as also in circumlocutions, <i>the serpent of the shield</i> = <i>a sword; the serpent of the arm</i> = <i>a bracelet.</i>",
            }
