          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [prob. derived from læra, q. v., Goth. <i>laisjan,</i> before the <i>s</i> was changed into <i>r</i>]:—<i>art, craft;</i> þá list sem astrologia heitir, Stj. 66; kvennligar listir, Fs. 134; klerklig list, Bs. i. 680; hann hafði þeirrar listar eigi fengit, Fb. i. 215; gör með list ok kunnáttu, Edda 8; hann fann ok margar listir, 148 (pref.)",
            }
