        >
          ljósa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Lat. <i>lucina</i>], <i>a nurse</i> or <i>foster-mother,</i> who was usually a midwife also, freq. in mod. usage, also called ljós-móðir, <i>‘light-mother;’.</i> hún ljósa mín! hún ljósmóðir mín!",
            }
          }
