        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an allurer,</i> MS. 4. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lokkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S., Engl., Germ., and Dan. <i>lock</i>], <i>a lock of hair,</i> Stj. 417, Fb. ii. 563, Fs. 5, Bret. 103, the word is not freq. with the ancients, who used leppr (q. v.), which is now vulgar. <strong>lokka-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a man with thick locks of hair,</i> Sturl. i. 21.",
            }
