        >
          losti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [this word is, according to Grimm, derived from ljósta, <i>to smite</i>, so that <i>‘lust’</i> prop. means <i>smiting</i> or <i>being smitten;</i> Ulf. <i>lustus</i> = ἐπιθυμία; A. S. <i>lyst;</i> Engl., Germ., and Dan. <i>lust</i>]:—<i>lust,</i> esp. <i>carnal lust,</i> Hom. 16, 25, Pr. 474, Barl. 27, Orkn. 160; líkams losti, <i>carnal lust,</i> Magn. 466.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lostigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lostigr
