            {
              "__html": "m. [Shetl. <i>loom</i>], <i>the loon, ember-goose, columbus arcticus,</i> Edda (Gl.), Eggert Itin.; metaph. from the cry of these birds, <i>a cry, lamentation;</i> cp. bar-lómr: in local names, <strong>Lóma-gnúpr,</strong> Nj.",
