      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lunga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. lungu, gen. lungna; it occurs only in plur., the sing. may now be used of <i>one</i> lung; [common to all Teut. languages]:—<i>the lungs,</i> Orkn. 18, Stj. 612, Fbr. 137, Fms. iii. 285, Sturl. ii. 150; lungun féllu út í sárit, Glúm. 381, Skíða R. 144.",
            }
          }
        />
