          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lú-berja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "barði, <i>to beat till it becomes tender, beat thoroughly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/luda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a small flounder.</i> <strong>lúðu-laki,</strong> a, m. <i>a drone</i> (abuse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ludr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., the <i>r</i> radical, [cp. Dan. <i>lur,</i> Shetl. <i>looder-horn</i>], <i>a trumpet,</i> Edda 17; þeir höfðu lúðr ok blésu, Orkn. 300; lát taka lúðra ok lát blása um alla borgina, Sks. 748; blása í lúðr, Fms. iv. 300; þeyta lúðr, Al. 35, Stj. 392; kvóðu við lúðrar, Fms. vi. 16; við hinn síðasta lúðr-þyt, því lúðrinn mun gella, 1 Cor. xv. 52, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ludr-blastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúðr-blástr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a blast of a trumpet,</i> Fms. iv. 300.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ludr-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
