      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Ivar Aasen <i>luva;</i> cp. lubbi], <i>rough, matted hair,</i> as a nickname; Haralds hár var sítt ok flókit, fyrir þá sök var hann Lúfa kallaðr, Fagrsk. 9: cp. the vow of king Harold with that of Civilis, Tac. Hist. iv. 61.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
