          className="link"
          href="/word/lui"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>weariness,</i> esp. of the body from age and overwork. <strong>lúa-legr,</strong> adj. <i>mean,</i> (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/luinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>worn;</i> see lýja.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/luka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the hollow hand</i> held like a cup, and in plur. of both hands held together.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/luka-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. lýk; pret. lauk, laukt (mod. laukst), lauk; pl. luku; subj. lyki; part, lokinn; mod. <strong>ljúka,</strong> which form is not found in old writers; [Scot. <i>louk;</i> Shetl. <i>lock</i>; Dan. <i>lukke</i>]:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lukning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúkning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a discharge, payment;</i> skulda-lúkning, <i>discharge.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lunottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúnóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Germ. <i>laune</i>], <i>knavish,</i> Snót 210.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lupu-legr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúpu-legr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>crest-fallen,</i> (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lura"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>ð,</strong> pres. lúri, <i>to doze, nap;</i> and <strong>lúr,</strong> m. <i>a nap.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. lýss, [A. S. and O. H. G. <i>lûs;</i> Engl. <i>louse,</i> pl. <i>lice;</i> Germ. <i>laus</i>]:—<i>a louse;</i> lýss ok kleggjar, Eluc. 23; leita sér lúsa = Dan. <i>lyske sig:</i> sayings, læðast eins og lús með saum; sárt bítr soltin lús; munu jarð-lýsnar synir Gríms kögrs verða mér at bana? sárt bítr soltin lús, kvað Gestr, Landn. 146; hann er mesta fiski-lús, of a good angler, Hrólfr 6 (name of a play); færi-lús, <i>a sheep louse;</i> jarð-lús, <i>vermin;</i> ná-lús.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lus-idinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lús-iðinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sedulous</i> (slang), cp. Engl. <i>bookworm.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lusa-blesi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúsa-blesi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a niggard.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lusa-lyng"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúsa-lyng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the common ling,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lusa-oddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúsa-oddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. nickname of a beggar, Fbr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lusa-skegg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúsa-skegg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>lousy-beard,</i> a nickname, Fb. iii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lusa-sott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúsa-sótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>phthiriasis.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lusugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúsugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>lousy,</i> Fbr. 92 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/luta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. lýt, pl. lútum; pret. laut, lauzt (Nj. 70), laut, pl. lutu; subj. lyti; part. lotit: a weak pres. lúti, lúti ek helgum dómi, the Runic poem; pret. lútti, Barl. 199, Stj. 229: [A. S. <i>lútan;</i> Old and North. E. <i>lout;</i> Dan. <i>lude</i>]:—<i>to lout, bow down;</i> konungr laut þá allt niðr at jörðu, Fms. i. 159; hann hélt höndunum yfir höfuð sér ok laut til altaris, ok bar yfirhöfnina aptr af herðum honum er hann hafði lotið undan, iv. 172, 173; stendr hann á knjánum ok ölnbogunum, lýtr hann niðr mjök við, xi. 64; at eigi skal þurfa at lúta optar um sinn í hornit, en er hann þraut erendit ok hann laut ór horninu, Edda 32; Grettir sá er hann laut ok spyrr hvat hann tók upp, Grett. 93; hann lýtr fram yfir borðit, Þiðr. 323; þá féll niðr spónn fyrir henni, hón laut niðr eptir, Eb. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lutning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lútning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = lotning, Barl. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lútr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>louting, bowed, bent down, stooping,</i> Stj. 20, Bjarn. 33; með lútu höfði, 601, Mar.; fara lútari, Fs. 55; niðr-lútr, <i>shameful.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lydda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lydda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [loddari], <i>a naughty person</i>, Fas. iii. 434, Krók. <strong>lyddu-skapr,</strong> m., <strong>-ligr,</strong> etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lydska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyðska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>custom, manner;</i> sið ok lýðsku, 656 B. 8; ein var hón sér í lýðsku, Fs. 30; öngum manni var hann líkari í sinni lýðsku en Áka móður-bróður sínum, Fms. xi. 50; í allri lýðsku ok í öllu sínu athæfi, 78; hann hefir sömu lýðsku sína ok áðr, O. H. L. 5; see ljóð-æska.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lyf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. lyfjar. also spelt <strong>lif,</strong> see the references below; the word is used as neut. in Bs. ii. 87, and then chiefly in pl. in Bs. i. 179, Fas. iii. 11, Fms. ix. 282; [Ulf. <i>lubja-leisi</i> = φαρμακεία, Gal. v. 20; A. S. <i>lib;</i> O. H. G. <i>lupi;</i> Swed. <i>luf;</i> early Dan. <i>löv</i>]:—<i>a herb, simple,</i> esp. with the notion of healing, witchcraft or supernatural power, = Gr. φάρμακον; trúa á lyf kvenna eða görningar, Hom. 33; lækning, lyf eðr galldra, 121; góð smyrzl ok læknings-lif, Fas. iii. 174; með heilsamligum smyrslum né lækningar-lyfum, Stj. 272; lif (not líf) með lækning, Skv. 1. 17; varisk menn lif, rúnir ok galdra, N. G. L. iii. 300; töfr ok lif, rúnir ok galdra, 286; lækningar lyf, 245; kona hver er ferr með lif ok læzk kunna bæta mönnum, ef hón er sönn at því, þá er hón sek þrem mörkum, i. 390; hann tekr þá nokkur lyf af helgum dómi Jóns biskups, Bs. i. 179; ek hefi þat eitt gras, er … Dagfinnr svarar, engi (= enga?) lyf eðr lækning skulu vér til þessa hafa, nema þær einar (sic), er …, Fms. ix. 282; eitr-fullt lyf, Bs. ii. 87; lítil lyf kveða höfð til lýða sona, <i>the sons of men are made of small matter</i> (<i>seed, cause</i>?), Fas. iii. 11 (in a verse): adverb., ekki lyf, <i>not a whit</i>, Skv. 1. 9, (not as explained at p. 274, col. 1, line 1): ú-lyfjan, <i>poison.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lyf-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyf-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., also spelt <strong>lif-steinn,</strong> Korm. 80, 116, Fas. iii. 244, 307:—<i>a healing stone, stone of virtue</i> (cp. mod. Icel. náttúru-steinn); such stones are recorded as attached to the hilts of ancient swords to rub and heal the wounds with, e. g. the sword Skofnung; wounds made by this sword could only be healed by the stone grooved in its hilt, Ld. 250, 252, Korm. 80, cp. Þórð. (1860) 102; í eptra hjalti sverðsins vóru læstir lifsteinar, þeir er eitr ok sviða drógu ór sárum ef í vóru skafnir, Fas. iii. 244, 307; Bersi hafði lifstein á hálsi, Korm. 116, where the stone was to save one from being drowned.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lyfd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyfð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = lyf; oleum eðr aðrar lyfðir, Stj. 522.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lyfja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyfja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to heal;</i> in the phrase, lyfja e-m elli, <i>to cure one of old age</i> = <i>to kill him downright</i>, Am. 74, Fas. iii. 155, 156; lyfja þeim sitt of beldi, <i>to cure them of their overbearance,</i> Al. 10; skal ek lyfja þér þína íllsku, Flóv. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lyg-vitni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyg-vitni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = ljúgvitni, Anecd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lyga-siaga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lyga-siaga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>a lying story, false report,</i> Fms. xi. 118: <i>a fable</i> as opp. to sönn saga, Hrólfr sagði sögu af Hröngviði berserk ok frá Ólafi Liðsmanna-konungi ok haug-broti Þráins, ok Hrómundi Greipssyni, ok margar vísur með. En þessi saga var skemt Sverri konungi, ok kvað hann slíkar lygisögur skemtiligar, Sturl. i. 23; this is also the mod. common use, see List of Authors (G. III).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lygd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lygð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = lygi, Fms. ix. 401, x. 342, Bs. i. 766, Pass. 50. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/lygi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lygi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., indecl. in sing., but in pl. lygar; [ljúga]:—<i>a lie, falsehood;</i> fyrir lygi Ls. 14; slík lygi, Eg. 59; en mesta lygi, Nj. 79, Fms. vi. 241; ok gafsk ván at lygi (laygi), x. 389: plur., lygar ok drabl, Fas. iii. 423; aptr hverfr lygi þegar sönnu mætir, a saying, Bs. i. 639.",
            }
          }
        />
