        >
          lyrgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in., mod. <strong>lurgr,</strong> <i>a forelock</i> (?); only in the phrase, taka e-m lyrg (mod. taka í lurginn á e-m), <i>to take one by the forelock, by the ears</i> (vulg.), Fas. ii. 341; cp. the Engl. <i>loggerheads.</i>",
            }
