        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a medicine.</i> 656 B. 11, see lyf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [i. e. lœkr; Ivar Aasen <i>lök</i>], <i>the umbilical cord, navel string,</i> a midwife’s term, Stj. 198.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laemingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læmingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. læmingjar:—<i>a loom</i> (bird) = lómr, Gísl. 67, cp. 155: metaph., the phrase, í læmingi, <i>by stealth,</i> Gísl. 155; in Vígl. 22 the new Ed. reads í fleymingi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [lón], <i>a hollow place, vale.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>læri,</strong> [A. S. <i>lire</i>; Scot. <i>lyre</i> = <i>the fleshy parts of the body;</i> Old Engl. <i>leere</i> = <i>skin;</i> Dan. <i>laar</i>]:—<i>the thigh, the leg above the knee;</i> hjó á lærit ok undan fótinn, Nj. 97, Glúm. 380; taka í mitt lær, Fbr. 53; Icvsti holdit allt af lærinu, Róm. 239; blés upp allan fótinn, lærit tók þá at grafa, Grett. 153; lærit upp at smá-þörmum, 154:—of a beast, á lær galtanum, Gullþ. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laer-djupr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lær-djúpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>deep in lore,</i> a nickname, Bs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laer-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lær-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>learning, scholarship,</i> Bs. i. 8; hann hafði höfðingskap mikinn ok lærdóm góðan, 90, passim: of <i>the clergy,</i> as opp. to the laity, leikdómr, Bs., H. E. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laer-knuta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lær-knúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a joint bone.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laer-leggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lær-leggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the thigh bone,</i> Fms. ix. 219, Edda 28, Sks. 372, Gullþ. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Ulf. <i>laisjan</i> = διδάσκειν; A. S. <i>lærnan;</i> Old Engl. <i>lere;</i> Engl. <i>learn</i> = <i>to teach</i> formerly, and sometimes so used still; Scot. <i>lair</i> or <i>lear;</i> O. H. G. <i>leran;</i> Germ. <i>lehren:</i> Swed. <i>lära;</i> Dan. <i>lære</i>; in all changing the <i>s</i> into <i>r</i>; the word may be a derivative from lesa (I), <i>to gather;</i> cp. Eat. <i>legere, to gather</i> and <i>to read</i>]:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laerandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lærandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a teacher,</i> Stj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laerdoms-bok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lærdóms-bók
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a book of learning.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laerdoms-grein"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lærdóms-grein
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>science.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laerdoms-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lærdóms-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a scholar,</i> Bs. i. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laerdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lærðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part., [cp. Old Engl. <i>lered</i>], prop. <i>‘taught,’</i> and then <i>learned, a scholar;</i> næmr ok vel lærðr, Bs. i. 127, K. Þ. K. 154; lærðir menn, opp. to leikir menn (<i>laymen</i>); lærðr eða leikr, Dipl. ii. 13; in mod. usage = <i>a scholar;</i> há-lærðr, <i>high learned;</i> ó-lærðr, <i>unlearned;</i> lítt-lærðr, vel-lærðr, freq.; see læra (I).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>learning,</i> = lærdómr, Stj. 14, 64.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-dottir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-dóttir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘ lore-daughter,’ female disciple,</i> Stj. 157.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-fadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-faðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘lore-father,’ teacher, master,</i> Sks. 307, 803, Post.: of <i>the Fathers,</i> eccl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-modir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-móðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘lore-mother,’ female teacher,</i> Greg. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-maer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-mær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a female disciple,</i> Stj. 158, Greg. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-stoll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-stóll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a pulpit, chair,</i> Mart. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-sunr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-sunr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘lore-son,’ disciple,</i> Bs. i. 907.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeri-sveinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læri-sveinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>a ‘lore-swain,’ disciple,</i> Fms. i. 134, Gþl. 40; Eyjólfr virði Þorlák mest allra sinna lærisveina, Bs. i. 91, and passim in the N. T. (<i>the disciples</i> of Christ), Vídal., Pass.: freq. in mod. usage = <i>schoolboy.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laering"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>teaching, learning,</i> in olden times esp. for holy orders; þá seldu honum margir sonu sína til læringar, ok létu vígja til presta, Íb. 14, Bs. i. 63; til fóstrs eða læringar (<i>education</i>) eða farar, Grág. i. 172; hann var settr til læringar, 623. 54:—<i>teaching, precept,</i> Hom. 108, 157; læringar = kenningar, Skálda 205 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laesa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [láss; Dan. <i>laase</i>], <i>to lock, shut,</i> with dat., læsti hón þegar loptinu innan, Nj. 7; var þeirri hurðu læst, Fms. iii. 67; þau vóru öll læst innan borgar, xi. 74; hurðin var bæði læst innan ok útan, Hom. 120; læsti síðan skríninu, Fms. vi. 402; kirkjur vóru allar læstar, viii. 229:—<i>to shut one in,</i> hón fylgði þeim í úti-búr ok læsti þau þar, Ísl. ii. 108; var hestr Grettis læstr í húsi sterkliga, Grett. 113: læsa bréf, <i>to seal,</i> Róm. 247, Bs. ii. 122:—<i>to groove,</i> í hjalti sverðsins vóru læstir lyfsteinar, Fas. iii. 244.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laesing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læsing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a lock.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>locked, having a lock,</i> Dipl. iii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl., in dat. látum, [Dan. <i>lader,</i> cp. lát], <i>manner,</i> also including <i>sound;</i> læti er tvennt, læti heitir rödd, læti heitir æði, Edda 110. Vsp. 18; engi þau læti, hljóð eða raddir, Skálda 172; hón kveðr við svá hátt ok öskurliga at slík læti þóttisk konungrinn eigi heyrt hafa, Fb. ii. 26; við askranleg læti, Al. 142; honum þótti íllt at heyra læti þeirra, <i>their wailings,</i> Fms. iv. 369; bæði handa læti ok fóta, Sks. 116; lit ok læti, Skv. 1. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laevis-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lævís-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>artfully,</i> MS. 4. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/laezkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          læzkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of Lóm,</i> from the county Lóm in Norway, D. N.",
            }
          }
