        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>with the ledge broken off.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/logg-stokkinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          lögg-stokkinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. = löggbrotinn, Stj. 367.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/loggra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          löggra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [prob. from lögg; Dan. <i>logre</i> = <i>to wag the tail,</i> of a dog]:—<i>to crouch abjectly,</i> like a dog; hvat er þat it litla er ek löggra sék, ok snapvíst snapir, Ls. 44, a α-dasia-oxia;π. λεγ.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
