          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>fame, repute.</i> Fas. iii. 533, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-raun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-raun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a trial</i>; í hverri m. ok þraut, Clem. 45; Dróttinn tók á sik allar mannraunir, <i>all human trials,</i> 623. 19:—<i>trial, danger,</i> jafn hinum fremstu í öllum mannraunum, <i>perils, dangerous tasks,</i> Eg. 21, Bs. i. 638; koma í mannraunir, <i>perils,</i> Al. 61; þú þorir lítt í nánd at koma þegar er nokkur er m. í, Fær. 30; röskr í öllum mannraunum, Fs. 3, 120:—<i>experience,</i> lítillar skynsemdar ætli þér mik ok enga mannraun kunna, Fms. vi. 53:—<i>trial, adversity,</i> þá, or hann misti Ljóts sonar síns, var þat þó mannraun en þetta engi, Þorst. Síðu H. 174.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>plots against a man’n life;</i> þó hafa húsfreyjur verit góðar, at eigi hafi slaðit í mannráðum, Nj. 53; cp. fjörráð.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-samnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-samnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a gathering of men,</i> Fms. iv. 119, Ld. 76:—<i>people assembled,</i> Fms. viii. 64, Ísl. ii. 83, Grág. ii. 165.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-sekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-sekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., esp. in pl. <i>a penalty paid in one’s person,</i> opp. to fésekt: in the old law it signified <i>outlawry, banishment</i> of any of the three degrees, Bs. i. 675; hvárki fé né mannsektir, Ísl. ii. 385, cp. Nj. 189.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-semi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>valour,</i> a απ. λεγ., Hdl. 3; or perh. = <strong>man-semi,</strong> <i>love-making,</i> or <i>the being agreeable to women</i> (?), see man.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-skadi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-skaði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>‘man-scathe,’ loss of life,</i> Eg. 90: <i>a great loss</i> in a person’s death, þeir sögðn honum vígit, Gunnarr sagði, at þat var lítill m., Nj. 61; ok er þat enn mesti m. at taka þá af lífi, 136: <i>havoc in men,</i> þeim manni er þér hafði gört enn mesta mannskaða, Ó. H. 47; hann var þeirra meir lagðr til mannskada, <i>Th. was the more murderous fighter of the two,</i> Fbr. 23 new Ed. <strong>mannskaða-veðr,</strong> n. <i>a destructive gale.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mann-skelmir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mann-skelmir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a rascal,</i> Fas. i. 330.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
