        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘scatheful,’ savage to man;</i> stór dýr ok mann-skæð, Hkr. i. 69, Rb. 344: of a battle, <i>bloody,</i> Fms. i. 44, ii. 316, 323, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
