            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>loss of life,</i> Grág. ii. 130, MS. 625. 14, Bs. ii. 111, Fb. i. 70, Ver. 73; manntapa-vetr, <i>a winter of great mortality,</i> Ann. 1196.",
            }
          }
        />
