        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(qs. <strong>-œli</strong>?), n. [a απ. λεγ., prob. identical with Ulf. <i>manauli</i> = σχημα, Phil. ii. 8], <i>a ‘man-shape,’ hence a mannikin,</i> as a term of contempt, cp. Germ. <i>weibs-bild;</i> hann var m. mikit ok veslingr, Finnb. 214.",
            }
