        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [merja], a <i>‘crush-sledge,’</i> Art. 78, a απ. λεγ. rendering of <i>macue</i> = <i>mace,</i> of the French original.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mar-svin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
