            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘sea-swine,’ sea-hog,</i> a kind of <i>whale,</i> Eggert Itin.; marsvína-rekstr, Fél. vii. 28, <i>the driving whales ashore.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
