            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Lat. word], <i>marble,</i> Stj. 46, Róm. 342, Sks. 188, Bs. ii. 103; marmara-grjót, -steinar, <i>slabs of marble,</i> Symb. 57, Str. 5, Karl, 14.",
