        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>myre;</i> Swed. <i>myra;</i> Gr. μύρμηξ; Serb. <i>mraw</i>]:—<i>an ant;</i> mý ok maura, Eluc. 62; einn lítll maðkr er maurr heitir, Sks. 50: in plur., metaph. <i>money-bags,</i> in a contemptuous sense.",
            }
