      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/magr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mágr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>mêgs</i> = γαμβρός; Scot. <i>mac;</i> O. H. G. <i>mac;</i> Dan. <i>maag</i>]:—<i>a brother-, father-, son-in-law,</i> etc.; hón bauð til sín frændum sínum ok mágum, <i>she bade her kinsmen and</i> mágar (brothers- and sons-in-law), Landn. 117; vill Rútr görask mágr þinn (<i>son-in-law</i>) ok kaupa dóttur þína, Nj. 3, as also Ísl. ii. 250, Eg. 37; cp. the saying, eigi má göra tvá mága at einni dóttur, Fas. iii. 59: ironically, Nj. 94, N. G. L. i. 358: of <i>a father-in-law,</i> Laban mág sinn, Stj. 172; Davíð tók konungdóm eptir Sál mág sinn, Rb. 382: in plur., skilmáli þeirra mága (<i>father-in-law and son-in-law</i>), Stj. 172, Fms. ix. 496; of <i>brothers-in-law,</i> en er þeir mágar finnask, Ó. H. 90; Ólafr mágr, 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mags-efni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
