          className="link"
          href="/word/mal-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mál-stefna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a parley, council, conference,</i> Orkn. 52, Ó. H. 43, Sks. 274; vera á tali ok málstefnu, Fms. i. 52; á málstefnu ok ráðagörðum, vii. 282.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
