          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a. m. [Ulf. <i>mêna;</i> A. S. <i>môna;</i> Engl. <i>moon</i>; O. H. G. <i>mâno;</i> Dan. <i>maane;</i> Swed. <i>måne;</i> in Germ. the primitive word has been replaced by the derivative <i>‘mond,’</i> which properly means a <i>moon-period, month</i>]:—<i>the moon;</i> the word, however, is scarcely used in prose, old or mod., but is poetical or can only be used in certain phrases, for tungl is the common word, Vsp. 5, Alm. 14, 15, Hm. 138, Vþm. 22, Anal. 177; skarðr máni, <i>the crescent moon,</i> Vkv. 6: mythol. the Moon (Máni) was brother to the Sun (Sól), and both were the children of the giant Mundilföri (a name evidently referring to the rotation of the heavens), Edda 7, Vþm. 23. For the legend of the two men in the moon with a bucket and pole on their shoulders see Edda 7, 220 (in a verse): urðar-múni, <i>a weird moon,</i> an apparition, Fb. 270: poët. phrases, mána rann, <i>the moon’s dwelling</i> = <i>the sky,</i> Skálda (in a verse); mána-vegr, <i>the moon’s way</i> = <i>the sky,</i> Haustl.; mána-fold, <i>id.;</i> mána-salr, Hkv. 1: brá-máni, enni-máni, <i>the brow moon</i> = <i>the eye,</i> Ad.: a nickname, as also a pr. name, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/manudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mánuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>mánaðr,</strong> m., <strong>mónoðr</strong> with umlaut, Íb. 376; gen. mánaðar, nom. acc. pl. mánuðr (like vetr); mod. mánuðir, acc. mánuði, which form occurs in vellums of the 15th century; thus, mánaði (acc. pl.), Bs. i. 825, 896; even mánuðu (acc. pl.), 837, Fb. i. 205: [from máni: cp. Ulf. <i>mênoþs;</i> A. S. <i>mônað;</i> Old Engl. <i>moneth;</i> Engl. <i>month;</i> O. H. G. <i>mânod;</i> Germ. <i>monat;</i> Dan. <i>maaned;</i> Swed. <i>månad;</i> Lat. <i>mensis;</i> Gr. μήν]:—<i>a month;</i> á mánaði, <i>for a month,</i> Hm. 73; mánuðr níu, Rm. 6, 18, 30, Hom. 127; mónoðr tólf þritög-náttar, Jb. 376; þrjá mánaðr þrjátigu nátta, K. Þ. K. 164, Fms. ix. 239; aðra tvá mánoðr, Grág. ii. 261; tveir mánaðr, i. 420; sjau mánaðr, fimm mánaðr, ii. 393: tólf mánuðr, <i>a twelvemonth, year;</i> á hverjum tólf mánuðum, <i>every twelvemonth,</i> Hom. 149; ok hann hefir tólf mánuðr at gjöldum eðr handsölum, Grág. i. 196; halda þær tólf mánaðr þaðan frá er kona var föstnuð, 378; hvárt þat var af hinum tuttugustum tólf mánuðum, <i>the twentieth year,</i> Grett. 173 new Ed.; kaupa þeir nú enn saman um tólf mánuðr, Fb. ii. 124. The old heathen year consisted of twelve months, each of thirty days, so that a pentad (fimmt) added to that number made the year complete. For the names of the economical months see Edda 103 (gor-m., frer-m., hrút-m., ein-m., sól-m., and sel-m., kornskurðar-m.); tví-mánaðr (q. v.), <i>the ‘double month;’</i> út-mánuðir, <i>the last months of the winter</i> (of Þorri, Gói, Ein-mánuðr), það er komið fram á út-mánuði; see also the Icel. Almanack, where the old months are still marked. Of the Julian Calendar we have Martius mánaðar, 623. 37, Rb. passim; but that computation never came into household use in Iceland, where the old calendar (of Þorri, Gói, Ein-m., etc.) still prevails for all domestic affairs: astron., tungl-m., <i>a lunar month;</i> sól-m., <i>a solar month.</i> In popular usage, as elsewhere, a month often means <i>four weeks,</i> and hálfr mánuðr, <i>half a month</i> = <i>a fortnight;</i> hálfum mánaði eptir mitt sumar, Nj. 4; á hálfs mánaðar fresti, <i>within half a month, a fortnight,</i> Fms. x. 411; á hálfum mánaði, Grág. i. 152.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          már
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., in the latter part of pr. names, Bjart-már, Hreið-már, Gran-már; it is derived from mærr, <i>famous,</i> O. H. G. <i>mâri,</i> and formed at a time when the umlaut had not as yet taken place.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mar-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          már
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. más, dat. mávi or máfi, pl. mávar; in mod. usage sounded in nom. erroneously <strong>máfr,</strong> gen. máfs; [A. S. <i>meaw;</i> Engl. <i>mew;</i> Germ. <i>möve;</i> Dan. <i>maage</i>]:—<i>a sea-mew, gull (larus),</i> Edda (Gl.), freq. in mod. usage; see also Lex. Poët., where the word freq. occurs; hvít-máfr, <i>the common gull;</i> grá-máfr, <i>the grey gull, larus glaucus:</i> in poetry <i>the sea</i> is <strong>máva-röst; má-grund, má-ferill, má-skeið,</strong> <i>the land, road of the sea-mews,</i> Lex. Poët.: <i>crows</i> are ben-már, blóð-már; <i>the raven</i> is Yggjar-már, <i>Odin’s mew,</i> and so on.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maria"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máría
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>María</strong>), u, f. <i>Mary,</i> in old writers sounded with an <i>á,</i> see old rhymes, e. g. Lilja, passim; and is still sounded so in <strong>Márí-atla</strong> (= Máríu-erla), <i>the wagtail, motacilla alba.</i> Several flowers bear the Virgin Mary’s name, <strong>Máríu-stakkr,</strong> m. <i>the common lady’s mantle, alchemilla vulgaris;</i> <strong>Máríu-grös,</strong> n. pl. <i>lichen nivalis;</i> <strong>Máríu-vöndr,</strong> m. <i>‘Marys-wand,’ the field gentian, gentiana campestris;</i> <strong>Máríu-kjarni,</strong> a, m. <i>laver, fucus esculentus,</i> see Maurer’s Volks. 194, 195. Other COMPDS: Máríukirkja, Máríumessa, Máríuminni, MáríuSaga, Máríuskript, Máríusúð, Máríuvers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-kirkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-kirkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>Mary-church,</i> Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-messa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-messa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see messa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-minni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-minni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a hymn to the Virgin Mary;</i> til þess er borð vóru upptekin ok Máríuminni var sungit, Fms. x. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the Virgin Mary’s Saga,</i> Vm. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-skript"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-skript
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a tablet of the Virgin Mary,</i> Dipl. i. 10, Vm. 6, 22, 27, 69, Pm. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-sud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-súð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. the name of a ship, Fms. viii. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mariu-vers"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máríu-vers
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘Mary’s-verse’</i> = <i>the Ave Maria,</i> Bs. i. 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/masa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mása
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to heave</i> or <i>pant,</i> Lat. <i>anhelare.</i> of a horse; nær vissuð þér svá heimskan hest | hann mundi fyrir sverja | nær hann fram knúinn másar mest | menn séu til sem berja, Jón Þorl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/masi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mási
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Fms. vii. 239, see preceding word; prop. the name ot a bird; in Faroe <i>maasi</i> is <i>a sea-mew; val-maasi, Uislands-maasi</i> (= <i>an Icelandic mew</i>), <i>fiski-maasi,</i> see Mr. H.C. Müller’s Færoernes Fugle-fauna (1863).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mat-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mát
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [meta], <i>moderation,</i> Pass. 30. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mata-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to check-mate,</i> in chess.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mater"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátér
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [for. word], <i>a measure,</i> Stj., H. E. i. 476.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mati"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>maade;</i> early Dan. <i>måte;</i> from meta]:—<i>manner, way;</i> í engan máta, <i>in no way,</i> Vígl. 21; í þann máta, <i>thus,</i> Bret. 108; í allan máta, <i>in every way,</i> Fs. 15. <strong>máta-legr,</strong> adj. (<strong>-lega,</strong> adv.), see mátulegr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/matt-dreginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátt-dreginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>weak, exhausted,</i> Fær. 42, Fms. ii. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/matt-farinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátt-farinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>faint, weak,</i> Fms. ii. 270.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/matt-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátt-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without strength, exhausted,</i> Fbr. 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/matt-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátt-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>weakness, lack of strength, debility,</i> Fms. vii. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/matt-litill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátt-lítill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of little strength, feeble,</i> and of a sick person, <i>exhausted, faint,</i> Fms. i. 159, xi. 288, Eg. 567.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mattigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máttigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in old poets contr. before a vowel, and changing the <i>g</i> into <i>k,</i> máttkar, máttkan, máttkir; compar. máttkari, máttkastr, mod. máttugri, máttugastr; [Ulf. <i>mahetteigs</i> = δυνατός; Engl. <i>mighty;</i> Germ. <i>mächtig</i>]:—<i>mighty;</i> máttkar meyjar, Gs. 1; sá inn máttki munr, Hm. 93; máttkan moldþinur, Vsp. 59; með máttkom Kristi, Lex. Poët.; fjögur konunga-ríki hafa máttkust verit, Ver. 35:—<i>able,</i> máttugr afspring at geta, Stj. 26: al-máttugr, <i>almighty;</i> ú-máttugr, <i>weak;</i> á-máttigr, q. v. (p. 43, col. 2), perhaps, however, these words are rather akin to Ulf. <i>anamahtjan</i> = βιάζειν, and thus to mean <i>overbearing,</i> and then = <i>hideous, horrible,</i> as an epithet of trolls and giants.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., máttar, dat. mætti, pl. mættir; [Ulf. <i>mahts</i> = δύναμις; A. S. <i>meaht;</i> Engl. <i>might;</i> O. H. G. <i>maht;</i> Germ. <i>macht;</i> Dan. <i>magt</i>]:—<i>might, strength:</i> allit., trúa á mátt sinn ok megin, Fms. i. 35: er at þessu orðinn svá mikill m. (<i>it has come to such a pitch</i>) at hér eru við vafðir margir ríkis-menn, Fms. xi. 264; ok allir mættir hræðask, 623. 26: <i>value</i>, Skálda 175, 176; var mér alls máttar (<i>I had to use might and main</i>) áðr ek kom henni upp, Fms. iii. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mattu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máttu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>mightily, immensely,</i> Stj. 383, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mattu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          máttu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mighty,</i> Th. 26: <i>within one’s power,</i> honum er allt þat máttulegt er menninir megu eigi, N. G. L. iii. 242.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/matu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mátu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [máti], <i>meet, fitting,</i> Stj. 55, 97; meir en þér þykkir mátulegt, Fb. ii. 196; sveigja slíkt sem honum þótti mátulegt vera, Bs. i. 727; mátulegan (<i>moderate</i>) skatt, Fms. x. 113, v. l.; sá er þetta rúm var mátulegt, Fs. 5; ú-mátuliga, <i>immensely,</i> 383: <i>fitting,</i> of a suit, hann fór í serkinn ok var hann honum m., Fms. iii. 180; máttulegt beisl, Gd. 34: <i>meet, due,</i> það er honum mátuligt, <i>it serves him right.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/med"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          með
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "prep., also <strong>meðr,</strong> a form common in Stj. and in legendary writers, but not in the classical writers or in mod. speech or writing; [Ulf. <i>meþ</i> = σύν and μετά; A. S. and Chaucer, <i>mid</i>; it remains in Engl. only in <i>‘mid-wife,’</i> qs. <i>‘with-wife,’</i> cp. Icel. náveru-kona, nær-kona, yfirsetu-kona; Germ. <i>mit;</i> Dan. <i>med;</i> Gr. μετά]:—<i>with, along with,</i> a prep. with dat. and acc.; with dat. it has the notion of <i>coming</i> or <i>going in company,</i> with acc. of <i>bringing</i> or <i>fetching;</i> thus, hann kom með honum, <i>he came along with, in company with him;</i> but hann kom með hann, <i>he brought him wilh him.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/med-aumkan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          með-aumkan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>compassion,</i> Vídal. passim, <strong>meðaumkunar-samr</strong> adj. <i>compassionate,</i> Fas. iii. 644.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/med-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          með-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>management;</i> vandhæfi mun þér þykkja á meðferðinni Korm. 82; góðr meðferðar, <i>easy to manage,</i> Landn. 94, v. l.; til meðferðar, <i>to manage,</i> Fms. i. 256; veita e-m e-t til meðferðar, <i>to give it into one’s keeping,</i> Dipl. v. 24; þau kúgildi sem hann reiknaði í sinni meðferð, <i>which he had in his keeping,</i> iii. 13; hafa sök at meðferð, <i>to have a case to manage,</i> Grág. ii. 41; var konungi þá kunnigt hverja m. ek hafða, <i>how I did behave,</i> Eg. 65, Barl. 90, 105; hafa meðferðar, <i>to have about oneself, in one’s keeping,</i> Mar., Bs. i. 715, 866.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/med-ferdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          með-ferði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = meðferð, Th. 77, Karl. 216; hafa meðferðis = hafa meðferðar.",
            }
          }
