          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-særi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Scot. <i>man-sweir</i>], <i>perjury,</i> K. Á. 18, Gþl. 547, Fms. xi. 436, Rétt. 85. <strong>meinsæris-maðr</strong> (<strong>meinsæra-maðr</strong>), m. <i>a perjurer,</i> Jb. 339, Karl. 552, N. G. L. ii. 426 (v. l.), Bs. i. 718.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-tregi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-tregi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>affliction,</i> poët., Skv. 1. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-udigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-úðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>malignant,</i> Fas. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-vargr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-vargr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a noxious beast.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-vaettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-vættr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a noxious wight, an ogre,</i> = Germ. <i>unhold,</i> of giants, ghosts, monsters, or the like, Fb. i. 526: trölla ok meinvætta, ii. 314; þar mun liggja meinvættr nökkur, Grett. 110: fyrir þeim meinvættum (of highwaymen) er menn hugðu úti liggja, Fs. 4; Steinrauðr enn rammi er mörgum manni vann bót þeim er aðrar meinvættir görðu mein, Landn. 212: má þar engi maðr vera um nætr fyrir trölla gangi ok meinvætta, O. H. L. 57: metaph. <i>a noxious creature,</i> tak meinvætti þessa, Flóv. 34; var hvers-vetna í leitað at eyða þeim meinvættum, ok hafði ekki at sök (of mice), Bs. i. 194; hvat sem meinvætta mæltu þóptar, Bb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-yrda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-yrða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to abuse in words,</i> Bs. i. 855.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>abuse,</i> Bs. (Laur.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mein-thjofr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mein-þjófr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a mean thief;</i> m. markar, <i>‘thief of woods,’</i> i. e. <i>fire,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meina
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to harm,</i> Barl. 173; sólar hiti meinar þar um sumar, Stj. 69; þau meina þér ekki vætta, 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meina-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meina
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "irreg., pret. meinti, but pres. meina, meinar; part. meint; [a for. word from the Engl. or Germ.; it first occurs about or a little before the time of the Reformation; Germ. <i>meinen;</i> Engl. <i>mean</i>]:—<i>to mean;</i> the passage, Landn. 333, is in the words of Björn á Skarðsá; ek meinti, Bárð. 6 new Ed., is from a paper MS., as are also Fas. i. 499 and iii. 488; the word, however, occurs in the Ósv. S. (a vellum of the 15th century), and is naturalised in mod. usage, Vídal., Pass., N. T. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meina-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meina-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>blameless,</i> Fms. vi. 109: <i>unhindered,</i> meinbuga-lauss, Grág. i. 307; ef þeim er meinalaust, <i>if they are unforbidden,</i> 26; prestr skal syngja allar heimilis-tíðir at meinalausu, <i>if be is unhindered,</i> Am. 37; oss dugir fagna Ólafs-messu meinalaust, id., Sighvat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meining"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meining
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. <i>harm, injury,</i> Bs. i. 379.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meinka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meinka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to harm;</i> lasta né meinka, Bs. i. 911.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meinlat-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meinlát-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>chastising the body;</i> m. í vökum, föstum ok klæða-búnaði, hann gékk opt berfættr um nætr í snjóum ok frostum, Bs. i. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meinlat-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meinlát-semi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>chastisement of the body,</i> 625. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., meinni, meinstr, [Engl. <i>mean</i>], <i>mean, base;</i> hann er einkar m., <i>he is ‘unco mean,’</i> Ísl. ii. (in a verse); þat var hverju dýri meinna ok verra, Fas. iii. 637.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meins-vanr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meins-vanr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>guileless,</i> Gm. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meira-hattar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meira-háttar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>of greater importance, more remarkably,</i> Fms. v. 176 (v. 1.), vii. 219.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meiri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meiri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "neut. meira, compar. and superl. <strong>mestr,</strong> answering to mikill, q. v.; [Ulf. <i>maiza</i> = μείζων, <i>maists</i> = μέγιστος; A. S. <i>mâre,</i> etc., see meirr; Lat. <i>major</i>]:—<i>more</i> and superl. <i>most, greater, greatest,</i> and the like: of stature, <i>taller, tallest,</i> meiri en önnur naut, Ld. 120; meiri en aðrir menn, Fms. i. 44; mesta fingri ok lengsta, x. 398; væn kona ok kvenna mest, Eg. 598; hann var allra manna mestr, Fms. i. 2; kvenna vænst ok mest, 14; hverjum manni meiri ok styrkari, 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meirr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meirr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar., answering to mjök (q. v.), superl. <strong>mest;</strong> [Ulf. <i>mais</i> = μαλλον, <i>maist</i> = πλειστον; A. S. <i>mâr;</i> Engl. <i>more, most;</i> Scot. <i>mair, maist;</i> Germ. <i>mebr, meist</i>]:—<i>more,</i> and superl. <i>most;</i> meirr ok meirr, <i>more and more,</i> Stj. 468; meirr eptir annarra manna skaplyndi en Lauga-manna, Ld. 212; jafnmargir eða meirr, Grág. i. 336; en þó meirr at mildi, Fms. ii. 296; meirr en, <i>more than;</i> eigi m. en eitt fylki, Fb. i. 40, passim; elska meirr enn nokkurn mann, Fms. i. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meisingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meisingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>mâse;</i> Engl. <i>tit-‘mouse’</i> (a different word from <i>mouse,</i> Icel. mús); O. H. G. <i>meisa;</i> Germ. <i>meise;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>meis</i>]:—<i>a titmouse,</i> Lat. <i>parus.</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meiss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meiss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [O. H. G. <i>meisa</i>], <i>a wooden box, a basket</i> (in Norway of any <i>basket of wicker-work</i>); meis hefi ek á baki, verðrat matrinn betri, Hbl. 3; hann hafði mikinn meis á baki … rótar ofan í meisinn öllum fiskunum, þá er fullr meissinn, Grett. 137; selja mjöl í meisum, Gþl. 491; hann hafði borit í meis á baki sér Örvandil … ein tá hafði staðit ór meisinum, Edda 59; meisa síld, <i>barrel-herrings,</i> N. G. L. ii. 250; kola-meiss, Art., freq. in mod. usage; hey-meiss, <i>a hay-box</i> in which the hay is given to the cows, one meiss to each head of cattle.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meistara-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meistara-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>mastership, great skill,</i> Mar., Fms. xi. 431, Fas. iii. 426.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meistara-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meistara-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>masterly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meistara-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meistara-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>masterly,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meistari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meistari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Lat. <i>magister</i>], <i>a master, lord;</i> þjóna sínum meistara, Ld. 26, Stj. 70, Rb. 412: <i>a master, teacher, scholar,</i> Sks. 244, Bs. i. 228, 229; klerkar ok meistarar, Ann. 1215; m. Ovidius, Bs. i. 238; m. Gísli, 236; mikils háttar m. er Áki hét, 805; sumir meistarar, Skálda 177; m. Priscianus, 160; Þóroddr Rúna-meistari, <i>Thorodd ‘Rune-master,’ the Grammarian,</i> id.: <i>Master,</i> of <i>the Lord,</i> N. T., as a rendering of Rabbi, passim: as <i>a degree,</i> meistari Jón, the popular name of bishop Jón Vídalin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Ulf. <i>maitan</i> = κόπτειν; Germ. <i>metzeln;</i> cp. Germ. <i>messer</i> = <i>knife</i>]:—<i>to cut;</i> meita knífi, Fb. ii. 522 (in a verse); manar meita, <i>to cut the mane,</i> Akv. 37; ekki hafði hann látið meita skegg sitt né skera hár fyrir hrygðar sakir, Stj. 538.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meitill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meitill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. meitli, [Germ. <i>meissel</i>], <i>a chisel,</i> Eg. (in a verse), freq. in mod. usage; whence <strong>meitil-berg,</strong> n., Grett. 141; or also <strong>meitil-stapi,</strong> a, m. <i>a steep precipice</i> as if cut with a chisel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meitla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meitla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to chisel, cut,</i> Mar., freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meizl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meizl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>meizlur,</strong> see meiðsl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mekktr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mekktr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [makki], <i>necked,</i> of a horse.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t. [a for. word, from Germ. <i>macht</i>], <i>might,</i> Stj. 143; ef ek skal dæmdr af Danskri slekt, ok deyja svo fyrir kongsins mekt, Jón Arason: <i>pomp,</i> Fms. xi. 424.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mekta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mekta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to make mighty,</i> Stj. 140: reflex., 154, 174.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mektugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mektugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mighty,</i> Fms. v. 345, Stj. 205, Skáld H. i. 31; the passage Ad. 15 is doubtful or illegible, for such a word could not occur in so old a poem.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>mél,</strong> also <strong>mæl,</strong> n. [another form of mál (q. v.), but only used in a temporal sense; Ulf. <i>mél</i> = καιρός and χρόνος]:—<i>time, a while;</i> hann skal leggja á eigi skemra mel (<i>not shorter notice than</i>) en viku stefnu, Grág. ii. 349: in the phrase, eða meira meli, <i>or a longer time;</i> þrem nóttum fyrr eða meira meli …, fjórtán nóttum fyrr, eðr meira meli, <i>a fortnight or more,</i> Kb. i. 85; þá skulu þeir kveðja nótt fyrr en dómar fara út, eða meira meli, Sb. ii. 105; sjáu nóttum fyrr, eða meira mæli, Kb. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-bakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-bakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘mel-bank,’ hank on which bent-grass grows,</i> also <i>a sand-bank,</i> Nj. 155, 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-dyna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-dýna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a pad</i> or <i>cushion filled with</i> melr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-fluga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-fluga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a moth in clothes,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-gras"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-gras
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., botan. <i>elymus arenarius,</i> a kind of <i>oats,</i> Hjalt.; whence the local name <strong>Melgras-eyri</strong> in western Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-karl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-karl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Sturl. ii. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-rakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-rakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the ‘mel-dog,’ the white</i> or <i>polar fox,</i> from its burrowing in these sand-hanks, Nj. 198, Bs. i. 581, Grág. ii. 347, Sturl. i. 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-teigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-teigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a field of</i> mel (<i>oats</i>), D. I. i. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mel-torfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mel-torfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>turf grown with oats</i> (melr), Hrafn. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mela-sol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mela-sól
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. botan. <i>papaver,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. meldrs and meldrar; [mala; Swed. <i>mäld;</i> Ivar Aascn <i>mælder;</i> Scot. <i>melder; Mælder-skin,</i> the name of a mountain glacier in Norway, from its likeness to <i>a flour-bag</i>]:—<i>flour</i> or <i>corn in the mill:</i> koma til melds, <i>to go to the mill,</i> Gs. 4; standa at meldri, 23; Fenju meldr, <i>the flour of Fenja</i> = <i>gold,</i> Lex. Poët.; græðis meldr, <i>sea-flour</i> = <i>sand</i> (?), Edda (in a verse); the word is obsolete and poët., but remains in Sweden and Norway.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meldun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meldun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Landn., a Gael. word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. mel, pret. maldi, part. maliðr, <i>to pound, bray into dust;</i> mcl þat allt í dust, Pr. 475, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a noose,</i> in kapp-mella: <i>a trigger</i> (?) in a cross-bow, þat var lásör ok mella í, Sturl. i. 180 (but malla the vellum C).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mellingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mellingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>trigger</i> (?), Edda ii. 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [mél], the name of <i>a horse</i> (= Lat. <i>lupatus</i>), Hkr. i. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. melar, a kind of <i>wild oats,</i> esp. <i>bent-grass, arundo arenaria,</i> growing in sandy soil; it is esp. found in Skaptafells-sýsla and in Mýra-sýsla (near to Hitarnes and Akrar), cp. Bjarn. 22, which probably refers to cutting this grass, cp. Eggert Itin. §§ 490, 813; þeir leiddu hesta sína undir melbakka ok skáru fyrir þá melinn at þeir dæi eigi af sulti, Nj. 265; átta tigir mels í Hátuninga mcl, D. I. i. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melrakka-belgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melrakka-belgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., <strong>-skinn,</strong> n. <i>the skin of a</i> m., Grág. i. 392, 500, Fms. v. 251.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melrakka-veidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melrakka-veiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>fox hunting,</i> Jb. 23. In local names,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a malting,</i> <strong>meltu-hús,</strong> n. <i>a malt-house,</i> Rétt. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [malt; Goth. <i>maltjan</i> is a conjectural verb from <i>gamalteins</i> = ἀνάλυσις]:—<i>to malt for brewing;</i> engir menn skulu kaupa korn til meltingar, en ef meltir, gjaldi mörk silfrs konungi, N. G. L. ii. 249; melta korn til sölu, Gþl. 351.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/melting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          melting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a malting,</i> N. G. L. ii. 249.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/men"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          men
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. menja, dat. menjum; [A. S. <i>mene;</i> Hel. <i>meni;</i> cp. O. H. G. <i>mani-kold</i> = <i>necklace-gold,</i> as also the name of a plant, hence perhaps Engl. <i>marigold;</i> Lat. <i>monile</i>]:—<i>a necklace,</i> Þkv. 13; hringa ok men, Vsp. 23; móður menjum göfga, Hdl. 13; hlaðin háls-menjum, Am. 44, Yngl. S. ch. 17, 22:—they were also worn by men, hann lézk vilja færa þeim men er Björn hafði haft á sér, Bjarn. 67, Vápn. 26, 28: metaph. in plur. <i>treasures, jewels,</i> Þkv. 23, Fm. 16, Akv. 26:—poët. phrases, men jarðar, <i>earth’s necklace</i> = <i>the sea,</i> Orkn. (in a verse); men Karmtar, <i>island necklace</i> = <i>the sea;</i> lyngva men, <i>necklace of the bush</i> = <i>a serpent;</i> men storðar, <i>the earth’s</i> men = <i>the world serpent, the</i> Miðgards-orm, Lex. Poët.: as necklaces were chiefly worn by ladies, <i>a woman</i> is called mens Syn, <i>the fairy of the necklace,</i> Edda (in a verse): <strong>Men-glöð,</strong> <i>the ‘necklace-glad,’</i> is the name of a fairy woman, Fb. i. 529, Fsm.: as also <strong>men-brekka, -brík, -döll, -gefn, -grund, -gunnr, -hlín -reið, -skögul, -skorð,</strong> = <i>a lady;</i> on the other hand, <i>a man</i> is called <strong>men-broti, -brjótr, -fergir, -myrðir, -rýrir, -stríðir, -vörðr, -þverrir,</strong> = <i>the giver, breaker</i> etc. <i>of treasures,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [mangr, qs. margr; cp. Engl. <i>mingle,</i> Old Engl. <i>meng</i>]:—<i>to mingle, mix, blend,</i> freq. in mod. usage: in part. <strong>mengjaðr,</strong> <i>mixed, variegated;</i> blá-mengjaðr, rauð-mengjaðr, <i>mingled with blue, red,</i> D. N.; með mengdu klæði, <i>variegated clothes,</i> v. 102.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mengi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mengi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Germ. <i>menge</i>], <i>a multitude,</i> Hkv. i. 26, 49, Merl. i. 49, Fas. i. 496 (in a verse), Akv. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mengr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mengr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>mixed, blended,</i> Sól. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the giant maid</i> who grinds gold in the charmed mill, Edda, Gs.; hence <i>gold</i> is called <i>the flour of</i> Menja, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [maðr or mannr], <i>to make a man of, rear, breed;</i> mun ek fylgja sonum mínum, menna þá ok hreysta eptir megni, Finnb. 332.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a nickname, Glúm. 392; but esp. in compds, góð-menni, íll-m., rík-m., <i>a bad, good, mighty man;</i> and in a collect. sense, fjöl-menni, marg-m.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menniliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menniliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>manfully,</i> Fms. iv. 269, Stj. 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menniligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menniligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>manly, manlike, well bred,</i> Sturl. ii. 78.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>breeding;</i> ætt hans, auðr fjár ok m. góð, Ísl. ii. 239; ef hann hefir eigi kunnáttu til eða m., Gþl. 487; með litlu menningar móti, Krók. 35; koma e-m til menningar, <i>to educate, rear into a man.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mennska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mennska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>humanity;</i> veita e-m ást ok mennsku, Hom. 47; miskun ok m., 48, Barl. 42; eptir almennilegri mennsku, <i>in a human manner,</i> Fms. v. 347: freq. in compds, karl-m., góð-m., íll-m.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mennskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mennskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>human, belonging to man;</i> at mennskum aldri, Hom. 62; mennskr maðr, <i>a man of a man,</i> as opp. to giants, ogres, or superhuman beings, Eg. 110; þótti hann varla m. maðr at afli, Fms. vi. 212, Ísl. ii. 360; ok er miklu betra at fásk við mennska menn en við úvættir slíkar, Grett. 113; sumar með Ásum, Álfum, Vönum, sumar hafa mennskir menn, Sdm. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mennt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mennt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>art, skill, accomplishment;</i> hefir þú til ílls þína mennt, Nj 66; ok er henni flest til mennta gefit, Fas. ii. 148; hón vildi eigi kenna dóttur sinni neitt til mennta, Vígl. 19; allan sóma, fyrst menntina, <i>the instruction,</i> Fms. xi. 430; þú hefir marga hluti til menntar umfram oss bræðr, Hrafn. 17; sýn mennt þína, of swimming, Þórð. 11 new Ed.; mennt í sundförum, Fms. ii. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mennta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mennta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to civilise:</i> part. <strong>menntaðr,</strong> <i>learned, high bred;</i> menntaðar þjóðir, <i>civilised nations,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/menntan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          menntan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>culture, breeding;</i> vel virðr sakir menntanar sinnar, of a poet, Bjarn. 3; mér fór sem mörgum börnum, at ek lagða á ekki hug þat sem mér var menntan í at nema, Fms. ii. 267; nema menntanar list, ok íþrótt, Stj. 151; opt er sá í orðum nýtr sem iðkar menntan kæra, Hallgr.:—<i>culture, civilisation</i> are in mod. usage rendered by mentan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mer-hross"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mer-hross
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>mer-hryssi,</strong> n. <i>a mare,</i> Eb. 34, Grág. i. 504, Ísl. ii. 62, Grett. 122, Nj. 167, Rd. 284, Ám. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merar-leggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merar-leggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merar-son"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merar-son
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>son of a mare,</i> a term of abuse, Fas. i. 74; fast gyrðr merarson, for the pun see Safn i. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merg-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merg-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>marrowless, pithless.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merg-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merg-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>pithlessness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merg-runi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merg-runi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>‘lues medullae,’ a wasting sickness, pining away, caeliaca,</i> Fél. x.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merg-und"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merg-und
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘marrow-wound,’</i> a wound cutting through to the marrow, Grág. ii. 11, Nj. 217.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merg-undi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merg-undi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., and <strong>merg-undaðr,</strong> part. <i>wounded to the marrow,</i> N. G. L. i. 68, 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mergd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mergð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [margr], <i>multitude, plenty;</i> mergð fjár, <i>plenty of wealth,</i> Eg. 47; magn ok mergð ávaxtar, Bs. ii. 165, passim in mod. usage; the old writers prefer fjöldi, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mergjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mergjaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘marrowed,’ strong.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mergr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mergr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. mergjar, dat. merg, but mergi, Ls. 43; pl. mergir; [A. S. <i>mearg;</i> Scot. <i>mergh;</i> Engl. <i>marrow;</i> Germ. <i>mark;</i> Dan. <i>marv</i>]:—<i>marrow,</i> Edda 28, Grág. ii. 91; frost og fjúk. er fast á búk frosinn mergr úr beinum, a ditty, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. mer; pret. marði; subj. merði; part. mariðr, mod. marinn:—<i>to bruise, crush;</i> svá var mariðr hans líkami, Róm. 329; the word is freq. in mod. usage, marinn reyr mun hann eigi sundr mylja, Matth. xii. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merk-ordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merk-orðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sensible in one’s words,</i> Bs. ii. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. merkja, dat. merkjum, [mark]:—<i>a landmark, boundary,</i> esp. in pl., Grág. ii. 213, 216, 223, 279, 285, N. G. L. i. 41, 307, passim; also landa-merki, q. v.: sing. <i>a mark,</i> færa mark til síns merkis, Grág. i. 416.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-a"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-á
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a boundary river,</i> Grág. ii. 349.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-bjork"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-björk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a landmark-birch,</i> Grág. ii. 297, Jb. 236, 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a mark-day,</i> of days by which the calendar is arranged, Rb. 38, 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a landmark fence,</i> Grág. ii. 265, Gþl. 381.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>remarkably,</i> Ísl. ii. 333, Stj. 293; svá merkiliga, <i>with so much distinction,</i> Bs. i. 797: <i>perceptibly,</i> Fms. xi. 441; Þorkell segir frá öllu vel ok m., Ld. 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>perceptible;</i> m. hljóðsgrein, Skálda 179: <i>articulate,</i> of sound, 174: <i>remarkable, noteworthy, distinguished,</i> of men and things, ok þykkir oss hans sögn öll merkiligust, Ó. H. (pref.); at ek hafa mart merkiligt látið eptir liggja í frásögn hans æfi, Bs. i. 137; vitr maðr ok m., Fs. 11; uppruni hans var m., Þorst. Síðu H. 171, Fms. x. 161, vii. 150, Boll. 314, Sturl. i. 95, Dipl. ii. 11, H. E. i. 523, Ld. 100.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-mall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-máll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>speaking things worthy of note,</i> Ld. 216.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-oss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-óss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a landmark, outlet,</i> Grág. ii. 353.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-spjot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-spjót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a staff</i> Þiðr. 289.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a mark, print,</i> Karl. 543.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-stjarna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-stjarna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘mark-star,’ planet;</i> sól ok tungl ok fimm merkistjörnur, Skálda 174, Lil. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-stong"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-stöng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the standard-staff,</i> Eg. 289, Ó. H. 217, Fms. vi. 336, N. G. L. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-tungl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-tungl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = merkistjarna, Rb. 520.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merki-vatn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merki-vatn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘mark-water,’ a lake used as a boundary,</i> Grág. ii. 290, 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>marking,</i> the act, Grág. ii. 311.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merkis-burdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merkis-burðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the carrying of the standard,</i> Karl. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merkis-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merkis-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the standard-bearer,</i> Þorst. Siðu H. 170, Eg. 52, Nj. 136: in later times it was a post of high rank at the king’s court, stallari eða m., Gþl. 365, Bs. i. 712; whence it came to mean <i>a man of mark, a distinguished person,</i> Ld, 10, Eg. 36, Fs. 20, 161: hverir merkis-menn biskuparnir hafa verit, Bs. i. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [mark], <i>to mark,</i> as a landmark, boundary; merkja um, <i>to mark round, enclose,</i> Stj. 409.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of mark, noteworthy, truthful;</i> merkr maðr ok sannorðr, Fms. ii. 282; er bæði var merkr ok réttorðr, Bs. i. 138; sem dyggvastr ok merkastr, Th. 18; eigi merkr ok miðlungi réttorðr, Sturl. ii. 188; ú-merkr, <i>inaccurate, untrustworthy,</i> Ld. 232, Fms. ii. 268.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to gleam;</i> fjöll geisla merluð, <i>the fell gleaming with beams of light,</i> Edda (in a verse); hvít-merluð, <i>white-gleaming,</i> of the morning dew, Grönd. 66.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/merr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          merr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., mod. <strong>meri,</strong> gen. merar, acc. and dat. meri, pl. merar; [from marr, q. v.; A. S. <i>mere;</i> Engl. <i>mare;</i> Germ. <i>mähre</i>]:—<i>a mare,</i> Grág. i. 503, 504, Nj. 185, Edda 26, 57, Fs. 56, N. G. L. i. 75, Glúm. 355, Fbr. 104, 107 new Ed., Vígl. 37; eigi var þá undarligt at þú bitisk vel er merrin fylgði þér, Fms. vi. 323: as a term of abuse, ef þú hefir heldr manns hug en merar, Fs. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mersing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mersing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>messing,</strong> f. <i>brass,</i> Þorf. Karl. 374; enda lögsilfr þat er meiri hluti sé silfrs en messingar, ok þoli skor, Grág. i. 392; mersingar-spónn, <i>a brasen spoon,</i> Þorf. Karl. 376, Pm. 6; mersingar-hestr, <i>a brasen horse,</i> Glúm. 353; mersingar-ker, -stika, -ketill, -kola, -kross, -lampr, <i>a brasen vessel … lamp,</i> Vm. 2, 8, 35, 102, 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mersing-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mersing-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>brasen,</i> MS. 732. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meskinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meskinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [<i>meskjen</i> = <i>merry,</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>sporting,</i> see ú-meskinn, Ld. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to say the mass, hold divine service,</i> Sturl. ii. 13, Ám. 14, Vm. 99: still in use, það verðr ekki messað í dag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [eccl. Lat. <i>missa</i>], <i>a mass,</i> from the Roman Catholic times; syngja messu, <i>to chant the mass,</i> Bs. i. 21, K. Þ. K. 56, Hom. 137, passim, Nj. 157; messu bók, <i>a mass book,</i> Vm. 17, 68, Pm. 104; messu brefer, <i>a breviary,</i> Dipl. v. 18; messu söngr, <i>chanting the mass,</i> Bs. i. 823, Stj. 238, K. Á. 116, Vm. 108; messu embætti, <i>mass service, divine service,</i> Fms. xi. 429, Bs. i. 823; messu-föt, messu-fata-lindi, see lindi, Fms. iv. 111; messu klæði, messu skrúð or skrúði, <i>the vestments,</i> K. Þ. K. 56, 57, 72, 74, Fms. ii. 177, viii. 197, Bs. i. 63, 429; messu hökull, <i>a cope,</i> Nj. 279, B. K. 52; messu serkr or messu sloppr or stakkr, <i>a surplice,</i> Fms. iii. 168, B. K. 83, Vm. 29, 52; messu stóll, <i>the. mass desk,</i> Mar.; messu djákn, <i>a deacon, clerk,</i> Nj. 272, Vm. 5, Bs. i. 412, 871:—poët., odda messa, vápna messa, <i>the weapon mass,</i> = <i>battle,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messn-faert"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messn-fært
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>when service can be held;</i> það er ekki messufært, <i>when so few worshippers are present that no mass can be said.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messu-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messu-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a failure of service,</i> when there is no service from some accident.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messu-hald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messu-hald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the holding mass,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messu-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messu-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>mass time</i>, Fms. viii. 291, xi. 269.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messu-prestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messu-prestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a mass-priest,</i> N. G. L. i. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messu-songs-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messu-söngs-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a reading clerk to chant the mass,</i> D. I. i. 282, 489.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/messu-vin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          messu-vín
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>communion-wine.</i> ☞ The word messa has in Icel, remained since the Reformation = <i>divine service;</i> fyrir messu, eptir messu, vera við messu.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mest-hattar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mest-háttar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>most remarkably,</i> Bs. i. 805, 828, Fms. iii. 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mest-megnis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mest-megnis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>for the most part,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., <strong>mest,</strong> adv. <i>most;</i> see meiri and meirr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/met"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          met
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. pl. <i>the weights</i> of scales; einir pundarar, ein met ok mælikeröld, Gþl. 522; vega í skálum með metum, 523; vórti teknar skálir ok met, Fms. vi. 183; skálir góðar, þar fylgðu tvau met, annat af gulli en annat af silfri, xi. 128; meta-skálir góðar með metum, Ám. 55: the phrase, koma sínum metum við, <i>to use one’s own weights, one’s own wages;</i> Ribbungar kómu þar aldri sínum metum við, <i>could never have their own way there,</i> Fms. ix. 367, v. l. (Fb. l. c. mætti, but wrongly); þar hefir hamhleypan Dís komið við metum sínum, Fas. ii. 395.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/met-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          met-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘prize-thing,’</i> a thing of singular value, cattle or dead things, Grág. i. 398: of living stock, arðr-óxi gamall á vár, þat er m., 502; hrútr þrévetr ok ellri ok forystu-geldingr (<i>a bell-wether</i>), þat er m., 503; það er metfés-skepna!",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/met-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          met-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an estimate, valuation;</i> hann skal eið vinna ok meta, ok skal hans m. þá standa, Grág. i. 393, Gþl. 296, Fb. i. 563, where = <i>taxation.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/meta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          meta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mat, mátu, metinn: imperat. met (mettu); pret. subj. mæti seems not to occur, but a weak metti (from metja) is used, Fas. ii. 464: with neg. suff., pret. matkat ek, Fbr. (in a verse): in mod. usage a weak pret. matti, mattist, mettist is often used, eg mattist um við hann, ef eg metti það nokkurs, and the like; þeir möttust um hin efstu sæti, N. T., and the like: [Ulf. <i>mitan</i> = μετρειν; A. S. <i>metan;</i> Engl. <i>mete</i>; O. H. G. <i>mezan;</i> Germ. <i>messen:</i> Swed. <i>mäta.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/metandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          metandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an appraiser,</i> Grág. ii. 169.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/metja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          metja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "met, matti, [Ulf. <i>matjan</i> = φαγειν; from matr], prop. <i>to ‘take food,’</i> but it remains only in the special sense <i>to lap</i> with the tongue like a dog; þeir er sötra vatn ór lófum allt eitt ok rakkar metja með tungu, Stj. 392: in mod. usage esp. used of fishes <i>mumbling</i> with the mouth in water when feeding, þtir vóru at metja stökkva ok steðja, Bb. 2. 29; metja strauminn, <i>to gulp the stream,</i> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/metnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          metnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>metnuðr,</strong> m., gen. ar, <i>‘meetness,’ honour, fame;</i> fjár ok metnaðar, <i>wealth and honour.</i> Eg. 17; konungar görðu svá mikinn metnad hans (<i>paid him that honour</i>) at af hans bæn sættusk þeir, Fms. i. 13; var hann þar í miklum metnaði einn vetr, x. 220; Davíð fékk tíðleik ok metnuð af verkum sínum, Ver. 6; metnaðar virðing, <i>respect of persons,</i> Hom. 19; metnaðar kona, <i>a lady of rank,</i> Str. 53; með ríkdóm ok metnaði, Fs. 21: <i>esteem, valuing,</i> þann metnuð hefi ek á ráðagörðum mínum, at ek vil at þat sé haft er ek legg til, Fms. x. 249.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
