      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/midviku-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          miðviku-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(proncd. <strong>miðku-dagr</strong>), <i>mid-week-day,</i> i. e. <i>Wednesday;</i> cp. Germ. <i>mittwoche,</i> (for this use see the remarks s. v. dagr), Rb. 102, Orkn. 322, K. Á. 188, Ó. H. 223, Sturl. ii. 153, D. N. v. 505: <strong>mið-viku-aptan, -morgin, -nótt,</strong> f. <i>Wednesday eve, morning, night,</i> K. Þ. K. 124, K. Á. 22, Ísl. ii. 346, Sturl. iii. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
