        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, infin. pret. misstu, Fms. i. 178 (in a verse); [A. S. <i>missjan:</i> Engl. <i>miss;</i> O. H. G. <i>missan;</i> Dan. <i>miste</i>]:—<i>to miss, lose:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
