        >
          mor
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., spelt morð; hafa morð fjár, Al. 123, Hom. (St.), MS. 623. 21, where it is spelt morg = morþ:—<i>a swarm,</i> prop. <i>a swarm of ants</i> (akin to maurr); mor af mýi, fiski, síld, <i>a swarm of flies, shoal of herrings</i>:—<i>an atom</i>, svo lítið mor.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mora"
          onClick={[Function]}
