            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          móna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [the word is still said to be used in provinc. Icel., and also remains in provinc. Swed. <i>lius-muna</i> = ljós-móðir, q. v. (Ihre); Scot. <i>minnie</i>]:—<i>mammy,</i> of a baby; mona mín móna, kveðr barnið, við mik göra verst hjóna, Skálda (Thorodd) 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. mós, dat. mó, pl. móar, [akin to Engl. <i>moor;</i> Norse <i>Moe</i>]:—<i>a moor, heath,</i> mostly used of <i>a barren moorland,</i> grown only with ling; en biskup dragnaði um grjót ok móa, Sturl. ii. 50; tekr Skeggi á rás upp eptir móunum ok grípr þar upp malinn, Grett. 93: freq. in local names, <strong>Mór, Móar</strong> (<i>Moe</i> in Norway), Landn.; <strong>Mó-berg:</strong> in pr. names, referring to <i>the hue,</i> <strong>Mó-gils, Mó-eiðr,</strong> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-ylla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mór-ylla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a dusky sheep,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [A. S. <i>gemot;</i> Old Engl. <i>mote</i> or <i>moot,</i> in <i>ward-mote,</i> the <i>Moot-ball</i> at Newcastle; Dan. <i>möde;</i> Swed. <i>mot</i> and <i>möte</i>]:—<i>a meeting;</i> mæla mót með sér, <i>to fix a meeting</i> Eg. 564; þeir mæltu mót með sér ok hittusk í Elfinni, 444; manna-mót, <i>a meeting;</i> vinamót, <i>a meeting of friends</i>.",
            }
