              "__html": "n. <i>muggy, misty weather,</i> Ísl. ii. 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-gat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-gát
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., thus spelt (and not munn-gát) in the best MSS., Bs. i. 340, etc.; [prop. = <i>a dainty;</i> from munr and gát (q. v.) from geta; Dan. <i>mundgodt</i>]:—a kind of <i>ale, small beer,</i> Ölk. 34, Fms. vii. 249, viii. 87, Eg. 24, 247, Sks. 163; matr ok m., Gþl. 15, Hom. 87; mjöðr ok m., Fs. 4, Fms. vii. 12; Sigurðr konungr veitti annan hvern dag fiska ok mjólk en annan-hvern slátr ok mungát, Ó. H. 33; gestum líkaði ílla er hirðmenn drukku mjöð en þeir mungát, Fms. viii. 166; göra m., <i>to brew</i> m., Bs. i. 197; heita m., 340; var mjöðr blandinn ok m. heitt, Sturl. ii. 245; súrt mungát, Bs. i. 819; mjöð eðr m., Fb. ii. 340; ale (öl) and mungát are synonymous, whereas beer and mungát are distinguished, B. K. 88, D. N. (see Fr.); mungáts bytta, Fms. ii. 165; mungáts efni, Bs. i. 340; mungáts görð, <i>brewing of</i> m., Fas. ii. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-hugd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-hugð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= munuð (q. v.), Post. (Unger) 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>delightful,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a match on which one has set his heart,</i> Hkv. 2. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-strond"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-strönd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the ‘mind’s-strand,’</i> poët. for <i>the breast,</i> Höfuðl. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-staerandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-stærandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>love-awakening,</i> epithet of a girl, Haustl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-tun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-tún
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘mind’s-town,’</i> poët. for <i>the breast,</i> Fas. i. 437 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mun-vegar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mun-vegar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the ways of joy, the heavens,</i> Stor. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/muna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          muna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [the root word of mund, n., mundi, mundanga, munr; the primitive notion is from scales, balance, weight, disparity, or the like]:—<i>to move, remove,</i> with dat.; þess er ok kostr, at muna út garði, <i>to ‘eke out’ a fence, remove it farther off, widen it,</i> Grág. ii. 257; ef menn vilja muna várþingi, <i>if men will alter the time of the parliament,</i> i. 116; prob. also, mér er ór minni munað, <i>it is removed out of my memory, I have quite forgotten it,</i> Bs. i. 421; þat merkðu þeir at sólar-gangi, at sumarit munaði aptr til vársins, Íb. 7; miðlum ekki sporum nema vér munim fram, <i>unless we move forwards,</i> 116; slíkt munar ok sýkna skógar-manns (<i>amounts to the same thing, is equally valid</i>) þútt hann vegi sjálfr, Grág. ii. 159: with dat. impers., e-u munar, <i>a thing changes its place;</i> því munar áfram, <i>it moves forward.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/muna-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          muna-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>delightful,</i> Sól. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. munaðar:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munar-heimr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munar-heimr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>delight’s abode, the world, of pleasure,</i> Hkv. Hjörv. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (mod. <strong>munaðar-lauss</strong>), <i>joyless, orphaned,</i> Gkv. 1. 4, (cp. <strong>munaðar-leysi,</strong> n. <i>orphanhood,</i> and <strong>munaðar-leysingi,</strong> a, m. <i>an orphan,</i> which forms are freq. in mod. usage.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> heterogene, in sing. n., in plur. f. <strong>mundir;</strong> [muna]:—<i>a moment, the nick of time;</i> en er þú hefir gört þetta, þá mun þér mund (<i>high time</i>) ór hauginum á braut, O. H. L. 2: followed by a gen., í þat mund dags er út tók eyktina, Fms. xi. 136; þat var mjök í þat mund dægra, er, Niðrst. 3; þat var miðviku-dagr ok þat mund árs, er …, Hom. 110; í þat mund missera, Bs. i. 185:—single, þat mund, er Bersi var til búðar borinn, <i>at the moment when,</i> Korm. 128; skip kom út í þetta mund norðr, Lv. 74; í þat mund kemr Haukrmeð skikkju-verðit, Fb. i. 577; þat mund er sá andaðisk, N. G. L. i. 250; var hann ágætastr víkinga í þat mund, Fms. xi. 74; þat var skírsla í þat mund, <i>in those days,</i> Ld. 58; þat var þá tíðska í þat (þann Ed.) mund, 104; í þat mund mun orðit siða-skipti, 128; í sama mund, <i>at the same time next day, month, year,</i> passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mund-laug"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mund-laug
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., usually spelt and sounded <strong>munn-laug,</strong> Edda 40 (ii. 185, note) Fs. 5, Fms. ii. 167, Gísl. 21, N. G. L. i. 211 (Js. 78), Str. 40, Vm. 96; but möndlaugu (dat.), Edda i. 184; even spelt <strong>mullaugu</strong> (dat.), N. G. L. ii. 443: [from mund = <i>hand</i>; early Swed. <i>mullog</i>]:—<i>a basin</i> for washing the hands, esp. before and after a meal, see the remarks s. v. handlaugar and dúkr; hann setti munnlaug fyrir sik ok þó sik ok þerði á hvítum dúk, Fs. 5; stóð hjá honum mundlang full af blóði, Band. 42 new Ed.; munnlaugar þrjár fáðar með gulli, Gísl. 21; munnlaug eina skal dóttir hafa, nema rekendi sé fast á meðal þá skal hón hafa báðar, N. G. L. i. 211, cp. Art. 80:—poët., munnlaug vinda, <i>the basin of the wind,</i> i. e. <i>the vaulted sky,</i> Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mund-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mund-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an agreement about</i> mundr, Grág. i. 370, Ísl. ii. 318.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mund-ridi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mund-riði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the handle of a shield</i>, Gr. ὄχανον (Herod, i. 171), Nj. 66, Ld. 220, Bjarn. 65, Finnb. 286, Karl. 440, Gþl. 105, Sks. 373; þrír mundriðar, N. G. L. ii. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [prob. from mund, n.], <i>to aim, point</i> with a weapon; hann mundar til höfuðs á Gesti, Ísl. ii. 305; mun hann ekki lengi m. atgeirinum ef hann er reiðr, Nj. 78; mundum æ fram, <i>keep the spears in rest,</i> Fagrsk. 138 (munim, Mork. l. c.); ef maðr mundar til manns ok stöðvar sjálfr ok varðar fjörbaugsgarð, Grág. ii. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a pointing at;</i> mál ok m., Mag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundang"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundang
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the balance</i> or <i>the tongue of the balance;</i> it is only used in COMPDS: mundangshóf, mundangsmaðr, mundangsmikill.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundang-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundang-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>moderation,</i> Karl. 517.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundang-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundang-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>justly, duly,</i> Flóv. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundang-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundang-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>just;</i> m. hóf, Bs. i. 280, Barl. 148, Pr. 406.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundang-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundang-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. = mundmál, see mundr below, Grág. i. 370.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundanga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundanga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>justly, in due measure;</i> mundanga heitr, Sks. 69; eigi var möttullinn mundanga. Art. 151; m. mjök, Barl. 178; jafnhávan við þær er mundanga eru, N. G. L. ii. 243: skip mundanga hlaðit, 274.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundangs-hof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundangs-hóf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the making a true balance, moderation;</i> með mundangshófi, <i>with just balance, moderately,</i> Stj. 517, 552, Sks. 691; sjá vel með mundangshófi, (<i>minutely</i>) hvat maðr á hverjum at gjalda, Sks. 444; eptir mundangshófi, Stj. 283: esp. in the phrase, mjótt er mundangshófit, <i>the just balance, the true middle, is hard to hit,</i> Gþl. 173, Js. 55, Thom. 153, Bs. i. 667 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundangs-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundangs-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a just, moderate man,</i> Sks. 495.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundangs-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundangs-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>balanced, just, moderate,</i> Bs. i. 133, Edda 165.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. an abbreviation from the pr. names ending in -mundr, see Gramm. p. xxxiv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundia"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundia
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., and <strong>Mundia-fjöl,</strong> n. pl. <i>the Mounts</i> = <i>the Alps,</i> Symb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundil-fori"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundil-föri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. the name of a giant, the father of the Sun and the Moon; akin to möndull, referring to <i>the veering round</i> or <i>revolution</i> of the heavens, Vþm., Edda 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the latter part of several pr. names, Ás-mundr, Ey-m., Guð-m., Geir-m., Há-m., Hall-m., Her-m., Loð-m., Sig-m., Söl-m., Þór-m., Ver-m., Vé-m., Vil-m., Ög-m.: contr. <strong>Mundi,</strong> whence <strong>Munda-grös,</strong> n. pl. a kind of <i>lichen,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mundr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. mundar, dat. mundi; [cp. O. H. G. <i>munt,</i> whence low Lat. <i>mundium</i> = <i>tutelage</i> in the old Teut. laws; women are said to live <i>‘sub mundio’</i> of their parents and husbands, Du Cange, s. v.; cp. also Germ. <i>vor-mund</i> = <i>a guardian,</i> and <i>mündling</i> = <i>a minor</i> or a person living under tutelage; perh. akin to mund (<i>hand</i>), as hand and authority are kindred notions. So in Lat. phrases, <i>in manu parentis, manumissio,</i> etc., used of <i>minors, slaves.</i> In Norse the word is used in a special sense.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munhugd-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munhugð-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sensual,</i> Barl. 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/muni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          muni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the mind;</i> see munr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/muninn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          muninn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of one of Odin’s two ravens, Gm., Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munn-biti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munn-biti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a bit, little mouthful.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munn-eidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munn-eiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>swearing,</i> Sks. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munn-fagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munn-fagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>munn-fríðr,</strong> adj. <i>with a fine-shaped mouth,</i> Fms. viii, (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munn-fyllr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munn-fyllr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a mouthful,</i> Edda 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/munn-harpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          munn-harpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
