        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [Ulf. <i>maþlian</i> = λαλειν; A. S. <i>mæðlan, madelian;</i> Germ. <i>melden</i> by way of metathesis; Old Engl. <i>mele;</i> the Dan. <i>mæle</i> as well as the Icel. are contracted forms, cp. nál from <i>nadal</i>]:—<i>to speak,</i> with acc. and absol.; mæli þarft eðr þegi, Hm. 18; mæla staðlausa stafi, id.; hví þegið ér, svá at mæla né meguð, Ls.; margir menn mæltu ílla við Skamkel, Nj. 80; eigi munt þú þat vilja mæla, 85; Gizurr hvíti (Njáll), … mælti, 90, 91, 220, 228; stafnbúar mæltu, at hann skyldi mæla allra hötðingja heilastr, Fms. vii. 290; mæl þú allra drengja heilastr, viii. 97; þat þætti mér mælanda (gerund.), <i>that is a remarkable speech,</i> Fb. ii. 196; mæla mörgum orðum, <i>to use many words,</i> Hm. 104; mæla þessum orðum, <i>to use these words,</i> Hkr. ii. 78; mæla e-n orðum, <i>to address,</i> Vþm. 4; mæla í hug sér, <i>to speak to oneself,</i> 623. 54; mæla máli, <i>to speak a language;</i> hann mælti allstaðar þeirra máli sem hann væri allstaðar þar barnfæddr sem þá kom hann, Bs. i. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maelandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mælandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a pleader,</i> Grág. ii. 112, Sturl. ii. 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maelgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mælgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [máligr], <i>prattle, much talking,</i> Fms. iii. 148, Orkn. 464, Greg. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the pronunciation, voice, intonation;</i> eg þekki hann á mælinu, <i>I know him by the voice:—a saw,</i> það er í mæli, <i>it is rumoured;</i> munn-mæli, <i>oral relations;</i> bögu-mæli, <i>bad grammar;</i> um-mæli, <i>utterances;</i> vil-mæli, <i>friendly words,</i> and in several other compds.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeli-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæli-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in compds, <strong>mæli-askr,</strong> m., <strong>-ker, -kerald,</strong> n. <i>a measure, vessel,</i> N. T., Matth. v. 15, Stj. 293, Gþl. 524: <strong>mæli-hlass,</strong> n. <i>a measured cartload,</i> Rd. 232, Ám. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a measuring,</i> Edda 47, Stj. 211, Fms. xi. 441:—<i>a measure, dimension,</i> Skálda 175, Alg. 372, Stj. 292. <strong>mælingar-fræði,</strong> f. <i>geometry.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maelir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mælir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a measure,</i> esp. of a certain measure, a sixth of a sáld (q. v.), Gþl. 524, Fms. x. 398, xi. 441, Stj. 621. 2 Kings vii. 17, B. K. 13, 16; kornið fyllir mælirinn, <i>the grain fills the measure,</i> a saying; of fluids, N. G. L. i. 29; tveggja mæla öl, 137: of land, a field sown with a mælir of grain, 240; níu mæla land, Vm. 48; whence <strong>mælis-land,</strong> n. <i>a land of one</i> mælir, 49; it remains in the phrase, hann er ekki lengi á mælislandi, of a swift runner. <strong>mælis-öl,</strong> n. <i>a measure of ale,</i> about six gallons and a half, Fms. i. 31, N. G. L. i. 6; skyldi þá hverr maðr eiga mælisöl en gjalda fé elligar, Fms. i. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maelska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mælska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>eloquence,</i> Hdl. 3, Post. 645. 90, Fr. 439, passim: <i>idiom,</i> nema mælsku allra þjóða, Konr.: <i>pronunciation,</i> mod. mæli, hón kvaðsk kenna mælsku hans at hann var Galverskr, 656 C. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maelsku-andi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mælsku-andi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the spirit of eloquence,</i> Sks. 560.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maelsku-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mælsku-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an orator,</i> Sks. 315, MS. 656 C. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>spoken</i> so and so, Grett. 146: esp. in compds, fá-mæltr, harð-mæltr, lin-mæltr, loð-mæltr, sein-mæltr, fljót-mæltr, hýr-mæltr, glað-mæltr, and so on.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the spinal marrow,</i> Slurl. ii. 95, freq. in mod. usage, <strong>mænu-sótt,</strong> f. <i>disease of the spine.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maena-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>mœna,</strong> d, <i>to provide with a</i> mænir, <i>to roof;</i> leka möndi húsit ef ekki mœndi smiðrinn, Skálda (Thorodd) 163, D. N. v. 637.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maenir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mænir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., i. e. <strong>mœnir,</strong> [Dan. <i>mönning</i>], <i>the ridge</i> of a house, Fs. 42, Ísl. ii. 194, Sks. 146, Skíða R. 179; hús-mænir, q. v. <strong>mænir-áss,</strong> m. <i>the ridge-rafter.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. meyjar, dat. meyju, acc. mey; pl. meyjar, dat. meyjum: <strong>meyja,</strong> u, f. a later form in MSS. of the 14th century, sú meyja, meyjan, Stj. 136, Bs. ii. 27; þú meyja (voc.), Fb. ii. 194, Skáld H. 1. 9; as also nom. <strong>mey,</strong> Fas. iii. 177; [Ulf. <i>mawi</i> = κοράσιον, παις; A. S. <i>meowle</i> = meyla, q. v.; Swed. and Dan. <i>mö;</i> the Engl. <i>maid</i> and Germ. <i>magd</i> are derivatives]:—<i>a maid, girl, virgin;</i> þaðan koma meyjar, Vsp. 20; mey, Hm. 81, 96; meyjar orð, 83; mörg góð mær, 101; en horska mær, 95, Vþm. 47; meyja, 49; meyjar ástir, Alm. 8; mér tíða mey, Skm. 7; mær (voc.), 23, 25, 26; mær er mér tíðari, 7; mær heitir fyrst hver, en kerlingar er gamlar eru, Edda 108; leizt honum mærin fögr, Eg. 23; Egill sá þar mey fagra, … mærin var úkát ok grét … Egill mælti við meyna, 481, 483; mær tvítug eða ellri, Grág. i. 307, 465; ekkjur ok meyjar tvítöga ok ellri, ii. 108; eigi mær heldr göfuglig ekkja, Fms. x. 294: <i>a girl,</i> hón lék sér á gólfi við aðrar meyjar, hversu lízt þér á mey þessa, þykkir þér eigi fögr! ærit fögr er mær sjá, Nj. 2; Þóra ól barn um sumarit, ok var þat mær, Eg. 166; litlu síðarr fæddi hón barn, þat var mær, Steinn hélt meyjunni undir skírn, hét sú mær Þóra, Steinn gaf meyjunni fingrgull, Ó. H. 144; hvárt sem er sveinn eða mær, N. G. L. i:—<i>a virgin,</i> Gefjon, hón er mær ok henni þjóna þær er meyjar andask, Edda 21; hón var mær alla æfi, 655 ix. C. 1: allit., brúðr Guðs, mær ok móðir, Mar., esp. of the Virgin Mary, Lil.; mær meyja, <i>the maid of maids,</i> Hdl. (begin.):—of the zodiac, Rb. (1812) 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Ulf. <i>merjan</i> = κηρύσσειν], <i>to praise, laud,</i> Ad. 1, Höfuðl. 2, Geisli 20:—mæra e-n e-u, <i>to bless one with a gift,</i> Fms. vii. 152 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maerd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mærð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ulf. <i>meriþa</i> = φήμη], <i>praise, laud,</i> Stor. 5, Lex. Poët. passim: <i>an encomium.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [mærr], <i>a noble, illustrious man,</i> Edda passim, also in mod. usage: the name of a sword, Bjarn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maerna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mærna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become cheesy,</i> of milk, Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. (i. e. <strong>mœrr</strong>), gen. mærar, dat. and acc. mæri:—<i>a land</i>, prop. <i>border-land</i>, only in poetry; mærar, Skálda 236 (in a verse); and in compds, blá-mœrr (q. v.), <i>the blue land</i> = <i>the sea;</i> borð-mœrr, máfa m., <i>id</i>.; dag-mærr, <i>the day-land,</i> i. e. <i>the heaven;</i> hauk-mœrr, <i>the ‘hawk-land’</i> = <i>the hand;</i> Móins mær, <i>serpent-land,</i> i. e. <i>gold.</i> Lex. Poët.: the word remains in landa-mæri, <i>border-land,</i> and",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>mœta</strong>), t, [mót; Ulf. <i>môtjan;</i> A. S. <i>mêtan;</i> Engl. <i>meet;</i> Hel. <i>môtjan;</i> Dan. <i>möde;</i> Swed. <i>möta</i>]:—<i>to meet,</i> with dat. <i>to meet a person;</i> mætti hann Þór miðra garða, Þkv. 9; mæta e-m á brautu, Hm. 88; mættu þeir Ögmundi, Nj. 5; eigi veit hvar manni mætir, a saying (= mod. eigi veit hvar manni kann at mæta), Fs. 106; ok mætir austmanninum Erni, Ísl. ii. 149; þat mætti hann Grím inum rauða, Nj. 245; þá mætti Þorgeirr Þorvaldi, id., passim:—láta ráð ráði mæta, <i>to pay like for like</i>, Fms. i. 15; þá skal mæta horn horni, hófr hófi, N. G. L. i. 41; láta dal mæta hóli, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeta-gripr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæta-gripr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a costly thing,</i> Fas. i. 61.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maetask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mætask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, dep. [meta], <i>to make oneself costly;</i> láta biðjask lengi ok m. ok myklask, Str. 9: act. part. in auð-mætandi, <i>a valuer, taxer of wealth,</i> Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [meta], <i>good things, wealth;</i> mörg mæti, <i>many good things,</i> Hým. 32; man ek at vér meiri mæti áttum, Vkv. 13; mætum ágætum, Am. 66; nökkut mæta (gen. pl.), Fsm. 29; veglig mæti, Lex. Poët.; veraldar mæti, Nikuld., Skáld H. 2. 38; hans mæti kná ek hljóta, Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maeti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mæti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>valuable,</i> Al. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maetir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mætir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>one who meets,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maetis-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mætis-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>mæta-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a worthy man,</i> Sturl. i. 9, Fas. i. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>valuable, excellent,</i> of persons <i>meet, worthy;</i> mætr ok ágætr, El., Stj.; mætan mar, Hdl. 5; Guði ok hans mætu móður, D. N. i. 51; mætustu móður, Th. 78; maðr mæztr und sólu, Gkv. 1. 7:—<i>lawful, valid,</i> dæma sök mæta eðr úmæta, Grág. i. 67; lög-mætr, <i>lawful;</i> ú-mætr, <i>invalid</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/maetur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mætur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl.; in the phrase, hafa (vera) mætur á e-u, = mæti, Ld. 60, Fb. i. 262, Grett. 68 new Ed., Fas. i. 247 (in a verse), and in mod. usage; see mæti above.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/moerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mœrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = mýrr, <i>a moor, bog;</i> æpa kann í mrum fröskr, Mkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mog-thrasir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mög-þrasir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the giant father of the weird sisters (hamingjur), Vþm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mogdir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mögðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>a peg,</i> Edda (Gl.) 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mogl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mögl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>murmuring,</i> Stj. 324, Mar. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mogla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mögla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to murmur,</i> Stj. 291, 322, 324, Bs. ii. 115, Fb. i. 440, Mar., N. T., Vídal. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/moglan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möglan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t. <i>a murmuring,</i> Hom. 26; möglunar orð, Grett. 153. <strong>möglunar-samr,</strong> adj. <i>grumbling,</i> 686 B. 2, Grett. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mögr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. magar, dat. megi, pl. megir, acc. mögu; [Ulf. <i>magus</i> = παις, Luke ii. 43, ix. 42, xv. 26; = τέκνον, ii. 28; A. S. <i>magu;</i> Hel. <i>magu;</i> Gael. <i>mac</i>; mögr is masc. answering to fem. A. S. <i>mægð,</i> Engl. <i>maid</i>, Germ. <i>magd</i>]:—prop. <i>a boy, youth,</i> and so, like παις, <i>a son;</i> mannskis mögr, <i>no man’s son</i>, Hm. 147: allit., mey ok mög, <i>daughter and son,</i> Vþm. 33; mæla við mög, Hðm. 23, Skm. 2; okkarn mög, 1; geta mög, Ls. 35, 36; megir Heimdalar, <i>sons of H.,</i> Vsp. 1; maga þinna, Am. 79; mögr Sigföður, Vsp. 55; mögr Hlóðynjar, 56; megi hveðrungs, 55: míns magar, Gm. 24; magar Þóris, Ad. 16; magar Hallgarðs, Ht.: allit., mögr móður kallar, Grág. ii. 170; mögr fann ömmu, Hým. 2; ósk-mögr, <i>a son by adoption,</i> also <i>a beloved son.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mogu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mögu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>possibly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mogu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mögu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [from Germ. <i>möglich;</i> the word appears in the 14th century]:—<i>possible,</i> Fms. xi. 431, Fas. i. 45, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mok-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mök
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>intercourse;</i> in the phrase, eiga mök við e-n, ef þeir eiga við hann kaup eðr önnur mök nokkur, Grág. ii. 164; see mak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mökkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. mekki, [akin to makki?], <i>a dense cloud;</i> upp setr mökk inn mykla, Skálda (in a verse), Fb. i. 212 (the verse), freq. in mod. usage; og hrynja lætr hvarmskúrar haglið úr mekki blám, of a cloud on a mountain top, Bjarni 58; þoku-m., ský-m., gufu-m., <i>a cloud of fog, vapour.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mokkur-kalfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mökkur-kálfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. the name of the clay giant, Edda 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mokkvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mökkvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a cloud, mist,</i> Sks. 203; ok um miðnætti máni í mökkva sig hylr, Bjarni 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. malar [mala], <i>pebbles, worn stones,</i> i. e. <i>the bed of pebbles on the beach</i> or <i>in a river;</i> annat liðit stóð niðri á mölinni, Fms. x. 138; Flosi var uppi a mölinni, er hann sá þetta, Grett. 89; eru þeir nú kasaðir þar í mölinni, Fs. 175; glymja við möl, Þd.; þar var brúk ok möl fyrir ofan, Sturl. ii. 69, passim in mod. usage: poët., haukstrandar möl = <i>gems</i>, Höfuðl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mol-brotinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möl-brotinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>shivered into pieces.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/molr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mölr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., acc. pl. mölu, Fb. ii. 78; pl. melir or gen. sing. malar hardly occurs; [Ulf. <i>malo</i> = σής, Matth. vi. 19, 20; O. H. G. <i>miliwa;</i> Germ. <i>milbe</i>]:—<i>a moth;</i> þá mun mölr eigi spilla, Pr. 474; eigi einn möl, 655 xiii. A. 3; mölu ok maðka, Fb. ii. 78; er eigi grandar ryð né mölr, Hom. 15; mölr né ryð, Matth. vi. 19, 20; sem mölr eða motti etr ok eyðir, Barl. 44. <strong>möl-étin,</strong> part. <i>moth-eaten.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/molva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mölva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. <i>malwjan,</i> Luke iv. 18], <i>to shiver, break</i> into fragments, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/molvir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mölvir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shiverer, cracker,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mon"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mön
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. Manar, <i>the Isle of Man.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mon-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mön
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. manar, pl. manar, Akv. 37; [Engl. <i>mane</i>]:—<i>the mane of a horse;</i> æ lýsir mön af mari, Vþm. 12; mörum sínum mön jafnaði, Þkv. 6; manar meita = <i>to cut the manes,</i> Akv. 37; hann vildi taka hesta sína ok skera mön á, Rd. 268; hann sagði at hann mundi fara á Hvítings-hjalla ok skera mön á hestum Þorsteins, Bjarn. 62; hann sker mön á hestinum, Finnb. 282; Þórir fór at skera mön á hrossum sínum ok Guðmundr son hans með honum, Gullþ. 22. The cutting of horse’s manes was a favourite amusement in olden times, cp. man-skæri, <i>mane-scissors,</i> <strong>mön-skurðr,</strong> m. <i>a mane-cutting,</i> Gullþ. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mond-laug"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mönd-laug
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = mundlaug, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mondudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mönduðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sword,</i> from being <i>grasped with the hand,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mondull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möndull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. möndli, [qs. mundull, from mund; cp. Engl. <i>mangle,</i> qs. <i>mandle;</i> Germ. <i>mangeln</i>]:—<i>a handle,</i> esp. <i>of a handmill;</i> tökum skarpara á möndli, Gs. 19: hræra möndul, Hkv. 2. 3, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mopurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möpurr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [for. word], <i>a maple-tree,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-bjuga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mör-bjúga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a sausage of lard and meat,</i> Korm. 34, Fbr. 193, 194, Sturl. ii. 132, Bs. i. 357 (810).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-landi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mör-landi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (<strong>mör-lendingr,</strong> m., Bs. i. 222, v. l.; <strong>mör-fjandi,</strong> m. = <i>suet-fiend,</i> Fms. vii. 35), <i>a suet-man,</i> a nickname which the Norsemen used to give to the Icelanders in consequence of their supporting themselves chiefly by their flocks and herds, viltú, mörlandi, þú ert mör-biskup, Bs. i. 357, 811, see also Fms. iii. 154, vii. 114, 118, Ísl. ii. 39 (read mörlandi).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-nefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mör-nefr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>suet-nose,</i> a nickname, Fms. vii. 138.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-strutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mör-strútr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-sugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mör-sugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>marrow-sucker,</i> the name of the midwinter month, Rb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mor-vomb"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mör-vömb
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>suet-paunch.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mörðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. marðar, dat. merði, [Engl. <i>marten;</i> Germ. <i>marder;</i> Dan. <i>maard</i>]:—<i>a marten;</i> in Edda (Gl.) mörðr is wrongly put among the names of rams, for the marten is not known in Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mork"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mörk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f., gen. sing. merkr, pl. merkr, [a word common to all Teut. languages]:—<i>a mark,</i> in weight equal to eight ounces or half a pound; twenty merkr make a fjórðung, q. v.; eighty merkr = a vætt; þat er lögpundari at átta fjórðungar eru í vætt, en tuttugu merkr skolu í fjórðungi vera, Grág. i. 499.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/morn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mörn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. an ogress or giantess, Edda (Gl.); <i>the ship</i> is called mörnar vakr, hestr, <i>the steed of m.,</i> Hallfred; <i>the sea,</i> mörnar mór, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mornir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mörnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., as also <strong>Mörni,</strong> a, m. the name of an idoi, þiggi M. þetta blæti, Fb. ii. 334 (in a verse). Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/morr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mörr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. mörvi, mod. mör, gen. pl. mörva, Bjarn. (in a verse):—<i>the suet</i> of an animal, Stj. 430, Bs. i. 568; soðinn mörr, Kormak; forn mör. Bjarn. (in a verse); hálf vætt mörs var í dilkinum, Grett. 141 new Ed.; skera mör, <i>to chop suet,</i> K. Þ. K. 92, Vm. 119, Dipl. iii. 4, Bs. i. 611; netja ok mör, Sks. 129; garn-mör, nýrna-mör, <i>the kidney-fat;</i> mörva mígir. a term of abuse, Bjarn. (in a verse); blóð-mör, a kind of <i>black pudding.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/moru-eldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möru-eldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., see maurueldr, Edda ii. 174.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/morvadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mörvaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>fat</i>, of a beast.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/moskvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möskvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>mæscre;</i> Engl. <i>mesh;</i> O. H. G. <i>masca;</i> Germ. <i>masche;</i> Dan. <i>maske</i>]:—<i>a mesh;</i> ríða möskva, hann tók net ok garn ok reið á möskva svá sem net er síðan, Edda 39 (i. 182, v. l.); selnet tuttugu möskva djúpt, Grág. ii. 358, freq. in mod. usage. The word seems to be used as neut. (with the art. moskon) in O. H. L. 74,—þá mun (= munu?) eigi gott þola moskon þin (= moskvinn þinn?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mosmar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mösmar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>treasures,</i> Rm. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mosni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mösni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. the name of a bear, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mosur-bolli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mösur-bolli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., <strong>-skál,</strong> f., <strong>-ker,</strong> [Old Engl. <i>maser-bowl</i>], n. <i>a bowl</i> or <i>vessel of maple,</i> Fms. vi. 184, Karl. 53, Vm. 58, Dipl. iii. 4; such bowls are freq. mentioned in inventories of churches, Vm. 58; cp. mid. H. G., where <i>maser</i> is even used of <i>a chalice, a maple-wood cup.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mosur-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mösur-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a maple-tree,</i> Fms. iii. 135.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mosurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mösurr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [O. H. G. <i>masar;</i> mid. H. G. <i>maser;</i> Early Engl. <i>maser</i>]:—<i>a maple-tree, ‘spot-wood,’</i> Fb. i. 548.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mottul-band"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möttul-band
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a mantle-tie,</i> fastening it round the neck, Fb. i. 131, Fms. vii. 201, Flóv. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mottul-skaut"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möttul-skaut
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a mantle-skirt,</i> Korm. 214 (as also the verse), Fms. vi. 243.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/mottull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          möttull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. möttli; [no doubt from Lat. <i>mantile,</i> = <i>a hand-towel</i> or <i>napkin;</i> whence the word came into the Romance languages, Ital. <i>mantello;</i> Span. <i>mantilla;</i> Fr. <i>manteau;</i> Engl. <i>mantle;</i> thence into the Teutonic, O. H. G. <i>mantal</i>]:—<i>a mantle;</i> occurring as early as in Kormak, but not used elsewhere by old poets, although freq. in the Sagas, Fms. i. 211, ii. 280, xi. 275, Fs. 60, Nj. 28, Fb. i. 20, ii. 131, Fær. 264, 266; the möttull was worn by both men and women; skikkja, which is the genuine Norse word, seems to be synonymous with möttull; thus skikkja, Fagrsk. 115 (line 25), is called möttull, 117 (line 24): the möttull was prob. a short light mantle, fastened by strings (tuglar) round the neck, whence it was called tugla-möttull, Fb. ii. 130, Fær. 263, or möttull á tuglum, and it seems usually to have been of foreign cut and of costly foreign stuff (a purple mantle is mentioned in Fagrsk. l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/motu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mötu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see mata.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/motu-nautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          mötu-nautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a messmate,</i> N. G. L. i. 186, Eb. 194, Orkn. 118, Grág. i. 186, ii. 73, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
