        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [nauðigr], <i>to compel, force,</i> 625. 71: with dat., n. e-m til e-s, nauðga mönnum til blóta, 65, Fms. i. 129, xi. 181, Nj. 134; n. e-m til sagna, Fb. 46 new Ed.:—<i>to ravish,</i> Lat. <i>violare,</i> K. Á. 214.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudgan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðgan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>compulsion:—ravishing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in old writers often contr. nauðgan, nauðgir, nauðgum, <i>forced, unwilling,</i> N. G. L. i. 12, Ld. 172; Þyri fór mjök nauðig, Fms. ii. 132, Landn. 247; láta hann fara nauðgan, Nj. 114; ef maðr færir mann nauðgan ördrag eða lengra … varðar þat, Grág. ii. 131; af nauðgum múnkum, Fms. vii. 207; með nauðgum kosti, Barl. 70; þó honum væri þetta nauðigt, Flóv.; taka konu nauðga, <i>to ravish,</i> Fms. ix. 451, D.I. i. 243, N. G. L. ii. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f.; this is perh. the only fem. of the 1st decl. which has retained the inflexive <i>r</i> as in Goth.; for the feminines with <i>i</i> in acc. and dat., see Gramm. p. xvii, col. 2 (III. at the bottom), are of a different declension; [Scot. <i>neide,</i> see nauð]:—<i>necessity,</i> only used in nom.; ef mik nauðr um stendr, Hm. 155; nauðr um skildi, <i>need made them part,</i> Vkv. 3; nauðr er at nýta eiða, <i>‘tis needful to keep one’s oath,</i> Orkn. (in a verse); rak hann þó engi n. til þess, <i>there was no necessity for him,</i> Skálda 164; mun þik þó n. til reka, Nj. 61, Fs. 127; n. er á e-u, eigi drap ek Gauk fyrr en mér væri nauðr á, Nj. 227; enda sé þó n. at skilja (<i>one must needs know</i>) hvat þeir stoða í málinu, Skálda 165; mun eigi n. at minnask Jökuls fræada várs, Fs. 23; þótti þeim n. til bera, Fms. vi. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>nauðugliga,</strong> adv. <i>in need</i>; n. kominn, staddr, <i>in straits,</i> Fms. i. 186, Sturl. i. 79, Karl. 456; kom hón n. frá, Eb. 318:—<i>direly, closely,</i> at rétta þann krók er honum var svá n. beygðr, Ld. 40:—<i>with difficulty,</i> Nj. 245; komask n. undan, á brott, <i>to have a narrow escape,</i> 155, Fms. i. 75; hann fékk n. forðat sér, ix. 408; hann dró undan sem nauðuligast, 393; komsk hón n. frá, Eb. 318, = Dan. <i>med nöd og neppe;</i> er þeir megu lifa við sem nauðuligast, Hom. 87; ganga n. fram, <i>to proceed slowly,</i> Bs. ii. 157.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudung"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðung
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>compulsion,</i> Fms. i. 297, H. E. i. 503, Ó. H. 243, Fs. 76; göra e-m nauðung, Bs. i. 288:—<i>unwillingness,</i> Sturl. iii. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudungar-eidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðungar-eiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an oath taken under compulsion,</i> Fms. vii. 176.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudungar-kostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðungar-kostr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dire choice,</i> Eg. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudungar-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðungar-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>without compulsion,</i> Fms. vi. 215: <i>unharmed</i>, 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudungar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðungar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m.; in the phrase, vera e-s n., <i>to be under another person’s thumb, yield him forced obedience,</i> Ld. 170, Fms. i. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naudungar-saett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauðungar-sætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = nauðasætt, Hkr. iii. 373.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naum-daell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naum-dæll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>one from</i> <strong>Naumu-dalr,</strong> a county in Norway, so called from the river <strong>Nauma,</strong> Fms., Landn., Munch’s Norg. Beskr. <strong>Naum-dælskr,</strong> adj. id., Fms. vi. 112.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naum-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naum-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>close, stingy,</i> Fas. iii. 425.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naum-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naum-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>scarcely, hardly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nauma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nauma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., poët. <i>a woman,</i> from her <i>tight</i> dress (?); nála n., <i>a needle-woman,</i> Grett. (in a verse): hirði-n., hör-n., poët. = <i>a woman, linen-keeper,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naumindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naumindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>difficulty;</i> með naumindum, <i>with difficulty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naumr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [akin to nema?], <i>narrow, close;</i> í holdsins hreysi naumu, Pass. 17. 10: <i>close, scant, stingy,</i> verða naumt fyrir, <i>to run short as to time;</i> hafa nauman tíma, <i>to have a short time;</i> naum grið, Bs. ii. 508 (17th century); vera naumt við kominn, <i>to be pressed for time:</i> superl. naumast, as adv. <i>scarcely</i> or <i>narrowly,</i> eg get naumast lesið það, <i>I can hardly read it.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>nöst</i>; Orkn. <i>noust;</i> from an obsolete nó-r = <i>a ship</i>, with which cp. Lat. <i>navis,</i> Gr. ναυς]:—<i>a ship-shed, boat-house,</i> often used in pl., like Lat. <i>navalia</i> or Engl. <i>docks;</i> konungr hafði látið göra hús mikit, þat er hann ætlaði til nausts, þat var nírætt at lengd en sextigi álna breitt, Fms. vii. 247, x. 13, Ó. H. 62, 115, Fbr. 93 new Ed.; skip í nausti, Korm. 68; hann gengr út ór naustinu, id.; hann leyndisk í naustinu, ofan frá naustinu, Grett. 88, 97, 99, Fs. 147, Háv. 27 new Ed., Eb. 236, passim; hurða-naust, <i>a shed of hurdles,</i> Háv. 20 new Ed.: poët., nausta blakkr, <i>‘naust-steed,’</i> i. e. <i>a ship</i>, Hkr. i. (in a verse); böðvar-naust, <i>war-shed</i>, i. e. <i>a shield,</i> Nj. (in a verse); hríðar-n., <i>tempest-shed,</i> i. e. <i>the sky,</i> Harms. 23: local name, <strong>Nausta-lækr,</strong> Ísl. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naust-dyrr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naust-dyrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>‘nausl-doors,’</i> Stor. 3, Rd. 268.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naust-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naust-görð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘naust-making,’</i> N. G. L. i. 101, Pm. 7, Vm. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naust-veggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naust-veggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘naust-wall,’</i> Fær. 268.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naut"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naut
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [from njóta; A. S. <i>neât</i>; Engl. <i>neat</i>; Scot. <i>nout</i>; O. H. G. <i>nôz;</i> Dan. <i>nöd</i>]:—<i>cattle, oxen:</i> plur., naut ok sauði, Fms. ii. 92, vi. 69, Ld. 160, Fs. 26, 128; ef hann hefir oxa í nautum sínum, N. G. L. i. 25; láta inn naut, Gísl. 20; hann knýtir saman halana á nautunum, 29; gæta nauta, Bjarn. 32; hann kom til nautanna, ok stangaði hvert annat, Grett. 112; þessi vetr var kallaðr sandvetr, þá dó hundrað nauta fyrir Snorra Sturlusyni á Svignaskarði, Sturl. ii. 93 (of herds of cattle grazing in the mountain pastures during winter); kunna ek á ísleggjum, en þú kunnir þat eigi heldr en naut, Fms. vii. 120; nauta fjöldi, flokkr, <i>a drove of cattle,</i> Glúm. 342, Stj.; naut mörg, Eg. 743; nauts belgr, skinn, húð, <i>a neat’s hide, skin,</i> Landn. 212, Hkr. iii. 80, Eb. 136, Sks. 184; nauts höfuð, rófa, síða, Grett. 116, Eb. 276, Fms. ii. 139; nauts fall, <i>a neat’s carcase,</i> Fms. v. 21; nauts búkr, id., Eb. 220, Fms. ix. 309; nauts blóð or nauta blóð, Landn. 258, Hdl. 10; nauts bein, Fms. ii. 142; nauts virði, <i>a neat’s worth, price of a head of cattle,</i> D. N.; nauts fóðr, <i>‘a neat’s fodder,’ a measure of hay enough to keep one cow through winter,</i> Eb. 260: metaph. <i>a nout, blockhead,</i> hann er naut, cp. nautheimskr: local names, <strong>Naut-eyri, Nauta-bú,</strong> Dan. <i>Nödebo,</i> Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/naut-beit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          naut-beit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = nautabeit, Vm. 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
