        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>nigh, near to, near at hand,</i> with dat., Sks. 782; þar var n. til görs at ganga, Ld. 96; um várit n. kyndil-messu, Fms. x. 411: as adv <i>almost, nearly, well-nigh,</i> Eg. 58, Nj. 219, Fms. i. 222, ii. 50, Ld. 38, Sks. 62, Bs. i. 394, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
