          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>nátt-verðr,</strong> m., <strong>nótturðr,</strong> Greg. 28, 74; [Swed. <i>nattvärd;</i> Dan. <i>nadver</i>]:—<i>a ‘night-meal,’ supper;</i> fara til náttverðar, Fms. i. 209 (as also Hkr. and Fb. l. c.); fyrir náttverð ok eptir, Fms. x. 331; gefa náttverð, K. Þ. K. 108; ala prest at dagverði ok náttverði, 50; búa til nátturðar, Edda 29; settisk Þórr til náttverðar ok þeir lagsmenn, 28; af því er samkunda Guðs köllut n́tturðr heldr en dögurðr, Greg. 28; er eigi sá beini beztr, at yðr sé borð sett ok gefinn náttverðr, ok síðan fari þér at sofa, Eg. 548; suppers are also meant by the meals in the poem Rm.; náttverðar dvöl, <i>stopping for supper,</i> Hkr. ii. 373.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natt-vaka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nátt-vaka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a night-wake, night-watch, sitting up at night,</i> Hom. 36:—of <i>a lyke-wake,</i> alla þjónustu skal hann veita mót tíund nema náttvöku, N. G. L. i. 347.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natt-veizla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nátt-veizla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a night-banquet,</i> Thom.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natt-vig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nátt-víg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a putting one to death during the night,</i> which was regarded as murder, see the remarks s. v. morð, Eg. 416, Fas. ii. 400.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natt-thing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nátt-þing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a night-meeting,</i> 625. 165, Orkn. (in a verse); opp. to dagþing, q. v.: meetings during night were not thought proper.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nátta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to pass the night:</i> subj. nætti, þat er mitt ráð að vér nættim þar, Fms. iii. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nattmala-skeid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttmála-skeið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the hour of night-meal,</i> Sturl. iii. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nattmala-varda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttmála-varða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a pyramid</i> or <i>column</i> on the horizon, intended to shew the hour of n. by the sun’s position relatively to it, Þórð. 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nattura"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [from Lat. <i>natura</i>], <i>nature;</i> eptir boði náttúrunnar, Fms. i. 104; sjálf náttúran, Stj. 177; náttúran sjálf en fyrsta móðir vár, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúraðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>having such and such virtue,</i> Stj. 84, Bs. ii. 55: <i>given, inclined to,</i> n. fyrir e-ð, mod.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúrliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>according to nature, properly,</i> Bs. i. 221, Fms. i. 102, Mirm. ch. 14, Skálda 176:—<i>of course,</i> (mod.): (? from Germ. <i>naturlich.</i>)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúrligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>proper, natural;</i> n. dagr, <i>the natural day,</i> Stj., Rb. 476: <i>natural, carnal,</i> H. E. i. 523.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-bragd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-bragð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., Lat. <i>indoles, natural character,</i> Mag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-gjof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-gjöf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a <i>natural gift,</i> Stj. 70, 254, Edda (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-gripr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-gripr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an object possessed of virtue,</i> Bs. ii. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-gros"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-grös
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>herbs possessing virtue.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without virtue,</i> Konr. 20: <i>impotent.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-log"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-lög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the law of nature.</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/natturu-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          náttúru-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a stone possessing virtue,</i> Pr. 423, Karl. 119, 178.",
            }
          }
        />
