      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nefst"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nefst
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (nepst), [Swed. <i>näfst</i>], <i>a penalty, chastisement;</i> undir Heilagrar kirkju nefst ok refsing, Munk. 72, D. N. v. 785: en er verra, þat er vita þykkjumk, niðja stríð um nept, <i>my mind bodes me still worse things, a sore retribution to thy sons (a bitter fratricidal strife),</i> Skv. 2. 8, for this must be the true sense of this contested passage; nept for nepst may be right by analogy of heipt and heipst; the word is altogether obsolete in Iceland, but is still in use in Sweden.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/negg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
