          className="link"
          href="/word/negla-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          negla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [nagli], <i>to nail</i>, N. G. L. i. 111, Fbr. 133, Hom. 103, Fms. v. 224, Sks. 707, Eb. 182, Sól. 65, Fb. i. 515, passim: <i>to stud,</i> negldar brynjur, Vkv. 6; ey-negld, hólm-negld, <i>island-studded, holm-studded,</i> an epithet of the sea, Eg. (in a verse), Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
