            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nei"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nei
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [Ulf. <i>nê;</i> A. S. <i>nâ;</i> Engl. <i>no;</i> Germ. <i>nein;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>nei</i>]:—<i>no;</i> nei sem nei er, K. Á. 200; nei, kvað Úlfhéðinn, Fs. 78; kveða nei við, <i>to say no,</i> N. G. L. i. 345; þeir kveða þar nei við, Hkr. i. 277; setja nei fyrir, <i>to set a no against it, refuse,</i> Fms. ix. 242; setja þvert nei fyrir, <i>to refuse flatly,</i> ii. 131, Ld. 196; segja nei móti e-u, <i>to gainsay,</i> D. N. ii. 257.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nei-kvaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nei-kvæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to disown,</i> with dat., Str. 16; see nékvæða.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. pron., prop. a compd contr. from né einn = <i>not one, none,</i> but afterwards contr.; it is, however, never used as a pure negative, but only after a negative, as indef. pron.; for the older uncontr. usage see né A. II: [cp. A. S. <i>nân;</i> Engl. <i>none</i>]:—<i>any,</i> Lat. <i>ullus,</i> following after a negation, aldri svá at honum væri nein raun í, <i>never … any danger,</i> Nj. 262; varð eigi af neinni eptir-för, Valla L. 196; ekki er þetta furða nein, <i>it is no apparition,</i> Ísl. ii. 337; þess mundi eigi leita þurfa, at konungr mundi neina sætt göra, 84; Erlingr hafði eigi skaplyndi til at biðja konung hér neinna muna um, Ó. H. 47; aldri svá … at neitt vápn, Fas. i. 281; kom mér aldregi í hug, at sá mundi neinn vera, Art.; ekki neinu sinni, <i>not once</i>, Fb. i. 104; ekki neins staðar, <i>nowhere</i>:—where the negation is indirect or understood, lét hann af at eggja konung á neinar ferðir, Fb. ii. 427, (né einar, Fms. vii. 29, l. c.); skal ek miklu heldr þola dauða en veita þeim neitt mein, Nj. 168; at hann mundi taka úmjúkliga á því, at vægjask í neinum hlut til, Ó. H. 51; fyrr skal hón fúna en neinn taki hana, Lv. 50:—en neinn = en nokkur, <i>than any</i>; fleira íllt gékk yfir Gyðinga-lýð en yfir neina þjóð aðra, Ver. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. neipar, <i>the ‘nip,’ the interstice between the fingers;</i> í neipinni; perh. better gneip.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neisa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neisa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to put to shame;</i> herfiliga neist ok rangliga raskat, Bs. i. 392; for more references see hneisa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neisa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neisa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., mod. hneisa, which form also occurs in old vellums, [Swed. <i>nesa</i>]:—<i>shame, disgrace;</i> this is the true form, as is shewn by the allit. in Hm. 48 and Fm. 11; and also in phrases like, niðra ok neisa; for references see hneisa. <strong>neisu-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>shameful, degrading.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neisi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neisi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = neisa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neisinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neisinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = neiss; in ú-neisinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neiss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neiss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Swed. <i>nes</i>], <i>inglorious, ashamed;</i> neiss er nökkviðr halr, a saying, <i>a naked man is ashamed,</i> Hm. 48, cp. Gen. iii. 10; Norna dóm þú munt fyrr neisum hafa, <i>thou wilt scorn the doom of the Norns,</i> Fm. 11; þeir sendu hann til sömu eyjar nöktan ok neisan, Barl. 62.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neisti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neisti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a spark;</i> see gneisti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>flour, efflorescence,</i> a απ. λεγ.; neit Menju góð, <i>the costly flour of Menja,</i> i. e. <i>gold,</i> Skv. 3. 50; the word remains, though with a false aspirate, in common Icel. hneita (q. v.), <i>the white efflorescence on seaweed</i> (söl); akin is the Icel. naut. phrase, það hnitar í báru (in a ditty of Pal Vídal.), <i>the waves are white-tipped</i> (as if sprinkled with flour); the explanation given in Lex. Poët., s. v. neit, is prob. erroneous.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, and also <strong>neitta, neitti,</strong> [Scot. <i>nyte;</i> Dan. <i>nægte</i>], <i>to deny, refuse,</i> absol. or with dat.; konungr neitaði þverliga, Fms. vi. 214; þeir höfðu boðit honum laun, en hann neitti, i. 12; hann neitaði með mikilli þrályndi, x. 306; hinn sem neitar, K. Á. 204; hefi ek þar góðum grip neitt, Fms. vi. 359; er nú vel þú veizt hverju þú neitaðir, 360; neita penningum, xi. 428:—with a double dat., neita e-m e-u, vii. 90: with acc. of the thing, ef nokkurr neitar kirkju-garð, K. Á. 68; hverr sá er neitar mitt nafn, þeim (sic) skal ek neita, Barl. 122.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neitan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neitan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>denying;</i> af-neitan, K. Á. 204, Th. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neitari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neitari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a denier,</i> Gd. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neiting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neiting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a denial,</i> Hom. 11, Th. 8: gramm. <i>the negative,</i> Skálda 200.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nekkverr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nekkverr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "indef. pron.; this word is a compound of the negative particle né (q. v.) and the pronoun hverr, qs. nih-hverr, ne-hverr, nekkverr; the double <i>k</i> (in the oldest MSS. often represented by <i>cq</i>) may be due to the final <i>h</i> of the particle, as the compd was formed at a time when the final <i>h</i> had not been absorbed into né: [Dan. <i>nogen;</i> Swed. <i>någon.</i> Mr. Uppström, and since Bugge, derive this word from ne-veit-hverr, instead of Grimm’s ne-hverr, cp. A. S. <i>nâthwæt</i> = <i>ne-wât-hwæt</i> = Icel. nakkvat; this would better account for the double <i>k,</i> but otherwise it has no influence on the inflexive changes of the word.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [nökviðr], <i>nakedness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nema"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nema
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> conj. [compounded of the negative particle <i>ne,</i> and the adverb <i>if</i> or <i>ef</i> (q. v.) in an older dissyllabic form ifa; for the change of <i>f</i> into <i>m</i> see the introduction; cp. Ulf. <i>nibai;</i> A. S. <i>nemne, nimne;</i> O. H. G. <i>nibu, nibi, nubi;</i> Hel. <i>nebu;</i> early Swed. <i>num;</i> cp. Lat. <i>ni-si,</i> see Grimm’s Gramm. iii. 724.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nenna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nenna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>energy,</i> <strong>nennu-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>listless, idle,</i> Al. 100.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nenna-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nenna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Ulf. <i>nanþjan</i> = τολμαν; A. S. <i>nêþan;</i> O. H. G. <i>nendian,</i> whence the Germ. pr. name Ferdi-<i>nand</i> = <i>the doughty, striving</i>]:—<i>to strive,</i> with dat. or infin., but only used in peculiar phrases; nenna e-u or n. at göra e-t, <i>to have a heart, mind for a thing;</i> hann nennti eigi starfi því ok áhyggju, Bs. i. 450; sem synir mínir nenni eigi (<i>cannot bear</i>) þessari kyrrsetu lengr, Ld. 262; mun ek eigi n. öðru (<i>I cannot longer forbear to</i>) en fara í móti þeim, Fb. ii. 41; hann kvaðsk eigi lengr nenna at þola háð ok spott, Ísl. ii. 269; ek nennta at vísu at neyta vápna, 366; þeir nenntu eigi at verja sik, Orkn. 78; ólíkr er Gísli at þolinmæði, þvíat þessu mundu engir nenna at ljá nú gripina, þannig sem hann er áðr beiddr, Gísl. 112; eigi nenni ek (<i>I have no mind</i>) at hafa þat saman at veita Högna enda drepa bróður hans, Nj. 145; slíkar eptir-görðir sem hverr nennti (<i>was minded</i>) framast at göra eptir sinn vin eða náung, Fms. viii. 103; ef nokkorir eru þeir er nenna (<i>who wish</i>) at hverfa aptr til bæjarins, 320; nú nenni ek eigi at vér farim svá halloki, Fær. 228; eigi nenni ek því (<i>I cannot forbear</i>) at marka hann eigi, Fms. ii. 61; Gyrgir nennti eigi (<i>could not bear</i>) brott at fara við lítið fé eðr ekki, 152; Hrafn nennti eigi at starfa, <i>H. would not work, was lazy,</i> vi. 102; whence the mod. eg nenni því ekki, <i>I will not, I am too lazy to do it;</i> þú nennir öngu, <i>thou art good for nothing!</i> hann er svo latr … hann nennir ekki neitt að gera, Grönd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nenning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nenning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>activity, energy,</i> Edda 109, Fms. v. 177 (in a verse), Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nenningar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nenningar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>slothful,</i> Fms. iii. 158, Fbr. 92 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nenningar-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nenningar-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>irksomeness,</i> Grág. i. 301, Róm. 344.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nenninn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nenninn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>active, striving,</i> Sighvat, Lex. Poët., and in poët. compds; fjöl-n., marg-n., <i>doing much good work;</i> þrek-n., <i>doughty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nennir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nennir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [prob. an assimilated form, qs. neknir, see the remarks s. v. nykr]:—the popular name of the nykr (q. v.), Maurer’s Volks.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nepja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nepja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [napr], <i>chilliness, bitter cold;</i> en undir birtinguna andar köld nepja frá fljótinu, Od. v. 469.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neppi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neppi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [Swed. <i>näppeligen</i>], <i>hardly;</i> n. eðr ekki, Stj. 25; þeim vannsk n., <i>the ends did hardly meet,</i> 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>scant;</i> ganga neppr níu fet, <i>to walk with pain nine paces,</i> Vsp.; fjör-neppr, <i>scant of life,</i> Fbr. (in a verse); nauð görir neppa kosti, Rkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. nesja, dat. nesjum, [A. S. <i>næs;</i> Engl. <i>ness;</i> Germ. <i>nase;</i> Lat. <i>nasus</i> = <i>nose;</i> as also nös nasar, = <i>the nostrils</i>, are kindred words]:—<i>a ness</i> projecting into the sea or a lake; undir nesi einu, Nj. 43; nes mikit gékk í sæ út, Eg. 129; nesit þat er fram gékk í sjóinn, Fbr. 89 new Ed.; vatn þat er nes liggr í, Ísl. ii. 345: even of a river (= oddi), Nj. 95, 96; ann-nes or and-nes, q. v.: of <i>a slip</i> of land, búar skulu rétta merki, ok jamna þar nesjum saman, Grág. ii. 262, 263.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-hraun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-hraun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>Ness lava,</i> Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-hofdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-höfði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a headland,</i> Fms. iii. 44.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-konungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-konungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘ness-king,’</i> a nickname of the old sea kings, who had no lands, but their ships, for a kingdom, Fms. ix. 255; skjótt man eigi vanta annan tíma neskonunga í Noregi ef því skal fram haldask, N. G. L. iii. 33; þá munu margir verða neskonungar brátt, Fms. ix. 255.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-konungr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-konungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a pr. name, Baut. 402.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men from</i> Nes, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-nam"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-nám
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n.; nema nesnám, <i>to make a ‘ness-raid,’</i> a term used by the old vikings when they landed on narrow headlands and took cattle and provisions by force; nema nesnám ok höggva strandhögg, Eg. 81, Orkn 64, Fms. i. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-oddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-oddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>nes-tangi,</strong> a, m. <i>a point of a ness,</i> Nj. 125, Fms. vii. 361, Fs. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nes-thjodir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nes-þjóðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the people of Caithness,</i> Fms. x.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nest"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nest
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>nesti,</strong> n. [A. S. <i>nest;</i> Dan. <i>niste</i>]:—<i>viands, provisions,</i> Lat. <i>viaticum;</i> hann batt nest þeirra allt í einn bagga ok lagði á bak sér, Edda 29; ok vóru á öðrum vistir þeirra bræðra ok ætlaðar þeim til nests, Ísl. ii. 342; skal hann bera, ef hann vill, nest sitt til skips, N. G. L. i. 143; veg-nest, <i>viaticum,</i> Hm. 11; far-nest, q. v.: allit., með nesti og nýja skó, <i>furnished with ‘nest’ and new shoes.</i> <strong>nestis-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>without</i> nest.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nest-baggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nest-baggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘nest’ bag, wallet,</i> Edda 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nest-lok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nest-lok
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the ‘bottom of the bag;’</i> in the adverb. phrase, at nestlokum, <i>at last, finally,</i> Bs. i. 417 (at nêst lokum Ed.); en at nestlokum sverði höggvinn, Blas. 51; mon ok Goð láta eldinn ganga yfir heiminn at nestlokonom, Hom. (St.); at nestlokum krossfestr, 656 B. 4; at n. vinnr Már á Þórði, Sturl. i. 10: with gen., at nestlokum málsins, 23, v. l.; at nestlokum æfinnar, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nesta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nesta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t; nesta sik, <i>to provide oneself with food.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. netja, dat. netjum, [Ulf. <i>nati</i> = δίκτυον; A. S. and Engl. <i>net;</i> Hel. <i>neti;</i> Germ. <i>netz;</i> Swed. <i>nät</i>]:—<i>a net;</i> tók hann lín ok garn ok reið á möskva svá sem net er síðan, Edda 39 (in the mythical story of the origin of the net as an invention of Loki); ef maðr hittir net í látrum sínum ok sel í, þá á hann net ok svá sel, til hinn leysir landnámi net út, N. G. L. i. 45; nú tekr maðr síld ór netjum manna, ii. 136; leggja net í á, Grág. ii. 350; hvárki net né öngla, K. Þ. K.; netja spell, <i>damage of nets,</i> N. G. L. ii. 136, 137; netja stæði—netlög. Boldt 134; netja veiðr, <i>a net-haul,</i> id.; ríða net, <i>to make a net;</i> drag-net, <i>a drag-net, draw-net;</i> lag-net, <i>a lag-net;</i> slag-net, <i>a casting-net,</i> for catching birds:—metaph., net lifrar = <i>reticulum jecoris,</i> Stj. 310. Exod. xxix. 13, 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-flar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-flár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl., and <strong>net-kubbar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the quills of a net.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-hals"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-háls
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the neck</i> or <i>throat of a net,</i> Post. 656 C. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-lagnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-lagnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>places where nets are spread.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-log"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-lög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>‘net-layings’,</i> i. e. the right of laying nets in certain waters; hann skyldi rýma netlögin fyrir þeim, Fs. 35; kirkja á selveiði við Eiðsker ok tvau netlög, Vm. 57; menn eigu at veiða fyrir útan netlög at úsekju, Grág. ii. 358.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-naemr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-næmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>that may be caught in a net;</i> netnæmir fiskar, Grág. i. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-rost"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-röst
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = netlagnir, on the sea, D. N. ii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/net-thinull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          net-þinull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the upper net-line,</i> bordering the net, Edda 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/netja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          netja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to net, catch:</i> metaph. netjaðr, <i>netted, entangled,</i> Fms. x. 404; allri skurðgoða villu er hann hefir yðr í netjað, i. 282; er hann nú svá í netjaðr ást hennar, Str. 24:—reflex., netjask í bandi, H. E. i. 238, Str. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nett-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nett-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>neatness,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nettr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>neat, handsome,</i> (mod. and for.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>need, distress,</i> Hkr. iii. 288, Stj. 182, 213; this form is very freq. in mod. usage, esp. in hymns, Vídal., the Bible, instead of the older nauð (q. v.), e. g. Pass. 41. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [nauð], <i>to force, compel;</i> neyða e-n til e-s, Grág. i. 306, O. H. L. 41; ek þykkjumk þó mjök neyddr til hafa verit, Nj. 88; þeir neyddu hann og sögðu, Luke xxiv. 29, passim in mod. usage: <i>to subdue,</i> hann neyddi útrú Gyðinga, Hom. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neydar-kostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyðar-kostr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dire choice.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neydar-urraedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyðar-úrræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>dire expedients.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyslu-salt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyslu-salt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>common salt,</i> Gþl. 430.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [nautr, njóta; Germ. <i>nätzen;</i> A. S. <i>notian;</i> Old Engl. and Scot. <i>note</i>], <i>to use, enjoy,</i> with gen. or absol.; neyta fjár-nytjar þeirrar, <i>to use the milk,</i> Grág. i. 428; koma mun þar at vér munum þess n., Nj. 232; þeim er neytti eðr njóta þyrfti þessa vættis, 238; ok svá allra gagna til at neyta, Grág. ii. 81; þar er menn selja hross sín til geymslu á alþingi at lögmáli, skal sá, er við hefir tekit, at engu neyta, 140; nefnir hann sér vætti þat at lögum, at njóta ok neyta, ii. 79.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [nautr], <i>fellowship, mateship, a company;</i> neyti eru nítján menn, <i>nineteen make a company,</i> Edda 208; bera vætti með neyti þat (<i>with other fellow-witnesses</i>) er ek fæ þér til, Grág. ii. 54; leysa þann kvið af hendi þegar er þeir hafa neyti at, i. 54: esp. in compds, mötu-neyti, föru-n., ráðu-n., lögu-n. (q. v.), etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the using a thing, tasting,</i> <strong>neytingar-vatn,</strong> n. <i>water for domestic use,</i> Gísl. 28, (mod. esp. of drinking water, opp. to water for washing.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neytr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neytr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>good, fit for use;</i> vápn þat er neytt sé, Grett. 99 A; hesta alla þá er neytir eru, Sturl. iii. 237:—neytr at e-u, <i>good for something,</i> at hví neyt sé, <i>for what they are useful,</i> Grág. ii. 266; n. til e-s, andvana lík til einskis neytt, Pass. 4. 23: of persons, <i>good, useful,</i> Kolbeinn féll ok margrir aðrir neytir menn, Bs. i. 141.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyzla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyzla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a using, consuming,</i> Barl. 14, 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyzlu-grannr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyzlu-grannr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>one who requires little nourishment;</i> hann er n., opp. to <strong>neyzlu-frekr.</strong>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neyzlu-vatn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neyzlu-vatn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = neytingarvatn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nezla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nezla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>nestla,</strong> u, f. [nisti], <i>a loop</i> to fasten a cloak or the like, Þorf. Karl. ch. 7: mod. hnezla or hnesla, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/neztr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          neztr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= neðstr, see neðri, Barl. 155, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. niðar, N. G. L. i. 29; dat. pl. niðjum, Vsp. 6 (later niðum); the gender is seen from the pl. niðar (l. c.) from the compd niðar- below, as also from the provinc. Norse and Swed. <i>near</i>; [Swed. <i>nedar;</i> Dan. <i>næ;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>near</i>]:—<i>the wane</i> of the moon, when there is <i>‘no moon;’</i> it is in use in Sweden and Denmark, but now obsolete in Iceland, except in the compd niða-myrkr, qs. niðar-myrkr; in old writers esp. in the allit. phrases, ný ok nið, <i>full moon and no moon,</i> Vþm. 25; Máni stýrir göngu tungls ok ræðr nýjum ok niðum, Edda 7; um ny hit næsta ok niðar (acc. pl.), N. G. L. i. 29; nótt með niðum, Vþm. 24; nótt ok niðjum (i. e. niðum) nöfn um gáfu, Vsp. 6; máni, ný, nið, Edda 76: poët., niða borg = <i>the heaven,</i> Skálda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-gjold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nið-gjöld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>weregild after the slaughter of a relative</i> or <i>the weregild payable to the more distant relatives of the slain,</i> opp. to the höfuðbaugr; or even simply = <i>weregild,</i> gjalda hinn vegna niðgjöldum, Grág. ii. 63, 79; skal þessa menn alla gjalda niðgjöldum, 131; þá menn alla skal jamt aptr gjalda niðgjöldum, sem þeir sé vegnir, þótt þeir lifi, svá er mælt, at þat sumar skal niðgjalda heimting upp hetja, er …, Grág. ii. 185; gjaldi sendimenn konungs niðgjöldum, Eg. 575, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-kvisl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nið-kvísl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the lineage of agnates,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-myrkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nið-myrkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = niða myrkr, Gkv. 2. 12, Fær. 171, Sks. 202, Orkn. 110 (v. l.), 432, Gísl. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-orkliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nið-örkliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>hideously;</i> geispa n., Fb. i. 259.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = gniða (q. v.), <i>to rub,</i> Grett. 151 A: <i>to murmur,</i> of water.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nida-myrkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niða-myrkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘nið-mirk,’ pitch darkness and no moon;</i> þeir höfðu skriðljós með sér, en niðamyrkr var úti, Ó. H. 71, Fms. ii. 5; n. var á, Eg. 216, 235, Fms. viii. 429: the word is now used without thinking of the moon, simply = <i>pitch darkness;</i> also kol-niðamyrkr, <i>coal-pitch-dark.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. the name of a dwarf, from nið (<i>no moon</i>), Vsp., Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidjungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðjungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = niðr, <i>a son, relative,</i> Rm. 38, Lex. Poët.:—the name of a dwarf, from nið, f. (q. v.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., better gniðr, [from gniða], <i>the murmur of running water,</i> of a brook, stream, ár-niðr, lækjar-niðr, prop. <i>the wearing</i> of the water against the pebbles at the bottom; the word is very freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. some of the cases of which are taken from niðr (gen. niðs), some from a supposed niði (gen. niðja); from the former are nom. niðr, acc. nið, gen. niðs; from the latter, the plur. niðjar, niðja, niðjum; an acc. sing. niðja also occurs, Ó. H. (in a verse), as also gen. sing. niðja, Bragi; cp. also langniðjar: [Ulf. <i>niþjis</i> = συγγενής]:—<i>a son,</i> and hence of <i>any kinsman, a descendant;</i> nema reisi niðr at nið, <i>man after man,</i> Hm. 71; Börs niðr, <i>the son of B.</i> = Odin, Eg. (in a verse); Fjölnis niðr, Yggs niðr, <i>the son of F., of Ygg,</i> Ýt. 6, Fagrsk. (in a verse); Ása niðr, <i>the scion of the A.,</i> Ht.; sjávarniðr, <i>the sea’s kinsman</i> = <i>fire,</i> Ýt. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-bjugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-bjúgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>crooked;</i> n. nef, Rm. 10, Ó. T. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-brot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-brot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘down-break,’ destruction,</i> Rb. 332, Mar., Fms. v. 163. <strong>niðrbrots-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a destroyer,</i> Bs. i. 724.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-brotari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-brotari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a destroyer,</i> Bs. i. 733.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-drattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-dráttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dragging down,</i> Fb. i. 307.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-drep"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-drep
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a pulling down,</i> H. E. i. 497.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a downfall,</i> Stj. 9, Sks. 146, Barl. 89:—<i>destruction, dilapidation,</i> N. G. L. i. 343:—metaph. <i>decay, ruin,</i> Stj. 65, Sks. 450: <i>downfall, loss,</i> Fms. x. 31 (v. l.), Bs. i. 92, 132: as a law term, <i>the dropping</i> of a case, handsala n. at sökum, Nj. 21, passim.:—<i>a plague,</i> Mar. <strong>niðrfalls-sótt,</strong> f. <i>epilepsy,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>descent,</i> Bev.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-ganga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-ganga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>descent,</i> Bret. 32: <i>setting</i> of the sun, Rb. 472, 476.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-gangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-gangr
