        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = niðrganga:—medic. <i>diarrhoea.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-kvama"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-kváma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a coming down,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an end, conclusion;</i> at niðrlagi mánaðarins, Rb. 28: a saying, lítið upphaf görir stundum ágætt n., MS. 4. 9:—of a verse, book, or the like, upphaf ok n. vísu, Vígl. 30; ok er eitt n. (<i>one burden</i>) á öllum, Hkr. iii. 71: lýkr hér sögunni með svá föllnu niðrlagi ok enda, Fas. iii. 452.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-leitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-leitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>down-looking,</i> Stj. 20, 71, Karl. 553.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-lutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-lútr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘down-louting,’ downcast,</i> Sighvat, Pass. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-nida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-níða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to dilapidate,</i> esp. of a farm; jörðin er niðrnídd, <i>the estate is let down, is in a bad condition.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-rada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-raða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to arrange;</i> <strong>niðr-raðan,</strong> f. <i>order, arrangement.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-seta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-seta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = niðrsetningr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-setning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-setning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a setting down, burying,</i> Bs. i. 132.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-setningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-setningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a pauper,</i> from being distributed (<i>set down</i>) in Icel. among the different households in a parish, (setja e-n niðr á hreppinn.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-stada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-staða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the final end, conclusion</i> of a thing; það var niðrstaðan á því.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-stiga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-stiga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a descent,</i> Sks. 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-stigning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-stigning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a descent,</i> Stj. 376, Niðrst. 8, Sks. 55, passim, <strong>niðrstigningar-Saga,</strong> u, f. <i>the History of the Descent into Hell</i> (sec List of Authors F. III), Am. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-stiga-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-stíga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "steig, <i>to descend:</i> part. niðrstiginn, <i>descended,</i> Bs. i. 823.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-taka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-taka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a pulling down,</i> Fms. xi. 431.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-varp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-varp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an overthrowing,</i> Sks. 526.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidr-vidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðr-víðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wide</i> or <i>large beneath.</i> Fas. ii. 343.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. hniðra, [Scot. <i>nidder</i>], <i>to put down, lower,</i> with dat.; niðra e-m or e-u; n. blótum, Fb. i. 63; n. drambi e-s, Al. 10; þeir er mér vildu n., Fms. ix. 278; hafa hans frændr niðrat mínum ættmönnum, 306; hver sem mér n. vildi, Pass. 24. 11; ok Guðs andskotum at n., Bær. 18; neist ok niðrat, Bs., with acc. Stj. 67: mod. <i>to pull down, revile,</i> passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., mod. hniðran, <i>degradation, shame,</i> Fms. i. 208, viii. 448 (v. l.), x. 305, Sks. 775 B, Bs. i. 738.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nidri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., see niðr B. <strong>niðri-vist,</strong> f. <i>a remaining below,</i> Fms. vii. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nifl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nifl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [O. H. G. <i>nibul;</i> Germ. <i>nebel;</i> Lat. <i>nebula;</i> Gr. νεφέλη]:—<i>a mist, fog;</i> this ancient word is obsolete in the Northern languages, and solely remains in COMPDS, chiefly mythol.: <strong>nifl-farinn,</strong> part. <i>gone towards the dark,</i> i. e. <i>the dead</i>, a απ. λεγ., Akv. 33. <strong>nifl-góðr,</strong> adj. a απ. λεγ. in a doubtful passage, Stor. 15. <strong>Nifl-hel,</strong> f. <i>the Tartarus</i> of the heathen mythology, deeper down than Hel (<i>Hades</i>); wicked men are said to die a second death and pass from Hel into Niflhel; fyrir Niflhel neðan, hinnig deyja or Helju halir, Vþm. 43; ríða norðr til Niflheljar, Vtkv. 2; vándir menn fara til Heljar ok þaðan í Niflhel, Edda; ok sendi hann (the giant) niðr undir Niflhel, 27. <strong>Nifl-heimr,</strong> m. <i>Hades,</i> Edda 18,—Hel kastaði hann í Niflheim ok gaf henni vald yfir níu heimum, Edda 4; fyrr var þat mörgum öldum en jörð var sköpuð, er Niflheimr var görr, 3. <strong>nifl-vegr,</strong> m. pl. <i>the foggy way,</i> Gg. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/niflungar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          niflungar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the Niebelungen,</i> of the Germ. tales; the older form hniflungar (q. v.) shews that the word cannot be derived from nifl; the derivation in Edda 104, 105 (from king Nefir) is fanciful, and a later invention; hodd Niflunga (hniflunga?) = <i>Nibelungen hort,</i> Akv.; Niflunga skattr, <i>id.;</i> Niflunga arfr, <i>id.,</i> Bm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nikudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nikuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>Nikuðs,</strong> <strong>Nikarr,</strong> m. one of the names of Ódin, Gm., Edda (Gl.); but, as suggested by Finn Magnusson in Lex. Mythol. s. v., it no doubt was originally the name of <i>Neptune</i> or <i>a water-goblin,</i> cp. Nykr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nipt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nipt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., acc. nipti, as if from niptr, Hkv. 2. 28, [nefi]:—<i>a female relative,</i> Edda (Gl.): <i>a sister,</i> ek hefi nauðigr nipti grætta, Hkv. 2. 28; nipt ok dísi nú mun ek telja, Edda (Gl.); nipt Nara = Hel, Höfuðl. 9, cp. Edda 18; Njörfa nipt, <i>id.,</i> Stor. 24; nipt Nera, of a weird sister, Hkv. 1. 4; nipt Tveggia bága (= <i>the sister of Fenrir</i> = <i>Hela</i>) Stor. 24: <i>a daughter,</i> heil Nótt ok nipt, <i>hail Night and daughter</i> = <i>the Earth,</i> Sdm. 3, see Edda 7: <i>a niece,</i> Freys nipt, <i>the niece of Frey,</i> i. e. <i>Hnoss,</i> the daughter of Frey’s sister Freyja, Edda (in a verse):—of <i>a nun,</i> as it seems, Sighvat (in a verse):—hlað-nipt, see hlað.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nist"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = nest, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nist-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>nisti,</strong> n. <i>a brooch</i> or <i>pin,</i> as also <i>a locket;</i> that it was shaped like a pin is seen from the verb nista, see Worsaae, Nos. 371–373, 384 sqq., 425 sqq.; Halldórr hafði yfir sér skikkju ok á nist löng sem þá var títt, … sprettr Halldórr upp svá hart at nistin rifnaði (sic) af skikkjunni, Ld. 322; dóttir skal hafa kross ok kingu ok nisti öll, ef vegr eyri eðr minna, af silfri gör, N. G. L. i. 211 (Js. 78); hón fór ór fötum ok spretti frá sér félitlu nisti, Bs. i. 337; bleikr ásýndar sem nesta gull, Fms. v. 345; fimm sylgjur ok þrjú nisti, Bs. i. 874; hón hefir menit á hálsi sér ok nistin horfðu niðr, Fb. i. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, erroneously proncd. nísta:—<i>to pin, nail fast,</i> esp. <i>to pin</i> with a weapon; sú (the arrow) nisti klæði hans við gólfit, Fms. i. 269; spjótið hafði nist allt saman fótinn ok brókina, Eb. 242; ok nisti hann svá dauðan út við borðinu, Sturl. iii. 66; ok nistir hann niðr við klakann, Finnb. 286; ok nistí hann við rist honum skjöldinn, Rd. 267; ok ætlaði at n. hann í gegnum við hallar-vegginn, Stj. 466; var hann skotinn gaflaki í óstinn ok nistr svo niðr við garðinn, Sturl. i. 112; ok nistir svá tunguna niðr við kverkrnar, Al. 77; ok nisti hann svá at öll námu staðar í hjartanu, Stj. 534; nist sverði, <i>pierced with a sword,</i> Lil. 56, cp. Líkn. 16. 32: the phrase, nístandi kuldi, <i>piercing cold,</i> not from gnísta, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nistill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nistill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a little pin;</i> n. silki-treyju, <i>silk-jacket-pin,</i> an ironical circumlocution for a man, Skíða R. 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nisting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nisting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = nist; dálkrinn er ór feldi mínum ok vil ek at þú saumir á nisting, Glúm. 343; ný nisting, Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = gnit, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ni-kvaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ní-kvæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, = neikvæða, <i>to deny,</i> Sks. 576, 586, 654 B, Anecd. 44, Mar. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ni-kvaedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ní-kvæðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., eiga níkvætt, <i>to have the ‘jus negandi,’</i> N. G. L. i. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ni-raedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ní-ræðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>measuring ninety</i> (fathoms, ells …); or of age <i>ged ninety years,</i> Fms. x. 13, see Gramm. p. xxi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ni-tjandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ní-tjándi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>the nineteenth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ni-tugti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ní-tugti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>the ninetieth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          níð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [Ulf. <i>neiþ</i> = φθόνος; A. S. <i>nîð;</i> O. H. G. <i>nid;</i> Germ. <i>neid;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>nid</i>]:—<i>contumely,</i> Vsp. 56; segja e-m níð, Akv. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-hoggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          níð-höggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a mythical serpent, Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nid-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          níð-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv.; tala n., <i>to use foul language,</i> Grett. 116.",
