          className="link"
          href="/word/njall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          njáll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a pr. name [from the Gaelic], Landn.; whence <strong>Njáls-brenna,</strong> u, f. <i>the burning of Njal,</i> An. 1010, Nj. ch. 130, inscr.: <strong>Njáls-Saga</strong> (commonly called <strong>Njála</strong>), named in Þorst. Síðu H. Anal. 170, see List of Authors: in the sayings, vera vitr sem Njáll, <i>to be as wise as Njal;</i> or, Njáls bíta ráðin, a saying quoted as early as by Arngrim in 1593.",
            }
          }
        />
