            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/non-tidir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nón-tíðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the service at nones,</i> Fms. vi. 302, Sturl. i. 138.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>nones,</i> = nón, 625. 177: <i>the service at nones,</i> ganga til nónu, Fms. iv. 266; allir menn vóru til nónu farnir, Bs. i. 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. <i>an inlet, sea-loch;</i> this word is still used in Dan., and freq. in Dan. local names, e. g. Mön’s nor, Falster nor, Noret near to Danavirki in Sleswig; but it is obsolete in Icel., and not recorded in old writers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nóra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>noer</i> = <i>a baby</i>], <i>a small, wee thing,</i> or of a person, <i>a Lilliputian</i> or the like; silungs-nóra, <i>a small trout.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/not-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. nætr (nœtr); net and nót are kindred words, derived from a lost strong verb (<i>a, ó</i>), cp. the remarks to njóta:—<i>a net,</i> esp. a large net for catching seals; sel, ef í nót liggr, K. Þ. K. 88; nætr tvítugar kóp-heldar, Vm. 98, D. I. i. 576 (notr = ntr Ed.); hér eru þrjár nætr, Háv. 46, N. G. L. i. 379; sela-nætr, and so in mod. usage: of <i>a drag-net,</i> Gþl. 428. <strong>nóta-verpi,</strong> n. <i>a right of casting nets,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nota-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nóta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f., esp. in pl. <strong>nótur,</strong> [from the Lat.], <i>notes</i> in music; nótna-bok, -grallari, -kver, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/notera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nótera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to note, mark,</i> Skálda: <i>to denote,</i> Stj. 231, 278:—of music = nóta, sýngja sléttan söng sem nóterað var, Bs. i. 903.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/noti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nóti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a note;</i> merking eðr nóti, Skálda: <i>notes</i> in music, með inum fegrstum nótum, Str. 14, 6l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. nætr, pl. nætr; the old writers mostly spell this word thus (not nátt), agreeably with its mod. sound and form; this, however, is not a real <i>ó,</i> but a remains of the old umlaut <i>́</i> (n́tt); nom. nótt, Sdm. 26, Hkv. 1. 2, Vþm. 24, 25, Gkv. 2. 12, Skm. 42, Alm. 29, 30, Sks. 50 new Ed.: acc. nótt, Hm. 112; miðja nótt, Grág. (Kb.) i. 36 (four times), 32, 37; þvátt-n́tt, id.: dat. nótt, Ó. H. 187, Vsp. 6; nóttina, Ó. H. 62, 72, 115, 118 (twice), 187, Íb. 12, Edda 28, 29, 89, Fb. ii. 381: dat. pl. nóttom, Vkv. 6, Hkv. 2. 51; so also in old rhymes, n<i>ó</i>tt, <i>ó</i>ttu, Fms. vi. (in a verse): the spelling with <i>á</i> chiefly occurs in Norse MSS. or in writers influenced by the Norwegians, dag ok nátt, Stj. 15, and so rhymed in Skíða R. 194; náttinni, Stj. 15, 16: gen. nætr, passim; náttar only in a few compds: pl. nætr, but næternar (irreg.), Kb. i. 33, 36. In most kindred Teut. languages with <i>á,</i> not <i>ó:</i> [Goth. <i>nahts;</i> A. S. and Engl. <i>night;</i> O. H. G. <i>naht;</i> Germ. <i>nacht</i>; Swed. <i>natt</i>; Lat. <i>noct-is;</i> Gr. νύξ, νυκτ-ός.] ☞ A dat. sing. nóttu is used in mod. poets, e. g. Bs. ii. 479 (in a poem of 1548); eg var að ráða árið um kring það Egill kvað á nóttu, in a ditty of Björn á Skarðsá; and even in acc., þessa nóttu þegar í óttu, það til bar, Hallgr. Pétr; but in old vellums this form is not attested; for the Jd. 39, line 8 (sáttir á einni nóttu), is a mod. conjectural addition, as the vellum (Cd. Reg.) ceases at line 7 of that verse.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/notturdar-tid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nótturðar-tíð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>supper-time,</i> Greg. 28. For the Holy Communion the Swed. use <i>nattvärd,</i> Dan. <i>nadver</i> (cp. Germ. <i>abendmahl</i>), but Icel. call it kveld-máltíð (q. v.), not náttverðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nudda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nudda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. gnudda <i>to rub,</i> (conversational): <i>to maunder,</i> hvað ertu að n., (slang.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nugga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nugga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [from gnúa], <i>to rub.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nunna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nunna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Lat. <i>novena</i>], <i>a nun,</i> Ld. 332, Grág. i. 307, Bs. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nunna-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nunna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að (?), [akin to nenna (q. v.), referring to a lost strong verb, ninna, nann, nunninn]:—<i>to do, pursue;</i> oss nunnask skil (thus, not numnast), <i>our subject is pursued,</i> i. e. <i>our song proceeds,</i> Fms. ii. 289 (in a verse, Hkr., O. T. ch. 97): freq. in later poets, at læra þetta ok kunna, ok ekki annað nunna, <i>to learn this and know, and study nothing but that,</i> Vísna-bók, Ed. 1612, Hugvekju Sálm. 15. 4, 42. 3, see Nj. the Lat. Ed. p. 247, in the foot-note <i>a.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nunnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nunnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [nunna], <i>one who strives, a worker, pursuer,</i> απ. λεγ. in the poët. compd hlíf-nunnr = <i>armourer</i> = <i>a warrior,</i> Nj. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nurla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nurla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>nurfla,</strong> að, [nyrfill; cp. Scot. <i>nirl</i> = <i>a crumb</i>]:—<i>to make money like a miser.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [Ulf. <i>nu;</i> A. S., O. H. G., Germ., and Dan. <i>nú;</i> Engl. <i>now;</i> Germ. <i>nun;</i> Lat. <i>nunc;</i> Gr. νυν]:—<i>now,</i> meðan enn er nú, Hom. (St.); eggmóðan val nú mun Yggr hafa … nú knáttu Óðin sjá, Gm. 53; nú né í gær, Hðm. 2; heill þú nú, Vþm. 6; rístú nú ! Skm. 1, passim:—in a narrative, <i>now, next,</i> nú víkr sögunni, nú er þar til máls at taka, passim; nú er þat er, <i>now it is to be told that, now it comes to pass,</i> Orkn. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nu-verandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nú-verandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>now being, now living,</i> Skálda 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nua"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          núa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "neri, <i>to rub,</i> Fb. ii. 367; see gnúa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          núfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., see hnúfa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nuligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          núligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>now being, present,</i> of time, Eluc. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/num-verskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          núm-verskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>from Numidia,</i> Róm. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nuna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          núna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>now, just now,</i> Valla L. 223, Fb. ii. 238; þar er þat núna, faðir minn, Mar.: freq. in mod. speech, see -na.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nuningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          núningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
