        >
          ný-bæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>ný-býli</strong>), n. <i>a new farm</i> built in a wilderness where there was formerly none, Gþl. 432.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
