        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyjung"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýjung
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>newness, novelty, news, innovation,</i> mostly in a bad sense; fals ok n., Fms. xi. 308; lands-fólkit var gjarnt á alla nýjung (= <i>novarum rerum cupidi</i>), i. 203; ganga undir sektir eða aðrar nýjungar; þeir vildu undir engar nýjungar ganga af Auðunni biskupi, Bs. i. 835; þá kom út til Íslands Álfr or Króki, hann hafði mörg konungs-bréf ok margar nýjungar, 807:—<i>news,</i> hann segir nú allt þat er verðr í nýjungu, Mag. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyjunga-girni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýjunga-girni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>love of novelty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyjunga-gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýjunga-gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fond of novelty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = nýliga, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>newly, recently,</i> Sks. 58, Ld. 256, Hom. 57, Fms. vi. 144: compar., Ísl. ii. 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>new, recent,</i> Skv. 3, 26: <i>present,</i> Hom. 25, 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., ný, nýtt; gen. nýs, nýrar, nýs; dat. nýjum, nýri, nýju; acc. nýjan, nýja, nýtt: pl. nýir, nýjar, ný; gen. nýra, mod. nýrra; dat. nýjum; acc. nýja, nýjar, ný, see Gramm. p. xix: compar. nýri, mod. nýrri; superl. nýstr, mod. nýjastr; [Ulf. <i>niujis</i> = καινός and νέος; A. S. <i>niwe;</i> Engl. <i>new;</i> O. H. G. <i>niuwi;</i> Germ. <i>neu;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>ny</i>]:—<i>new;</i> vaðmál nýtt ok únotið, Grág. i. 500; skrúðklæði ný, 504; nýtt tungl, <i>a new moon,</i> but in old usage, as it seems, <i>the waxing,</i> or even <i>the full moon;</i> cp. however, þvíat nýtt var at ok niða-myrkr, Grett. 111 A, where Ed. 1853 has hríð var á.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. nýru, gen. nýrna; [Scot. <i>neirs;</i> Germ. <i>nieren;</i> Dan. <i>nyre</i>; Gr. νεφρός]:—<i>the kidneys,</i> Stj. 310, passim: poët., haf-nýra, <i>a pearl,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyrna-mor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýrna-mör
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>kidney fat,</i> in beasts.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyrna-verkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýrna-verkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., medic. <i>‘kidney -work,’ pain in the kidneys,</i> Ann. 1426.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nysa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, mod. form hnýsa, see introduction to letter H (B. II. 2. γ); [akin to njósn]:—<i>to pry, enquire;</i> nýsta ek niðr, Hm. 140; svá nýsisk fróðra hverr fyrr, 7; nýsumk hins, ok hygg at því, Stor. 13: mod. hnýsa, forvitnin holdsins hnýsir þrátt í Herrans leyndar-dóma, Pass. 21. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyt-menni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýt-menni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a worthy, good man,</i> Ld. 334.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [njóta], <i>to make use of;</i> ek ætla at þú nýtir eigi boga minn, <i>thou canst not wield my bow,</i> Fms. vii. 120: absol., ok frétti Þorstein, hvárt þá mætti svá nýta, <i>he asked Th. if that would do,</i> Ísl. ii. 207; skulu vér bræðr búnir ok boðnir til slíks sem þér vilit okkr til nýta, Eg. 50; ekki nýtir þú hér af, Edda 32; eigi munu þit lengr nýta hvárt af öðru, <i>enjoy one another,</i> Sturl. i. 96; þau Sigríðr nýttu eigi af samförum, <i>lived unhappily together,</i> 116; vóru þau í Reykjaholti lengstum, þvíat ekki nýtti af henni um samvistir ef þau vóru eigi þar, ii. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>useful, fit to use.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nyting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a term of husbandry; góð, íll nýting, of getting in the hay or crop, Esp. 1761.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/nytr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          nýtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fit, usable;</i> nýtr dúkr, Pm. 107; sagði fé til þess nýtt, at …, Ld. 318: <i>able</i>, Str. 68; hefir eigi nýtra dreng fundit, Fms. ii. 23; hinn nýzti maðr, Eg. 141, Ld. 162; enn nýtasti fardrengr, Fms. ii. 23: <i>valid</i>, þá er hvárskis görð nýt, Grág. i. 494; láttú niðr detta, engu er nýtt, <i>‘tis all good for nothing,</i> Fs. 159: neut. as subst., at öngu nýtu, <i>to no use</i>, H. E. i. 243; þær konur er með nýtu hafa verit, <i>who have been good for something,</i> id.",
            }
          }
