        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [for. word; Gr. ἐλέφας; Old Engl. <i>olifaunt</i>], <i>the unicorn,</i> Karl. 386:—the name of a trumpet, Karl., l. c.; skaptið var af olifant-horni, <i>ivory?</i> Karl. 369.",
            }
