        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., <strong>olivu-tré,</strong> n., <strong>-viðr,</strong> m. [for. word], <i>the olive-tree,</i> Stj. 256, 403, 413, 441, Karl. 199, Þiðr. 116. <strong>olifa-kvistr,</strong> m., Karl. 226, 334.",
            }
