        >
          orða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to talk, talk of;</i> var þetta brátt orðat, Háv. 39; cp. þau eru orðuð saman, <i>it is talked of that they are to be married;</i> vera orðaðr við e-ð, <i>to be talked of in connection with a thing</i> (in a bad sense); sem hann heyrði at menn um orðuðu ok at töldu, <i>as he heard that people talked and gossipped,</i> Str. 54; þá orðaði konungr (<i>the king declared</i>) at hér skyldi laga-skipti á vera, Fms. ix. 336, v. l.; sem þeir áðr hafa orðat nökkut, <i>as they had spoken of, discussed,</i> 472, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orda-atvik"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          orða-atvik
        </a>
        <p
