              "__html": "and <strong>ógnar-orð,</strong> n. pl. <i>menacing words,</i> Stj. 643, Greg. 74, Fms. i. 216, vii. 104, x. 292, xi. 408.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
