        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>St. Patrick,</i> from whom was named the <strong>Patreks-fjörðr,</strong> m. in western Icel., Landn. 1. ch. 12, where Ari, the Icelandic historian, by misapprehension, makes St. Patrick the foster-father of Örlyg (end of the 9th century) instead of his saint and patron. Ari, in this case, probably merely repeated the current legend.",
            }
