        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (the older form Póll, Bs. i. (the Miracle-book) 333 passim, K. Þ. K. 112):—<i>Paul, Paulus;</i> the name appears in Icel. about the 12th century, and soon became very popular: Páls-kirkja, <i>St. Paul’s Church,</i> 625. 47; Páls-líkneski, Pm. 51; Páls-messa, see messa.",
            }
          }
        />
