        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Gael, <i>prine</i>; Scot. <i>prin</i>], <i>a prin</i> or <i>pin,</i> esp. of <i>knitting pins;</i> whence <strong>prjón-les,</strong> n. <i>knitted wares,</i> Snót 161: <strong>prjóna-peisa,</strong> n. <i>a knitted jerkin:</i> <strong>prjóna-stokkr,</strong> n. <i>a prin-case:</i> týtu-prjónn, <i>a needle-pin</i>:—prjónn as a nickname occurs in Sturl. iii. 209, so the word must then have been known.",
