              "__html": "adv. <i>finely, bravely,</i> Fms. iii. 44, v. 324. vii. 223: <i>nobly,</i> hefir honum allt p. farit, Vígl. 33: <i>beautifully,</i> passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
