        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>puggs</i>], <i>a small bag, purse,</i> hanging on the belt (= púss); silki-pungr, Dipl. v. 18; buðkr ok pungr, id.; vefja saman ok hafa í pung sér, Edda 70, Grett. 161, Fs. 97: hefi ek elnorð allra lendra manna Magnúss konungs í pung mér, Fms. viii. 128, Sks. 27; <strong>tóbaks-pungr,</strong> <i>a snuff-bag, tobacco-pouch</i>:—<i>scrotum.</i> <strong>pung-arfi,</strong> a, m., botan. <i>bursa pastoris</i>, Hjalt.",
            }
