        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to Engl. <i>Puck;</i> cp. also Dan. <i>pokker</i>]:—<i>a devil,</i> but with the notion of <i>a wee devil, an imp,</i> see the tale in Fb. 1. 416–418 and freq. in mod. tales:—<i>the evil one,</i> móti púkanum, <i>against the devil</i> Stj. 8, 55; allir menn heita í skírn at hafna púkanum, <i>to forsake the devil,</i> N. G. L. ii. 366; hann játar öllum púkans vilja, Th. 4: maura-púki <i>‘treasure-puck’</i> = <i>a miser,</i> Maurer’s Volks. <strong>púka-bit,</strong> n., botan. <i>scabiosa.</i> Germ. <i>teufels abbiss,</i> Hjalt.",
