          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rakna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be unwound, unwind itself;</i> en þráðrinn raknaði af hörhnoða, Fms. vi. 296; rakna upp, <i>to get loose,</i> of a seam or the like: þá lætr Loðinn rakna hendr af Sigríði, <i>L. loosened the grasp, let S slip through his hands,</i> Fbr. 138; láta hendr rakna niðr fyrir sik, <i>to let the hands sink, hold them still</i>, Sks. 92 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
