        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. and <strong>Rangæingar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the men from the county</i> <strong>Rangár-vellir</strong> in Icel.: <strong>Rang-á,</strong> f. <i>the Rang-water,</i> i. e. <i>the ‘wrong, crooked water’</i> (?), prob. thus called from the angle or bend near Oddi, for in old times the Thwerá was but a small tributary river until the Markarfljót broke into its bed; cp. Dan. <i>Wrange-bek,</i> Dipl. Arnam. i. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
