        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (<strong>rangl,</strong> n.), = ragla (q. v.), <i>to stroll idly about.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ranglat-ligr"
