        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Engl. <i>rafter</i>], <i>a rafter,</i> Eb. 224, Gullþ. 17; þeir víggyrðn kirkju-garðinn með röptum, Sturl. i. 185; krók-r., birki-r.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ras"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ras
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Scot. <i>rash</i>], <i>a rush:</i> allit., fylgir sjaldan ráð rasi, a saying. Fms. xi. 377; ras ok ráðleysi, Thom. 249; rasi þínu ok ákafa, Fas. iii. 91; ok er ofmikit ras á fyrir þér, Band. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ras-gjof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ras-gjöf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in the saying, ragr maðr tekr aptr rasgjöf sinn, <i>a miserly fellow takes back his rash gifts.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rasa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rasa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to rush headlong;</i> slíks er mér ván, sagði Höskuldr, þú fórt rasandi mjök, Nj. 155; en rasa eigi eptir reiði sinni, Fb. ii. 303; hefir þetta fólk farit æst ok rasanda, Fms. xi. 275: the saying, rasa fyrir ráð fram, Ld. 242; hætt er rasanda ráði, a saw, Pass. 48. 12; rasandi reiði, Mar.; rasa fram, <i>to rush forwards,</i> Al 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rasan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rasan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a rushing,</i> Al. 146; see hrasan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>fish-offal.</i>",
            }
