          reifing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a summing-up;</i> sum mál dæmd sum búin til reifingar, Band. 6; um reifing, Grág. i. 63. <strong>reifingar-maðr,</strong> m. <i>the person who sums up</i> (see reifa), Grág. i. 63, Nj. 243.",
            }
          }
        />
