        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reifr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>glad, cheerful;</i> gladr ok reifr, Hm. 14; heima glaðr ok við gesti reifr, 102; er Guðmundr reifr við þá ok veitir þeim stórmannliga, Ísl. ii. 388; reifr gékk herr und hlífar, Edda (in a verse); bjór-r., <i>cheerful from wine,</i> Ls. 18; hug-r., <i>joyful of heart,</i> Hallfred; böð-r., gunn-r., her-r., hjaldr-r., <i>‘war-glad,’</i> Lex. Poët., a standing epithet of a warrior, which reminds of Tacitus’ ‘Germani, <i>laeta bello</i> gens.’",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reigingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reigingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>stiffness,</i> <strong>reigings-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>stiff, puffed up.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reigjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reigjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, the vellums always spell with <i>i</i>, not <i>ey</i>, and Eb. 117 new Ed. note 6 is a misprint; [rígr and reigjask point to a lost strong verb, ríga, reig]:—<i>to throw the body back,</i> with the notion of stiffness and haughtiness; reigðsk hann við ok lét útrúliga, Eb. 320; reigðisk (thus the vellum) næsta brúðr í móti, Þryml. 50; hón reigðisk við honum ok mælti, Fas. ii. 131; ok svá sem á leið þeirra tal, þá reigðusk æ því meir við liðs-menn, Fms. viii. 158; Þórdís reigðisk (ræiddisk Ed. wrongly) nokkut svá við honum, ok skaut öxl við Þormóði, Fb. ii. 153; reygðisk, Fbr. 38 new Ed., a paper MS., is an error.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reigsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reigsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, an iterat. <i>to walk stiffly and haughtily.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reik"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reik
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Scot. <i>raik</i>], <i>a strolling, wandering;</i> vera á reiki: <i>wavering,</i> þar var helzt reik á ráðinu, hvárt ek munda af ráða, Fas. ii. 335; ráð hans er á reiki, <i>is unsettled.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reik-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reik
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the parting of the hair;</i> hvirfil, hnakka, enni, reik, vanga, Edda ii. 430; hár hans var öðru-megin reikar bleikt en öðru-megin rautt, O. H. L. 34, Fs. i. 212, Fas. iii. 392; hnakka eða reikar, 500; Gyrðr kembir nú gula reik með gyltum kambi, Safn i. 33: poët., reikar eik, <i>the oak of the</i> reik, i. e. <i>the hair,</i> Edda 217; and reikar rúfr, <i>the rye of the</i> reik, i. e. <i>the crop of the head, the hair,</i> Gísl.; reikar-tún = <i>the head,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reik-stjornur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reik-stjörnur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the planets,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reika"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reika
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to wander, take a walk;</i> Þrándr reikaði eptir fjörunni, Fms. ii. 93; Björn reikaði framm með sjónum, Ld. 6; Gautr reikaði á gólfinu, Fær. 242; konungr reikar ofan til strandar, Fas. iii. 456; eptir máltíðina dagliga reikaði hann fyrst, Bs. i. 848.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>reikull,</strong> adj. <i>wandering, unsettled:</i> a nickname, Gullþ.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a strolling, wandering;</i> r. hugrenningar, <i>a wandering of the mind,</i> Greg. 6l; sumar fóru úr borginni til reikanar, <i>some went out of the town for a walk.</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikan-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikan-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wandering,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikanar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikanar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a land-louper,</i> Rb. 274, Ísl. ii. 243, Sturl. ii. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikanar-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikanar-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wandering,</i> Sturl. iii. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að; this word occurs in writers of the 13th and 14th centuries, but scarcely earlier, for in Hdl. 44 reikna is an error for rekja, q. v.; [A. S. <i>recnan;</i> Engl. <i>reckon;</i> Germ. <i>rechnen;</i> Dan. <i>regne</i>]:—<i>to count, calculate;</i> hann reiknaði sik hundraðfaldan ávöxt hafa fengit á því sama ári, Stj. 162; ‘perfecta fortitudo’ hvat er reikna má algörvan styrkleik, Fb. ii. 534; aðrir sex þeir er Styrmir reiknar í sinni bók, 68; item hefir gefisk, síðan biskup Michel reiknaði, eitt hundrað vaðmála, 22; reiknaði hón jörð eiga geldfjár-rekstr. Dipl. v. 7; biskupinn reiknaði Koðrán í banni … var sú sök hans reiknuð, at … reiknaði hann at þat væri mikit góz at þeir höfðu eytt, Bs. i. 830; þrgar tók hann þá eptir at reikna framferði manna, 840; reikna e-t við sik, <i>to make up an account of,</i> 784.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reiknan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reiknan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a reckoning,</i> N. G. L. ii. 429.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>calculation,</i> Stj. 150, 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a reckoning, account,</i> Fms. xi. 441 (v. l.), Dipl. ii. 12, iii. 4, v. 18, Vm. 137, 140, Rb. 196, Ann. 1348, Bs. i. 910, Skíða R. 38; reiknings bréf, <i>a bill of account,</i> Dipl. iii. 4; reiknings brestr, <i>a deficit,</i> ii. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reikud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reikuð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f.(?); only in the phrase, færa e-n í reikuð, <i>to handle roughly,</i> of a mob or crowd, Fms. vi. 203, Rd. 306, Fs. 150, Bárð. 43 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reim
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. reimar, [Germ. <i>rieme</i>], <i>a lash, thong,</i> Bjarn. 19 (of a garter = hosnareim).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reim-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reim-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>the being haunted by ghosts;</i> eptir þetta görðusk reimleikar miklir, Eb. 270; reimleikar ok aptrgöngur, 278, 280, Fms. iv. 27, Bs. i. 598, Grett. 113, 140, 142.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reima
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to string, fasten on a thong.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reimir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reimir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘thong,’</i> poët. <i>a snake,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reimt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reimt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. [the root or origin of this word and its derivatives is not known, perh. qs. vreimr, akin to Dan. <i>vrimmel—a swarm</i>]:—<i>haunted;</i> in the phrase, þar er reimt, <i>a place is haunted by ghosts;</i> þar var reimt mjök, Grett. 110; þótti þar reimt jafnan síðan, Fs. 59: reimt þykir þar síðan vera hjá kumlum þeirra, Ísl. ii. 115; þar þótti mönnum reimt mjök sakir trolla-gangs, Grett. 140, Fas. ii. 115; ok þótti þar reimt fyrir er Sigrflugan var á lopti, Fms. viii. 374, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reimudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reimuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a απ. λεγ.; r. Jötun-heima, <i>the haunter of Giant-land</i> = <i>a giant,</i> Haustl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reimun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reimun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>winding.</i> <strong>reimunar-kefli,</strong> n. <i>a winding-stick</i> to wind thread on (as a clew), Krók. 41 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rein"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rein
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. reinu, e. g. mark-reinu, kaup-reinu, Gþl. 460, 485; sef-reinu, Lex. Poët.; pl. reinar; [Scot. <i>rins</i>]:—<i>a strip of land,</i> freq. in mod. usage; mark-rein, skógar-rein (q. v.), <i>a strip of woodland;</i> kaup-rein, <i>a market-place:</i> poët., ragna rein, <i>the heavenly strip,</i> i. e. <i>the rainbow.</i> Hd.; geð-rein, <i>the mind’s strip,</i> i. e. <i>the breast;</i> svana flug-rein, <i>swan’s pinion-strip,</i> i. e. <i>the sky,</i> Harms. 44: in circumlocutions, baug-rein, rein steina, = <i>a woman,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reini"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reini
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., qs. vreini, [A. S. <i>wræne;</i> Swed. <i>vrensk-hest</i> = <i>a stallion;</i> cp. Swed. <i>vrenska,</i> Dan. <i>vrinske,</i> = <i>to neigh</i>]:—<i>a stallion;</i> reini mun ek þér þykkja … þótt þú hafir reina rödd, Hkv. Hjörv. 20, 21; vilda ek at Steingerðr væri gömul jalda í stóði, en ek reini, Kormak; the word is else obsolete, see Bugge 407 note.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>reipi,</strong> [Goth. <i>raip;</i> A. S. <i>râp;</i> Engl. <i>rope</i>; Scot. <i>raip;</i> O. H. G. <i>reif;</i> Dan. <i>reb;</i> Swed. <i>rep</i>]:—<i>a rope,</i> Fms. iv. 335, Grág. ii. 361; hann sleit í sundr reipin, Edda 26; láta reip á háls hverjum þeirra, 623. 33; fyrir hví gáfut ér oss eigi eins reips jörð, Stj. 361; þat er gyrði töng eða reipi, N. G. L. i. 349; reips hald, <i>a rope’s hold</i>, Sturl. ii. 139; heljar reip, Sól. 27; festa reipin upp á hestana, Eb. 180; göra upp reipi, <i>to tie up a rope;</i> ólar-reip, band-reip, hrosshárs-reip.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reip-rennandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reip-rennandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘rope-running;’</i> in the phrase, lesa, kunna e-ð r., <i>to read</i> or <i>know by heart without a knot,</i> i. e. <i>fluently.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reipa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reipa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to fasten with a rope:</i> naut., var reipat tréit á skipinu, <i>the mast was rigged,</i> Fms. ix. 480, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reipari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reipari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a rope-maker,</i> N. G. L. ii. 204.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reisa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reisa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [from the Germ. <i>reise</i>], <i>a journey;</i> this word, which is very rare in mod. usage (ferð and för are the vernacular words), appears at the end of the 15th century, Bs. i. 900 (Laur. S. the second recension); var svá hörð reisan þeirra, Fms. viii. 32 (v. l., an error for reiðan, in a vellum of the latter part of the 15th century, but shewing that the transcriber knew the German word); in Norway it occurs in a deed of 1344: in mod. usage Icel. say ferða-reisa, vera á ferða-reisu:—í þrjár reisur, <i>thrice,</i> Bs. ii. 474. <strong>reisu-móðr,</strong> adj. <i>journey-weary,</i> Jón Þorl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reisa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reisa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, a causal to rísa; pret. reisði or raisþi is freq. in the older Runic stones, see Rafn; [Goth. <i>raisjan;</i> Engl. <i>raise</i>, etc.]:—<i>to raise;</i> takit nú ok reisit viðuna, Fms. vii. 310; þá lét hann reisa viduna ok draga seglit, Ó. H. 170; r. niðstöng, Fs. 54; r. af dauða, Rb. 82:—reisa e-n upp, <i>to raise up,</i> Fms. i. 10; hann reisti hann upp ok kyssti, 148; r. upp af dauða, <i>to raise up from the dead,</i> 623. 22 (upp-risa, <i>resurrection</i>): <i>to raise up, put up,</i> Fms. x. 411; reisti hann upp (<i>restored</i>) lög í landinu, xi. 296; upp mun Guð r. spámann mikinn, 655 xiii. B. 4:—r. dýr, <i>to spring a deer,</i> a hunting term, Gþl. 447: r. net, <i>to lay a net,</i> of a bird-net, Barl. 55.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reisi-fjol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reisi-fjöl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>reisi-súð,</strong> f. <i>a wainscotted roof.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reist"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rising;</i> in upp-reist, mót-r., við-r.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, qs. vreista, [Engl. <i>wrest;</i> Dan. <i>vriste</i>], <i>to wrest, wring, bend;</i> var skipit svá reist ok hrist, at í sundr brotnuðu brandarnir, Fms. viii. 247; lagðisk litt sverðit, en síðan reisti hann þat í glugg einum, i. e. <i>the sword was soft and he bent it straight in a window,</i> Fas. ii. 465.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reisting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reisting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a bending, twisting,</i> Fas. ii. 465.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reistr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reistr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. reistar, qs. vreistr, [cp. Engl. <i>wrist</i>], <i>a twist;</i> jarðar reistr, <i>the ‘earth-twist,’ ‘earth’s curl,’</i> poët. <i>a serpent,</i> Bragi, see Bugge in Philol. Tidskr.:—a nickname, Landn., whence the local names, <strong>Reistar-á, Reistar-gnúpr,</strong> Landn., map of Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reisuligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reisuligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>high, stately;</i> r. bær, Sturl. iii. 166, Háv. 58, Hrafn. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, qs. vreita, [akin to ríta; Germ. <i>reissen, reizen;</i> Swed. <i>reta</i>]:—<i>to scratch,</i> prop. <i>to irritate, stir up, excite one’s anger,</i> Fs. 46; reita forlögin, Al. 55; reita þinn skapara, N. G. L. ii. 416; r. Guðs reiði, Stj. 54, 449; r. hug e-s, Barl. 96, 114; hví hefir þú reitta Philisteos í mót oss, Stj. 414: <i>to charm,</i> sú er mik reitir, Gísl. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reiting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reiting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>irritation, offence,</i> Pr. 452: <i>anger,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reitinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reitinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>irritating, offensive.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., qs. vreitr, acc. pl. reitu, Grág. i. 65, but usually reita; [from rita or ríta; Swed. <i>vret</i>]:—<i>a square, a space marked out, a place sketched out,</i> used of <i>a bed</i> in a garden, <i>a square</i> on a chessboard, and the like; gör þú með blóðrefli sverðsins níu reita umhverfis húeth;ina, Mar.; þrír reitar feis breiðir, út frá reitum skulu vera stengr fjórar, Korm. 86; níu reita rístr Þrándr alla vega út frá grindunum, Fæer. 184: þeir skulu rísta reitu tvá, Grág. i. 65; svá hit sama vóru ok reitir níu á taflborðinu, at annarr hverr var gyllr, enn annarr þaktr af hvítu silfri, Karl. 486; sátt er þeim lið allt er í sjóð kemr, en á reitum reitt, Gsp.; heima-menn eigu skála yztir ok reit á möl, of <i>a place for drying fish,</i> Vm 88, þess-háttar sjóreita kalla þeir m ð, Bs. ii. 145: göra reit, N. G. L. i. 241 (for sowing); næpna-reitr, q. v.; Guðs barna reitr, cp. Germ. <i>Gottes-acker</i> = <i>a church-yard.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reitur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reitur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>scourings, scrapings;</i> eiga dálitlar reitur, of a poor man’s property; fjár-reitur.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reizla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reizla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = reið-la, <i>weighing;</i> fá þá mann til at sjá reizlur, Ó. H. 154; um reizlur, Grág. (Kb.) ii. 169; reizlu-maðr, see reiðsla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rek"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rek
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., qs. vrek, [Engl. <i>wreck</i> and <i>wretch;</i> early Dan. <i>wrac, wrag:</i> Swed. <i>wrak;</i> quae cognominantur lingua Danica <i>wrec.</i> Dipl. Arna-Magn. Thork. i. 3]:—<i>jetsum, a thing drifted ashore:</i> rek þan öll er rekr í almenninga, þá á konungr, N. G. L. ii. 165; haf-rek, vág-rek, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rek-hvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rek-hvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a whale drifed ashore,</i> Grág. ii. 385, K. Þ. K. 112, K. Á. 162, Jb. 335, Am. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rek-saumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rek-saumr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘drive-nails,’ large nails,</i> such as are used in ships, Sks. 30, Fms. viii. 199, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rek-spolr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rek-spölr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
