            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rekkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rekkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. rekki, Hdl. 3; pl. rekkar; [akin to rakkr, q. v.]: prop. <i>a straight, upright man, a franklin</i> (?), a freq. word in poetry, see Lex. Poët. (Hkv. Hjörv. 18), but in prose only used in old law phrases: in the allit. law phrase, rekkr ok rýgr, <i>man and wife;</i> þann mann skal leiða á rekks skaut ok rýgjar, N. G. L. i. 209; árbornum manni (<i>a noble</i>) fjóra aura, rekks þegni (<i>a freeholder, franklin</i>)? þrjá aura, en leysingja tvá aura; as also, höldr, árborinn maðr, rekks þegn, leysingi, N. G. L. i. 172, 173 (the rekkr stands therefore as the third in rank next to a freed man); rekkar þeir þóttusk er þeir ript höfðu, <i>they felt themselves proud,</i> Hm. 48; Hálfs-rekkar, <i>the champions of king H.,</i> Fas. ii. 25, Edda 107 (the etymology there given is a mere fancy).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/reklingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          reklingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an outcast,</i> Str.: = riklingr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rekningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rekningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an outcast;</i> Cain var r. frá Guði, Ver. 6, Greg. 26, Hom. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rekstr"
