        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>rennsli,</strong> <i>a run;</i> í einu rennsli, <i>in one run,</i> Ó. H. 78; í einni rensl (fem.), Sks. 20 new Ed., v. l.: <i>a course of water,</i> vatns-r.",
            }
