      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/repta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          repta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [Dan. <i>ræbe;</i> Scot. <i>rift</i>], <i>to belch, bring up wind,</i> Sturl. 21, 22 (the verse, thrice):—repta aptr, <i>cacare,</i> of diarrhoea; sumum repti hann aptr ok heitir arnar-leir, Edda ii. 296.",
            }
