      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-truandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-trúandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. = rétttrúaðr. Fb. i. 244, Stj. 50, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-vaxinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-vaxinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>upright of growth,</i> Fb. iii. 246, Fs. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-visa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-vísa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = réttvísi, Hom. 32, Sks. 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-visi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-vísi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f <i>righteousness, justice,</i> Boll. 350, K. Á. 202, Stj. 177, Sks. 510, N. T., Vídal. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-visliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-vísliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>justly.</i> Fms. i. 242.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>righteous, just,</i> Hom. 34, 64, Karl. 552, Bs., N. T., Vídal. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rett-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétt-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = réttmæli, Lv. 105.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/retta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tt, [Ulf. <i>ga-raihtjan</i> = κατευθύνειν, δικαιουν; Germ. <i>richten;</i> cp. Engl. <i>reach</i>]:—<i>to make right</i> or <i>straight;</i> dvergarnir réttu skip sítt, of a capsized boat, Edda 47; at rétta þenna krók, Ld. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/retta-skid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétta-skið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Germ. <i>rechtscheid</i>], <i>a ruler,</i> Stj. 363.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettar-bot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttar-bót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an amendment of the law, a ‘novel’ in law,</i> esp. a Norse law term used in the Icel. law after the introduction of a code of laws, when from time to time new amendments (<i>novellae</i>) were issued by the king; these were written as an appendix to the law code (and since then printed), and were, for the sake of distinction, called réttarbót, see Jb. 445 sqq, N. G. L. i. 257, 258: en er þetta spurðisk í annat fylki ok þriðja, hver réttarbót Þrændum var gefin, Gísl. 84, Bs. ii. 18; hann hét þeim sinni vináttu ok réttarbót, Ó. H. 35; else the word does not occur in the old Icel. law.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettar-far"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttar-far
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>right;</i> um r. manna, <i>of personal right,</i> N. G. L. i. 69; um r. á festarkonu manns, 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettar-gangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttar-gangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>public procedure</i> (mod.), cp. Dan. <i>rettergang.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>outlawed, out of the pale of the law,</i> N. G. L. i. 247.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a righteous man,</i> Fms. xi. 445.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettar-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttar-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a point of law;</i> ef hann görir þá réttarstaði, er fjörbaugs-garð varða, Grág. ii. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Germ. <i>richter</i>], <i>a justiciary, justice,</i> mid. Lat. <i>justiciarius,</i> appointed by the king, Edda 93, Gþl. 141, 195, Bs i. 769, Fms. x. 88, N. G. L. iii. 77, rare and not classical, and appears about the middle of the 13th century: afterwards used of <i>a headsman,</i> Bs. ii. (16th century.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/retti-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétti-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = réttliga, K. Á. 114, 204, H. E. i. 471, Bs. i. 739.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/retti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>just, right,</i> Band. 6, K. Á. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettil-beini"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttil-beini
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>‘straight-leg,’</i> a nickname, Hkr. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>réttendi,</strong> and <strong>réttyndi,</strong> n. pl. <i>right, justice;</i> sannendi ok r., Band. 6; þá bæti biskupar yfir með sínum réttyndum. N. G. L. i. 352; unna e-m réttinda, Fms. i. 82; ef maðr fær eigi r. sín, Gþl. 34; heimta sín r., Bs. i. 738; ná eigi réttendum, Fs. 47; láta oss koma réttendum fyrir oss (<i>a fair hearing</i>), Bs. i. 201; sem þeir vissu at r. vóru til, Eg. 39; virði lítils þat er hann hafði frumburðanna r., Stj. 161; halla dómi meir eptir vilja sínum en eptir réttendum, Sks. 110; lög ok r. Fms. iv. 207; þeir þolðu honum eigi r., Ó. H. 190; móti réttindum, Band. 6, Anecd. 3, Barl. 108; fylgja réttendum, Anal. 237; meirr fyrir fégirni en r., Fs. 125; réttinda vald, Gþl. 183, H. E. i. 503, passim; ó-réttindi, <i>injustice.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/retting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rétting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a putting right, correction;</i> vil ek eiga r. allra orða minna, Nj. 232, Grág. i. 43, Skálda 203: <i>redress,</i> varð engi r. af Önundi, Ísl. ii. 273, fá r. síns máls, Rd. 237: leið-r., <i>correction.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. réttar, [Engl. <i>right;</i> Germ. <i>recht;</i> Dan. <i>ret</i>]:—<i>right, law;</i> hann görði harðan rétt þeirra, <i>gave them hard measure, gave them small pasture,</i> Fms. i. 66; hann görði harðan rétt landsmanna, <i>tyrannised over them,</i> x. 385; konungr setti þann rétt allstaðar, at hann eignaðisk öll óðul, 182; hann skipaði svá réttum öllum sem fyrr hafði verit í Tróju, Edda (pref.) 152; at allir jafnbornir menn hefði jafnan rétt, Fms. vi. 339; þat er forn réttr, <i>old law, time-honoured law,</i> N. G. L. i. 135: lands réttr (q. v.), <i>the law of the land;</i> lög ok lands réttr: Guðs réttr, <i>‘God’s right,’</i> i. e. <i>church law,</i> O. H. L. 30; Kristinn réttr, <i>the ecclesiastical law,</i> Fb. iii. 246; Kristins dóms réttr, id., K. Á. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rettr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          réttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., réttari, réttastr; [Ulf. <i>raihts</i> = εὐδύς, i. e. <i>straight,</i> mostly in the proper sense, but <i>ga-raihts</i> = δίκαιος; A. S. <i>riht</i>; Engl. <i>right;</i> O. H. G. <i>reht;</i> Germ. <i>recht:</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>ret,</i> contr.; Lat. <i>rectus;</i> Gr. ὀ-ρέγω; to the same root belong Icel. rak-, rakna, rekja, in all of which the fundamental notion is <i>to stretch, extend</i>]:—<i>straight;</i> skapti réttara, Gsp., Fas. i. 470 (in a verse); rétt rœði, <i>straight oars,</i> Fms. vi. 309 (in a verse); réttar brautir, Rm. 14: réttr vindr, Edda (Ht.): <i>upright, erect,</i> Óttarr stóð réttr ok brá sér ekki við, Fms. vii. 257: á réttum krossi, 656 C. 37; svá mikil at maðr mátti standa réttr í henni. Fas. iii. 223; réttr sem laukr, Sks. 131; réttr líkams vöxtr, Stj. 20; mannsins líkamr er r. skapaðr ok upp-reistr, 22; upp-r. (cp. Engl. <i>upright</i>), <i>standing upright;</i> upp frá þeim degi mátti hann eigi réttum augum sjá Davíð, Stj. 466; þá öfundaði hann Óláf, ok mátti eigi réttum augum til hans líta, Fms. iv. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ribbaldi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ribbaldi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [through Engl. <i>ribald,</i> from Ital. <i>ribaldo;</i> Fr. <i>ribauld</i>]:—<i>a ‘ribald,’ savage,</i> Fas. i. 3, Þiðr. 273, Stj. 65, Bs. ii. 134, Fb. i. 358: as a nickname, Fms. viii. <strong>ribbalda-skapr, -dómr,</strong> m. <i>ribaldry.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ribbungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ribbungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = ribbaldi, Fms. viii. 105: the name of a party of <i>rebels</i> in Norway, viii, ix. <strong>Ribbunga-öld,</strong> f. <i>the age of the Ribbungs,</i> Fms. ix.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>knighthood,</i> Bær. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-herr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-herr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., <strong>-lið,</strong> n. <i>cavalry,</i> Hkr. i. 216 (of the German emperor’s troops), Fms. i. 258 (referring to Wales), vii. 235, Ld. 78 (referring to Ireland), Stj. 513.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-ithrott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-íþrótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>chivalry.</i> Fas. i. 463.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (<strong>-ligr,</strong> adj.), <i>chivalrously,</i> Str., Fms. x. 230.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a knightly tale, romance,</i> the popular name for these Sagas, see List of Authors (G); riddarasögur á tveim bókum, Dipl. v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-skapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>knighthood, chivalry,</i> Fms. i. 97, x. 231, 381, Bær. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-sveinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-sveinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a knight’s page,</i> Fms. vi. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddara-tign"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddara-tign
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a knight’s order,</i> 623. 30. ☞ Riddari as a title was first introduced into Norway A. D. 1277,—Magnús konungr gaf skutilsveinum riddara-nöfn ok herra, Ann. s.a.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riddari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riddari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., older form <strong>ríðari</strong> or <strong>ríðeri,</strong> 645. 110, Fms. x. 88, Geisli (in the burden), where it rhymes to st<i>rið</i>um; and so in the oldest vellums, Eluc., Greg., Pd.: [Germ. <i>ritter</i> and <i>reiter;</i> Dan. <i>ridder</i> and <i>rytter</i>]:—<i>a rider, horseman,</i> but esp. <i>a knight:</i> the word, like most of those formed with inflexive <i>-ari,</i> is of foreign origin; for the old Northmen or Scandinavians make no reference to horsemen in battle till the 12th or 13th century, Fms. vii. 56, 236, xi. 331, cp. vi. 411 (referring to the English in the battle of Stanford-bridge), Stj. passim; Guðs riðari, Geisli; riddara nafnbót, Bær. 6; riddara-búnaðr, -skjöldr, -vápn, -höfðingi, Fms. v. 148, vi. 225, Stj. 163, 204, Bær. 5; riddara-meistari, Stj. 513; riddara-kappi, Str.:—<i>a knight in chess,</i> Ó. H. 167, Sturl. iii. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., qs. vrid (?), [ríða = <i>to writhe</i>], <i>a winding staircase, steps, a staircase</i> leading to the upper part, esp. outside the walls; hann lét göra kirkju í stöplinum ok rið upp at ganga, Bs. i. 132; salernit stóð á stöfum, en rið upp at ganga til dyranna, Ó. H. 72, Grett. 98, 99, Stj. 383; Ásbjörn hljóp upp í riðit ok svá í stöpulinn, Fms. viii. 247:—<i>a bridge</i> between two buildings, as it seems, höilina miklu ok Postula-kirkju ok riðit í milli, vii. 122; þá felldu þeir ofan riðit milli kastala biskups ok kirkjunnar, ix. 523, v. l.: see lopt-rið.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid-henda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið-henda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [riða], a kind of <i>metre,</i> a specimen of which is Ht. 32; in the even lines the rhyming syllables are as far apart as possible, but in the odd lines as close to one another as possible, which gives a ‘trembling,’ ‘rocking’ cadence in recitation.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid-hendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið-hendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>in the metre</i> riðhenda, Edda 135, Skálda 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid-skelfdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið-skelfðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>palsied,</i> Thom. 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid-tid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið-tíð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the time when sheep are at heat</i> (October).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid-vaxinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið-vaxinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>broad-shouldered and short-necked, square-built;</i> r. ok ekki hár, herði-mikill, Fb. iii. 246, Fbr. 183 (v. l.), Fms. x. 387: Atli inn skammi var maðr ekki hár, ok riðvaxinn, ok ramr at afli, Eg. 179; lágr á vöxt ok mjök r., Fas. iii. 298.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rid-volr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rið-völr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a short round stick,</i> to carry in the hand; tók hann riðvöl í hönd sér, Dropl. 29; hann greip upp riðvöl, ok laust sveininn í höfuðit svá at blóð féll um hann, Hkr. iii. 285.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a shivering fever, ague.</i> El. 1, MS. 544. 39, Sks. 137: in mod. usage <i>the trembling of the head and hands</i> from age or infirmity.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rida-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to tremble</i> as from age or infirmity; hann riðaði nokkut lítið, Sturl. i. 20; hann gékk við tvær hækjur ok riðar á báðar síður, Grett. 161, freq. in mod. usage: of the eyes of an infant, riðuðu augu, Rm. 18; riða skip, Fms. ix. 377, is prob. a mere error = reisa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. riðli, the name of a sword, Sæm. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [ríða A. 2]; leika á riðli, of cows that do not calve.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridlask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðlask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. [Engl. <i>reel</i>], <i>to rock, waver, reel to and fro,</i> of ranks in battle; riðlaðisk fylkingin ok losnaði öll, Eg. 298, Al. 37; flokkar tóku at riðlask (<i>began to move</i>), ok upp vóru sett merki fyrir höfðingjum, Fms. ii. 309; riðluðusk þá förunautar hans frá honum, <i>his followers dropped away, slunk away,</i> Orkn. 457; en þegar er los kom í liðit, … til þess er allt riðlaðisk í smá flokka, Ó. H. 122; hann lét riðlask vínberin … með riðluðum vínviðum af vínberjum ok allskyns aldini, <i>the vine clustered with grapes and fruit,</i> Ó. T. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shock, shaking;</i> stökk sú af járnunum við riðinn, Fms. vi. 168.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridu-sjukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðu-sjúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sick of ague,</i> 656 C. 22, Karl. 547, Thom. 463.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridu-sott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðu-sótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>fever, ague,</i> Str. 25; höfuð-skjálpti svá sem af riðusótt, Stj. 43, 344 (rendering <i>of febris</i> of the Vulgate), Mar. 131, Thom. 463.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ridull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. riðli, a milit. term, <i>a small detachment of men;</i> kómu þá Birkibeinar neðan ór bænum riðlum saman, Fb. ii. 578, Fas. i. 530; rennum at riðlum saman, ok görum dyninn sem mestan, Fms. viii. 403; konungr hafði riðul einn manna, 355, v. l.; var þetta lið lítill r. manna hjá þeim úvígja her er hans úvinir höfðu, ii. 306, Bs. i. 622, Stj. 522.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = rifs, Barl. 134, Bs. ii. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rif-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. rifja, dat. rifjum, [Engl. <i>rib, reef;</i> Germ. <i>rippe</i>]:—<i>a rib</i>, Lat. <i>costa;</i> á síðuna millum rifjanna, Nj. 262, Gullþ. 26; rifin öll, Orkn. 18, Fb. i. 531, Skíða R. 176; þá tók Guð brott eitt hans rif, Stj. 33, Eluc. 24, Ver. 3; at hann fyndi þat at mér býr fleira innan rifja en kál eitt, þvíat héðan skolu honum koma köld ráð undan hverju rifi, Ó. H. 132; cp. the allit. phrase, hafa ráð undir hverju rifi, <i>to have ‘rede’ under every rib,</i> i. e. <i>to have all one’s wits about one</i>:—metaph. <i>cause, reason,</i> við þat vaknar Geirmundr, … ok þykkisk vita af hverjum rifjum vera mun, Ld. 118; þá skildi hann af hverjum rifjum vera myndi, Ó. H. 67; konur þær er óarfgengjar vóru af þeim rifjum at þær höfðu leynt barngetnaði sínum, eða …, Grág. i. 228; ok skal á kveða af hverjum rifjum hann færir, 245:—of a whale’s ribs used as rollers for launching ships, Háv. 48 (hval-rif):—rifja rétti, Hkv. Hjörv., see réttr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rif-blautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rif-blautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>lean ribbed,</i> of a horse, Bs. ii. 389.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rif-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rif-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the swathes</i> or <i>rows of hay</i> spread out for drying.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rif-hris"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rif-hrís
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>brushwood, fagots,</i> Grág. ii. 263, 288.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [Scot. <i>rive</i>], <i>a rift, rent, cleft, fissure,</i> Sks. 210, freq. in mod. usage; bjarg-rifa, kletta-rifa, also a rift in a wall between two planks.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to rake hay into rows</i> (rifgarðar); rifja hey, Eb. 260, and in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifjaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>ribbed;</i> kald-r.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be rent, riven, cracked;</i> unz himininn rifnar, Arnór; muðrinn brast, ok rifnaði upp í gegnum herðuna, Eg. 181; höggvinn, rifnaðr (<i>cracked</i>) eða brotinn, Grág. ii. 11: esp. of texture, a membrane, or the like, þótt seglin rifnuðu, Fas. i. 156; kyrtillinn rifnaði, Eg. 602; tjaldið musterisins rifnaði mitt í tvennt, Luke xxiii. 45; ef klæði rifnar, ok skal sauma, K. Þ. K. 88; sárin rifnuðu upp, <i>the wounds were ripped up,</i> Fs. 67, Gullþ. 79.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. rifjar, [akin to rif], <i>the beam on which the warp hung</i> in the ancient loom; maðr telgði þar meið til rifjar, Rm. 15; reiði-ský rifs = <i>the hanging cloud of the</i> rifr, <i>the warp,</i> poët., Darr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifrildi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifrildi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shred, a thing torn to pieces;</i> bókar-r.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifs"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifs
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>plunder;</i> rán ok rifs, Fms. ii. 119, vi. 42, vii. 263.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rifsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rifsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, an iterative, [akin to rífa], <i>to plunder;</i> ok rifsuðu bú þeirra, Fms. viii. 390; rifsaði hverr slíkt sem hann fékk, Al. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = rígr, <i>stiffness;</i> en svo í kroppinn komi ei rig, karlfólkið stundum reyni sig, Bb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>roughness on the surface;</i> svá skírt, at glöggliga sér hverja rigu, Fms. xi. 441, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riga-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [cp. reigja and rígr], <i>to lift heavily</i> or <i>with difficulty,</i> with dat.; fengu þeir hvergi rigat honum, Eb. 115 new Ed. (thus, not rygað); rigaðu þér á fætr, Fas. ii. 369; sagði, at hann lét eigi vinna þat er meira lá við, en at riga at slíku, <i>than to do such drudgery,</i> Rd. 263: in mod. usage, eg riga því ekki, eg get ekki rigat því, <i>I cannot move it.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rigna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rigna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <strong>regna,</strong> Hom. 5, Fms. x. 323, [regn; cp. Dan. <i>regne;</i> Swed. <i>regna</i>]:—<i>to rain,</i> 656 B. 12: followed by a dat., rignir eldi ok brennu-steini, Ver. 13; rignir blóði, Darr.; blóði hafði rignt í skúrinni, Eb. 260, passim in old and mod. usage: part. rigndr, <i>wet from rain,</i> Bs. i. 322.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rigning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rigning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rainy weather;</i> miklar rigningar, <i>much rain;</i> rigninga-sumar, <i>a rainy summer,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rigsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rigsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to stalk stiffly and haughtily,</i> = reigsa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/riklingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          riklingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a flounder cut into strips and dried</i> (a dainty), Sturl. i. 164, N. G. L. i. 143, D. N. iii. 914, Rétt. 47, and passim: also spelt reklingr, esp. in Norse writers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rim
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. rimar, [Engl. <i>rim</i>], <i>a rail</i> in a paling; en sá er annarr garðr er heitir rima-garðr (<i>a rail fence</i>), fjórar rimar í ok okar á endum, Gþl. 381; þá tók hann rim af sleðanum ok studdisk við, Bs. i. 614; ok af saumförin með af riminni, 390 (of a ship): freq. in mod. usage, meis-rim, smíða rim í meis, hurð; skjald-rim, vett-rim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rimi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rimi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a strip of land,</i> Edda (Gl.) i. 586; hann ferr til fjalls ok görir þar kenni-mark, … ok er sá rimi kalladr at Kambi, Sd. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rimma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rimma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a battle, tumult, fray;</i> í þeirri rimmu ráku þeir Símon á braut, Clem. 37; í þeirri rimmu fékk hann fjögur sár, Sturl. iii. 30, Lex. Poët., freq. in mod. usage; ógna-hörð var r., Úlf. 7. 96. <strong>Rimmu-gýgr,</strong> f. <i>‘battle-ogre,’</i> the name of Skarpheðin’s battle-axe, Nj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rindill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rindill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. rindli, qs. vrindill, a dimin. [cp. Engl. <i>wren</i>; but Dan. <i>rindel</i>], a bird, <i>the wren</i> (in Eggert Itin. ch. 678 = <i>motacilla fusca,</i> the smallest bird in Icel., also called músar-bróðir or músar-rindill): as a nickname of <i>a small, puny person,</i> Lv., Bs. (Laur. S.) <strong>rindil-þvari,</strong> a, m. = rindill, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rindr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rindr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. and acc. Rindi, qs. Vrindr, which form remains in the old alliteration (<i>V</i>)rindr berr í <i>ve</i>str-sölum, Vtkv.; see Bergmann in the Mythol. Glossary to the Message of Skírnir, Strasburg 1871:—the name of a goddess or giantess, the mother of Vali, Vsp., Vtkv., Gg.; seið Yggr til Rindar, Kormak; the Earth is called Rindar elja (see elja), Edda (in a verse). The loves of Wodan and Rind resemble those of Zeus and Europa in the Greek legends.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ringar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ringar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men from</i> <strong>Ringa-ríki</strong> in Norway: <strong>Ringskr,</strong> adj., Fms. ii. 252.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ringja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ringja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., qs. hringja. <i>a round pail,</i> cp. mælke-ring in Norway = <i>a pail full of coagulated milk,</i> Stj. 294.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ringl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ringl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>craziness:</i> <strong>ringlaðr,</strong> <i>crazy.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Engl. <i>to ring,</i> of the voice], <i>a shock, a quivering, convulsive motion;</i> taka harða ringi, of a ship, (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ringul-reid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ringul-reið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f.; in the phrase, vera á r., <i>to be in confusion, topsy-turvy;</i> síðan fór á ringulrey (sic) réttr á Ísa-landi, Bs. ii. 497.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rippa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rippa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [akin to rifja], <i>to sum up;</i> þá rippuðu þeir upp öll mála-ferli þeirra vel ok einarðliga, Vápn. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ript"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ript
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f., or <strong>ripti,</strong> n. a kind of <i>cloth</i> or <i>linen jerkin;</i> rekkar þeir þóttusk er þeir ript höfðu, Hm. 48, Edda ii. 494; Vala-ript, <i>a Welsh,</i> i. e. <i>foreign jerkin,</i> Skv. 3. 63; lé-rept, q. v.; kona sveip ripti, Rm. 18, Skv. 3. 8; strjúka ripti, <i>to mangle linen,</i> Rm. 25; Nanna sendi Freyju ripti, Edda 39; and setjask und ripti, of the bridal veil, Rm. 20: ‘rhenones sunt velamina humerorum et pectoris usque in umbilicum, intortis villis adeo hispidi ut imbres respuant … quos <i>reptos</i> vocant,’ Isid. Hisp. xix. 23; this corresponds exactly with the use in Hm. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ripta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ripta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to ‘rip up,’ invalidate</i> a bargain or agreement; with acc., ripta kaup, Grág. i. 333, ii. 213; r. alla landsöluna, 214; engi maðr á at r. gjöf sína, i. 203; r. grip undan manni, Jb. 472; r. görð, id.: <i>to break,</i> fyrir-bjóðum ver þessa vára skipan at r. eðr rjúfa, D. N. i. 60:—<i>to regain,</i> of an estate, Kolskeggr ætlar mál frammi at hafa ok ripta fjórðung í Móeiðar-hváli, Nj. 102; ef undan honum riptisk at lögum þessi helmingr jarðar á Skriðulandi, Dipl. iii. 6; en svá mörg hundruð sem riptask í Torfa-stöðum, eða Skála-nesjum, þá skal Óláfr taka svá mörg hundruð upp í Bessa-stöðum, v. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ripting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ripting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a withdrawal</i> (of a bargain); hversugi mikit fé er þeir gefa … þá skal engi r. til þess vera, þótt eigi komi búar til at vinna eiða at, Grág. i. 223; lion gai fyrir heklu fitkkotta ok vildi kaup kalla, henni þótti þat úhættara við riptingum, Landn. 319.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ris"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ris
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the rise</i> or <i>top</i> of a building; það er hátt á því risið.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ris-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ris-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the hour for rising,</i> about 6 o’clock A.M., Dropl. 20, Grág. ii. 224; milli ris-mála ok dagmála, O. H. L. 24; hirðis-rismál.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/risa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          risa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in blóð-risa (q. v.), <i>smeared with blood,</i> prob. qs. vriðsa, from ríða, <i>to smear.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/risa-legr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          risa-legr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>gigantic,</i> Al. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/risi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          risi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., thus sounded with a short <i>i</i>, but perh. better rísi; qs. vrísi; [cp. Hel. <i>vrisul;</i> Germ. <i>riese</i>; Ivar Aascn <i>ryse</i> and <i>rysel;</i> the <i>v</i> shews that the word has no connection with the verb rísa, and the root is unknown; Swed. <i>vresig</i> = <i>burly</i> may be a kindred word]:—<i>a giant,</i> Hkr. i. 5, Sks. 601, 705, Fas. iii. 24, Ann. 1338. In popular Icel. usage risi denotes size, jötunn strength, þurs lack of intelligence; thus, hár sem risi, sterkr sem jötunn, heimskr sem þurs, <i>as tall as a</i> risi, <i>strong as a</i> jötun, <i>stupid as a</i> þurs. The ancient legends describe the risar as handsome, and a long-lived race; bygðu þá risar víða, en sumir vóru hálfrisar, þá var mikit sambland þjóðanna, þvíat risar fengu kvenna af Ýmislandi, Fas. i. 513, Herv. S. ch. 1, Örvar Odds S. ch. 18; cp. also the tales of Godmund on Glasisvellir: compds, hálf-risi, berg-risi. The word is very popular (even more so than jötunn) in modern tales, but is only found once (in the compd berg-risi) in old poems; risa barn, -dóttir, <i>a giant-bairn, giant-daughter.</i> Fas. ii. 239; but in compds risa fólk, -kyn, -ætt, <i>giant-folk, giant-kind,</i> 383, 384, Bárð. 163, Landn. 118; risa vöxtr, <i>a giant’s size,</i> Stj. 326.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/risinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          risinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in gest-r., víg-r.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/risna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          risna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. (spelt ristna, Fb. i. 362, ii. 227), <i>hospitality, munificence;</i> r. ok örlæti, Fms. ii. 118; hann lofaði risnu Þórarins, v. 315; hvárki var nú minni rausn né risna í búinu en áðr, Band. 3; ek veit risnu þína, at þú munt taka við honum, Lv. 26; varð þeim mart talat um risnu Sveins, Orkn. 464. <strong>risnu-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a hospitable man,</i> Fb. ii. 227.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/risni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          risni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = risna, in gest-risni.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rispa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rispa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [Scot. <i>resp</i> or <i>risp;</i> Engl. <i>rasp</i>], <i>to scratch;</i> klóra ok r., Stj. 77 (v. l.), freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rist"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t. <i>a gridiron;</i> panna, rist, steiki-teinn, Dipl. v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rist-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. ristr, mod. ristir, for the ristr in Pass. 33. 4 is poët.; older form vrist; [Engl. <i>wrist</i>, used only of the hand; Dan. <i>vrist</i>; the word is derived from (v)ríða, Engl. <i>writhe;</i> Scot. <i>reist;</i> cp. also Engl. <i>wrest, wrestle,</i> which are kindred words]:—<i>the instep of the foot,</i> Þiðr. 86; gegnum búðar ristrnar, Fms. v. 347; þá sté hann fætinum á aðra ristina, vii. 13; horfa fætrnir ok ristrnar á bak aptr, Stj. 94; il ok rist, 160; sull hafði hann á fæti niðri á ristinni, Ísl. ii. 218; troðnir í sundr tvennir skór … upp vóru hinir á ristum, Skíða R. 193.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, <i>to slice;</i> see rista.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
