        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosm-hvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rosm-hvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ivar Aasen <i>rosmaal;</i> Engl. <i>wal-rus</i> and A. S. <i>bors-hwæl</i> are prob. corrupt forms of the same word: it is not known how the former part of the compd is to be explained]:—<i>a walrus,</i> Jb. 310, K. Þ. K. 112, Bs. i. 641; and in local names, <strong>Rosmhvala-nes,</strong> in Icel., whence <strong>Rosm-hvelingar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the men from R.,</i> Sturl. i. 224: rosm-hvalr and rostungr are synonymous, so that in the Jb. some MSS. have the one word, some the other.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
