      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rostu-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rostu-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unruly,</i> Sturl. ii. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rostungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rostungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a walrus,</i> Edda (Gl.), Grág. ii. 359, Sks. 178, Jb., Fbr. 161: costly things were carved on the teeth, Páls S. ch. 16, Rafn S. ch. 4; and the hide was made into ropes for ships’ rigging (svörðr), cp. Sks., and Oros. in king Alfred’s transl. <strong>rostungs-hauss,</strong> m., and <strong>-tönn,</strong> f. <i>a Walrus-tooth,</i> Krók. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a concussion of the brain from a blow,</i> as also <i>the stunning</i> or <i>insensibility</i> from such a blow; falla í rot, Korm. 230; hann réttir við ór rotinu, 62; spyrndi Grettir svá fast við eyrun; á tveimr at þeir lágu í roti, Grett. 127; hann sló sveininn í rot, … í því raknaði sveinninn við, Ísl. ii. 421: also <i>the insensibility</i> of a drunkard, rakna ór roti, liggja í roti, Snót 100. <strong>rot-högg,</strong> n. <i>a staggering, stunning blow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rota
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to stun by a blow;</i> rota sel, rota naut, <i>to fell an ox:</i> part. <strong>rotaðr,</strong> hálf-rotaðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rotinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rotinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>raadden;</i> Engl. <i>rotten;</i> akin to reyta, q. v.], <i>rotten;</i> var þá líkaminn r. ok ílla þefjaðr, Fb. i. 582; rotið vín, Stj. 367; ær ú-rotnar, loðnar ok lembdar, Grág.: also of paper, vellum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rotna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rotna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to rot, become putrid;</i> ef hann lætr inni r. mann dauðan, N. G. L. i. 14, K. Á. 70; rotna kvikr, Sks. 457; hér á jörð þó holdið rotni, Pass. 48. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rotta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rotta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a rat;</i> a for. word, which occurs only in the nickname <strong>rottu-hryggr,</strong> Bs., Arna S.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rotti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rotti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a band, gang, company;</i> aldrei muni jafnmikill herr hafa saman dregisk í einn rotta, Róm. 198.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., i. e. ró, <i>a cabin;</i> see rá.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. [A. S. <i>row;</i> Germ. <i>ruhe;</i> Dan. <i>ro</i>], <i>rest, calm, quietness,</i> Sks. 235; gefa ró reiði, <i>to give rest to one’s wrath,</i> Karl. 99, Nj. 175; skömm mun ró reiði, Am. 75; at Egill skyldi aldrei ró bíða á Íslandi, Eg. 402; í ró, <i>in rest, in peace,</i> Orkn. 418; sofa í ró, Fms. vii. 317; með kyrð ok með ró (rꜹ Cd.), Fms. x. 405; magna seið, at hann megi sér hvergi ró eiga í landi, <i>feel restless, feel no rest anywhere,</i> Gísl. 116:—medic. <i>relief,</i> honum þótti sér þat helzt til róar, of one sick, Fms. vi. 156.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>restless,</i> Sks. 235.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>quietly,</i> 655 xiv. A. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>calm, quiet,</i> [Germ. <i>ruhig</i>], Sks. 232.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró-lyndr
