        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>ró-semi,</strong> f.), adj. <i>calm.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ro-spolr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ró-spölr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an iron sheet from which a</i> ró (q. v.) <i>is cut,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. ræ (i. e. rœ), rær, rær, pl. róm, Orkn. 402; else róum (Bs.i. 497), róit, róa; pret. réri, older and better reyri or röri, which form is still used in eastern Icel.; imperat. ró, róðú; part, róinn, see Gramm.p. xxiii: [A. S. <i>rowan;</i> Engl. <i>row</i>; Dan. <i>roe</i>; Swed. <i>ro</i>]:—<i>to row</i>; sigla eðr róa, Grág. ii. 130; róa at, Fms. viii. 315; róa leiðangr, vii. 152; þeir réru yfir vatnið, Eg. 109; menn reyru til Sauðeyjar, 219; róa undan, Fms. i. 45; réri fram undan eyjunni allr herr konunganna, ii. 305; róa út ór höfninni, iv. 97 þeir reyru á brott, vii. 201; rétu þeir út fyrir Norðnes, viii. 135; hann réri til þeirra, 231; hann rær út í Bjarneyjar, Nj. 19; róm vér í mót þeim sem harðast, Orkn. 402; róa skipi, Eg. 80; þeir réru þveran árstrauminn, Fms. vii. 264; sá skal fá skip ok mat ok sæ róa, er taki skýtr, N. G. L. i. 48; róa af fjörðinn, Fms. ix. 502; fornt skip er hömlur sé af rónar, <i>rowed off, worn off,</i> N. G. L. i. 75: róa út, <i>to row out to sea, go fishing,</i> K. Þ. K. 90 (út-róðr): as also absol., ok er hann kom þar vóru allir menn rónir nema Þorvaldr, <i>all the fishing-boats were at sea,</i> Nj. 19; róa á sjá, róa til fiskjar, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rod-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = ræði (?), Fms. ix. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. (<strong>róði,</strong> a, m., Vm. 32, and in the name Róðadrápa below), [a word borrowed from the A. S. <i>rôd;</i> Engl. <i>rood,</i> cp. <i>rod;</i> Germ. <i>ruthe</i>]:—<i>the rood, holyrood, crucifix,</i> Fms. v. 136, 344, 345, viii. 247. Symb. 20, Rb. 370, Hom. 97, Pm. 77, and passim, but only in this eccl. sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodi-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> a, m. = róða, Vm. 32. <strong>Róða-drápa,</strong> u, f. the name of a poem, Ó. H.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. róðrar [róa], <i>a rowing, pulling,</i> Eg. 358, Fms. ii. 180; þeir höfðu fagran róðr, yi. 120; var mjök vandaðr róðr á drekanum,309, and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodr-goltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðr-göltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>war-ram,</i> Sks. 394.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodr-hafr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðr-háfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of háfr or <i>bag-net,</i> with which herrings are caught, Gþl. 427.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Sansk. <i>rudhira</i>], <i>blood,</i> esp. as it seems <i>sacrificial blood,</i> only used in special phrases; þeir höfðu válkask í róðru ok blóði, Gísl. 67; slátrum sýsliga sjám þá róðru, Am. 19; sýndisk tungl svá sem róðra væri, Bs. i. 145; ok var sjórinn sem á róðru sæi, Fas. i. 156; ok rjóða hann í róðru blótnauts þess er hann blótaði þar sjálfr, Fb. i. 249.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodrar-ferja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðrar-ferja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a rowing ferry,</i> Eg.354. 500, Fms. vii. 320, Hkr. i. 185.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodrar-hanzki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðrar-hanzki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a rowing glove.</i> Fas. ii. 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodrar-hufr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðrar-húfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the gunwale on which the rowlocks are fixed,</i> N. G. L. ii. 283.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodrar-leidi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðrar-leiði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a calm, dull sea,</i> so that one has to take to the oars, Eg. 203; þeir tóku r., <i>at first they rowed,</i> Orkn. 412, Bs. i. 520, Grett. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodrar-skip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðrar-skip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-skúta,</strong> u, f. <i>a ship with oars,</i> Eg. 93, 109, Ó. H. 62, K. Þ. K. 86, Orkn. 462, N. G. L. i. 304, Fær. 92, Fms, iv. 91.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodu-kross"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðu-kross
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a crucifix,</i> Nj. 158, Bs. i. 173, Fms. ii. 178, 325, Bárð. 179, Vm. 50, 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodu-kyrtill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róðu-kyrtill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a holyrood-kirtle,</i> as church furniture, Vm. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rofa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rófa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., proncd. <strong>róa,</strong> thus in rhymes, aldrei tryggist <i>tóa,</i> þó tekin sé úr henni <i>róa,</i> Hallgr.; [akin to Germ. <i>rumpf</i>]:—<i>a tail,</i> i. e. the vertebral part, opp. to the hair; nú höggr maðr hala af hesti ok höggr nokkut af rófu, þat er spellvirki, N. G. L. i. 46, Fas. i. 80, Gpl. 399, Kb. 276: in mod, usage esp. of a cat, dog, or the like, kattar-róa, hunds-róa. <strong>rófu-bein,</strong> n. <i>the caudal bone,</i> Jb. 114.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. in mod. usage <strong>rógr,</strong> m.; thus, með ríkan róginn mest, Bs. ii. 493, in a poem of the 16th century; originally vróg: [Ulf. <i>wrohs</i> = κατηγορία; A. S. <i>wrôht;</i> Germ. <i>räge</i>]:—<i>a slander,</i> Hom. 85, Eb. 60 new Ed.; hróp ok róg, Ls. 4; þungligt, geysiligt róg, Gd. 29, 33; berask róg milli, Am. 95; róg íllra manna, Eg. 55; hvert etni þeir hüfðu í um rógit, 59; bera róg þetta fyrir konung, 576; svá fremi skaltú rógit í frammi hafa, Nj. 166; Haraldr lét drepa Þórólf af rógi Hildiriðar-sona, Landn. 55; engi á sök á sönnu rógi, Gþl. 196.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog-beri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg-beri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a slanderer, backbiter,</i> Edda 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog-burdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg-burðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>slander.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog-girni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg-girni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a disposition to slander,</i> Hom. 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog-maeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg-mæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a calumny,</i> Þorst. Síðu H. 175.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>backbiting,</i> Fær. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rog-sterkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róg-sterkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘strife-strong,’ martial,</i> Runic stone.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rogs-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rógs-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a slanderer,</i> Fms. xi. 330, Gþl. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rói
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [ró], <i>a rest, repose,</i> Fms. x. 354; ú-rói, <i>tumult.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ról
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [from Engl. <i>roll</i>, Lat. <i>rotula</i>], <i>a walking, rolling to and fro;</i> nú er eg klæddr og kominn; á ról, Kristr Jesús veri mitt skjól, a ditty; nú eru þau öll (i. e. the bairns) á róli, einu fæst varla skóli, Espol. Arb. s.a. 1616.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rola"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a swing,</i> Dan. <i>gynge;</i> hanga í rólu.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., <strong>Róma,</strong> u, f., <strong>Róma-borg,</strong> f., but also spelt with <i>u,</i> <strong>Rúm, Rúma-borg,</strong> etc., <i>Rome;</i> the forms and spelling vary, <strong>Róma,</strong> indecl., Symb. 24, Fms. vi. 228; or <strong>Róm,</strong> n., Róms, gen., Sighvat; til Róms, Nj. 275, Bs. i. 900; Pétr ok Páll at Rómi hjálpi mér at dómi, a ditty.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>Rúm-ferð,</strong> <strong>Róm-fór,</strong> f. <i>a pilgrimage to Rome,</i> Fms. iii. 31, Hkr. ii. 24, Ísl. i. 329.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom-ferill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm-ferill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a pilgrim to Rome,</i> Symb. 15, Fms. vi. 302.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom-lendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm-lendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>Roman</i> (?), Rd. 232, (R. at kyni, but the reading seems to be corrupt.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom-verjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm-verjar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>Rúm-verjar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the Romans,</i> Fms. i. 106, Hkr. i. 8, and passim in old and mod. usage; thus, Pistillinn til Rómverja, <i>the Epistle to the Romans,</i> N. T.; Rómverja kirkja, <i>the Roman church,</i> Stj.; Rómverja herr, höfðingi, keisari, konungr, land, riki, veldi, <i>the Roman army, chief, emperor, king;, land, empire, kingdom,</i> Symb. 9, Clem. 26, 42, MS. 673. 51, Stj., Ver. 46, Bær 12, and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom-verska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm-verska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the Roman tongue, Latin,</i> Ingv. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rom-verskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róm-verskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>Rúm-verskr,</strong> adj. <i>Roman,</i> Fms. viii. 277, Sks. 653, Ver. 37, N. T. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a weapon, clash, battle,</i> only in poetry, see Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roma-borg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róma-borg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the city of Rome,</i> Eluc. 50, passim; Rómaborgar keisari, höfðingi, lýðr, <i>the Roman emperor, king, people,</i> Eluc. 50, Fms, vii. 86, 99, 221; Rómaborgar lög, kirkja, <i>the Roman law, church,</i> 645. 98, H. E. i 464; Rómaborgar ríki, <i>the Roman empire,</i> Bs. i. 71; but also",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roma-skattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          róma-skattr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Peter’s pence,</i> K. Á. 78, 94, 194, Vm. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ror"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., fem. ró, neut. rótt, [ró]:—<i>calm, composed;</i> Þorbjörn man ekki rór í bygðinni við þik, Krók. 37 C; róir menn, hógsamir ok friðsamir, Fms. x. 415; Guðs boðorð má neykkvi helzt cun rói hugr of rannsaka, 677. 6; miklu eru róari góðir menn en íllir, 12: neut., sofa rótt, <i>to sleep sweetly;</i> ú-rór, <i>restless, unruly:</i> e-m er ó-rótt, <i>to feel restless.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ros"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rós
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (the old writers use the Lat. form <strong>rósa,</strong> Fms. x. 352; rauðr sem rósa, Stj. 72, Bs. ii), [Lat. <i>rosa</i>]:—<i>a rose;</i> rauðar rósir, Bjarni; eyra-rós, q. v.; frost-rósir. <i>frost-roses.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rósta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., see rosta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. [different from the preceding, perh. akin to hrót, q. v.; Ivar Aasen <i>rot</i>]:—<i>the inner part of the roof of a house,</i> where meat, fish, and stores are hung up; mær nökkur átti erendi at fara í rót upp, þá sá hún liggja á hurðásnum sjau fiska skarpa, Bs. i. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. rætr (rœtr), [a word common to all Teut, languages, cp.also Lat. <i>rādix</i>]:—<i>a root;</i> hvers hann af rót um renn, Hm. 139; rót af grasi, Pr. 471; íllr ávöxtr af íllri rót, Fms. ii. 48: metaph., vera rót (<i>cause</i>) undir e-u, Sturl. ii. 72; koma af rótum e-s, id., Fms. ix. 254; rót ok upphaf, Fb. iii. 245; af hverjum rótum þetta hefði risit, 308; af rót vándra manna, Bs. 11. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot-fastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rót-fastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘root-fast,’ rooted, fixed,</i> Hkr. i. 71, Js. 17, Stj. 644 (v. l.), Pr. 462, Barl. 86, N. G. L. i. 40, 63.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot-festa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rót-festa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to root</i>, and reflex, <i>to take root,</i> Barl. 5, 86, 95, Pr. 462.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rót-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>root-less, without roots,</i> Hm. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rot-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
