        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Engl. <i>rubbish</i>], <i>to huddle,</i> with dat.; r. e-u saman.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rubbi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rubbi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (and <strong>rubb,</strong> n., <strong>rubbungr,</strong> m.), <i>rubbish, refuse.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rudda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rudda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a coarse kind of club</i> (of an unbarked tree?); ruddu er menn kalla klubbu, Ó. H. 108, 109, Fas. iii. 229. <strong>ruddu-vetr,</strong> m. the name of a severe winter, A. D. 1022; as lurkr of the winter 1601.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
