          className="link"
          href="/word/ruddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ruddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a clown, rude person;</i> and of things, <i>coarseness, refuse,</i> e. g. of bad hay. <strong>rudda-legr,</strong> adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <strong>rudda-skapr,</strong> m.<i>coarseness</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ruð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a clearing in a wood;</i> hann lagði á þat kapp mikit, at ryðja markir ok byggja aptr ruðin, Hkr. i. 45; sá er á ruði býr, skal kalla til bónda, Gþl. 485, D. N. iii. 120: freq. in Norse and Dan. local names,<i>-röd</i> and <i>-rud,</i> Hille-röd, in Denmark; Villinge-rud, Linde-rud, in Norway; Orme-rod, in North England; these names, however, were in olden times not so frequent as at present, see Munch’s Norg. Beskr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rud-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ruð-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a cleared place</i> (= ruð), Gþl. 431, (mod. Norse <i>Rustad.</i>)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ruda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ruða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>ravage;</i> Oddr var eigi ruðu-lítill, <i>O. made no small havock,</i> Fas. ii. 255; to this may also belong ruðu-brandar, <i>the ravenous swords,</i> Orkn. 72 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rudning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ruðning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (<strong>ruðningr,</strong> m., Nj. 235, v. l.), [ryðja], <i>a challenging,</i> of neighbours or judges in the old Icel. court, Grág. i. 29, 33, 52, Nj. 82, 87, passim. <strong>ruðningar-mál,</strong> n. pl. <i>the formula of a challenge,</i> Grág.i. 27, Nj. 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
