        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to confound,</i> with dat., Al. 50, Rb. 164, Sks. 234, K. Á. 28, Stj. 142; r. e-u saman, <i>to confound.</i>",
            }
