              "__html": "n. (<strong>ryðr,</strong> m., Sks. 442 (v. l.), Fas. i. 514, Al. 132):—<i>rust</i>, from the red colour, Stj. 344, Ld. 114, Hom. 15, Matth. vi. 19, 20, passim.",
            }
