      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rydja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ryðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ryð, ruddi, rutt, [this word has lost the initial <i>h</i> (qs. hryðja), being derived from hrjóða, denoting <i>‘to clear, rid of,’</i> cp. also hroði, hryðja, <i>sweepings, offal;</i> and is altogether different from rjóða = <i>to redden;</i> the <i>h</i> remains in hruðning, q. v.; see hrjóða; Engl. <i>rid</i>; Scot. <i>red</i> or <i>redde;</i> Dan. <i>rydde</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rydjandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ryðjandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
