          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rygir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the inhabitants of</i> <strong>Roga-land</strong> in Norway, Fms. passim; Hólm-Rygir, <i>the Island ‘Rugians.’</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rygjar-to"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rygjar-tó
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., spelt rykkjar-tó, Ó. H. 227, Hkr. ii. 384, and some other vellums, see Fms. v. 101, v. l. 3, cp. also O. H. L. 60:—<i>a ‘lady’s tae’</i>(see tó), <i>a tax on linen to be paid by every mistress of a house;</i> húsfreyja hver (skyldi fá konungi) r., þat var lín órennt, svá mikit, at fengi spennt um mesta fingri ok lengsta (lengsta fingri ok þumalfingri. Fms. l. c. better); synjar-spönn, ok rygjar-tó, ok reykmela, þat hafa konungar getit Naumdælum, at þeir skolu eigi heldr greiða en allir aðrir Þrændir, N. G. L. i. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rygr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rygr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. rygjar, dat. and acc. rygi, pl. rygjar, Fas. i. 497:—<i>a lady, housewife,</i> Lat. <i>matrona;</i> rygr heitir sú kona er ríkust er, Edda 108; þann mann (a person to be adopted) skal leiða á reka (rekks?) skaut ok rygja(r), N. G. L. i. 209; rygr kvaðsk eiga inni álfa-blót, Sighvat; aldin rygr, <i>an old lady,</i> Kristni S. in a verse, (of a priestess); rygjar blóð, Sól. (dubious): baug-rygr (q. v.), <i>a matron who receives of the</i> baugr (<i>weregild</i>), enjoying the rights of an agnate.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rygskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rygskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>from</i> Rogaland, Hkr. i. 301.",
            }
          }
        />
