              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fms. vii. 110.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rymr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rymr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>roaring,</i> of a hoarse voice, Edda 110; rymr oneagri, 673. 54; með rymnum, 56: poét., rymr öxa, randa, ríta, <i>the clatter of weapons: the sea</i> is called <strong>rym-fjall, -leið, -völlr,</strong> = <i>the roaring fell, way, field,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
