            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rysking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rysking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a rough shaking,</i> Grág. ii. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryskja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ryskja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Dan. <i>ruske</i>], <i>to shake roughly, handle roughly;</i> hón tók báðum höndum í hár sér ok ryskti sik, Stj. 520: ef maðr ryskir mann ok varðar þat skóggang, Grág. ii. 9; hann hafði slitið af sér klæði sín ok ryskt sik, Al. 57; mjök hetir Rán ryskt um mik. <i>Ran has dealt roughly with me, stripped me,</i> Stor.:—reflex., þar myndi ekki þykkja við kollóttan at ryskjask, Sturl iii. 238; eðr menn r. eðr berjask með hnefum, Jb. 100.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rytja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rytja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a vile, shabby thing,</i> Grett. 114 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rytningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rytningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = rytingr, Js. 31, Fms. iv. 173.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rytr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rytr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., and <strong>rytsa,</strong> u, f. <i>a sea-gull,</i> Edda (Gl.), = <i>the larus tridactylus,</i> as Faber; or rather = <i>larus albus minimus,</i> mod. rita, as Eggert Itin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
