        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a shabby thing,</i> Hom. 152; gömul ok vesöl rytta, Barl. 88, 154. <strong>ryttu-legr,</strong> adj. <i>wretched.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rygi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýgi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [róg], <i>slanderous;</i> r. orð, <i>abusive words,</i> Bs. i. 653, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a rag,</i> esp. of worn linen.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "rý, rúði or rýði, part. rúinn, [Scot. <i>roo</i>], prop. <i>to pluck the wool off sheep</i> instead of shearing, as is still done in Icel.; rýja gemlinga, Sd. 155; hann görði Loptr rúinn, <i>L. pulled it off,</i> of a twig, Fsm.: the word is freq. in mod. usage, metaph., hnígr þá úr höndum mér, harpan strengja rúin, <i>the harp stripped of its cords,</i> Núm. (fine); ó-rúinn, <i>unplucked.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [rum; Germ. <i>räumen;</i> Dan. <i>römme</i>], <i>to make room for;</i> þá mælti hann at rýma skyldi pallinn, Eg. 303; þvíat hann rýmdi fyrir herra Ásgrimi, Bs. i. 716; kallar at Þorleifr skyli rýma höfnina fyrir honum ok leggja ór lægi, Hkr. i. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rymka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýmka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to widen, enlarge:</i> <strong>rýmkan,</strong> f. <i>an enlargement.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [rún; Old Engl. <i>roun</i>], <i>to enquire;</i> rýna eptir e-n, <i>to pry into</i> (reyna); ok mi lætr hann sækja galdra-menn er eptir öllu geta rýnt, Fas. i. 5: part. rýnendr. <i>friends, counsellors,</i> Akv. 9: ræða ok rýna, <i>to talk and converse,</i> Rm. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>scrutiny, contemplation:</i> poët., rýnis reið, <i>contemplation’s vehicle,</i> i. e. <i>the breast,</i> Stor.: <i>grammar,</i> skáld eru höfundar allrar rýnni, <i>the poets are the judges, the authorities in all matters of grammar,</i> Skálda 164.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryninn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýninn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wise, deep in lore,</i> in full-rýninn. Am.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rynir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>shark, squalus maximus,</i> Eggert Itin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>thin, small.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Ulf. <i>rjurjan</i> = φθείρειν], <i>to make small,</i> merl. 1. 35",
            }
