          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýrð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ulf. <i>rjurei</i> = φθορά], <i>a detriment,</i> Sturl. ii. (in a verse), Pass. 50. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryrir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýrir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a diminisher,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryrna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýrna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to dwindle.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryrr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. <i>rjurs</i>, = θνητός, φθαρτός, πρόσκαιρος, φθειρόμενος, and <i>un-rjurs</i> = ἄφθαρτος]:—<i>thin, poor;</i> rýrt man verða fyrir honum smámennit, Nj. 94; vænti ek at rýr verði þræla-ættin fyrir oss, Lv. 4; var rýrt fyrir þeim lið Herþjófs konungs, Fas. iii. 21; en þar sem hann fór varð rýrt fyrir, i. 281, Karl. 185.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rysla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to clatter;</i> rýsla í penningum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rysli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýsli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. Fr. <i>ruisselant</i>], <i>a ‘babbling’ stream;</i> bekkjar-rysli, Ann. Nord. Oldk. 1846, p. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Swed. <i>ryta</i> = <i>to roar</i>], <i>to squeal,</i> of a wild boar or swine; rýtanda svini, Hm. 84; rýtandi ok emjandi, Fb. ii. 27; rýta man göltrinn ef gríssinn er drepinn, Þórð. 20 new Ed.; en hón (the sow) rýtti af raun, <i>squealed with pain.</i> Fas. i. 482.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ryting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>roaring,</i> of a lion, Stj. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rytingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rýtingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>dirk</i> or <i>dagger,</i> Gþl. 164, Hkr. ii. 112; rýtningr, Fb., Ó. H. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> (i. e. <strong>rœða</strong>), u, f., gen. pl. ræðna, Sks. 636, [Germ. <i>rede</i>], <i>speech, talk;</i> síðan töluðu þeir mart, ok kómu þar niðr ræður Höskuldar, at …, Nj. 3; konungr reiddisk mjök við ræður þessar, Eg. 51; en er þeir Þórólfr ok Björn kómu á þessar ræður fyrir Eiríki, <i>touched on this. subject,</i> 174; jarl tók henni heldr seint í fyrstu, en mýktisk ræðan svá sem á leið, Orkn. 304; þótti hvárum-tveggjum þær ræður skemtiligar. Eg. 686.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>rœða</strong>), d, [Ulf. <i>ródjan</i> = λαλειν; A. S. <i>rædan;</i> Germ.<i>reden;</i> a word different from ráða, q. v.]:—<i>to speak;</i> Högni því nítti er hinn um ræddi, Am. 7; ræðit ér um ráð, <i>speak your rede, say what is to be done,</i> Hðm. 20; ræða hugat mál fyrir höldum, Kormak; ræða við reglur Eddu, Gd. 2; kom þar brátt tali at þeir ræddu um skáldskap, Eg. 686; ef þú ræðir þetta mál (<i>discusses it</i>) fyrir konungi, Fms. i. 82; þá ræddi Höskuldr við Rút, þá ræddi Höskuldr til Rúts, Nj. 2:—ræða um e-t, <i>to speak about;</i> konungr. ræddi fátt um þessi tíðendi fyrir mönnum, Eg. 51, Nj. 270, Orkn. 400; also freq. in mod. usage, Pass. 21. 5, 39. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raedari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræðari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [róðr], <i>an oarsman.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [ráð], <i>rule, management;</i> skipa e-m ræði staðarins, Mar.; skal hann hafa ræði þeirra ok lukla, D. N. iii. 88. <strong>ræðis-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a steward, manager.</i> Fms. i. 101, 290, xi. 229, D. N. ii. 235, iii. 149, 506, Bs. i. 716, Sturl. iii. 47, Sks. 58 new Ed.: rendering of Lat. <i>consul,</i> Róm. 386: = <i>imperator</i> (Sallust Catil. ch. 53), 346.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raedingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>ræding</i>], <i>a reading, text,</i> Bs. ii. 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raedir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (mod. <strong>ræðari</strong>), [Germ. <i>ruderer</i>], <i>a rower,</i> Fbr. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raedri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a rudder</i> (?); bera má maðr ok öll þilju-föt, ræði skips ok ræðri allt at úsekju, N. G. L. ii. 17, 36.;, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raefill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræfill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a rag, tatter,</i> passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a roof;</i> see rát. <strong>ræfr-viðr,</strong> m. <i>thatch-faggots,</i> Hom. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raegi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rægi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>accusative;</i> r. fall, Skálda 188.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raegja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rægja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>rœgja</strong>) or older vrœgia; [róg; Ulf. <i>wrohjan</i> = κατηγορειν; Hel. <i>wrogjan;</i> A. S. <i>wregjan;</i> O. H. G. <i>rôjan;</i> Germ. <i>rägen;</i> Swed. <i>röje</i>]:—<i>to slander, defame,</i> Grág. ii. 99, 309, Eg. 54, 56, Fms. i. 100, iii. 153, vii. 132, Nj. 166. MS. 655 xvii. 1; rægja menn saman, Jb. 292: part. rægjandi, <i>a defamer,</i> Edda 56; rogendr = rœgendr, pl., Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raegsla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rægsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>slander, calumny,</i> Fms. viii. 295.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a rover;</i> ræingja sveit, Bs. i. 427.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>reikall</strong> (?), m. [Dan. <i>rækel</i>], <i>a rover,</i> used as a kind of oath; hver rækallinn! rækals-:—<strong>Reikall,</strong> as pr. name, Gullþ.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeki-brekka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræki-brekka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f.; in the phrase, bera e-t á rækibrekku, <i>to put out for show, exhibit;</i> berr hann ok þá fram á rækibræku (sic) þat glys er hón hefir sýslað. Thom. 301.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeki-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræki-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [rœkja], <i>earnestly, carefully, sincerely, devotedly;</i> elska r., Greg. 46; biðjask fyrir r., <i>to pray fervently,</i> Orkn. 166; geyma r., K. Á. 104; lifa r., 134; halda r., <i>to observe strictly,</i> 188; hetja söng r., H. E. i. 487; varðveita r., Barl. 148; iðrask r., <i>to repent sincerely;</i> gör r. við dauða menn. Fas. i. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeki-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræki-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. [reka], <i>to be rejected,</i> Fas. iii. 664.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [reka], <i>an unclean thing, refuse;</i> hann kvaðsk aldri etið hafa rækindi, Fms. viii. 107; ef rækindi falla í grýtu þá saurgask hón, Str. 317.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in trú-r., <i>pious, devout,</i> Lex. Poët.; trú-rækni, <i>piety.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð, qs. vrækja, [reka], <i>to reject, refuse;</i> at þér vitið hvat ér skoluð eta, ok hvat ér skoluð rækja, <i>what you shall eat and what reject,</i> Stj. 317; skal hann kenna honum rétta hluti en r. hann eigi, Greg. 27; r. syndir, <i>forsaking the sins,</i> 23; hann fyrirleit ok rækti fórnir hans, 656 A. i. 4; þann ilm skal hverr Kristinn maðr r. er heiðnir menn göra fyrir skurð-goðum, Hom. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. [reka], <i>rejected, outcast,</i> Grág. ii. 167; brennu-vargar eru rækastir görvir bæði í Guðs lögum ok manna, Sturl. iii. 261; varg-rækr ok rekinn (i. e. vargr rækr ok rekinn), Ísl. ii. 381; hversu þetta verk var rækt (<i>abhorred</i>) fyrir Guði ok góðum mönnum, Fms. xi. 280 (Guð-rækr, q. v.); at sú fúl synd verði þeim mun rækari, H. E. i. 510; rækt kvikendi, <i>an unclean beast,</i> Stj. 317; ræk eru hræ þeirra, 316.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeksni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræksni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., prob. qs. vræksni, [from ríða = <i>to knit?</i>]:—<i>a mesh;</i> skulu vér leysa ræksna (rexna Cod.) tortrygðar hans, 623. 26; konu svá nakta at aldrei beið á hana ríðanda ræksn (better rærksna), Sd. 188; hann reið á ræxna (acc. pl.) svá sem net eru síðan, Edda i. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>rœkð,</strong> f. <i>love, affection;</i> görði hann þat til skapraunar við hana en eigi fyrir ræktar sakir, Sd. 184; at hrinda ór mínu hjarta þessa rækt, en því heitari brennr ást í mér, Str.; goðin hafa lengi haft rækð mikla á ættmönnum sínum, Ó. H. 87; þá skal hann upp láta göra kirkju … en ef hann hefir eigi kost eða vill eigi rægt (sic) hafa á, N.G.L, i. 387; ok menn vilja enga rækt á leggja, ii. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raekta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rækta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>rœkta</strong>), ð, [Dan. <i>rögte], to take care of, regard;</i> rækta réttindi, Stj. 162, Karl. 137; at r. sínar kirkjur eða til þeirra ganga, N. G. L. iii. 290; var hans hár klippt ok ræktað, <i>hair cut and trimmed,</i> Stj. 202; hversu dyggiliga síra Egill hafði ræktað (<i>performed</i>) hans eyrendi, Bs. i. 911.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raektar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræktar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>reckless, unmindful,</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raektar-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræktar-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>recklessness, impiety, negligence,</i> Sks. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raektar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræktar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a watcbful man,</i> N. G. L. i. 455, Barl. 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raektar-thokki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræktar-þokki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>devotedness,</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raelast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rælast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dep., in svá mælir Heilagr Andi fyrir munn Davíð konungs, hégómliga ‘ræliz’ margr maðrinn, Post. (Unger) 425, should, we believe, be ‘ræsiz,’ i. e. hræsiz, <i>to vaunt, puff oneself up,</i> see Ps. xxxix. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raelni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rælni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>sport, play;</i> göra e-t í r., <i>unintentionally,</i> Safn i. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raema"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a ribbon,</i> Bjarn., = reim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raema-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, (i. e. <strong>rœma</strong>), [rómr], = róma, Al. 108, Ld. 172, 196; e-t ræmisk á hendr e-m, <i>is rumoured,</i> Sturl. ii. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, and mod. t, [rán], <i>to rob, plunder,</i> with acc. of the person and dat. of the thing, Eg. 81, 85, Orkn. 94, Fms. i. 28, 151. Nj. 53, Ld. 102, K. Á. 50, Fas. ii. 521, and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raengjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rængjar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the inhabitants of the island Rugen</i> (<strong>Ræ</strong>), Knytl. S.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeningi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræningi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [rán], <i>a robber,</i> Eg. 736, Sd. 158, Ölk. 35, Orkn. 92, Fas. iii. 520.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raepa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, <i>to suffer from diarrhoea.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raesa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [rás], <i>to make flow;</i> ræsa; ár, Ht.; sá flytr er ræsir, id.:—metaph., ræsa e-t á e-n, <i>to bring it home to one, trace to one;</i> ek mun þetta ekki ræsa á hendr yðr, <i>I will not charge it on you,</i> Fms. xi. 54; ér ræsit (hræsit Cod.) á hendr oss mikla synd, 656 C. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raesi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a gutter.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raesi-brekka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræsi-brekka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = rækibrekka; bera e-ð á ræsibrekku, <i>to put out for show,</i> esp. in a bad sense, the faults of others or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raesir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræsir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>ræswa</i>], poët. <i>a chief, captain, king,</i> Edda (Gl.), Hkv. Hjörv. 18, Skv. 2. 18, Edda 104. <strong>ræsi-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a worthy man,</i> Lv. 108.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeskingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræskingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a slight cough,</i> Fél. x.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raeskja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræskja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [= rumska], <i>to clear the throat</i> by coughing.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raesta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ræsta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [rás], <i>to clear, clean out;</i> ræsta styfldan læk, <i>to clear out the brook which had been ‘stifled’</i> or <i>dammed up,</i> Dropl. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/raetask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rætask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, qs. <strong>rœtask,</strong> dep. [rót], <i>to take root, strike root,</i> Hom. 68, Skálda 169, Fms. x. 236.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rod-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. raðar, pl. raðar, Höfuðl.; later raðir; [cp. Ulf. <i>raþio</i> = ἀριθμός, <i>garaþjan</i> = ἀριθμειν; Dan. <i>rad</i>; provinc. Norse <i>rad</i>; Lat. <i>ratio</i>]:—<i>a row, series;</i> báðar raðir, of numbers, MS. 544. 6; svú var skipat mönnum á þinginu, at raðir vóru settar í kring, Fas. iii. 292; geirvangs raðar, <i>ranks of shields</i>, Höfuðl.: freq. in mod. usage, húsa-röð <i>a row of houses;</i> bæja-röð; ganga á röðina, <i>to go down the row, from one to the next in turn.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rödd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. raddar, dat. röddu and rödd, pl. raddir; acc. roddo, as if from <strong>radda,</strong> Mork. 128; [Ulf. <i>razda</i> = λαλία and γλωσσα; O. H. G. <i>rarta;</i> A. S. <i>reord;</i> the Norse is an assimilated form; r<i>öd</i>d and kv<i>öd</i>dusk are made to rhyme in Hkr. i, in a verse of the 10th century]:—<i>the voice</i>; raddir ok orð, Stj. 67; hljóð þat er rödd heitir … en annat er eigi er rödd, … rödd er hljóð, Skálda 174; hverrar raddar, Sks. 635; þeir mæltu einni röddu, 656 A. ii. 5; manns rödd, <i>the human voice,</i> 655 xxii. B. 2; með skjálfandi röddu, Fms. viii. 8; kalla kaldri röddu, Akv. 2; kalla hárri röddu, Matth. xxvii. 46, Luke xxiii. 46; stilla röddu, Vkv. 15; ein rödd úr skýinu sagði, Matth. xvii. 5; rödd hrópanda í eyðimörku, John i. 23; röddin niðr af himni, Matth. iii. 17; engla raddir, <i>angels’ voices</i>;—with the notion of <i>music,</i> Skálda; af bar söngr hans ok rödd af öðrum mönnum, Bs. i. 127; fögr rödd, sætlig hljóð raddanna, 240:—reina rödd, Hkv. Hjörv.; dýrs rödd, Barl. 56; fugls rödd, Fms. vi. 445.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. in the latter part of pr. names, [Goth. and old Scandin. <i>-rid</i>, in <i>Wodu-rid</i>], Guð-röðr, Sig-röðr (whence by metathesis Sigurðr), Hún-röðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. röðli, poët.:—<i>a halo, glory;</i> verðr hann kórónaðr með gulligum röðli, Sks. 39; skínandi röðull, 41:—<i>the sun,</i> Lex. Poët. passim: as also the compd álf-röðull:—röðlar, pl. = <i>the saints;</i> lesi bjartar þeir bækr ok röðla, Merl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rof-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>amber,</i> Edda i. 408; see raf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rögg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in the popular phrase, sýna rögg af sér, <i>to exert oneself, work hard;</i> it is a corruption from rök in röksamr, sounded röggsamr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rogg-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rögg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. röggvar, pl. röggvar; [Engl. <i>rug;</i> Swed. <i>ragg, rugg</i> = <i>coarse hair, goat’s hair]:—a tuft, shagginess,</i> of the fur of a cloak; á þá mynd sem loðkápa þ;á er önnur rögg fellr ofan fyrir aðra, en þessar röggvar vóru af skeljum, Mag. 63; varar-feldr, þrettán röggvar um þveran feld, <i>thirteen strips across the cloak,</i> Grág. i. 500; sáttu eigi at feldar-röggvarnar hrærðusk er hann hló, Lv. 55; er ýmist kallat á feldinum röggvar eða lagðr, Krók. 64. The great number of strips to a cloak may refer to the ancient Teutonic custom of having their cloaks furred with patches and stripes of various skins; eligunt feras et detracta velamina spargunt maculis pellibusque belluarum, Tacit. <strong>röggvar-feldr,</strong> m. [provinc. Norse <i>rugge-feld</i>], <i>a tufted cloak,</i> Grett. 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roggvadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röggvaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>furred, tufted,</i> of a cloak, Sks. 228, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rogn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the gods</i> = <i>regin,</i> q. v.; ramaukin rögn, Vellekla; rögn ok Óðin, Hallfr.; Hróptr rögna, Hm,; rögna kind, Hdl.: and in compds, rögna-konr, <i>the kinsman of the gods,</i> Vellekla; ragna-sjöt, <i>the seat of the gods,</i> i. e. <i>heaven;</i> ragna-rök, <i>the world’s doom, spell of the gods,</i> see below.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rognir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rögnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., and <strong>Rögnuðr,</strong> a name of the chief deity = <i>Odin,</i> Lex. Poët., Edda (Gl.); reið Rögnis, <i>the wain of R.,</i> of the constellation <i>ursa major</i> (?), also called <i>the wain of Odin,</i> Sdm 15:—land-r. = <i>a king,</i> poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rok-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rök
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [O. H. G. <i>rahha</i> = <i>sentence, judgment;</i> the word is prob. akin to rakna, rak-, rekja, réttr]:—<i>a reason, ground, origin;</i> segja nokkur rök frá Dróttins-degi, Leiðarv. 5; nú skal tína nokkut um rök tiðanna, 625. 164; af þessum rökum hófsk sjá hátíð, Hom. 132; enn eru regulares, er upp hefjask af enum sömum rökum, Rb. 124; ek skal víss verða af hverjum rökum úrar-horn er upp runnit, Fas. iii. 633; nú skal segja af hverjum rökum heiðnir menn héldu Jól sín, Fb. i. 564, Hom. (St.); nú eru þessi rök til, hví Guð vildi, Mar.; Dróttinn sýndi þeim flest rök sinnar dýrðar á þessum degi, Hom. (St.); fvrra dag sögðum vér nakkvat frá tvennum rökum hátíðar þeirrar, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rok-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rök-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>on good authority,</i> Rb. 84; þessi saga er svá er til komin r., <i>on so good authority, so trustworthy,</i> Fms. viii. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rok-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rök-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>reasonable, just, true;</i> röksamlig ritning, Stj. 1; röksamleg bók, <i>a true, learned book,</i> 655 xxii. A. 2; röksamlig skilning, <i>a true understanding,</i> Mar.; röksamlig refsing, <i>a just punishment,</i> Fb. i. 409; r. í stjórn, <i>just in government,</i> Bs. ii. 3: freq. in mod. usage in the sense of <i>conclusive,</i> of an argument, <i>authoritative,</i> of a person.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rok-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rök-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>energetic, one who makes his authority felt;</i> þegar Jón biskup var seztr at stóli, var hann þegar röksamr ok einbeittr í kirkjustjórninni, Ný Fél. vii. (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rok-semd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rök-semd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>reason, authority;</i> hann skynjaði brátt hvílíkrar röksemdar Brandr ábóti var, Bs. i. 681; fyrirbjóða af páfalegu valdi ok röksemd, K. Á. 228: móti röksemd ritninganna, <i>against the authority of Scripture,</i> 230; meiri er röksemd þessarar ritningar, en allr glöggleikr mannlegs skilnings, Stj. 12; hin fyrsta er drottnunar r., … annat er upphafsins r.,20; bióðum vér með valdi ok r. þessa þings, H. E. 469; á mannligar bóklistir ok Guðligar röksemdir, <i>theological learning,</i> 585.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rok-stolar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rök-stólar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>a judgment-seat,</i> Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rokkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rökkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. rak, an obsolete strong verb; [Engl. <i>reach;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>rökkja;</i> provinc. Swed. <i>räkkja;</i> Dan. <i>række</i>]:—<i>to suffice,</i> D. N. iv. 457, 564; meðan eigi rak lausa penninga til, i. 723. In mod. usage Icel. say, það hrökkr ekki til, confounding this word with hrökkva, which seems to be a different word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rokkr-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rökkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = rokkr, <i>a jerkin,</i> Thom. 457.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rokn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rökn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. pl. <i>beasts of burthen,</i> as also <i>steeds;</i> rökn bitluð, Hkv. i. 50; kjalar rökn, rasta rökn, <i>the keel-steeds, sea-steeds,</i> i. e. <i>ships,</i> Edda (Ht.), Fms. i. (in a verse); borð-rökn, haf-r., sund-r., = <i>ships,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rokr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rökr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., sounded <strong>rökkr</strong> (reykkr, Fms. iv. 70) with a double <i>k;</i> rokkr, Fb. i. 538; røckr, Ó. H. 28; in Edda the Ób. gives <i>kk,</i> the Kb. <i>k</i>, which is the better form, see Edda i. 186, foot-note 3: see also rökvit:—<i>the twilight;</i> rökr rökra, Hdl. 1; en við rökkr kom þar Þorfinnr Önundarson, Sturl. i. 156; um rökkr (røckr Cod.) eða um nætr, Ó. H. 28; þau tóku fæðslu bæði saman við rökr, Greg. 65: seldom of the morning twilight, as rennr dagr rökkrið þrýtr, Úlf. 9. 83: the twilight is in Icel. the time set apart for song and story-telling, as in the ditty, Árni Böðvarsson til sanns sýngr ljóð í rökrum | bezta skáld um bygðir lands, búandi á Ökrum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rokva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rökva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>rökkva,</strong> að, [Ulf. <i>riquizjan</i> = σκοτίζεσθαι]:—<i>to grow dark, darken;</i> eigi verðr þat allt at regni sem rökkr í lopti, Ísl. ii. 481 (out of a lost verse in Heiðarv. S.); rökr at regni miklu, <i>it darkens for rain,</i> Ó. H. (in a verse of A. D. 1030); ok nú rökr (rekr Kd.) at élinn annat sinn, Fms. xi. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rokvid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rökvið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [rökr; Ulf. <i>riquiz</i> = σκότος], <i>twilight,</i> but only used as a participle in the phrase það er rökvið; in other phrases rökkr is used; the forms also vary, rekvið, rökvið is the oldest, whence rökkið and mod. rökkvað; er rekvið var, Hkv. Hjörv. 35 (Cod. requiþ); þá var half-rokkit, Grett. 150 new Ed. in Cod. Upsal., but rökvað (l. c.) in the Edit. 1853; þá er hálf-rökkvat var, 79, but rökit, Cod. Upsal. l. c.; hvert kveld er hálf-rökkvat var, 141; um kveldit er rökkvat var, 183, but rokkit, Cod. Upsal. l. c.; þá var rökvið er þeir gengu ór kirkju, Sturl. ii. 224; föstu-kveldit var rökkvit nokkut, iii. 154; er hálf-rökvit var, Al. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rolta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rölta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (<strong>rölt,</strong> n.), [Dan. <i>vralte</i>], <i>to stray about restlessly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rond"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rönd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. röndn, pl. randir and rendr, Rm., Bs. i. 42; [Germ. and Scot. <i>rand</i>]:—<i>a rim, border,</i> Skíða R. 103; á fornum skjöldum var títt at skrífa rönd þá er baugr var kallaðr, ok er við þann baug skildir kenndir, Edda 87; skjaldar rönd, Vkv. 31; rauðum skildi rönd var ór gulli, Hkv. 1. 33; bíta í skjaldar rendr, Bs. i. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rondottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röndóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>striped,</i> 671. 16, Al. 168, N. G. L. iii. 262.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rong"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. rangar, pl. rengr, qs. vröng; [thus called from the curved form; from rangr, q. v.]:—<i>a rib in a ship;</i> nú ef brestr ór byrði eðr borði eðr brotnar röng, N. G. L. ii. 81 (Jb. 147); ristin röng, Fms. vi. (in a verse); bifask rengr í röstum, vii. 49, freq. in mod. usage: poët. ranga-jór, -hjörtr, <i>the rib-steed, rib-stag,</i> i. e. <i>a ship.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosk-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rösk-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>briskness, deftness,</i> Fms. vi. 35, Sturl. ii. 217, Orkn. 344 old Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosk-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rösk-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>deftly, bravely;</i> er svá r. vann at, Nj. 270; r. segir þú, Grett. 155; berjask r., Hkr. i. 342; biskupi fór svá r., Bs. i. 772.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosk-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rösk-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>deft, brisk.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosk-mannliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rösk-mannliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>bravely,</i> Grett. 109.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roskott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röskótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ivar Aasen <i>raaskje</i> = <i>sleet, wet</i>]:<i>—wet, rough;</i> þeir fengu hvasst veðr ok höfðu röskött (raskótt) fyrir stálinu, Fms. viii. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., with a <i>v</i> before a vowel, röskvan, röskvar, röskvir, röskva; compar. röskvari, röskvastr; prop. vraskr, yet in the Am. rhyming with <i>r,</i> röskr ræða, 51, 56, 88: [akin to Ulf. <i>wrisqan;</i> Dan. <i>rask</i>; Germ. <i>rasch;</i> Engl. <i>rash</i> (with change of sense)]:—prop. <i>ripe, mature,</i> but only used metaph. <i>vigorous, doughty, brave.</i> Am. 51, 56, 88; röskr maðr, <i>a valiant man,</i> Nj. 106; röskr maðr ok einarðr, 223; hann var röskvastr maðr með Flosa einnhverr, 205; mikill skaði er þat um svá röskvan mann, Grett. 155; hann þótti því röskvari sem meirr leið á æfi hans, Fms. vi. 218; mannvali því er röskvast var innan lands, Fas. iii. 292; verða eigi röskvari menn en þessir at minni raun, Bs. i. 581; hyggr ek at fáar konur muni finnask jafn-röskvar, Fms. xi. 229; svá röskr at viti, <i>so ripe in understanding,</i> Grág. ii. 68.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roskva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röskva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., rhymed Vröskva, Þd., the name of the maiden follower of Thor; she is a personification of the ripe fields of harvest.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roskvask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röskvask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to grow up, ripen;</i> þar til er sjálf vínberin röskuðusk, Stj. 200; sýndisk mér vísirinn vaxa smám þeim ok vínberin röskvask, Stj.; ef sá randviðr röskvask næði, Stor.; see roskna.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/roskvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röskvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>quickness,</i> Al. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rost"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          röst
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f., gen. rastar, pl. rastir, qs. vröst (?); [cp. reistr, rist; Engl. <i>race;</i> Norm. Fr. <i>raz</i>]:—<i>a current, stream in the sea,</i> such as the Pentland Firth; nú ef maðr hittir hval á röstum út, Gþl. 464; sigldu þeir í röst norðr fyrir Straumneskinum, … féll um sjórinn ok því næst vellti … hann lagðisk út í röstina, Fms. ix. 320; ok er þeir sigldu yfir Petlands-fjörð, var uppi röst mikil í firðinum, x. 145; vestr í röstum, Orkn. 154 (in a verse): in local names, Látra-röst in western Iceland. <strong>rasta-fullr,</strong> adj. <i>full of currents,</i> Sks. 223.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rösuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>one who emits;</i> reyks r., poët. <i>‘reek-vomiter,’</i> i. e. <i>fire,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rosull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rösull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [rasa], <i>apt to stumble,</i> of a horse.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/rotudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          rötuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [rata], a <i>hitter, finder,</i> Bragi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saddr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saddr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part., older form <strong>saðr,</strong> Hým. 1, which answers to the Goth. and Lat., [Ulf. <i>saþs,</i> Luke vi. 25, xv. 16; O. H. G. <i>sat;</i> Lat. <i>satur;</i> see seðja]:—<i>sated, having got one’s fill,</i> Hým. 1; vera s. á e-u, Ld. 98; s. e-s, Hbl. 3; s. lífdaga, <i>full of days,</i> Bible; hálf-s., <i>half sated.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sadning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saðning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>satiety, fill,</i> Stj. 157, 164, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sooth;</i> see sannr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/safali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          safali
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., <strong>safal,</strong> n., Flor. 5, 7, 10, D. N.; [for. word]:—<i>a sable,</i> the animal, and hence <i>the fur,</i> Eg. 57, 64, 71, Ó. H. 134, Fb. i. 545; safala-skinn, <i>sable-fur,</i> Þórð. 61.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/safi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          safi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Engl. <i>sap;</i> Germ. <i>saft</i>], <i>the sap</i> of trees (the juice of berries is called lögr, q. v.); börkr af viði ok safi, Fms. viii. 32; þeir átu safa ok sugu birki-við, 33; ber ok safa, Fas. iii. 208, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/safn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          safn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a collection,</i> Vm. 6, 15, passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/safna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          safna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, see samna.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>sawdust:</i>—<i>sawing,</i> keppa sag, Skíða R.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sag-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sag-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a saw, saying, N. G. L. i. 368.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to saw, cut with a saw,</i> Barl. 166, Fms. vii. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saga-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. sögu, pl. sögur; gen. pl. sagna is rare; and in compds the gen. sing. sögu- is preferred, thus sögu-bók, sögu-fróðr, where sögu-is used in a collective sense; when gen. sagna- is used it is often to be regarded as borrowed from sögn, as in sagna-fróðr, sagna-meistari; sagna from saga, however, occurs in dæmi-sagna, Stj. 560; Orkneyinga-sagna, Ó. H. 90, l. 3 from the bottom: [from segja; cp. Engl. <i>saw;</i> Germ. <i>sage.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sagands-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sagands-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = sagorð, D. N. ii. 119.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. moistness, dampness, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sagla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sagla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, to saw or cut with a blunt instrument: metaph. to haggle.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sagna-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sagna-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. an historian, Sturl. i. 9; Josephus s., Stj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sagna-meistari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sagna-meistari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. an historian, Stj. 245.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sagna-skemtan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sagna-skemtan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., see saga, Sturl. i. 25, Þorf. Karl. ch. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-auki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-auki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a relation of a slain person entitled to an additional portion of weregild, defined in N. G. L. i. 79, 185, and Grág. ii. 183; a son or brother born of a bondwoman, a brother on the mother’s side, a grandfather and grandson are so named, N. G. L. l. c., cp. also Grág. l. c., where the sakauki is opp. to the receiver of the höfuð-baugr. <strong>sakauka-bót,</strong> f. compensation due to a s., N. G. L. i. 187.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-bitinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-bitinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. guilty, Fms. vii. 135, 294, Ld. 226, Ísl. ii. 385, Ó. H. 105, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-baetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-bætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. an additional penalty, fine, damages, Grág. ii. 87, 183, N. G. L. i. 21, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-eyrir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-eyrir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a fine, penalty, Bs. i. 36, Jb. 444: esp. a fine due to the king, the king’s fiscus or privy purse, Fms, iii. 16; konungs s., vii. 300: = sakgildr eyrir, en áðr hafði gengit s. sem í konungs mál, viii. 270. By the ancient law all transgressions of law were punishable with a fine to the king.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-ferli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-ferli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a lawsuit, action, Landn. 259, Ölk. 36, Rétt. 5: = sak-bætr, D. N. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = sakbætr, N. G. L. i. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-gildr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-gildr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. current, as legal tender for a sakeyrir, Grág. ii. 187, N. G. L. i. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-gaefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-gæfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>sak-gæfinn,</strong> Orkn. 308), adj. quarrelsome, offensive, Eb. 290.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-hardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-harðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. severe, exacting, Finnb. 270, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Old Engl. sack-less; Dan. sages-lös; Swed. sack-lös]:—‘sackless,’ innocent, not guilty, esp. as a law term, Nj. 175, Eg. 49, Ó. H. 32, Fms. i. 84, Sól. 6, passim in old and mod. usage; vera saklauss af e-u, Mag. 60: neut. saklaust, without cause or reason, Gþl. 226: mod. það er s., it does no harm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. the being not guilty; in old writers esp. used in phrases, um (fyrir) sakleysi, without due ground, without provocation, Nj. 270; faðir hans sótti Hjalta um saklöysi, Bs. i. 19; at eigi hafi um s. verit, þar sem Gunnarr rauf sætt við þá nafna, Nj. 106; ekki görði Kári þetta um s., hann er í öngum sættum við oss, 270; eigi er s. við þú, Fb. ii. 352; fyrir s., Fms. i. 302; Ólafr var eigi í s. við Sýja, O. H. L. 12; sumir kalla at eigi sé s. í, þótt …, Ld. 64.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. a charge, lawsuit; hefja s. við e-n, 677. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-metinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-metinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. = sakgildr, Fms. vii. 300.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-naemt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-næmt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. liable to a charge, blamable, Grág. i. 337, Stj. 498; eigi skal s. þó at menn blóti á laun, Fms. ii. 242; eiga s. við e-n, Ísl. ii. 385.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. consultation in a lawsuit, Grág. i. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-rada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-ráða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "réð, to tender advice in a suit, Grág. i. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-runar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-rúnar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. Runes causing strife, Hkv. 2. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-soknir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-sóknir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. an action, lawsuit, Fær. 257, Sturl. i. 134, Gullþ. 25, Fms. vii. 142.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-saell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-sæll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. lucky in lawsuits, Bjarn. 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-taka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-taka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tók, to convict, Lv. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-tal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-tal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>sök-tal,</strong> N. G. L. i. 184, Fb. i. 562), n. the law as to the penalties (sakeyrir) due to the king; hann setti lög … görði s. ok skipadi bótum, Hkr. i. 72.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-tala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-tala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. the tale of fines, = saktal, Grág. ii. 173.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-varr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-varr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. inoffensive, shunning strife, Bjarn. 51; thus written, and not sáttvarr (corrupt reading for sacvarr) as in the Edition.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-vernd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-vernd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = sakvörn, Thom. 452.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sak-vorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sak-vörn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>sök-vörn,</strong> Nj. 232), f. a defence; þeim manni er handselda s. hefir fyrir hann, Nj. l. c.: an excuse, exculpation, = afsakan, 655 xxvii. 2, Al. 75, Sks. 542.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [sök; Ulf. sakan = μάχεσθαι, ἐπιτιμαν, ga-sakan = ἐλέγχειν, A. S. sacan; cp. sókn, sækja, sekr]:—prop. ‘to fight,’ which remains in Hom. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saka-baetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saka-bætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. = sakbætr, Fs. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saka-dolgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saka-dólgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = sökudólgr, Fs. 63, Fbr. 102 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saka-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saka-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>guilty,</i> Fms. viii. 326, Sks. 341.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saka-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saka-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘sackless,’ guiltless,</i> = saklauss (q. v.), Sks. 337; þat vilda ek at þú tækir sættir ok sjálfdæmi sakalaust (<i>dropping the prosecution</i>?), Lv. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saka-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          saka-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man qualified as an attorney;</i> vænn maðr, görr at sér ok s. mikill, <i>a great litigant,</i> Ld. 124: <i>a man under charge,</i> Lat. <i>reus</i>, Bs. i. 727: <i>a guilty man, criminal,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>saka-,</strong> for these compds see sök.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-adili"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-aðili
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the chief party in a suit,</i> Grág. i. 144, 355, ii. 405, Nj. 239; see aðili (p. 3, col. 2).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-aberi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-áberi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a plaintiff, accuser,</i> Sks. 644, Gþl. 22,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-eyrir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-eyrir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = sakeyrir (q. v.), Fms. vii. 300, Gþl. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-ferli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-ferli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. = sakferli, q. v.; kæra mál ok s., Stj. 164.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-gipt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-gipt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘charge-giving,’ charge,</i> Fms. vi. 163, vii. 293, K. Á. 174, Nj. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-spell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-spell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘suit-spoil,’ mispleading, by which a suit may be spoiled</i> or <i>lost</i>, Grág. i. 40, Nj. 235.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an offence, transgression;</i> hann kvaðsk vilja góðu við hann skipta ok upp gefa sakar-staðinn, Finnb. 346; Áskéll görði Mýlaugi við jafn-mikinn ok tólf aura silfrs fyrir sakar-staði (where sakastaðr is almost identical with lögmáls-staðr); féllu hálfar bætr niðr fyrir sakastaði, þá er hann þótti á eiga, Nj. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-taka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-taka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the taking up a suit.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-vandraedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sakar-vandræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>litigation,</i> Edda 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sakar-vorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
