          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>bran;</i> hleifr þrunginn sáðum, <i>a bran-loaf,</i> the diet of bondmen, Rm. 4; blanda sáðum við brauð, Stj. 263; verða mönnum jamndýrar sáðar eða ok dýrri en hreint korn, Sks. 323 B; hey ok sáðir, Stj. 136; hann gaf þeim (the camels) hey ok sáðir, id.; sundrlyndis sáðir, 192: the old writers distinguish between the neut. sáð and the fem. sáðir; the neut. sing. sáðin (<i>bran</i>), Fél. ii. 145, l. 23 sqq., is therefore wrongly used for sáðir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sadugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sáðugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>full of bran;</i> brauðit var ílla bakat, blautt ok sáðugt, Art. 110.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saga-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sága
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to saga and segja?], one of the goddesses, see Gm. 7; often used in circumlocutions of a woman, silki-sága, öl-sága, etc., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sal-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a skin bag,</i> carried behind the saddle; skinn-sál, selskinns-sál.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sal-fastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sál-fastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘soul-fast,’ firm of soul,</i> Gísl. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sala-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sála
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., also later form <strong>sál,</strong> f., gen. sálar, which form prevails in mod. usage, but the old writers prefer the weak form, thus sála, Hom. 31, 89; gen. sing. sálu, K. Á. 76; dat. sálu, passim (e. g. Hallfred, l. c.); acc. sáluna, Fms. viii. 252. v. l.; pl. sálur, Stj. 243, Hom. 30, MS. 671. 5, Sks. 99 C; gen. pl. sálna, H. E. i. 499, passim. The word is certainly Teutonic, but hardly Scandinavian, and was probably adopted from the Saxon with the introduction of Christianity; it is therefore only used in a religious and ecclesiastical sense: it first occurs in Hallfred (ef sálu minni vissak borgit); it never occurs in heathen poems, for the sálfastr, in Gísl. 120 (where, however, it is put in the mouth of a ‘prime-signed’ man) is, like other verses in that Saga, of later composition (12th century): [Ulf. <i>saiwala</i> = ψυχή; A. S. <i>sawl</i> and <i>sawle</i> Engl. <i>soul</i>; Hel. <i>seola</i>; O. H. G. <i>sala</i>, etc.]:—<i>the soul</i>; sálin, líkamr ok sála, Hom. 89; allra þeirra sálir, Gþl. 69, passim in old and mod. usage, N. T., Pass., Vídal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. <i>to depart,</i> Stj. 165, Fms.iii. 167; sálað hold, Pass. 49. 17: passim in mod. usage, in a religious sense, whereas deyja is the common word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sáld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>sold</i>], <i>a sieve;</i> þrjá hleifa er aldregi höfðu í sáld komit, Flóv. 24; rúmborat sáld, <i>a coarse sieve,</i> Fms. viii. 243:—of a measure, Gþl. 524; sáld korns, Vm. 30; sálds sæði, D. I. i. 471; þriggja sálda öl, 31, Fms. ii. 16; sáld malts, N. G. L. i. 5; sex menn sé um sáld, Grág. ii. 402: as a measure of a field, sex sálda sáð, N. G. L. i. 6; naut skal hafa á sálds sáði hverju, 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sift;</i> s. e-u, <i>to let drop as out of a sieve.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, with dat. <i>to kill, put to death.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sáligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Germ. <i>selig;</i> A. S. <i>sælig</i> = <i>blessed;</i> whence Old Engl. <i>seely</i>; mod. Engl. <i>silly</i>]:—<i>poor,</i> mostly in a good sense, but also in a bad = <i>wretched,</i> but only in a religious or eccl. style, Stj. 152, 428, Bs. ii. 18, Fb. i. 514.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salma-bok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálma-bók
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a psalm-book, hymn-book.</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salma-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálma-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a psalm-tune.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salma-skald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálma-skáld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a psalmist, hymn-writer,</i> Fms. viii. 239, x. 304.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salma-songr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálma-söngr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>psalm</i> or <i>hymn-singing, psalmody,</i> Sks. 600.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(psálmr), [Gr. ψαλμός], <i>a psalm,</i> Stj., Bs., passim, not only of the Psalms, but also generally <i>a hymn;</i> Passíu-sálmar, Hugvekju-sálmar, Kveld-sálmr, Morgun-sálmr, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/salpti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sálpti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a firth in Norway, Grett., Munch’s Norg. Beskr.; whence <strong>Sálpt-verjar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the men from S.,</i> Fms. ix. 471.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sam-land"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
