              "__html": "n. <i>Samogitia</i> or <i>Semgallen,</i> in Russia, Fms. xi. 322 (not Smáland), 324, 414.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sam-leitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sám-leitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>swarthy, blackish;</i> þat sortnar ok verðr sámleitt, Barl. 166; svartr ok s. af sumars-hita ok bruna, 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/samr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sámr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [the word is prob. from the Finn, <i>saomi</i>], <i>swarthy, blackish,</i> from the hue of the Finnish tribes; svartar ok sámar í sólviðri, Gsp.; en sáma Svívör, of an ogress, Edda (in a verse):—the name of a dog, Nj.:—the name of a giant, Edda (Gl.), Fas. passim:—a nickname, Fms. ix. 372:—a pr. name, Landn., Hrafn.; and Sæmingr in Yngl. S. ch. 9: the very name is a sign of intermarriage between the Finns and Northmen, see Prof. Munch’s Det Norske Folk’s Historie.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sapa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sápa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Lat. <i>sēbum</i>], <i>soap,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= sá, demonstr. pron., is of frequent occurrence on Runic stones, e. g. sar eigi flo, <i>he flew not;</i> sár vann Nurviag at kristnu, <i>he won Norway to Christianity;</i> this ‘sár’ is simply a nominative case formed like öngr, margr, from einngi, manngi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m., gen. sás, acc. sá, pl. sáir, and so in mod. usage, but saar (i. e. sár), N. G. L. iii. 15, l. 6; [Swed. så]:—<i>a large cask;</i> þau báru á öxlum sér sá, Edda 7; fjóra sái fulla vatns, Stj. 593; sás-girði, <i>cask-hoops,</i> Grág. ii. 338; sáir kallask stór keröld, Krók.; smá-verplar eðr sár, N. G. L. iii. 15: freq. in mod. usage of large vessels in a dairy, skyr-sár.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar-auki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sár-auki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = sársauki, Js. 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar-beittr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sár-beittr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘sore-biting,’ very keen,</i> Hom. 109, Þiðr. 122, Fas. iii. 353, Grett. 116 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar-baetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sár-bætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>compensation for a wound,</i> Gþl. 149, 190, N. G. L. i. 67, 73.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar-dropi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sár-dropi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>‘wound-drop,’</i> poët. <i>blood,</i> Hkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sar-eggjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
