        >
          sefa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, older form svefa, Fms. ix. 444, [akin to svefn], <i>to soothe, soften;</i> sefa ok svefja, allit., Rm. 41; the act. is rare in old writers, but freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
