          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sepi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a lap of flesh hanging down.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sepill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sepill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fms. vii. 285, ix. 419; prob. from the preceding word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/seppi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          seppi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a dog,</i> a pet term; einn á hón seppa sér, Snót.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/serda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          serða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sarð, an obsolete defective strong verb, part. sorðinn, also stroðinn (formed as if from metathesis), Grág. ii. 147; the word remains in the vulgar streða, used of dogs and beasts: [mid. H. G. <i>serte</i>]:—<i>stuprare,</i> with the notion of Sodomitic practices; ef maðr kallar mann sorðinn, id.; viltú serða hann, Fas. ii. 337; sarð hann yðr þá eigi Agðinn, Fms. vi. 360; in Nj. 15 it is not used in a proper sense: pass., Fb. iii. 427.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/serkir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          serkir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. [said to be derived from Arabic <i>sharkeyn</i> = <i>Easterlings</i>], <i>the Saracens, the people of</i> <strong>Serk-land;</strong> used of northern Africa, southern Spain, Fms. vi, vii, ix, Orkn., also in translations of ancient Lat. writers, of the Assyrians, Babylonians, Stj., Al. passim: Serkja-konungr, Serkja-ríki, <i>the king, kingdom of the S.,</i> Al., Stj. <strong>Serk-neskr,</strong> adj. to render the Lat. <i>Punicus,</i> Róm. 324.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/serkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          serkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. serkir, [Old Engl. and Scot. <i>sark;</i> Dan. <i>sœrk</i>], <i>a sark, shirt;</i> þú skalt fara í serk minn, Fms. iii. 190; s. af sauðar-ullu, 180; serkr eða skyrta, Edda; tók ek hamar ór serk mér, Fms. x. 329; síðar slæðr, serk bláfán, Rm. 26; blóðgan hugðak mæki borinn ór serk þínum, Am. 23; serki valrauða, Akv. 4; hón tekr ór serk sér steina-sörvi mikit, Ísl. ii. 343; hann var svá, lítill af hafa mátti í serk sér, Edda; Gísli vermir höndina í serk sér, Gísl. 29; hafa dreng í serk sér, <i>to have a man inside one’s sark, to be a bold true-hearted man,</i> Fms. ix. 381: messu-s., <i>a priest’s cope,</i> Vm. 156: poët. of a shirt of mail, hring-s., járn-s., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sermon"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sermon
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Lat.], <i>a sermon,</i> Ísl. i. 385; sermons-bók, -skrá, Pm. 109, 131; svo eptir sermon þann, Pass. 7. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sess"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sess
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [sitja], <i>a seat</i>; ráða sessa kostum, Gm. 14; sessa ok staði velit mér sumbli at, Ls. 7; snjallr ertú í sessi, 15; í sessi ok sæingu, Gkv. 1. 20; hvat viltú, sveinn, í sess minn? Eg. (in a verse); eiga drykk ok sess við, 95, Fs. 43; hann var hár í sessi, <i>he was high in the seat,</i> Fms. x. 151, Ld. 274, v. l. (cp. Iliad iii. 211, of Odysseus); hvar vísar þú mér til sess? Nj. 129; er hann mundi setja yfir sess hans, 656 C. 25; svá var skipat sessum, Fms. x. 16; var sá sess veglegastr, Fagrsk. 149; vera kominn í vandan sess, <i>in a difficult situation,</i> Bs. i. 141: the saying, opt er lágr sess hægr, <i>a low seat is an easy seat,</i> = Lat. <i>bene vixit qui bene latuit.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sess-megir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sess-megir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>‘bench-mates,’</i> Hm. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sess-meidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sess-meiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the seat-beam,</i> Akv, 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sess-rumnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sess-rúmnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of the palace of Freyja = <i>‘large-seated,’</i> Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sessa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sessa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. sessna, N. G. L. i. 104; <i>a seat</i> in a ship (= rúm), the size of the ship was counted by the ‘seats;’ þat skip er með sessum má telja, N. G. L. i. 39; ok göra eigi skemra en sessum má telja, 99; tvítug-s., <i>a twenty-oared ship,</i> id.; þrettún-s., fimt;ui-s., sextuu-s. (q. v.), id. II. <i>a cushion</i> in a chuïch, Ám. 77. Dipl. iii. 4: in mod. usage, of <i>a pad</i> or <i>cushion on a saddle.</i> <strong>sessu-nautr,</strong> m. <i>a bench-mate.</i> Fms. ii. 147, vi. 241, Ó. H. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sessi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sessi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a bench-mate,</i> Edda 94 (in a verse), 108; sessar eða samsætis-menn, Sks. 366; tali hverr lágt við sinn sessa, 367; sessar manns beri vitni með honum, N. G. L. i. 68:—of <i>oar-mates,</i> bogi skal liggja við þóptu hverja, þann skulu sessar tveir fá ok streng á, Gþl. 100.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., lit. <i>the seat;</i> in ancient dwellings it appears to have meant <i>the aisle</i> or <i>wing</i> that ran along the hall on both sides, divided from the nave or middle hall by posts and a partition (set-stokkar and bríkr); the ‘set’ was the daily <i>sitting-room,</i> and here were the beds; innar gengr hann eptir höllinni, breið vóru set báðum megin … fyrir stokkana, Konr.; þá snúa þau rekkjum sínum ok horfa þá um endilangt setið, Gísl. 106 (endilangt húsit, 22, l. c.); en um kveldit er menn fóru í rekkjur, þá bygðu sitt set hvárir, Sturl. i. 173; þeir Ingimundr hjuggu upp í setið þá er þeir kómu í skálann (during the night when all were in bed), ii. 73; höggvit er til okkar ofan ór setinu, iii. 174; síðan bjuggusk þeir til rekkna ok lögðusk niðr í seti þar við eldinn, Ó. H. 153; var búit um þá í setinu ok lögðusk þar til svefns, id.; ef hundr er bundinn í seti, þá skal hann eigi ná á stokk (i. e. setstokk) fram, at bíta menn er ganga á gólfi, Grág. ii. 119; Grettir sér nú hvar stóðu ullar-kambar í setinu, Grett. 24 new Ed.: the phrases ‘innar af seti’ and ‘útar af seti’ are not quite clear, perh. the former means <i>towards the nave</i> or <i>central hall,</i> the latter <i>towards the aisle</i> or <i>outer chambers;</i> thus, innar frá seti, Sturl. ii. 67; ek hefi búit, góða sæng útan af seti, Dropl. 28; hann hvíldi í lokrekkju innar af seti, Ísl. ii. 262; hinu iðra setinu, Fb. ii. 297; dyrr vóru fram ór skotinu at setum innan-verðum, gékk Egill fram í setið, ok lagði hann niðr í setið, Eg. 397. <strong>seta-skáli,</strong> a, m. <i>a sitting-room,</i> Eb. 274.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-berg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-berg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp, the Cumbrian <i>Saddleback</i>], <i>a seat-formed</i> or <i>saddle-formed rock</i> or <i>crag,</i> Gs. 11, Edda 34 (from the points of Thor’s hammer); sitja setbergs (= á setbergi), Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-geiri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-geiri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘seat-goar,’</i> a piece let into a pair of breeches; í brókum með setgeira í, Ld. 136; hann skar rauf á setgeiranum, Fms. vii. 202. <strong>set-geira-brækr,</strong> f. pl. <i>breeches with goars in the seat,</i> Ld. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = seta skáli, N. G. L. ii. 139, v. l. 6; called <i>sœde-hus</i> in Lister in Norway, Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘seat-cloth,’ carpet;</i> inn til elds ok arins, til þess húss er s. eru í breidd, N. G. L. i. 218; s. ok bekklæði, Js. 78.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-skauti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-skauti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = setgeiri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-stofa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-stofa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = sethús, N. G. L. ii. 139, D. N. passim, see Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/set-stokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          set-stokkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a partition-beam</i> or <i>post</i> in a hall between the set (q. v.) and the centre of the skáli (the wainscotted space between the setstokkar or stafir was called brík, q. v.); ef hann brýtr setstokka ór húsi eða bríkr, N. G. L. i. 39 (Gþl. 345); s. mjök ramligr var fyrir framan setið, ok spyrndi hann þar í, Grett. 114 A; Gizurr lagðisk niðr í skálanum með setstokkunum öðrum megin, Sturl. iii. 189; þá tók Kári einn setstokk loganda í hönd sér, Nj. 202, Vápn. 28 (used instead of a club); Hallsteinn skaut setstokkum fyrir borð í hafi at fornum sið, Landn. 301; þá léði hann þergesti setstokka … þá heimti hann setstokkana … Eiríkr sótti setstokkana á Breiðabólstað, 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/seta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          seta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n, f. <i>a sitting;</i> nú varð setan löng, Fms. vii. 126: <i>a remaining, staying,</i> þótti þeim seta hans þar úvarlig svá nærri Ljótólfi, Sd. 182; þótti þeim seta sín íll ok úfrelsi, Ó. H. 141: hvat merkir seta sjá, <i>what means this sitting still?</i> Fb. ii. 122; nátt-setur, <i>a sitting up at night,</i> Fms. vii. 126.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "set, setti, sett; a causal to sitja, q. v.; [Ulf. <i>satjan, ga-satjan</i>, = τιθέναι, φυτεύειν; Engl. <i>to set;</i> Dan. <i>sætte;</i> Swed. <i>sätta</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = sjatna. <i>to settle, subside, dwindle;</i> hefir enn engi fallit, heldr setna þeir í jörð niðr (of a wall), Finnb. 336; en er setnaði ok hljóð fékksk, Fms. ii. 43; setnaði þá kurrinn, Fb. i. 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>position, site,</i> Al. 89; s. hússins, <i>the plan of a bouse,</i> Fms. v. 338; þoka e-u ór setningu, <i>to dislodge,</i> Rb. 562.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>set purpose, design,</i> Fms. vi. 372; eptir setningi, <i>purposely,</i> Finnb. 340: <i>a rule, rite,</i> Hom. 142; á-setningr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a seat, residence;</i> kaupstaðrinn í Björgyn görðisk brátt mikill, ok auðigra manna setr, Fagrsk. 149 (Fms. vi. 440); sælligt setr, Ls. 43: með engum konungi vil ek heldr setr (sætr Ed.) búa en með þér, Fas. i. 137; Sighvatr hafði nökkut öfundar-samt setr fyrst er hann kom í Eyjafjörð, Sturl. ii. 66, cp. Eb. ch. 65 (begin.); konungs-setr, <i>a king’s residence;</i> at-setr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sett-letr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sett-letr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>black-letter,</i> of type, opp. to Latínu-letr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sett-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sett-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>steady;</i> s. aldr, Al. 114: gramm., settligt nafn = <i>positivus,</i> Skálda 185.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-efni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-efni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>opportunity for resting;</i> eigi er nú s., Boll. 358, Fms. viii. 40, Karl. 181.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a country-seat, manor,</i> Safn i. 270.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-grid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-grið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>an abode;</i> Glúmr bauð honum með sér s., Glúm. 359: <i>rest,</i> sagt hefir þú oss þá sögu er oss mun eigi s. bjóða, Nj. 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a sitting-room,</i> N. G. L. ii. 139 (Jb. 181).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the people of the house,</i> K. Þ. K. 136; skemma er Þorkell var vanr at sofa í ok s. hans, Fbr. 136: in sing., hér vilda ek vera í vetr, en görask eigi setumaðr með öllu, <i>not as a settled inmate,</i> Fas. ii. 346.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-pallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-pallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sitting-floor,</i> Hom. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-prestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-prestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a domestic chaplain,</i> Vm. 66, 136, D. I. i. 266, 270.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/setu-rum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          setu-rúm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a sitting-room,</i> Ísl. ii. 147: <i>a room, space,</i> þeir skulu allir inni vera, ef þeir hafa s., <i>if they can find room,</i> N. G. L. i. 47.",
