          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. siðar, dat. sið, pl. siðir, acc. siðu, mod. siði, [Ulf. <i>sidus</i> = ήθος; Hel. <i>sidu</i>; O. H. G. <i>situ;</i> Germ. <i>sitte</i>; Dan. <i>sæd</i>; Swed. <i>sed</i>]:—<i>custom, habit, manner,</i> Lat. <i>mos,</i> a word of importance and wide use; sjá, kanna annarra manna siðu, Sks. 17; sem þá var víða siðr til, Bs. i. 41; þat mun hér vera siðr, Eg. 110; sæmileikr hennar ok siðir, Str. 21; konungliga siðu, kaupmanna siðu, lærðra manna siðu, … siðu ok athæfi, Sks. 5; lands-siðr, <i>the custom of the land;</i> í fyrnskunni var sá siðr, at …, N. G. L. ii. 416: <i>conversation,</i> falla í sið með mönnum, <i>to live sociably,</i> Þiðr. 149 (sið-blendinn).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sidugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siðugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>well-bred, well-conducted;</i> svá siðugr ok góðháttaðr sem hinn siðugasti spekingr, Bs. i. 38; vel siðugr, Sks. 279; spakr maðr ok s., Fms. xi. 97; ó-siðugr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. sifjar; [Ulf. <i>sibja.</i> Gal. iv. s. Rom. ix. 4; A. S. and Scot. <i>sib</i>; Engl. <i>gos-sip</i> = <i>god-sib;</i> Hel. <i>sibbia;</i> O. H. G. <i>sibba;</i> Germ. <i>sippe</i>]:—<i>affinity.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sif-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sif-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a woman related through affinity,</i> opp. to frændkona; þá er maðr á frændkonu sína eðr sifkonu, Grág. i. 366; frændkonu sína eðr sifkonu at fimta manni, H. E. i. 245; til Ástríðar sifkonu sinnar, Fms. ix. 243.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sif-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sif-skapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>affinity,</i> as opp. to frændsemi, N. G. L. i. 148, 382, H. E. i. 481, MS. 671. 17: varla má þat vel allt saman vera sakir ok sifskapir, N. G. L. i. 187; en ef þau skiljask fyrir þann sifskap, at karlmanns völd hafa til komit, Jb. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a relation by marriage, affinis;</i> sifja silfr, Sdm. 28 (Bugge); at álnum sifja, Ad.; but both passages are dubious; guð-sifi, <i>a god-sib.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, in the compd af-sifja, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifjaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>bound in affinity;</i> Óðni sifjaðr, Hým. 21; sitjaðan sjötum görvöllum, Hdl. 42: in the allit. sifjaðr and sakaðr (q. v.), Gþl. 67, 547; eiga skylt eðr sifjað við e-n, D. N. v. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifjugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifjugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = sitjaðr, Skv. 1. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifjungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifjungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a relation by affinity,</i> Edda (Gl.), Hkv. 2. 32: of <i>a brother-in-law,</i> Akv. 29, cp. also Am. 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a near relation,</i> Edda ii. 496, hence in Úlf. 3. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sift"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sift
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>affinity;</i> see karlsift, kvennsift.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sifuni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sifuni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [cp. Ulf. <i>sipoueis</i> = <i>a disciple</i>], <i>a companion</i> (?) = sifjungr, a απ. λεγ., Þd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [sigr], <i>a victory,</i> Edda (Gl.), Lex. Poëtt, passim, but never in prose: in poët. compds as. <strong>sig-björk,</strong> <i>a weapon;</i> <strong>sig-freyr,</strong> <i>a warrior;</i> <strong>sig-máni,</strong> <i>a shield;</i> <strong>Sig-föðr,</strong> of Odin, Lex. Poët.: cp. the pr. names, <strong>Sigi, Sigarr, Sig-fastr, Sig-björn, Sig-fúss, Sig-hvatr, Sig-mundr, Sig-valdi, Sig-tryggr, Sig-urðr;</strong> of women, <strong>Sig-ný, Sig-ríðr, Sig-vör,</strong> Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sig-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [síga], <i>a rope which is let down;</i> fóru þá sigin ofan í gröfina, en Þoroddr upp, Ó. H. 152, Þjal. S: also of <i>the rope</i> by which a fowler is let down precipices, as described in Bs. ii. 111.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sig-tivar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sig-tívar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the gods of victory,</i> Vsp., Akv., Ls. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sig-toptir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sig-tóptir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the homes of victory,</i> Vsp. 61.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sig-yn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sig-yn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. Sig-ynjar, the name of a goddess, the wife of Loki, Vsp., Edda; hence the female name Signý, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, = sígá; þá sigaði svá at honum (<i>‘it sank over him,’</i> i. e. <i>he fainted away</i>) … ok lá náliga milli heims ok helju, Grett. 85 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., in mod. usage <strong>sigð,</strong> f.; in eastern Icel. (Skaptafells-sýsla) it is still used masc., þat verkfæri kallask fyrir austan mela-sigðr, en af öðrum mela-sigð, en sigðrinn má vera svá beittr … með sigðinum …, sigðinn (acc.), Fél. ii. 140, 141, of the year 1781: [A. S. <i>sicol</i>; Engl. <i>sickle</i>; O. H. G. <i>sihila</i>; Dutch <i>zikkel;</i> Dan. <i>segel</i>]:—<i>a sickle;</i> gref, leá ok sigða (acc. pl. sigðar v. l.), N. G. L. iii. 15; þrir sniðlar, item í nöfrum öxum ok sigdum, D. N. i. 321, Post. 26, Boldt 112: the word is now fem., beitt dauða-sigðin sárbeitt sker sóltögr blómstrin væn, Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [akin to seigr, sigi?], = Lat. <i>callus;</i> hans hörund er svá hart sem sigg villi-galtar, Þiðr. 180, 297; þat var hart sem sigg ok ekki blóð í, Fbr. 77 new Ed., freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigg-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. Siggjar, the name of an island in Norway, Munch.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., <strong>Siggi,</strong> a, m., dimin. from Sigríðr and Sigurðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = segi, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the mast;</i> fyrir framan siglu, Eg. 33; fyrir aptan siglu, þeim megin siglu, Grág. ii. 137; stóð maðr við siglu, Nj. 125, Fms. vi. 359.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigla-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð or d, [segl], <i>to sail</i>; sigla ok róa. Eg. 86, Grág. ii. 130; s. af landi, <i>to stand off the land,</i> Landn. 26; s. at landi, <i>to stand in to land;</i> s. með landi, <i>to sail along shore;</i> s. rétt í vestr, í norðr, Eg. 86, Landn. 25; s. út ór ánni, Þórð. 26; s. í haf, á haf, or til hafs, <i>to stand out to sea,</i> Ld. 32, Nj. 4, Fms. vi. 359; en er þeir höfðu um siglt, <i>sailed by,</i> Fms. v. 305; freisia ef þeir sigli svá um oss fram, Orkn. 402; s. undan, <i>to sail away,</i> id.; s. meira, <i>to sail faster,</i> Ó. H. 182; s. eptir e-m, id.; sigla djarfliga. Fms. vii. 67; s. á skip, <i>to strike against,</i> x. 76: the distance or course in acc., sigla þeir sunnan fyrir Stað tuttugu vikur sævar, xi. 122; þá mun siglt vera tylpt fyrir sunnan Ísland, <i>then the course will be a</i> ‘tylpt’ <i>south of Iceland,</i> Landn. 25; segla menn, at Skopti hafi fyrstr Norðmanna siglt Njörva-sund, <i>that S. is the first Northman that sailed by N.</i>, Fms. vii. 66; s. lítinn byr ok fagran, ii. 182; sigla þeir góða byri, x. 260; sigldi hann inn um Agðanes vá mikinn storm, at …, ix. 314: sigldi hann ór Suðreyjum svá mikla sigling. at …, <i>he sailed so famous a voyage, that…,</i> Landn. 214; þeir sigla norðr um Sognsæ byr góðan ok bjart veðr, Eg. 120; sigli þér sælir! (Gr. εὐπλοειτε), Am. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [A. S. <i>sigele</i>], <i>a necklace,</i> Ls. 20; hroðit s., Skv. 3. 47; sigli-sága, <i>‘necklace-fairy,’ a lady,</i> Korm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sigling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sigling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>sailing;</i> þegar þeir sá s. yðra, Eg. 49; Skalla-grímr var hverjum manni skygnari, hann sá s. þeirra Hávarðs, 120; þá sá menn Knúts konungs siglingina, Ó. H. 170; sjau dægra sigling, <i>seven days’ sail,</i> Landn. 25: <i>a voyage,</i> tóksk þeim siglingin ógreitt, Ld. 56; hafa kaupskip í siglingum, Nj. 3:—in specific Icel. sense, <i>a journey abroad,</i> passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglinga-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglinga-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sea-faring man, seaman,</i> Symb. 15, Grett. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglinga-skip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglinga-skip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n.; gott s., <i>a good sailing ship.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglingar-austr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglingar-austr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the pumping a vessel,</i> Jb. 407.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglu-biti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglu-biti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the step of the mast</i> (?), Fas. ii. 442.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglu-ra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglu-rá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the sail-yard,</i> Fas. iii. 659.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglu-skeid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglu-skeið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the part near the mast, midships.</i> Fms. ii. 323.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglu-toppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglu-toppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the mast-head,</i> Rb. 468.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/siglu-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          siglu-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the mast-tree,</i> Kb. i. 532, Fms. xi. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/signa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          signa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [siga, síga], <i>to glide down;</i> hann hafði band fjrir augum, ok hafði signat nokkut frá augunum, Bret. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/signa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          signa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in pres. signi; pret, signdi, but also signaði; part. signt and signat. This word occurs in one of the oldest heathen poems, and is applied to a northern heathen rite; it is common to all Teut. languages except Gothic; yet as no ‘laut-verschiebung’ has taken place, it may be borrowed from the Latin, and perhaps came in with the earliest missions, cp. the remarks s. v. prim-signing: or sigr and signa may possibly be kindred words? [Hel. <i>seginon;</i> Germ. <i>segnen;</i> Lat. <i>signare</i>]:—<i>to sign, consecrate;</i> signa e-m e-t:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/signan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          signan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a blessing.</i> Mar., Hom. 149; far í Guðs signan., Karl. 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/signet"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          signet
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [for. word], <i>a signet-ring.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/signing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          signing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
