            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sizing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sizing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>sizlingr,</strong> m. = suzungull (q. v.), Sks. 403.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/si"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sí
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., contracted from sin, [Goth. <i>sinteino</i> = πάντοτε, <i>sinteins</i> = ἐπιούσιος, ὁ καθ ἡμέραν; O. H. G. <i>sin-</i> and <i>sina-</i> in several compds, e. g. <i>sin-vluot, the great flood</i> = <i>the Deluge</i> (whence by corruption the mod. Germ. <i>sünd-fluth</i> and Dan. <i>synd-flod</i> = <i>the sin-flood);</i> A. S. <i>sin-</i>; Lat. <i>semper;</i> see Grimm’s Gramm. ii. 554]:—<i>ever;</i> it is, however, used singly only in the phrase, sí ok æ, <i>ever and aye, incessantly,</i> but it is used in several compds as a prefixed particle.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
