        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>covetousness,</i> Post. 640.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sink-gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sínk-gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = síngjarn, Barl. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sinka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sínka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [no doubt derived from sinn = síngjarn], <i>greed, avarice,</i> Sks. 451, 585, 665: <i>stinginess,</i> 440, and so in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sinkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sínkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stingy,</i> so in mod. usage, but in old writers perhaps <i>covetous;</i> s. ok fégjarn, Sks. 701, Fms. vii. 239; þeir vóru menn sínkir, i. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sira"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          síra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. indecl.; though so spelt, it is by old people in Icel. sounded <strong>sera,</strong> commonly, however, and less correctly <strong>séra,</strong> [a Romance word borrowed from the French]:—<i>sirrah</i> (a word now only used contemptuously), <i>sir, master;</i> the word is in Art. S. used as an address to a knight, Síra Ivent, etc.; but this saga is a translation from the French. In Norway and Icel. the word appears at the end of the 13th century (Arna S., Hák. S. Gamla, Ann. after 1260, Laur. S.), and is then used of priests only, as it is in Icel. at the present day a recognised title of a priest, and with the Christian name only, so that a clergyman is never named without this title,—Síra Hallgrímr, Síra Þorkell; thus in the ditty, Síra Ólafr á Söndum, | sálina og vísur kvað; Síra Hallgrímr hagr | á hróðrar smíðið var; hann Síra Jón, etc.; cp. Old Engl. <i>sir,</i> used of priests, with the Christian name only, as <i>Sir Hugh,</i> etc., in Shakespeare.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sirna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sírna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>lethargy.</i> <strong>sírnu-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>sleepy,</i> Björn; hence prob. <strong>sírnir,</strong> m\`. the name of a giant, Edda, Ísl. ii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sizt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sízt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (síz, sítz), <i>since;</i> síz Hákon fór með heiðin goð, Hkm.; síz, Gm. 48; sítz, Am. 52, Stor. 19; sízt Gunnarr lézk, Nj. 142; síz ek tók at erfð, Grág. ii. 204; sítz Haraldr gráfeldr féll, Fms. x. 387; sítz Magnúss féll, 407; sítz hann kom í land, 398; sítsz þeir bræðr höfðu í Noreg sótt, 382; þeir höfðu ekki etið sízt laugar-dag, ix. 406, v. l.; sízt í hanzka-þumlungi hnúkðir þú, Ls. 60; sízt þik geldu, Hkv. 1. 39; sízt vér misstum skipa várra, Fms. viii. 181, v. l.; sítz þeir Magnúss ok Erlingr gáfu honum þat upp, Pref. xxi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja-vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sja-vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = sjóvegr, Bs. ii. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjafni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjafni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to sefi], <i>mind, love, affection,</i> poët., Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjald-gaefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjald-gæfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = sjaldgætr. mod.; það er mikit sjaldgæft, <i>this is very rare.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjald-gaetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
