      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjaldan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjaldan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., compar. sjaldnar, sjaldnast (but sjaldar, Barl. 96, 100); in mod. proncd. skjaldan, with a non-radical <i>k</i>: [A. S. <i>seldan;</i> Engl. <i>seldom;</i> Germ. <i>selten;</i> Dan. <i>sjelden</i>]:—<i>seldom;</i> mjök s., Am. 78; sem sjaldnar kann henda, Fas. i. 158; þá væri hann sjaldar á tali við þik, Barl. 96; miklu sjaldar enn hann vildi, 100; ef prestr syngr þar sjaldnar, K. Þ. K.; sjaldnar verðr sá heim sóttr er fám görir gott, Bs. ii. 98; meira vírðisk þat er sjaldnar verðr = ‘omne ignotum pro mirifico.’ Hom. (St.); það er nýtt sem skjaldan skeðr, a saying (mod.); sem sjaldnast, Hom. (St.); tvá daga í viku it sjaldnasta, <i>at least</i>, Vm. 94; it sjaldnasta á tólf mánudum, <i>at seldomest once a twelvemonth,</i> Bs. i. 168; ó-sjaldan, <i>not seldom</i>, Vsp. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjatna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjatna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, older form setna (q. v.), Finnb. 336, Fms. ii. 43, Fb. i. 56, [setna, sitja, setja]:—<i>to ‘settle,’ sink, dwindle, subside,</i> esp. of food, <i>to be digested</i> just after having been taken; fyllask menn ekki af því vatni, sjatnar þat vel, ok rennr í hörund sem mungát, Sks. 163; láta sér sjatna, of resting after a meal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>sjö,</strong> a cardinal number; [Goth. <i>sibun;</i> A. S. <i>seofon;</i> Engl. <i>seven;</i> O. H. G. <i>sibun;</i> Germ. <i>sieben;</i> Dan. <i>syv;</i> Swed. <i>sju;</i> Lat. <i>septem;</i> Gr. ἑπτά; the Icel. and Scandin. is a contracted form, suppressing the medial labial, cp. Engl. <i>sen</i> in <i>‘sennight,’ Senhouse</i>]:—<i>seven,</i> passim; sjau-vikna-fasta, <i>Lent.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-fald-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-fald-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (<strong>-ligr,</strong> adj., Bret. 54), <i>sevenfold,</i> Stj. 43, 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-faldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-faldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sevenfold,</i> Al. 35, Stj. 416.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-raedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-ræðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = sjautugr, Fms. i. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-sinnum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-sinnum
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>seven times.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-stirni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-stirni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (mod.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-tjan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-tján
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= sautjan (sjotjan, Thom. 477), <i>seventeen:</i> <strong>sjau-tjándi</strong> = sautjandi, <i>the seventeenth,</i> N.G.L i. 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-tugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-tugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>sjö-tugr,</strong> adj. <i>seventy years old,</i> K. Þ. K. 134, Fs. 160. Bs. i. 77, Stj. 554: of measure, <i>measuring seventy</i> fathoms, ells. <strong>sjautug-faldliga,</strong> adv. <i>sevenfyfold,</i> Stj. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-tugti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-tugti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>sjö-tugasti,</strong> <i>the seventieth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjau-vetra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjau-vetra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>seven years old.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjaund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjaund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a period</i> or <i>term of seven, ‘seven-night,’</i> just as fimmt (q. v.) is used of a summons before a court, so is this word in the old law only used in the metaph. sense of <i>a funeral</i> or even <i>a funeral service;</i> nú er maðr dauðr … komi þeir allir þar at sjaund, Gþl. 254, Jb. 146; at sjaund eða þrítugs-morni, N. G. L. i. 14, D. N. passim, see Fritzner; um sjaundar-görð (<i>a funeral banquet</i>) ok skulda-lúkning, N. G. L. i. 51; en þó mun ek því heita þér at þú komir til nokkurrar hvíldar eptir seond þína = <i>after thy death,</i> Fb. ii. 342 (Fbr. 200).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjaundi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjaundi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>the seventh,</i> passim: mod. <strong>sjöundi. 2. Sjaundi, Sjundi,</strong> as a pr. name, freq. in early Dan., see Thork. Dipl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjaundungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjaundungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a seventh part,</i> Rétt 210, MS. 415. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "the pronoun, see sá, sú. This word or form might have been put under a separate head, it is often used in a pointedly demonstr. sense, like þessi; see the references s. v. sá.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. sé, sér, sér, pl. sém, séð, sé, or later, sjám, sjáð, sjá; pret. sá, sátt, sáttu (s<i>át</i>tu rhymes with r<i>ét</i>ti, Fms. vi. in a verse), sá, pl. sám, sáð, sá: pres. subj. sé, sér, and later sjá; pret. sæi: imperat. sé, séðú: part. sénn; neut. séð (sét): a medial form sjámk, sámk: with neg. suff. sér-at, sák-a ek, <i>I saw not;</i> sá-at, <i>saw not</i>; sátt-a-ðu, <i>thou sawest not,</i> Eg. (in a verse): the mod. form is,—pres. sé, sér, sér, sjáum, sjáið, sjá; pret. sá, sást, sá, pl. sáum, sáuð, sáu; pres. subj. sjái, sjáir, sjái: pret. sæi; imperat. sjá, sjáðú; part. seðr, keeping the <i>ð</i> throughout: [Ulf. <i>saiwan</i> = ὁραν; A. S. <i>seon</i>; Engl. <i>see</i>; Germ. <i>sehen;</i> Dan. <i>see</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja-byggvar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjá-byggvar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>sea-dwellers, coast-people,</i> Fms. viii. 404, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja-daudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjá-dauðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = sjódauðr, Fms. iii. 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja-dreginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjá-dreginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘sea-dredged,’ caught,</i> of fish, Bs. ii. 5, 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sja-drif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjá-drif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
