              "__html": "(<strong>-lofaðr</strong>), part. <i>‘self-allowed,’ requiring no special licence,</i> H. E. i. 394.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-lopta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-lopta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>lifted of oneself,</i> Þd. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘self-counsel’ independent judgment;</i> göra e-t at sjálfráði, <i>of one’s own accord,</i> Grett. 162 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-radi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-ráði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of free-will, voluntary;</i> hann hafnaði sjálfráði blótum, Landn. 278: s. dó siðan, Skálda (in a verse referring to Christ).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-raedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-ræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>selv-raadighed</i>], <i>‘self-rule,’ liberty,</i> Sks. 523; s. ok hóglífi, Ó. H. 34: <i>self-will,</i> Sks. 232; at þínu s., <i>as thou likest,</i> Fms. vii. 304; at s. sínu, <i>of one’s own free-will,</i> Grág. i. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-sagdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-sagðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘self-said,’ as a matter of course;</i> sé hann s. ok útsettr af heilagrar kirkju inngöngu, B. K. 108: in mod., hann er s., <i>he is (to come) as a matter of course, self-appointed,</i> or the like: neut., sjálfsagt, <i>of course! no doubt!</i> Germ. <i>freilich.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-sainn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-sáinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-sáðr</strong>), part. <i>self-sown;</i> akrar sjálfsánir, Þorf. Karl. 420, Rb. 318, Fms. xi. 413.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-settr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-settr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘self-appointed,’</i> as a matter of course, Gþl. 177.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-skapa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-skapa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘self-shaped,’ of one’s own -making;</i> sums ertu s., <i>some is of thy own making, thy own fault,</i> Am. 64: in the phrase, <strong>sjálf-skapa-víti,</strong> n. pl., sjálfskapat víti, Ld. 140: <i>any self-caused evil</i> (það eru sjálskapa víti), for which no one is to blame but oneself.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-skeidungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-skeiðungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a clasp-knife.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-skeyttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-skeyttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part., see skeyta; sé jörð sjálfskeytt, N. G. L. i. 236, 250.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-skipan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-skipan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a spontaneous order,</i> Stj. 632.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-skot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-skot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a trap</i> or <i>bow going off of itself;</i> ef maðr leggr s. at birni, þá skal hann lýsa at héraðs-kirkju eðr á þingi hvar liggr, Gþl. 446.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sjalf-stefndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sjálf-stefndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘self-summoned,’ without special summons;</i> sé honum sjálfstefnt, Gþl. 21; sjálfstefnt skal sökum hans, Grág. ii. 407.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
