      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-faera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-færa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Dan. <i>skamfere</i>], <i>to spoil, cut short;</i> skipit er skammfært ef eigi fylgja árarnar, 673. 59; hestana háðuliga útleikna ok skammfærða, Fas. i. 90 (spoiled by cutting off the manes and tails).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shameless, without shame;</i> ætla ek at þú sér s. af þessu, <i>‘tis no shame to thee,</i> Eb. 160; þú góð kona, skammlaus ertú af mér, Bær. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>shamefully,</i> Sks. 503.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-naktr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-naktr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shamefully naked,</i> Sks. 504.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-raun"
          onClick={[Function]}
