          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-raun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., Fms. iv. 264; read skapraun, see Ó. H. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>shamefully,</i> Fs. 134, Al. 30, Sks. 503.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shameful, disgraceful,</i> Fs. 31, Stj. 585, Róm. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-aedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-æði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a short duration;</i> mun þér þetta draga til skammæðar, <i>it will not last thee long,</i> Þórð. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-aeligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-æligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>short-lived, fleeting, brief;</i> s. líf, Fms. i. 225; s. gleði, Greg. 42; girndir skammæligra hluta, 677. 4; hann kvað hann skammæligan (<i>short-lived</i>), Sturl. i. 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamm-aer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamm-ær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (-æ, -ætt), <i>short-lived;</i> s. sigr, Fms. ii. 10 (Fs. 90); skamæ lýti, Mkv. 19; skammætt ríki, <i>short-lived power,</i> opp. to everlasting, 677. 7: Teitr varð skammær, Fms. vii. 40; munum skammæir, Am. 29 (Bugge).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [skömm], <i>to shame, disgrace;</i> hraktr ok skammaðr, Sturl. iii. 11; þeir er vinir hennar höfðu drepit ok skammat, Fs. 85: <i>to scold.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skammar-erindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skammar-erindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shameful errand,</i> Fb. iii. 315.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skammar-vig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skammar-víg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = níðingsvíg, Nj. 253.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>skammr,</strong> skömm, skamt, adj., compar. skemri, superl. skemstr; usually spelt and sounded with <i>mm</i> before a vowel, but <i>m</i> before a consonant, [cp. Engl. <i>scamped,</i> of carpenter’s work when ill-done]:—<i>short;</i> var fótleggrinn skamr, Fms. viii. 447, skammar ‘ro skips rár (see rá, f.), Hm.; láta e-n höfði skemra, <i>to make a head shorter,</i> i. e. <i>behead,</i> Hým.: as a nickname, Atli inn Skammi, <i>the Short,</i> Eg.: not freq. in a local sense, except in the neut. skamt, en er þeir vóru skamt komnir frá, skála, Fb. i. 540; ok er þeir áttu skamt til garðsins, Eb. 60; hón bjó skamt frá Skalla-grími, Eg. 109; þaðan skamt á brott, 130; skamt í frá honum, Fms. x. 420, Fs. 37, Edda 29; um aðra hluti var skamt milii máls konunga (i. e. <i>they did not dissent much</i>), en þó gékk eigi sættin saman, Fms. x. 132: compar., var sú leiðin skemri, Eg. 576; örskot eða skemra, Grág. ii. 264; hann hljóp eigi skemra aptr en fram, Nj. 29; þykki mér þat opt rjúfask er skemra er at frétta enn slíkt, 259: þar er skemst var milli skógarins ok árinnar, Eg. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skamta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [from skammr], <i>to share, dole out, portion,</i> esp. of food at meals to the household; skamta fólkínu; skamta í búrinu; skamta e-m úr hnefa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skamtadar-erendi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
