        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = skark; skarkala mikill, <i>the making a great noise,</i> Fas. ii. 330; spelt skarkjali, iii. 399.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarlat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarlat
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>skarlak, skallat, skarlak</strong> = skarlat), n., Fb. ii. 75, 273; <strong>skarlakan,</strong> n. id., D. N. iv. 363, N. G. L. iii. 205, 208, [for. word; Engl. <i>scarlet</i>; Dan. <i>skarlagen</i>]:—<i>scarlet,</i> Sks. 287, Sturl. iii. 132; kyrtill af skaljati, Fms. vi. 358; hekla gör af skarlati, ii. 70; skarlats kápa, Ld. 330, Ó. H. 31; skarlats klæði, Nj. 48, Ld. 330, Ó. H. 153; skarlas kyrtill, Nj. 24, Fms. vii. 143; skarlats möttull, -skikkja, x. 271, Nj. 48, 169, Bs. i. 636.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>skarn;</i> cp. Gr. σκώρ, σκατός], <i>dung;</i> einn ók skarni á hóla, Nj. 67: <i>grime, dirt,</i> freq. in mod. usage, þvo af sér skarnið. <strong>skarn-sækinn,</strong> adj. <i>shewing dirt:</i> <strong>skörnugr,</strong> adj. <i>dirty</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarp-eggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
