        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>‘sharp-ware,’ dried fish.</i> D. N. iv. 152, Munk. 154.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarp-vaxinn"
