        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>sharp-grown, gaunt and bony,</i> Sturl. i. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarp-vitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarp-vitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sharp-witted.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarpr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skörp, skarpt, adj.; [A. S. <i>scearp;</i> Engl. <i>sharp;</i> Germ. <i>scharf;</i> akin to skorpinn, related to a lost strong verb]:—<i>sharp,</i> prop. <i>scorched</i> or <i>pinched</i> from dryness; með skörpum reipum, <i>with hard ropes</i> (of ropes of skin), Stj. 416; því harðara er hann brautsk, því skarpara varð bandit, Edda 20; skarpar álar, Ls. 62; skarpr belgr, <i>a shrivelled skin,</i> Hm. 135; skörp skrydda, Gd. 34; skarpr skinn-stakkr, Fas. ii. 147; skarpr fiskr (mod. harðr), <i>a dried fish,</i> Bs. i. 209, 365, 367, H. E. ii. 120; skörp skreið, id., i. 457.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. skæra], <i>a skirmish, tumult;</i> skarr í Dýra-firði, Fb. iii. 573; þótti honum ílla er þeir höfðu farit með skari nokkurum (nokkuru Ed.) at Böðvari, Sturl. iii. 231; görr skarr at Krókálfi í Skagafirði, Ann. 1305:—the name of a sword, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skars"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skars
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sounded <strong>skass</strong> (? gender), [cp. skyrsi and skersa], <i>a monster, ogress, giantess,</i> Hdl. 39, Hkv. Hjörv. 23, Hkv. 1. 38: hjálm-skars, <i>the ‘helm-ogre’</i> = <i>an axe,</i> Lex. Poët.: in mod. usage of <i>a romping lass,</i> þú ert mesta skass!",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [skara], n. <i>the snuff of a candle</i> (= skar), Konr. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skart"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skart
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>show, finery;</i> búa sik í (við) skart, Fms. vii. 321, Ld. 194; fara með dramb ok skart, Edda 108; höfuð-búnaðar skart, Sks. 225; skarts-kona, <i>a dressy woman;</i> skarts-maðr, <i>a dandy,</i> Eb. 256, Fms. vii. 219; berjask af skarti, Þiðr. 148; skart eðr skraut, Bs. i. 92: as a nickname, Sturl. iii. 184 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skart-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skart-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>finely;</i> búinn s., Fas. i. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skart-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skart-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>showy, dressy,</i> Stj. 142, Fas. iii. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skart-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skart-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dressy,</i> Str. 9, Fms. ii. 169.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skarta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skarta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to dress fine,</i> Bs. ii. 450.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skartari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
