      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skattr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. renders ἀργύριον, δηνάριον, and μνα, all by <i>skatts;</i> A. S. <i>sceat</i> = <i>a coin;</i> O. H. G. <i>scaz</i>, whence mod. Germ. <i>schatz; scatt</i> is an old Danish tax still paid in Shetl.; Dan. <i>skat</i>]:—<i>tribute,</i> Fms. i. 157, Hkr. i. 58, Nj. 8; svarinn Hákoni ok Magnúsi Noregs konungum land ok þegnar ok æfinligr skattr á Íslandi, Ann. 1262, cp. 1263, 1264: allit., leigt Ísland með sköttum ok skyldum um þrjá vetr, 1361; allan Noreg með sköttum ok skyldum, Fms. i. 3; Róma-skattr, <i>Peter’s pence:</i> the phrase, skatt vel ek honum harðan, <i>pay him hard tribute,</i> Orkn. 20 (ironically, in a verse on piling stones over a slain king): in Icel. the tax paid to the king was levied on the franklins (skattbændr), as described in Jb. 52, 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skatu-vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skatu-vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tram-way</i> for carrying heavy loads, D. N. ii. 770.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaud-hvitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skauð-hvítr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘sheath-white,’</i> of a horse’s disease, N. G. L. i. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
