      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaunn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skaunn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., poët. <i>a shield,</i> Edda (Gl.); prop. <i>a ‘protector,’</i> akin to Germ. <i>schonen;</i> skaunar seil, <i>the shield strap,</i> Þd. 9. The word also occurs in þing-skaun, <i>the</i> ‘þing-<i>sanctuary’, asylum,</i> within the holy bounds vé-bönd (= þing-helgi?), Fms. ix. 419.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
