        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘sheet-king,’</i> the nickname of the Swedish king Olave who was an orphan child and was carried about by the Swedes, as the tale is told in Fas. i. 511, cp. Ó. H. ch. 15; but may not the name be derived from his having been an adopted son of the old king? See the references s. v. skaut (3).",
            }
