          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, a causal to skjálfa, q. v.:—<i>to make to shake, give one a shaking;</i> skeifa lind, Rm. 34; s. aska, 39; hann rétti gullrekit spjót at Armóði ok skelfði við, Orkn. 328; Bengeirr skelfði sverðit, Fms. viii. 317; skelfðan græði, <i>the troubled waters,</i> Fms. vi. (in a verse); hann fær eigi steinvegginn sundr skelfdan, Sks. 410; þat er skelfi þína hamingju, Fms. x. 223.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelfi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelfi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>terrible.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelfing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelfing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘shaking,’ terror,</i> Th. 25, freq. in mod. usage: as adv. = <i>awfully,</i> skelfing er að tarna fallegt, <i>awfully fine!</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
