        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>trembling,</i> Al. 76, Fas. ii. 192; ó-skelfr, <i>undaunted,</i> Fb. ii. 8, 351: compar., at ek skula tala lægra eðr skelfra, <i>with a lower</i> or <i>more faltering voice,</i> 296.",
            }
          }
        />
