          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>mockery,</i> Arna-Magn. 234 (vellum).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelkinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelkinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mocking,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [skálkr], <i>to mock;</i> s. at e-m, Stj. 363, Al. 153, Fas. iii. 37 (in a verse); s. at Guði, Stj. 363; þeir gengu fyrir krossinn ok skelktu at líkneskinu, Bs. i. 147; þá mun hann ei ok ei (aye and aye) s. at oss, Karl. 374: reflex., Guð lætr eigi skelkjask, Hom. 144 (Gal. vi. 7).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelkni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelkni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>mockery,</i> [Shetl. <i>skeelkin</i>], Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [mid. H. G. <i>schellech;</i> Engl. <i>skulk</i>], <i>fear;</i> only in the phrase, e-m skýtr skelk í bringu, <i>one is taken by fear, loses heart, is frightened,</i> Fb. i. 418, Ld. 78, Fms. viii. 43, 350, Ó. H. 108, 121, Eg. 49, with a mocking notion, see skalkr, q. v.; or e-m slær skelk í bringu, Stj. 372.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a rattle</i> for scaring horses; skaka skellu, Grág. i. 441.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skella-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, causal of skjalla (q. v.), <i>to make to slam, clash;</i> skelldu skip mitt er ek skorðat hafðak, <i>knocked my ship,</i> Hbl., Sturl. i. 177; hann skelldi þeim saman, <i>beat them together,</i> Landn. 84; s. sverði í skeiðin, Eg. 304; s. aptr hurðu, <i>to slam the door,</i> Fb. i. 258, Fms. viii. 341: <i>to smack,</i> s. á lærin, <i>to smack the thigh with the palm;</i> skella lófum, <i>to clap with the hands,</i> Merl.; s. hrömmum yfir, <i>to clutch,</i> Ld. 52; spor svá stór sem keralds botni væri niðr skellt, <i>footprints as great as if the bottom of a cask had been thrown down,</i> Grett. 111.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelli-brogd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelli-brögð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>merry pranks,</i> Fb. iii. 241 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelli-hlatr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelli-hlátr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>roaring laughter,</i> Fas. iii. 572.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelli-hurd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelli-hurð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a door that slams of itself,</i> Háv. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skellr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skellr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. skellir, <i>a loud splash;</i> er hann heyrði skellina, <i>the splash</i> of one diving, Fær. 172: <i>a smiting, beating,</i> sá hlaut skellinn er skyldi, Nj. 141; hón skell um hlaut fyrir skillinga, Þkv. 32: rass-s., <i>a flogging behind.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelmir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelmir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>skjelm</i> = Germ. <i>schelm</i>], <i>a rogue, devil;</i> drepa skelmi þann, Boll. 352; skelmirinn, of the devil, Th. 76, Fb. i. 417, Bs. ii. 81; hann spratt upp ok spurði hvat skelmi þat væri, Grett. 66 new Ed.; hvat vill skelmir þinn! Fs. 52; þinn skelmir! 166; skelmir sá, Bjarn. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelmis-drep"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelmis-drep
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a plague, murrain,</i> Stj. 326, 344.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skelmis-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelmis-skapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>devilry,</i> Gísl. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
