          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skelpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [skálpr], <i>a wry face;</i> in the phrase, göra skelpur, <i>to make a wry mouth,</i> in crying, Fb. i. 566.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Engl. <i>shambles;</i> Scot. <i>skamyll,</i> a bench; Dan. <i>skammel</i> = <i>a foot-stool</i>]:—prop. <i>a bench,</i> whence <i>a foot-stool;</i> see fót-skemill.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [prop. from skamr = <i>short</i>], <i>a small detached building</i> in an ancient dwelling, for sleeping in or for a lady’s bower; hann átti eina litla skemmu ok svaf hann þar jafnan, Fær. 259; þau vóru öll í svefni í skemmu einni, Gísl. 7. Ísl. ii. 38; sá hann Steingerði sitja í skemmu einni, Korm. 228; skemmu-búr, <i>a bower,</i> Eg. 560; skemmu-dyrr, -gluggr, -hurð, -veggr, Fms. ii. 125, iii. 67, iv. 335, Fær. 144, Fas. i. 197; skemmu-seta, <i>sitting in a</i> skemma, of ladies, iii. 68, Fms. ii. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemma-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [skömm, skamm], <i>to put to shame,</i> Sks. 702, Barl. 54, 55, 125, 146.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemmd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemmd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>shame, disgrace,</i> Barl. 115, 129, Ver. 5, 26, MS. 655 v. 1, 623. 31, Rb. 382; þola þeim allar skemmdir, Anecd. 12; skemmdar auki, Boll. 354; skemmdar-orð, -verk, -víg, <i>a villainous word, deed, slaughter,</i> Fms. vi. 33, N. G. L. ii. 49; skemmdar fullr, <i>disgraceful,</i> 623. 6, Fms. ii. 47, Fb. i. 512; skemmdar-lauss, <i>without disgrace,</i> Al. 48: neut., Hom, 111: <i>without hurt, unscathed,</i> Rd. 247; skemmdar-maðr, <i>a villain,</i> Fms. vi. 32, D. N. iv. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemmi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>shame,</i> = skemmd, Hom. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemmi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemmi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>shamefully,</i> Fas. iii. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemmi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemmi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shameful,</i> Háv. 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemmingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemmingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>seal,</i> the smallest species, Sks. 177: as a nickname, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. compar., superl. skemst, [from skamr], <i>shorter:</i> of space, þeir sögðu at konungr hefði skemr farit en líkligt þætti til Oslóar, Fms. ix. 529: er skemr hefir búit í því héraði, Grág. i. 423; lifa skemr, Al. 15; alldri s. en þrjár nætr, Rb. 566; hann lifði skemst þeirra bræðra, Ó. H. 92; á einum degi, ok láta sem skemst á meðal, Grág. ii. 124.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Dan. <i>skjemt</i>], <i>an amusement,</i> = skemtan, Pass. 21. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, but að, Fms. x. 226, 281, [prop. from skamr = <i>to shorten</i>]:—<i>to amuse, entertain,</i> with dat. of pers.; skemta sér, <i>to amuse oneself, play,</i> Nj. 129; þeir drukku ok skemmtuðu sér, Fms. x. 281; skemtaði hann sér á hverjum degi, 226; hón gékk um gólf ok skemti sér, Eg. 48; vér erum kátir ok skemtum oss, Fms. viii. 354. 357:—so also of other persons, sveinn þeirra er inni, ok skemtir þeim, Ísl. ii. 348; þótti ok vel skemt, <i>a good entertainment,</i> Fms. viii. 207.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemtan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemtan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>skemtun</strong>), f. <i>an entertainment,</i> Edda 25; hafa s. af e-u, <i>to amuse oneself with a thing,</i> Eg. 232; at henni þætti s. at tala við Óláf, Ld. 72; at þú eigir fá skemtanar daga (<i>days of joy</i>) héðan í frá, 154;skemtanar-ganga, <i>a pleasure-walk, promenade,</i> Sks. 371; skemtanar líf, <i>a life of pleasure,</i> 619; hafa skemtanar ræður, <i>to have a chat,</i> Fms. vii. 119.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemtan-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemtan-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>amusing, pleasant,</i> Sks. 379.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemti-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemti-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>amusingly, pleasantly;</i> segja frá vel ok s., <i>to tell a story well and pleasantly,</i> Fbr. 146; svá sem skemtiligast, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skemti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skemti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>amusing, interesting, pleasant,</i> Fms. ii. 22, vi. 350, Ísl. ii. 212, Stj. 91; ó-skemtiligr, <i>dull, uninteresting.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skenking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skenking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the serving drink at the table;</i> því næst kómu inn sendingar (<i>dishes</i>), þar næst skenkingar, Ó. H. 86; ekki starf skulu þeir hafa fyrir s. um Jól, N. G. L. ii. 447.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skenkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skenkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Dan. <i>skjœnke;</i> Germ. <i>schenken, einschenken</i>], <i>to serve drink, fill one’s cup,</i> often with dat. of pers.; Orkn. 216; hann skenkti honum með fríðu horni búnu, Fms. iv. 49; drekka silfri skenkt it fagra vín, Edda (H.); Freyja fór þá at s. honum …, eða hví Freyja skal s. honum sem at gildi Ása, Edda 57; s. mjöð, 76; þann mann er þar hafði skenkt um kveldit, Eg. 557; s. drykk, Flóv. 12; öll minni þau er bændr skenktu, Fms. i. 37; at hann skyldi s. sjálfum honum, Stj. 201; hann lét standa fyrir borði sínu skutil-sveina at s. sér með borðkerum, Fms. vi. 442, N. G. L. ii. 447: <i>to give drink,</i> skenkta ek þyrstanda, Sks. 632: mod., skenkja kaffé, <i>to give one a cup of coffee.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skenkjari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skenkjari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a cup-bearer,</i> Stj. 200, 571, N. G. L. ii. 413, 415, 447, Sturl. iii. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skenkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skenkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. skenkir, <i>the serving of drink at a meal;</i> ok er menn höfðu matask um hríð kom iunar skenkr, Sturl. iii. 182 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skapði, see skapa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [skapa; Dan. <i>skabning</i>], <i>a shape, form;</i> með hverigri skepnu sem er, K. Þ. K. (begin.); eptir réttri skepnu, Fms. v. 347, Hom. 115.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skeppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skeppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>skjeppe;</i> Engl. <i>skip</i>], <i>a measure, bushel,</i> N. G. L. i. 136, ii. 166. v. l. 35, 366, D. N. v. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a shaft</i>, = skeptiflétta, Fms. x. 357.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [skapt]; skepta örvar, <i>to make shafts to arrow-heads,</i> Rm. 25; s. geira, <i>to make spear-shafts,</i> Akv. 37; skepta spjót, Fs. 64, Krók.:—<i>to furnish with a handle,</i> ramliga skeptar öxar, Gþl. 104: metaph., hann bað hann þá ekki um skepta = skipta, <i>he begged him not to meddle,</i> Fms. viii. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shaft;</i> tvennar tylptir örva, skefla eðr brodda, N. G. L. i. 201; var skeptið langt at spjótinu, Gísl. 101.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepti-fletta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepti-flétta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a kind of <i>shaft with a cord,</i> Sks. 389, Fms. vi. 77, Ó. H. 217, Hallfred.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepti-smidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepti-smiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shaft-maker,</i> Hm. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skepti-volr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skepti-völr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>pike,</i> Hkr. iii. 313.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skeptingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skeptingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>head-gear,</i> Edda ii. 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skeptr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skeptr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>shafted,</i> of arrows, spears; skeptar örvar, dörr álmi skept, Lex. Poët.; auð-skept spjör, Ad.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sker
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. skerja, dat. skerjum; [Dan. <i>skjœr;</i> Swed. <i>skär</i>; Engl. <i>skerry</i>]:—<i>a skerry, an isolated rock in the sea;</i> í hólma eðr í sker, Grág. ii. 131; upp á skerit, Fær. 171; til þess er þraut sker öll, Eg. 128, Eb. 12, 236–240, passim; as also in local names, <strong>Skerja-fjörðr:</strong> for the saying, sigla milli skers ok báru, see sigla; eyði-sker, <i>a desert skerry;</i> blind-sker, <i>a sunken skerry:</i> also in the phrase, að flaska á því skerinu, <i>to split on that rock.</i> <strong>skerja-blesi,</strong> a nickname, Dropl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sker-auki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sker-auki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Gísl. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sker-bord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sker-borð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a dish, plate;</i> eins og s. reist á rönd, rambar þar til dettr, Tíma R.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sker-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sker-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>skærgaard</i>], <i>a reef of rocks in the sea near shore,</i> Bs. i. 842, Trist. 8, Rafn. S. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sker-gipr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sker-gípr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>bird,</i> Fas. iii. 230.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sker-nar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sker-nár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a person left to die on a skerry,</i> Grág. ii. 185; see nár.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sker, pret. skar, pl. skáru; subj. skæri; part. skorinn: [A. S. <i>sceran;</i> Engl. <i>shear;</i> Germ. <i>scheren;</i> Dan. <i>skjære</i>]:—<i>to cut;</i> skera með knífi, klippa með söxum, Str. 9; þeir skáru böndin, Fms. iv. 369; hann skar af nokkurn hlut, x. 337; s. tungu ór höfði manni, Grág. ii. 11; hann skar ór egg-farveginn ór sárinu, Þórð. 54 new Ed.; þann flekk skera ór með holdi ok blóði, Fms. ii. 188; s. á háls, Nj. 156; skera ór út ór, <i>to cut sheer through,</i> 244, Fms. i. 217.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skerda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skerða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [skarð], <i>to diminish;</i> þá skal s. jafnt alla aura … skerða mundinn, Grág. i. 125, 126; þat er hvárki skerði verð né leigu, Gþl. 503.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skerdingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skerðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shark</i> (há-skerðingr), as a nickname; whence <strong>Skerðings-staðir,</strong> in western Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skerdir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skerðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a diminisher,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skerfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skerfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>skjœrv</i>], <i>a share, portion.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skerja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skerja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., prop. <i>a cow</i> = skirja, akin to skars, skersa, <i>a romping lass;</i> að skerjan þessi skyldi mér … snuprur nógar veita, Grönd.",
            }
          }
        />
