          className="link"
          href="/word/skikkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skikkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to put on a cloak;</i> skikkja sik, <i>to cloak oneself;</i> þá tók konungrinn einn gráfeldinn ok skikði sik, Hkr. i. 180; varar-feldir nýir ok úskiktir, <i>not worn,</i> N. G. L. i. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skikkja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skikkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a cloak, mantle,</i> Am. 47, Nj. 22, Eg. 213, 318, 579, Fms. ii. 280; skikkja and möttull (q. v.) are synonymous, thus, hann gaf honum ‘skikkju,’… hann sá altaris-klæði þat er gört var ór ‘möttlinum’ (both referring to the same garment), Fms. vi. 164; skikkjur þær er feldir heita, Krók.; skikkju verð, Fms. x. 199; skikkju kaup, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skikkju-bond"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skikkju-bönd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the mantle straps,</i> Fms vi. 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skikkju-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
