        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-vangi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-vangi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = skildagi, N. G. L. i. 136, 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-visi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-vísi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an account;</i> göra s. fyrir kaupum, Gþl. 493.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-visliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-vísliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>clearly, conclusively, with despatch, promptly,</i> Gþl. 66, Dipl. ii. 13, Anecd. 66, Sks. 57, 282 B, 315.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-visligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-vísligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>trustworthy, authentic,</i> Stj. 17, Anecd.; öll bréf eiga á sér s. mörk, <i>marks proving their authenticity,</i> 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = skilríkr, <i>trustworthy;</i> s. maðr, Ld. 274; í skilvísum bókum, Stj. 17, 41, 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-vaenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-vænn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = skilvíss, K. Á. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skil-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skil-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = skilorð, Fms. vi. 194, D. N., freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skila"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skila
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to perform a duty;</i> fylgd ok vörðr skal boðinn vera snimma dags, ok skilaðr í seinsta lagi þann tíma sem konungr gengr til borðs, N. G. L. ii. 414; at ekki sé eptir ú-skilat eðr úgört, Hom. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skila-bod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skila-boð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>a message.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skila-dottir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skila-dottir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = skilgetin dóttir, D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skila-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skila-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a Norse law term, <i>a private court of adjustment,</i> like the Icel. görð, q. v.; cp. mod. Germ. <i>‘schieds’-richter,</i> N. G. L. i. 87; halda skiladómi fyrir kaupi sínu, Gþl. 496 (Js. 119), Dipl. ii. 12; halda s. fyrir jörðina (acc.), iii. 11; halda skiladómi fyrir, ok njóta vátta sinna, at hann tók fyrri, Gþl. 335; halda (landi) til skiladóms, Dipl. ii. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skila-litill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skila-lítill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = skillítill, Sturl. i. 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skila-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skila-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a trusty man,</i> Sks. 20, Rd. 260, Gþl. 25; ó-skila maðr, <i>an untrustworthy man.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skildi-vondr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skildi-vöndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a reed-wand,</i> Fb. i. 405 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skildingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skildingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skillingr, D. N., in deeds of the 14th century.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilfingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilfingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [either from skelfa = <i>the shaker,</i> or, it may be, akin to Germ. <i>schilf</i> = <i>a reed</i>]:—the name of a mythical royal familv, <i>a prince, lord,</i> Edda, Lex. Poët.; dauða skilfingr, <i>the prince of Death,</i> Niðrst. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skiling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a disposition,</i> Skálda 197.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [skilja; Scot. <i>skeely</i>], <i>distinct;</i> skilin orð, <i>clear, distinct words,</i> Hm. 135; tala hátt ok snjallt ok skilit, Konr. 56; svá skýrt ok skilit, Bs. ii. 16; til þess at þá verði skilnari frásögnin, Róm. 108; snjallr ok skilinn í öllu framferði, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. skil, skill, Grág.; pret. skilði, skildi; part. skiliðr, and later, skildr and skilinn; neut. skilið and skilt: [the original sense, viz. <i>to cut,</i> Lat. <i>secare,</i> appears in Goth. <i>skilja</i> = <i>a butcher;</i> A. S. <i>scylan</i> = <i>to separate.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiljan-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skiljan-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>distinctly,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiljan-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skiljan-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>distinct,</i> Skálda 174: <i>intelligible,</i> Sks. 157; ú-skiljanligr, <i>unintelligible.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skillingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skillingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Goth. <i>skilliggs;</i> A. S. <i>scilling;</i> Engl. <i>shilling;</i> Dan. <i>skilling</i>], <i>a shilling,</i> Þkv. 32, Eg. 278, 280: as a rendering of the Hebr. <i>shekel</i>, Stj. 363. 396, 461, 534, Mar. 1202; gull-s., Ó. H. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilmi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>skimmel;</i> Shetl. <i>skilm</i>], <i>mustiness;</i> and <strong>skilma,</strong> að, <i>to be covered with mouldiness,</i> (Oldn. Ordb.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a separation,</i> Grág. ii. 13, 114: <i>a separation, divorce,</i> i. 378, Fms. x. 348: <i>a parting,</i> Stj. 479; at skilnaði, <i>at their parting, at last,</i> Eg. 574, 575, Nj. 106, Fms. viii. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (in mod. usage <strong>skilningr,</strong> m.), <i>a separation, division;</i> einn Guð þrennr í skilningu, Hom. 146; Guð görði himna í skilningu, Eluc. 9; s. millum íllra hluta ok góðra, Sks 502; þær þrjár skilningar er einn Guð, Gþl. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilningar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilningar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>senseless, without understanding,</i> Sks. 246 B: <i>a brute,</i> s. skepna, 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilningar-vit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilningar-vit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>mother-wit, sense, instinct,</i> Stj. 98, 101: <i>the (five) senses,</i> 20, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skilningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skilningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skilning, <i>sense, meaning, understanding;</i> þann skilning, Stj. 2; skilningi, id.; andaligr s., 25, 50; var í bréfinu sá s., Bs. i. 803, 838; þessi o:ð bera þann skilning, ii. 42; þat er minn s. at sú skipan á at standa, i. 827; tvenna skilninga, Skálda 207, and so in mod. usage: <strong>skilnings-góðr,</strong> <i>clever;</i> <strong>skilnings-laus, -lítill,</strong> adj. <i>senseless, of small understanding,</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skima
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to look all around,</i> of a restless and eager look; hann skimar at fé sínu, Fas. i. 7; s. í allar áttir; see skuma.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skimudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skimuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., poët. <i>a he-goat,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skin
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [skína; in provinc. Germ. the moon is called <i>schein,</i> Grimm’s Dict.], <i>sheen, shining,</i> of the sun, moon, stars; skin sólar ok tungls, 623. 21; hann ræðr fyrir regni ok skini sólar, Edda 16; einn dag var skin heitt, Fms. i. 118, vi. 411; þann dag var fagrt veðr af skini, x. 344; höfðu þeir skorpnat í skininu, Háv. 47, passim: sól-skin, <i>sunshine;</i> tungl-skin, <i>moonshine;</i> a poët. name of the moon, Alm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skin-faxi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skin-faxi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>Sheen-mane,</i> name of the sun-horse, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skin-hringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skin-hringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fms. viii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a kind of <i>cloth;</i> Grönl. H.M. iii. 96, Flóv., D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skininn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skininn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>bleached, withered;</i> s. bein.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [a specially Scandin. word, not known to the Saxon and Germ., unless Germ. <i>schinden</i> (= <i>to flay</i>) is of the same root; the Engl. <i>skin</i> is probably a borrowed Norse word, esp. as <i>sk</i> is not represented by <i>sh</i>]:—<i>a skin;</i> húð af nauti, skinn af sauði, N. G. L. i. 420; bera (fall) af skinni, K. Þ. K., passim; sauð-skinn, <i>sheep-skin;</i> skinna tíund, N. G. L. i. 462.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-bjartr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-bjartr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>bright-skinned,</i> of complexion, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-drattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-dráttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘skin-pulling,’</i> an athletic game, uncertain what; ef maðr gengr til fangs eðr skinndráttar at vilja sínum ábyrgist sá sik sjálfr at öllu, N. G. L. ii. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-dreginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-dreginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>lined with fur,</i> Ísl. ii. 223.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-hvitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-hvítr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>white-skinned,</i> = skinnbjartr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-klaedast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-klæðast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to put on one’s skin clothes,</i> of fishermen.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a suit of skin clothes;</i> see skinn B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skinn-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skinn-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>skinless, with abraded skin,</i> Fas. iii. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
