      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [from Lat. <i>excubitum;</i> Byzan. Gr. ἐσκύβιτον], <i>the camp of the Varangians</i> at Constantinople, Fagrsk. 111.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [A. S. <i>scyftan;</i> Engl. <i>shift</i>; Dan. <i>skifte</i>]:—<i>to make a division of a thing,</i> with dat. of the thing; <i>to part, share, divide;</i> skipta e-u í hluti, Eluc. 8; s. hrepp í fjórðunga, Grág. i. 443; s. liði í sveitir, Fms. ix. 511, x. 268; skipta þeir nú félagi sínu, Ld. 192; s. arfi, Eg. 197; s. með sér úmögum, Grág. i. 237 sqq.; sumum mönnum skiptu þeir með sér til ánauðar, Fms. i. 77; tóku þeir at herfangi allt fólk ok skiptu milli skipanna, vii. 195; s. vatni með mönnum, Grág. ii. 290; s. landi með okkr, 254; konungr skipti landi með sonum sínum, Fms. i. 6: s. e-u við e-n, <i>to share it with another,</i> Eg. 333, Fms. vii. 176; s. sundr, <i>to part asunder, divide;</i> ef sundr er skipt lögunum, þá mun sundr skipt friðinum, Nj. 164: <i>to share,</i> nornir skipta geysi-újafnt, Edda 11; enda skipti Guð með okkr, Nj. 165; látum s. Guð giptu, Fms. viii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a division, distribution, sharing;</i> þegar í áttir er skipt úmögum, þá skal þat s. halda, Grág. i. 237; þér hafit lítið af ríki, en erut margir til skiptis, Fms. i. 52; þessa skiptis mun ek opt iðrask, Eg. 294; ok er þeir fundusk um skiptin, orðu þeir vel ásáttir, Þorst. Síðu H. 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipti-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipti-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>shiftingly, in parts,</i> 677. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>divisible,</i> 677. 11, Skálda 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipti-tiund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipti-tíund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a tithe,</i> thus called from being divided into four parts, between the church, bishop, priest, and poor, K. Þ. K. 162, Bs. i. 834, Vm. 84, H. E. ii. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a division, dividing,</i> Grág. i. 242, ii. 342, Alg. 356 (of arithmetic), passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiptingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skiptingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a changeling</i> (Germ. <i>wechselbalg</i>), <i>an idiot,</i> believed to have been substituted for the right child by fairies, Sks. 296, Fms. xi. 56, 445, Fas. ii. 341, Mar., Stj. 475; for the popular superstition see Maurer’s Volksagen.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipu-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipu-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>order, disposition.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>orderly,</i> Fms. ii. 147, Sturl. i. 9, ii. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skipu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skipu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
