              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>skrifli,</strong> [Germ. <i>scherbe</i>], <i>a hulk, an old dilapidated thing;</i> skjaldar-s., Band.; skip-skrifli, bát-s., freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
