          className="link"
          href="/word/skiding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = suzingull, Sks. 403.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skífa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [Germ. <i>scheibe</i>], <i>a shaving, slice,</i> passim in mod. usage; a nickname, Fms. x.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skima-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a shimmer, faint gleam of light;</i> dags-s., ljós-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skimi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skími
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Ulf. <i>skeima</i> = φανή, John xviii. 3; Germ. <i>schimmer;</i> A. S. <i>scîma;</i> Engl. <i>shimmer</i>]:—<i>a gleam of light;</i> nokkurir skímar af hennar geislum, Sks. 205; at af þeim geisli þessi skími, 206; með bleikum skíma, 627; leiðir fram dökkvan skíma, 229 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skína
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. skínn, Nj. 146; þú skínn, 623. 18: mod. skín (with a single <i>n</i>); pres. skein, skeint (mod. skeinst), skein, pl. skinu; subj. skini; part. skininn: [Ulf. <i>skeinan</i> = λαμπειν, ἐξαστράπτειν; common to all Teut. languages]:—<i>to shine;</i> sól skínn, Grág. ii. 170; nú skínn sól í sali, Alm.; sól skein sunnan, Vsp. 4; veðr var fagrt, skein sól í heiði, Ó. H. 216; geislar skinu, Ór. 60; er sólin skínn á, Nj. 146; s. með mikilli birti, Fms. i. 77: tne phrase, skína í jarteinum, 623. 18; or, s. jarteinum, of a saint, Bs. passim; ok er hann skein í þvílíkri dýrð, Fms. x. 231; þeim er skein í heims prýði, 656 A. ii. 2; heilög Krisini hefir skinit með björtum blóma, Bs. i. 237; skínanda klæði, <i>shining, glittering clothes,</i> of gold-embroidered stuff, Dipl. iii. 4, v. 18, Vm. 52, 55.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘pure-born,’ born in wedlock,</i> Grág. i. 288, Fms. x. 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Maundy-Thursday,</i> Bs. i. 168, 247, ii. 167, Ld. 324, Rb. 358, Fms. ix. 500, Sturl. i. 25, 114, iii. 203: <strong>Skíri-dagr,</strong> <i>id.,</i> Gþl. 177: <strong>Skíri-Jón,</strong> <i>John the Baptist,</i> Gd. <strong>Skíri-Þórsdagr,</strong> id., N. G. L. i. 10, Gþl. 177, Fms. ix. 500, Karl. 469.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-draepr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-dræpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dazzling;</i> lét hann tjalda svörtum tjöldum til þess at þá væri síðr skírdræpt, Ó. H. 156 (Fær. 213).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-getinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-getinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>born in wedlock,</i> Fms. ix. 250, Grág. i. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>-leiki,</strong> a, m.), <i>purity;</i> at slá slíkt silfr at skírleika sem várr vili verðr til, N. G. L. i. 446; sakir orða gnóttar eða skírleiks, MS. 15. 1: mostly in a moral sense, s. andarinnar, Stj. 34, 142, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-leitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-leitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>pure of countenance,</i> Gm. 39, Akv. 35; bjartari ok skírleitari, MS. 234. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "Adv. <i>purely,</i> Sól. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = skírleitr; s. í yfirbragði, Sturl. ii. 189; s. at yfirlítum, Fb. ii. 431 (MS. skýrligr, less correct).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-lifi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-lífi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a pure life, chastity,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-lifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-lífr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>pure-lived, chaste,</i> HE. i. 469, MS. 625. 78, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-skota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-skota
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to appeal,</i> a law term, with dat.; the word is prob. derived from the appeal to ordeal; s. e-u undir e-n, <i>to appeal to;</i> s. þessum órskurði undir þá menn alla, … ok skírskotaði til þeirra laga er gengu á Uppsala-þingi, Ó. H. 86; því s. ek undir þik, Arinbjörn, ok þik, Þórðr, … at …, Eg. 352; s. skal hann undir vátta svörum þeirra, N. G. L. i. 348; konungr skírskotaði þá fyrir þeim er hjá vóru, at Símon gékk við, <i>called them to witness, upon that S. confessed,</i> Fms. ix. 358; þá er hann réttlauss ok hefir hann því skírskotað, N. G. L. i. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skir-teini"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skír-teini
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. jartein], <i>a proof, evidence</i> (documentary or personal), freq. in mod. usage: <strong>skír-teinn,</strong> m. the name of a charmed sword, which shewed the guilt or innocence of one who touched it, Hem.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skira"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð; a distinction is made between skíra (with <i>í</i>) = <i>to purify,</i> and skýra (with <i>y</i>) metaph. = <i>to explain;</i> but that both words are identical is shewn from the Goth.: [Ulf. <i>skeirjan</i> = ἑρμηνεύειν, <i>skeireins</i> = ἑρμηνεία, <i>skeirs</i> = <i>clear</i>]:—<i>to cleanse, purify;</i> s. silfr, Hkr. i. 185; þat skírir ok birtir augu, … þat bætir myrk augu ok skírir, Pr. 472, 473; skíra sik, <i>to cleanse oneself.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [cp. A. S. <i>fullere</i>], <i>the Baptist,</i> N. T., Vídal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiri-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíri-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = Skírdagr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiri-fadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíri-faðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘baptism-father,’ one who has baptized one,</i> Sturl. i. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiri-nafni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíri-nafni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a namesake,</i> Sighvat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiri-thorsdagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíri-þórsdagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = Skírdagr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skiring"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a clearing;</i> skíringar-vitni, <i>a compurgatory witness,</i> N. G. L. i. 207.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [as a translation of the A. S. <i>fulluht,</i> which prop. means <i>cleansing,</i> cp. Engl <i>fuller</i> = <i>bleacher</i>]:—eccl. <i>baptism, christening;</i> skírn görir alla hreina ok skíra, 655 i. 1, K. Þ. K., Bs., in countless instances, old and mod.; heima-s., <i>christening at home;</i> skurðar-s., <i>circumcision;</i> halda barni undir skírn, <i>to stand godfather,</i> Fb. ii. 264; skírnar-hald, <i>the standing godfather,</i> Str. 17; skírnar embætti, -þjónosta, Fms. i. 148, H. E. i. 473, Karl. 204, Stj. 377; skírnar-dagr, 677. 15; skírnar-brunnr (-bruðr), <i>the fount of baptism,</i> Fms. iii. 168, MS. 656 A. ii. 2; skírnar-dropi, Hom. 56; skírnar-ketill, skírnar-munnlaug, <i>a font,</i> Vm. 17, 109; skírnar-Sár, <i>a baptismal font,</i> H. E. i. 473, Vm. 1; skírnar-klæði, <i>baptismal clothing</i> = hvíta-váðir (q. v.), <i>a white garment,</i> Fms. x. 244, Stj. 49, Ó. T. 25, 29; skírnar-nafn, <i>a baptismal name,</i> Bær. 6, Stj. 139; skírnar-steinn, <i>a font,</i> Vm. 38; skírnar-vatn, <i>baptismal water,</i> 655 vii. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become clear;</i> vatn sem betr hefði skírnat ok setzk, Stj. 290; þá tekr þat ljós at skírnask ok birtask, Sks. 204.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the Bright,</i> the name of the messenger of Frey, the god of light, Edda. <strong>Skírnis-för</strong> (in mod. Edd. called <strong>Skírnis-mál</strong>), Sæm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. skírri, superl. skírstr, Sks. 138 new Ed., MS. 15. 5; [Goth. <i>skeirs</i>; A. S. <i>scîr</i>; Engl. <i>sheer</i>; Germ. <i>schier;</i> Dan. <i>skjær;</i> cp. also skærr and skýrr]:—<i>clear, bright, pure,</i> of glass, water, sky, light, etc.; gler allra hreinst ok skírst, MS. 15. 5; skírt vatn, Hb. 544. 39; skír ok úskír vötn, Rb. 352; skír veðr eðr úskír, Stj. 15; þrjár merkr gang-silfrs móti einni skírri, 732. 16; skírt silfr, id.; sýndisk honum eigi skírt mála-silfrit, Fms. vi. 243; átta hundruð marka skírra, x. 92; drykkr skírri hverju víni, id.; getinn af skírri meyju ok flekklaussi, 625. 70.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., prop. <i>purification, an ordeal;</i> for the ordeal see the remarks s. v. bera A. 111, jörð A. in fine, ketill 1. 2; as also the words járn-burðr, ketil-tak, jarðar-men; göra skírslir, Fms. x. 418; Guðs skírslir, <i>‘God’s ordeal,’</i> is opp. to manna skírsl, <i>man’s ordeal</i> (i. e. <i>an oath</i>), N. G. L. i. 389; göra e-m stefnu til þings, ok njóti þar skírsla sinna, Js. 38; hann skal eigi eiga hverft til manna skírsla ef hann býðr fyrri Guðs skírslir, i. e. <i>if a man first offers God’s ordeal he shall have no right afterwards to man’s ordeal, the oath,</i> N. G. L. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirsla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a purification, ordeal,</i> see skírsl, Fms. vii. 164, ix. 284, K. Þ. K. 168, Grág. i. 341, 361: in a heathen sense, of passing under a jarðarmen, Ld. 58: metaph., göra skírslu til e-s, <i>to put to the test,</i> Fms. xi. 95, Orkn. 356.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirsla-thing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírsla-þing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a meeting for an ordeal,</i> N. G. L. i. 459.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skirslar-eldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skírslar-eldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>skers-ild</i>], <i>purgatory,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skit-holt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skít-holt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
