          className="link"
          href="/word/skita-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skíta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skeit, skitu, skitið, [A. S. <i>scitan;</i> Engl. <i>shite</i>; Germ. <i>scheissen;</i> Dan. <i>skide;</i> now only vulgar]:—<i>cacare,</i> Grág. ii. 133, Fms. vii. 21; þeir fuglar er í sitt hreiðr s., <i>that foul their own nest,</i> Sturl. iii. 253: part. <strong>skitinn</strong> (q. v.), <i>dirty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
