          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "the form taken by skjöldr in COMPDS: skjaldblætr, skjaldborg, skjaldfimr, skjaldhvalr, skjaldkona, skjaldkænn, skjaldmær, skjaldrim, skjaldsteinn, skjaldsveinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjald-balkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-bálkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (N. G. L. i. 84), and <strong>skjald-þili,</strong> n. (should be spelt skjal-, not skjald-, from skilja, not from skjöldr?), [Norse <i>skjel-tile</i>]:—<i>a wooden partition-wall,</i> Eg. 90, 233, 235, Fms. v. 338, viii. 172, Grett. 98 A, Orkn. 110, N. G. L. ii. 245 (skjælldili).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjald-blaetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-blætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shield worshipper</i> (?), Yngl. S. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjald-borg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-borg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘shield-burgh,’ wall of shields,</i> an old battle array, Ó. H. 206, Nj. 274, Eg. 92, 532, Fms. ii. 319, vi. 416, 418, vii. 262, described in Har. S. Harðr. ch. 117 (Fms. vi 413).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjald-brik"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-brík
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = skjaldbálkr: <strong>skjald-bríkja,</strong> t, <i>to wainscot,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjald-fimr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-fimr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>quick with one’s shield,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjald-hvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjald-hvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>whale,</i> from its particoloured skin, Sks. 124.",
