        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = skjanni, (conversational.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjanni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjanni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to kinn?], <i>the side of the head,</i> Fas. ii. 451 (but coarse) <strong>skjanna-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>gaunt-faced.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjappa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjappa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., mod. <strong>skeppa,</strong> [Dan. <i>skjeppe;</i> East Engl. <i>skip</i>], <i>a bushel;</i> skjöppur ok vágir, N. G. L. i. 126; fjórar skeppur, 136: a nickname, Fms. vii. 215.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Engl. <i>shy</i>; Germ. <i>scheu</i>], <i>shy, timid,</i> of animals, deer; skjarra sauði, Nj. 27, Bs. i. 330; skjörr hross, Hrafn. 7: skjarrt hross, Gþl. 504; sauðfé þat er skjarrast var, Ld. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
