        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., Edda ii. 610; read skrjóðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f [Engl. <i>shelf</i>], <i>a shelf, seat;</i> remains only in hlið-skjálf, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalf-henda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálf-henda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a kind of <i>metre,</i> Edda (Ht.) 35, 129, 130; for the origin of this metre see Edda l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalf-hendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálf-hendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>in the metre</i> skjálfhenda, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalf-raddadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálf-raddaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>with faltering voice.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= skelfa, <i>to make to shake;</i> s. ok hræða e-n, Barl. 197.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalfa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skelf, skalf, skulfu; subj. skylfi; part. skolfit (skolf = skalf, Barl. 53):—<i>to shiver, shake, quiver;</i> honum þótti s. bæði jörð ok himin, Nj. 194; með skjálfandum beinum, Fms. x. 314: svá þat skylfi af hræðslu, Fbr. 12; s. sundr, <i>to shake so as to burst,</i> Sks. 412; þeyg henni hendr skulfu, Am. 48; hann skalf mjök, Lv. 59; griðkona kom inn ok skalf mjök, Orkn. 326; sá skal vita er á strengnum heldr hvárt hann skelfr, Fb. ii. 129; s. sem hrísla: skjálfandi, <i>shivering;</i> ú-skjálfandi, <i>steady, firm,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalfra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálfra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to shiver, shake;</i> hann skjálfraði allr, Fms. x. 314.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalfta-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálfta-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shivering,</i> Fms. i. 162, Bs. i. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalfta-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálfta-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>not shaking,</i> Bs. ii. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalfti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálfti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(skálpti), a, m. <i>a shivering, shaking,</i> Orkn. 326 (<i>shivering from cold</i>), Gullþ. 8: pass., land-s., jarð-s., <i>an earthquake.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalg-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálg-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(spelt skjágleiki), m. <i>wryness,</i> Rb. 476.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjalgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjálgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. [Engl. <i>shallow,</i> although in an altered sense]:—<i>wry, oblique;</i> með skjálgum skotum, Sks. 383: the phrase, skjóta augum í skjálg, <i>to look askance,</i> Fbr. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (the older form was prob. ské, analogous to lé, klé, q. v.):—<i>a window</i> (the opening). In old dwellings the openings were round, fitted with a hoop or frame (called skjá-grind), which had a membrane (skjall) stretched over it, and this was used instead of glass, and could be taken out at pleasure-; such windows are still found in Icel. farm-houses, all such openings being in the roof, not in the walls, cp. Nj. ch. 78 (init.); and when the frame was taken out, these openings served as outlets for smoke. In some instances skjár seems to be used synonymously with ljóri (q. v.); the hlið-skjár (q. v.), or <i>‘side-skjar,’</i> would then answer to the window or opening in mod. Icel. dwellings; hristust skjáir (<i>chimney-pot</i> = mod. strompr. q. v.)á húsum sem fyrir vindi hvössum, Ann. 1341; Þorbjörn þreif upp stokk ok reisti undir skjáinn ok fór þar út, Gullþ. 19; taka af skjána ok láta leggja út reykinn, Fbr. 99 new Ed.; ef menn sitja í húsum þeim er skjáir eru á, þá er svá ljóst inni, at hverr maðr kennir annan, Sks. 47 new Ed.; konungr hafði gört skjá fyrir stofuna, Fms. vii. 34; fara upp á stofuna ok taka af skjáinn (i. e. <i>the frame</i>), Fbr. 170; hann kastaði því inn um skjáinn, Fas. ii. 81; brutu þeir stofuna um skjána, Sturl. i. 168; hlið-skjár, Sturl. ii. 85; hann hlörar við hliðskjáinn er á var stofunni, Bs. i. 628: the phrase, nú gengr eigi skjall á skjá, N. G. L. i. 384 (see skjall); krumminn á skjá, skjá, skekr belgi þrjá, a nursery rhyme.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjáta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a piece of scorched skin;</i> skinn-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjatla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjátla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, impers. mér skjátlar, <i>one falters, misses;</i> see skjóplast.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a skin bag,</i> N. G. L. ii. 248.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjoda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjóða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to skauð], <i>a small skin-bag,</i> H. E. i. 473, Edda ii. 314, 430; nafra-s., skjóðu skrúð, Fms. vi. 374, freq. in mod. usage. <strong>skjóðu-pungr,</strong> m. <i>a skin-purse,</i> Þjorf. Karl. 374.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
