          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dappled, skewball,</i> of cattle; rauð-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjoldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjöldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. skjaldar, dat. skildi; an old dat. in poets skjaldi,—hj<i>ald</i>rs á mínum skj<i>ald</i>i, Eb. 27 new Ed. (in a verse); h<i>ald</i>orð í bug skj<i>ald</i>i, Fms. vi. (in a verse); h<i>ald</i>ir fast ok skj<i>ald</i>i, Kormak: plur. skildir; acc. skjöldu, mod. skildi: [Ulf. <i>skildus</i> = θυρεός, Ephes. vi. 16; Dan. <i>skjold</i>; Swed. <i>sköld;</i> common to all Teut. languages: it is commonly derived from skjól, <i>shelter,</i> although the short root vowel and the final <i>d</i> of <i>skild</i> speak against this: ‘skillingr’ or ‘skildingr’ (<i>a shilling</i>) may be a derivative from <i>‘skildus,’</i> from the shape, and from the painted or scratched ‘ring’ on the shields; see below: in fact, an old poet (Bragi) calls the shield ‘the penny of the hall of Odin.’]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjoldungar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjöldungar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. the famous lineage of the kings of Denmark, from Skjöld, the son of Odin, Edda, Yngl. S. The Danish legend derives the name from his being found in infancy in a bed of reeds to which he had floated on a shield; but in fact the name is derived from the ancient Teutonic custom of electing the king by lifting him on a shield in the assembly. <strong>Skjöldunga-ætt,</strong> f. <i>the kin of the S.,</i> Fas. ii. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjoldungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjöldungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a bird, <i>the sheldrake,</i> from the shield-like band across his breast, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skjolug-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skjölug-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>wordiness.</i> Fas. iii. 372, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sko"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sko
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "interj. <i>see! behold!</i> qs. skoða, skoðaðu.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Swed. <i>skåda;</i> early Dan. <i>skode;</i> the Germ. <i>schauen</i> and Goth. <i>skawjan</i> are kindred words]:—<i>to look after, view;</i> skoða augum, Hm. 7, Skíða R. 196; er málit var skoðat, Grett. 102 A, H. E. i. 387; veri sýslumaðr skyldr at s. þetta á hverjum tólf mánuðum, Gþl. 526; s. nauðsyn mannsins, K. Á. 76; svá at vér allir megim s. hvárt …, Dipl. ii. 14; höfu vér iðuliga skoðat hana, <i>revised it</i> (the book), Gpl. (pref. v); hón býðr at s. í höfði honum, Ld. 156; at líta ok eptir at s. um landamerki, Dipl. ii. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skodan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoðan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a viewing,</i> Stj. 299, H. E. i. 584, Bs. i. 703; undir skoðan ok yfir-sjón Gunnsteins ábóta, Dipl. iii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoffin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoffin
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. an animal, said to be <i>a hybrid between a she-cat and a fox,</i> Ísl. i. 612.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skokkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a trunk, chest;</i> skokkr var á gólfi, <i>a carpenter’s chest,</i> Rm. 15; þeir höfðu með sér skokka (skrokka Cod.) ok í dýra-merg, Þorf. 430, v. l.: <i>a ship’s hulk,</i> Fms. vi. 141, 252 (in a verse), Orkn. 104 (in a verse), Pd. 20, 38: mod. skrokkr = <i>a trunk.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skol
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., qs. skvál, [Engl. <i>scullery</i>], <i>washing water.</i> <strong>skola-vatn,</strong> n. <i>scullery water.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skol-beinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skol-beinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>brown-legged,</i> a nickname, Fms. x. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skol-brunn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skol-brúnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. the etymology and exact sense of this word is uncertain, either from skol and brúnn = <i>scullery-brown,</i> or from skálpr or skolptr, qs. <i>‘scalp-brown’ swarthy,</i> perhaps the latter; svarteygr ok s., Eg. 305; svartr á hár, skarpleitr, nökkut s., Orkn. 66; nökkut s., hvítr á hár ok rétthár, Glúm. 335; s. ok skarpleitr, Sd. 147; hárr í skeggi ok s. mjök, Ld. 274; rauðbleikr á hár, skolbrúnn, eygðr mjök ok vel, Eb. 30; Hallfreðr var s. nökkut, jarpr á hár, Fs. 86; rauðskeggjaðr, skol-brúnn. ok heldr íllmannligr, 101, Hem. (of earl Tosti).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skola"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skola
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to wash;</i> skola handklæði, H. E. i. 489; s. í vatni, MS. 544. 39; sjór skolar kjöl, Edda (in a verse): impers., skolar til hafs öllu ór skipinu, <i>it was all washed away,</i> Sturl. i. 120; alda skolar kjöl, Edda ii. 492 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skola-klerkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skola-klerkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘school-clerk,’ scholar,</i> Bs. i. 793, Mar., D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoll-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoll-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>guileless,</i> Sighvat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoll-valdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoll-valdr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a skulker, deceiver,</i> one of the names of Odin, Edda (Gl.); but more probably belonging to some ancient fable about Reynard the fox.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoll-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoll-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>skulking, wily,</i> Hkv. 1. 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skollir, skolli, skollat, <i>to hang over, dangle;</i> belg þann er skollir með skrám, Hm. 135; þar er þú skollir við ský uppi, Vkv. 35; Bjarni skoldi við tré, <i>dangled in the tree,</i> Fms. vi. 304 (in a verie); gull-mörkuð vé skollu (skolldu), <i>the standard floated,</i> Fagrsk. (in a verse); ek læt skeiðr skolla við sker, <i>I make the ships hover among the skerries,</i> Fms vi. (in a verse); létum tjöldut skip s. fyrir landi, <i>we made the ships hover off the ness,</i> Sighvat: in mod. usage, treyjan (<i>the coat</i>) skollir upp á herðar blöðum, of a short, ill-fitting jacket.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolla-braekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolla-brækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>devil’s breeks:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolla-fingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolla-fingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "botan. = <i>lycopodium selago,</i> a kind of fern:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolla-fotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolla-fótr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., botan. = <i>equisetum, horse-tail,</i> a plant akin to the ferns:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolla-hraki"
