        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (see above):",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolla-reipi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolla-reipi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., botan. <i>‘devil’s rope,’ the bramble,</i> = <i>rubus:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the ‘skulker,’ a fox, Reynard,</i> Edda (Gl.); esp. used in nursery tales and in games, e. g. <strong>skolla-leikr,</strong> <i>the fox-game, blind-man’s-buff,</i> in which every man in turn pats the skolli (<i>the blindfolded man</i>) on the shoulder, shouting, klukk, klukk, skolli minn, klukk, klukk! and then turns round; hann hleypr upp at selinu ok spurði hvárt skolli væri inni, <i>whether the fox were in?</i> Ld. 278, Sturl. iii. 218; hann gaf stór högg á dyrnar ok spurði hvárt skolli væri inni …,—answer, Inni er skolli ok ekki hræddr | bittu til þess að hann er klæddr, Safn i. 53: in the phrase, skella skolla-eyrunum við e-u, <i>to turn a ‘fox-ear’ (deaf-ear) to a thing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skollkini"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skollkini
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Engl. <i>skulk</i>], poët. <i>a wolf,</i> Edda (Gl.); no doubt akin to skolli.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skollr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ivar Aasen <i>skæll</i> = <i>a fog</i>], = skolli, <i>a fox,</i> Edda ii. 490.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skolp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skolp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., qs. skvalp, [cp. Dan. <i>squalpe</i>], <i>scullery water.</i>",
            }
