        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a top</i> (?), a nickname, Sturl. iii. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skopt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skopt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., better <strong>skoft,</strong> mod. <strong>skott,</strong> q. v.; [Ulf. <i>skufts</i> = τρίχες; O. H. G. <i>skuft;</i> Germ. <i>schopf</i>]:—<i>hair;</i> skopt heitir hár, Edda 109; skopt it svarta, Fbr. (in a verse); þó heilagt skopt, Edda (in a verse); only in poets; it remains in the pr. name <strong>Skopti,</strong> Hkr., Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skopta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skopta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skopti, skopta, <i>to float atop</i> (like hair); skopta ek upp, <i>I rose to the surface, emerged,</i> Fbr., Fb. ii. 215 (in a verse); this certainly is the sense, and not as explained in Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skor
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. skorar, <i>a score, notch, incision;</i> setja þrjár skorar á dyra-stoð, N. G. L. i. 55; bera, þola skor, <i>to ‘thole a score,’ stand a cut,</i> of a good silver coin (bad coins were merely silvered over), Grág. i. 392, 500; hvítr í skor, <i>white in the cut,</i> of silver, Hkr. i. 185.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skor-bildr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skor-bíldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a score-axe,</i> Km. (for skeribíldr); in the phrase, skor-bíldar ganga í e-u, <i>the axe has been shaving off much,</i> i. e. <i>we have had great losses,</i> Ld. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skor-kvikindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skor-kvikindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an insect,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skor-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skor-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Germ. <i>schornstein</i>], <i>a cbimney,</i> Fms. xi. 367, Boldt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skora
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a score, notch, incision,</i> passim in mod. usage. <strong>skoru-kefli,</strong> n. <i>a ‘score-stick,’ tally</i> (used in keeping accounts); þó skal búandi hverr augljós nef hafa á bryggju-sporði á skorukefli fyrir ármann, <i>each franklin</i> (in paying his levy) <i>is to shew his tally to the king’s steward,</i> N. G. L. i. 200.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skora-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skora
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (but skorðu, Gs. 14), [Engl. <i>to score</i>], <i>to make a score, incision;</i> járnin skoruðu mjök at beini, Fms. xi. 288; af annan fótinn en skoraði mjök annan, Sturl. ii. 158; þar skorðu vit (<i>we scored</i>) blóð ór benjum, Gs. 14; þeir skora sundr vegginn með bolöxum, Al. 148; skora sundr í miðju, Fas. iii. 343; þeir skoruðu af spjótskapti (<i>scored a piece off</i>) ok görðu þar af hæl, Slurl. ii. 181; þeir skora fætr á fílunum þar til er þeir falla, Al. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a scoring;</i> þriggja marka ból at s., D. N. iv. 279; á-skoran, <i>a challenge.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skorða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to prop;</i> þvertré er skorða staflægjur, Hom. 96: of a ship, skorða skip, Hbl. 39, Sd. 141, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skorða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a stay, prop,</i> esp. under a ship or boat when ashore, Grág. ii. 39;, Edda 91; setja skorður undir skip. Fms. x. 98: metaph., reisa (setja) rammar skorður við, <i>to put a stop to, take precautions against,</i> Eb. 262, Nj. 88, Fms. vii. 28; vera (standa) í skorðum, <i>to be well propped, all right.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorin-ordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skorin-orðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [from skora ll. 2], <i>clear-spoken;</i> heill ok s., Hom. 114, Mar.: mod. <i>out-spoken,</i> tala skorinort, <i>to speak out.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skorningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a strip of cloth,</i> Vm. 127, Pm. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoron"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skoron
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a pomegranate, ‘malo-granata,’</i> Stj. 391 (Numb. xx. 5).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skorpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>skorpe</i>], <i>a crust,</i> as a nickname, Fms. vii. 304; skorpu-skalli, a nickname, 253: = skerpa (q. v.), vinna skorpu, í einni skorpu.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorpinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
