        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shooting of fire,</i> of Greek fire, Fms. vii. 97, Fb. ii. 299, Þiðr. 179, Fas. iii. 90: mod. <i>bombardment.</i>",
            }
