          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skráma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [Dan. <i>skramme</i>], <i>a scar,</i> Grett. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skramr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrámr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Swed. <i>skrämma</i> = <i>to scare</i>], the name of a monster giant.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrapr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrápr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [akin to skrapa], <i>a shark’s skin, shagreen,</i> Ísl. ii. 113; skráp-skór, <i>shoes of shark’s skin:</i> <strong>skrápi,</strong> a nickname, Fms. viii. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skref"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skref
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>skrev</i>], <i>a pace;</i> á hlaupanda skrefi, Sks. 374; í einu skrefi, Þiðr. 99; taka skref mikit, Grett. 153 A: as a measure = Lat. <i>passus,</i> Rb. 482, MS. 732. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrefa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to stride,</i> Pr. 415, Mar. 1055, Bs. ii. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [skríða], <i>a shoal of fish</i> (A. S. <i>scâlu;</i> provinc. Engl. <i>school</i>), this is the Norwegian sense, see Ström Söndmor’s Beskr. i. 317; hence, skreið varga, <i>a flock of wolves:</i> þar dreif at honum varga skreið mikil, Bret. 150; this sense is obsolete in Icel., where it is only used of",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreid-fiski"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreið-fiski
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fishing</i> (skreið = <i>a shoal</i>); hann hafði menn sína í síldveri ok svá í skreiðfiski, Eg. 42; hann hafði menn í s. í Vágum, en suma í síldfiski, 68, Gullþ. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreid-faeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreið-færi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>implements for snow-travelling,</i> Fms. viii. 400.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreid-ver"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreið-ver
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = skreiðfiski; skreiðver ok síldver, Eg. 42, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreidask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreiðask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, dep. [skríða], <i>to creep, slink;</i> s. ór rúmi, Lv. 60; s. fyrir borð, Nj. 136; skreiðisk hón undan höfði honum, Ld. 156, Stj. 418; hann skreiddisk fram með landinu, Fms. viii. 437; hann skreiðisk upp með berginu, Róm. 148; s. aptr af hestinum, <i>to slip down,</i> Fs. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreidi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreiði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = skreiðfæri; ef maðr tekr s. manns ef hann ferr til þings, N. G. L. i. 227.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreidingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreiðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a subterfuge</i> (?), Sturl. iii. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sliding;</i> in ör-skreiðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrenkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrenkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Engl. <i>shrunk</i>], a nickname, Ann. 1184.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>skreppe;</i> Engl. <i>scrip</i>], <i>a scrip, bag,</i> Stj. 464, 616, Fms. vi. 374, viii. 26, Barl. 104, Skíða R. (of the beggar’s skrip): allit., stafr ok s., of pilgrims; taka staf ok skreppu ok fara til Jórsala, H. E. i. 243, Fms. vi. 303, Fagrsk. 93, Karl. 467 (v. l.), Symb. 17: <i>a mouse-trap,</i> sem mús í skreppu, Fms. vii. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreppa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skrapp, skruppu; subj. skryppi; part. skroppinn:—<i>to slip;</i> skruppu honum fætr, <i>his feet slipped,</i> Fms. viii. 75, 393, Nj. 114; honum urðu lausar hendrnar ok skruppu af fanga-stakkinum, <i>the hands slipped, lost hold,</i> Ísl. ii. 447; ermarnar skruppu af höndunum fram, Fms. viii. 358, v. l.; skruppu ór tennr fjórar, Skíða R. 142.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreyja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>skryde</i>], <i>a brayer</i> (?), <i>bragger,</i> a nickname, Hkr. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [s-kraut], <i>to ornament, dress fine;</i> skylda ek skreyta (= Dan. <i>pynte</i>), Gkv. 1. 9; skreytask við körlum, <i>to dress fine to please the men,</i> Bs. i. 453; skreyttr inum beztum klæðum, Fms. i. 149; skreytt orð, Róm. 301; s. sína undir-hyggju, Magn. 484.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreyting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreyting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>ornament, embellishment,</i> Stj. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skreytinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skreytinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [prop. <i>adorned in one’s speech,</i> cp. Dan. <i>forblommet</i>]:—<i>untruthful;</i> and <strong>skreytni,</strong> f. <i>a falsehood.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skribla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skribla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. from <i>the grating</i> sound (?), the name of a hot spring near Reykholt in Iceland.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrid-bytta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrið-bytta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a lantern.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrid-kvikendi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrið-kvikendi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., collect. <i>creeping things, reptiles, worms,</i> etc. (Dan. <i>kryb</i>), Stj. 19, 317, Fb. ii. 78; foglar, ferfætingar ok s. jarðar, Post. 656 C. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrid-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrið-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>creeping;</i> s. kvikendi, <i>a reptile,</i> Stj. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrid-ljos"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrið-ljós
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘creeping light,’ lantern,</i> Nj. 153, Ám. 6, Fms. iv. 168 (skrilljós), xi. 66, Bs. i. 635, Thom. 455.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrid-ormr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrið-ormr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘creeping worm,’ reptile,</i> Konr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. pl. skriðna, Ann. 1171; [skríða]:—<i>a land-slip,</i> on a hill-side; fyrir skriðum eða vatna-gangi, Grág. i. 219; skriða brast upp í fjallit, Fb. ii. 72; hljóp skriða á bæinn, Hrafn. 1; skriða hljóp í Geitdal, Ann. 1186; hljóp ofan skriða mikil með grjóti ok leiri, Hkr. i. 47; í þessi skriðu týndisk Magnúss, of an avalanche, Bs. i. 640: also used of the black streaks on a mountain-side from old slips, hann keyrir undir honum hestinn upp á skriðuna, Bs. i. 625; er hann kom á skriðu þá er Geirvör heitir, Eb. 218, 226, 232, Sturl. iii. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skridna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriðna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to slip, slide,</i> Bret. 92, Fb. i. 414, ii. 87, Mar. 1146; þá fellr torfa ór garðinum ok skriðnar hann, Ísl. ii. 357; skriðnaði hann öðrum fæti, Edda 77; skriðnuðu honum fætr, Fas. ii. 135; þá skriðnar þat á brott, <i>slips away,</i> Mar.; hvers manns líkami skriðnar í jörðina, 656 C. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skridnan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriðnan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a slipping,</i> Bs. ii. 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skridr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. skriðar, <i>a creeping</i> or <i>sliding motion,</i> of a reptile; beina þeir sinn skrið, Stj. 98; til skriðsins ok rásarinnar, id.: of a ship, vóru þeir Gunnsteinn langt komnir er skriðr var á skipi Þóris, Ó. H. 137; á skip skal skriðar orka, Hm. 81; tók skridinn af skipinu, <i>the ship stopped,</i> Fms. ii. 305; þegar er festi ok skriðinn tók af, vi. 168; með fullum skrið, Bs. ii. 30; tekr nú buzan góðan skrið, 47; frýr skutrinn skriðar, Grett. 125; renna á, skrið, <i>to slide,</i> of a sledge, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skridu-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriðu-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an avalanche,</i> Ann. 1390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skridu-hjalli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
