          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrimta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, = skolla; jamt læt ek við ský skrimta, Sd. (in a verse): in mod. usage, það skrimtir við að tarna (= Dan. <i>slæber af</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skringi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skringi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>strange, grotesque;</i> s. búningr, Fas. iii. 653 (v. l.), freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skript"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skript
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> <strong>skrift,</strong> f. [skrifa], <i>a picture, drawing, tapestry;</i> skjöldrinn var skrifaðr fornsögum, en allt milli skriptanna vóru lagðar yfir spengr af gulli, i. e. <i>the subjects represented on the shield were separated by golden spangles,</i> Eg. 698; höfðu vit á skriptum þat er skatar léku, ok á hannyrðum hilmis þegna, of tapestry, Gkv. 2. 15; seglit var sett með fögrum skriptum, Fms. x. 77, see the remarks s. v. segl; hence a sail is poët. called hún-skript, <i>the ‘mast-picture,’</i> Fms. ix. (in a verse): <i>a painted tablet</i> in a church, í krossum, líkneskjum, skriptum, Bs i. 132; stendr frúin frammi fyrir skriptinni með hreinum bænum, Mar.; Maríu-skript, Ólafs-s., Þorláks-s., Jóns-s., Andreas-s., Cecileu-s., <i>the picture of the Virgin Mary, St. Olave, Thorlak, John,</i> etc., Vm., D. I. i. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skript-bera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skript-bera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "bar, <i>to bring to confession;</i> s. synd, <i>to shrive a sin,</i> H. E. i. 484; skript-borinn, <i>confessed.</i> 483.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skript-rof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skript-rof
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the breach of a penance,</i> K. Á. 148, N. G. L. i. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skript-rofa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skript-rofa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-rofi,</strong> K. Á. 148), <i>failing to fulfil one’s penance;</i> verða s., N. G. L. i. 152, 429.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to shrive, hear confession;</i> gékk biskup til Ásbjarnar ok skriptaði honum, Ó. H. 118; sá maðr er skriptað var, K. Á. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-bod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-boð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an episcopal ordinance as to shrift,</i> D. I. i, MS. 655 xi. 2, 673. 61.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-dottir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-dóttir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘shrift-daughter,’ a female confessor,</i> H. E. ii. 190.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-fadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-faðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘shrift-father,’ confessor,</i> Karl. 545, Bs. i. 440.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unshriven,</i> Fms. viii. 103, MS. 655 xxiv. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man under penance,</i> Bs. i. 855.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
