            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripta-prestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skripta-prestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘shrift-priest,’ confessor,</i> Fms. v. 214.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skriptar-ganga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriptar-ganga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>confession,</i> Hom. 79, Fms. viii. 114.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skriptar-gangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skriptar-gangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. id., Fms. iii. 175, v. 219, Sturl. ii. 34, Gþl. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrida-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skríða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "skríð, skreið, skriðu, skriðinn; neg. suff. skríði-at, Hkv. 2. 30, [Dan. <i>skride;</i> Germ. <i>schreiten</i>]:—<i>to creep, crawl,</i> of reptiles; hvert kvikendi þat er skríðr á jörðu, Stj. 317; hann brast í orms líki ok skreið í nafars-raufina, Edda 49; þá er hann (the serpent Fáfnir) skreið til vatns, Sæm. 133; þeir skríða á húðinni, Stj. 98; skriðit um lyng, Fms. vii. 251: of vermin, skríða kvikr, see kvikr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrikja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skríkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [Engl. <i>shrike</i>], <i>a shrieker;</i> in the compd, sól-s., <i>the shrike</i> or <i>butcher-bird,</i> Eggert Itin. 582.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skríll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Skrælingi; Dan. <i>skræl</i> = <i>parings of apples, potatoes</i>]:—<i>a mob,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrím
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. skími and skrímta], <i>a glimpse;</i> með svá miklu myrkri, … sá ekki skrím úti heldr en menn væri blindir, Ann. 1341; náliga myrkt útan þat lítið sk(r)ím, Mar. 1051.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrimingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrímingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skrím; þar í afhaugnum var s. lítill sá, Ísl. ii. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrimsl-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrímsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>skrímsli,</strong> n. [cp. Dan. <i>skræmsel;</i> Swed. <i>skrämsel</i> = <i>scarecrow</i>]:—<i>a monster;</i> s. heldr enn menn, Al. 94, Mar. 1158; kyn fiska eðr s., Sks. 74: hann ærðisk at skrímsli nökkuru, Bs. i. 170; hljópu þeir upp allir ok lutu því skrímsli, Ó. H. 109; eitt s. er menn kalla margygi, Sks. 169; Skrímslið góða, <i>the good Beast,</i> in the tale of Beauty and the Beast; sjó-s., <i>a sea-monster.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrín
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., skríni. Bs. i. 134 (paper MS), [Lat. <i>scrinium</i>], <i>a shrine,</i> of a saint, 124, 134, Ó. H. 235, 246, passim: poët., skyja skrín, byr-s., leiptra-s., <i>the shrine of the clouds, wind, lightning,</i> i. e. <i>the heavens,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrin-brot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrín-brot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a broken shrine,</i> Pm. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrin-dukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrín-dúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shrine-cover,</i> Dipl. v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrin-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrín-görð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a shrine-making,</i> Bs. i. 134, 325.",
            }
