        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "lagði, <i>to enshrine,</i> Magn. 512.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrin-smidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrín-smiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a shrine-smith,</i> Sturl. i. 146, Bs i. 144.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrína
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a shrine-shaped chest,</i> in which fishermen keep butter and the like; matar-s., smjör-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripa-hofud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrípa-höfuð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a monster-head,</i> Mag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripa-lat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrípa-lát
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. (mod. <strong>skrípa-læti</strong>), <i>buffoonery, scurrilous gestures,</i> Fms. viii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripa-tal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrípa-tal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>scurrilous language.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrípi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mostly only in plur. <i>a grotesque monster, a goblin, phantom</i> (with notion of absurdity, unreality, scurrility); stundum dreki, stundum ormr eðr önnur skaðsamlig skrípi, Fas. iii. 342; verði s. ok undr mikit, Nj. 20; skí ok s., Gsp.; þegar myrkva tók, sýndisk honum hverskyns skrípi, Grett. 115: þeir þoldu mikla skömm ok s., Stj. 436; hann var fjölkunnigr ok görði mörg s. ok undr, Bret. 14; þessu kvikendi … er þetta s. berr, glæpafull s., Gd. 3, Fas. iii. 620; ek hefi eigi séð meira s. en þú ert, 654; sel-s., <i>a monster seal;</i> orða-s., <i>scurrilous language, buffoonery.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrípindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = skrípi, Post. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skripr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrípr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a monster,</i> Edda 238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skriti-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skríti-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>adv. funnily, merrily.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skriti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skríti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>funny, amusing.</i> This word and derivatives, which are very freq. in mod. usage, seem not to occur in old writers, unless it be Post. 26 (paper MS.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skritinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrítinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>funny, witty, full of humour;</i> segja skrítna sögu, það er skrítin saga; or of persons, hann er smá-skrítinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skritlur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrítlur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>merry tales, oddities,</i> = Germ. <i>schwänke.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to skulk</i> like a coward (skræva); þeir sóttu at Kormaki, Narfi skrjáði um it ytra, Korm. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrjafa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrjáfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to clatter like shrivelled skin.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrjodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrjóðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>dis-skreitan</i> = διαρρηγνύναι; A. S. <i>screadian;</i> Engl. <i>shred,</i> i. e. <i>to cut into small pieces;</i> to this root belong the Icel. skrjóðr, skrydda, skræða]:—<i>a shred</i>, see Bs. i. 76, v. l.: chiefly used of <i>an old folio torn to shreds.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrjupr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrjúpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ivar Aasen <i>skryp;</i> Swed. <i>skröplig;</i> Dan. <i>skröbelig</i>]:—<i>brittle, frail,</i> Merl. 1. 65, Skálda 202 (in a verse): as a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skrof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skrof
        </a>
