        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuldingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skuldingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the nearest of kin on whom the duty of alimentation devolves;</i> þá á til síns skuldingja hverr at hverfa, Grág. i. 250.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuldu-nautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skuldu-nautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., prop. <i>a customer,</i> used of <i>a creditor,</i> N. G. L. i. 51: of <i>a debtor,</i> Grág. ii. 216, Mar. 1202: eccl. in the Lord’s Prayer, fyrir-gef oss vorar skuldir, svo sem vér og fyrir-gefum vorum skuldunautum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuldu-neyti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skuldu-neyti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the relation of debtor and creditor,</i> Lv. 103 (the passage is somewhat corrupt).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuldugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skuldugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Germ. <i>schuldig</i>], <i>in debt, owing;</i> s. e-m e-t (or um e-t), Dipl. iv. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skulka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skulka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to mock,</i> = skelka, Post. 119, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skulu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skulu
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a verb whose present is in a preterite form, see Gramm. p. xxiii; pres. skal, skalt (skaltú), skal, pl. skulum, skulut, skulu; pret. skyldi and skyldu; subj. pres. skyli, skuli; pret. skyldi and skyldu; pres. infin, skulu; pret. infin. skyldu; skyli as a kind of imperat., Hm. i, 14, 32, 41, 53–55, Og. 22. In the oldest vellums <i>o</i> is used throughout instead of <i>u,</i> skolu, skolom, skolot, skolo: with the pers. pron. suffixed, skal’k = skal ek, skola’g, skyla’g, skylda’g: with neg. suff. skal’k-at, <i>I shall not;</i> skal’k-a, Fms. vi. 417 (in a verse); skal-at, <i>he shall not;</i> skal-a, Hm. 29, 34, 37; skal-at, Ó. H. (in a verse); þú skalt-at, Kormak; skal-at-tu, Hm. 130, Sdm. 29, Skv. 1. 22, Plac. 37 (skala-þu); skulu-t, Sighvat; skyli-t, Hm. 6, 39; skyldo-at, Am. 2, 3, see Bugge (foot-note), and -at, p. 2. In mod. usage and in less correct paper transcripts of vellums or Editions the pret. infin. skulu, skyldu are replaced by the subj. skuli, skyldi; in such cases the infin. is to be restored, as, hann kvaðsk skuli, skyldi koma = skulu, skyldu koma; see munu: [Ulf. <i>skulan</i> = ὀφείλειν and μέλλειν, but not freq.; A. S. <i>sculon;</i> Engl. <i>shall, should;</i> O. H. G. <i>skolan;</i> Germ. <i>sollen,</i> with elided <i>k;</i> Dutch <i>zullen;</i> Dan. <i>skulle;</i> Swed. <i>skola</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skuma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= skima; hafr er úti hvítr í túni, skumir augum. Hem.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skumpr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skumpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>skunpr,</strong> m. <i>a boar,</i> Edda (Gl.): <strong>skuppr,</strong> a word of abuse, Skáld H.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skunda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skunda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to speed,</i> = skynda; with dat., hón skyldi skunda prestinum til sín, <i>forward the priest at once,</i> Str. 76; skunda ferð sinni, Fms. ix. 298; skunda fé saman, <i>to make a collection,</i> v. 216.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skundan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skundan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a speeding,</i> Stj. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skundi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skundi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>speed;</i> með skunda, Fms. ii. 223, vii. 134, Stj. 479.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skunza"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skunza
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [cp. Engl. <i>shunt</i>]<i>, to shake, ruffle;</i> eptir þat skunzaði Einarr honum í svölunum, D. N. ii. 295.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skupla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skupla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a woman’s hood hiding</i> or <i>shading the face,</i> chiefly worn by old women; skuplu ok skammfyllingar = <i>‘velamen oculorum’</i> of the Vulgate, Stj. 127. Gen. xx. 16, freq. in mod. usage; enda er faldrinn yðar fallegr, það er munr að sjá krókfaldana en skuplurnar sem ekki eru fyrir aðrar en afgamlar kerlinga-hrotur, … hafði hún ekki gáð að því að Ingveldr var þar ok hafði skuplu, Piltr og Stúlka 34; see skypill.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skura"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skura
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [skera], <i>a score, trench;</i> skurn ok skurur, Karl. 279; engar skurur (<i>diggings?</i>) skulu þeir göra út í megin-forsinn frá veiði herra Finns, D. N. iv. 156.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurd-god"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurð-goð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>skurð-guð,</strong> n., spelt <strong>skurgoð</strong> and sounded <strong>skúrgoð,</strong> <i>a carven image.</i> Fms. x. 255, 318, Stj. 102, 181, Pass. 26. 5; heiðin skurðgoð, Fms. i. 97; hof yðvart ok skurðgoð, 623. 24; skurðguðir, MS. 4. 31; skurgoð, 623. 24, 45, Rb. 400; skurgoð, skurgoðinu, skurgoðs, Stj. 311, 312, Barl. 124; skurðgoða blót, <i>idolatry,</i> Stj. 26. 404, Fas. iii. 672; skurðgoða dýrkan (mod. skúrgoða-dýrkan), <i>idolatry;</i> skurðgoða-villa, id., Nj. 164, Fms. i. 282, Edda (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurd-hagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurð-hagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>skilled in carving,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurdar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurðar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a carver,</i> Grág. ii. 370, Jb. 324.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurdar-skirn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurðar-skírn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>circumcision,</i> Stj. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurdar-ol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurðar-öl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>harvest-ale,</i> D. N. ii. 673.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. skurðar, pl. skurðir, [skera], <i>a scoring, cutting, carving;</i> skurð ok skipti á hvalnum, Grett. 88 A; hón (the church) á skurð (<i>has a share of whales</i> driven ashore) um öll þing sín … ok skurð í öllum þeim rekum, er…, Ám. 3, Pm. 133; manns-hlut í flutningu ok fullan skurð, Ám. 33; kirkja á skurð fullan milli Ormsár ok Tungu-reka af hverjum hval sem kemr, Pm. 69: of cutting peat, skurðr torfs, Dipl. iii. 6; göra skurði um torfvöllu, iv. 12: <i>a cut, wound,</i> skera sig djúpan skurð, þver-s.: fé til skurðar, <i>cattle for slaughtering,</i> Fms. vii. 218, viii. 60; skurðar-fé, <i>sheep fit for slaughter.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurfir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurfir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>bird,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurfur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurfur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>scurf on the head,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to roll off with a rattle and noise;</i> lét hann s. út, <i>let him roll out,</i> i. e. <i>flung him out.</i> Fas. ii. 341.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurmsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurmsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., mod. <strong>skurmr,</strong> n. <i>an egg-shell,</i> = skuru, Mork. 220, see Fms. vii. 225, l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (cp. Fas. iii. 215, Clar., but erroneously), <i>an egg-shell</i> or <i>nut-shell:</i> ostram, þat köllu vér skurn eðr skel, Stj. 88; hafði konungr skurnit (sic) fyrir borðker, Fas. iii. 215; eggit, var brotin rauf á skurninni, id.; skurn ok kjarni, Karl. 279; egg-skurn, <i>an egg-shell,</i> Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurtla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skurtla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dimin. <i>to graze, cut slightly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skussa-legr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skussa-legr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>slovenly, weak.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skussa-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skussa-skapr
