        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>slovenliness, sluggishness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skussi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skussi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [see skyrsi], <i>a slovenly follow;</i> þú ert mesti skussi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-breidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-breiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>broad-sterned,</i> Thom. 378.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-bryggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-bryggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a stern-gangway,</i> by which people went on board or went ashore. Fms. vii. 143, Eg. 121, Fbr. 130.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-byggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-byggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-byggvi</strong>), a, m. <i>the ‘stern-mates.’</i> the sailors set in the stern of a ship, Fms. vi. 143, viii. 224.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-festr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-festr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a cable from the stern, stern-moorings;</i> bera á land skutfestar, <i>to take the stern-moorings ashore.</i> Fms. vii. 260, viii. 216.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-menni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-menni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., Sturl. ii. 192, v. l. (prob. only a had reading).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-stafn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-stafn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-stamn</strong>), m. <i>the ‘tail-stem,’ the stern,</i> Fms. ii. 71, vii. 256, x. 348, xi. 110, Ld. 76, MS. 656 C. 22, N. G. L. i. 203, ii. 283; opp. to framstafn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skut-thilja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skut-þilja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the poop-deck;</i> jamlangt stýri, aust-keri ok skutþilju, N. G. L. i. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutil-diskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skutil-diskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [see skutill II], <i>plates on which dishes were served.</i> Eg. 238, Þiðr. 87, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skutill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., dat. skutli, [skjóta; cp. End. <i>shuttle</i>]:—<i>an implement shot forth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skutla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [cp. Engl. <i>to scuttle</i> a ship], <i>to harpoon.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutlan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skutlan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a squandering,</i> Dipl. iii. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutlari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skutlari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a harpooner.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skutr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. skutar, pl. skutir, [from skjóta, from shooting or launching a ship into the water, cp. North. E. <i>scut</i> = <i>the tail</i> of hares or rabbits]:—<i>the stern,</i> Höfuðl. 1; aptr í skut, Hym. 21; réri Grettir í skut, Grett. 125 A; skaltú ganga at framstafni en ek at skut, Finnb. 254; var rekkju-maðr í skut, Lv. 98; setja augu sín aptr um skut, <i>to look back,</i> Al. 12; hann bað Ketil ganga fyrir skut, ok setja á (<i>and push on</i>) Fas. ii. 112; leggja land fyrir skut, <i>to pass by,</i> Edda (in a verse): in plur. including stem and stern, opp. to midship, skip minna til skutanna en um mitt, Fms. viii. 197; skipit var lítið til skutanna en breitt um miðbyrðit, Grett. 88; í hvárn-tveggja skutinn, O.T. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skua"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [skór], <i>to shoe;</i> vel hosaðr ok skúaðr, Sks. 286; fætr þína skúar þú, Barl. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuf-slitinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúf-slitinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>with the hip out of joint.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = skýfa, Fas. ii, 60; út-skúfa, <i>to turn out.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skufadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúfaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>tasselled;</i> skúfaða skóþvengi, Eb. 220; skildir skúfaðir af skeytum, örum, Fms. ii. 332, ix. 528, x. 361.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skufr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tassel,</i> Eb. 216; dúk með fjórum skúfum, Post. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skulka-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúlka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to mock,</i> = skelkja, Fas. ii. 343.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skumi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>skummel, skumring,</i> = <i>twilight</i>], <i>shade, dusk;</i> dagr myrkra ok skúma, Barl. 37, Sks. 229, v. l. <strong>skúma-skot,</strong> n. <i>the dusk, twilight;</i> þegar í skúma-skotinu, Barl. 190: <i>a dark nook,</i> skríða í skúma-skot, Mar. 1056.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the skua or brown gull, larus catarractes,</i> also called skúfr: metaph. <i>a chatterer, gossip.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., but originally masc. as in other Teut. idioms, which gender is still preserved in the north of Icel.; it is thus masc. in Run. Gramm. Island.; so also Pal Vídal.,—Norðlinga kennum vér af <i>‘generibus vocum’</i> svo sem skúr er hjá þeim karlkennt, en kvennkennt hjá Sunnlingum, Skýr. 126; Runolf, a native of northern Icel., in Gramm. Island., has it masc.; so in later times the poet B. Gröndal, a native of Mývatn, sól og myrka skúra (acc. pl.), in a ditty of 1790. [A. S. <i>scúr:</i> Engl. <i>shower;</i> Germ. <i>schauer</i>]:—<i>a shower;</i> fyrir élum ok skúrum, Hom.; regn eða skúr, Edda i; dropa eða skúrir, 350; þau ský er skúrum blandask, Alm.; skúr, 656 B. 12; blóði hafði rignt í skúrinni, Eb. 260; hvervetna gengu skúrir við annarstaðar í nónd, Bs. i. 339; skúrum ok regnum, Stj. 30; himins í dimmu skúr. Pass.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skur-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúr-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>showery,</i> Rb. 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skur-van"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúr-ván
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the clouds,</i> poët., Alm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skur-ordigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúr-örðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. an epithet of a ship, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skura-drog"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúra-drög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>drizzling.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skura-vedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúra-veðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>showery weather,</i> Ld. 56, Bs. i. 349.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>skur</i>], <i>a shed.</i> <strong>skúr-fjalir,</strong> f. pl. <i>shed-deals,</i> Fms. viii. 329.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> pres. skútir, pret. skútti, <i>to jut out,</i> so as to form a shade or cave, of rocks or the like; fjallit sýnisk skúta yfir fram sjóinn, Fms. x. 313; bjargit skútti yfir fram, vii. 81; þeir (the glaciers) skúttu fram yfir dalinn, Grett. 141 new Ed.; þær (the trees) skúttu svá langt, at lauf þeirra ok limar lágu á jörðu, Konr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>skude</i>], <i>a small craft</i> or <i>cutter;</i> a number of such used to accompany a fleet for use in rivers or on the coasts; they were distinguished from the byrðingar or ships of burden, which carried the supplies; þeir höfðu sex langskip. fimm skútur, en þrjá byrðinga, Orkn. 256; hann fór með skútu alskipaða norðr í Fjörðu, Eg. 155, Fms. i. 60; gakk á skútu er hér liggr útborða langskipinu, Eg. 354; skútur ok róðrar-ferjur, id.: hann hafði skútu er hann átti, ok á þrjá tigi manna, 23; hrundu þeir fram skútu ok hljópu þar á sex karlar, Nj. 18; þá reyri skúta at skipi jarls, Fms. vi. 317: kom borð skútunnar á kinnung karfans, Eg. 386; ganga á skútur ok sigla vestr til Orkneyja, eðr allt til Suðreyja, Fms. viii; skútu góða, réru á borð tíu menn eða tólf, Ó. T.; hann lét búa snekkju tvítug-sessu ok með skútu fimtán-sessu, ok enn vista-byrðing, Fms. vii. 310; skútu fimmtán-sessu með öllum reiða, Hkr. i. 201; hann spurði at Varbelgir vóru fyrir sunnan á þremr skútum, Fms. ix. 474: létti-s., hleypi-s., róðrar-s., lagnar-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skuti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skúti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a cave formed by jutting rocks;</i> hverr s. við annan … þar hittir hvergi skúta, Glúm. 312; inn í bergit er skúti ok fellr þar úr lítill lækr, Ó. T. 26; það er íllr skúti, sem ekki er betri enn úti, a saying; hellis-skúti, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutna-herr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skútna-herr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a fleet of</i> s. (manned); en er skútnaherrinn reyri ofan eptir ánni, Fms. vii. 259, viii. 376, ix. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutna-lid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skútna-lið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the crew on the</i> s., Fms. viii. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutna-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skútna-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skútna-lið, Fms. viii. 376.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skutu-hvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skútu-hvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>whale,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvadra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvaðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a nickname, qs. <strong>skvaldra,</strong> cp. Swed. <i>squallra</i> = <i>a jackdaw,</i> Ann. for Nord. Oldk. 1846, p. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>skvakk,</strong> n. <i>a gurgling sound;</i> hafs-skak, Egilsson’s Poems.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvakka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvakka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to give a sound,</i> as of water shaken in a bottle; sökk öxin ok skvakkaði við, Grett. 16 new Ed., v. l. skvatta, see skvetta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skval"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skval
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Engl. <i>squeal</i> and <i>squall;</i> cp. skjal and sköll]:—<i>a squalling, noisy talk,</i> Edda 110; horna-skvol, Eb. 13 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [North. E. <i>squeal</i>]<i>, to squeal, bawl out;</i> risinn tók at s. með mikilli raust, Fas. ii. 517.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvaldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvaldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>skvalder;</i> Swed. <i>sqvaller</i>], <i>a squalling, bawling,</i> Fms. iv. 112, vi. 287, Bárð. 176.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvaldri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvaldri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘squaller,’ bawler,</i> a nickname, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvali
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., in hornum-skvali, the name of a he-goat, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvampa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvampa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to paddle</i> in water.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvetta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to squirt out, throw out,</i> prop. of the sound of water quickly thrown out of a jug; skvetta úr fötunni, freq. in mod. usage; tók hún vatn úr læknum, ok skvetti framan í það, Kveldv. ii. 176; hann (the brook) skvetti á mig, Jónas 322.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skvettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvettr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a gush of water poured out.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skviari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skvíari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>skýari,</strong> a, m. [French], <i>an esquire,</i> Thom. 100, Dip., v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygdir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in., poët. <i>a sword,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyggdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyggðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [skuggi], <i>bright, polished, transparent,</i> so as to throw a light; dýrs-horn skyggt vel, sá görla í gegnum, Fms. vi. 241, Hkr. i. 90; hjálmr s. sem gler, Fas. i. 138; s. skjöldr, Lex. Poët.; s. steinn, Mar., Magn. 450; í skyggðum línkyrtli, Sturl. i. 96 C; fagr-s., svart-s., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "older <strong>skyggva,</strong> ð, <i>to overshadow;</i> skyflókum skyggðar ok huldar, Stj. 30; þegar skyggva synda-myrkr andar-ljós, Eluc. 17; s. e-t við sólu, <i>to screen it from the sun,</i> Rb. 348; also skyggja fyrir, Sks. 208 B; s. sér við sólar-hita, Rb. 344, Þiðr. 215; skyggja yfir, <i>to overshadow,</i> Luke i. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>seeing;</i> tvan skygn augu, Mar.; skygn báðum augum. Fms. vi. 235; hann hafði fengit sýn sína ok var þá skygn maðr, Ó. H. 224; heil-s., <i>hale-sighted,</i> i. e. <i>with good sight;</i> ú-skygn, <i>dim-sighted.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygn-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygn-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the eyesight,</i> Bs. ii. 148: með hjörtum skygnleik, Ó. H. 251; s. hugskotsins, H. E. i. 511, Nj. 258, Hkr. iii. 367.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to spy, pry;</i> skygna um e-t, <i>to spy after,</i> Sks. 501 B; þar skygnir hverr um annars athæti, 278; s. um siðu sjálfs sín, 9; gakk þú út ok skygn um kaup þín, id., Hom. 46: skygna egg, <i>to hold an egg</i>(fresh from the nest) <i>up to the eye,</i> to see if it is new.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. Germ. <i>scheune</i>]<i>, the shade of a cap.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a looking out,</i> Sks. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skygnur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skygnur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>wide open eyes;</i> Hallbjörn rak þá skygnur á landit, Ld. 154; hann rekr upp skygnurnar, <i>the eyes wide open,</i> Háv. 54; hann hafði síða hettuna ok rak undan skygnur. Band. 16 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skykkjum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skykkjum
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., a dat. pl. [cp. Engl. <i>shock</i>], <i>tremulously;</i> varð landskjálpti mikill, gékk jörðin uudir þeim skykkjum, <i>the earth went rocking under them,</i> of an earthquake, Edda i. 144 (skukkum v. l.); svá gékk skykkjum (skrykkjum the Ed. 34) hallar-gólfit undir fótum honum sem bylgjur á sjó, Konr. (vellum MS.): akin to this is the mod. phrase, e-ð gengr <strong>skrykkjótt,</strong> qs. <strong>skykkjótt,</strong> <i>it goes up and down,</i> i. e. <i>it is rather bad.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. skylr, see skola, [Dan. <i>skylle</i>], <i>to wash;</i> dröfn skylr stál, Edda ii. 493 (in a verse); hefring skylr (skilr Cod.) hlýr, 534.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. another form for skuld (q. v.), <i>a tax, due;</i> með sköttum ok skyldum, Eg. 280: <i>an incumbrance, outgoing,</i> on an estate or the like, hann lagði þessa skyld á heima-land, … bóndi skal greiða, etc., Vm. 112; Heggstaði gaf Herra Ketill með þeirri skyld, at bóndi skal lúka …, 116; sú er skyld á Tjörn, at þar skal vera prestr, Jm. 25; kenni-manna skyld, <i>obligatory maintenance of a person;</i> þar er tveggja presta skyld, Vm. 13; skyldir úloknar, <i>dues unpaid,</i> Gþl. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-bundinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-bundinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>duty-bound,</i> Fms. xi. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-folk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-fólk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>kinsfolk.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>relationship</i>, = skuldleikr, N. G. L. i. 49, Stj., freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>duly, dutifully,</i> Hom. 80; þurfa s., <i>to stand in pressing need of,</i> Grág. i. 334, Fms. viii. 398 (skylliga): <i>becomingly,</i> þó þeir léti s. hvárir við aðra, xi. 108.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>in duty bound,</i> Sks. 45, 636: <i>important, urgent,</i> 686 C. 1, (spelt skylligr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>relations, kinsmen.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = skyldliga, <i>dutifully,</i> Bs. i. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyld-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyld-semi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>relationship;</i> frændsemi eðr s., N. G. L. i. 355.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skylda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skylda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d and að. <i>to bind in duly, oblige, enjoin;</i> allra þeirra orða, er yðr skylda lög til um at bera, Nj. 208; er þá skylda lög til, Grág. i. 8; en þat skyldar mik til at ríta, Bs. i. 59; konungr skyldaði þá til at flytja líkin til graptar, Fms. viii. 231; ek em skyldaðr til at blóta, 656 B. 9; vera til skyldaðr, H. E. i. 471: hverrgi má skylda annan til garðlags, Grág. ii. 262; skylda ek ykkr heldr til þessa enn aðra menn, at …, Fms. i. 189; því skyldi ek þik til blóta, 656 B. 4; hann skyldir mik at fella tár, Eluc. 56; nauðr skyldi yðr til, <i>urged you,</i> Bjarn. 54: láta þeir sem eingu ætti við aðra at skylda, <i>as if they had no concern with one another,</i> Band. 4 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an obligation,</i> Stj. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. skyldri, skylztr, but usually skyldari, skyldastr, see below:—<i>due bounden, obligatory,</i> skyldr þjónustumaðr e-s, Edda 28; vera s. undir stjórn e-s, Sks. 270 B; sá er skylztr at færa lik hans til kirkiu, Grág. i. 192; þú mant þykkja skyldastr at bæta fyrir konu þína, Nj. 76, Fs. 36; vera s. til at göra e-t, Eg. 225; or, s. við at göra e-t, N. G. L. i. 352; skyldr e-s, Fms. ix. 23: of an action, <i>due;</i> veita konungi skylda þjónustu, 432; skylt tal, <i>a due, proper talk,</i> Sks. 12; ú-skylt tal, <i>uncalled-for, out of the way talk:—pressing, urgent,</i> skyld nauðsyn, Gþl. 266, skylt erendi, Eg. 29, Ld. 176; mitt erindi þykki mér skyldast, Fms. vi. 205: of debt, <i>due, owing;</i> vera e-m skyldr um e-t, <i>to owe to another.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-embaetti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-embætti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = skyldarembætti, Sks. 126.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-hjon"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-hjón
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. = skuldahjón, Grág. ii. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-hlydni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-hlýðni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>due obedience, homage,</i> Fms. vii. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>having no business</i> or <i>duty,</i> Nj. 185, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>in duty;</i> bjóða s., Stj. 148, 277, H. E. i. 472: <i>dutifully, obediently,</i> K. Á. 202, Bs. i. 165, Sks. 603 B: <i>necessarily,</i> þurfa s., Fms. viii. 398.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>obligatory,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldu-songr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldu-söngr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the rubrical, official mass,</i> Vm. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyldugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyldugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>skyldig</i>]<i>, bound, obliged;</i> s. at göra e-t, s. at halda eið, Gþl. 62, K. Á. 8, 22; hón var eigi skyldug at lúka, <i>not bound to pay,</i> Dipl. iii. 13; s. til e-s, s. til hollustu ok hlýðni, Js. 17; sem vér erum skyldugir við yðr, H. E. i. 342; s. e-m e-u, hverju prestr er s. bændum, <i>which are his duties towards them?</i> N. G. L. i. 346: of a thing <i>due,</i> skyldug hlýðni, K. Á. 226; nú er skyldugt, <i>it is obligatory,</i> 330: <i>due,</i> skyldug pína, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skylfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skylfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð. <i>to shove, push,</i> = skýfa; skýf mér ekki, sagði sira Guthormr,—Ekki vil ek þér skylfa, D. N. i. 359.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skylft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skylft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>expensive, craving much</i> (men or money); in the compds. fé-skylft, lið-skylft, bú-skylft, qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., gen. Skylja, poët. <i>a ‘protector,’ king,</i> Edda, Lex. Poët.: a pr. name, usually <strong>Skúli,</strong> Fms., and freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skylmask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skylmask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, dep. <i>to fence</i> with a weapon; hann hafði sverðit undir buklaranum sem þá er menn skylmask, Sturl. ii. 221 C; talaði maðr einn um, hvárt þeir berðisk,—‘Skylmask menn þar,’ segir hann, var því ekki til hlaupit, Bs. i. 505 (skylmar með mönnum þar, Sturl. ii. 18 C, erroneously); í hringinum innan vóru tveir menn með vápnum, ok skylmðusk, Ísl. ii. 265; þeir skylmðusk, ok vildu svá reyna vígfimi sína, Al. 137; vandi hón sik burtreið, ok skylmask með skjöld ok sverð, Fas. iii. 68; sumir ríða sumir skylmðusk, Karl. 486, Skíða R. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skylming"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skylming
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>fencing,</i> Fms. ii. 100, Trist. 5, Art. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyn
