      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyn-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyn-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>sensibly, rationally;</i> hlýða s., Fms. x. 296; fara s. með e-u, Edda 28.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyn-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyn-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>rational;</i> s. kvikendi, Skálda 104; s. skepna, Barl. 100, Greg. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyn-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyn-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>rational;</i> allt mannkyn þat er skynsamt var skapat, Greg. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyn-semd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyn-semd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>reason;</i> með lítilli s., Barl. 21; með engarri skynsemd, Gþl. 276; virða e-t með skynsemd, <i>reasonably,</i> K. Á. 174; þá er vér erum údruknir ok með fullri s., Fms. ii. 262; svara s., fyrir sik, Sks. 788 B; fulla s. eða vissu, Fms. i. 138; kunna litla s. til e-s, ix. 331; upp á s. mína. <i>upon my reason, upon my word,</i> i. 102; skilrekki ok s., Stj. 150; þá muntú synja þess með s., <i>deny it, giving reasons for it,</i> Nj. 80; sakir þriggja skynsemda, <i>for three reasons,</i> Stj. 49: hver s. er til þess? Sks. 305; krefla e-n skynsemdar, <i>to ask for reasons,</i> 652; flytja þitt fals fram með nokkurum skynsemdum, Barl. 6; gjalda skynsemd e-s, <i>to give reasons for,</i> 687; gjalda Guði s. af öllum sinum verkum, MS. 671. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyn-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyn-semi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = skynsemd; in old usage skynsemd prevails, in later times skynsemi: móti skynseminni, Stj. 35; aumri skynsemi ætla of hátt, aldrei til skilnings koma. Pass.; af skynsemi ok sannindum, Fms. ix. 451; hafa ærna s. at leysa ór því er þeir spurða, x. 374; með þeirri s. ok viti sem Guð hefir oss léð. Dipl. ii. 5; mikil s. er at rifja vandliga þát, <i>it is a vast amount of knowledge,</i> Edda 14; konungr bað hann at taka rétta trú, ok sagði honum marga skynsemi, Fms. ii. 167; ér allir er skilja megut rétta skynsemi, 656 A. ii. 14; þá tók Páll at sýna þeim s. fyrir sik, 656 C. 20; gjalda s. fyrir e-t, <i>to give reasons for,</i> Skálda 205; gjalda s. fyrir þik, 623. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skynda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skynda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [Dan. <i>skynde</i>], <i>to hasten,</i> with dat.; vér viljum svá s. oss af akri ok eng, N. G. L. i. 348; konungr skyndi þá, ferð sinni, Fms. ix. 390: skynda at e-u. <i>to speed with a thing,</i> Grág. i. 39: ef maðr dvelr ferð sína eðr skyndar hann, ii. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyndi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyndi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> a, m. = skundi; meðr skynda, 732. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyndi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyndi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>in haste, of a sudden, speedily,</i> Nj. 205, Fms. i. 163, vii. 288, Fær. 261, Eg. 81, 320.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyndi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyndi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sudden,</i> Al. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skynding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skynding
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>speed, haste,</i> Skálda 167; með (af) skyndingu, Fms. viii. 175. x. 266, 281, Sturl. i. 25, (af skvndingi, masc., Fms. ix. 377, is less correct.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyndir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyndir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>one who speeds,</i> Sks. 453, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skynja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skynja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [skyn; cp. Dan. <i>skönne;</i> Swed. <i>skönja</i>]<i>, to perceive, make out, understand,</i> of the senses; þú skynjar ekki fyrir hræðslu sakir, hvárt skipit skríðr undir þér, Orkn. 402; þeir skynja skjótt, hverir höfðingjar vóru vinir Magnúss konungs, Fms. vi. 11; ef ek sé í augu manni, at ek mega þá s. háttu hans, hvers-háttar maðr hann er, Fb. ii. 295; skynja hvat þetta táknaði, Fms. i. 228; þó kann ek einna sízt at s. þat er þér kallit kveðit, vii. 60; hann kvaðsk eigi s. drauma, Fas. i. 372 (cp. Dan. <i>jeg skjönner det ikke</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skynugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skynugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>skynjugr,</strong> Stj. 95), <i>sagacious;</i> vitr ok s., Fas. iii. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skypill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skypill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skupla (q. v.), Edda ii. 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a. [<i>skjör-ost</i> in Fünen in Denmark], <i>curdled milk, curds,</i> stored up for food; þeir vóru þyrstir mjök ok supu skyrit, Eg. 204; askar fullir af skyri … tókn þeir askana ok drukku ákaft skyrit, 548, 549; graut, ost, ok skyr. Korm. 150; Rindill hafði (see hefja A. 2) skyr ok mataðisk skjótt þvíat skyrit var þunnt, … skyrit sprændi ór honum, Lv. 64; í skyrbúri skyr níu tigir skjólna, Dipl. v. 18, cp. Grett. 107; þeir höfðu skyr ok ost, <i>curds and cheese</i> (for supper), Eb. 244; ostr ok skyr var at náttverði, Bjarn. 53; skyr ok rjómi, <i>curds and cream;</i> berja-skyr, <i>blackberries and curds:</i> the saying, þeir verða að sletta skyrinu sem þat eiga. Skyr is quite a national dish of the Northmen and the Icelanders of the present day, as it was of the Teutons in more ancient times; for it doubtless was the ‘lac concretum’ of Tacit. Germ. ch. 23, cp. Virg. G. 3. 463.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-askr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-askr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a curd-bowl,</i> Eg. 204.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-bjugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-bjúgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [the etym. perh. from A. S. <i>sceorfa,</i> Engl. <i>scurf,</i> and bjúgr (q. v.), which word Icel. use of any <i>tumor</i> which sinks when touched, e. g. vind-bjúgr, vatns-bjúgr, skyr-bjúgr. In Dutch skyrbjúgr is called <i>scheur-buyk,</i> in Engl. <i>scurvy, scorbutic,</i> and in both the word may well be of northern origin]:—<i>scurvy;</i> tekr hann skyrbjúg í hafi, Þorst. Síðu H. 38; hann fékk mikinn skyrbjúg í munninn, Bs. i. 781 (also at sea); þrútnuðu upp á honum fætrnir, en skyrbjúgr hljóp í búkinn, 820.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-bur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-búr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘curd-bower,’ dairy.</i> Dipl. v. 18, Sturl. iii. 191.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-hnakkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-hnakkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Sturl. iii. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-ker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-ker
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a curd-vessel,</i> Sturl. iii. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-kyllir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-kyllir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘curd-bag;’</i> skyr í húðum ok bundit fyrir, þat kölluðu menn skyrkylla, Grett. 107 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-kyll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyr-kýll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skyr-kyllir, Grett. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>bedabbled with curds,</i> Grett. 107.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "proncd. <strong>skyssa,</strong> u, f. <i>a monstrous blunder;</i> mér varð á skyssa í dag, það var ljóta skyssan! this mod. phrase is derived from the following word; see also skussi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrsi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [akin to Ulf. <i>skohsl</i> = δαιμόνιον; Germ. <i>scheusal</i>]:—<i>a portent, phantasm,</i> as also <i>mischance</i> arising from <i>witchery;</i> þeir þóttusk náliga brenna ok óttuðusk þann atburð sem skussi (= skyrsi), <i>as a bad omen,</i> Fms. x. 416; ho, ho, skyssi mikit, segir hann, <i>thou monster!</i> Al. 42; margir eru dauðir þeir er til hafa komit at brjóta, eðr ella hafa þeim orðit önnur skyrsi (<i>mischances</i>), Gullþ. 6; brott rekr hann frá manni skyssi ok hégómlega drauma, <i>phantasms and dreams,</i> MS. 544. 39. <strong>skyrsi-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>monstrous, abnormal;</i> skyssiligar ásjónur, … skyrsiligar ok hræðiligar, Stj. 75, 79; skyrsilig skurðgoða-blót, 26; sá hinn skyrsiligi ok hræðiligi hlátr, 101; af skyssiligri mynd, 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Engl. <i>shirt</i>; Dan. <i>skjorte;</i> Germ. <i>schürz</i>]:—<i>a shirt,</i> a kind of <i>kirtle,</i> Ísl. ii. 343; skyrtu þröngva, Rm. 15; ætla góðan mun styttri skyrtu þína enn kyrtil, Sks. 287; á kyrtlum ok skyrlum, Fms. vii. 321; skyrtu ok brautargangs-höfuðsmátt, Ld. 134; í skyrtum einum, Gþl. 540: jarl var uýstaðinn upp ok var í skyrtu einni ok línbrókum, Orkn. 182: in the phrase, slíta eigi mörgum skyrtum, <i>to wear out few shirts, have but a short time left to live,</i> Þorst. St. 53: in poets, hring-s., <i>a ring-shirt, a coat of mail;</i> Hamðis s., id., Lex. Poët.; fyrir-skyrta, <i>an apron.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrtu-blad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrtu-blað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shirt-lap,</i> Þorst. St. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrtu-ermr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrtu-ermr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a shirt-sleeve,</i> Fms. v. 317.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrtu-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyrtu-görð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the making a shirt,</i> Fas. ii. 198, 202.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skytari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skytari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Engl. <i>shooter</i>], = skyti, Barl. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skyti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., old gen. skytja, [Dan. <i>skytte</i>], <i>a marksman, shooter, archer,</i> Vkv. 4. 8; mesti bogmaðr ok hinn bezti s., Stj. 128; skytanum, Hkr. iii. 312, Fms. vii. 192; skyti allra manna beztr, x. 362; hundrað skyta (gen. pl.), Ann. 1393: <i>a harpooner,</i> Jb. 326; hval-skyti, id.: a nickname, Sturl. ii. 178; ú-skyti, <i>a bad marksman;</i> ú-skytja ör, Fms. vii. 262, Fas. ii. 358, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skytja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skytja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = skyti, mod. <strong>skytta,</strong> [Dan. <i>skytte</i>]<i>, a marksman, shooter;</i> ú-skytja = ú-skyti, Fas. ii. 358, Hkr. iii. 388 (Cod. Fris. l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skytningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skytningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [skot], <i>a ‘scot-house,’ an inn</i> or <i>club,</i> where each guest paid or contributed his own <i>scot</i> or <i>shot</i> (skot), whence the name; skytning and hjúkólf are synonymous, whereas gildi is different, cp. höfu vér fyrir-boðit samdrykkju eða gildi … útan skytningar viljum vér at haldisk eptir fornum siðvanda, Rétt. 6. 3; hann tók sér skytning í bænum, Fms. vii. 113; drekka í skytningum, 242; hann veitti allri hirð sinni mat ok mungát, svá at engi maðr þurfti í skytning at ganga, Orkn. 80, O. H. L. 35; gengu skipverar í skytninga at skemta sér, Orkn. 206; fór Kali í hinn sama skytning til Unnar húsfreyju, 210; þat var eitt kveld at Þórðr drakk í skytningi, Bs. i. 635; þann tíma er menn vóru komnir í skytninga, Fms. ix. 44; hann skaut ok einn fyrir sveitunga sína þá er þeir sátu í skytningum, Ld. 73; skytnings-stofa, <i>an inn, tavern,</i> Fms. ix. 478, D. N. passim; hann hélt skytning alla tólf mánuði ok veitti sínum mönnum, Ó. H. 48; hann lét sér sverð búa af gulli ok sýndi í skytningi, O. H. L. 48; konungr gékk frá skytningi til aptan-söngs, Fms. vii. 152; hann (the king) drakk aldri svá í skytningum, at eigi drykki húskarlar hans með honum, 242; þeir (the soldiers) dreifðusk ok skipuðu til skytninga hvar hverir skyldi drekka um kveldit, viii. 408; þat var í þann tíma er menn vóru komnir í skytninga (viz. the evening), ix. 44. All the above refer to Norway; in records referring to Icel. there is only one instance, ef hann vildi fara ofan á Grund til skytnings, Glúm. 373, and this looks suspicious.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. pl. skýja, dat. skýjum; [Dan. Swed. <i>sky;</i> cp. Engl. <i>sky,</i> although different in sense]:—<i>a cloud,</i> Alm. 18, 19; ský dökkt ok dimmt, Fms. xi. 136; svart ský, þrumu-ský, <i>a thunder-cloud;</i> ok sýnir regnboga þinn í skýjum, Blas. 47; þóttusk menn sjá, at regn mundi í skýinu, Eb. 260; tungl veðr í skýjum, <i>the moon wades in clouds;</i> skýjum efri, <i>above the clouds,</i> Edda; skýja deild, Skálda 162; skýja-rof, <i>a rift</i> or <i>break in the clouds.</i> For the notion that the fleeting clouds were the scattered brains of the giant Ýmir, see Gm. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-bolstr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-bólstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘bolster’</i> or <i>bed of clouds.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-drupnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-drúpnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘cloud-dripper,’</i> poët. <i>the air full of clouds,</i> Sól.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-fjall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-fjall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘sky-fell,’ mountain of clouds,</i> Sks. 229.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-floki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-flóki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘sky-flock,’ pack of clouds,</i> Eb. 260, Fas. iii. 471, Bárd. 169, Stj. 30, 594, Hem.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>cloudless,</i> K. Þ. K. 138: metaph. <i>clear, certain,</i> það er skýlaust, vita e-ð skýlaust.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-pilarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-pílarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skýstólpi, Stj. 286.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-skafa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-skafa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘shaving’</i> or <i>streak of cloud;</i> þá vas heið ok sá hvergi skýsköfu á himni, Greg. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-stolpi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-stólpi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a pillar of cloud,</i> Stj. 326.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-svipan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-svipan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the ‘waving of a cloud,’ a moment;</i> í þeirri s., Fms. v. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sky-thakdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ský-þakðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>cloud-covered,</i> Sks. 225.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Dan. <i>skubbe;</i> Engl. <i>shove</i>], <i>to shove, push;</i> skýfðr ok rekinn, Stj. 9; út skýfðr. <i>expelled,</i> 275; mod. út skúfaðr: with dat., látið mik vera kyrra ok skýfit mér hvergi, Grett. 160; þat skýfir brott skotum ok járni, Stj. 86: pass., skýfast brott, <i>to be shoved away,</i> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyfing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýfing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a shoving;</i> með s. eða skotan, N. G. L. ii. (Hirðskrá).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to cloud;</i> skýja ok skyggva fyrir ljósit, Sks. 208; ek hefir himininn skýja látið, Stj. 62; skýjat ok ú-skygnað, 142: vel hefir þú einurð haldit hér til, en nú skýjar á heldr, <i>but now it clouds over,</i> Glúm. 367: part. <i>clouded,</i> Sks. 226; skýjað veðr, Ó. H. 108: <i>shaded,</i> of a helmet, Sks. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyja-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýja-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., botan. <i>tremella.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyja-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýja-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a cloud-drift,</i> Pr. 385.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyja-glopr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýja-glópr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘cloud-gazer,’ a fool.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyla-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a veil, cover.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyla-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [skjól; Dan. <i>skjule</i>]<i>, to screen, shelter,</i> with dat., Fms. i. 136, 274, Stj. 565; skýla við e-u, Hkr. i. 26, Fas. ii. 116.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyli-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shelter,</i> MS. 4. 12: <i>a shed,</i> passim in mod. usage. <strong>skýlis-hús,</strong> n. <i>a shed,</i> D. N. iv. 370.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyli-hogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýli-högg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cross with an axe,</i> so as to spoil a thing; ef maðr höggr s. á hafskip manns, Grág. ii. 403: ef maðr höggr s. á viði, 296; ok setti í borðit ofan hvert s. af öðru, … telgði borðin svá at ór gengu öll skýlihöggin, Fms. ii. 218, 219; þar lá tréstobbi mikill, ok í s. mikil, Ó. H. 72.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a screening,</i> Mar. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>intelligent, clever, discreet;</i> því mun skýrligri sem þú ert maðr vitrari, Fs. 121; skýrligr at yfir-bragði, Sturl. ii. 189 (Ed.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Ulf. <i>skeiran</i> = ἑρμηνεύειν; see skíra]:—<i>to explain, tell, expound, interpret, set forth;</i> kveðsk skýra mundu fyrir honum, ef hann vildi vita, Fms. xi. 12; þá er þat nú skýranda, <i>‘tis now to be told,</i> Sks. 522; skýrir ritningin heimsins görð, Stj. 2; ok er þó rétt at hann skýri þat eigi meirr, enn hann segisk, <i>he is not bound to more particulars than that,</i> Grág. ii. 88; svá sem skýrir Decreta, Anecd. 38 C; skýra spurdaga, <i>to solve a question,</i> Fms. x. 377; þá skýrði hann (<i>interpreted</i>) bók Jobs, Rb. 368; skýra ritningar, Al. 10; ráða ok skýra drauma, Stj.; ok spyrja síðan alla lögréttu-menn at skýra þat hvat hverr þeirra vill, Grág. i. 8; skal dóttir konungs sitja hjá ok skýra (<i>to decide</i>) hvárir vinna, Fas. ii. 546; nema váttar skýri, <i>unless witnesses decide,</i> Grág. ii. 226 A; út-skýra, <i>to comment on,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyring"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an elucidation, explanation,</i> Sks. 522; s. eða glöggvari greining, Skálda 205; til sanns vitnisburðar ok skýringar, H. E. i. 508; skýringar meistari, <i>an interpreter,</i> Stj. 542, 559; skýringar laust, <i>without commentary,</i> 236; skýringar-grein, <i>an explanatory note, foot-note.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>clear, evident, manifest;</i> með skýrum sannindum, Fms. ii. 298; með skýrri skipan, H. E. i. 462; skýrar jarteinir, Glúm. 357; önnur skýrari tilraun, Lv. 78; Broddi kvað þat skýrst at göra svá sem hann vildi, Ölk. 72 new Ed.; á því þingi var þat skýrt gört, 625. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skyrsla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skýrsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a report, written report,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skae-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæ-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., see skí and skímaðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaed-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæð-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>‘scathefulness,’ ferocity,</i> Mar., Stj. 236, 581.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to furnish with shoes;</i> skæða sik ok vápna, Þiðr. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> i. e. <strong>skœði,</strong> n. pl. [derived from skór], <i>the piece of leather cut square for making a pair of shoes;</i> þar liggr léskrápr, taki hann sér þar af skæði, Ísl. ii. 113; var þá skorin yxnis-húðin til skæða, 71, Skíða R. 23, 24, 26, 32, 38; il-skæði, Od. xiv. 24. <strong>skæða-drífa,</strong> u, f. <i>flakes of snow.</i> <strong>skæða-tollr,</strong> m. <i>a ‘shoe-tax,’</i> a kind of church-tax; s. af hverju bænhúsi, Vm. 92; s. ok osttollr, 74; hey-tollr, ljós-tollr, ost-tollr, skæða-tollr af ellifu bæjum, en af Arnar-vatni osttollr ok s. at eins, Pm. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>skœðr,</strong> adj. [skaði and skóð], <i>scatheful, noxious,</i> Hkv. i. 38; skæðr ok skaðsamligr, Stj. 23, Ld. 278; skæðir við hesta, Stj. 71; skæðar tungur, Nj. 264, Barl. 165; skæðir vargar, <i>wild beasts,</i> Fms. i. 273, x. 362, Magn. 494; auð-skæðr, <i>easily hurt;</i> mann-s., q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skækja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> i. e. <strong>skœkja,</strong> [Dan. <i>sköge</i>], <i>a harlot</i>, Stj. 197, Hm. 86, Karl. 173, Rb. (1812) 17; skækju-sonr, <i>a whore-son,</i> Fas. iii. 556.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, [Dan. <i>skjele;</i> Germ. <i>schielen</i>], <i>to make a wry face;</i> skaela sig, Fas. iii. 471; hann er allr skældr og skakkr: <i>to cry,</i> of children, vertu ekki að skæla! skældu ekki!",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaelda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skælda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [skáld], <i>to make verses.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaeldinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skældinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>skilled</i> or <i>versed in poetry,</i> Hkr. iii. 319, Bs. i. 593.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dog-tooth,</i> = skögultönn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaeni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [skán, skeini], <i>a skin, membrane:</i> <strong>skæningr,</strong> m. <i>a film,</i> of ice.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. skæs, dat. and acc. skæ, [skæva, skævaðr], <i>a racer, steed,</i> Höfuðl. 12, Orkn. (in a verse), Ísl. ii. 229: metaph., s. skorðu, sunda, = <i>a ship,</i> Lex. Poët.; skir (= skær), Hým. 36; only used by poets.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaer-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skær-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>brightness,</i> Stj. 142.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaer-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skær-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (<strong>-ligr,</strong> adj.), <i>purely,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> i. e. <strong>skœra,</strong> f. <i>a fray, quarrel,</i> Am. 48: esp. in pl., skærur þeirra vestr í sveitum, Sturl. ii. 38; skærur Arnórs ok Sveins, 116; sennur ok skærur, Greg. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaera-husi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæra-húsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a shears’ case,</i> Gullþ. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaera-knifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæra-knífr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skæri, Dipl. iii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. (or dual), <i>a pair of shears,</i> Bjarn. 66, Fms. vi. 106, Barl. 136, Dipl, v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>skjær;</i> Engl. <i>sheer;</i> see skírr]:—<i>bright, clear;</i> skært lopt, veðr, Stj. 69, Pr. 415; skærar sem cristallus, Mar.; skært vatn, Stj. 208; skært ljós, Bs. ii. 93; skærr himinn, 29; skær ásjón, Pr. 406; skærir silfr-penningar, Fms. ii. 93; skærr kolorr, Stj. 72; skærasta gull, með skæru ljósi, hit skærasta viðsmjör, Mar.; skær rödd, skær raust, Bs. i. 830, Sks. 632: <i>pure,</i> skær iðran, skærar bænir, með sönnu ok skæru hugskoti, Mar.; skær jungfrú (Dan. <i>en skjær jomfru), a pure maid,</i> id., Stj. 70, 207; hina skærustu mey, Magn. 466; hin skærasta mær Máría Th. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaeting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>skœting</strong>), f., mod. <strong>skætingr,</strong> m. [Engl. <i>skit;</i> cp. skúta, skat-yrðask; the skœt- refers to a lost strong verb skat, skót]:—<i>a skit, scoff, taunt;</i> af skætingu viltú svara oss ok spotti, Rd. 311; svara þér skætingu, Ld. 34; alls þú mér skætingu einni svarar, Hbl. 59: cp. the mod. phrase, hann svaraði mér í skætingi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaetingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skætingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skæting; at honum muni skammt til skeytings ef hann snertir þeirra hoferan með fátæki sínu, Bs. ii. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaeva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skæva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. <i>skewjan</i> = ὁδον ποιειν, Mark ii. 23]:—<i>to stride,</i> absol. and only in poetry; hón skævaði skýjum efri, Hkv. 2. 3; hón skævaði (<i>she strode</i>) veigar þeim at bera, 35; þá kom in arma út skævandi, Og. 32; skæva vér létum, Am. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skaevadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skævaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(skævuðr), m. <i>a racer, steed,</i> Edda (Gl.), Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoflungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköflungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (mod. <strong>sköfnungr</strong>), <i>the skin</i>; framan á knjánum ok sköflungunum, Sturl. iii. 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skofnungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköfnungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>weapon;</i> sköfnungs-öx, Fbr. 12: the name of the sword of king Rolf Kraki, Landn. 169, Fas. i, Korm., Ld.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skofu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköfu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see skafa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skogul"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skögul
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (gen. Sköglar, Km.), one of the Valkyriurs, Edda, Gm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skogul-tonn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skögul-tönn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [a corrupt form, qs. skæltönn?], <i>a dog-tooth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skokull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skökull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. skökli, [Swed. <i>skakel</i>; Dan. <i>skagle;</i> from skaka]:—<i>the pole of a cart</i> or <i>carriage,</i> Hým. 37, Þkv. 21; cf maðr höggr festi, sela, beisl, tauma eðr skökla, Gþl. 359; leysa sköklana frá okinu, Al. 19: a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. and n. pl., Sturl. l. c. [cp. skval, skjall], <i>mockery, loud laughter;</i> þeir görðu at þessu mikla sköll (fem, sing.) ok hlátr, Eb. 60; but sköll þau (neut. plur.), Sturl. ii. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skollottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköllóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [skalli; Dan. <i>skaldet</i>], <i>bald,</i> Háv. 41 new Ed., Eg. 84, Ld. 274 (v. l.), Fms. vi. 302 (v. l.), passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skomm"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skömm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. skammar, pl. skammir; <strong>skamm,</strong> n. also occurs, but rarely, Fb. i. 411; mesta skamm, Bs. ii. 494 (a poem of the 16th century); but the fem. still prevails in speech and writing with a double <i>m,</i> as seen from Fms, vi. 386,—heyr þjóð-skáldit, kvattú svá, grö<i>m</i> skö<i>mm</i>, ekki eru þær hendingar jafnhávar, hrö<i>mm</i> skö<i>mm</i> þat væri jafnhátt, en hitt er málleysa: [A. S. <i>sceamu;</i> Engl. <i>shame;</i> Germ. <i>scham;</i> Dan. <i>skam;</i> in these and other cognate languages the <i>m</i> is single, cp. Ulf. <i>skaman</i> in <i>skaman sik</i>]:—<i>a grave bodily hurt,</i> but rare in this sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skop-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>weird, fate;</i> see skap.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skor-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skör
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. skarar, [skara], <i>a rim, edge;</i> allt út að skörinni, <i>the rim of ice,</i> Eb. 236; víða um ísinn … þeir lendu útan at skörinni, Fms. viii. 404: = tjald-skör, hljóp konungr ór lyptingunni, var hann svá reiðr at hann hljóp út um skarirnar, Fas. i. 373; spretta skörunr, ii. 187, 206, Bs. ii. 108: the phrase, skríða til skarar, <i>to slide to the very edge, to fight it out,</i> Sd. 189; skal nú til skarar skríða með okkr Knúti bróður mínum, Fms. xi. 15, the metaphor prob. from running or racing to the edge of the ice.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skordottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörðóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [skarð], <i>notched,</i> Skálda 170, Þiðr. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoru-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköru-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = skörungskapr, Fagrsk. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoru-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköru-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>bravely, frankly, with authority;</i> mæla vel ok s., Nj. 24, Fs. 18, 91; hefna s., Fms. ii. 6, vii. 33; fremja, vinna s., v. 308, vii. 164; fara s., Boll. 344.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skoru-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sköru-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>brave, frank, bold, manly, imposing in appearance;</i> mikill maðr vexti, s., Fms. vii. 102; s. maðr, <i>a fine, stalwart man,</i> Eg. 28, 199; ekki fríðr maðr sýnum en þó inn sköruligsti í yfirbragði, Ld. 18; vænn maðr at áliti, meðalmaðr at vexti, kvikligr ok s., Bs. i. 80; manna sköruligastr at sjá, Fb. i. 539; Magnús konungr var sköruligastr ok skjótligastr, Fms. vii. 63; mikill ok s., Finnb. 334; vex upp sveinninn, s. með miklu mannviti, O. H. L. 4: of a lady, hón var væn ok ætt-góð ok skörulig, Lv. 73; mikil kona ok s., Fs. 54, 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorug-lyndi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörug-lyndi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a noble character,</i> Magn. 480.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorug-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörug-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>noble, authoritative, frank-minded,</i> Fms. vi. 102, Bs. i. 326.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorug-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörug-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = sköraligr; skörugsöm híbýli, Lv. 73.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorung-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörung-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= sköruglyndr, Þiðr. 175, Hkr. iii. 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorung-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörung-skapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>nobleness, manliness, generosity;</i> með miklum ríkdóm ok skörungskap, Fms. xi. 317; líkligr til mikillar framkvæmdar ok skörungskapar, vii. 76; þú færðir þik með skörungskap í þína ætt, Glúm. 338; um ráða-görðir, vitsmuni ok allan skörungskap, Fs. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skorungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skörungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (skarungr, O. H. L. 4), [skara]:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skotu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skötu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see skata, skati.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skotu-bard"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skötu-barð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a skate’s flap.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/skotu-modir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          skötu-móðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘skate’s-motber,’</i> a fabulous monster, Ísl. Þjóðs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slabb"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slabb
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>dirt</i> from sleet and rain.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slafak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slafak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>rank grass and weeds</i> that grow near farm-houses.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slafast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slafast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
