          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sleði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Old Engl. <i>sled</i> (‘the <i>sledded</i> Polack,’ Hamlet, and so still in North. E.); Engl. <i>sledge;</i> Germ. <i>schlitte;</i> Dan. <i>slæde,</i> cp. Engl. <i>slide</i>]:—<i>a sledge,</i> Sdm. 15, Grág. ii. 295, N. G. L. ii. 118, 121, Landn. 94, Eg. 543, Eb. 188, 190, Fs. 55 Ó. H. 85. Gísl. 37, passim; sleða-menn, Fms. ix. 352; sleða-höfuð, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slefa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>slaver</i> (Lat. <i>saliva</i>), Edda 20, Sks. 229; slefu-speldi, <i>a bib</i> or <i>tucker</i> round the neck of children.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sleggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sleggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [from slá, slag; A. S. <i>slecge</i>], <i>a sledge-hammer,</i> Bs. i. 346, Dipl. iii. 4, Vm. 154, Þ;iðr. 166; með hömrum ok sleggjum, Al. 171; the phrase, verða milli steins ok sleggju, <i>to come between the hammer and the anvil,</i> Fas. i. 34; rek-s., <i>a sledge-hammer;</i> fiska-s., járn-s.: in Icel. the sleggja is often a round stone with a hole for the handle: sleggju-nef, <i>a club-nose.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sleif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
