        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slett-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slétt-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>smooth words,</i> Barl. 121, 164.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sletta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slétta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [Engl. <i>slight;</i> Germ. <i>schlichten</i>], <i>to make plain, level;</i> lítill blær sléttir ok hylr þá vegu, Stj. 16; slétta tún, <i>to level, smooth a field:</i> metaph., slétta yfir e-t, <i>to smooth over a thing;</i> hafit ér vel yfir slétt vanhyggju mína, Ísl. ii. 201, Fms. i. 74; s. um e-t, Clar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sletti-baka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slétti-baka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>‘smooth-back,’</i> a kind of <i>whale, balaena mysticetus</i> L., Edda, Sks. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sléttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. <i>slaihts</i> = λειος, Luke iii. 5; a word common to all Teut. languages, but in the Scandin. the <i>h</i> is lost, as Dan. <i>slet;</i> but in Germ. <i>schlicht</i> and <i>schlecht,</i> in Engl. <i>slight</i>, etc.]:—<i>plain, flat, even, smooth, level;</i> sléttr steinn, Eg. 141; á sléttum velli, Fms. i. 137, ii. 319, Edda 31; slett land, Fb. i. 431; vellir sléttir, Ó. H. 134; sléttr sjór, <i>a smooth sea;</i> þar sem slétr er, Fms. vii. 297; ú-sléttr, <i>uneven, rough:</i> metaph., segja sínar (farar) eigi sléttar, <i>to tell of one’s journey not having been smooth,</i> i. e. <i>that it had all gone wrong,</i> Orkn. 68, Eg. 75, Nj. 254, Ld. 64, Fms. i. 75: gengu þeir slétt (<i>straight</i>) út af borðunum, Fms. ii. 319.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>strain,</i> a horse disease, Bs. i. 389.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to strain</i> a horse: reflex. <i>to be strained:</i> <strong>sligaðr,</strong> <i>strained.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slinkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slinkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a nickname, Fms. x. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slinni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slinni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a clownish fellow, boor,</i> Edda ii. 495. <strong>slinna-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>clownish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [slíta], <i>a slit, tear;</i> kápa komin at sliti, <i>a worn-out cloak,</i> Band. 5; rif ok slit, Bs. ii. 143; það er ekki til slits; kvið-slit, <i>hernia.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. ‘cismos,’ þat er ‘slita’ at váru máli, Skálda 184.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slitna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slitna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (neut. of slita), <i>to be rent, break,</i> of a cord, rope, string, or the like (rifna, being used of cloth, etc.); festr mun, s., Vsp. 41, Am. 35, Fms. vii. 13, Grett. 101, MS. 656 C. 31, Karl. 450; slitnaði skóþvengr hans, Nj. 74: medic. of hernia, kviðrinn slitnaði, Bs. i. 121, 208: metaph. <i>to end, break up,</i> Lv. 11, Fs. 21: kaupmáli slitnar, Þiðr. 85.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>slitri,</strong> n. <i>shreds, tatters,</i> Grett. 101, 114 A; klæða-slitr, Vm. 77, Pm. 133, Finnb. 246.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slitt-maeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slitt-mæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a reproach for slothfulness,</i> Sturl. ii. 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slitti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slitti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>tatters,</i> = slitr, Clar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slittungar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slittungar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. the name of a rebel party in Norway, Fms, ix.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ulf. <i>sleiþa</i> = ζημία], <i>punishment,</i> the name of one of the rivers of hell, a place for the wicked, Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., the <i>r</i> is radical, [Ulf. <i>sleiþis</i> = χαλεπός, cp. <i>sleiþis</i> = κίνδυνος; A. S. <i>slíð, slîdor</i>]:—<i>fearful;</i> hefndir slíðrar ok sárar, Gh. 5; í slíðri Súðvík, <i>in the fatal Southwick,</i> of a place of battle, Ó. H. 19 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidr-beittr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðr-beittr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sharp as a rasor,</i> Akv. 22, Eb. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidr-fengligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðr-fengligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dire, fearful,</i> Gh. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidr-hugadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðr-hugaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>atrocious,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidr-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðr-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>savagely;</i> eta s., Haustl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sheath, put in the scabbard,</i> Nj. 185, Fas. i. 529, 576, Þórð. 49 new Ed., Al. 44, Karl. 240, Pass. 7. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidrar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðrar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. (<strong>slíðrin,</strong> n. pl., Eg. 304), [Engl. <i>slither, sliver</i>]; slíðr, as well as skeiðir, prop. means <i>a lath</i> or <i>‘slither,’</i> used to make cases for knives and swords, see Fritzner, s. v.; whence",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slidrug-tanni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíðrug-tanni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>‘the boar with the awful tusk,’</i> the name of Frey’s boar, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sliki-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíki-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a <i>‘sleek-stone,’ a fine whetstone,</i> D. I. i. 255, Vm. 6. <strong>slíkisteins-auga,</strong> n. <i>the eye</i> or <i>hole of a whetstone,</i> a nickname, Ld.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slikja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a smooth, thin texture.</i> <strong>slíkju-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>smooth,</i> of a kerchief.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sleek, smooth;</i> hrognkelsi líkr, | var á holdi slíkr, <i>flabby-fleshed,</i> of a lump-fish, Bjarn. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slikr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., prop. a compd. qs. svá-líkr, so-líkr; [Ulf. <i>swa-leiks</i> = τοιουτος; A. S. <i>swilc,</i> i. e. <i>swa ylc</i> = <i>so like;</i> Early Engl. <i>silk</i>, whence mod. Engl. <i>such,</i> with the <i>l</i> dropped; Scot. <i>sic</i>; Germ. <i>solch;</i> Dan. <i>slig;</i> Swed. <i>slik</i>]:—<i>such;</i> slíkr maðr, <i>such a man,</i> Fms. i. 99; slíkr maðr sem, Eg. 759; slíkan sem, Fms. i. 21; slíkt sems, Am. 103; slíks úfriðar, sem …, Ísl. ii. 242; slíkt lið sem hann fékk, Fms. i. 74: slíkr svá, <i>such-like;</i> með slíkum svá fortölum, Al. 33; meira enn slíkt svá, Fms. v. 303; at slíkum svá, mönnum, vi. 99: slíkt ok it sama, Post. 645. 66, Stj. 356: neut., ef slíkt skyldi þreyta, Fms. ii. 176; er hann slíkt um fregn, Vsp. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slím
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>slîm;</i> Engl. <i>slime;</i> Germ. <i>schleim,</i> etc.]:—<i>slime;</i> dró af slímit augunum, Bs. i. 315, H. E. i. 513, Mar.: passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>sliminess.</i> <strong>slímu-setr,</strong> n., in the phrase, sitja slímusetr; in olden times, when wayfarers were hospitably entertained, a man who remained as guest above a certain time (three days at most, and for a stranger a single night) was said to sitja s., and was regarded as a vagrant or cosherer, and might be punished, N. G. L. i. 72, Gþl. 200; cp. þat var engi siðr at sitja lengr en þrjár nætr at kynni, <i>it was not manners to stay longer than three nights in a visit,</i> Eg. 698: exactly the same is still said in Scotland, see Lockhart’s ‘Life of Sir W. Scott,’ 1871, p. 589, in a foot-note.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slipa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slípa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Germ. <i>schleifen;</i> Dan. <i>slibe;</i> Swed. <i>slipa</i>], <i>to whet.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slipari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slípari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m, [Germ. <i>schleifer;</i> Dan. <i>sliber</i>], <i>a whetter,</i> N. G. L. ii. 204 (v. l. 23), Rétt. 2. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slita-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slíta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "slít; pret. sleit, sleizt, sleit. pl. slitu; subj. slíti; imperat. slít, slíttu; part. slitinn: [A. S. <i>slîtan;</i> Engl. <i>slit;</i> Dan. <i>slide</i>]:—<i>to slit, break,</i> of a string, rope (rífa, of cloth); snara er slitin, 623. 36; slíta þráðu, reip, bönd. Sól. 37, Stor. 7; s. í sundr svá mjótt band, Edda 20; þeir sýndu honum silki-bandið ok báðu hann slíta, id.; þær fá nú varla svá títt spunnit örlaga-þráð sem ein slíta, Al. 141; hann tók Mistiltein ok sleit upp, Edda 37; sleit hann af sér slæðurnar, Fms. vii. 149; Steinarr vildi s. hann af sér, <i>threw him off,</i> Eg. 747; sleit hann undan veðr, <i>the gale drove him out of his course,</i> Landn. (Hb.) 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljakka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljákka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. sljófga, <i>to abate.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljo-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljó-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>dulness,</i> Bs. ii. 126.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljo-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljó-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>slæ-liga,</strong> adv. <i>slowly, dully, carelessly,</i> opp. to briskly, Al 34, Stj. 531; reiða sverð s., Fms. x. 360 (sljáliga, ii. 322, Hkr. i. 343, l. c.); róa slæliga, Fms. ix. 301; ú-slæliga, <i>deftly,</i> xi. 277.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljo-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljó-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>slæ-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>blunt, slow;</i> er þá för vár sljólig, Fs. 66.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljofa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljófa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to blunt, make blunt,</i> Mar.; but usually in",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljofga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljófga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, sljófgast = sljófast, Fas. i. 507, Sturl. ii. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sljor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sljór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sljó, sljótt; before a vowel the <i>v</i> appears, sljóvan, sljóvum, … (also spelt with <i>f</i>); the older form is <strong>slær,</strong> slæ, slæ, slætt (slævan, etc.), or even <strong>sljár,</strong> Ld. 312, v. l.; analogous to snjór, snjár, snær: sjór, sjár, sær; mjór, mjár, mær: [A. S. <i>sláw</i>; Engl. <i>slow;</i> Dan. <i>slöv</i>]:—<i>blunt,</i> Lat. <i>hebes;</i> sverð sljó ok brotin, Fms. ii. 322; þó at sverðin sé slæ, x. 360; sljó öx. Fs. 184; sverð vár eru slæ, Hkr. i. 343; með slævu sverði, Fm. 30; slætt sverð, Fbr. (in a verse); með hljóði sljófu, <i>a dull sound,</i> Skálda 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slok
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Engl. <i>sluice;</i> Dan. <i>slug;</i> cp. Germ. <i>schlucht</i>], <i>the sluice</i> by which the water is led to the wheel of a water-mill, B. K. 81, D. N. iv. 536; hann var mylnu-vörðr ok hafði vaktað slok (sloa Ed.) undir mylnurnar, Post. 246 (the printed Ed.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sloka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sloka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>sluge</i>], <i>to slop.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slokna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slokna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>slukkes;</i> N. Lancashire <i>slocken;</i> Engl. <i>slake</i>], <i>to be extinguished;</i> brennr … sloknar, Hm. 50; ljós (log, ekir) sloknar, Rb. 352, Fms. iv. 28, xi. 35, Fb. ii. 8, 129, Gísl. 29, Gullþ. 50; sloknar hann aldregi hvárki af vindi né vætum, Stj. 86; gaus upp stundum eldrinn en stundum sloknaði niðr, Nj. 204: part., þá er sloknaðr var eldrinn, Edda (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slokr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slokr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the slaver, saliva,</i> from the mouth of animals.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sloppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sloppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. and Engl. <i>slop</i>; Germ. <i>schleppe;</i> akin to Dan. <i>slæbe</i>], <i>a slop, gown,</i> a loose trailing garment; brynja undir sloppi, Fms. vi. 158; vaðm;áls sloppr, Bs. i. 674: esp. of a priest’s white gown, skrýddr sloppum ok kantara-kápum, 186, Vm., Pm., D. I., Dipl. passim; slopp-slitri, <i>a tattered gown,</i> Pm. 133; slopp-töturr, <i>id.,</i> 124 (spelt slof-töturr, Bs. i. 565).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slor
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the offal of fish,</i> used as dung: <strong>slorugr,</strong> adj. <i>bedabbled with</i> slor.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>abatement;</i> vind-slot, Alm.; veðra-slot, bylja-slot.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slota
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, slotir, Hom. (St.); the pret. would be slotti, but is not found (cp. þora þorði þorað); mod. usage distinguishes between slúta = <i>to hang down,</i> and slota = <i>to abate;</i> [cp. Germ. <i>schliessen</i> and <i>schluss</i>]:—<i>to hang down, droop;</i> láta slota hendr niðr með síðu ok höfðusk ekki at, Fms. ii. 229,; láttú slota hattinn, Nj. 32; hann var í kufli ok lét slúta hattinn, Sturl. ii. 230, Fas. i. 61 (both paper MSS.): slota við, <i>to slink away;</i> ok er ekki at slota við eða svara skatyrðum, Fms. vii. 20; þat þú þegir við ok slotir, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slo"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sló
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the bone</i> in the hollow of the horns of animals.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [cp. Ulf. <i>slauþjan;</i> Engl. <i>sleuth, slot,</i> in <i>sleuth-hound</i>], <i>a track</i> or <i>trail</i> in snow or the like; slóð Fáfnis, Sæm. 133; kómu á manna-för, ok lá sú slóð framm á skóginn, Eg. 578; þá skildi ok slóðina, 579; hann seri því eptir í slóðna, Ó. H. 135; skuluð ér nú fara at slóð þessi, Fms. iv. 340.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slod-gata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóð-gata
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a track-way,</i> Fas. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sloda-hris"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóða-hrís
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a truss of brushwood,</i> Grág. ii. 338 (Jb. 218).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sloda-stod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóða-stöð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a track-way, tram-way.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sloda-vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóða-vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a track-way, tram-way,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slodi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [slóð], <i>a truss of fagots trailed along;</i> draga slóða, <i>to drag a slot</i> or <i>trail;</i> and metaph. <i>to leave a slot behind, be fatal;</i> slóða mun draga, at því er ek hygg, Band.; má annars staðar meiri slóða draga enn hér, Nj. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slodra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, slöðra, as it is spelt in editions, is less correct, for the mod. slóra, q. v., is a contracted and corrupt form of sloðra (<i>oð</i> = <i>ó</i>); [cp. Ulf. <i>slauþjan</i>]:—<i>to drag</i> or <i>trail oneself along;</i> sloðruðu þeir þá vestr af heiðinni, Sturl. iii. 158; þeir sloðruðu svá til lands, 163; flestir gátu fengit bakkann ok sloðruðu svá at landi, Fb. ii. 511 (slöðruðu, Orkn. 456, l. c., but less correct); hefir ek ekki spurt til sanns hverjum þá sloðraði (sloþraðe Cod.), Ölk. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slog"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the eatable inwards</i> (liver etc.) <i>of a fish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slokr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slókr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [North. E. <i>slotch</i>], <i>a slouching fellow,</i> Edda ii. 495.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(slórir, stórði, slórt), contr. from sloðra, [Engl. <i>slur</i>], <i>to trail</i> or <i>lounge about;</i> hvað ertu að slóra þarna! see sloðra.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slottugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slóttugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sly, wily;</i> ú-slóttigr, <i>guileless,</i> Hom. 148; eigi s. ok einfaldr, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sludda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sludda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [cp. Dan. <i>slud</i> = <i>sleet;</i> North. E. <i>slutch</i>], <i>a clot of spittle</i> or <i>mucus;</i> hor-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slumsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slumsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to slop and swill,</i> like swine.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slund-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slund-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>flabbily</i> (?), Eb. 37 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slunginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slunginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. as adj., see slyngva.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slungnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slungnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a mythical steed, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sluta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to project, hang down;</i> see slota (I), as also skúta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slydda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slydda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>slud</i>], <i>sleet, cold rain, wet.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slydra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a flabby lump;</i> blóðugar slyðrur, Grett. 153 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slydrask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyðrask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. sloðrast; ymsir fóru á kné eða slyðruðust fyrir öðrum, Grett. 167 new Ed. (in Cod. Upsal.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyndra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyndra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = slyðra; mör-slyndra, of a lean animal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyndru-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyndru-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj., as adv. <i>‘slothlessly,’ deftly,</i> Ísl. Þjóðs. i. 437.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyngr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyngr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>versed, skilled;</i> s. við íþróttir, Fas. iii. 195: slyngum þeim sláttu-manni, Hallgr.; e-m er e-t slyngt, <i>to be expert in a thing,</i> Grett. 118 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyngva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyngva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>slöngva,</strong> pres. slyng; pret. slöng or slaung, slungu: part. slunginn; this strong verb, however, is defective in its tenses and persons, and is chiefly used in poets, but rarely in prose; and later it was displaced by the weak <strong>slöngva,</strong> ð (or mod. <strong>slengja,</strong> ð), except in the part. slunginn, which remained: [Dan. <i>slynge;</i> A. S. <i>slingan;</i> Engl. <i>sling</i>]:—<i>to sling, fling, throw,</i> with dat. as Engl. <i>to throw with a thing:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [sleppa, sluppu], prop. <i>unarmed, weaponless;</i> ek hugðumk ganga hér ór garði einn saman ok slyppr, Glúm. 375; gengu þeir á land upp slyppir, Eg. 81; gakk eigi slyppr, Fbr. 58; sumir gengu slyppir á vald biskups, Sturl. ii. 7 C, Orkn. 114; engi þorði at honum at ráða þó at hann væri s., 105; at þú bærir vápn, en færir eigi slyppr sem konur, Ísl. ii. 407; haf þú saxit í hendi, ok ver eigi s., Fbr. 58; brast sverðit sundr undir hjöltunum,—Nú kalla ek, at Hrafn sé sigraðr, er hann er s., Ísl. ii. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slys"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slys
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a mishap, mischance, accident;</i> slys mun þat þykkja, er hann hjó hönd af konu sinni, Eb. 60; vóru fallnir niðr hlekkir ór söðli hennar, ok var þat bæði slys ok fjár-skaði, Bs. i. 341; sigrask af slysi e-s, Korm. 90; Dofra þótti þá mikit orðit slys sitt, ef hann hefði drepit piltinn, Fb. i. 565, Bs. ii. 175; Þorgils bað þá gæta sín við slysum, Ld. 280 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slys-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slys-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>fatally,</i> Fas. i. 460, Band. 14 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slysast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slysast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. <i>to suffer mischance.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slysinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slysinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mischievous, bringing ill-luck;</i> maðr s. ok rógsamr, Eb. 44: in mod. <i>unlucky</i> (like Germ. <i>fatal</i>), of an awkward fellow who always is blundering, having a broken bone, a cut, or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slysni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slysni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>fatality</i>:—see slysinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slytti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slytti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [slý], <i>a flabby lump,</i> wet rags or the like; hann er einsog s.! <strong>slytti-mákr,</strong> m. <i>a lazy fellow, laggard,</i> Grett. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyttinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyttinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>flabby, sluggish;</i> s. ok linaflaðr, Fb. i. 521.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slyttu-mannliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slyttu-mannliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>flabbily, sluggishly,</i> Mag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sly"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slý
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., botan. <i>water-cotton, byssus lanuginosa;</i> af sefi eðr slýi, Stj. 253: it was dried and used as tinder, Bs. i. 616 (wrongly spelt slij), freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slae-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
