        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>meadow-land.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaegju-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slægju-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-lítill,</strong> adj. <i>having little</i> or <i>no land in grass.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaegleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slægleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>sly, cunning,</i> Nj. 35, 241, Stj. 357.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaegliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slægliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>slily, cunningly,</i> Barl. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaegligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slægligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sly, cunning,</i> Háv. 55, Fms. x. 358, Barl. 152.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [slá], <i>kicking, vicious,</i> of a horse.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaegr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>a profitable thing, gain,</i> Fas. iii. 194, Orkn. 424, v. l.; segja þeir hversu mikill slægr var til fjárins, Band. 20 new Ed.; vil ek sjá hann, ok virða fyrir mér hverr s. mér þykkir í vera, <i>consider what I think he is worth,</i> Fs. 11; þykki mér þó meiri slægr til hans, Nj. 42, Hem.: hón kvað nú vera slæg í at hitta Hólmverja, Ísl. ii. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaeki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slæki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Germ. <i>schlank;</i> Engl. <i>lanky</i>], <i>a slender, tall person;</i> þú ert mesta slæki: hence perh. <strong>slæki-drengr,</strong> a nickname of a lady, Landn. (from her slender stature).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaema"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slæma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>slœma,</strong> ð, <i>to slam</i>, i. e. <i>to swing a weapon, to strike at an object almost out of reach;</i> hann slæmir til hans öxinni, Ni. 155; Barði slæmir á síðu honum, Ísl. ii. 365; Sigurðr slæmir til hennar sverðinu ok höggr af henni höndina, O. H. L. 42; slæmdi hann á fót Hrolleifi, Fs. 33; hann fékk brugðit sverðinu, ok slæmir eptir honum, 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaemr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slæmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj., without compar. and superl., prop. <i>‘slim,’</i> but only used,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaepast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slæpast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, dep. [slápr], <i>to lounge:</i> <strong>slæpingr,</strong> m. <i>a slouching fellow</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (see sljór), <i>blunt,</i> Fm. 30, Sturl. iii. 117, Bs. i. 775, Ls. 22, 23, Fms. x. 360 (Hkr. i. 43), Fbr. (in a verse); for the references in full see sljór.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaetringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slætringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>mown grass;</i> ef maðr stelr slætringi af jörðu manns, N. G. L. i. 85 (in ii. 171 spelt sltringr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slaeva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slæva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= sljófa, see slæfa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slokva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slökva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "originally a strong verb, of which there remains only the part. slokinn; in all other parts weak, slökvi, slökði or slökti, slökt; in mod. terms usually spelt and sounded with double <i>k</i> (slökkvi), but less correctly; thus slecþi, i. e. slökði, MS. 625. 70; slökþ, Fms. x. 389; slækva, Barl. 135; but slökkva, Fb. i. 435, l. 34; and slecqua, 625. 70: a strong pres. indic. slökkr has, strangely enough, been restored in mod. language instead of slökkvir, which is always found in the vellums and old writers: [Dan. <i>slukke;</i> cp. Engl. <i>slake</i>]:—<i>to slake, extinguish,</i> esp. of fire; ganga frá sloknum eldi, Gþl. 377; ok var nú allr (the fire) kaldr orðinn ok slokinn, <i>cold and slaked,</i> Fms. xi. 35; Reginn slökkvir nú ljósin öll, Fas. i. 12 (slökkr Ed. from a paper MS.): jafn-skjótt sem þat er slökkt, Stj. 123; þótti mér slökt hit sætasta ljós augna minna, Nj. 187; svá sem vatn slökvir eldinn, 655 xi. 4; hón slökvir svá hans synd sem vatn slökvir eld, K. Á. 76; tekr sefvisk, kastar í ljósit ok slökvir þat, Gísl. 29; s. þrysvar eldinn, 7; þeir fengu eigi fyrr slökt, Fms. viii. 341; báru konur sýru í eldinn ok slöktu niðr fyrir þeim, Nj. 199: metaph., ætt öll farin ok slökð, <i>extinct, dead,</i> Fms. x. 389.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slokvir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slökvir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a slaker, one who extinguishes,</i> Barl. 175, Lex. Poët.: in compds, <strong>slökkvi-tól, -vél,</strong> <i>fire-engines.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slongva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slöngva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to sling;</i> see slyngja.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slongvan-baugi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slöngvan-baugi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>ring-slinger,</i> the nickname of a king, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slongvir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slöngvir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>one who slings away,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slop"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slöp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the slimy offal of fish;</i> see slepja.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/slottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          slöttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a heavy, log-like fellow;</i> hann er mesti slöttr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smakka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smakka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>smæcigan;</i> Dan. <i>smage;</i> Germ. <i>ge-schmack;</i> Engl. <i>smack</i>]:—<i>to taste</i>; the word is mod., for in Sks. 163 it is only in the late vellums; the old B l. c. has þefjat; but it is freq. since the Reformation, Pass. 33. 1, 3, 43. 1, Vídal. passim; see smekkr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smal-menni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smal-menni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = smámenni (see smár), Nj. 188. (Lat. Ed.), in the vellum fragment.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smal-vamm"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smal-vamm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a small fault,</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to tend sheep, act as a shepherd,</i> esp. to collect and drive home the flock for milking; with dat., smala fénu, farðu að smala.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smali
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, m. [from an obsolete adjective <i>smals;</i> A. S. <i>smæl;</i> Engl. <i>small;</i> Germ. <i>schmal</i>]:—prop. <i>small cattle,</i> esp. <i>sheep,</i> but also <i>goats,</i> Rb. 80; málnytan smala, <i>milch cattle,</i> Grág. i. 158; þá var ok drepinn allskonar s. ok svá hross, Hkr. i. 139; bæði svínum yðrum ok öðrum smala, Fms. xi. 224; tvau kýrlög í smala, <i>two cows’ worth in small cattle,</i> Munk. 67; smala-kýrag, id., B. K. 55; smala sínum (sauðum ok lömbum), Barl. 35; ef maðr nýtir þann smala er svá verðr dauðr, N. G. L. i. 341.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smalki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smalki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = smælki, smáka, Sks. 8 new Ed. v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smaragdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smaragðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [for. word, from Gr. σμαραγδός]<i>, an emerald,</i> Bb. <strong>smaragð-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>emerald-like,</i> Sks. 48 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Dan. <i>for-smaae;</i> Germ. <i>schmähen</i>]<i>, to scorn;</i> smá e-n í orðum, Fms. iii. 110; þó at þú smáir hann með úfögrum verka, ii. 248; hatrliga smáðr, Bs. i. 45 (for-smá, q. v.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sma-saman"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smá-saman
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>little by little;</i> see smár.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smaka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smáka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a trifle;</i> í smáku, <i>in detail,</i> Sks. 8 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
