      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smanar-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smánar-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>disgraceful.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "smá, smátt: gen. smás, acc. smán, dat. smám, smá: pl. smáir, smár, smá, dat. smám, acc. smá, smár, smá: mod. bisyllabic smáan, smáum, smáa: compar. smæri; superl. smæstr. The Icel. form <i>‘smá’</i> instead of <i>‘smal’</i> of the Germ. and Saxon is peculiar to all the Scandin. languages, and also prevails in Scotland and North. E., but the words are one; ‘smá’ is only a contracted form, as is seen by the fact that ‘smal’ remains in the words smali (q. v.), smalki, smælingr; and (although as απ. λεγ.) in smalvamm, smalmenni, q. v.: [Ulf. <i>smals</i> = Germ. <i>schmal,</i> Engl. <i>small,</i> etc.; but Dan.-Swed. <i>smaa;</i> Scot. and North. E. <i>sma’.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smári
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., botan. <i>clover,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smatka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smátka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to make small,</i> Sks. 105 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/smatt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          smátt
