        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snar-raedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snar-ræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>presence of mind, a dashing-, smart feat.</i> Fms. viii. 392; þetta verk þótti it mesta s., Lv. 110; Gísl (acc.) rak þat til þessa snarræðis, <i>this rash deed,</i> Bs. i. 156.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snar-skygn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snar-skygn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>keen-eyed,</i> a nickname, Landn. 201.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snar-spjot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snar-spjót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a javelin,</i> Ísl. ii. 450.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snar-synn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snar-sýnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>keen-eyed,</i> Post. 636.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snar-volr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snar-völr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [provinc. Swed. <i>snar-wral</i>], <i>a ‘turning-stick,’ a tourniquet,</i> a stick by which a cord is tightened; lét hann reka at honum marga snarvölu, Fas. iii. 568: in mod. usage, <i>a twitch,</i> i. e. a cord twisted round the upper lip of a vicious horse while being shod, það er bezt að setja á hann snarvöl!",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., pl. snörur, [A. S. <i>sneare</i>], <i>a snare</i> (prop. <i>a ‘hard-twisted cord’</i>). Fms. i. 206, MS. 623. 36; egna snöru, Grett. (in a verse), Mar.; eigi sá hann snaruna, O. H. L. 53; ek mun sitja í snörunni, Fms. vi. 13; leggja snörur fyrir e-n, ix. 309; þá fann hann í hverja snöru hann hafði gengit, Ó. H. 232: <i>a halter,</i> Mar.; dæma e-n til snöru, Pr. 413.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snara-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Engl. <i>to snare</i>], <i>to turn quickly, twist, wring;</i> hann snaraði skjöldinn, Nj. 43, 262, Valla L. 213; hann snarar (<i>wrings</i>) af honum höfuðit, Finnb. 228; Bárðr snaraði glóvana sundr milli handa sér, Fms. ii. 148; strengr var snaraðr at fótum þeim. i. 179; hann snaraði, svá at fætr vissu upp, Eg. 508; Hrappr tekr báðum höndum um fal spjótsins, ok snarar af út, Ld. 98; snaraði hann hárit um hönd sér, Landn. 152; snaraði hann at sér klæði, Fms. iii. 77; snaraði Þorkell höttinn at höfði honum, Landn. 146; snaraðr ok snúinn, <i>wrung and twisted,</i> Bs. i. 560: <i>to translate a book,</i> snara bók upp í Norrænu, Stj. 1, 40; hér byrjar sögu OÓlafs konungs er Bergr ábóti snaraði, H. E. i. 591.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snarfla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snarfla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= snörgla, O. H. L. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snarka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snarka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sputter, fizzle,</i> of a light when the wick is damp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snarl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snarl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = snörgl: <strong>snarla</strong> = <strong>snarfla</strong> (Ó. H. 84), = snörgla, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snarla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snarla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = snarliga, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snarp-eggjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
