        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a pruning-knife,</i> D. N. i. 321; sniðil at höggva upp þorna, Greg. 62; sniðrli (= sniðli), Gþl. 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snidils-varp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sniðils-varp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘cast of the pruning-knife;’</i> a person was entitled to land so far outside his fence as he could throw his sniðill, Gþl. 453: sniðill, the name of a sword, Fas. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snidugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
