            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>snegel;</i> Engl. <i>snail;</i> Dan. <i>snegl</i>], <i>a snail,</i> Fas. iii. 12 (as also the verse); brekku-s., freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snikka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snikka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. sniðka, <i>to nick, cut,</i> esp. as a mason’s or carpenter’s term; telgja eðr s., Fms. xi. 431.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snikkari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snikkari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>snedker</i>], <i>a carpenter,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snilld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snilld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [snjallr], <i>masterly skill, eloquence;</i> orðhegi, snilld ok skilning, Sks. 438; vitra ok s., Mar.: kom hann svá sínu máli, at þat þótti öllum áheyrilegt, bar til þess s. haus, Fms. xi. 219; lauk drottning með því sinni tölu, at allir lofuðu hennar s. ok vitrleik, i. 141; ok völðusk til þrír hinir snjöllustu menn at tala á þinginu, ok vóru þessir ágæztir bæði at viti ok snilld, x. 278; með s. sinna orða, 279; vitrleik, s. ok hyggju, Barl. 12; í þeirri helgu snilld (<i>in the holy text</i>) mælir svá, Hom. 155; orða-snilld, Lil. 64; mál-snilld, <i>eloquence;</i> snilldar-orð. Gd. 41; snilldar-framr = Lat. <i>disertus,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snilldar-bragd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snilldar-bragð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>prowess,</i> Fms, x. 258; stórvirki ok s., iv. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snilldar-legr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
