        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>masterly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snilldar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snilldar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a great orator, a master,</i> Hkr. iii. 27; s. til mælsku, Sks. 475.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snilldar-verk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snilldar-verk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a heroic deed, prowess,</i> Fms. vi. 38, vii. 87, Ó. H. 33; <i>a masterly work.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
