          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or better <strong>Snori,</strong> a pr. name, see snerrir, Eb. <strong>Snorrungar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the descendants of Snorri the Priest,</i> Sturl. i. 55, ii. 82.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snotr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., the <i>r</i> is radical, fem. snotr, neut. snotrt; [Ulf. <i>snotrs</i> = σοφός; A. S. <i>snotor</i> = <i>sapiens</i>]:—<i>wise,</i> a word noticeable for its use in the old Hm. (where it is used of the <i>‘wise’</i> man, ú-snotr of the ‘fool’), Gr. σοφός, Lat. <i>sapiens,</i> cp. Hebr. הכם; ok með snotrum sitr, Hm. 5; snotrs manns hjarta, 54; til snotr, 55; hveim snotrum manni, 94; ó-snotr maðr, 23–26, 78, 160; meðal-snotr, 53–55; al-snotr, <i>all-wise,</i> 54; ráð-s., 63; otherwise of rare occurrence in old writers, snotr kona, Edda; ef hann vill snotr heita, Sks. 317; ósnotr, 449; Sturl. iii. 241,—lögðu menn á þat eigi fullan trúnað er hann sagði, þvíat Björn var nokkut snotr (ú-snotr?) ok svá nokkut grályndr kallaðr—is a dubious passage and prob. corrupt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snotr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snotr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>clever;</i> mæla sannara eðr snotrligra, Valla L. 206.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snotra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snotra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to make wise;</i> seint er afglapa at snotra, Fas. iii. 585.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snotra-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snotra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. the name of one of the minor goddesses, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snokr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snókr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>snog</i>], <i>a snake;</i> see snákr: a nickname, Sturl. iii. <strong>Snóks-dalr,</strong> a local name in Icel., from the pr. name.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snopa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snópa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. snópir, <i>to idle about dismally</i> (destitute and hapless); sitr ok snópir, Hm. 32; snópa snauðr, Fas. iii. 12 (in a verse); so in the mod. phrase, snópa úti í kulda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [snotr], <i>a gentlewoman,</i> Edda 109; snótar úlfr, <i>the ‘lady’s wolf,’</i> i. e. Loki, who carried off the goddess Idun, Haustl.; snótum öllum, opp. to jörlum öllum, Gh. 21, Rm.; the word is poët., and in prose only ironical, þessar snótir, <i>these dames,</i> Al. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snubba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snubba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Old Engl. <i>snybbe;</i> Engl. <i>to snub</i>], <i>to snub, chide.</i> Stj. 423; hón frúin snubbaði hann, Karl. 53; s. e-n um e-t, Mar.; hence mod. snupra, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snubban"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snubban
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a snub, chiding,</i> Mar. <strong>snubbu-ligr,</strong> adj.; s. orð, <i>snubbing words,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snubbottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snubbóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>snubbed, nipped,</i> the pointed end being cut off; það er snubbótt fyrir endan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snudda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snudda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, = snuðra; s. eptir e-u.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snudra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snuðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (<strong>snoðra,</strong> Finnb. 214), <i>to snuff, scent,</i> like a dog, Vd. 126 old Ed.; hann ferr ok snoðrar um hvern stein, Finnb. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snugg-illr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snugg-íllr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dismal;</i> var heldr snuggíllt veðr, <i>chilly weather,</i> Grett. 111 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snugga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snugga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. snuggir, defect. in other forms, [Swed. <i>snugga</i> = Icel. sníkja]:—<i>to hanker after;</i> snæliga snuggir kváðu Finnar, <i>it snuffs of snow, quoth the Finns,</i> Fms. vii. 20; horfa ok snugga heljar til, <i>to throw a hankering look towards Hel,</i> Skm. 27; Judæi skyldi eigi þurfa til þess at snugga, at nokkurn tím komi undir þá konungdómrinn, <i>they need not hanker after that,</i> Stj. (MS.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snupra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snupra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to snub, chide</i> a child; and <strong>snuprur,</strong> f. pl. <i>chidings.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snurda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
