            {
              "__html": "[from snotr, qs. snytri-], <i>neat, elegant:</i> <strong>snyrti-liga,</strong> adv. <i>neatly,</i> búask s., Str. 81; <strong>snyrti-ligr,</strong> adj., Konr.: <strong>snyrti-maðr,</strong> m. a <i>gentleman,</i> Edda (Gl.); snyrti-drengr, -freyja, -gátt, -gerðr, -grund, all poët. epithets of <i>gentlemen</i> and <i>women.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
