      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [snáð], <i>to eat, take a meal,</i> with dat.; sem vit höfum snætt þessu, Stj. (mod. with acc.): absol., þeir snæddu báðir samt, Fms. i. 216; s. af einum diski, 259; er konungr hafði snætt at dagverðar-borðum, vi. 150; þeir hvíldusk ok ætlaði konungr at snæða, ix. 404.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a meal</i>, = snæðing, Fms. ix. 404, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (<strong>snæðingr,</strong> m., Fms. ix. (v. l.), MS. 4. 24, and so in mod. usage), <i>a meal, the taking a meal;</i> snæðingunni, Fms. ix. 404; sitja í snæðingu, <i>to sit at meals,</i> Korm. 232; s. ok samsæti, Sks. 632; taka snæðing, Sd. 161, Fms. viii. 411; veita e-m snæðing, <i>to give a dinner,</i> vii. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., the <i>r</i> is radical, [Norse <i>snæv;</i> Dan. <i>snæver</i>], <i>tight, narrow;</i> höfðu þeir kyrtla styttri ok snæfrari en hjörtu betri. Fms. viii. 336.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaefr-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæfr-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>alertness,</i> Fbr. 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaefr-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæfr-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>deftly,</i> Hkr. iii. 252.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaefr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæfr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>deft, alert,</i> Fms. vii. 343; s. ferð, Ld. 284: <i>rash,</i> er yðr eigi einn hlutr vel gefinn, at svá er allt snarligt ok snöfrligt um yðr, Band. 16 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaefr-mannligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæfr-mannligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>deft,</i> Hkr. iii. 338 (Cod. Fris. snæfr-).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaefugls-stadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæfugls-staðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a local name in Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaelda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snælda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to snjallr], <i>a spindle;</i> suúðr ok snælda, N. G. L. i. 92. <strong>snældu-hali,</strong> a. m. <i>a ‘spindle-tail,’</i> Bret. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeldingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snældingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [snáldr], poët. <i>a serpent,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., this word has three different forms, snær, snjár, snjór; (analogous to sær, sjár, sjór; slær, sljár, sljór; mær, mjár, mjór); of these snær is the oldest, snjár rare, snjór prevalent in mod. usage: gen. snæs; acc. snæ, snjá, snjó: before a vowel the <i>v</i> (also written <i>f</i>) appears, snjófar, Bs. i. 198; dat. snævi, 656 A. ii. 8; snjávi, 623. 3; snjófi, Vtkv. 5, Dipl. ii. 14; nom. pl. snjóvar, Hdl. 41, Bs. i. 198, etc.; acc. gen. pl. snjófa, Lv. 25, Dipl. ii. 14; snjáva, Fms. ii. 97; dat. pl. snævum (snjávum, Fms. ix. 233), snjávum, snjóvum: in mod. usage the <i>v</i> has been dropped, dat. snjó, pl. snjóar, snjóa; this shortened form also occurs in old writers, esp. before the suffixed article, snænum, K. Þ. K. 6 (Kb.); snæ (dat.), Grág. ii. 88; snjánum, K. Þ. K. 12 B; snjónum, Bs. i. 198: [Ulf. <i>snaiws;</i> common to all Teut. languages, as also to Gr. and Lat., though without the initial <i>s</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>snœri,</strong> n.; [snúa; Ulf. <i>snorjo</i> = σαργάνη; O. H. G. <i>snuor;</i> Swed. <i>snöre;</i> Germ. <i>schnure</i>]:—<i>a twisted rope,</i> of hemp, esp. such as is used for fishermen’s lines and the like; hann kom snærinu á akkeris-hringinn, Lv. 99; lögð s. umhverfis, Eg. 340; þeir týndu snærum sínum, <i>their fishing-lines,</i> Gd. 51: <i>the thong of a javelin,</i> Lat. <i>amentum;</i> þeir fengu fingrum í snæri, <i>they fingered their thongs,</i> Am. 42, cp. ‘inserit amento digitos’ of Ovid; grípa í bug snæum, Jd. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeri-dorr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæri-dörr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>a javelin with a thong.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeri-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæri-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>brisk,</i> Fms. x. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeris-spjot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæris-spjót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a javelin,</i> Eb. 310, Rd. 267, Hkr. iii. 38, Fas.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snaeugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snæugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>snowy;</i> skór snæugir, Gísl. 31; snæfgum höndum, Fb. ii. 334 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snofr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snöfr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., see snæfrligr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snogg-klaeddr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snögg-klæddr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘snug-clad’</i> i. e. <i>in under-clothing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snogg-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snögg-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>suddenly,</i> Landn. 85.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snogg-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snögg-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sudden;</i> s. viðburðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snoggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snöggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., the <i>v</i> appears before a vowel, snöggvan, etc.; compar. snöggvari; superl. snöggvastr: [Engl. <i>snug,</i> but metaph. = <i>smooth</i>]:—<i>bald</i> or <i>short, smooth,</i> of wool, hair, crop; á loðna ok lembda en aðra snöggva ok gelda, Vm. 33; snöggvar ær, Grág. i. 505; nauts rófa snögg, Eb. 272; snöggvan belg, Landn. (in a verse); stutt skegg ok snöggvan kamp, Sks. 288; þeir bitu allt gras at snöggu, <i>bit it close,</i> Fms. xi. 6: freq. in mod. usage, esp. of grass, það er snöggt, túnið er snöggt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snokta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snökta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>snökt,</strong> n. <i>whining</i>), t, <i>to sob, whine;</i> ér látið ílla, snöktið eða syrgit, Fms. viii. 234; með snöktandi röddu, i. 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snop"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snöp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [snapa], <i>a ‘nip,’</i> scanty grass for sheep to nibble at in snow-covered fields; það er ekki nema litil snöp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snor-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snör
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see snor.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snorgl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snörgl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (sounded <strong>snörl</strong>), <i>a rattling sound in the throat,</i> Fs. 144, Sturl. ii. 67 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snorgla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snörgla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to ‘snarl,’ rattle in the throat,</i> Hom. 121, Fms. v. 213.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snortr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snörtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. snartar, [Ivar Aasen <i>snart</i> = <i>a stick burnt at one end</i>]:—a nickname, Landn.; hence <strong>Snartar-tunga,</strong> a local name.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snos"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snös
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ivar Aasen <i>snos</i>], <i>a projecting rock;</i> þeir höfðu þar tjald hjá snösinni, Gullþ. 8: freq. in mod. usage, kletta-snös, fram á snösina; berg-snös, Eg., Gullþ., Hom.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/snottungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          snöttungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [snatta], <i>a rover,</i> Fas. ii. 357.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/so"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          so
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "—svá. (q. v.), <i>so</i>; <strong>soddan,</strong> svoddan, <i>such.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/so-guru"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          so-guru
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>so-goru,</strong> <strong>so-gurt,</strong> <i>so done</i> (see göra F. III); enda siti um sogurt, <i>let it remain as it is,</i> Skáda (Thorodd); at soguru, <i>as things stand,</i> Ó. H. 202, Skv. 1. 24. 40; at eigi mundi sogurt sjatna, Nj.; á sogurt ofan, <i>to boot,</i> Bs. i. 178, Ölk. 36; þeir fóru heim við sogort, 655 vii. 4; fara heim með soguru, [= Gr. ἄπρακτος], Glúm. 332: the full form, svágörvu. Eg. 155, or svágört, Fas. i. 85, is due to editors or late transcribers, and is not idiomatic.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          soddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., mod. <strong>suddi,</strong> [soð], <i>dampness, steam,</i> as a nickname, Fms. ix.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
