        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>decent, proper, respectable,</i> Fs. 21, Fms. v. 284, Magn. 434.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soma-spell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sóma-spell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>lack of property,</i> Sks. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soma-saemd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sóma-sæmd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>dignity,</i> Fms. i. 259.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/somi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sómi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>honour;</i> vil ek eigi drepa hendi við sóma mínum, Nj. 71; þeir bræðr þökkuðu konungi þann sóma er hann veitti þeim, Eg. 96; leiðangrs-görða ok annars konungligs sóma (<i>due, honour</i>) er þér erut honum skyldir at veita, Fms. vii. 19; eigi er á kveðit hve mikit fé henni skyldi heiman fylgja, en likligt at vera mundi góðr sómi, Ísl. ii. 393; margs var alls sómi, manna tiginna, <i>abundance of all things.</i> Am. 92.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/son"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          són
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Germ. <i>sühne, ver-söhnung</i>]:—<i>an atonement, sacrifice,</i> of the heathen age; this ancient Teut. word remains in the Norse only in a few COMPDS: sónarblót, sónardreyri, sónargöltr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sound,</i> = Lat. <i>sonare.</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sonar-blot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sónar-blót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an atonement-sacrifice,</i> and at the same time <i>an oracle;</i> Dagr konungr … gékk hann þá til sónar-bloós til fréttar, Hkr. i. 24. Fas. i. 532.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sonar-dreyri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sónar-dreyri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the blood of atonement</i> (the blood of the sónar-göltr, q. v.), Hdl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sonar-goltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sónar-göltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘atonement-boar,’</i> consecrated to the sun-god Frey. The ancient sacrifice of atonement (sónar-blót) was thus performed:—the largest boar that could be found in the kingdom was on Yule-eve led before the king and his men assembled in the hall; the king and his men then laid their hands on the boar’s bristly mane and made a solemn vow, strengja heit at Braga-falli. The animal being sacrificed, divination took place, probably by chips shaken in the boar’s blood; for descriptions see Herv. S. ch. 10 (Fas. i. 531, 532), Hkv. Hjörv. (the prose), Yngl. S. ch. 21 (ganga til sónar-blóts til fréttar). The boar’s head at Yule-tide in Queen’s College, Oxlord, is probably a relic of this ancient heathen sacrificial rite.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sonn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sónn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [from Lat. <i>sonus</i>], <i>a sound;</i> með sætum són, Fb. ii. 26, Pass. 25. 13; láta sónin ganga, <i>to go on trumpeting.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sop-limi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sóp-limi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a sweeping-broom;</i> sóplimum prýtt. Luke xi. 25, in the N. T. of 1540.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sopa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sópa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>swapan;</i> Engl. <i>sweep;</i> Scot. <i>soop,</i> the <i>oo</i> = <i>wn</i>]:—<i>to sweep,</i> the thing swept in dat.; ok sópaði á ofan moldu, Fms. i. 213; hann sér sópat snjánum, Glúm. 329: acc., norðan-vindr sópar burt alla illviðris-klakka, Sks. 234: griðkonan sópar saman léreptunum, Hrafn. 25; hann sópaði þeim af sér, Fms. vi. 110: s. vatni frá andliti sér, Bs. i. 355.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
