          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = spákona, Eb. (in a verse); in Norway <i>spaa-möy</i> is a knuckle in a cow’s foot (the same double sense as in Icel. vala?), used in the game of playing the wizard or prophet, Ivar Aasen.",
