        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘spae-word,’ prophecy;</i> nú kom fram spásagan Gests, Ld. 286, Sturl. ii. 78: plur., góðar þykkja mér spásögur þínar, Nj. 146; þessi s. er nú fram komin á várum dögum, Fms. viii. 240, Al. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spa-sogn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spá-sögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = spa saga, Fms. ii. 285, Stj. 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spamann-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spámann-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>prophet-like.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/span-bakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spán-bakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = skotbakki, Fms. ii. 271.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/span-brjota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spán-brjóta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "braut, <i>to shiver, break into splinters,</i> Ann. 1343.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/span-nyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spán-nýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (spelt <strong>spánýr</strong>), [Engl. <i>span</i> in ‘spick and <i>span</i>’], <i>span-new,</i> very freq. in mod. usage; vín spánnýtt at drekka, <i>fresh wine,</i> Þiðr. 15, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/span-osi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spán-ósi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>span-new,</i> of ships just launched; þau (the ships) vóru spánósa ok nýbrædd, Fms. viii. 382; kista s. svá sem nýskafin væri, Ó. H.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/span-thak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spán-þak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shingle-roof,</i> Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/span-thaktr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spán-þaktr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>shingle-thatched,</i> Fms. v. 331.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spann-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spánn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>Spain,</i> Fms. vii. 78 sqq., x. 92: <strong>Spán-land,</strong> n. <i>id.,</i> Stj. 92 (<strong>Spána-land,</strong> id. v. l.): <strong>Spán-verjar,</strong> m. pl. <i>Spaniards</i>, Mirm.: <strong>Spán-verskr,</strong> adj. <i>Spanish,</i> Karl. 449: mod. <strong>Spánskr.</strong>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spann-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spánn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>spónn,</strong> m., gen. spánar, dat. spæni, pl. spænir, acc. spánu, spónu, Fms. i. 128, 290, N. G. L. ii. 131: the mod. form is <strong>spónn,</strong> spóns, acc. pl. as well as dat. spæni: [A. S. <i>span, spoon;</i> Germ. <i>spann;</i> Dan. <i>spaan;</i> Engl. <i>spoon</i>]:—<i>a chip, shaving,</i> made by a plane, knife, axe; þó at miklir spænir væri af telgdir, Bjarn. 14: spánn af krossinum helga, Fms. vii. 91; spánu nokkora … hann sópaði spánunum öllum í hönd sér … lét brenna spánuna í lófa sér, Ó. H. 197; spánu þá er þeir telgdu, Fms. xi. 34; ok fylldu upp af spánum, i. 127: tjörgaða spónu. 128; afhógg ok spónu, 290; til þess er snjór kemr á spónu, N. G. L. ii. 131; hrjóta spænirnir upp í móti honum, Edda; lokar-spænir, spána-hrúga, Krók. 52 C: in the phrase, brotna í spán, to <i>be ‘broken into matchwood,’</i> of a ship, Eg. 405, Nj. 267, 282, cp. Kristni S. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., spá, spátt, [spá]:—<i>prophetic;</i> í hjarta spás manns, Hom. 58; þat er spátt, er spakir mæla, Bs. i. 264: also spá (fem. adj.) er spaks geta, Grett. 72 new Ed., Fms. xi. 154: sann-spár, for-spár, veðr-spár, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spazera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spázera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [from Germ. <i>spazieren</i>], <i>to walk,</i> Fms. xi. 430, Stj. 138, Bs. ii. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spazia"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spázia
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the margin</i> of a book, skrifa á, spázíuna.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spegill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spegill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>speil;</i> Germ. <i>spiegel;</i> Lat. <i>speculum</i>.], <i>a mirror,</i> Stj. 9, Fms. iii. 543, Mar. 1032, Pm. 87, 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spegla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spegla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to look in a glass.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a spy;</i> sínum speingum ok galdra-mönnum, Hb. (1865) 30, as also in arg-speingr, <i>a spy,</i> Dropl. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>spæja,</strong> að, [Germ. <i>spähen;</i> Dan. <i>speide</i>], <i>to spy:</i> hafa spæjat (spejat v. l.) ok rannsakat, Stj. 145; hann leyndisk ok vildi speja um húsfreyju, Grett. 200.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spejari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spejari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a spy,</i> Stj. 219. Rétt. 8 (D. N. i. 87).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [spakr], <i>wisdom</i> (= Gr. σοφία, Lat. <i>sapientia</i>); sú speki er hann sagði fyrir ú-vorðna hluti, Fms. i. 146; eilíf speki, Ann. 1848. 372; speki ok vísdómr, … af speki Salomonis, Stj. 560; speki-meistari = spekingr, id.; get-speki. heim-s., q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speki-andi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speki-andi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the spirit of wisdom,</i> Rb. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speki-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speki-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = spekingr, Glúm. 388.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speki-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speki-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>words of wisdom,</i> Greg. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speki-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speki-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wise counsel,</i> Fas. i. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spekingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spekingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wise man, a sage;</i> Sigurðar Hlaða-jarls er allra spekinga var mestr, Fms. i. 20; heyrit, ér spekingar, orð mín, ii. 240; Einarr bjó þá at þverá, s. mikill, Lv. 36; hann var inn mesti s. at viti, Eb. 26; Osvifr var s. mikill, Ld. 122; Gestr var s. at viti, framsýnn um marga hluti, 124; síðan fór hann til spekings eins ok sagði honum drauminn, Nj. 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spekja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Dan. <i>spæge</i>], <i>to calm, soothe, keep quiet;</i> s. menn sína, Flóv. 26: reflex. <i>to be calmed,</i> muntú þá spekjask, þótt eigi spekisk þú svá brátt, 677. 12; lét setja hann í járn ok hugði at hann mundi spekjask, Fms. vi. 291.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spekjur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spekjur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. [A. S. <i>spæc</i>], <i>parley;</i> aðrar váru okkrar spekjur, Gkv. 3. 4 (a απ. λεγ.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "older form <strong>spekð</strong> = speki, <i>quietness, peace;</i> gæta e- með spekt, Sks. 126; spekðar ok hógværis, Fms. x. 408; spektar-maðr, <i>a peace-loving man,</i> K. Á. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>speldi,</strong> n. <i>a square tablet;</i> gluggar, ok snúin fyrir speld, Nj. 114; undir söðulfjölinni sprettir hann upp speldi, tekr þar upp bréfit, Sturl. iii. 295: <i>a tablet</i> to write on, ríta á speldi, Fas. ii. 551.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spelkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spelkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to stuff,</i> of skins; síðan lætr Oddr troða belginn ok s., Fas. ii. 516.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spelkur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spelkur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. [A. S. <i>spelc</i>], <i>a splint</i> for binding up broken bones; hann setti við fætrna, ok batt við spelkur, Fas. iii. 309, passim in mod. usage; lætr hann flá af því belg, siðan lætr hann setja spelkur (spjalkir v. l.) í munn því, ii. 181.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [A. S. <i>spell</i>], <i>a flaw, damage;</i> ábyrgjask landit við öllum spellum til fardaga, Grág. ii. 216; ábyrgjask e-t við spellum við kaupanda, 249; áðr menn sjá at með spellum ferr, N. G. L. i. 54: <i>a flaw, fault,</i> allmikil spell, Fms. viii. 53, v. l.: <i>a breach,</i> frændsemis-spell, sifja-spell, sakar-spell, etc. <strong>spella-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>faultless,</i> N. G. L. i. 232.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spell-reid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spell-reið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the damaging a horse by overriding him,</i> Grág. i. 435.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spell-verk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spell-verk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a misdeed, the doing damage,</i> Grág. ii. 327.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spell-virki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spell-virki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. <i>mischief-working, damage;</i> verða sekr (fjörbaugs maðr) um s., Grág. i. 88, 129, Gþl. 241; göra spjallvirki eða rán búum, Grág.; höggva bú eðr taka aðra vist en göra eigi annat spellvirki, id.; göra skaða ok spjöllvirki, Eg. 196; nú höggr maðr í borð skipi manns framan eðr aptan, þat er s., N. G. L. i. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spell-virkni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spell-virkni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the doing damage,</i> Grág. ii. 327, Fbr. 99 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að (?), = spilla; fæðask af spellaðum hlutum, Stj.; ok hafi svá spellask = spilzk, 290; öll veröldin var spellað, 55: hann hafði spellat sinn veg, 56; ú-spellað mál, <i>uncorrupt,</i> N. G. L. ii. 78, 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spellan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spellan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>defilement,</i> Stj. 24, 290.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spen-bolga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spen-bólga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a swelling of the teat</i> or <i>dug,</i> Pr. 471.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spen-drekkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spen-drekkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sucking child;</i> þat barn er s. er, Grág. i. 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spen-volgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spen-volgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>warm from the cow,</i> of milk.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spengi-legr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spengi-legr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>tall and fine,</i> of stature.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [spöng], <i>to spangle;</i> borðit var spengt járni, Fas. ii. 64; exi forna ok spengda, Sturl. ii. 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/speni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          speni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>spana</i>], <i>a teat, dug</i>, esp. of animals: grís er drukkit hafði spenann, Fs. 71; fjórar mjólkár runnu ór spenum hennar, Edda; ýla þegar er þeir missa mjólkr ór þurrum spenum, Al. 31; þat var gyltr ok spenar á, Fms. vi. 216; fjórir hanga spenar, Gsp.; þat skrímsl hefir á brjósti sér stóra spena, Sks. 169; hann kom hverju lambi á spenann, Od. ix. 245. <strong>spena-barn,</strong> n. <i>a sucking child,</i> Fas. ii. 328.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spenja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spenja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. spenr; pret. spandi; subj. spendi; part. spanit; cp. spana: [akin to speni; A. S. <i>spanjan</i>]:—prop. <i>to draw the teat,</i> but only used",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
