        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spjall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spjall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘spell,’ mischief, damage,</i> = spell; taka spjall af e-u, Sks. 352 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spjall-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spjall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. <i>spill</i> = μυθος; A. S. and Engl. <i>spell;</i> O. H. G. <i>spel</i>, hence mod. Germ. <i>spiel</i>]:—<i>a ‘spell.’ saw, saying;</i> hafa mart í spjalli, <i>to treat of many things.</i> Skáld H. 4. 10; and-spjall, <i>an answer, reply;</i> guð-spjall (q. v.), <i>gospel</i>:—else used in plur. and only in poetry: <strong>spjöll,</strong> <i>words, tidings;</i> forn spjöll, <i>old words, old lore,</i> of bygone days, Vsp 1. Hkv. 1. 36; ný spjöll, <i>news,</i> Hkv. Hjörv. 31; jó frá ek spjalla, <i>asked him for news,</i> Gkv. 2. 5; sunnan em ek kominn at segja spjöll þessi, Fas. i. 499 (in a verse); heilög spjöll, <i>holy ‘spells,’</i> Skákl H. 7. 62; móðug spjöll, <i>‘moody spells,’ lamentations,</i> Gh. 9; hermdar spjöll, <i>angry words,</i> Edda (in a verse); fé-spjöll, <i>‘fee-spells,’</i> Vsp. (see fé); vig-spjöll, <i>war-news.</i> Lex. Poët.; læ-spjöll, <i>lewd spells.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spjall-virki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spjall-virki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = spillvirki, Grág.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spjalla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spjalla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [Ulf. <i>spillen</i> = <i>to pronounce</i>], <i>to ‘spell,’ talk;</i> myrkri við man spjalla, Hm. 81; fjöld nam at s., Bkv. 13; spjallandi = mál-vinr; spjalii, Edda ii. 497.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
