        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>mocking.</i> Barl. 197.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spott-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spott-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mocking, sporting,</i> Nj. 61, Bjarn. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spotta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spotta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að. [Germ. <i>spotten;</i> Dan. <i>spotte</i>], <i>to mock, make sport of;</i>þó þeir spotti mik, Fms. vi. 208; eigi þarf at s. þetta svá, mjök, Ld. 216; mun þú vera spottaðr, <i>duped, mocked, made sport of,</i> Fms. vii. 153; þótti honum þeir hafa mjök spottað sik, er honum höfðu komit í þessa ferð, 212: spotta e-t af e-m, <i>to cheat one of a thing;</i> hafa þær hæðiliga spottað af mér mitt ríki, Bret. 164; s. at e-n, <i>to make sport of,</i> Nj. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spottan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spottan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a mocking,</i> Flóv. 30, Skálda 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spotti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spotti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., <strong>spottr,</strong> Vm. 103, [Engl. <i>spot</i>], <i>a bit, small piece;</i> brátt mun hann beita upp land várt þegar er hann þykkisk nokkurn spotta í eiga. Fms. vi. 103; tak nú til þín þessa tíu spotta möttulsins, Stj. 576 (<i>seissura</i> of the Vulgate): freq. in mod. usage, band-spotti, a <i>piece of string;</i> reipis-s., ólar-s.: of distance, vegar-s.; fara lítinn spotta; or <strong>spotta-korn,</strong> n. <i>a bit of the way.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spozkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
