          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., qs. spraðki, [cp. Dan. <i>sprade</i> or <i>sprade-basse</i> = <i>a dandy</i>]:—<i>a ‘spark,’</i> poöt. <i>a woman,</i> Rm., Edda (Gl.), Lex. Poët., freq. in mod. lays, but not used in prose, <strong>spraka-leggr,</strong> n. a nickname, Ó. H.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprang"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprang
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>lace-weaving;</i> dúkr hálfr með sprang (<i>lace</i>), hálfr með glit (<i>brocade</i>), Pm. 123; dúkar tveir blámerktir, hinn þriði með sprang, 14, cp. D. N. v. 386. <strong>sprang-dúkr,</strong> m. = sprangaðr dúkr, Pm. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spranga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spranga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to walk sprightly,</i> Úlf. 11. 50; spratt hann upp frá spaðs rétt og sprangaði út á húsgang, Stef. Ól.; þá skal bera til sýnis þat klókasta smáþing sem hvers hjákona hefir sprangat, Thom. 301.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprek"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprek
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a stick;</i> eldiviðar-stikum eðr sprekum, Stj. 264; smá-sprek, <i>small sticks.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spreka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spreka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [from Germ. <i>sprechen</i>]; spreka e-m til, <i>to accost one.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spreklottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spreklóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
