            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprengi-kveld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprengi-kveld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘bursting-eve,’</i> i. e. <i>Shrove Tuesday,</i> from the habit of over-eating at that time, Icel. Almanack.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, the causal of springa, [A. S. and Germ. <i>sprengan;</i> Dan. <i>sprænge</i>]:—<i>to make burst;</i> öxi forna ok sprengda, Sturl. ii. 170; s. egg, <i>to break an egg</i>; s. ber, Stj. 200; s. augu úr hausi e-s, Landn. 51; s. hest, <i>to ride a horse to death,</i> Korm. 68, Ísl. ii. 331, Landn. 84, Karl. 308; ok vilit þér s. mik, <i>to work one to death,</i> Sturl. iii. 225.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprengr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprengr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>bursting;</i> honum hélt við spreng (from exhaustion), Fas. iii. 411; fólkinu hélt við spreng (from heat), Sturl. iii. 223; ek hefi unnit hér til sprengs í sumar, <i>worked me to death,</i> Grett. 121 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spretta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spretta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, a causal to the preceding, <i>to make spring up, unloose;</i> s. gjörðum, <i>to ungird,</i> Ísl. ii. 339, 340; s. belti, Fms. iv. 31; hón spretti frá sér nisti, Bs. i. 337; s. af sér digrum fésjóð. Fms. viii. 141; s. frá loku, <i>to unlock,</i> 332; s. tjaldskörum, Fbr. 65, Fms. vi. 179, Bs. i. 420; sprettir hann upp speldi, Sturl. iii. 295; s. gildru um nætr, <i>to unbend a trap,</i> Gþl. 445.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spretta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spretta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. sprett; pret. spratt, sprazt, spratt, pl. spruttu; subj. sprytti; part. sprottinn: [an iterative from springa; Swed. <i>spritta;</i> Engl. <i>spirt;</i> Germ. <i>spritzen</i>]:—<i>to spirt out,</i> of water; þar sprettr einn brunnr, Ver. 2; spratt þar vatn upp, Edda (pref.); þar spratt upp brunnr, Fms. vii. 251; helli þeim sprettr vatn ór berginu, i. 232; veita vötnum þeim er spretta upp í engi manns, Grág. ii. 289; sá er næstr býr vötnum þeim í héraði, er upp spretta næst líki á fjalli, K. Þ. K. 34; spratt honum sveiti í enni, <i>sweat burst out on his forehead,</i> Nj. 68.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spretti-tidindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spretti-tíðindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>flying news,</i> Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprettr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘spurt,’ spring, bound, run;</i> hlaupa í einum sprett, <i>to run in one spurt:</i> esp. of a horse, ríða í einum spretti, hleypa á sprett, harðr á spretti. <strong>sprett-harðr,</strong> adj. <i>id</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spreyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spreyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [spjátra], <i>to make show, sport:</i> <strong>spreytingr,</strong> m. <i>prudery.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprikla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprikla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sprawl</i>, = sprökla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/springa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          springa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. spring; part. sprakk (Early Dan. <i>sprank</i>), sprakkt (sprakst), sprakk, pl. sprungu; subj. spryngi; imperat. spring; part. sprunginn: [common to all Teut. languages]:—prop. <i>to spring, leap, bound;</i> this sense, however, is obsolete in the Icel. and only found in poets; hefðir egi mat nema á hræjum spryngir, <i>unless thou springest on carrion,</i> as a beast of prey, Hkv. 2. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sprawl;</i> s. fótum, Þiðr. 94, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprok
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [Dan. <i>sprog;</i> Germ. <i>sprache</i>], <i>foreign phrases, gibberish;</i> útlend sprok, Eggert, (mod.) <strong>sprok-verskr,</strong> adj. <i>mixing one’s native language with foreign jargon.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sproti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sproti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Germ. <i>spross</i>], <i>a sprout, twig, stick, rod;</i> vínviðis teinungar eða sprotar, Stj. 200; stangir eða sprota, N. G. L. i. 380; hann laust sprotanum á pallinn, Landn. 121; laust hann sveininn með sprota, Nj. 16; reiði-s., <i>a rod of ire,</i> Pass. 48; veldis-s., ríkis-s., <i>a sceptre</i>:—<i>the end-piece</i> or <i>clasp</i> of a belt, Þiðr. 114 (beltis-sproti). <strong>sprota-barn,</strong> n. <i>a ‘rod-child,’</i> Fas. ii. 328; ef átta vetra gamalt barn stelr eðr yngra, þat er s., berja skal þat ef vill, N. G. L. i. 325.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprog-setja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spróg-setja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to stare at mockingly</i> or <i>critically;</i> ambátt hann ein sprógsetti, Pass. 11. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sproga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spróga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to amble</i> of a horse; yfir um skóg at spróga, Fms. vi. (in a verse): <strong>Sprógr,</strong> m. <i>an ambler,</i> the name of a horse, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a woman,</i> poët., Rm. 22, Edda 108, Hallfred (Fs. 114, v. l.), freq. in mod. lays.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprunga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a chink, fissure;</i> jökul-s., <i>a crevice.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spraekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>spræk-ligr,</strong> adj., <strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>sprightly, sprouting;</i> sveinninn var sprækr, Fms. ix. 241.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spraena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spræna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a spirt, sprout, spring,</i> of water; lækjar-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sprokla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sprökla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, spelt <strong>spraukla,</strong> mod. <strong>sprikla,</strong> [Dan. <i>sprætte</i>], <i>to sprawl, kick with the feet;</i> annarr sprauklar nú, Al. 41, Mag. 134; þeir létu smábörn sprækla á spjóta-oddum, Fms. x. 117: also of fishes, hann nær seiði ok kastar því spriklandi á land upp, Od. xii. 254.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
