        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spusa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spúsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [a Fr. word], <i>n spouse,</i> Str. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyrda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spyrða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, [sporðr], <i>to tie up fish by the tail,</i> Fas. ii. 352.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spyrja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. spyr, spyrjum, pl. spurði; subj. spyrði; imperat. spyr, spyrðú part. spurðr, spurt: a part. spurnum, as from a strong verb spurinn, Sks. 12 B. In mod. usage sounded as with <i>u</i> throughout, thus, infin. spurja; pres. spur; imperat. spurðu: with neg. suff. spyrjattu (<i>speer thou not</i>), Fas. i. (in a verse): [spor; A. S. <i>spurian;</i> Scot. and North. E. <i>speer;</i> Germ. <i>spüren;</i> Swed. <i>spörja, spörge.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyrna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spyrna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [spor, cp. sperna, sporna; A. S. <i>speornan;</i> Engl. <i>spurn</i>]:—<i>to spurn, strike with the feet;</i> er úlfrinn spyrnir, Edda 20; s. fæti á e-m, Glúm. 338, Edda 38; stinga huefa eðr spyrna fæti, Grág. ii. 133; s. við fætinum, Bs. i. 462; spyrna fótum í e-t, <i>to spurn with the feet at,</i> Fms. vii. 120; svá hafði Björn hart spyrnt til Vagns, xi. 153; hann spyrndi til sveinsins, Dropl. 31; s. í e-t, <i>to put the feet against, to kick,</i> Bs. i. 462: s. móti broddinum, Acts ix. 5; s. af sér fjötri, Ísl. ii. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spytta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spytta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [spott], <i>to cheat;</i> s. e-t af e-m, Anecd. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a vomit,</i> Eg. 553, Magn. 532, Hom. 151, 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. spý; pret. spjó, spjótt (spjóst), spjó, pl. spjó; subj. spýi; part. spúinn: the mod. form is a weak spúa, spúði, spúð: [Ulf. <i>speiwan;</i> common to the Teut. and Lat.]:—<i>to spew, spit up, vomit;</i> hón spjó blóði, Bs. i. 323; hón hafði mikla sátt ok spjó jafnan, 189; spýja upp, <i>to cast up,</i> Sks. 629 B; s. e-u ór sér, id., Al. 44; sumir spjó (plur.) þar inni í stofunni, Eg. 206; lýkr hundi þeim er spýr, Hom. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [spjót], <i>to spit, pin with sticks;</i> s. at sér vaðmál, Fas. iii. 10; hann spýtti aptr tjaldinu, ii. 285; s. skinn, <i>to spit a skin,</i> for drying it.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spyting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spýting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a spitting,</i> Mar., Th. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spytingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          spýtingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a roll</i> containing sixty ells of wadmal, D. N. iii. 914, Bs. i. 842.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/spaeja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
