        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. spörs, Ýt. 8. but sparrar, Landn. 135, [A. S. <i>spearwa;</i> Engl. <i>sparrow;</i> Dan. <i>spurv;</i> cp. Fr. <i>épervier</i>]:—<i>a sparrow,</i> Edda (Gl.); spórr einn, Hkr. i. 24: as a nickname, Landn. l. c.: the word is, however, rarely used in Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
