        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. indecl.; in the phrase, verða staðsa, <i>to stop, hesitate;</i> the word is a απ. λεγ. occurring in a verse on the fly-leaf of the Ub. of the Edda, cp. Dan. <i>standse.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
