          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a. m. <i>the forecastle-men</i> on a war-ship. Eg. 33, 54, 772. Fms. ii. 331, vii. 266, Nj. 8, passim; the best men were selected for this post.",
            }
