          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-leggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "lagði, <i>to lay stem to stem</i> in battle, Fms. viii. 386, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafn-le"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-lé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a grappling hook,</i> in sea-fight, Nj. 47, Fms. vii. 64, Sturl. iii. 63.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafn-lok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-lok
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the locker in the stem,</i> Sturl. iii. 106.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafn-rekkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-rekkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = stafnhvíla, Sturl. iii. 186, Háv. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafn-sveit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-sveit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the forecastle-men,</i> Fms. vii. 289, viii. 385.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafn-saeng"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-sæng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = stafnhvíla, Fas. iii. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafn-tjald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafn-tjald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a tent in the bow</i> or <i>stem,</i> Fms. vii. 114, Hkv. 1. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stafr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stafr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. stafs, old pl. stafar, Hom. 97. Plac. 48, Korm. 178, 246 (in a verse); stafana (acc.). Fms. x. 16, v. l., [Ulf. <i>stabs</i> = στοιχειον, cp. <i>staua</i> = κρίσις; a word common to all Teut. languages]:—<i>a staff, post,</i> esp. in a building, as is still seen in Norway; bundinn við staf einn, Eg. 232; þrír aurar við staf hvern, ok svá fyrir staflægju hverja, N. G. L. i. 101; ása, stafi, þvertré, syllur, Dipl. iii. 8; hit nyrðra megin við innstafana sat konungr, <i>the inner posts</i> in a hall, Fms. x. 16, v. l.; Egill tók höndum í axlir honum ok kneikti hann upp at stöfum, Eg. 552; hann hafði lagt af sér kápuna uk vápnin ok sat upp til stafa, Ld. 282; kastalarnir vóru svá görvir, at stafir fjórir stóðu upp ok syllr upp í milli ok þar arinn á, en hurðir milli stafanna, … hann bar kaðalinn um einn kastala-stafinn … tók þá kastalinn at ríða mjök, Fms. viii. 429; cp. Ivar Aasen, s. v. <i>stav-hus, stav-kyrkja, stave-naust;</i> horn-stafir, dyri-s. (q. v.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. stög, [A. S. <i>stæg</i>]:—<i>a stay,</i> esp. the rope from the mast to the stem; en fyrir dragreip tvá aura silfrs ok svá fyrir stag, N. G. L. ii. 283, Edda (Gl.); stögin á kugginum festi á höfði skipsins, ok tók af nasarnar, Fms. x. 135, v. l.; bændr skulu fá reip til skips, en ef missir stags, þá liggja við aurar tólf, N. G. L. i. 199; en er þeir drógu seglit gékk í sundr stagit ok fór seglit ofan þver-skipa, Ó. H. 137: the phrase, á stag, <i>ahead,</i> of a ship; rétt á stag, Fms. vi. (in a verse); <i>á</i> stag stjórnmörum steypa vildi, <i>to make the ship go down head foremost,</i> Hkv. i. 29 (thus to be emended, stagstiorn mörum Cd.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stag-brellr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stag-brellr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘stay-brails’</i>(?), a nickname, Orkn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stag-nagli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stag-nagli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘stay-pin,’</i> the pin to which the stay is fastened, Edda ii. 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stag-nal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stag-nál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a darning-needle,</i> a nickname, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          staga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to darn</i> or <i>to patch coarsely;</i> draugr stagaðr náböndum, Mar.; ef maðr stagar (<i>sews up</i>) höfuð svá at ekki bitr, Grág. i. 383; hvítum svörtum stagat allt með þráði, Hallgr. (of a beggar’s rags).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stagl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stagl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>steile</i>], <i>a rack;</i> þenja í stagli, 625. 76; písl sem í stagli, 656 B. 3; festa í stagli, id.: a local name, <strong>Stagl-ey,</strong> Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stagl-festa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stagl-festa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to fasten on a rack,</i> 623. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stagla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stagla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dimin. from staga, <i>to keep harping on,</i> lit. <i>darn often;</i> s. upp aptr og aptr = jaga: as also <strong>stagl,</strong> n. <i>a darning;</i> bóta-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stak-steinar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stak-steinar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>single stones, stepping-stones.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stak-steinottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stak-steinóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stony, with stones here and there,</i> Eg. 755, v. l.; <i>rough,</i> of a road.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          staka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a single ditty;</i> kveða stöku, Eb. 218, Fas. ii. 213; honum varð s. af munni, Band., passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staka-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          staka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to punt, push;</i> stökuðu þeir húskörlum Sveins, Landn. 286 (stjaka, v. l.), Fms. vi. 269; þeir stökuðu Gretti, Grett. 198 A; síðan tók hann ok stakaði (stjakaði) honum, Fas. i. 62, Bs. i. 860.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staka-stormr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          staka-stormr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a gale with squalls and gusts,</i> Fms. ii. 177.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stakk-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stakk-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a stack-yard</i> (for hay), Grág. ii. 233, Eb. 58, Njarð. 374, Bs. i. 669, Dipl. iii. 11, iv. 9, Sturl. ii. 31, 140, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stakka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stakka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to stakkr; cp. Dan. <i>stakket</i> = <i>brief, scant</i>]:—<i>a stump;</i> hafi sá stökku er stytti, Gþl. 399, Jb. 274.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stakkadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stakkaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [Dan. <i>stakket</i>], <i>short, curtailed,</i> D. N. v. 87 (of time).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stakkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stakkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a short coarse bag-like blouse</i> without a waist, Fas. ii. 343, Nj. 143, Fbr. 59, Fs. 33; skinn-s., fanga-s., bak-s., þófa-s., q. v.; stakks-vaðmál, Ann. 1330.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stakr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stakr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [stök, stakt], <i>single, odd;</i> handlín stakt, <i>an odd napkin,</i> Pm. 73 (cp. Dan. <i>umage</i>); tvennir hauzkar og einn stakr, stakr sokkr, etc.; annan vetr verðr stakt sævar-fall, Rb. 90; fjórtán hundruð, sextigi, ok eitt stakt, Ann. 415. 10; sjaldan er ein báran stök, a saying: adv. <strong>stöku-,</strong> in compds, <strong>stöku-sinnum,</strong> adv. <i>now and then;</i> ein-stakr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stakra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stakra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = staka, <i>to push;</i> jafnan finn ek at á-flóð (<i>river-stream</i>) stakrar, Mkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stall-brodir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stall-bróðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>stald-broder</i>], <i>a companion.</i> <strong>stallbræðra-lag,</strong> n. <i>fellowship.</i> Fas. iii. 649.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stall-heilagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stall-heilagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>altar-holy,</i> Fsm. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stall-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stall-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [stallr 4], <i>the step of the mast,</i> El.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stall-stada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stall-staða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a standing in a stall,</i> Gþl. 392.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stall-systir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stall-systir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a female companion.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stalla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stalla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to put in a stall,</i> Ann. 1413.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stallari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stallari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [through A. S. <i>stallare,</i> from Lat. <i>stabularius</i>], <i>a king’s marshal;</i> the word and title first occur in the reign of St. Olave (Björn stallari), Ó. H.; then Ülfr s., Har. S. Harð.; since freq. in Norway, stallara-sæti, stallara-stóll, Sks. 289, Hkr. iii. 181, N. G. L. ii. (Hirðskrá).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stalli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stalli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [see stallr], <i>an</i> (heathen) <i>altar;</i> moldina undan stallanum þar er Þórr hafði á setið, Eb. 8; stóð þar stalli á miðju gólfinu sem altari, ok lá þar á hringr einn mótlauss … á stallanum skyldi ok standa hlautbolli … umhverfis stallann var goðunum skipat í afhúsinu, 10; baugr tvíeyringr skyldi liggja í hverju höfuðhofi á stalla, Landn. 258, Stj. 335; engi maðr skal hafa í húsi sinu staf eðr stalla, N. G. L. i. <strong>stalla-hringr,</strong> m. <i>the altar-ring,</i> see above, Eb. 230; vinna eið at stalla-hring, Landn. 89, Hrafn. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = stalli, [the word may be akin to standa, cp. Lat. <i>stabilis;</i> A. S. <i>steall;</i> Engl. <i>stall</i>]:—<i>any block</i> or <i>shelf on which another thing is placed;</i> skurðgoð sett á stall, Fms. x. 255; af heiðnum stalli, Kristni S. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stallra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stallra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>stallðra,</strong> Fms. iii. 178, and so in mod. usage), að, <i>to halt, stop a bit;</i> stallra við, Stj. 383: <i>to falter</i> = drepa stall, þá tók at stallra hjarta heiðingja, 357, 463. 491. v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stam-hendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stam-hendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. of a metre, Edda (Ht.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stamba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stamba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = stumra; stamba at e-m, Fbr. 16, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stamma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stamma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>stama,</strong> að, <i>to stammer,</i> Anecd. 10, Nikdr. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stampa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stampa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to push with the foot.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stampr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stampr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a large tub;</i> trogum, stömpum, keröldum, skjólum, tunnum, Vm. 177. <strong>stamp-austr,</strong> m. <i>a bucket for baling out,</i> Grett. 51 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stamr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stamr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>stammr,</strong> adj. [A. S. <i>stamor</i>], <i>stammering;</i> þá varð hann svá stammr, Fms. i. 282; sjá maðr varð svá stamr at ekki nam, x. 279; annar hét Þorviðr stammi, hann fékk eigi mælt þrem orðum lengra samt, Ó. H. 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
