            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steina
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [A. S. <i>stânjan;</i> Engl. <i>to stain</i>], <i>to stain, colour, paint;</i> s. skipit með allskyns litum, Fms. x. 320: esp. used in the part. pass., skipit var allt steint fyrir ofan sjó, Orkn. 332, Eg. 68; karfi steindr allr fyrir ofan sjó, 371; altara-klæði steint, bríkar-klæði steint, Vm. 10, Jm. 22; steint merki, B. K. 83; hús tjaldat með steindum klæðum, Fms. x. 16; í steindum söðli, Ld. 272; lopt steint með líkneskjum, Str. 5; steinda kistu, Am.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steina-bru"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steina-brú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a stone-bridge, stone-arch,</i> a natural one, not made by human hands, hence the phrase, gamall sem steinabrú, <i>old as a stone bridge</i> = <i>‘stone-old,’</i> Fas. iii. 61, cp. Ht. (fine): the very phrase shews the ancient Scandinavians, like the old Germans, knew not the arch, as their buildings were all of wood, cp. Tacit. Germ. 16, Herodian. vii. 2: indeed, stone masonry first became known after the introduction of Christianity.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steina-sorvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steina-sörvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>-seyrvi,</strong> n., see sörvi, Edda 68, Ísl. ii. 343, Fas. iii. 543.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Engl. <i>stain</i>], <i>a stain, colour;</i> birt með hvítum steini ok rauðum, Ó. H. 124; rauðum steini, <i>red paint,</i> Karl., Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steinn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [a word common to all Teut. languages], <i>a stone,</i> N. G. L. i. 65; meistari á stein, Barl. 167; steinn einn mikill, Fms. viii. 8, passim: <i>a boulder, rock,</i> stein at lýja járn við. Eg. 141: allit., stokkar eða steinar, Grág. ii. 132, Fb. ii. 102; gengr mark fyrir neðan ór steinum þeim er heita Klofningar, D. I. i. 471; dyrnar á steininum lukusk, Fas i. 514: of a gem (gim-steinn), Js. 78, Þkv. 16, 19, Ó. H. 30; settr steinum, Eg. 698; altaris-steinn, Vm. 37; leiðar-s., sólar-s., <i>a loadstone:</i> stones used for warming rooms, ok hófðu hvárki á því kveldi ljós né steina, Eb. 276; cp. mjólk var heit ok vóru á steinar, Lv. 70: dragging stones as a punishment, see Sól. (draga dreyrga steina); draga stein ok vera útlægr, N. G. L. iii. 16, 210. but it is of foreign origin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stekkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stekkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. stekkjar, pl. stekkir, <i>a fold</i> in which lambs in spring are weaned during the night before being taken from the ewes and driven to the mountain pastures; which season in Icel. is called <strong>stekk-tíð,</strong> f., Edda 103; eggtíð eða stekktíð, Icel. Almanack, 1872. May 27; merkja lamb í stekk, Grág. i. 415; taka lamb ór stekk, Ld. 170; lamb skal marka ór stekk hvert vár ok skal Pétr ábyrgjask ok gefa um haust er aptr kemr, D. I. i. 201; göra upp stekka, Sturl. i. 27; stekkjanna, 28; skal gefa lamb ór stekk, ok gefa um haustið ef aptr kemr, Vm. 169; hafði faðir minn stekk fyrir neðan langa-garðinn fyrir útan ána, Dipl, v. 25. <strong>stekkjar-lamb</strong> or <strong>stekk-lamb,</strong> n. <i>a lamb from the</i> stekkr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stel-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stel-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>thievish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stela
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(stel, stell, Js. 128), pret. stal, stalt, stálu; subj. stæli; imperat. stel, steldú; part. stolinn: [a common Teut. word]:—<i>to steal,</i> with dat. (stela e-u), Eg. 237, Boll. 350, Nj. 74, N. G. L. i. 82; stela stuld, <i>to commit a theft,</i> 83: the phrase, hann stelr öllu sem steini er léttara, <i>he steals whatever is lighter than stone,</i> of a thorough thief.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stelari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stelari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a stealer,</i> Þiðr. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stelkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stelkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a bird, <i>tringa islandica</i> L.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stelling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stelling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [cp. Germ. <i>stellen, stallr</i>], <i>the mast-step;</i> íss var í stellingunni, Fms. ix. 386, v. l.: hence the phrase, setja e-ð í stellingu, <i>to put it firm, right;</i> úr stellingu, <i>out of groove;</i> setja sig í stellingarnar, <i>to put oneself in posture,</i> metaphor taken from raising the mast.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stemma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stemma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [stamr], <i>to stem, stop, dam up,</i> esp. of a stream or fluid; steinn sá er stemdi þurftina, <i>stopped the urine,</i> Bs. i. 310; tekr kuldinn at s. vindæðaruar, Al. 22; stemdu svá upp vatnit, Ó. H. 163; stemma af, Fms. vi. 351: impers., stóra læki stemdi uppi, <i>were stemmed, obstructed,</i> 67; vatnið (acc.) stemdi uppi, Bs. i. 315; at ósi skal á stemma, <i>to dam up a river at its outlet,</i> a saying, Edda; demma ok stemma, D. N. i. 275; hljóp skriða … fylldi dalinn ok stemdi ána Gaul, Ann. 1345: reflex., stríð stemmisk, <i>grief abates,</i> Brand. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [stöng; Dan. <i>stænge</i>], <i>to bar;</i> s. úti, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterk-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterk-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>-leiki, styrk-leikr,</strong> Fms. i. 261), <i>strength;</i> afl ok s., Edda 7; ágætr at sterkleik, Fms. x. 293.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterk-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterk-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (<strong>styrk-liga,</strong> Fms. iii. 60, vi. 267), <i>strongly,</i> Th. 4; berjask vel ok s., Fms. iii. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterk-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterk-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>styrk-ligr,</strong> Fms. ii. 81), <i>strong-like, strong looking;</i> mikill maðr ok s., Eg. 486.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterk-mannligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterk-mannligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), = sterkligr, Fas. ii. 478, vl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterk-vidri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterk-viðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>styrk-viðri,</strong> Fms. ii. 177), n. <i>a strong gale,</i> Grett. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., and <strong>styrkr,</strong> q. v.; the older form takes a <i>j</i> before a vowel, sterkjan, sterkjum; whereas styrkr has both <i>j</i> and <i>v</i>, styrkjan and styrkvan: compar. sterkari, sterkastr, but sterkstr, Hom. 46, 95, 97: [a common Teut. word; A. S. <i>stearc;</i> Engl. <i>stark;</i> Dan. <i>stærk</i>]:—<i>stark, strong;</i> mikill maðr vexti ok sterkr, Nj. 29; hverjum manni meiri ok sterkari, Eg. 179; allra manna sterkastr, Fms. i. 2; styrkr at afli, 19; hverjum manni meiri ok styrkari, 17; aðrir styrkari njósnar-menn, ix. 365; meiri ok styrkari enn aðrir menn, vi. 65; sterkstu stoðir, Hom. 95, 97; sterkst allra dýra, 46; sterkjan vað, Edda 36; styrkja treyju, Fms. ix. 527.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Engl. <i>Easterling, sterling;</i> a word given to the Flemish and Baltic traders]:—<i>sterling;</i> Enskra sterlinga, Ann. 1265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, <i>to crease, pleat;</i> in the phrase, strauk of ripti, sterti ermar, <i>she smoothed the kirtle and pleated the sleeves,</i> Rm.; cp. þá höfðu menn ermar fimm álna langar ok svá þröngvar, at draga skyldi at við handtygil, ok lerka allar at öxl, Fms. vi. 440.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sterti-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sterti-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a stately, fine-dressed person,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stertr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stertr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [A. S. <i>steort;</i> Engl. <i>start</i> in red-<i>start;</i> O. H. G. <i>sterz</i>], <i>a tail,</i> the vertebrae of the tail; skera tagl upp í stert, <i>to dock a horse’s tail;</i> því berr hann stýfðan stert, Fas. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steyldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steyldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [stauli, staulast; cp. Ivar Aasen <i>stöl</i> = <i>a horseshoe-shaped iron hook</i> or <i>clasp</i>]:—<i>crouching;</i> steyldr á hæli, <i>standing in a crouching posture,</i> Fbr. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steypa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steypa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð and t, [a causal answering to stúpa, staup]:—<i>to ‘make stoop,’ cast down, overthrow</i> (Germ. <i>stürzen</i>), with dat.; at vér steypim hánum, Fms. vii. 261; s. þínum úvinum, viii. 220; at eigi mætti ofsi lögum s., x. 120, Hkr. i. 72; s. niðr e-u, <i>to throw down,</i> Barl. 152; s. hjálminum þeim inum gullroðna, Fms. vii. 242; þeir steyptu fimm konungum í eina keldu, Ó. H. 69; hann steypir sér fram, <i>stooped down,</i> Karl. 161.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steypari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steypari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a caster,</i> Clar.; eir-s., <i>a brass-founder,</i> Rétt. 120.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steypdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steypðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "stopðr, part. [see stopi, stapi; A. S. <i>steâp</i>], <i>steep, rising high;</i> steypðir hjálmar, <i>steep helmets (cp.</i> Fris. <i>stâpa helm</i>), Gkv. 2. 19; stöpðir reykir, <i>steep</i> (pillars of) <i>smoke,</i> Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steypi-regn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steypi-regn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a pouring rain.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steypi-reydr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steypi-reyðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a whale, balaena maxima.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steyping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steyping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an overthrow,</i> Fms. viii. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steypir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steypir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a caster</i> (?), a nickname, Fms. viii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Ulf. <i>stautan</i> = τύπτειν; Dan. <i>stöde;</i> Swed. <i>stöta;</i> Germ. <i>stossen;</i> connected with a lost strong verb stúta, staut]:—<i>to push,</i> with dat., <i>cast violently;</i> hverjum hlut er þar í hefir steytt verit, <i>cast into the lake,</i> Stj. 75; þeir steyta þeim út ór vagninum niðr á jörðina, Karl. 161; steytandi honum dauðum á jörð, 194; steytast (<i>to be thrown</i>) niðr í eina dýblizu, 550; vóru þar út á steyttir (<i>flung</i>) dauðir menn, Ann. 1349; steytir urð at urð, <i>was flung from rock to rock,</i> Bs. ii. 25; skipið steytti á skeri, <i>she struck on a skerry;</i> steyta fót sinn við steini, Matth. iv. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steyting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steyting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in á-steyting, <i>a stumbling,</i> N. T., Vídal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/steytr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          steytr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>stöd</i>], <i>a capsize;</i> fá úhagligan steyt, Bs. ii. 129; hón (the wave) horfði á þvert skipit ok ógnaði hræðiligan steyt, 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stétt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [no doubt akin to A. S. <i>stibtan</i> = <i>to found;</i> Germ. <i>stiften;</i> formed like réttr, léttr (q. v.); stétt therefore prop. means <i>a foundation</i>]:—<i>a pavement;</i> en er hann kom fram í stéttirnar, Sturl. ii. 107; kirkju-stétt, iii. 200, 221: in Icel. the raised pavement running along the front of houses is called stétt, bæjar-stétt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stétta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to found, establish;</i> s. mikit íllt, <i>to cause much evil,</i> Stj. 32; <i>to avail,</i> s. harðla mikit, 298; hvat stéttir, at …, 110: <i>to support,</i> at s. vára þörf, Mar.; stétta bæn e-s, Karl. 355; þau stoða þér ekki né stétta, Stj. 20; at þú megir fleirum stétta ok stoða, 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stettar-ker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stéttar-ker
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a vessel with a base,</i> Fs. 5, Vm. 58, 109, Dipl. iii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stettar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stéttar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without a base,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stéttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., see stétt (II).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stibba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stibba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to stifla], <i>a stifling;</i> það er stibba í mér, stibba í nefinu: in reykjar-s., <i>a stifling smoke.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [stíga], <i>a step;</i> stig fyrir stig, <i>step for step.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stig-gata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stig-gata
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a footpath,</i> Sks. 728.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stig-hosur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stig-hosur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>riding-stockings,</i> Fms. x. 415.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stig-reip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stig-reip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>stig-râp;</i> O. H. G. <i>steka-reif;</i> Engl. <i>stirrup</i>]:—<i>a ‘stepping-rope,’ stirrup,</i> Fms. vi. 416; menninir stóðu í stigreipum, Bs. i. 670; varð fótrinn fastr í stigreipinu, Orkn. 450.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stig-vel"
