        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a stirrup,</i> Thom. 420.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stigi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stigi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., <strong>stegi,</strong> Sks. 423 (v. l.), 428 B, [stigr]:—<i>a step, ladder, steep ascent;</i> hann sá stiga frá himnum, Ó. H. 211; stiga sex álna hávan, Vm. 129; stigi skal til eldhúss hvers vera, ok tveir krókar í hverjum fjórðungi, N. G. L. ii. 248, passim in old and mod. usage: of a scaling ladder in war, Al. 146, Sks. 413, 423, 428: the phrase, leggja á stiga, <i>to stretch on a ladder,</i> as on a rack, Fms. ix. 349.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stigning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stigning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in upp-s., niðr-s., q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(also sounded <strong>stígr,</strong> <i>stíg</i> and <i>víg</i> make rhyme in old poems), m., gen. stigs, dat. stig; n. pl. stigar, stiga, which forms seem older and better than stigir, stigu, which also occur: [A. S. <i>stíg;</i> Early Engl. <i>stie</i>; Engl. <i>stair;</i> Dan. <i>sti;</i> Germ. <i>steg;</i> cp. North. E. <i>stye</i> or <i>stie</i>, a steep ascent or pass, as in <i>stye</i>-head Pass]:—<i>a path, footway;</i> sveinarnir hljópu þegar á stiginn er heim lá til bæjarins, Fms. ii. 100; sá er stigana hafði bannat, Fs. 5; dreif liðit af hverjum stig (dat.). Anal. 88; ok ferr þá stigu, Edda 44; taka úkunna stiga, <i>to walk in unknown paths,</i> Fms, viii. 30; kanna ókunna stigu, <i>to visit unknown paths,</i> i. e. <i>foreign lands;</i> ganga þessa stigu, Fs. 32; þóttú lafir á stigum, id.; hylr stigu alla, of snow, Gísl. 28 (drífr í stigu alla, 112. l. c.); stemma stiga fyrir e-m, <i>to bar one’s way, cut one off,</i> Róm. 213; vega ok stiga, <i>ways and paths,</i> Sks. 625 B; götu ok stigu, Greg. 31; ryðja stiginn, <i>to rid</i> or <i>clear the way,</i> Eg. 289; af-stigr, Fs. 5; hjá-stigr, <i>a by-path;</i> leyni-stigr (q. v.), <i>a hidden path;</i> gagn-stígr, <i>a ‘gain-path,’ short cut;</i> glap-stigr, vil-stigr, stafkarls-stigr, ein-stigi, q. v. <strong>stiga-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a highwayman.</i> Eg. 537, Fs. 8, Gullþ. 10, Fms. v. 46; stigamenn ok ránsmenn, Hkr. ii. 336.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stik"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stik
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>stakes, piles,</i> which in times of war were driven in the mouths of rivers, inlets, and along the shore; stiknðu Gautar Gautelfi, at konungr skyldi eigi mega leggja skipum sínum upp í landit, Haraldr konungr lagðisk við stikin, Hkr. i. 92 (see also the verse); þeir lögðu at landi við stikin, Fms. vii. 188; uppi við stikin, 256; þeir hjuggu tengslin frá stikunum, 259: sing., þar gengr Sjólfr til er stikat er, <i>a stake for shooting,</i> Fas. ii. 266.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stika"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stika
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [A. S. <i>stician</i>], <i>to drive piles</i> (stik), Hkr. i. 92 (see stik); hann lét stika ána Temps, Bret.; stikaðr var út óssinn, sem vandi er á í Austrvegum (<i>as is the custom in the Baltic</i>) at stika fyrir úfriði, O. H. L. 12; svá er sagt at Ólafr konungr lét stika ána uppi, ok stór vötn er nær lágu. 52; hann skyldi ok láta stika þjóðleið … svá at eigi væri þar skipum fært, Fb. ii. 72; stika hvert grunn, Edda (Ht.): <i>stakes</i> driven in between high and low water-mark for whale or salmon catching, s. fyrir hval, N. G. L. i. 61; s. laxa-fiski, D. N. v. 531.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a measuring,</i> Grág. i. 497.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>stikls</i> = ποτήριον], <i>the pointed end of a horn,</i> often mounted with gold or silver; manns-höfuð var á stiklinum, Fms, iii. 190; stikillinn hornsins, Edda 32; ristin horn vóru á honum (the ox) ok rennt gulli í stiklana, Fas. iii. 30; slær sik eitt horn á auga hestinum … stikillinn stingr þat brott, Bs. ii. 177.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikk-knifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikk-knífr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sticking-knife, dirk,</i> H. E. ii. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a kind of <i>short, measured poem;</i> stundu vér til stikka … nú er vel tamiðr stikki, Fms. xi. 222 (in a verse); Sörla-stikki, the name of a poem, Fb. i. 277; stikka-lag, a kind of <i>metre,</i> Edda (Ht.) i. 712.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikkinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikkinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stickling, saucy,</i> Fb. ii. 134.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikkjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikkjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dep.: sá er við þat stikkisk, <i>feels himself hit,</i> Hom.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to leap,</i> as on stepping-stones; sá studdi höndunum á bálkinn, ok stiklaði svá út yfir bálkinn ok mannhringinn, Orkn. 112; hann stiklar í södulinn, Nj. 112; ok stiklar svá með reykinum, 202; hann stiklar yfir inn, Ísl. ii. 357; siðan stiklar hann út af Járnbarðanum, Fms. xi. 133; hann stiklaði þá hart upp á þéttleif, 367; stiklar hón ofan af seið-hjallinum, Fas. i. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stikna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stikna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [steikja, <i>ei</i> and <i>i</i> indicating a lost strong verb]:—<i>to be roasted, scorched;</i> bréfit stiknar, Th. 27, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>stilk</i>], <i>a stalk, stem,</i> freq. in mod. usage: as a nickname, Fb. iii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [A. S. <i>stilljan;</i> Engl. <i>still;</i> Dan. <i>stille</i>]:—<i>to still, soothe, calm;</i> Njörðr stillir sjá ok eld, Edda; stilla sik, <i>to still oneself, keep down one’s wrath,</i> Nj. 27, Fms. i. 15; hann var svá óðr at þeir fengu varla stillt hann, Fs. 38; s. skap sitt, 34; s. sonu okkra, <i>to restrain them,</i> Eg.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a resting-place;</i> friðar-stilli, Pass. 21. 8, 12; til-stilli, um-stilli, <i>an arrangement.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilli-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilli-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>composedly, calmly, with moderation;</i> svara s., Ó. H. 59, 97, Ísl. ii. 351; fara s., Fms. vii. 262; fara s. með e-u, Bs. i. 139; maela s., Eg. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilli-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilli-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>moderate, composed,</i> Al. 87, Stj. 381.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>moderation, calmness, temperance,</i> Fms. ii. 38, Fs. 36; með stillingu, Th. 11, Bs. i. 136; hafa stilling við, Ísl. ii. 347: <i>management,</i> kunna góða stilling á e-u, Fms. i. 98; stillingar-maðr, Bs. i. 635.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stillir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stillir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘stiller,’ ‘moderator,’</i> i. e. <i>a king,</i> poët., Hdl. 42, Hkv. Hjörv. 31, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stilltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stilltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (or part.), <i>still, calm, tempered, composed,</i> of mind, character; ákafr ok eigi mjök s., Þorst. Siðu H. 173; vel stilltr, Fs. 23, Nj. 14; s. manna bezt, Eg. 702; ó-stilltr, <i>unruly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stillur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stillur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>stepping-stones,</i> in water.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stimpast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stimpast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að; s. við e-t, <i>to tug against.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stinga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stinga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sting, pret. stakk, stakkt (stakst), stakk, pl. stungu; subj. styngi; imperat. stikk, stikktú; part. stunginn: [Goth. <i>stiggan;</i> A. S. <i>stingan;</i> Engl. <i>sting, stick,</i> and <i>stitch;</i> Germ. <i>stechen;</i> Dan. <i>stikke</i>]:—<i>to sting, stick, stab;</i> maðr stingr á manni stauri, stöngu eða öxar-skapti, eða spjótskapti, N. G. L. i. 69; hann stakk öxar-skaptinu á Þrándi, Eg. 717; hann stakk við forkinum, 220; s. höndum við e-m, Finnb.; stinga við fótum, <i>to put the foot forward,</i> of one suddenly stopping, Finnb. 300; hann stingr niðr atgeirinum, Nj. 83; hann stakk niðr merkinu í jörðina, <i>he stuck the pole fast,</i> Fms. viii. 363; hann stakk sverðinu í bug hringinum, Eg. 306; at Búi hafi stungit stúfunum í hringa kistnanna. Fms. i. 178; stikk stafs-broddi mínum í vatnið, Landn. 251; stikk mér í, kvað reka, Fms. vii. 115 (stikk í mér, Mork. l. c.); Þórólfr stakk þar sverðinu, Ld. 204; hann stakk því í munn sér, <i>stuck it in his mouth,</i> Eb. 242; stakk hendinni í eldinn, Bs. i. 341.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a pin, stiletto;</i> in fetil-stingi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stinn-leggjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stinn-leggjaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>strong-legged,</i> Fas. ii. 358, Fb. i. 69.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stinn-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stinn-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), n. <i>solidity,</i> N. G. L. i. 446.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stinn-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stinn-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (<strong>-ligr,</strong> adj.), <i>strongly,</i> Hkr. iii. 161, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stinnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stinnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stiff, unbending, strong,</i> esp. of anything like a stick, opp. to klökkr, q. v.; stinna stafi, Hm. 143; stinnt spjót, Sturl. ii. 221; setja undir stafi, ok ærit stinnt fyrir grjóti, Hkr. ii. 11; stinnr bogi, stinn skeyti, Karl. 168; s. hjálmr, 285; stinn stál, Stj. 544; stinnr jökull, Mar.: neut., fljúga stinnt, <i>to fly with great force,</i> Hm. 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stipta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stipta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>stifta,</strong> að, older form <strong>stigta;</strong> [A. S. <i>stihtan;</i> Germ. <i>stiften;</i> old Low Germ. <i>stiftion</i> = <i>aedtficare;</i> Dan. <i>stifte</i>; see stétt]:—<i>to establish, found;</i> the word with its derivatives is mod. and from the Dan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stiptan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stiptan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an establishment, foundation.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>stift,</i> and earlier Low Germ. form <i>stigt</i>]:—in Denmark and Norway the country is divided into <i>stifter,</i> i. e. <i>bailiwicks,</i> or eccl. <i>bishoprics;</i> in Icel. the word and thing are quite mod.; hence <strong>stiptamt</strong> and <strong>stiptamt-maðr,</strong> <i>a governor.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stira"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stira
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Dan. <i>stirre;</i> see stara], <i>to stare,</i> = stara; stirðu ér á þeirra fegrð, Mar. 655 xxxii. 3; hann spurði hví sjá ambáttar-son stirði (not styrði) svá á sik, Fs. 68.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stird-faettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirð-fættr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stiff-footed, stiff-legged,</i> Fas. ii. 354.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stird-kvedinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirð-kveðinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>stiff and hard,</i> of poetry, Ísl. ii. 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stird-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirð-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>peevish,</i> Ó. H. 92, Fms. ix. 243, Hrafn. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stird-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirð-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>frowardness, hardness, a hard temper,</i> Ó. H. 70.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stird-ordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirð-orðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stiff-spoken;</i> Halldórr var maðr fámæltr ok s., Hkr. iii 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stirdna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirðna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become stiff,</i> Greg. 67, Fms. iii. 129, Eb. 220; stirðnaðr ok dauðr, Fær. 269; stirðnat lík, Fms. viii. 232, freq. in old and mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stirdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>stiff, rigid;</i> hann var andaðr ok svá s., at menn fengu hvergi rétt hann, Eg. 396; er ek lá stirðr á strám, Sól. 47; fótinn görði stirðan sem tré, Bs. i. 180; ákafliga móðr ok stirðr, Grett. 98; gamlan mann ok stirðan, Sturl. ii. 251; af stirðu lérepti, Sks. 404 B; með stirðum orðum, Mar.; stirt kvæði, <i>stiff, not fluent,</i> of rhymes, Fms. vi. 217, Ísl. ii. 237, v. l.; e-m er stirt um mál, <i>to talk with difficulty,</i> Fms. vii. 165; honum var málit stirt, <i>he had not a fluent tongue,</i> Bs. i. 277.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stirfinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirfinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [stjarfi], <i>peevish, froward,</i> Fs. 78, Grett. 111; ú-stirfinn, <i>unfroward,</i> Hkr. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stirna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [stjarna], <i>to sparkle, gleam;</i> in the phrase, það stirnir í það.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stirndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>starry;</i> s. himinn, Al. 134; al-stirndr, heið-s., <i>star-bright;</i> stirnt hásæti, <i>a starry throne,</i> i. e. <i>the heavens,</i> Sks. 627; stirnd hjálmgjórð, <i>studded,</i> Hkr. iii. 455.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stirtla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stirtla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a dry cow.</i> <strong>stirtlu-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>dry, dull.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stia"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stía
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to pen, to pen sheep,</i> putting lambs into the separate kró, q. v.; hann heyrði jarm þangat er stiat var, Gullþ. 19, cp. Páll Vídal. 519, and so at the present time, see the remarks s. v. stekkr; hence metaph., stía e-m sundr, <i>to separate.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stia-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stía
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [A. S. <i>stige;</i> Engl. <i>sty</i>; Dan. <i>sti</i>], <i>a sty, kennel;</i> sem hundr hjá stíu, Fas. iii. 129; hundr til varðar fyrir búri, búð eða stíu, Grág. ii. 119; svína-stí, <i>a pig-sty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stifla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stífla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a dam;</i> göra stíflur í engi, Grág. ii. 281; göra stíflu, Ó. H. 163; brjóta stíflurnar, 164; lækr, vóru þar í stíflur, Háv. 51 (for flooding a field); brast stíflan, Ann. 1345.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stifla-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stífla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d (mod. að), [Engl. <i>to stifle</i>], <i>to dam up;</i> lækrinn var stífldr (<i>dammed, blocked</i>), Dropl. 34; stífldu með viðum ok torfi, ok stifldu svá upp vatnit, Fb. ii. 280 (stemdu, Ó. H. l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stig-vel-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stíg-vél
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [a for. word, a mod. form of styfill, q. v.], <i>boots.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stiga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stíga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. stíg; part. steig, steigt (Fms. vii. 160), steig, pl. stigu; also sté, Niðrst. 8; þú stétt, Blas. 50, Fms. vii. 160, v. l.; stéttú, Edda 54 (in a verse): subj. stigi; imperat. stíg, stígðú; part. stiginn: [Ulf. <i>steigan</i> = A. S. <i>stîgan,</i> Old Engl. <i>to sty;</i> Germ. <i>steigen,</i> etc.]:—<i>to step,</i> esp. <i>to step upwards;</i> hón mátti ekki stíga á fótinn, Bs. i. 343; stíga fótum á Noreg, á land, <i>to set foot on,</i> Fms. x. 259; svá nær landi, at maðr má stíga á hólmann, Sks. 93 B; stíga í skó, N. G. L. i. 31; hann sté í gólfit upp at ökla, Fms. iii. 188; þú steigt (v. l. stétt) upp ór ánni, vii. 160; annarr fótr sökk áðr öðrum væri upp stigit, ix. 511, v. l.; s. yfir borð, <i>to step over the table,</i> Sks. 259; s. fram, <i>to step forward,</i> Nj. 50, 52; s. undan borði, <i>to rise from table,</i> Ísl. ii. 352; þeir stigu á skíð, Eg 545; stiga á skip, <i>to go on board,</i> Nj. 19, Fms. viii. 228; s. í bát, ix. 374, Nj. 172; s. á hest, <i>to mount one’s horse,</i> Fms. xi. 332; s. á bak, <i>to get on horseback,</i> Nj. 58; s. af hesti, af baki, <i>to alight,</i> 53, 58, 104, Eg. 744: stíga stórum, <i>to stride, take long steps;</i> hann spurði hverr þar stigi stórum, Bs. i. 628 (stór-stígr, smá-stígr); s. fyrir borð, <i>to leap overboard,</i> Fms. ii. 117; s. ofan, <i>to step down,</i> x. 238; s. upp, <i>to ascend;</i> s. upp til himna, Rb. 56; s. niðr, <i>to descend,</i> 623. 8; cp. upp-stigning, <i>ascent;</i> niðr-stigning, <i>descent:</i> s. í fótspor e-m, Fs. 4, Sks. 13; s. til ríkis, <i>to ascend the throne,</i> Fms. x. 390, 410, 415; s. til föður-leifðar sinnar, xi. 331; konungr steig til vizku, x. 380:—s. yfir, <i>to overcome,</i> Blas. 50; stíg þú yfir íllt með góðu, Hom. 6; at stíga yfir höfuð þvílíkum höfðingjum, Fms. vii. 296; en nú er svá komit aldri mínum, at þat er á öngri stundu örvænt, nær elli stígr yfir höfuð mér, Eb. 332; ef talan stígr yfir (<i>oversteps, exceeds</i>) sjau, Rb. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
