        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a young wood, plantation,</i> Edda ii. 483: in the phrase, falla sem storð, <i>to fall like</i> storð, Fas. ii. 554: poët., storðar úlfr, storðar gandr, -galli, <i>the wolf, bane,</i> etc., <i>of the</i> s., i. e. <i>fire,</i> Lex. Poët.; storðar lykkja, <i>‘wood-loop,’</i> i. e. <i>a serpent,</i> Km.",
            }
