              "__html": "f. [A. S. <i>stôd-myre</i>], <i>a brood-mare,</i> mod. stóð-meri. ☞ Studs are freq. mentioned in the Sagas, not for racing, but for horse-fights (hesta-víg, hesta-þing), see the passages above, as also Þkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
