          className="link"
          href="/word/strand-hogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strand-högg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘strand-raid,’</i> such as <i>the raid</i> of the old Vikings who landed on the coasts and drove off cattle and stores for their ships; þar var nógt búfé til strandhöggva, Fms. i. 128: in the phrase, höggva s., <i>to make a</i> strandhögg. Eg. 81; þurfa strandhöggva, … leita eptir strand-höggvi, Fms. vii. 68; um morguninn kómu þeir ofan með strandhögg mikil, <i>much cattle, great booty,</i> vi. 79.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strand-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strand-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘strand-laying,’ the right of laying a net along a shore</i> or <i>bank,</i> Grág. ii. 350.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
