        >
          strangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., ströng, strangt, [a common Teut. word]:—<i>strong:</i> of a stream, ströng á, <i>a strong, rapid river,</i> Ísl. ii. 352, Fms. viii. 49; strangt straumfall, Stj. 489; allra á (gen. pl.) strangast, Stj. 73; strangr, opp. to hægr, Hom. (St.); ströngust orrosta, <i>the strongest, hottest fight,</i> Eg. 33; bardagi langr ok s., Stj. 544: of pain, strangan augna-verk, Bs. i. 317; ströng sótt, Pr. 411.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
