          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          striplast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to run about stripped,</i> of children; vertú ekki að striplast.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a hard task</i> (<strong>strit-vinna</strong>); standa í striti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to struggle, strive hard;</i> hann stritaði heim til skála, Grett. 151 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stri-nefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strí-nefr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fms. viii. 310 (strý-nefr?)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>strîð</i>, whence Engl. <i>strife,</i> by changing the <i>ð</i> into <i>f</i>; O. H. G. <i>strît;</i> Germ. <i>streit</i>]:—<i>woe, grief, affliction, calamity;</i> sótti bæði at henni stríð ok elli, Ld. 82; hann bar þat með allmiklu stríði, <i>he was much afflicted by it,</i> Fms. x. 239; springa af stríði, Ld. 230; síð léttir mér stríða, Edda (in a verse); stemma stríð manna, Brandkr. 60; munar-stríð, hug-stríð, Skv. 3. 38; aldr-stríð, of-stríð, <i>a heavy grief.</i> Helr.; af stríðum, Og. 28; mitt stríð er þat … stríð hafa staddan mik, Fms. vi. (in a verse); bíða stríð, Hallfred; æxta e-m stríð, Am. 102: poët., snáka stríð, <i>‘snake-bale,’</i> i. e. <i>the winter,</i> Fb. ii. 523 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-grid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-gríð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an affliction</i> (?), Gh. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>vehemence,</i> of a stream, Sks. 154; s. vatnsins, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>rigidly,</i> Sks. 496; fara fram s., 569; dæma s., Mar.; blása s., <i>roughly,</i> Sks. 229.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>severe;</i> s. dómr, Sks. 726; s. kváma, Hkv. 1. 47.",
            }
