        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-lundadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-lundaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>stríð-lyndr,</strong> adj. <i>obstinate, sullen,</i> Hkr. iii. 97, Þd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>backwardness, sullenness,</i> Fms. vi. 245, xi. 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-maeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-mæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>strong language,</i> Bs. i. 102.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-maeltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-mæltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>using hard language,</i> Fb. i. 506.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-vana"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-vana
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘sorrowless;’</i> era s., <i>grief is not wanting,</i> Fms. vi. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strid-vidri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríð-viðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a contrary wind,</i> Vígl. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>adversity,</i> Stj. 445: <i>hardness, austerity, severity,</i> er biskup lagði stríðu á stóra höfðingja, Sturl. iii. 266; með valdi ok stríðu heilagrar kirkju, Bs. i. 288; með freku fullrar stríðu, Fms. ii. 243; stríða vendisk brátt í blíðu, Bs. i. 125; hvárt sem hann mætti bliðu eðr stríðu, Fms. vi. 250; gangask heldr fyrir blíðu enn stríðu, <i>to yield sooner to gentleness than to hardness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stridir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an adversary,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stridr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "stríð, strítt, adj. <i>strong,</i> of a stream, Stj. 73; keldan vall stríðara, Art.; í stríðri móðu, Fms. vii. (in a verse); stríðr straumr, Bs. ii. 5, Edda (in a verse); stríðr verkr, <i>a strong pain,</i> Bs. i. 183, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strids-afli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríðs-afli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an army,</i> 420.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strids-kostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríðs-kostr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the means of fighting,</i> Sturl. iii. 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strids-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríðs-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a warrior, fighter,</i> Edda (pref.), Grett. 118 A, Fas. iii. 421.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strip-rendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stríp-rendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>with stripes,</i> Sturl. iii. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stripadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strípaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>stripped, naked.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stripr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
