        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a stripling,</i> Run. Gramm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. A. S. <i>slral</i> = <i>a dart;</i> Germ. <i>strahl;</i> Dan. <i>straale</i>]:—<i>a scattering abroad;</i> vera á strjáli: also as adj., fara strjált, <i>to go one by one.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjála
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to disperse, be scattered abroad,</i> sauðirnir strjálast.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjalingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjálingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = strjál; á strjálingi, <i>scattered abroad.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [A. S. word], a nickname, Fms. xi. (see Saxon Chron.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjúgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>strúgr,</strong> m. [the Engl. <i>stew</i> may be the same word, dropping the <i>r</i>]:—<i>a stew</i> of meat, esp. of a coarse kind; stafkörlum strjúg skal senda, Hallgr.; beina strjúgr, <i>bones boiled to a jelly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjuka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjúka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>strykja,</strong> Ó. H. 61, Fms. viii. 217), pres. strýk; pret. strauk, straukt, strauktu, Fms. vi. (in a verse); mod. straukst; plur. struku; subj. stryki; imperat. strjúk. strjúktu; part. strokinn: [Dan. <i>stryge;</i> Engl. <i>stroke</i>]:—<i>to stroke, rub, wipe;</i> hann strauk blóð af sverðinu, Sæm. 135; strauktu um mækis munn, Fms. vi. (in a verse); hann strauk diskinn með dúknum, Ó. H. 154; þá stökk Sigurðr af baki, en ek strauk hest hans ok þó ek leir af honum, Fb. i. 354; tók dúkinn, strauk hann sér kurteisliga á miðjum, Hkr. 597 new Ed.; lét konungr göra sér laug ok strykja (strjúka, strykva, v. l.) klæði sín, <i>to brush, beat his clothes,</i> Fms. viii. 217; en húskona strauk of ripti, <i>smoothed it, brushed it.</i> Rm.; nú tekr hann enn ör ok strýkr blaðit ok fiðrit, Þiðr. 88; hann strauk höfuð-beinin, Gísl. 47; þreifaði um hendr þeim ok strauk um lófana, Fms. vi. 73; strauk hann hendi sinni um augu honum ok bein, Ó. H. 250: in the phrase, strjúka aldri frjálst höfuð, <i>‘never to stroke a free head,’ to live in worry and work,</i> cp. the Engl. ‘no one dared to call his life his own,’ Fms. viii. 412 (v. l.), Sturl. ii. 124; aldri strykum (sic) vér frjálst höfuð meðan Ólafr er á lífi, Ó. H. 61; Skarphéðinn strauk um ennit, Nj. 190: with prepp., strjúk þoku ok mörkva frá augum þér, Barl. 116, 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/strjupi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          strjúpi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>strube;</i> Swed. <i>strupe</i> = <i>throat;</i> akin to stropi, q. v.]:—<i>the spurting, bleeding trunk,</i> when the head is cut off; hann lét höggva kálf, ok blæða ór kálf-strjúpanum, Njarð. 374; mjólk hljóp ór strjúpanum fram fyrst, 655 xiii. A. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
