        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [styggja], <i>loathing, abhorrence;</i> mér stendr stuggr af því, <i>it bodes me ill.</i> <strong>stugg-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>free from dislike,</i> Bs. i. (in a verse).",
            }
