        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. stuldar, pl. stuldir, [stela]:—<i>theft, stealing,</i> Skálda 204, Gþl. 531, Stj. 63; án ok s., K. Þ. K. 176; stefna e-m stuld, Nj. 78, Landn. 161; refsa stuldi, Magn. 464, passim. <strong>stulda-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a stealer, thief,</i> Sturl. i. 61, Fms. iv. 111.",
            }
