          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. stundu, pl. stundir, with neg. suff. stund-gi, q. v.; [A. S. <i>stund;</i> Old Engl. <i>stound;</i> Dan. <i>stund;</i> Germ. <i>stunde</i>]:—<i>a certain length of time, a while, hour,</i> of a longer or shorter time according to the context, mostly of a short time; en er at þeirri stundu kom at hón mundi barn ala, Fms. i. 14; var stund til dags, <i>it was a while before daybreak,</i> Ld. 44; stund var í milli (<i>a good while</i>) er þeir sá framstafninn ok inn eptri kom fram, Fms. ii. 304; langa stund eðr skamma, <i>for a long while</i> or <i>a short</i>, Grág. i. 155; langri stundu fyrr, <i>long ere</i>, Fms. ix. 450; litla stund, <i>a little while, for a short time,</i> MS. 623. 32, Bs. i. 42, Eg. 160; jafnlanga stund sem áðr var tínt, Grág. i. 406; er á stundina líðr, er á leið stundina, <i>in the course of time, after a while,</i> Fms. x. 392, 404; jarl mælti er stund leið, <i>after a while,</i> Fær. 93; þat var allt á einni stundu, er … ok, <i>that was all at the same moment,</i> Bs. i. 339; var ok stundin eigi löng, <i>it was but a short time,</i> Fms. iv. 361; þat var stund ein, <i>but a short time,</i> 623. 32; allar stundir, <i>always,</i> Fms, i. 219, xi. 76; nú líða stundir, <i>the the time passes on,</i> Fær. 23; er stundir líða, <i>as time goes on, in course of time,</i> Nj. 54; vera þar þeim stundum sem hann vildi, <i>whenever he liked,</i> Ísl. ii. 205; stundu eptir Jól, <i>a while after Yule,</i> Fms. ix. 33; stundu síðarr enn Skalla-Grímr hafði út komit, Eg. 137;. alla stund, <i>the whole time, all the time,</i> Fær. 123; á þeirri stundu, er …, <i>during the time, that…, in the meantime.</i> Fms. xi. 360, K. Þ. K. 33 new Ed.; á þessi stundu, Eg. 424; fyrir stundar sakir, <i>in respect of time,</i> Gþl. 31; but um stundar sakir, <i>but for a while;</i> dvelja af stundir, <i>to kill the time,</i> Band. 23 new Ed.; hann gáði eigi stundanna, Fms. v. 195: savings, opt verðr lítil stand at seinum, Líkn.; lítil er líðandi stund, <i>brief is the fleeting hour,</i> Hkr. i. 154; hvat bíðr sinnar stundar, Grett. 168 new Ed.: allit., staðr ok stund, <i>place and time.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stund-gi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stund-gi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>no time;</i> hví gegnir er góðir menn lifa stundgi (<i>that good men live no time</i>) í þessum heimi, Greg. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stund-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stund-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>with zeal, eagerly,</i> Stj. 557: <i>temporally,</i> Vídal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stund-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stund-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>temporal, worldly,</i> opp. to eilífr (mostly eccl.), Sks. 794, Blas. 44, Fms. i. 274, x. 371.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stunda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stunda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [stund III], <i>to go, proceed;</i> stopalt munuð ganga ef it stundit hingat, <i>if ye intend to go thifher,</i> Am. 16; stundu vér til strandar, Fms. xi. (in a verse); obsolete in this sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stunda-klukka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stunda-klukka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>an eight-day clock,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stunda-tal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stunda-tal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a tale of hours,</i> Rb. 568.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a paying respect, regard;</i> þeir menn er hann áðr hefir haft stundan af, Ld. 146: <i>heed-taking, painstaking,</i> hefi ek verið með yðr í góðum fagnaði, en þú hefir ekki haft fyrir þína s., Bær. 5: <i>pursuit, industry,</i> af lífi þínu ok s. munu mikil stór-tíðindi hljótask, Orkn. 140; á-stundan, <i>industry, painstaking.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundar-el"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundar-él
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a brief storm,</i> Nj. 200.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundar-hrid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundar-hríð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a small distance,</i> Hkr. i. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundar-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundar-stefna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a summoning with short notice,</i> Jb. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundar-vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundar-vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a short distance,</i> Pr. 411.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundar-thogn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundar-þögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a brief silence,</i> H. E. ii. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stundum"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stundum
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [Dan. <i>stundom</i>], <i>sometimes;</i> see stund I. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stunga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [stinga], <i>a stab</i>, a wound from a pointed weapon; blóði því er ór stungunum hafði runnit, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stunga-foli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stunga-fóli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (= borufoli, q. v.), N. G. L. i. 383.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sturla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sturla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. <strong>stúrla,</strong> [a derivative from stúra, q. v.]:—<i>to stir, derange, disturb,</i> esp. of the mind; íllr andi sturlaði hann, Stj. 460 (of king Saul), Barl. 160, 180, 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sturla-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sturla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. (or perh. better <strong>Stúrla,</strong> later corrupt form <strong>Stulli,</strong> a, m., Skíða R. 99); [this word is probubly not related to the verb sturla, but is better explained as a diminutive noun (qs. stjuri-la) from stjórr (or stjûrr), meaning <i>a stirk, young bull,</i> cp. mey-la; the ancient Gothic abounded in such diminutive proper names]:—a pr. name, Sturl., Landn.; hence <strong>Sturlungar,</strong> <i>the Sturlungs,</i> a family famous in Icel. in the 12th and 13th centuries. <strong>Sturlunga-saga,</strong> see List of Authors.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sturlan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sturlan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>derangement of mind, gloom, despair;</i> sturlan ok á-hyggja, Fas. iii. 456, Pass. 11. 4; hugar s., Stj. 461.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stuttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stuttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. styttri, superl. stytztr; stuttara, Sks. 288; stuttr is no doubt assimilated qs. stuntr: [A. S. and Engl. <i>stunted, stinted</i>]:—prop. <i>stunted, scant;</i> stutta brynju, Gkv. 2. 19, Fms. vi. 66; s. kyrtill, vii. 63, Valla L. 208; ætla styttri skyrtu þína enn kyrtil, Sks. 287; hár styttra en eyrna-blöð, Sks. 66 new Ed.; s. toppr, id.; stutt skapt, Sturl. i. 64; þrjá tigi álna var yfir gjána þar sem stytzt var, Fas. ii. 405: of time, stuttar samvistir, Bs. i. 629; fyrir stuttu, <i>a short while ago,</i> Fas. iii. 532; stuttr máls-háttr, Bs. ii. 6; hafði hann stuttar kvaðningar, Fms. iii. 95: <i>scant,</i> stutt hjáip, Barl. 58; svara stutt, <i>to answer shorily,</i> Eg. 95, 175, Karl. 200, Stj. 578; svara stutt ok styggt, Fms. vii. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/studera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúdera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Lat.], <i>to study,</i> Sks. 6, Bs. i. 793, Karl. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/studeran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúderan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>studering</strong>), f. <i>studying,</i> Stj. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stuf-hendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúf-hendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>apocopate,</i> of a metre, of which a specimen in Edda (Ht.) 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stufa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a stump,</i> N. G. L. i. 85 (the reference see under hnúfa); the name of a poem (by the poet Stúfr), Fms. vi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stufr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>stúfi,</strong> a, m., N. G. L. i. 350); [cp. Engl. <i>stump;</i> Germ. <i>stumpf</i>]:<i>—a stump,</i> Nj. 97, Ísl. ii. 268, Fms. i. 178, Ölk. 36; festar-s., Grág.; tungu-stúfr, see festr, tunga.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stuka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [mid. H. G. <i>stuche</i> = <i>manica</i>]:—<i>a sleeve;</i> næfra-stúkan á hendi hans annarri, Fas. ii. 281; bryn-stúka (q. v.), <i>a sleeve of mail.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stulka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúlka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., staul-ka, [cp. stauli, staulpa; the <i>-ka</i> being a diminutive inflexive]:—<i>a girl, lass;</i> ung stúlka, Fær. 41; sá hann stúlku ganga með vatns-fötur, Fb. i. 258; sjau vatn gamlar stúlkur, Fas. ii. 149; ef þat er sveinn … en ef þat er stúlka, 236; hversu lízk þér, bróðir, á stúlkur þessar, Ísl. ii. 200; mey-s., Fb. i. 262: the word is very freq. in mod. usage, and answers to <i>girl</i> in Engl., <i>flicka</i> in Swed., <i>genta</i> in Norway.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stumi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Germ. <i>stumm</i>], <i>dumb;</i> ok þegir sem stúmi, Skald H. R. 5. 10; the root-word is else rare and obsolete.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stupa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a defect, obsolete strong verb, [Ivar Aasen <i>stûpa, staup;</i> Swed. <i>stupa;</i> Engl. <i>stoop;</i> mid. H. G. <i>stieben</i>]:<i>—to stoop;</i> létu upp stjölu stúpa, stungu í kjöl höfðum, Hkr. (Hornklofi): the word is thus a απ. λεγ., and is now obsolete in Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = stúra; þeir kenna Guði sultar-stúr, Bb. 1. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stura"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "stúri, stúrði (stúrat?), [Ulf. <i>and-staurran</i> = ἐμβριμασθαι]:—<i>to mope, fret;</i> hann stúrði ok svaraði engu, D. N. i. 961.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stura-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>gloom, despair;</i> Steingerðr hefir steypt mér í stúru, <i>S.</i> (his lady love) <i>has steeped me in gloom, made me unhappy,</i> Kormak; ekki er mér (manni?) at stúru gaman, <i>a gloomy mind has no happiness,</i> Mkv. 22, cp. Hm. 94; en er hann heyrði þetta, þá drap honum í stúru, <i>he was stunned and downcast,</i> Barl. 8. <strong>stúru-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a care-worn man,</i> Valla L. 208.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stuta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stúta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að. <i>to kill, destroy,</i> with dat., of dogs or the like (slang), cp. láta höfði skemra: <i>to stunt,</i> heldr mun fyrir höggin stór þinn hrottinn verða at stúta, Skíða R. 163; Starkað gamla stúta lét, 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stútr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>stud;</i> Swed. <i>stilt;</i> Engl. <i>stút;</i> akin to stuttr?], <i>a bull,</i> D. N. i. 63, iv. 664, 782, Boldt 165, 167; uxa-stútr; this sense, however, is not in use in Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stydja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = stoð, Stj. 210.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stydja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "styð, pret. studdi; subj. styddi; imperat. styð, styddú; part. stutt; [stoð; A. S. <i>studu;</i> Dan. <i>stötte</i>]:<i>—to steady, prop;</i> s. hendi, fæti, <i>to lean upon the hand</i> or <i>foot;</i> þat er fall ef hann styðr niðr kné eðr hendi, Grág. ii. 8; sá studdi höndunum á bálkinn, Orkn. 112; annarri hendi styðr hann á herðar Jökli, Finnb.; styðja sik við, <i>to lean upon;</i> falla munda ek nú, ef eigi stydda ek mik við báða fætr, Fas. i. 22; Hrafn hnekði at stofni einum ok studdi þar á stúfinum, Ísl. ii. 268; hann studdi sik með hendinni … þeir segja at þat var alls ekki at fótr styddisk við hönd, Edda 77: styðja e-n, <i>to hold one up, support one;</i> at eigi tæki menn til hans ok styddi hann er hann gékk út á skipit, Ó. H. 125.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styfill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styfill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (mod. <strong>stígvél</strong>), [from Ital. <i>estivale, stivale;</i> Germ. <i>stiefel</i>]:—<i>boots,</i> D. N. iv. 221.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stygd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stygð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘shunning,’ aversion, anger;</i> með s., Stj. 268; hafa s. við e-n, <i>to shew dislike to,</i> Fms. x. 98; görði hann þá stygð mikla við frændr Arinbjarnar ok vini, Eg. 538; hann mælti fátt, en af stygð (<i>peevishly</i>) þat er var, Eb. 270; stygðar strengr, Pass. 21. 12; and-stygð. <strong>stygðar-fullr,</strong> adj. <i>froward</i>, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stygg-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stygg-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>aversion,</i> Sks. 485, Fb. i. 410: <i>a hasty temper.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stygg-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stygg-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>harshly, angrily;</i> svara s., Eg. 40, Fms. vi. 158, 364, xi. 286; s. hafði farit með þeim, Sturl. ii. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stygg-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stygg-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = styggr; in and-styggiligr, <i>loathsome.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stygg-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stygg-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hasty-tempered, peevish,</i> Fms. ii. 98, vi. 250.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>styggva,</strong> ð, prop. <i>to make shy, make to run,</i> which sense remains in the phrase, styggja sauðina (féð), <i>to worry, start the sheep, the herd.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>styg</i> = <i>ugly</i>], <i>shy, wary</i> (= skjarr), of deer, birds, animals, which are easily startled; hann vildi höndla hann (the horse), en hann var þá svá styggr, at Einarr komsk hvergi í nánd honum, Hrafn. 7; styggr sauðr, N. G. L. i. 36; ef menn eigu haglendi saman ok styggan sauð, 38; very freq. in mod. usage, in which skjarr (q. v.) is obsolete; hlaup-s., læ-s., flótt-s., <i>fraud-shunning;</i> dag-styggr, <i>‘day-shy’ shunning light,</i> of a dwarf; Dag-styggr, a pr. name, Landn., Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stykki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stykki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Germ. <i>stäck;</i> Dan. <i>stykke</i>], <i>a piece, chop;</i> skipta í tólf s., Stj. 384; smá s., 458; sníða í s., 309; hón leggr sitt s. (<i>a piece of meat</i>) fyrir hvern þeirra bræðra, Ísl. ii. 337; fiska-s., Skíða R. 40; eitt s. af disk konungs, Fms. v. 149; í öllum sínum stykkjum, <i>in all its parts,</i> Dipl. ii. 13: in a local name, <strong>Stykkis-hólmr,</strong> map of Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styn-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styn-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sighing, groaning,</i> Al. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stynja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stynja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "styn, pret. stundi; subj. styndi; part. stunit; [Dan. <i>stönne</i>; Germ. <i>stöhnen</i>]:—<i>to groan;</i> grét ok stundi, Hkr. iii. 366; stynéndr, Hom. 54; Helgi tekr at stynja fast, Gísl. 47; stynja dvergar, Vsp. 53, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stynr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stynr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. stynir, <i>a groan,</i> Hom. 57, Fb. i. 145; sjúkra manna s, Skálda 174; dauðans stynir, Stj. 50; s. ok sýting, 51; með miklum styn, Fms. v. 218; styn né hósta, Nj. 201; sárum styn, Fb. ii. 392.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrfinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrfinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., better stirfinn, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrj-old"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrj-öld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. styrjaldar, spelt stjorjold, Bs. i. 581; [styrr and öld]:—<i>‘stir-age,’ war, fray, tumult;</i> vekja styrjöld, 623. 25; hefir þú þat skap er engi styrjöld fylgir, <i>thou art no man of war,</i> Landn. 260; með mikilli s. ok gný, Fms. x. 265; ópi ok s., i. 273; standa á s., Fas. iii. 155; fremja s., 623. 11; göra mikla styrjöld, Stj. 489; með harðfengi sinni ok s., Fb. ii. 71; orrosta þessi ok s., 298. <strong>styrjaldar-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a warlike man,</i> Ísl. ii. 361; vér fundum þenna styrjaldar-mann, <i>this peace-disturber,</i> 645. 97; hann hafði engi s. verit hér til, Sturl. iii. 7; styrjaldar-Magnús, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Germ. <i>stör;</i> Norse <i>styrja, makrél-styrja;</i> Engl. <i>sturgeon</i>], <i>a sturgeon,</i> Edda (Gl.): a nickname, Fms. viii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrk-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrk-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>strength,</i> Bs. i. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrk-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrk-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>strong-looking,</i> Fms. ii. 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a strengthening, refreshment,</i> Stj. 493, Bs. ii. 161: <i>confirmation,</i> Dipl. ii. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to make strong;</i> skepta spjót, styrkja skjöldu, Fas. i. 505; minta styrkir kvið, Pr. 473, 474.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
