        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a supporter,</i> Blas. 42, Stj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrkjari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrkjari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a strengthener,</i> Stj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrkna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrkna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to grow strong,</i> Al. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>strong;</i> see sterkr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrkr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>stearc;</i> Engl. <i>stark;</i> Dan. <i>styrke</i>], <i>strength, bodily strength;</i> hann drakk eigi meira enn hann mátti halda styrk sínum, Fms. i. 82; eljan ok styrkr, vii. 228; reipi öruggligt til styrkjar, <i>a rope strong enough,</i> Sks. 420 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrkt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrkt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>styrkð,</strong> f. <i>strength;</i> styrkðina, Fms. x. 373; s. ok hófsemi, Hom. 97, Fb. ii. 37, 365: <i>help,</i> Orkn. 108; styrkðar-andi, Rb. 80; styrktar bréf, <i>a writ of confirmation,</i> Ann. 1371. <strong>styrktar-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a helper,</i> Dropl. 23, Fms. vii. 229.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [stormr; A. S. <i>styrmian</i>], <i>to blow up for a gale;</i> gékk um veðrit ok styrmði at þeim, Bs. i. 775, Grett. 113 new Ed.; þá tók veðrit at s. af land-suðri, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styrr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          styrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. styrjar and styrs, [Engl. <i>stir</i>], <i>a stir, tumult, brawl, disturbance;</i> styrr varð í ranni, <i>there arose a stir in the hall</i>, Hðm. 24; úlítill styrr, <i>no small stir,</i> Edda (Ht.); stála styrr, hjálma styrr, randa styrr, <i>‘steel-stir,’ ‘helm-stir,’ ‘shield-stir,’</i> i. e. <i>a battle,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stytta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stytta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f., in <strong>styttu-band,</strong> n. <i>a band to hold up a woman’s dress.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stytta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stytta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [stuttr; Engl. <i>stunt</i>], <i>to make short, shorten;</i> hafi sá stökku er stytti, <i>who scamped it,</i> Gþl. 399; ok styttu svá strenginn, Fms. v. 289: freq. esp. in mod. usage, stytta sér stundir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stytti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stytti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (<strong>styttni,</strong> Mork. 51), = stytting, Fms. ix. 329.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stytting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stytting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a shortening;</i> dægra-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [stúfr], <i>to cut off, chop off, curtail,</i> Jb. 274; af stýfa, Stj. 379; s. af tungunni, Hom. 115; s. höfuð af e-m, Al. 53; því berr hann stýfðan stert, <i>a docked tail,</i> Gsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., in bú-stýra, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styra-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [stjórn, stýra; Goth. <i>stiurian;</i> A. S. <i>steôrjan;</i> Engl. <i>steer;</i> Germ. <i>steuern;</i> Dan. <i>styre</i>]:—<i>to steer</i>, with dat., Hbl. 7; s. með bryggjum ok árum, Fms. xi. 193; stýra skipi, N. G. L. i. 98; stýr þú hingat eikjunni, Hbl.; en Loki stýrir, Vsp. 51, passim; stýra á e-n, <i>to steer upon another;</i> stýrðu ekki á mik, Steingerðr, Kormak: metaph. phrases, s. til váða, <i>to steer into straits, take a dangerous course,</i> Fms. vii. 145; mér þótti þú stýra oss til ens mesta váða, Ó. H. 136; eigi hefir tekizk misræða við, en var þó til stýrt, i. e. <i>attempted, but failed,</i> Grág. ii. 61; stýra undan, <i>to escape.</i> Post. 645. 88; hversu sem ek fæ undan stýrt, Fms. xi. 193, Lv. 69, Fb. ii. 80; ok orðit þó heldr nær stýrt, <i>‘steered near,’</i> i. e. <i>had a narrow escape,</i> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a helm, rudder,</i> Korm. 230; leggja s. í lag, Hkr. i. 32, Fms. i. 42, vii. 47; leggja stýri ór lagi, Al. 67; sitja við stýri, Eg.; láta (vel, ílla, ekki) at stýri, <i>to answer (well, ill, not) to the rudder,</i> O.T. 70, Fms. x. 368.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styri-hamla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýri-hamla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the ‘rudder strap,’ the loop by which the tiller is worked</i> (sec hamla), Gþl. 122; sitja við stýri-hömlu, Ó. H. 16; skiptusk menn við stýrihömlurnar, Fms. viii. 383: in the phrase, ræna e-n stýrihömlu, <i>to take the skipper’s place,</i> N. G. L. i. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styri-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýri-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>manageable,</i> Grett. 98; ú-stýrilátr, <i>unruly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styri-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýri-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., in ú-stýrilæti, <i>unruliness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styri-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýri-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘steersman,’</i> but only in the sense of <i>a skipper, captain,</i> N. G. L. i. 98, 103, Grett. 95, Ó. H. 136, Fms. vii. 257, 286, ix. 19, Landn. 51; stýrimaðr ok hásetar, Grág. i. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styri-stong"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýri-stöng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a rudder-post,</i> Fms. v. 186, Eg. 360, Fas. ii. 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styris-drengr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýris-drengr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a rudder-post</i> (?); stýri ok stýris-drengi, N. G. L. i. 102.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styris-fiskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýris-fiskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a fish, <i>echinus cauda bifurca,</i> Eggert Itin. 994.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styris-hnakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýris-hnakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the ‘rudder-neck,’ the top piece of the rudder,</i> Fms. ii. 320.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styris-knappr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýris-knappr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = stýrishnakki, Fb. i. 486.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/styris-lykkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stýris-lykkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the rudder-hook,</i> by which the rudder is hooked on to the stern-post, Eg. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staeda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to establish;</i> s. ok staðfesta, H. E. ii. 187.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>stœði,</strong> n. [standa, stóð], <i>the place which a thing takes up;</i> fimm manna stæði, <i>room for five men,</i> Ám. 98: <i>the place</i> on which a thing stands, skegg-stæði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staedi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæði-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>fit to stand, stable;</i> stæðiligt hús, s. veggr; gegn-s., q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staedingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., a naut. term, <i>braces,</i> 673. 60; dragreip, stœðingr, höfuð-benda, N. G. L. i. 199, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., neut. stætt, <i>standing;</i> in compds, gagn-s., <i>contrary;</i> sam-s., <i>harmonious.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stækja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a bad stench.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staekka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stækka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(stœkka), qs. stærka, að, [stór], <i>to grow, wax,</i> impers.; sjó stækkar, Þorf. Karl. 372, v. l. (better stæra): reflex. stækkask, Háv. 12 new Ed.: freq. in mod. usage, það stækkar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Engl. <i>stink, stench;</i> Dan. <i>stinke</i>], <i>a stinking.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [stál], <i>to steel, put steel into,</i> a blacksmith’s term; hence <i>to temper,</i> hann lét stæla oddana, Str. 77; sverð stælt með eitri, <i>a sword tempered with poison, poisoned,</i> Bær. 15 (= eitri herðr); stæltr lé, Grág. i. 501.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>stœra</strong>), ð, [stórr], impers. of the wind, sea, <i>it swells, waxes rough;</i> stærði veðrin (acc.), Eg. 404; sjó tók at stæra, Þorf. Karl. 372; haustar, stærir sjóinn, Finnb. 242; stærir sterkar bárur (acc.), Bs. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staerd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stærð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>size, bigness;</i> borgar-stærð, Völs. R. 10, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/staeri-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stæri-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>proud,</i> Korm. (in a verse): <strong>stæri-læti,</strong> n. <i>pride.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stod-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. stöðvar, pl. stöðvar; [staðr. standa; A. S. <i>stæð</i>; Engl. <i>stead,</i> in <i>roadstead;</i> cp. Lat. <i>stātio</i>]:—<i>a berth, harbour;</i> stýr þú hingat eikjunni, ek mun þér stöðna kenna, Hbl.; ef hvalr rekr í stöð manns, … er í stöðinni liggr … er stöðina á, er um gengr stöðina út, N. G. L. i. 252: esp. in plur., þeir kómu í þær stöðvar, … ok lögðu skipit undir mels-höfða, Sd. 147; í þær stöðvar er átti Sveinn konungr ok leggja þeir skip sín í lægi, Fms. xi. 70; þeir kómu í stöðvar Gorms konungs síð um aptan, 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stod-renni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöð-renni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a neighbourhood;</i> búa, sitja í s. við e-n, Fas. ii. 152, Bs. i. 417, Sturl. i. 115.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see staða.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodu-brunnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðu-brunnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a well of still water,</i> N. G. L. i. 341, Trist. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodu-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðu-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a standing, permanent fence,</i> Gþl. 350.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodu-gleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðu-gleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>steadfastness, firmness,</i> N. G. L. iii. 92, Bs. ii. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodu-merki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðu-merki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a standard,</i> Karl. 364.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodu-vatn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðu-vatn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘standing-water,’ pond</i> or <i>lake,</i> Stj. 75, 82, 89, Str. 78, MS. 623. 33, Fms. viii. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>steady, stable;</i> ver s., ok hræðsk eigi, Th. 3; stöðugir í sér, Al. 173; s. í framferði, Mar.; þessi stöðugi riddari, Magn. 496; stöðugan stólpa, Fms. iii. 174; stórlyndr ok stöðugr, Fs. 129; varð honum þat (viz. the heart) eigi stöðugt, Edda 58; göra stöðugt, <i>to confirm,</i> Vígl. 29, Dipl. iii. 9; standa stöðugt, Pass., D. N.; halda e-t stöðugt, <i>to observe,</i> Dipl. v. 16; til stöðugrar eignar, i. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. stöðli, [A. S. <i>staðol</i>; O. H. G. <i>stadal</i>]:—<i>a milking-sbed,</i> for kine; milli bæjar ok stöðuls, K. Þ. K.; griðkona þín þerrir fætr á jafnan er hón gengr af stöðli, Fb. i. 268; naut vóru á stöðli, … graðungr var á stöðlinum, Vápn. 1; fé var á stöðli of aptaninn, Bjarn. 47: vóru konur at mjöltum, Þóroddr reið á stöðulinn, … hvert sinn er Þóroddr kom á stöðul, Eb. 316, 320; reka naut á stöðul, Eg. 712; konur er til stöðuls fóru, 713; konur vóru á stöðli, Nj. 83; norðr í stöðlum, Sturl. ii. 249; stöðul ok kvíar, Vm. 18; tvá stöðla ok sel, D. N. i. 81; stöðuls-hlið, Landn. 78. <strong>stöðul-gerði,</strong> n. <i>a milk-pail,</i> Ísl. ii. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stodva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöðva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, with neg. suff. stöðvig-a-k, Hom, 151, [stöð]:—<i>to stop;</i> hann stöðvar sik ekki, Nj. 144; hann stöðvaði her sinn, <i>halted,</i> Eg. 274; s. liðit, Fms. vii. 298.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stok-land"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stök-land
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [stakr], <i>an isolated land;</i> sitja á stöklöndum, N. G. L. i. 380, 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [stakkr; Dan. <i>stakket</i>], <i>stinted, curtailed,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> or <strong>stökr,</strong> m. [provinc. Norse <i>staak</i> = <i>noise</i>], <i>a stir, disturbance;</i> vær kómum stökk (dat.) í lið þeirra, <i>we put them to flight,</i> Stj. 515; ek mun vita ef ek koma nokkurum stökk í lið þeirra, Fms. viii. 49; áðr hann görði stökk í órum búðum, <i>ere he brought discord into our dwelling,</i> Bjarn. 28 (in a verse, if thus to be emended); stökkr óx, <i>the swell</i> (of the sea) <i>waxed,</i> Edda (Ht.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>stökkvill,</strong> D. I. i. 408), <i>a brush used for sprinkling holy water, an aspersoir,</i> Eb. 10, Stj. 279, Bs. i. 195, Hkr. i. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t (ð), a causal to the preceding, <i>to cause to spring, make start, propel, drive,</i> with dat.; s. úaldar-flokki þessum, Fms. vii. 263; sumum stökti hann brott, i. 98; ek stökta í brott Steinari, Ísl. ii. 215; þeir hafa stökt honum norðan, Eb. 304, Dropl. 35; hann stökti honum ór landi, Fms. vi. 27; hví er þér stökt ór landi, Hkv. Hjörv. 31; vér munum ríða at sem harðast ok s. í sundr (<i>break</i>) fylkingu þeirra, Orkn. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkva-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. stökk, pl. stökkvum; pret. stökk, stökkt, stökk, pl. stukku; subj. stykki; imperat. stökk, stökktú; part. stokkinn: also spelt with <i>ey</i> (steyqva): [Ulf. <i>stigqwan;</i> A. S. <i>stincan</i>]:—<i>to leap, spring;</i> stökkva hátt, <i>to make a high leap,</i> Fær. 57; hann stökk ofan ór loptinu, Fms. i. 166; þeir stukku upp, <i>they sprang to their feet,</i> Korm. 40; stukku þeir á skip sín, Fms. ix. 275; s. á hest, Karl. 261; þessi maðr stökk af bjarginu, Fas. iii. 197.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkvi-brogd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkvi-brögð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>an unforeseen accident</i> (?); nú hafa vorðit í s., Fb. iii. 450.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stokkvi-vig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stökkvi-víg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a single, isolated case of manslaughter,</i> Ann. 1296, Krók. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stong"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. stangar, dat. stöngu, Haustl., but else stöng; plur. stangir and stengr: [A. S. <i>steng;</i> North. E. <i>stang;</i> Germ. <i>stange;</i> Dan. <i>stang,</i> pl. <i>stænger</i>]:—<i>a pole;</i> taka mikla stöng ok binda við hvíta blæju, Fms. ix. 358; berja e-n stöngum, <i>to beat with staves,</i> Blas. 51, MS. 655 xiii. B. 3: of <i>a standard pole</i> (merkis-stöng), taka merkit af stönginni, Nj. 274: the phrase, ganga undir stöng, <i>to go under a pole,</i> in order to be counted up (see skora), Fms. viii. 320: the phrase, bera fé til stangar, of cattle as booty, <i>to bring to the pole,</i> that it may be counted and valued (cp. Lat. <i>‘sub hasta’</i>), Barl. 188; allt þat er þeir fengi í herförum þá skyldi til stanga bera, Fms. xi. 76; var féit til stanga borit ok skipti Hákon jarl fénu með sér ok svá vápnum þeirra, 147; með svá miklu kapp, at stóð í stönginni, <i>that the tally was full</i> (?), 424 (probably a metaphor from scoring).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stopla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöpla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(better than <strong>staupla</strong>), að, (<strong>stolpa,</strong> N. G. L. iii. 27, v. l.), [Swed. <i>stjelpa;</i> Dutch <i>over-stelping</i> = <i>overwhelming</i>]:—<i>to bespatter, sprinkle;</i> stórum stauplar nú yfir, Fs. 153; stöplaðisk út af keri, <i>a drop was spilt out of the beaker,</i> Vígl. 52; stöpluðusk yfir kerit (af kerinu) nokkurir dropar, Flóv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stoppudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöppuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/stopull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          stöpull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. stöpli, [A. S. <i>stypel;</i> Engl. <i>steeple</i>], <i>a steeple, tower,</i> Rb. 402; smíða einn stöpul, Edda (pref., of Babel); þann stöpul, 656 A. ii. 10; hann lét göra stöpul mjök vandaðan … uppi í stöplinum, … stöpulsins, Bs. i. 132, Fms. viii. 247, ix. 12; kirkju-s., 285; klukkur fjórar í stöpli, Pm. 99: <i>a beacon-tower,</i> Fms. vii. 122, viii. 97: <i>a pillar,</i> Eluc. 2; sá stöpull, <i>a pillar of smoke,</i> Ver. 21; stöpul-dyrr, Sturl. iii. 101; stöpul-görð, -smíð, Pm. 9, Bs. i. 132, Edda (pref.); stöpul-vörðr, <i>a steeple keeper,</i> N. G. L. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
