        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. <i>sums</i> = τίς; common to all Teut. languages, but mostly with <i>o;</i> Dan. <i>somme;</i> Engl. <i>some</i>]:—<i>some;</i> þá fell áin sum (<i>some part of the river</i>) í landsuðr, Nj. 263; hann rænti fólk, en drap sumt, sumt hertók hann, Fms. i. 28; Anakol ok sum sveitin var eptir, Orkn.; yðr þykkir sumt ofjarl en sumt ekki at manna, Fms. vi. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
