          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          súsvort
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the nightingale;</i> einn fugl þann er heitir philomela á Látinu en á Norrænu heitir súsvort, sumir kalla ok niktigalu, Barl. 39: the word is obsolete in Icel., and the passage in Barl. stands alone in the old literature; not even does the Edda (Gl. in the list of birds) record this word; but it is preserved in provincial Norse <i>sysvorta (sisvorta, svisvorta</i>) = <i>turdus torquatus, the ring ousel,</i> Ivar Aasen: the etymology is quite uncertain.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
