              "__html": "a, m. [Lat.], <i>a tanner,</i> Grág. ii. 84, N. G. L. ii, Rétt., D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. and <strong>svaði,</strong> a, m. [sveðja], <i>a slippery place, a slide,</i> as of frozen ground with a half-thawed muddy surface; þá var þeyr, var svað (svaði, Fb. l. c.) á þelanum, Fms. viii. 393; svað (svaði C) var á vellinum, ok skriðnaði hann, Sturl. ii. 104; hestrinn skriðnaði á svadanum, iii. 141: metaph. phrase, var við svað um, at mart manna mundi drukna, <i>it was on the slide, was imminent, that many people should be drowned,</i> Mork. 92. In mod. usage svaði is chiefly used of slippery ledges of rock projecting into the sea, and washed by the tides.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svad-hall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svað-háll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>slippery.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svaða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to swathe;</i> svaðaðir upp í kurt ok skart, Karl. 168.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svadi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svaði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., see svað. <strong>svaða-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>slippery, dangerous.</i> <strong>Svaði,</strong> a pr. name, Fms. ii: the name of a giant, Orkn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svadill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svaðill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a slippery place:</i> in the phrase, fara svaðil fyrir e-m, <i>to get on slippery ice, get a bad fall,</i> Fms. vii. 56, Stj. 433, 513.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svafnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svafnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [svefja], <i>a sleep-maker, soother</i>, Lat. <i>sopitor;</i> fjör-svafnir, the name of a sword, Nj.: poët. <i>a serpent,</i> Gm., Edda, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svagi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svagi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a gurgler</i> (?), a nickname, Fms. viii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svagla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svagla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to gurgle,</i> Sturl. iii. 192 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>svakk,</strong> n. [cp. sukk], <i>a muddle, disorder,</i> Nj. 18, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svakka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svakka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to riot, be disorderly,</i> <strong>svakk-samr,</strong> adj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sval"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sval
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cool breeze.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sval-brjostadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sval-brjóstaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>cool-breasted, chilly,</i> Edda.",
            }
