        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to chill, cool;</i> frost má við koma sínu afli at svala, Sks. 197 B; svala sér, <i>to slake one’s thirst.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svala-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen. svölu; a <i>v</i> has been dropped, as the proper form would have been svölva (gen. svölu), cp. völva (völu); [A. S. <i>swealwe;</i> Engl. <i>swallow;</i> Germ. <i>schwalbe</i>]:—<i>a swallow,</i> Eg. 420, Edda (Gl.), Karl. 304, Fas. iii. 280; svölu-hreiðr, <i>a swallow’s nest:</i> poët. dólg-svala, <i>a ‘war-swallow,’</i> i. e. <i>a shaft,</i> Eb. (in a verse): a pr. name of a woman, Band.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svala-drykkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svala-drykkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a cooling draught.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svala-lind"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svala-lind
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a refreshing stream,</i> Pass.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svalar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svalar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. a kind of <i>balcony</i> running along a wall; stóð jarl í svala-glugg einum, Fms. ix. 427, v. l.; Sverrir konungr var genginn ór herberginu út í svalarnar, … síðan hljóp hann ofan í garðinn, viii. 123; hann hljóp út um svalarnar ok ofan í kirkju-garðinn, var þat furðu-hátt hlaup, 191; jarl svaf í öðru herbergi, hann hljóp upp við ok gékk út í svalarnar, ix. 449; hann var úti í svölum í gæzlu hafðr, Ó. H. 117. cp. 235, Stj. 211, 402. Judges ix. 51. <strong>svala-klefi,</strong> a, m. <i>an alcove with balcony,</i> D. N. v. 342.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [identical with soll (q. v.) and Engl. <i>swill</i>]:—<i>a drunken bout;</i> and <strong>svalla,</strong> að, <i>to swill, drink hard</i>. <strong>svallari,</strong> a, m. <i>a swiller, debauchee.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "svöl, svalt, adj. <i>cool, fresh;</i> með svalri veðr-blöku, Sks. 234; svölum regnélum, 629; vindr mikill ok s., Fms. vi. 421; hægra ok svalara, 226; svölum eggjum, Hdl.: poët. eitr-s., úr-s., Lex. Poët.: freq. in mod. usage, svala-drykkr, q. v.: as a nickname, Bs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svamla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svamla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (<strong>svaml,</strong> n.), <i>to swim with great fuss and noise,</i> like a whale, Fas. iii. 443; víða trúi eg hann svamli sá gamli, Jón Arason.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svan-fjadrar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
