          className="link"
          href="/word/svana-songr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svana-söngr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a swan’s song.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svangi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svangi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. or <strong>svangr,</strong> m. [<i>svange</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>the groins,</i> esp. of animals; tina í svanginn, <i>to fill the belly;</i> ek em lagðr í gögnum spjóti svangann, ok er út kominn oddrinn at hrygginum, Karl. 404; takit ór mér svangan og langann, Ísl. Þjóðs. i. 152; svangs súðir, <i>‘belly-boards,’</i> i. e. <i>ships</i>, Ó. H. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [svangi], <i>slender, slim, thin</i> (= Germ. <i>schlank</i>), of a horse; svangir (hestar) sól draga, Gm. 37 (Bugge); svangri und söðli, Hkv. 1. 41; svipta söðli af svöngum jó, Og. 3; this sense is obsolete, and the word is only used,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svanni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svanni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to svanr or svangr?], poët. <i>a lady,</i> Edda 108, Kormak, Hallfred, Rm., freq. in old and mod. poetry.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svanr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svanr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. svans, Pr. 478, pl. svanir; [A. S. <i>swana;</i> Germ. <i>schwan;</i> a common Teut. word, but in Icel. svanr is the poetical, álpt (q. v.) the common word]:—<i>a swan;</i> svanir hvítir at lit, Stj. 90; fugls þess er s. heitir, Barl. 135; hjá söngvi svana, Edda 16 (in a verse): poët., svana beðr, fold, fjöll, dalr, strind, <i>the swan’s bed, land …,</i> i. e. <i>the sea</i>: as also <strong>svan-bekkr, svan-bingr, svan-fjöll, svan-flaug, svan-fold, svan-mjöll, svan-teigr, svan-vangr, svan-vengi,</strong> <i>the bench, bed, fell, field, earth, snow … of the swans,</i> i. e. <i>the sea, the waves,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. svör, <i>a reply, answer,</i> in ancient writers only in plur.; sagði Kári Eireki svör þeira, Nj. 137: the phrases, halda upp svörum fyrir e-n, <i>to be one’s spokesman,</i> Fms. ii. 292, vi. 269; sitja fyrir svörum id., iv. 274, vi. 13, Band. 36 new Ed.; gjalda svör fyrir e-t, <i>to give a reason,</i> Barl. 91: in mod. usage also in sing.: compd, and-svör.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svar-dagi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svar-dagi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an oath,</i> usually in plur., allra svardaga, binda svardögum, veita svardaga, and the like, Nj. 164, Eb. 302, Íb. 16, Hkr. i. 272, Fær. 191, Fms. i. 49, 206, Stj. 303.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svar-stuttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svar-stuttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>giving short replies,</i> Fms. iv. 165.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>and-swarian;</i> Engl. <i>an-swer</i>], <i>to reply, answer,</i> absol. or with double dat. (s. e-m e-u), ef maðr svarar eigi, Grág. i. 21; svara engu orði, Fb. ii. 63; Hrútr svaraði þá—‘ærit fögr er mær sjá,’ Nj. 2; því (dat.) mun ek svara þér um þetta er satt er, 49; hón svarar svá, at hón vill …, Fms. i. 2; svara e-u fyrir sik, <i>to make answer in defence,</i> 656 C. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svard-fastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svarð-fastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [svörðr], <i>‘sward-fast,’ swarded, turfed, with sward</i> or <i>sod</i>; svarðfast land, Grág. ii. 291, 355.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svard-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svarð-lauss
