        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (<strong>sveim,</strong> n., Orkn. l. c.), <i>a soaring, bustle, stir;</i> göra fjándsligan sveim, Hallfred; sá sveimr görisk um allar herbúðir, at …, Al. 117; í Eyjunum var sveim mikit, <i>in the islands there was mickle stir,</i> Orkn. 334: a nickname, Sturl.",
