        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>abode in a</i> sveit, Lv. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sveiti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sveiti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (mod. <strong>sviti</strong>), [A. S. <i>swât</i>; Engl. <i>sweat;</i> Germ. <i>schweiss;</i> Dan. <i>sved;</i> cp. Lat. <i>sudor</i>]:—<i>sweat;</i> blóð ok sveita, Blas. 45; spratt honum sveiti í enni, Nj. 68; konungr hafði fengit sveita, <i>got into a perspiration,</i> Fms. viii. 444.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sveittr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sveittr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (or part.), <i>in a steaming heat,</i> Sturl. ii. 217 C, Ísl. ii. 210, Fb. i. 254; kóf-s., löðrandi s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sveitugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sveitugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = sveittr, Sturl. ii. 217, Þiðr. 229, Karl. 315.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sveitungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sveitungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man belonging to a</i> sveit (I. 1), <i>a comrade;</i> vil ek fylgja sveitungum mínum, ÓH. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svelgja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svelgja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "svelg; pret. svalg, pl. sulgu; subj. sylgi; imperat. svelg; part. solginn; since it became weak, svelgðist, Bs. ii. (in a verse of the 14th century), and so in mod. usage; [A. S. <i>swelgan;</i> Engl. <i>swallow, swill;</i> Germ. <i>schwelgen</i>]:—<i>to swallow,</i> with acc., Ýt. 4; hræ Ólafs hofgyldir svalg, 21; at jörðin sylgi hestinn, Nj. 163; mun hón solgit hafa yrmling, Fms. vi. 350; s. sinn föður-arf, Al. 114; eitt skógar-dýr svalg hann, Stj. 219; svelgja þik, Barl. 111: <i>to swallow,</i> svelg hrákann niðr, Pr.; svelgr hann allan Sigföðr, Ls. 58; Eljúðnir vann solginn Baldr, Mkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svelgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svelgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Shetl. <i>swelchie</i>], <i>a swirl, whirlpool, current, stream,</i> = röst, q. v.; var þar eptir svelgr í hafinu, Edda; sem svelgr í hafi eða Sirtes aðr Scylla, Al. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svelja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svelja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. svelr; pret. svalði, <i>to swell,</i> an obsolete word, only two forms of which are recorded; gadd svelr blóðug-hadda, Edda 23 (in a verse); húfar svölðu, Edda (Ht.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>swollen ice, a lump of ice;</i> mikit svell var hlaupit upp, Nj. 144; svell þrútnar upp hjá garði, Grág. ii. 283; svelli ok hjarni var steypt yfir alla jörð, Fms. ii. 228: in mod. usage ‘svell’ is ice with solid ground beneath, ‘iss’ ice on water: poët., handar svell, <i>the ice of the hand,</i> i. e. <i>gold;</i> sárs, dreyra, fetla svell, <i>‘wound-ice,’</i> i. e. <i>weapons,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svell-ottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svell-óttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>swollen with lumps of ice,</i> Fb. iii. 408.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, a causal to the preceding, <i>to make to swell;</i> svellendr, Eb. (in a verse); böð-svellendr, sveldr húfr, <i>blown up,</i> Fms. viii. (in a verse); sveldr af harmi, Skáld H.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svella-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. svell; pret. svall, pl. sullu; subj. sylli; part. sollinn; [A. S. <i>swellan;</i> Engl. <i>swell;</i> Germ. <i>schwellen;</i> Dan. <i>svolne;</i> Swed. <i>swälla;</i> cp. Goth. <i>uf-swalleins</i> = φυσίωσις]:—<i>to swell;</i> skip konungs vóru sett mjök ok sollin, of ice, Ó. H. 182; húfr svall, sjór svellr, sollit haf, sollinn sær, éli sollinn, veðr-sollinn, hrími sollinn (of the waves), Lex. Poët.: of a wound, sár þat tók at þrútna ok svella, Fms. ix. 276; sárit var sollit, ÓH. 223; hestrinn svall svá ákafliga at allan blés kviðinn, Bs. i. 319.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svellir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svellir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>who makes to swell,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svellr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svellr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. qs. <strong>svelldr,</strong> <i>swelling high;</i> með svellu sinni. Pass. 7. 4; svellt hafði hón belti, Bs. ii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svelta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svelta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, a causal to the preceding, <i>to put to death</i> (by hunger?); svinna systrungu sveitir þú í helli, Am. 53; láta sveitask, Og. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svelta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svelta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. sveit; pret. svalt, 2nd pers. svaltz, Ls. 62 (Bugge); mod. svalst: pl. sultu; subj. sylti; part. soltinn; [Ulf. <i>swiltan</i> = ἀποθνήσκειν; A. S. <i>sweltan;</i> Early Engl. <i>swelte</i>]:—<i>to die;</i> this sense, which agrees with the use in Goth. and A. S., is disused in the Northern language and remains only in poetry; svalt þá Sigurðr, saztu yfir dauðum, Hm. 7; þat mál it hinnsta áðr hann sylti, Og. 16; björt áðr sylti, Akv. 43; hafa skal ek Sigurð mér á armi, eða þó svelta, Skv. 3. 6; þeim er sultu með Sigurði, 62; nema þú Sigurð svelta látir, 11, Gkv. 2. 3; er annan lét s., Fms. i. 258 (in a verse), ii. 271 (in a verse); soltnar þýjar, ærnar soltnar, Skv. 3. 45, 48; soltinn varð Sigurðr sunnan Rínar. Bkv. 11; aflir svelta, þeir er af bekkjar bergja drekku, Merl. 1. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svelti-kvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svelti-kví
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a pen in which one is put to starve,</i> Grág. ii. 328, 330; reka fé ór sveltikvíum, K. Þ. K. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sveltir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sveltir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a starver, one who starves,</i> Lex. Poët.; hrafna-s., <i>raven famisher,</i> a nickname, Fb. iii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svemla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
