        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a sword-stroke,</i> Fms. viii. 180, xi. 190.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sverfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sverfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sverf; pret. svarf, pl. surfu: part. sorfinn; [Ulf. <i>af-swairban</i> = ἐξαλείφειν, ἐκμάσσειν; Engl. <i>swerve;</i> Dutch <i>swerven;</i> Swed. <i>swerfva</i>]:—<i>to file;</i> járn sorfit, Stj. 160; sverfr hann, 158; svarf hann með snarpri þél, Bs. i. 237; sverfa til stáls, <i>to ‘file to the steel’ to the core,</i> i. e. <i>to fight it out to the last;</i> kvað þá verða at s. til stáls með þeim, Fms. vii. 244; láta þá til stáls sverva með þeim, Ó. H. 41; ok láta s. til stáls með ykkr bræðrum, Fb. ii. 122, Orkn. 234, 428: sverfr at, <i>it presses hard;</i> er í kreppingar kemr ok at sverfr, Fms. iv. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sverja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sverja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. sver, pl. sverjum; pret. sór, pl. sóru (also svór, Fas. iii. 393, Fms. x. 396; svóru, 416, Grág. ii. 410); subj. sœri; imperat. sver, sverða; part. svarinn. A weak pret. svarði, part. svarðr. also freq. occurs in old writers, thus, svarði, Hkr. i. 79, Fas. i. 178, Edda i. 136 (Cod. Reg., sór Cod. Worm. l. c.); þú svarðir, Gkv. 1. 21 (Bugge); svörðu, Landn. 154 (sóru, Hb. l. c.), Fms. xi. 67, Nj. 191, Grág. ii. 410 (twice); svörðusk, Mork. 207 (in a verse): but in mod. usage the strong form alone is used: [a common Teut. word; Ulf. <i>swaran</i> = ὀμνύναι; A. S. <i>swerjan;</i> Engl. <i>swear;</i> Germ. <i>schwören;</i> Dan. <i>sværge;</i> Swed. <i>svärja</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sverra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sverra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð (?), an obsolete defective word, [svarri, svarkr; cp. Goth. <i>sweran</i> = τιμαν], <i>to be mighty</i> (?); sverrandi hjaldr, Eg. (in a verse): hence",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sverri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sverri-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in poët. compds, sverri-flagð, <i>the mighty ogress;</i> sverri-fjörðr, <i>the mighty firth;</i> sverri-gjörð, <i>the vast belt of the land,</i> i. e. <i>the main sea,</i> Lex. Poët.: <strong>Sverrir,</strong> a pr. name (of king Sverri), <i>the worthy</i> (?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sverta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sverta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [svartr], <i>to make black, blacken.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svertingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svertingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a pr. name: <strong>Svertingar,</strong> [cp. A. S. <i>swertling</i>], the name of an old family, Ld. 2, Saxo.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svidda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. indecl., contr. form <strong>svidaði,</strong> N. G. L. i. 341, v. l. 14; <strong>svedae,</strong> 399; <strong>svidauðar,</strong> 341, l. 1; qs. sve-dái, sve-dauðr; [the etymology is uncertain, but it appears to be a compd word, the latter part being -dái or -dauðr]:—<i>suddenly-dead,</i> from falling sickness or the like; in the old eccl. law the word is used of cattle that have died a natural death, whose flesh may not be eaten; um svidda ok úátan, … eta svidda … þat köllu vér svidda er engi maðr veit bana at, N. G. L. i. 18; sveita né sviða … þat heitir allt sviða er svá verðr dautt at eigi ganga manns handa-verk til, 341 (sviðaði v. l. 14); um svedae, 399; allt annat ef sviða liggr, 144, 342; verða s., K. Þ. K. 172, K. Á. 198.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. pl. <i>singed sheep’s heads,</i> Sturl. i. 166, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svid-balki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svið-bálki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svid-eldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svið-eldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = sviðueldr, Fær. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svid-kaldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svið-kaldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘roasting-cold,’</i> Fms. i. (in a verse describing the waves): in mod. usage of a drink.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a kind of weapon, <i>a halberd,</i> Edda (Gl); spjót, sviður, bryntröll, K. Þ. K. 170; Viðkuðr hafði sviðu. silfr-rekinn leggrinn, járn-vafit skaptið … lagði Viðkuðr til Jóns með sviðunni, Sturl. i. 63 C; hann hafði sviðu í annarri hendi, Nj. 96; skaut hann sviðunni eptir Óspaki, Eb. 298; bjarn-s., q. v. <strong>sviðu-skapt,</strong> n. <i>the handle of a</i> sviða, Fas. iii. 546.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svida-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [svíða], <i>a roasting, burning, singeing;</i> bæta eyri fyrir sviðu hverja er sviðin er, N. G. L. i. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviðarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>Sviðuðr,</strong> <strong>Sviðrir,</strong> m. <i>the burner, destroyer</i> (?), one of the names of Odin, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a burn, the smart from burning;</i> þola sár ok sviða, Edda; sviða ok þrota, Ld. 252; sviðar ok hitar, Bs. i. 182. <strong>sviða-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>free from burning pains,</i> Bs. i. 182; brjóst-sviði, <i>heart-burn.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviðinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>singed;</i> see sviða. <strong>sviðin-horni,</strong> a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviðna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be singed;</i> loði sviðnar, Gm. 1; eigi sviðnuðu hinar minnstu trefr, Fms. i. 266; sviðnar þat at eins en brennr eigi, Sks. 145; torfi því er sviðnaði, Ísl. ii. 412; hendr sviðnuðu, Gkv. 3. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
