        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. a local name of islands in western Icel., where salt was made by burning sea-weed (salt-sviða), see Landn. 2. ch. 23, and Gullþ. S.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
