        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = svig; fara á svik, Fms. vi. 41 (in a verse), viii. 165, v. l.:—in the phrase, opt er svik á millum tanna (= gisnar tennr?), Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svik-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svik
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [A. S. <i>swic;</i> Scot. <i>swick</i> or <i>swyk;</i> Dan. <i>svig</i>], <i>treason, fraud, falsehood, betrayal;</i> segja upp svikin, Karl. 318; ef eigi fylgði svik, Nj. 105; brugga, ráða s., Fms. i. 59, v. 316; hver svik hann hafði heyrt, v. 320; verða fyrir svikum, Skv. 1. 33; sitja á svikum við e-n, Bs. i. 39, passim; dróttins svik, <i>treason.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svik-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svik-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>treason,</i> Hom. 159, Fms. xi. 303 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svik-folk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svik-fólk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>rebels,</i> Fms. xi. 296 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svik-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svik-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>full of falsehood,</i> Fms. v. 217, Anecd.",
