              "__html": "u, f. <i>a whip;</i> berja með svipum, Stj. 578, MS. 623. 12; hann hafði svipu í hendi ok keyrði hana, Sd. 185: esp. <i>a horse-whip,</i> svipu-ól, svipu-skapt, <i>the lash, handle of a whip.</i> <strong>svipu-leikr,</strong> m. a play, <i>‘swoop-game,’</i> perh. it should be sviðu-leikr (sviþu-leikr, <i>p</i> having crept in for <i>þ</i>), Fms. iii. 193, 196.",
