          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [svipr], <i>to swoop, flash,</i> of a sudden but noiseless motion; létu síðan frá landi ok svipuðu yfir ána (sveipuðu v. l.), <i>and swooped, went swiftly across the river,</i> Fms. viii. 170; fugl eir. n fló inn um glugginn ok svipaði (<i>swooped</i>) um húsit, Þjal.; sverð þat er svipar (<i>flashes</i>) allan veg meðr eldbitrum eggium, <i>a flashing sword,</i> Sks. 548 B; svipandi logi, <i>a sweeping fire,</i> 203 B (cp. sveipanda sverð, Gen. iii. 24); þegar hann sezt í sætið há, svipaði þaðan ótú, <i>fear flashed out from him where he sat,</i> Núm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>looking so and so;</i> svipaðr ílla = svip-íllr, Fas. iii. 627.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>svipull</strong>), <i>shifty, changeable;</i> svipul verðr mér sona-eignin, Grett. 123 A; afla svipulla sæmda, Al. 163: <i>unstable,</i> svipul er sjó-veiðr, svipull er sjóvar-afli, a saying, Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘swoop,’ suddenness;</i> þessi atburðr varð með svá skjótri svipan, at …, Nj. 144; kasta með harðri svipan, <i>quickly,</i> Fas. i. 67; sverða s., <i>the’swoop of swords’</i> poët., Skv. 2. 19: <i>a fight,</i> þar varð hörð s., Fms. viii. 317; varð hörð s. um hríð, ix. 257, 311; svipan þeirra frá ek snarpa, Nj. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipil-kinnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipil-kinnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>with gaunt cheeks</i> (?), Fas. ii. 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. svipir, <i>a swoop;</i> svipr einn var þat, <i>it was a sudden swoop, but a moment,</i> Hkv.; sverða svipr, <i>a swoop of swords,</i> Fms. vi. (in a verse): <i>a moment,</i> í þann svipinn, í þessum svip = svipan, q. v.; sitt í hvern svipinn, <i>one moment this, another that.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a loss;</i> hann kvað sér sviptu at þeirra skilnaði, Fs. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [cp. svipr, svipa; Engl. <i>swift</i>], <i>to pull quickly;</i> hón svipti (<i>sweeped, swept</i>) at mötli sínum, Fs. 60; hón svipti honum á herðar sér, 623. 36; svipta e-u ofan, <i>to sweep off, knock down,</i> Fms. ii. 45; svipti hón söðli af svöngum jó, Og. 3; s. ofan forfallinu, Konr.; er hann svipti honum Svarti, <i>gave him a shaking,</i> Fs. 140; þat (the bear) svipti honum undir sik, 149; s. undir sik tjaldinu, Fms. vii. 114; hann svipti undir hönd sér einum litlum gullbaug, Edda 72; s. e-u undan e-m, <i>to strip one of it,</i> Sks. 682.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipti-kista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipti-kista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a movable chest,</i> Eb. 256, Sturl. iii. 304.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviptingar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviptingar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>a tugging, wrestling;</i> harðar, miklar sviptingar, Edda 33, Fms. iii. 188.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviptingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviptingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>sviptungr,</strong> m. [cp. Engl. <i>swifters</i> = <i>shrouds,</i> thus in a different sense]:—<i>reefing-ropes,</i> (Swed. <i>svigt-linor,</i> Dan. <i>svöft, tage svöftet ind</i>); eyri við svifting hvern, til þess er kemr í sex sviptunga … sviptung hvern, N. G. L. i. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviptir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviptir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a loss;</i> e-m er s. í e-u, Vápn. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipul"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipul
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. one of the Valkyriur, Edda (Gm.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svipull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see svipall.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svirgull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svirgull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [svíri], a kind of <i>coarse necktie</i> (?); hence <strong>svirguls-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>coarse, bulky.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sviti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>sweat, perspiration;</i> see sveiti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svitna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svitna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sweat.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "interj. = svei, q. v.; sví verði þeim! Karl. 364; this form is else only used as prefixed in sví-virða, -virðing, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi-vird"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví-virð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = svívirðing, Anecd. 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi-virda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví-virða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð (mod. t), [sví and virða], <i>to dishonour, disgrace, put to shame,</i> Fs. 60, Fms. xi. 55; svívirðr, Ld. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi-virding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví-virðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = svívirða, Eg. 155, Nj. 139; svívirðingar-lauss, Fms. ii. 269; svívirðingar-maðr, -namn, -orð, Grett. 116 A, Sks. 270, Fms. vii. 166, Ld. 92.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi-virdliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví-virðliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>sví-virðiliga,</strong> Karl. 159), adv. <i>disgracefully,</i> Fms. vi. 245, vii. 23, x. 237, 341, Karl. 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi-virdligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví-virðligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>sví-virðiligr</strong>), adj. <i>disgraceful,</i> Fms. x. 217, 372, Nj. 263, Ó. H. 220, Stj. 58, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svi-thjod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sví-þjóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (often spelt <strong>Sviðioð</strong>), dat. Svíþjóðu, Gs. 13, Fas. ii. 485 (in a verse); Svíþjúðu, Rafn 181, 189: [Svíar and þjóð; the <i>d</i> in the forms <i>Suede, Schweden, Sweden</i> is from the <i>þ</i> in þjóð: the etymology (Edda 107) from Odin’s name Sviðrir is quite fanciful, for even Tacitus calls the people <i>Swiones,</i> not Swi<i>th</i>ones]:—<i>the people, land of the Swedes,</i> i. e. <i>Sweden,</i> orig. only of Sweden proper as opp. to Gothland; í Danmörku, Gautlandi eðr í Svíþjóð, N. G. L. ii. 277; afterwards used as a general name for the later Swedish empire, including Gothland (Svía-veldi, Svía-ríki): again, Svíþjóð in Kalda or in Mikla, Svíþjóð, <i>‘the Cold, the Great,’</i> was the old name of the east of Europe, ‘Scythia,’ see Hkr., Yngl. S. ch. 1; Symb. (begin.), Al. 131: the European Svíðjóð was therefore Svíþjóð in minni, or <i>Swecia Minor,’</i> Symb. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svia"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svía
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>svia</i>], <i>to abate,</i> of pains, (mod.); see svina.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svíar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [<i>Suiones,</i> of Tacit. Germ.; Swed. <i>svear</i>], <i>the Swedes,</i> originally in the limited sense of the Northern Swedes,—‘Svea och Göta konung’ is still the title of the king of Sweden; Svía-kind, Svía-dróttinn, Svía-kappi, <i>the kind, lord, champion of the Swedes,</i> Ýt., Lex. Poët.; Freyr Svía-goð, <i>Frey the god of the Swear,</i> Fb. iii. 246; Svía-herr, <i>the host of Swear,</i> Fms. x. 349; Sía-sker, <i>the Swedish skerries,</i> islands in the Baltic near to the Mälar lake; Svía-gríss, the name of a mythical ring, Yngl. S., Edda: Svía-konungar, <i>the Swedish king,</i> passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svíarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a dwarf, Vsp.: <i>the forger, the smith</i> (?), akin to sía, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svida-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svíða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "svíðr; pret. sveið, sviðu; part. sviðinn: a weak pret. svíddi, Greg. 60; svíddu, Lil. 56, Fms. vii. (in a verse): [Dan. <i>svie</i>]:—<i>to singe, burn;</i> tak rúgbrauð ok svíð við eld, … et þat sviðit, Pr. 475; svíða dilka-höfuð, <i>to singe, roast sheep’s heads,</i> Þorst. St. 51; nú svíðr hann lítt um höfuðit, Rd. 260; hann svíddi útan af þornunum, Greg. 60; hann svíðr klumbuna útan, Fms. xi. 129; svíða hár, Grág. ii. 129; nauts-rófa sviðin, Eb. 276; annat brjóstið svíða þær, Al. 121; sviðu hverja er sviðin er, N. G. L. i. 67; jöfurr svíðr bygðir, … logi svíðr bý, Lex. Poët.; sviðnir fuglar, Sól.; hann sveið hræ, Fms. vi. 55 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svidingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svíðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘singer,’ a stingy man;</i> hann er mesti s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svífa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sveif, svifu, svifit; [Ulf. <i>sweifan</i> = διαλείπειν; A. S. <i>swîfan;</i> Engl. <i>sway;</i> Germ. <i>schweben, schweifen</i>]:—<i>to rove, ramble, turn;</i> sumir svifu at nautum, <i>some rambled for the cows,</i> Sturl. iii. 241; sveif hann þá til stofunnar, Gullþ. 62; hverr svífr at sinni eigu, Al. 117; sveinn sýsliga sveif til skógar, Hým.; láta skúturnar svífa suðr um Stað með landi fyrir vindi, <i>to stand southwards before the wind,</i> Fms. vii. 186; bændr kómu at svífandi (hence the mod. að-vífandi) ok drápu hann, <i>overtook him of a sudden and slew him,</i> viii. 414; kom höggit á öxlina ok sveif (= svaddi, <i>bounded</i>) ofan á bringuna, vii. 167; láta samþykki sitt s. til e-s, <i>to sway one’s consent towards, to agree,</i> 8; cp. létum svífa sáttmál okkur, Skv. 3. 39. (which is prob. the right reading for ‘síga’ of the Cod.); betri sígandi arðr en svífandi, Bs. i. 139 (see arðr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svífr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., see ú-svífr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svikja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svíkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>svíkva,</strong> svík; pret. sveik, sveikt (sveiktú), sveik, pl. sviku; imperat. svík, svíktú; part. svikinn (svikvit = svikit, Hom. 64): a pres. sýkva (<i>y</i> = <i>vi</i>), Blas. 42, 59, Clem. 53; s<i>ykr</i> rhymed with l<i>ykr</i>, Mkv. 18; a weak form svíkvir, Hom. 33; [A. S. <i>swicjan;</i> Dan. <i>svige</i>]:—<i>to betray;</i> vil ek þik í engu svíkja, Nj. 49; mundo eigi mik of sýkva, 623. 53; sýkva andir ústyrkra manna, Blas. 42; þessir hlutir svikva þá er elska, Hom. 28; viltú svíkja mik, Fms. i. 159; þetta mun mér kallat íllt verk at svíkja fóstrson minn, 85; svík mik þá eigi—Eigi mun ek svíkja þik … ílla sveiktú mik nú, Ísl. ii. 269; engi fémúta sveik hans auga, Mar.; af sviptr ok svikinn þinni ásjónu, Stj.; svikit hefir þú oss nú … Er svá? þykkisk þú svikinn? … Svikinn þykkjumk ek, ok hefir þú svikit mik… þat þykki mér vel at ek svíkja (subj.) þann er engum trúir, Band. 36; þeir er land ok þegna sviku undan Ólafi konungi með fégjöfum, Fms. iii. 41, vi. 12; hinn er Svein konung sveik ór landi, Ó. T. (in a verse):—s. e-n e-u, <i>to cheat one of;</i> fé opt svikinn, Am. 52; hann (Loki) sveik Ásu (acc.) leikum (dat.), Haustl.; Suttung svikinn hann lét sumbli frá, Hm. 110.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [a common Teut. word], <i>a swine,</i> Grág. ii. 315, Fms. i. 213, Fs. 26, Landn. 177: the saying, opt er it sama svín í akri, Fms. vi. 216, viii. 233, Mkv., cp. Odyss. xviii. 29: of the hog-shapen beggar’s scrip, Skíða R.; (cp. Dan. <i>‘gris,’</i> = a clay-pig used as a money-box); svíns belgr, blóð, bógr, rani. Fas. iii. 622, Stj. 363, 644, Sturl. iii. 44; svíns hrin, Fas. iii. 149; svíns-lifr, <i>swine’s liver,</i> as a charm used to still enmities or in truce-making, Gkv. 2. 23 (cp. Stj. 363, v. l.,—því vóru heiðnir menn vanir at …); hafa svíns minni, <i>to have a swine’s</i> (i. e. <i>short</i>) <i>memory,</i> Ld. 216.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-beygja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-beygja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to make one stoop like a swine,</i> a word of contempt (cp. make one pass the Caudine forks); svínbeygt hefi ek nú þann er ríkastr er með Svíum, Edda 83, Fs. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-drukkinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-drukkinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>drunk as a swine,</i> Bárð. 176.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-eygr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-eygr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>swine-eyed,</i> Mkv. 2, (svíneyg drós, not svi<i>nn</i>-eyg, cp. Odyss. viii. 319.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-fylking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-fylking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘swine-array,’ the wedge-shaped phalanx</i> of the Scandinavians, from its being shaped like a swine’s snout (see hamall and rani), Sks. 384, Fb. i. 140.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-fylkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-fylkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to draw up in a</i> svínfylking, Sks. 384; mjótt framan, en breiðast aptan, ok kalla menn þat svínfylkt, Mag. 167 (Ed.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-faetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-fætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. a term of abuse (cp. Germ. <i>bunds-vot</i>), Mag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-galinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-galinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>mad (drunk) like a swine,</i> Bárð. 33 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-hvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-hvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>whale,</i> Sks. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-hofdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-höfði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-skinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-skinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>pig-skin,</i> Edda 69.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svin-sti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svín-stí
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a swine-sty,</i> Fms. x. 388.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svina-baeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svína-bæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a hog-sty,</i> Fms. i. 213, Hkr. i. 71 (of dreams in a hog-sty).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svina-geymsla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svína-geymsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-gæzla,</strong> u, f. <i>swine-tending,</i> Grág., Fs. 71, Fas. i. 218.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svina-hirdir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svína-hirðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a swine-herd,</i> Mart. 123, Fas. i. 430 (see the verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svina-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svína-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a swine-house, pig-sty,</i> Fms. x. 269.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svinka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svínka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Germ. <i>schwanken</i>], <i>to stagger;</i> frétta þat sem Girard hefir svínkat, Karl. 192: part. <strong>svínkaðr,</strong> <i>the worse for drink.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svipa-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svípa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. sveip, for the other forms of this strong verb see sveipa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sviri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svíri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>swîra</i>], <i>the neck</i>, esp. of an ox or beast of burden; beygt hefi ek svíra á feitari bukkum en þú ert, <i>bowed the neck,</i> metaphor from an ox under the yoke, Fms. xi. 237; þit brutuð svíra minna andskota, Th. 9; saur-stokkinn svíri, Fms. vi. (in a verse); til svíra, Þd. 7; hár vigra söngr of svírum, Hornklofi; lýðr þessi er með hörðum svíra, <i>stiff-necked,</i> Stj. 312 (harð-svíraðr, <i>stiff-necked</i>); herða þeir sinn svíra gegn Guði, 639; en er blóðit út springr af svíranum (= strjúpi), Karl. 56: svíra vín = <i>blood</i>, Km. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svo"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svo
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., see svá.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svoddan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svoddan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. indecl. <i>such</i>, Dan. <i>saadan</i> (mod. and borrowed from Low Germ. through Dan., and much used since the Reformation), Pass. 4. 18, 35. 6, 50. 6, Vídal. passim, so in mod. speech, in which it is gradually displacing the old and vernacular slíkr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svolgra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svolgra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to swill, swallow, drink greedily.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svoli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svoli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [svola?], prop. <i>a burnt rafter</i> (?): metaph. <i>a huge brutish person,</i> <strong>svola-legr,</strong> adj. <i>brutish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svunta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svunta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., in the east of Icel. <strong>svinta,</strong> Oldn. Ordb., [from a mid. Lat. <i>succinctum</i> or the like; the word was prob. borrowed during the Engl. trade of the 15th century]:—<i>an apron,</i> very freq. in mod. usage, Piltr og Stulka 35; röndótta svuntu, 50; svuntu-horn, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svyk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svyk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n.(?); bollar tveir annarr með svyk, Dipl. iii. 4; bolli með svyk, v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an open space;</i> görði á storm veðrs er þeir lágu á svæðinu, Fms. ii. 16; Kingála stóð á þar sem mest var svæðit, Grett. 91 A: in the mod. ber-svæði, <i>a bare, open field</i> exposed to wind and rain. ☞ On the Runic stone, Rafn 189, read Svíþjúðu.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svæfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [cp. svefja and sefa = <i>to sooth</i>, sæfa = <i>to kill</i>], <i>to lull to sleep;</i> hón svæfir með fögrum söng, Fms. iv. 56, v. 162; hann sló hörpu ok svæfði ormana, Sæm. 162; svíkja ok s. þá er vér skyldim vaka, Fms. ii. 142; vekja upp svæfða reiði, Al. 127; svæfðr, B. K. 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaefill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svæfill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a head-pillow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [A. S. <i>swol</i> = <i>heat, swælan</i> = <i>to burn;</i> Engl. <i>swelter, sultry;</i> Germ. <i>schwüle</i>]:—<i>a thick, choking smoke;</i> reykr ok svæla, Sturl. iii. 189 C; dimri svælu, Fas, iii. 441; nú görðisk brátt s. mikil í húsunum ok reykr tók at vaxa, Þorst. Síðu H. 175; reykjar-s., <i>a stifling smoke,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaenskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svænskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "more freq. <strong>Sœnskr,</strong> adj. [Svíar], <i>Swedish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sværa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Ulf. <i>swaihra</i> = πενθερός; A. S. <i>sweor, sweger;</i> O. H. G. <i>swehor;</i> Germ. <i>schwager;</i> Lat. <i>socer</i>]:—<i>a mother-in-law,</i> 623. 57, Stj. 343; sværu léztu þína sitja opt grátna, Am. 94; s. heitir vers móðir, Edda 109; s. Nönnu, 63: s. Sifjar, 65. The word was obsolete even in old writers; Icel. use a compound, tengda-faðir, -sonr, -móðr, -dóttir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svaesinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svæsinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>svæsni,</strong> f.), adj. <i>coarse, gross, rude.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svodu-sar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svöðu-sár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [svað], <i>a wound</i> from a weapon glancing off a bone; s. í enni, Lv. 86; s. en eigi beinhögg, Sturl. i. 13; grunn verða svöðu-sárin, 140; á bringuna, var þat s., Fms. vii. 167.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svoldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svölðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a local name of a current (not an island) near Hiddense (Héðins-ey) west of Rügen; prob. a rendering of a Wendish name, <i>the Swelchie, whirlpool</i> (?); fyrir Svölðar minni, <i>before the mouth of S.;</i> and ‘fyrir Svölð,’ Edda 83, also Knytl. S. ch. 120, 122; see the conclusive essay on the place and date of this battle by Mr. Jörgensen, in Aarb. for Nord. Oldk. og Hist. 1869; to which add, that ‘Héðins-ey’ actually occurs, although disguised, in Hallfred’s poems, composed immediately after the battle, viz. ‘á víðu sundi Héðins-eyjar’ for ‘Héðins-meyjar’ of the MSS.; and breiðan bekk Héðins ‘rekka’ of the same poem (Fs. 218, 219, verses 12, 15, being a local name, not a kenning).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svolr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svölr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the cold sea, sea-spray,</i> Fas. ii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svoppr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svöppr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. svappar, dat. sveppi, pl. sveppir, acc. svöppu; the mod. form is <strong>sveppr,</strong> pl. sveppir, acc. sveppi; an assimilated form: [Ulf. <i>swamms</i> = σπόγγος; A. S. and O. H. G. <i>swam;</i> Germ. <i>schwamm;</i> Dan. <i>swamp</i>]:—<i>a sponge;</i> váta svöppu, Stj. 17, see v. l. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svörðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. svarðar, dat. sverði, sverðinum, Fas. iii. 503; pl. sverðir; acc. svörðu: [A. S. <i>sweard</i>; Engl. <i>sward</i> = <i>turf,</i> and Swed. <i>sward;</i> Dan. <i>swærd,</i> in <i>grönswærd, fleske-swærd;</i> Germ. <i>schwarte</i>]:—<i>the skin,</i> esp. of the head (hár-s., höfuð-s.); meðan s. ok hold fylgði, of the skull, Eg. 770; svörðinn á höfðinu, Fms. vii. 227; hár manns má kenna við svörð eða. hvirfil eða hnakka, Edda ii. 430; hnakka, reikar, svarðar, eða ennis, 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svorfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svörfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>svörfuðr,</strong> see svarfaðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/svorr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          svörr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a kind of <i>bird</i>, Edda (Gl.) <strong>svörr-gælir,</strong> m. <i>the gladdener of a bird of prey,</i> Vellekla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sydri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar., from suðr, <i>the more southern;</i> superl. <strong>synnstr,</strong> <i>the southernmost</i> (mod. also <strong>syðstr,</strong> to make it conform to the comparative, but less correct; on the other hand, the old poets also use compar. <strong>synnri</strong>); hinn syðri hlutr, Edda 4; nær enu syðra landinu, Ld. 6; þverá hinni syðri, Fms. i. 251; á Víðivöllum inum syðrum, Dropl. 7; inum syðra, Landn. 218; Reykjadal inn syðra, Nj. 27; í syðra Bretlandi, Str. 1: hit syðra, as an adverb, <i>in the south, southwards,</i> Landn. 62; vendi Magnúss konungr it syðra (<i>he stood southwards</i>) með Bretlandi ok Skotlandi, Orkn. 150; at inu synnsta fjalli, Landn. 43, v. l.; it synnsta fjall, Ísl. ii. 398; frá hinum synnsta vita, Hkr. i. 147; Vallá hina synnstu, Dipl. iii. 8; synnsta Grund, v. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syfja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syfja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [svefn, sofa], <i>he gets sleepy,</i> only impers.; e-n (acc.) syfjar, mik syfjar, Finnb. 340, Nj. 94; hvárt syfjar þik, Járnskjöldr faðir? Fb. i. 258; hann kvað sik svá syfja, at hann mætti engan veg uppi sitja, Háv. 55.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syfla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syfla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to furnish with</i> sufl, q. v.; syfldr brauðhleifr, Bjarn. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sygnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sygnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men from</i> <strong>Sogn,</strong> a county and firth in Norway, Orkn. 214, Fms.; Sygna-fylki, <i>the county of</i> Sogn, x. 168; Sygna-kappi -kjúka, -trausti, a nickname, Landn., Gísl., Fb. iii; Sygna-ræsir, <i>the king of</i> Sygnir, i. e. <i>the Norse king</i>, Hallfred: <strong>Sygnskr,</strong> adj. <i>from</i> Sogn, Fms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sykn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sykn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = sykna; ok varð ekki af sykninni, <i>it was dropped,</i> Grett. 117 new Ed.; af þessu eyddist sykn (syknan Ub.) at sinni, 173 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sykn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sykn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; not sýkn; the short vowel is borne out by rhymes, l<i>yk</i>ill, s<i>yk</i>nu, … as also by etymology, for <i>vi</i> changes into <i>y,</i> not into <i>ý</i>(sykn = svikn): [Ulf. <i>swikns</i> = ἁγνός, ὄσιος, ἀθωος; Prof. Bugge suggests that this word may be a compd, from an intens. particle <i>sve</i>-, and an adjective, <i>ikn</i> or <i>akn</i>, Gr. ἁγν-ός]:—<i>‘sackless,’ free from guilt, innocent;</i> hlutlauss eða sykn af manndrápi, Fms. ii. 225; hafit ok hirðit syknar hendr yðrar, Stj. 193: with gen., sykn saka, N. G. L. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sykna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sykna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Ulf. <i>swikniþa, swiknei</i> = ἁγνότης, ἁγνεία, ἁπλότης; <i>swikneins</i> = καθαρισμός]:—<i>blamelessness, the state of being</i> sykn; ef skógar-maðr hefir vegit annan skógar-mann til syknu sér, Grág. ii. 160; víg Þorvalds skyldi vera til syknu Helga, Rd. 265; lýsa syknu e-s, … ok fékksk þar hvártveggja syknan, … mæla móti syknu e-s, 292; færa fram syknu e-s (to bring it out in parliament), Fms. vi. 119, Fbr. 53; meðan þeir hafa eigi farit syknu sinni, Grág. i. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syknu-leyfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syknu-leyfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a licence of the</i> alþing <i>to grant</i> sykna; lögsögu-maðr á upp at segja s. öll, Grág. i. 2; ok talði hann vera frjálsan ef þar fengisk syknu-leyfit, Rd. 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syknu-lof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syknu-lof
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = syknuleyfi; ef mönnum er syknulofs beðit at lögréttu skógar-mönnum eða fjörbaugs-mönnum, Grág. i. 99.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sykr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sykr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>sukker</i>], <i>sugar,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sylfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sylfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= silfr, cp. Dan. <i>sölv,</i> Post. 569.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sylgja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sylgja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a brooch</i> or <i>buckle,</i> chiefly of silver or gold, worn by women; þrjár sylgjur sex aura, Dipl. iii. 4; s. ok fingrgull, Fms. ix. 263; gull-sylgja týndisk … ok fannsk ekki sylgjan … hét hón at gefa hálf-virði sylgjunnar, … sylgjöna þá ena sömu, Bs. i. 348; fimm sylgjur ok þrjú nisti, 874.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sylgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sylgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. sylgjar and sylgs; [svelgr, svelgja; Engl. <i>swill</i>]:—<i>a drink, beverage;</i> allt er senn ef hann sylg um getr, Hm.; ylgr fær af hræm sylg, Edda (in a verse); the word is not used in prose, see Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., qs. svill, gen. syllar, pl. syllr; mod. <strong>sylla,</strong> u, f.; [A. S. <i>syll;</i> Engl. <i>sill;</i> O. H. G. and Germ. <i>schwelle</i>]:—<i>a sill, door-sill;</i> reisa upp góða stólpa ok þar yfir leggja stórar syllr, Sks. 91 new Ed.; stafir fjórir stóðu upp ok syllr upp í milli, Fms. viii. 429 (so also Cod. Eirsp. 192, Ed. 1871); fjóra ása, átta stafi, tvau þvertré, ok tvær syllr, Dipl. iii. 8; hann fékk komizt út undir syll kirkjunnar, Slurl. iii. 102 C (kyrkju-sylluna Ed.); syllr ok stöðr, Ld. 316, cp. v. l.; sönghús-syllur, Fms. ix. 26: syllar-efni, Pm. 11. <strong>syllu-stokkr,</strong> m. <i>a sill-post,</i> Hom. 94, 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sylla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sylla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to furnish will a sill;</i> ok syllt upp í milli, Fms. viii. 429, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syllingar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syllingar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the Scilly Islands,</i> Fms, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. synjar, [synja; syn is the root from which syn-ð is a derivative]:—<i>a denial, protest;</i> used in law phrases, koma, setja, hafa syn fyrir, <i>to protest</i> or <i>repel a charge</i> on oath, by ordeal, or the like; ef þeir hafa syn fyrir, þá skulu þeir synja með einseiði, K. Á. 150; hann setti þar syn fyrir, ok bauð skírslur, Fms. ix. 5; bændr kómu þar sumir syn fyrir sik, Hkr. i. 89; hón er sett til varnar á þingum … því er þat orðtak, at ‘syn sé fyrir sett’ þá er hann neitar, Edda 21; the word is freq. in the compd nauð-syn (q. v.), <i>necessity,</i> otherwise obsolete.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syn-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syn-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unobliging,</i> 655 iii. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syn-semi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syn-semi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an unobliging mood, petty denial of a favour;</i> en synsemi mun þér í þykkja ok eigi stórmannlegt ef ek synja, Fs. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., older form <strong>syn-ð, syn-þ,</strong> shewing that the <i>d</i> is inflexive, svnþ, svnþir (<i>sins</i>), Mar. pref. xxxii, xxxiii, Eluc., Greg., passim; [A. S. <i>syn</i> and <i>synn,</i> whence the Norse word may have been borrowed when Christianity came in, for it does not occur in poets of the heathen age; Engl. <i>sin;</i> Germ. <i>sünde;</i> Dan. <i>synd</i>]:—<i>a sin</i> (it prop. means <i>‘negation, denial,’</i> no doubt referring to denial by oath of compurgators, ordeal, or the like). Mar., Stj., Bs., H. E., passim in old and mod. writers in an eccl. sense only, for the very word implies a Christian, not a heathen, notion (the heathens said glæpr or the like); synda-freistni, bót, auki, band, bruni, byrðr, dauði, daunn, díki, flekkr, fýsi, gjald, görð, iðran, játning, kyn, lausn, lifnaðr (líf), líkn, saurgan, saurr, sár, sótt, verk, = <i>the temptation, atonement …, sickness, work of sin,</i> H. E. i. 462, 522, Greg. 9, 18, 19, 22, 45, 46, 73, K. Á. 76, Stj. 51, 119, 123, 142, 145, 162, 220, Rb. 82, 400, Hom. 5, 11, 41, 48, 59, 73, Vm. 84, Magn. 542, and passim; synda far, Stj. 123; synda þræll, Hom. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-audigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd-auðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sinful,</i> Greg. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sinful,</i> Hom. 63.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-getinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd-getinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>sin-begotten,</i> Eluc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sinful,</i> Sks. 449 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>sinful,</i> of a deed, Sks. 674.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-varr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synd-varr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wary against sin,</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, mod. t, [sund], <i>to swim;</i> synti allt út í haf, Brandkr. 60 (paper MS.); ok syndu vestr yfir Jökuls-á, Sturl. ii. 157; the word has prevailed in mod. usage, but is very rare in old writers, who either use the tenses of svimma (q. v.) or more freq. leggjask, see leggja.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sinful,</i> Stj. 404, Barl. 99.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sinless,</i> Stj. 567, Sks. 486, Gþl. 169.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>sinfully,</i> Stj. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sinful,</i> Stj. 26, 119.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sinner,</i> 677. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synda-thraell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synda-þræll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a thrall of sin,</i> Hom. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syndari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syndari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a sinner,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syndga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syndga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [syndigr, from A. S. <i>syngjan</i>], <i>to sin,</i> N. T., Pass., Vídal. passim; in old writers only used in the",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syndigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syndigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., contr. syngan (qs. syndgan), Hom. 40; syndgir, 130; synþgom, Mar. pref. xxxii, l. 23; but else uncontr. syndigir, Niðrst. 7; synduga, Stj. 173, 316, and so in mod. usage: [A. S. <i>synig;</i> Dan. <i>syndig</i>]:—<i>sinful;</i> einn syndugr maðr, Barl. 173, passim; see the references above.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., qs. symdr, svimdr, [from sund; <i>symd,</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>able to swim, swimming;</i> vera syndr, Fms. x. 66; s. vel, Fb. i. 368; s. sem selr, Nj. 29, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syndvar-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syndvar-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>warily against sin;</i> lifa betr ok syndvarligar, Bs. i. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syngja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syngja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. syng; pret. saung or söng, pl. sungu; subj. syngi; imperat. syng, syngdu; part. sunginn; older <strong>syngva,</strong> and then even sounded singva, as seen from rhymes, þ<i>ing</i>s, s<i>ing</i>va., Eb. 27 new Ed. l. 24, in a verse of the 10th century: [Ulf. <i>siggwan</i> = ἄδειν; A. S. and O. H. G. <i>singan;</i> Engl. <i>sing;</i> Dan. <i>synge;</i> Swed. and early Dan. <i>sjunga</i>]:—<i>to sing,</i> prop. <i>to ring, clash,</i> of metals, weapons; <i>to whistle,</i> of wind, or the like; hurð syngr í lási, Fms. iii. 67; syngr í atgeirinum, Nj. 44, 119; bítia þat sverð, nema sjálfum þér syngvi um höfði, Hkv. 2; (örvar) sungu á mínum skjaldi, Eb. (in a verse); sverð saung of vanga mér, Kormak; það syngr í reiðanum, syngr í böndum, of the rigging of a ship in a storm, see Lex. Poët.: of the swan’s single sad note, syngi, syngi svanir mínir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syngn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syngn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see sýkn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [this is the root verb for syn and synð], <i>to deny;</i> sannaði þat annarr en annarr synjaði, Fms. iv. 294; þá muntú s. þess með skynsemd, Nj. 80, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synjan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synjan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>synjun,</strong> f. <i>a denial, refusal,</i> Grág. i. 91; far-s., Hbl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synnstr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          synnstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "superl. <i>southernmost;</i> see syðri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syptir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syptir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Germ. <i>seufzen;</i> Engl. <i>sob</i> and <i>sigh</i>], <i>a sobbing;</i> in and-syptir or and-syftir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syrgi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syrgi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sad</i>, Stj. 52, Bs. i. 819.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syrgja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syrgja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [sorg; Ulf. <i>saurgan</i> = μεριμναν, λυπεισθαι; A. S. <i>sorgjan;</i> Engl. <i>sorrow;</i> Germ. <i>sorge;</i> Dan. <i>sörge</i>]:—<i>to sorrow, mourn;</i> hann bað menn eigi syrgja né láta öðrum herfiligum látum, Nj. 197; snökta eðr s., Fms. viii. 234; þeir syrgðu ok hrygðusk, Barl. 191.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syrja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [sori], <i>dress</i>; as a nickname, Sturl. iii. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syrpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syrpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [sorp; prop. = <i>a swill for beasts;</i> Norse <i>sörpe</i>]:—<i>a dirty woman,</i> Edda ii. 629: the name of an ogress, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syrta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          syrta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [sorti], <i>to grow dark;</i> það syrtir að.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. acc. and dat. systur, pl. nom. and acc. systr, gen. systra, dat. systrum; [Goth. <i>swistar</i>; A. S. <i>swuster;</i> Engl. <i>sister;</i> O. H. G. <i>swestar;</i> Germ. <i>schwester;</i> Dan. <i>söster;</i> Swed. <i>syster;</i> Lat. <i>soror</i>]:—<i>a sister,</i> Nj. 30, Grág. i. 288, passim; s. samfeðra, sammæðra, 170; al-systir, hálf-systir, <i>a half-sister;</i> móður-systir (Dan. <i>moster</i>), <i>a mothers-sister, aunt;</i> föður-s. (Dan. <i>faster</i>), <i>a father’s-sister, aunt;</i> afa-s., ömmu-s., <i>a great aunt.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systkin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systkin
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl., sounded <strong>syskin</strong> and spelt thus, Edda i. 56, Landn. 149, Fms. vi. 398, Grág. i. 232, N. G. L. i. 151; [Dan. <i>sösken</i>]:—collect. <i>a brother and sister, brothers and sisters;</i> öll syskin sín, þau systkin, systkin sín, passim; telja frá systkinum tveim, N. G. L. i. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systkina-born"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systkina-börn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the bairns of</i> systkin, <i>first cousins,</i> Gþl. 245.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systkina-daetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systkina-dætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the daughters of</i> systkin, <i>first female cousins,</i> Gþl. 242; systkinadætra-synir, N. G. L. i. 188.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systkina-synir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systkina-synir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the sons of</i> systkin, <i>first male cousins,</i> Hkr. i. 327; systkina-sönir (<i>first cousins</i>) ok systrungar, ‘systkin-<i>sons’ and sister-sons,</i> Grág. ii. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = systrungr, <i>a ‘sisterling,’ a sister-son,</i> N. G. L. i. 76.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systra-born"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systra-börn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>sisters’ bairns,</i> i. e. <i>cousins,</i> Gþl. 245.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systra-daetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systra-dætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>daughters of two sisters.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systra-synir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systra-synir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>sisters’ sons,</i> Gþl. 242, Ísl. ii. 208, Landn. 151.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systrung"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systrung
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = systrunga; ef maðr tekr bræðrung sína eðr systrung (bræðrungu, systrungu, v. l.), N. G. L. i. 148, ii. 302; Guðrúnu systrung Oddkötlu, Sturl. 1. 132; systrung sinn(sína), K. Á. 140; hón var systrung (Cod. systrungr) hans, <i>she</i> (Rachel) <i>was the</i> systrung <i>of him</i> (James), Stj. 171; whereas James and Rachel would collectively be called systkina börn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systrunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systrunga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>one’s mother’s sister’s daughter, a female cousin,</i> Am. 52; systrungu Oddkötlu, Sturl. i. 132 C; hón var s. Úlfeiðar, 109 C; ef þær eru bræðrungur eða systrungur eða nánari, Grág. i. 346.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systrungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systrungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>one’s mother’s sister’s son, a male cousin</i> (Dan. <i>moster sön),</i> Landn. 107, 178; s. við konung, <i>the king’s cousin,</i> Gþl. 54; Johannes euangelista, systrungr hans (i. e. Jesus) at frændsemi, Barl. 49; bræðrungar ok systrungar, <i>brother’s sons and sister’s sons, first cousins on the mother’s and father’s side,</i> Grág. i. 171; munu systrungar sifjum spilla, Vsp. (or is systrungar here the plur. fem. from systrung?); systrungs barn, <i>a sister’s son’s child, a cousin’s child,</i> Gþl. 244.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systur-barn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systur-barn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a sister’s child, niece, nephew,</i> Sturl. i. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systur-dottir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systur-dóttir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a sister’s daughter,</i> Grág. i. 171, Ld. 26, Finnb. 258; systurdóttur sonr, N. G. L. i. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/systur-sonr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          systur-sonr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sister’s son,</i> Grág. i. 171, Nj. 193, Fms. vii. 269; tveir systursynir Barða, Ísl. ii. 236.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [súð], <i>to wainscot</i>; sýða loptið fyrir gaflinum, D. N. i. 506.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>wainscotting;</i> nýjar syllar, sperror, ok nýja sýðing, þekja með spón ok bræða, D. N. iii. 409.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "also spelt <strong>sýgja,</strong> u, f. <i>the suture</i> of a ship (súð is <i>the board,</i> sýja <i>the single suture,</i> a súð therefore contains so and so many sýjur); komnar vóru níu sýjur á hvárt borð (mod. saumför), Fms. viii. 196; kjalar, stála, súða, sýgju, Edda 66; kjöl-sýja, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. seði, söði, [Ulf. <i>siujan;</i> A. S. and O. H. G. <i>siwian;</i> Engl. <i>sew;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>sye, sy</i>; Lat. <i>suere</i>]:—<i>to sew;</i> only cccurs in the part. söðr and pret. seðu, q. v.; sé þú hvé vel þeir seðu er fyrir saumförinni réðu, Skálda (Thorodd); hamri söðr, járni söðr, <i>hammer-knit, iron-knit,</i> of a coat of mail, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [Ulf. <i>siukei;</i> Dan. <i>syge</i>], <i>sickness,</i> freq. in mod. usage, esp. in compds.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sykjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýkjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð and t, [sjúkr; Ulf. <i>sjûkan</i> = ἀσθενειν], <i>to grow sick, sicken,</i> Sks. 97; sýkðisk, Fms. x. 410; sýkisk öll sú hin úhrausta kona, 656 B. 7; sýkðusk af heilsu hennar, Greg. 46; sýkjask í hugnum, Pr. 124.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sykn-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýkn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. an eccl. term, in sýkn dagr; the more correct form is <strong>sœkn,</strong> N. G. L. i. 385; [from sókn, Dan. <i>sögne-dag</i>]:—a day on which lawsuits and actions are permitted (= Lat. <i>dies fastus</i>), opp. to a holy day or Sabbath; in the phrase, sýknt eða heilagt, sýngnt (sic) eða heilagt, N. G. L. i. 349; meðan sýnkt (sic) er … þegar syngt er, 380; mod. Icel. sounded, sýnt og heilagt; á sýknum dögum, Gþl. 80; sœknum dagum, N. G. L. i. 385; nú er eigi langt til morguns ok er þá sýkn dagr, Ó. H. 118, Fms. iv. 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, or better <strong>syla,</strong> with <i>y,</i> qs. svela, [svell; Engl. <i>swell;</i> cp. Dan. <i>svulme</i>]:—<i>to swell, turn into ice,</i> of water; sýldi hvern dropa er inn kom, … sýldi um hann öll klæðin, Ísl. ii. 461, 462; allt sýldi bæði úti ok inni, Fas, ii. 144: part. <strong>sýldr,</strong> <i>stiff with ice;</i> kuflinn var sýldr allr, Grett. 117 A; skipit með öllum jöklinum, en þat var mjök sýlt, 125 A; hvar skúar Gísla liggja ok eru sýldir allir, Gísl. 115: of a wound, sýldi benjarnar (acc.), Þjal. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sylt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýlt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. (part.), [from syll = <i>a sill</i>?], <i>a sheep’s mark,</i> a piece being cut from the top of the ear; kirkja á mark, sýlt hit hægra, en heilt hit vinstra, Vm. 29, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = sjón, q. v. [Dan. <i>syn</i>], <i>a sight;</i> sýn, heyrn, Fms. i. 97; heyrn eða sýn, Grág. ii. 16; þat birtir sýn, Pr. 471; sýn er sögn ríkari, a saying, Stj. 621; kunnugr at sýn ok máli, Fb. ii. 58; sýn, at sjá it rétta, 623. 26, Gþl. 58; er mér þat at sýn orðit er ek hefi opt heyrt frá sagt, <i>I have seen it with my eyes,</i> Ó. H. 57; í sýn við bæinn, <i>within sight of the farm,</i> Fms. ix. 510; koma í sýn við menn, Rb. 388; ganga í sýn við e-n, Fms. x. 329; lét hann leiða í sýn við þá tvær dætr sínar, 105; svá at feli sýn (acc.), Vm. 88; sól hvarf at sýn, Ó. H. 218; sólar-gangr vex at sýn, <i>visibly,</i> Rb. 92: tungl er þá ekki at sýn, <i>not visible,</i> 452; hvarf hann frá henni at sýn, Bs. i. 184; var þeim at sýn þar vel fagnat, <i>apparently,</i> Hkr. i. 73; hann druknaði á firðinum, ok gékk þar inn í fjallit at sýn, <i>apparently,</i> Landn. 159, v. l.; <i>an appearance,</i> bregða á sik mannligri sýn, Fms. x. 301; forkunnar sýn, Fsm.: <i>a vision;</i> bar fyrir hann í svefni mikla sýn, Fms. i. 137. <strong>2. sýnum,</strong> adverbially, <i>by sight, apparently;</i> fríð sýnum, Nj. 2; hann var fríðr sýnum, Eg. 22; hinn likligsti sýnum, Hkr. i. 262.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to shew;</i> hón bað hann sýna sér sverðit, Gullþ. 14; á þinginu sýndu menn vápn sín, Fms. iv. 326; þú skalt enga fáleika á þér sýna, Nj. 14; sýna sik glaðan, Barl. 16; hann sýndi mun ek sýna yðr (dat.) í fata-búr Þorfinns, Grett. 98 A, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synd-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýnd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = sýn, in á-sýnd, <i>a countenance;</i> til-sýndar, adverb, <i>to see from afar off;</i> á-sýndar, adverb, <i>to see</i> (as in the phrase <i>‘fair to see’</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syndr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>with eyesight</i> so and so; gamall ok sýndr lítt, Eg. 710; lítt s., Hkr. iii. 127; hinn mikli maðr er svá lítt var sýndr, Nj. 34 (where ironic.); ú-sýndir hvelpar, <i>a litter of blind whelps:</i> of weather, <i>clear</i>, í björtu ok vel sýndu veðri, Konr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the sight;</i> in the adverb. phrase, til sýnis, <i>for the sight’s sake;</i> var hann sendr konungi til sýnis. <i>for the sake of curiosity,</i> Fms. vi. 362; til sýnis vaxtar hans, <i>as a sample of his sight,</i> Fas. i. 331; víð-sýni, <i>a ‘far-sight,’ a wide horizon;</i> mis-sýni, <i>eye-deception;</i> glám-sýni, <i>glamour-sight.</i> <strong>sýnis-horn,</strong> n. <i>a sample, specimen.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syni-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýni-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>visibly,</i> Fms. x. 332, 374 (<i>publicly</i>); ú-sýniliga, <i>invisibly</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syni-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýni-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>visible,</i> Fms. i. 139, Blas. 44; ú-sýniligr, <i>invisible.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a shewing,</i> 655 xxvi. 3; s. ok skýring, Stj. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/synn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>visible;</i> þótt ek sjá sýnar váfur, Grett. 112 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sypinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýpinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. a corrupt vulgar pronunciation for sýtinn (q. v.), used esp. of a niggardly person; hann er sýpinn: as also <strong>sýpa,</strong> t; sýpa í e-ð (qs. sýta), <i>to grudge an outlay,</i> of a miser, cp. Hm. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dish</i>, kind unknown; sýr var kallaðr réttr á Grænalandi er konur görðu ór kálfa-görnum, Fbr. 108, v. l. (A word of doubtful genuineness, and wanting in the vellums of that Saga.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. sýr, acc. sú, pl. sýr (declined as kýr, q. v.); [A. S. <i>sú;</i> Engl. <i>sow;</i> Dan. <i>so;</i> Germ. <i>san;</i> Gr. ύς; Lat. <i>sūs</i>]:—<i>a sow</i>; sýr ok grísir með, Grág. i. 504; sú (acc.) ræða, 427; súr eru augu sýr (gen.), Skálda (Thorodd); the word is obsolete in prose.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syr-daelir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýr-dælir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men of</i> <strong>Súrna-dalr,</strong> a county in Norway, Gísl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [súrr; Germ. <i>saüre</i>], <i>sour whey,</i> stored up and used for drink instead of small beer, Nj. 199, Gísl. 58; sýru-ker, Eg. 701, Bs. i. 120, Sturl. iii. 192, Gísl. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syrland"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýrland
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>Syria,</i> Stj. passim: <strong>Sýr-lendingr,</strong> <i>a Syrian,</i> 656 B. 10: <strong>Sýr-lenzkr</strong> (<strong>Sýr-neskr,</strong> 655 xiv. B. 2), adj. <i>Syriac,</i> Al. 77, Stj. 641.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sys-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýs-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>busily, smartly, speedily;</i> rís upp þú s., <i>rise up thou briskly!</i> 656 C. 11; högg enn mennina s., Fms. xi. 152; hann sá merki konungs fara s., viii. 86; slátra s., Am. 20; sveinn s. sveif til skógar, <i>went quickly to the wood,</i> Hým. 18; ganga s., <i>to walk briskly,</i> Fas. i. 433 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sysa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, a defect. verb, of which only the pret. and the past part. remain; [this is the root word from which sýsla (q.v,) is a derivative, cp. also sús and sús-breki]:—<i>to be busy with a thing, give effect to it;</i> either with dat. (s. e-u), or s. at e-u; or used absolutely, <i>to be busy;</i> hón sýsti um þörf gesta. Am. 6; sýsti hann svá mikit at á lítilli stundu, Barl. 177; at vér fáim ekki at sýst, Fms. v. 155; ér sýstuð suðr, <i>ye went busily, hastened, southwards,</i> vi. (in a verse); ef Magnúss konungr yrði víss hvat sýst væri, 13; þá er því var sýst, Hom. 117; þá er hann hefir sýst eyrendum sínum, <i>when he had done his errand,</i> Fms. ix. 345, v. l.; því er sýst, <i>that is done,</i> Geisli 12; þeim er þar sýst saman, <i>there they are busied together,</i> Hornklofi (Fagrsk. rather to be taken as a part. than as a fem. subst., see, however, Lex. Poët. s. v. sýst); fara brottu með svá sýstu eyrendi, Stj.; hvat hann hefir at sýst á þeirri stundu, Rd. 304; hvat þeir höfðu at sýst meðan, Fms. xi. 41; þeir sýstu þat eitt, at þeir sættusk á víg Snorra, Sturl. 186 C; höggva ísinn, ok var þat sýst á tveim dögum, Fms. ix. 400; Eysteinn konungr hafði mart sýst í landinu þat er nytsemd var á, vii. 100; bauð ok sagði, ok var þegar sýst allt á einu auga-bragði, Barl. 22; ef hann mætti nökkum þann mann fá sýst honum (<i>if he could get him a man</i>) er þessa mætti honum bætr ráða, 16; ef hón hefir eigi þann riddara nú sýstan, MS. 4. 30; var svá til sýst, at …, Fms. vi. 38; ef þetta sýstisk fremr en aðrir höfðu sýst, x. 7, v. l.; þá hefir þú vel sýst, <i>well done,</i> ix. 366; þeir gátu alls engi at sýst, <i>could procure none,</i> Str. 12; var svá til sýst (<i>it was so arranged that …</i>) at Sighvatr skáld hlaut …, Fms. vi. 38; ef hón gæti nokkut at sýst, Str. 13; leituðu margir við at bera hana, er alls ekki gátu at sýst, 54; sem víst er at vér fáim ekki at sýst, Fms. vi. 155, Hkr. iii. 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sysl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. <i>business,</i> = sýsla; góð sýsl var þat, Fms. vi. 333 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sysl-raekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýsl-rækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>transacting business</i>, Bs. i. 754.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sysla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýsla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [Dan. <i>sysle</i>], <i>to be busy, transact business;</i> menn skulu sýsla þat Föstudag hverr vera skal lögsögu-maðr, Grág. i. 1; Ólafr setr upp skip sitt … en er þat er sýslat, Ld. 87; er þ;tta var at sýslat, Al. 123: <i>to procure,</i> s. einn svá góðan mann, MS. 4. 27; sumir sýsla bann ok bölbænir í land várt, Anecd. 12; sýslaði biskup þeim allt lið er hann fékk, Fms. viii. 144; sýsla sínum bræðrum nökkurn kost, Mar.; sér sýslaðan ok sendan, Stj. 250; at þú mættir s. mér nokkura staðfestu, Sturl. i. 209, 210; segl ok akkeri skal til sýsla af bónda fé, Gþl. 81; sýsluðu hvárirtveggi vel í þeiri ferð, <i>made a good job of it, succeeded,</i> Fms. ix. 270.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syslu-bref"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýslu-bréf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>letters patent,</i> N. G. L. iii. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syslu-faerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýslu-færr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fit for work;</i> vel s. at flestu verki, Bs. i. 307.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syslu-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýslu-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unemployed, idle,</i> Barl. 156, Fb. i. 508.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syslu-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýslu-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>idleness, the being out of work,</i> Róm. 333, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syslu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýslu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a worker;</i> s. mikill ok starfsmaðr góðr, Eg. 203, Ld. 73: <i>a prefect, bailiff, king’s steward,</i> Gþl. 22, Eg. 67, Fms. ix. 429 (v. l.), x. 10, Nj. 126; sýslumenn konungs ok biskups, … lendir menn, sýslumenn, ármenn, Gþl. 12; sýslumaðr eða ármaðr, 6; Jamtr höfðu þá Svía-konungi skatt goldit, ok þaðan höfðu verit sýslumenn yfir landinu, Ó. H. 142, and so in mod. Icel. usage, the country being divided into sýslur, answering to the þing (q. v.) of the Commonwealth, each sýsla with its bailiff (sýslumaðr), who at the same time is the justice and the tax-gatherer or steward of the king; sýslumenn skulu þing eiga á Leiðum, Jb. 23; lögmenn ok sýslumenn, 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [sút], <i>to wail</i>; veit ek at vætki of sýtig, hvar aldri skal slíta, Hallfred; þeir sýttu hann sem dauðan, Bs. i. 743; Elena sýtti alla æfi dauða hans, Bret. 77: absol., Skálda 211; sýta ok klökva, Hom. 193; þér munuð sýta og gráta en heimrinn mun fagna, John xvi. 20: <i>to pine for,</i> with acc., er þat (acc.) íllt at sýta er maðr fær eigi. Fas. i. 174; sýtir æ glöggr við gjöfum, a saying, Hm. 47; sýtir eigi drengr við dauða, a saying, … er-at sýtandi dauði, Km.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= sútligr, <i>sad</i>, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/syting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>wailing;</i> grátr ok s., Fms. x. 290; stynr ok s., Stj. 51; uggr ok sœting (sic), Mar.; sýtingar tími, <i>a time of mourning,</i> 238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sytinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sýtinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Norse <i>syten</i>], <i>peevish,</i> Lat. <i>morosus.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sae-konungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæ-konungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a sea-king;</i> vóru margir sækonungar þeir er réðu liði miklu ok áttu engi lönd, þótti sá einn með fullu heita mega sækonungr, er hann svaf aldri undir sótkum rapti ok drakk aldri at arinshorni, Yngl. S. ch. 34, cp. Caesar Bell. Gall. i. 36; sækonungur, opp. to herkonungar, Fb. i. 25, ll. 6, 7; Auði ok Buðli vóru sækonungar ok fóru báðir með her sinn, id.; Haki ok Hagbarðr hétu bræðr tveir, þeir vóru sækonungar (sjá-konungar Ed.) ok höfðu lið mikit, Yngl. S. ch. 25; Gorr hafði Eyjarnar ok var hann því kalladr sækonungr, Orkn. 8; Sváfu barn ok sækonungs, Hdl.; hvernig skal sæ kenna? Kalla sækonunga leið ok braut, Edda 66; hvernig skal kenna skip?—Svá at kalla hest eða dýr eða skið sækonunga, 90. For a list of the names of mythical sea-kings see Edda (Gl.), ending thus,—sékk-at ek fleiri sækonunga, 111. The word is poetical, and refers only to the ancient age of the Vikings in the 8th and 9th centuries, see konungr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [sáð], <i>seed</i>; sálds sæði niðr fært, D. I. i. 476; sá sínu sæði, Barl. 18; rótfesta sæði sitt í hjarta sínu, 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saedingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæðingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Norse <i>sæing</i>], <i>the common gull</i> or <i>sea-mew, larus canus</i> L., Edda (Gl.), Ó. T. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>sœfa</strong>), ð, [akin to svefn, svæfa; cp. Lat. <i>sopire</i>], prop. <i>to put to sleep,</i> but distinguished from svæfa, and only used <i>to kill, slaughter</i> beasts; vök sú er menn sæfa hvali í, Jb. 331 B; skal gefa af inn fimta hlut af öllu fé nema maðr sœfi, K. Þ. K.; blóðit flóar svá sem lifandis maðr hefði sœfðr verit, Mar.; hann sæfði girndar-synd, Greg. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saefari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæfari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the slaughterer, sacrificing priest,</i> Stj. 430.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saefing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæfing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the sacrifice,</i> Stj. 377.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. sœgr), m. [cp. A. S. <i>gar-secg</i> = <i>the ocean</i>], <i>sleet, wet, rain;</i>þat var allt á einni stundu er sœgr enn mesti var, ok þat at þurrt var ok heið ok sólskin, Bs. i. 339: sægjum, adv. <i>pouring;</i> þó sjór um þik sægjum drífi, Fas. ii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saei"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [through the Fr. <i>soie</i>, Ital. <i>saia</i>, from Lat. <i>sericum;</i> as are also A. S. <i>seolc</i>, Engl. <i>silk</i>], <i>silk</i>, Rétt., N. G. L. iii. 122, 125, D. N., B. K., Vm.; sæi-kápa, 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. sæingar, these being the old forms; the later and mod. contr. form <strong>sæng,</strong> gen. sængr, pl. sængr, which is used in vellums of the 14th century; [Dan. <i>sæng;</i> Swed. <i>säng</i>]:—<i>a bed</i>; sakna ek í sessi ok í sæingu mins málvinar, Gkv. i. 20; sæing fóru síðan sína þau Högni, Am. 10; sofnuð var Guðrún í sæingu, Skv. 3. 24; ganga í sama sæing konu, Grág. i. 175, 311, 329, Glúm. 374(sæng Ed.); hann lagði hana í sæng hjá sér, Fms. i. 4; kona liggr í sænginni, … í sængina, Fb., i. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeki-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæki-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in ú-sækiligr, <i>impregnable,</i> Str. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
