        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>honourably, becomingly,</i> Ld. 62, Nj. 281, Fms. ix. 315, 418; vel ok s., Bs. i. 129; kaleikr s. görr, <i>handsomely,</i> Vm. 31; sæmiligar haldinn, <i>in more honour,</i> Fms. vii. 299; sem sæmiligast, i. 147.",
            }
          }
