          className="link"
          href="/word/saengar-for"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sængar-för
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>sængr-för</strong>), f. id., H. E. i. 492; kona hans var þá önduð af sængrför, Vígl. 53 new Ed. (vellum of the 14th century).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saengar-klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sængar-klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. id., Jm. 24; sængr-klæði, Karl. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saengr-fot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sængr-föt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>bed-clothes,</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saengr-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sængr-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a woman in childbed,</i> Fb. i. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saengr-stokkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sængr-stokkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a bed-side,</i> Grett. 107 A (vellum of the 15th century); but sængar-stokkr, Bs. ii. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saenskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sænskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>Sœnskr</strong>), adj. <i>Swedish,</i> passim in old writers; the full form <strong>Svænskr</strong> is much rarer.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>sæ,</strong> <strong>sætt,</strong> adj. [sjá], <i>seen,</i> in the compds, auð-sær, ein-sær, <i>clear, evident.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saer-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., there are three forms, sær, sjór, sjár (cp. snær, slær, etc.); in old writers sær is commonest, sjór in mod., sjár is the most rare: the <i>v</i> (also written <i>f</i>) appears in gen. sævar, sjóvar, sjávar; dat. sævi, sjóvi, sjávi; acc. sæ, sjó, sjá; the dat. sing. was then shortened into sæ, sjó, sjá, which forms prevail in prose: in mod. usage the <i>v</i> has also been dropped between two vowels, sjóar for sjóvar, pl. sjóir for sjóvir, dat. sjóum: a gen. sjós is only used in special phrases, and is borrowed from the Danish: [Ulf. <i>saiws</i> and <i>mari-saiws</i> = λίμνη, Luke v. 12; A. S. <i>sæ;</i> Engl. <i>sea</i>; O. H. G. <i>seô</i>; Germ. <i>see</i>; Dan. <i>sö</i>; Swed. <i>sjö</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          særa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð, [sár; Dan. <i>saare</i>], <i>to wound,</i> Grág. i. 92, 442, ii. 11, Nj. 18, passim; særa e-n sári, <i>to inflict a wound,</i> Grág. ii. 35; særa e-n holundar-sári, Nj.; hana skyldi s. til barnsins, of hysterotomy, Fas. i. 118.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          særi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> (i. e. <strong>sœri</strong>), n. pl. <i>oaths, swearing;</i> heit ok særi, Fms. i. 205; vinna s., vi. 94; at kaupi þeirra vóru sterk vitni ok mörg særi, Edda 26; goðinn sór sœrin, Skálda 162; færa fram sværi (sic), N. G. L. i. 4; eiðar, orð ok sœri, Vsp. 30; heilug sœri, Bret. 40; var þat sœrum bundit, 82; hygg þú heldr á þinn eið | og óbrigðanleg særi, a hymn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saering"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          særing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a wounding,</i> Stj. 46, 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          særr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>sœrr</strong>), adj. <i>to be taken,</i> of an oath; hann sór þeim eið, ok sagði þó at eigi mundi vel særr vera, <i>it was not quite a fair oath,</i> Fms. ix. 344; ú-sœrr eiðr, Sks. 80 new Ed., N. G. L. i. 17: the saying, lítið er í eiði ú-sært, see eiðr; heið-særr:—so in the mod. phrase, mér er sá eiðr sær, <i>I will swear to it that it is so</i>:—<i>of the time when an oath can be taken,</i> sœrr dagr, Gþl. 379, K. Á. 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saet-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæt-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>sweetness,</i> Stj. 60, 310, Sks. 107, Magn. 486, Fms. x. 288, Eluc. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saet-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæt-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>sweetly,</i> Stj. 1, 70, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saet-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæt-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sweet</i>, 655 v. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. a kind of <i>bondwoman;</i> tvær eru hans enar beztu ambáttir, sæta ok deigja, N. G. L. i. 70, 234; sæta heitir sú kona, er búandi hennar er af landi farinn, Edda 108.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [sitja, sat, sátu], <i>to sit in ambush for, waylay;</i> with dat., var þeim sætt við sætr nokkur, vóru þar drepnir sumir, Fms. viii. 380; at þér sætið þeim á Eiða-skógi, Eg. 576; hann ætlar at s. yðr (<i>waylay you</i>) þá er þér farit sunnan, 261; s. honum ef hann færi austan, Orkn. 406; hann sætti þar skipum ok rænti, Hkr. iii. 336; sæta því er Áki færi aptr, … ok taka hann af lífi, Fms. xi. 46; þessu sætir Sturlaugr ok höggr, Fas. iii. 331; s. áverkum við e-n, Orkn. 408, Fbr. 29; s. uppgöngum við Birkibeina, Fms. viii. 73; s. fláráðum við e-n, Boll. 348; s. leyni-brögðum, Fms. v. 257.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. <i>a seat;</i> sitja í því sæti, Edda 12; vísa e-m til sætis, Eg. 29; halda máttu þessu sæti, Nj. 6; leiða e-n til sætis, Fms. vii. 315, ix. 250; þat sæti (i. e. the throne) ætlaði sér hverr sona hans, i. 7; hof þat er sæti þeirra standa í, Edda; há-sæti, <i>a high seat:</i> eccl. a <i>see, chair,</i> postulligt, pávaligt s., H. E. i. 503, Dipl. v. 4; sam-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saeti-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sæti-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in ú-sætiligr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>sweetmeats.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetis-pallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætis-pallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a seat-bench,</i> N. G. L. ii. (Hirðskrá).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetis-stoll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætis-stóll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a chair of state,</i> Stj. 550.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>mountain pastures,</i> see setr B (p. 525).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>sœtr</strong>), adj., compar. sætri, Hom. 4; but sætari, Bs. i. 277, l. 25; superl. sætastr: [Ulf. <i>suts;</i> A. S. <i>swête;</i> Engl. <i>sweet;</i> O. H. G. <i>suozi;</i> Germ. <i>süss;</i> Dan. <i>söd;</i> Swed. <i>söt;</i> Gr. ἡδύς]:—<i>sweet;</i> sætt epli, MS. 4. 9; sætan ilm, Fms. i. 228; sætt vatn, Stat. 251: metaph., sætt mál, Fms. v. 239; svíða sætar ástir, Flóv. 41; sætar syndir verða at sárum bótum, Sól.; þótti mér slökt et sætasta ljós augna minna, Nj. 187; sætr svefn, <i>a sweet sleep;</i> the phrase, sofa sætan, <i>to sleep sweetly;</i> engan máttu þeir sætan sofa, Sól. 13; ok biðja sætan sofa, Sdm. 34 (Bugge’s emend, for sælan of the MS.), cp. the Germ. <i>schlafen sie wohl!</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetr-bud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætr-búð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a dairy-shed</i> (Germ. <i>senn-hütte),</i> N. G. L. ii. 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetr-gata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætr-gata
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a road to huts,</i> N. G. L. ii. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetra-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætra-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>removal into a shed,</i> Gþl. 404.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. [sitja], <i>what one can sit under, endurable;</i> stóð hann upp ok mælti, setið er nú meðan sætt er, <i>we have sat as long as we could bear,</i> Eb. 280, Bs. ii. 224; víst líkar mér ílla, ok er eigi um slíkt sætt, <i>it is not to be endured,</i> Bjarn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saett-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>Sidon</i> in Palestine, Fms. vii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saett-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [as to the etymology sátt or sætt is the same word as A. S. <i>saht</i> = <i>peace;</i> cp. Lat. <i>sancio</i>; it must not be confounded with Germ. <i>sachte,</i> whence Dan. <i>sagte,</i> a Low Germ. form answering to Engl. <i>soft</i>]:—<i>a reconciliation, an agreement;</i> for the references see sátt: also for compds in <strong>sættar-</strong> see sátt B (p. 518, col. 1).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sætta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [sátt], <i>to reconcile, make peace among;</i> s. mennina, sætta þá, Nj. 149, Landn. 105, Fms. i. 36, 48, vi. 337, x. 266, passim; sætta e-n við e-n, <i>to reconcile to another,</i> Eg. 226.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saettir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sættir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a peace-maker, reconciler;</i> engi var hann s. manna (manna sættir C), Sturl. ii. 39; er Týr ekki kallaðr s. manna, Edda 17; garðr er granna sættir, a law saying, N. G. L. i. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/saevar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sævar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see sær.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soeni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sœni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [són], in hapt-sœni, <i>the reconciliation of the gods,</i> Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soering"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sœring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an exorcism,</i> H. E. ii. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to saddle,</i> Nj. 20, Eg. 396; hestr söðlaðr, Ísl. ii. 333, Hkr. ii. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodla-bur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðla-búr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a saddle-room,</i> Sturl. ii. 250.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodlari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðlari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a saddler,</i> N. G. L. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodul-bakadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðul-bakaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘saddle-backed,’ hollow-backed,</i> of a horse, when the back sinks in instead of being straight.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodul-bogi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðul-bogi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the saddle-bow,</i> Sks. 406.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodul-fjol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðul-fjöl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the saddle-board,</i> the side board of an Icel, lady’s saddle, which is made like a chair, Sturl. iii. 295, Nj. 205.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodul-gjord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðul-gjörð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a saddle-girth,</i> Lv. 92, Mag. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodul-hringja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
