        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. the name of some verses, Grett.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. söðli, [A. S. <i>sadol, sadel;</i> Engl. <i>saddle</i>; Germ. <i>sattel;</i> Dan. <i>saddel;</i> this word cannot belong to the vernacular Teut., but is borrowed from Lat. <i>sedile,</i> as appears from the unchanged medial <i>d</i>, for sitja would require an Engl.-Icel. <i>t</i>, Germ. <i>z</i> (sötull, <i>satzel</i>)]:—<i>a saddle;</i> the word occurs in such old poems as the Vkv. 7, Akv. 4, Og. 3; leggja söðul á hest, Eg. 719; bera söðla í haga, Nj. 33; saðul, Sks. 403; steindr söðull, <i>a stained saddle,</i> Ld. 272; trog-söðull, q. v.; stand-s., q. v.: in mod. usage söðull is a lady’s saddle or pillion (formed like an arm-chair), hnakkr a man’s saddle.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sofn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söfn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = svefn, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sog-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. sagar, pl. sagar, [saga; A. S. <i>saga</i>; Engl. saw; Dan. <i>sav</i>]:—<i>a saw</i>, passim in mod. usage. <strong>saga-tenn,</strong> f. pl. <i>saw-teeth.</i> Stj. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sog-visi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sög-vísi
