        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>tattling,</i> Sks. 25 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [saggi], <i>dank, wet.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in sann-sögli, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. sagnir, [Dan. <i>sagn;</i> see segja and saga], <i>a saw, tale, report;</i> at sögn Ara prests ins fróða, Fms. i. 55; brá flestum sú sögn (<i>news</i>) í brún, vi. 226; nauðga e-m til sagna, <i>to force one to confess,</i> by tortures, Fbr. 46; pína til sagna, id., Fms. vi. 14: gramm., Skálda 174, 178, 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in compds, see saga.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-bok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-bók
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a saga-book, volume of sagas, Vm. 117; sögubók forn, ok á margar sögur, Ám. 42; Sturla lagði mikinn huga á at láta rita sögubækr, Sturl. ii. 123; þessar sögubækr, Maríu saga, Ólafanna sögur, Karlamagnús saga, Dipl. v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-brot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-brot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a fragment.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-efni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-efni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. materials for a saga; ritum vér þar ekki fleira af, eru þar mikil söguefni, Sturl. iii. 291.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. worth telling, important, Ísl. ii. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-ljod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-ljóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. epic lays, Hkr. (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a saga-man, Hom. 88: the hero of a tale, Magn. 448: one’s authority for a report, til-greina sinn sögumann.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-meistari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-meistari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a saga-master, Fær., Bs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-sogn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-sögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a tradition. Fms. viii. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogu-thattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögu-þáttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. an episode, Fas. i. 313.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sogull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sögull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [segja], in sann-sögull, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sök
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. sakar, dat. sök, and older saku, which occurs on Runic stones; pl. sakar, later sakir; a gen. sing. söku or saku (from saka, u, f.) remains in the compds söku-dólgr, söku-nautr: [Ulf. <i>sakjo</i> = μάχη; A. S. <i>sacu;</i> Engl. <i>sake;</i> Germ. <i>sache;</i> Dan. <i>sag;</i> Swed. <i>sak</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sok-tal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sök-tal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = saktal (q. v.), N. G. L. i. 187, Fb. i. 562.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sok-vorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sök-vörn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = sakvörn (q. v.), Nj. 232.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sokk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sökk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>a sinking;</i> láta skip liggja fimm nætr í sökk (<i>in a sinking state</i>) þá, skulu þeir upp ausa, N. G. L. i. 102.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sokkva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sökkva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð and t, a causal to the preceding, [Ulf. <i>saggqian;</i> Dan. <i>sænke</i>]:—<i>to make to sink, sink</i>, with dat., Fms. vi. 286, Blas. 48; ok sökðu þar niðr kistunni, Ó. H. 226; brutu á raufar ok söktu niðr, Eg. 125, (cp. Dan. <i>bore i sænk</i>); bar ek á sæ út ok sökða með grjóti, 656 B. 1; sökkva í fötu (dat.), <i>to sink a pail into the well</i> or <i>brook,</i> for fetching water; gékk Gunnlaugr til lækjar ok sökti í hjálminum, Ísl. ii. 269, v. l.; Egill tók hjálminn ok sökkvir (sökkr Ed.) niðr í kjölinn, ok drakk þrjá drykki mikla, Fms. xi. 233.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sokkva-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sökkva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. sökk; pret. sökk, sökkt (sökkst), sökk; plur. sukku; subj. sykki; imperat. sökk, sökktu; part. sokkinn: [Ulf. <i>siggqan</i> = βυθίζεσθαι, δύσειν; A. S. <i>sincan;</i> Engl. <i>sink;</i> Germ. <i>sinken;</i> Dan. <i>synke</i>]:—<i>to sink;</i> hann sökk niðr, <i>sank down,</i> Landn. 44, v. l.; sökk niðr hestr hans, Fms. ii. 202; sökk hón niðr með öllum farminum, Nj. 19; exin sökkr, Fær. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sokkva-bekkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sökkva-bekkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘sink-bench,’ deep seat,</i> the mythol. seat of Freyja, Gm., Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sokott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sökótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj., in the phrase, eiga sökótt, <i>to have many enemies,</i> Lv. 36, Eb. 54, Korm. 150, Fms. vi. 112; þykki mér vera mega, at sökótt verði nú í dag, v. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soku-dolgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söku-dólgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an enemy lying under penalty;</i> biskup segir öllum sökudólgum sínum, at …, Bs. i. 771 (of a person under ban); sá maðr er Ingólfr heitir, hann er sakadólgr (sic) minn, Fs. 63; sökudólgar (<i>the murderers</i>) hygg ek síðla muni kallaðir frá kvölum, Sól. 24; mun þat ekki upp tekit af sökudólgum mínum, Nj. 257.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/soku-nautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söku-nautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = sökudólgr; s. várr (= Lat. <i>reus</i>) býðr okkr Guðmund til görðar, Ölk. 35; svá sem vér fyrir-gefum várum sökunautum, Hom. 158 (Lord’s Prayer); skal hann bjóða skapdróttni hans til með váttum ok bjóða eigi sökunautum hans, N. G. L. i. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/sol-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          söl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl., gen. pl. sölva; an eatable sea-plant, perh. <i>the samphire;</i> ber ok söl eigu menn at eta sem vilja at úsekju í annars landi, Grág. ii. 347; hvat er nú, dóttir, tyggr þú nökkut …? Tygg ek söl, segir hón … slíkt görir at er sölin etr, þyrstir æ því meirr, Eg. 604, 605; freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be begrimed.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>salu, salwig;</i> O. H. G. <i>salo</i>; Engl. <i>sallow</i>], <i>yellow,</i> of linen or the like: a pr. name, <strong>Söl-mundr,</strong> Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to rob;</i> s. e-ð undir sig, <i>to get by covetousness and avarice.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a seller, also a purchaser; sölumann þann er ek hefi jörð selda, N. G. L. i. 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solu-vad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölu-váð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a piece of common stuff or cloth, for wadmal was the standard of payment; hann kastaði yfir sik söluváð, Sturl. iii. 112; söluváðar-bræðr, -kufl, -kyrtill, Finnb. 216, Grett. 148, Nj. 32; unless the word in this usage be derived from A. S. salow, Engl. sallow (?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solu-virdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölu-virðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. valued, H. E. ii. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/solva-fjara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          sölva-fjara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>right of picking samphire;</i> kirkja á sölvafjöru til búnautnar öllum heima-mönnum, Vm. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
