        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a shedding tears,</i> Eluc. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tarask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tárask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. <i>to shed tears, weep,</i> Fær. 104, Fms. ii. 108, Barl. 10, Stj. 214, Bs. i. 876.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tarugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tárugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>tearful,</i> <strong>tárug-hlýra,</strong> adj. <i>with tearful cheeks,</i> Gh. 9, (A. S. <i>teârig-hleôr.</i>)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tata"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          táta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Engl. <i>teat</i>], <i>a teat,</i> esp. <i>a sugar-teat</i> for babies; skinn-táta, <i>a skin-teat.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tedja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "teð, taddi, tatt, [tað], <i>to dung, manure;</i> akra töddu, Rm. 12; t. vel garða, Am. 59; of land verðr þá verr tatt, Grág. ii. 341; jammikinn akr sem hann taddi með myki hans, … hvar er taddan hefir, N. G. L. ii. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tefill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tefill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a hinderer;</i> orða-tefill, Fas. i. 533, Gsp. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tefja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tefja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tef, tafði, tafit, [töf], <i>to hinder, delay;</i> tefja fyrir e-m, hann tafði fyrir oss hvíldina, Fms. ii. 140, Fær. 149, (Sturl. iii. 56 read kafði for tafði): freq. in mod. usage, tefðu mig ekki, <i>do not interrupt, disturb me,</i> of a person when busy and wanting to be let alone.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tefla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tefla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [tafl], <i>to play at tables</i> or <i>draughts;</i> tefldu í túni teitir vóru, Vsp., Hkr. iii. 320; menn skolu ok eigi t. svá at þeir leggi fé við, Grág. ii. 198; konungr sat ok teflði hnettafl, Fms. vi. 29; sumir tefldu skáktafl eða hnettafl eða kvátru, Konr.; tveir menn vóru á heystáli ok tefldu, brann þar ljós, Ísl. ii. 69; t. kvátru, Sturl. ii. 184; þá skildi á um tafl, vildi Sámr bera aptr riddara er hann hafði telft í uppnám, iii. 123: metaph. in the phrase, t. e-n upp, <i>to take one up, beat in a game of draughts;</i> þann veg máttú mér mest upp tefla, Ld. 42; hann hefir ykkr upp teflt um fjárreiður, Bjarn. 40; ekr hart at mönnum ok eru margir þá upp tefldir, Ísl. ii. 132; en sá er tefldr verðr til eyris, gjaldi konungi tólf aura, ok svá sá er af honum teflir, Js. 128.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tefli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tefli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in jafn-tefli, <i>a drawn game.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tefling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tefling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a playing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teflingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teflingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [tefla II], <i>a weaving of checks;</i> altaris klæði meðr tefling, Ám. 89, Pm. 7, 78; teflings hægendi, <i>a cushion, case of</i> t.; teflings-ver, Vm. 109, Dipl. v. 18; sex sængr, hægindi, góðr teflingr um, D. N. i. 590, (= the mod. kniplingr.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tegla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tegla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, see telgja.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tegund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tegund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., see tigund.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teig-skogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teig-skógr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a measured strip of wood-land;</i> teigskógr ok torf-skurðr í Topta-dal, Vm. 97: poët., sval-teigr, <i>the cold strip,</i> i. e. <i>the sea;</i> svan-teigr, <i>the swan-field,</i> i. e. <i>the sea,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teig-yrki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teig-yrki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a field-labourer,</i> Róm. 290.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teiga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teiga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to take a long draught in drinking;</i> teiga mjólk.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. teigar, Landn. 241; later teigs; acc. pl. teigu, Grág. ii. 227:—<i>a strip</i> of field or meadow-land, <i>a close</i> or <i>paddock;</i> á teigum úti, Best. 47; eng þat er þú kallar Græna-teig … selja mun ek þér teiginn, Fms. vi. 103; teigr lá ónuminn … þann lögðu þeir til hofs ok heitir sá nú Hofs-teigr, Landn. 241; þeir sá at Þórir reið út um teig fyrir vestan fjörð, Gullþ. 13; mæli hann sér jammikinn teig, Gþl. 355; slá teig þann er heitir Gull-teigr, Ísl. ii. 344; mundi sleginn verða Gull-teigr þann inn sama dag, ganga til teigs, gékk Gísli um teiginn ok sá á er þeir ætluðu at slá, … sem þeir væri staddir á Gullteig, 354, 355; sagði hann at jörðin ætti hálfs-mánaðar-teig í Auðbrekku- jörð, ok annan hálfs-mánaðar-teig á Möðruvalla-staðar-nesjum, Dipl. v. 28; skal landeigandi gjalda teigs-verð inn fimta dag viku er sjau vikur eru af sumri, Grág. ii. 228; harðslægr var Hrísa-teigr í dag, sveinar, Glúm.; beitu-t., úværu-t.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teikn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teikn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [see tákn], <i>a token;</i> ek gef þér þetta teikn, Bret. 108, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teikna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teikna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [see tákna], <i>to mark, denote;</i> teikna ok fyrir-benda, Stj. 87; teiknar ok merkir, 110; hvat mun þetta hafa at teikna, Þorf. Karl. 422.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teiknan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teiknan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a beckoning,</i> Sks. 70, 294.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tein-lautar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tein-lautar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in Vellekla, see hlaut; cp. also A. S. <i>tân-hlyta</i> or <i>tân-hlytare</i> = <i>a soothsayer.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tein-vondr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tein-vöndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wand,</i> Karl. 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tein-aeringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tein-æringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>teina-hringr,</strong> m. [tíu and ár; mod. Norse <i>tendring</i>]:—<i>a ten-oared boat,</i> Eb. 234, Fbr. 180, Orkn. 242, Vígl. 63 new Ed., Vm. 109, Gullþ. 69, Grett. 18, 175 new Ed.; cp. átt-æringr, sex-æringr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tein-aerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tein-ærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ten-oared,</i> Ld. 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teindr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teindr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>beaten into bars;</i> teint járn, Grág. (Sb.) i. 504, (Kb.) i. 250, 251.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teiningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teiningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the horn-beam</i> or <i>maple, carpinus</i> or <i>acer,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>tains</i> = κλημα; Dan. <i>teen,</i> cp. Engl. <i>tiny;</i> A. S. <i>tân;</i> Engl. <i>‘toe’</i>, in <i>mistle-toe</i>]:—<i>a twig, sprout,</i> of a living tree; sem mjór teinn, Stj.; hugða ek hér í túni teina fallna, þá er ek viklig vaxna láta, rifnir með rótum, Gkv. 2. 39; hón þóttisk vera stödd í grasgarði sínum, ok taka þorn einn, óx hann svá, at þat varð teinn einn mikill, Hkr. i. 71; mistil-t., <i>the mistletoe;</i> gamban-t., <i>a divining-wand:</i> of <i>twigs</i> for soothsaying, see hlaut; hrista teina, Hým. 1; hlaut-teinn, val-teinn, <i>the chip chosen for soothsaying.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teinungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teinungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a twig, sprout;</i> viðar-t., Edda 37; vínviðis-t., Stj. 200 (cp. Goth. <i>weina-tains</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teinur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teinur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. [cp. Ulf. <i>tainjo</i> = κόφινος], <i>a basket, creel,</i> used for fishing; eigi eigu menn at leggja net um þvera á né göra teinor í eða góra garða eða ker, nema einn maðr eigi alla ána, Grág. ii. 350. <strong>teina-stæði,</strong> n. <i>a place where creels are put</i> (in a river), D. N. i. 889.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teista"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teista
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., and <strong>teisti-kofa</strong> = þeista, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teistinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teistinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>peevish, fretful,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to gladden, cheer;</i> hvat er mik teitir, Gísl. (in a verse); gamm-teitandi, <i>‘vulture-cheerer,’</i> i. e. <i>a warrior.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teitan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teitan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = teiti (q. v.), Kormak; ó-teitan, <i>sadness,</i> Jd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teiti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teiti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>gladsomeness, joy, cheerfulness;</i> mæla teiti, Gh. 2; opt var í túni teiti meiri, Gkv. 1. 22; ek verð at hefja þessa teiti, Fms. vii. 119; hitt er ölsiðr meiri, at menn göri sér gaman, ok fám oss ölteiti nökkura, id.; leik ok teiti. <i>play and joy,</i> vii. (in a verse): poët., hugins teiti, <i>the raven’s cheer,</i> Geisli. <strong>teiti-mál,</strong> n. pl. <i>words of good cheer,</i> Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teitir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teitir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a gladdener, cheerer;</i> varg-t., úlf-t., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>tât;</i> mid.H. G. <i>zeiz</i> = <i>dear, beloved</i>], <i>glad, cheerful;</i> tefldu í túni teitir vóru, Vsp. 8; teitum jó, <i>a wild steed,</i> Hm. 89; vit skolum teitir, Hkv. 1. 6; ú-teitr, <i>downcast,</i> Hým.; ein-teiti, q. v.; öl-teiti, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tekja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tekja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [taka], <i>a take, taking;</i> ábúð jarðar heimilar tekju, Gþl. 329: <i>seizure, booty,</i> plur., miklar tekjur fjár, Fs. 14; hafa kostgrip af hverri tekju, Fms. i. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., qs. tekð, [taka], = taka, <i>bail;</i> njóti vátta at þat fé var í tækt (sic) fengit, N. G. L. i. 434; á-tekt, <i>a touching;</i> inn-tekt, <i>‘intake,’ income;</i> fyrir-tekt, til-tekt, upp-tekt, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/telgja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          telgja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a cutter;</i> in tré-telgja, <i>a wood-cutter.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/telgja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          telgja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [tálga], <i>to shape, hew</i> wood or stone with adze or knife: of wood, telgja tré, N. G. L. i. 64; timbr er hann telgir, iii. 15; þó at miklir spænir væri af telgdir, Bjarn. 14; sumir at fella, sumir at telgja, <i>some to fell the trees, some to hew them into shape,</i> Hkr. i. 293; síðan gékk Þorbergr til ok telgdi borðit svá at ór gengu öll skýlihöggin, 294; Arnórr telgði þá með knífi, en tálgöxin lá þar hjá honum, Rb. 313; t. lokar-spánu af tyrvi-tré, Fms. vi. 183; spánunum þeim er hann hafði telgt, Ó. H. 197: of whalebone, síðan telgði hann af rúnarnar, … á telgðu tálkni, Eg. 566, 567: of stone, Mag. 63; af telgðu grjóti, 655 xxv. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/telja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          telja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. tel, telr, tel, pl. teljum, telit, telja; pret. talði and taldi, pl. tölðu; subj. telði; imperat. tel, teldú; part. taliðr, taldr, and talinn; neut. older form talt, then talið: plur. neut. talið, Gh. 20; thus in Edda i. 401, v. l. 22, all forms occur, tolð, taulld, i. e. töld, talin, see also the references below: with pron. suff. tel-k, Stor. 22: neg. suff. telr-at, Grág. (Kb.) i. 178: [A. S. <i>tellan, telian;</i> Engl. <i>tell</i>; Dan. <i>tælle;</i> Germ. <i>zählen.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teljandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teljandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a letter, counter,</i> Grág. i. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/telpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          telpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a girl,</i> = stelpa, by lisping and dropping the <i>s</i>, Piltr og Stúlka 9, freq. so in popular usage, for stelpa sounds too harshly; litla telpan, biddu telpuna að koma.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/temja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          temja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., in ó-temja, <i>an unbroken colt.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/temja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          temja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tem, pret. tamði; subj. temði; imperat. tem, temdú; part. tamiðr, tamðr, taminn: [Ulf. <i>tamjan</i> = <i>δαμαν;</i> A. S. <i>tamjan;</i> Engl. <i>tame;</i> O. H. G. <i>zemen;</i> Germ. <i>zähmen;</i> Dan. <i>tæmme;</i> Swed. <i>támja;</i> Lat. <i>domare;</i> Gr. δαμαν]:—<i>to tame, break,</i> of a steed; vel taminn, ílla taminn; öxn nam at temja, Rm. 19; tams vendi ek þik drep, en ek þik t. mun, Skm. 26; t. sterkustu flugdreka, Sks.; Kjalarr tamði mara, Skálda (in a verse); hross ú-tamit … hrossit ú-tamda, Sd. 177; ó-tömðum, Stj. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tempra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tempra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Lat.], <i>to temper, moderate,</i> Rb. 440; t. úspaka með hirting, Gþl. (pref. xi); t. reiði sína, Al. 43; tempra dóma ok greinir milli lærdómsins ok leikmanna, Bs. i. 724; t. skaplyndi sitt, Fms, xi. 92: part. tempraðr, <i>temperate, mild,</i> Sks. 196.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tempran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tempran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a tempering,</i> Stj. 68, 91, Stat. 233; tempranar-laust, <i>intemperately,</i> Th. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/temps"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          temps
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the river Thames;</i> Tempsar bakki, -síða, -minni, <i>the bank, mouth of the T.,</i> O. H. L. (in a verse), Fms. xi. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/temsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          temsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [= tempsa?], <i>to eat slowly and reluctantly,</i> of dainty children; þú tempsar, því ertu að tempsa með matinn?",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tendra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tendra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [tendr; Dan. <i>tænde;</i> Swed. <i>tända;</i> cp. A. S. <i>tyndre;</i> Engl. <i>tinder;</i> cp. Germ. <i>zänden</i>]:—<i>to make a fire, light;</i> t. ljós, Sturl. ii. 67, Orkn. 208, v. l.; t. kerti, Hkr. i. 283, Fms. viii. 56; t. eld, i. 268; Hallfreðr sló eld ok tendraðisk eigi skjótt, ii. 82; vóru þá ljós upp tendruð, iii. 139; tendra sinn hug, Bs. i. 238; kveykt eða tendrað, Mar.; tendrask með æði, upp tendrandisk, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengda-fadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengða-faðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a father-in-law.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengda-lid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengða-lið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>relations by affinity,</i> Al. 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengda-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengða-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. = tengðalið; frændr ok tengðamenn, Fms. i. 203, Ld. 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengda-modir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengða-móðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a mother-in-law.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengda-systir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengða-systir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a sister-in-law.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengdir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>‘bonds,’ affinity;</i> as a law phrase this word displaced the old heathen sifjar, q. v.; réttr at tengðum, Grág. i. 191; fyrir tengða sakir, Nj. 177; var honum efling at tengðum við Mýra-menn, Ld. 98; binda saman lag sitt ok félagskap eptir því sem tengðir þeirra vórn til, Fms. iv. 295; hann batt við þá tengðir, Eb. 4; ná-tengðir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tenging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tenging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a joining,</i> Mork. 138 (<i>points of meeting</i>); sam-tenging, <i>conjunction.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [cp. töng], <i>to fasten, tie together;</i> hann lét t. skip sín hvert fram af stafni annars, Fms. i. 157; viðum er þeir tengðu útan við vígin, Bs. i. 392: <i>to tie ships together</i> in battle, þat var þá siðvani er menn börðusk á skipum, at tengja skyldi skipin ok berjask um stafna, Hkr. i. 85; þar sem konungarnir höfðu barizt ok tengd vóru flest skipin saman, Fms. vi. 319; tengi saman skipin, ok búi menn sik til bardaga, ii. 306; heimti skip sín saman ok sé búnir við at tengja, Ó. H. 38: saman tengja, <i>to knit together,</i> 656 B. 7; sem tengjask saman á fitfuglum, Sks. 39 new Ed.: eigi varði oss, at ér munduð þetta mál þannig tengja til vár, <i>connect us thus, mix us up with this case,</i> Fms. xi. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the ropes</i> or <i>fastenings</i> by which ships were bound together during battle, Fms. vii. 259; þeir lögðu hvern aptan skipin í tengsl, Orkn. 418; höggva tengslin á skipum sínum, Fms. i. 174; mátti; þar eigi fram komask fyrir skipum þeim er lágu í tengslum, vi. 320; þeir hjuggu tengslin frá stikunum, vii. 259.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tengslur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tengslur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. = tengls; eigi þykkjumk ek slíkar tengslur séð hafa, Grett. 119.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tenningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tenningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "later <strong>teningr,</strong> m. [Dan. <i>terning</i> is a corrupt form, for the word is no doubt from tönn = <i>a tooth, tusk,</i> the dice being made of walrus-tusk]:—<i>a die;</i> tenninginn, tenningonum, Ó. H. 90; tenningrinn, Orkn. 200; teningr, tafl ok ten[n]inga kast, Sks. 436 B; dufla eðr kasta ten[n]ingum um penninga, N. G. L. ii. 165; kasta til teningum, Sturl. ii. 159, Fb. ii. 174, (where it is spelt teningana l. 7, tenningunum l. 8, te[n]ingum l. 5.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tenntr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tenntr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>toothed,</i> Lat. <i>dentatus,</i> Al. 173, Sks. 121, Fas. iii. 341; smá-t., <i>with small teeth;</i> skögul-t., <i>with a dog-tooth;</i> hvít-t., <i>white-toothed.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tepet"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tepet
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [for. word], <i>a carpet,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teppa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teppa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [tappi], <i>to confine, enclose, shut in;</i> vildi eigi láta teppa sik þar, Rd. 303; ok teppir oss inni, Stj. 526; teppa eyrun á hesti, <i>to stop the ears,</i> Karl. 282; vera inni tepptr í váginum, Fms. xi. 63; teppa þá inni í dölunum, viii. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teppi-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teppi-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an impeder,</i> Ann. for Nord. Oldk. (1845) 168.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tepra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tepra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>dimness, faintness;</i> augna-t. <strong>tepru-legr,</strong> adj. <i>foppish.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/termin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          termin
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [for. word; Lat. <i>terminus</i>], <i>a term,</i> Stj., Rb. (a comput. term).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/terminera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          terminera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to limit</i>, Stj. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/terra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          terra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, = tarra (q. v.), <i>to stretch out,</i> Dan. <i>spile ud;</i> terra fingr, fætr; tamt er fingr að terra | þá tekr sjón að þverra, Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tertia"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tertia
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., mathem. [for. word; Lat. <i>tertia</i>], <i>a part of a second,</i> Rb,: <i>a third part,</i> 625. 177.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/testament"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          testament
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [for. word; Lat. <i>testamentum</i>], <i>a bequest, will,</i> Bs. i. 718; bequests were an innovation from the Roman law, for as Tacitus says—heredes successoresque sui cuique liberi, et ‘nullum testamentum,’ ch, 20; the ancient Northern law knows no ‘last will,’ yet cp. Eg. ch. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tetr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (see töturr), Skíða R. and in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teyda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teyða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a vile, wicked person</i> (abuse), Edda i. 532; cp. tuddi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teygi-agn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teygi-agn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bait,</i> Fær. 254.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teygi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teygi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>seductive, tempting,</i> Bs. i. 372.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teyging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teyging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an enticement, temptation,</i> Bs. i. 372, Fms. i. 304, MS. 645. 68 (spelt tægingum).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teygja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teygja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, with neg. suff., imperat. teygj-at and teygj-at-tu, <i>draw thou not,</i> Sdm., Hm. [referring to a lost strong verb, tjúga-, taug-, of which only the part. toginn remains; cp. Engl. <i>tug</i>]:—<i>to stretch out, draw;</i> teygja hálsinn, … teyg þik sem mest, Fas. iii. 488; síðan lætr hann teygja, Fs. 176; teygja sig, <i>to stretch one’s limbs;</i> or, tevgjast sundr og saman, <i>to writhe</i> like a worm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/teyma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          teyma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [taumr], <i>to lead by the rein,</i> Sól. 55; teyma hest, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/texti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          texti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [mid. Lat. <i>textus</i>], <i>an evangelistary, the four Gospels,</i> in a costly cover, silver, gold, ivory, as church property; smíða texta tvá sæmiliga ok kaleik, Bs. i. 872; textar fjórir með silfr ok einn með tönn, Dipl. iii. 4; þetta í bókum, messu-bók, texti, legendu-bók, Am. 29; texta, graduale, Vm. 117; texta-dúkr, 52; texta-silfr, D. N. ii. 16; texta spjald, 136, Ám. 55.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/te"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          té
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [tjá], in the phrase, láta e-m e-ð í té, <i>to grant a thing to one;</i>það er yðr jafnan í té, <i>it is always free to you,</i> Fas. iii. 156.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tenadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ténaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a help;</i> see tænaðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tifa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [akin to tapsa?], <i>to trip, move the feet quickly;</i> fætrnir tifuðu óðar en vant var, Od. xxiii. (begin.); tifaðisk þá þegar saman fénaðrinn, <i>the sheep hastily flocked together,</i> Stj. 458.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tiggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tiggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., poët. <i>a king;</i> see tyggi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [O. H. G. <i>zîg</i> = <i>a charge</i>], <i>a charge;</i> only in the phrases, enginn í tigi nema þú, <i>none can be charged but thou, there is no question of any but thee;</i> kalla ek þar öngan mann annan í tigi til at eiga þenna svein með mér enn yðr, konungr, Jómsv. 6 (cp. Fms. xi. 53, wrongly spelt <i>tyge</i>); er þar þó enginn í tigi til, nema þú, at vera faðir at barni því er ek geng með, Fas. ii. 235; at hón væri með barni, ok er þar engi maðr í tigi til nema ek, Fb. i. 136; spurði hverr ætti (sveininn) með henni,—Hón sagði at þar var engi maðr í tigi til nema Haraldr konungr, 157: in all those instances of paternity; so also, það eru tveir í tiginu, <i>there are two suspected.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigin-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigin-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>of noble birth.</i> Eg. 343, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tiginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tiginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [tiginn and tigund are kindred words, so that tiginn prop. means <i>notable, marked</i>]:—<i>high-born, of high estate,</i> of a king or an earl; Uppsvía-ætt er tignust er á Norðrlöndum, þvíat sú ætt er komin frá goðunum sjálfum, Ó. H. 87; en þeir mundi þrjú hundruð vetra, at engi mundi vera í ætt hans kona eðr ú-tiginn maðr …, Edda 104; konungr mælti, far þú vel, vitr maðr ertú ok siðugr ok kannt vel at vera með tignum mönnum, Ó. H. 66: þá sagði Ólafr konungr, vel kanntú at vera með tignum mönnum, Sighvatr, Fb. ii. 112; lítt nýt ek þess þá, segir hón, at ek em konungs-dóttir, ef mik skal gipta ú-tignum manni, … þat hugda ek, segir hann (the king), at ek munda hafa vald at göra þann tiginn mann hér í landi sem ek vil, Fms. ii. 298; höll skipat með enum tignastum mönnum, Þiðr. 319; tiginn at metorðum, 655 x. 2; göra öngan manna mun hvárt er tiginn eða ú-tiginn, Eg. 351; öllum gaf hann þeim nökkurn grip, þeim stærri er tignari vóru, Fms. vi. 181; segir sér torfenginn slíkan mann ú-tiginn sem Kjartan var, Ld. 189; nú er þess engi ván, at ek giptumk ú-tignum manni … nú vill hón eigi eiga ú-tiginn mann, þá meguð ér gefa mér tignar-nafn, hefi ek til þess ætt, at ek mætta jarl heita, Fms. vi. 289: in tigna, a nickname, Orkn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigjund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigjund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(spelt tighiund) = tiund, <i>a tithe,</i> N. G. L. i. 401.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Lat. <i>tegula</i>], <i>a tile, brick;</i> af tiglinu … meðr tiglit, Stj. 46; elta leir ok göra tigl, 247; steikja tiglit, 263; þeir höfðu tigl fyrir grjót, Al. 29; see tigull.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl-grjot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigl-grjót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u. <i>‘tile-grit,’ tiles</i> or <i>bricks</i> used <i>as stones,</i> Stj. 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigl-görð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>brick-making,</i> Stj. 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigl-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a tile-bouse,</i> D. N. ii. 27 (Norse deed of 1290); tiglhús-tópt, N. G. L. ii. 483 (A. D. 1277).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl-ker"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
