        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl-ofn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigl-ofn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tile-oven,</i> D. N. i. 241 (deed of 1336); see ofn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigl-veggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigl-veggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tile-wall,</i> Stj. 612, Al. 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to reimburse, refund,</i> of small sums; ok skalat bóandanum tigla þat, Grág. i. 156; ok skal bóandinn tigla honum ef þá er hross þat verra en þá er hann tók við, 435: <i>to dole out,</i> of food or drink, opt er tiglat baulum töðum, Hallgr.; tiglaðu e-u í hann!",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tign"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tign
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the state of being high-born, highness;</i> taka af honum (the earl) tignina, Eg. 271; með mikilli tign ok virðingu, Fms. xi. 88; eptir tign verðleiks, Hom. 29; kyns tign, <i>birth, rank,</i> Greg. 64; fyrir tignar sakir várrar (of a king), Nj. 6; tign þín, <i>your highness,</i> 655 xxviii. 2; há-tign, <i>majesty,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tigna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tigna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to worship, honour;</i> t. sik konungs-nafni, <i>to assume a king’s name,</i> Fms. x. 387; skal ek þau aldri tigna, <i>I shall never worship them</i>(the gods), i. 98; t. líkneskjur, Barl. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tignadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tignaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = tign, <i>glory,</i> Post. 621.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tignar-bragd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tignar-bragð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. rendering of Lat. <i>reverentia,</i> Al. 70.",
            }
          }
        />
