          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a flint;</i> taka eld með tinnu, Fms. viii. 56; tiunu-grjót, <i>a flint-stone,</i> Gsp.: freq. in mod. usage, hrafn-tinna (q. v.), <i>‘raven-flint,’</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
