        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[Swed. <i>tio</i>; Dan. <i>ti</i>; cp. tigr, and Engl. <i>-ty</i> in <i>twen-ty, thir-ty,</i> etc.]:—<i>ten;</i> tíu tigir, <i>‘ten-ty,’</i> i. e. <i>a hundred,</i> Nj. 219; hundrað ok tíu-tigir, <i>a hundred</i> (i. e. 120) <i>plus ‘tenty’</i> (= 220), Vm. 107, see hundrað: hence mod. <strong>tíu-tíu,</strong> indecl. <i>‘ten-ty’</i> = <i>hundred.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
