      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tivi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tívi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., also spelt with <i>f</i>; mostly only used in pl. tívar; a dat. sing. tíva occurs in Haustl. 8; fróðgum tíva (thus Ób., the Kb. has tífi, a less correct form): a gen. sing. tíva, Vsp., in valtíva; [this old word is identical in root with Lat. <i>divus;</i> Sansk. <i>devas;</i> Gr. Διός (Ζεύς); cp. also Týr]:—<i>a god, divinity;</i> þriggja tíva, Haustl. 1; tormiðladr tívum, 3; tíva rök, Vþm. 42; Álfheim Frey gáfu tívar at tannfé, Gm. 5; ríkir tívar, Þkv. 14; mærir tífar, Hým. 4; sig-tívar (q. v.), <i>gods of victory,</i> Ls. 1, 2, Vsp., Gm., Fm., Akv. 29 (Bugge); val-tívar, <i>the gods of the slain,</i> Vsp. 50 (Bugge); sæki-tívar, <i>the martial gods,</i> Landn. (in a verse); kykvir tívar, <i>living beings,</i> applied to men, Ó. H. (in a verse of the Christian time), all the other references being heathen.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tivor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tívor
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [this word, a απ. λεγ. in the Vsp., is, as the form shews (the <i>r</i> being radical), different from the preceding, but identical with the A. S. <i>tifr</i> or <i>tiber</i> = <i>a victim, hostage,</i> and akin to tafn, q. v.]:—a <i>victim;</i> Baldri, blóðgum tívor, <i>Balder, the bloody victim,</i> Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tjald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tjald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. tjöld; [A. S. <i>teld;</i> Engl. <i>tilt</i> = <i>the cover of a cart;</i> Dan. <i>telt</i>]:—<i>a tent,</i> Ísl. ii. 178, Eg. 276: tents were pitched not only on land, but on ships, esp. when in harbour; dreki með tjöldum ok öllum reiða, 44; róðrar-skútu ok þar með reiða allan, tjöld ok vistir, 76; hann gékk út á skipit ok fyrir útan tjöldin, 195; láta þeir þegar af sér tjöldin, 261; bregða stafn-tjöldum, Hkv. 1; hlupu menn þá upp skyndiliga ok ráku af sér tjöldin, Fms. x. 135 (v. l.), viii. 130. At the time of public meetings (such as parliament) the men lived in tents; at þinglausnum þá er menn bregða tjöldum sínum, Grág. ii. 93; en er hann kom á þingit ok búð hans var tjöldut þá lét hann tjalda undir svörtum tjöldum innar af til þess at þá væri síðr skírdræpt, Ó. H. 156; for the tent-booths in market-places, see Ld. ch. 12, Fbr. 51, 52 new Ed.; land-tjald, <i>a tent ashore.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tjald-ass"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tjald-áss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tent-pole,</i> Fms. x. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tjald-bud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tjald-búð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a tent-booth,</i> Stj. 247; þeir görðu þar tjaldbúðir er heitir á Tjalda-velli, Landn. 270: eccl. <i>the Tabernacle,</i> Hb. 544. 1, Fms. v. 276, Stj., N. T., Vídal.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tjald-dyrr"
