          className="link"
          href="/word/tjald-sperra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tjald-sperra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>tent-spar,</i> a nickname, Sturl. ii. 233 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
