          className="link"
          href="/word/tjald-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tjald-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tent-stead, baiting-place where to pitch a tent,</i> Eg. 275, Fms. v. 286; kirkja á tjaldstað ok hrossa-beit, Pm. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
