        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "an adverbial prefix to compds, opp. to auð-, q. v.; [this inseparable particle answers to Gr. δυς-, and remains only in O. H. G. <i>zur-;</i> in Ulf. <i>tur-</i> in a single word <i>tur-werjan,</i> Mark xi. 23; it is lost in A. S., Engl., Germ., and in the mod. Scandin. languages; in Icel. it is in full use up to the present day]:—<i>difficult, hard.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
