          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-ræki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>misfortune,</i> Eg. 699.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-sottligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sóttligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. of persons, <i>hard to overcome, come at,</i> Lv. 49, Ld. 238; eiga við torsóttligt fólk, Fb. iii. 445: of things, <i>hard to perform</i> or the like, Fms. ix. 295, Ld. 178, 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-sottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = torsóttligr, Nj. 223, Ld. 278, Fbr. 38, Fms. v. 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-sveigdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sveigðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>hard to sway, bend,</i> Fms. x. 288.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-sveigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sveigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. id., Ísl. ii. 246.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-synn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sýnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hard to see,</i> Nj. 111, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-saekiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sækiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= torsóttligr, Grett. 133 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-saer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-sær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = torsýnn, Ísl. ii. 333.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-talinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-talinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>hard to count,</i> Fms. viii. 411.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tíma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>tor-týna</strong>), d, <i>to destroy,</i> with dat., Fas. ii. 517, 519, Stj. 456; drepit hafa þeir Jamund ok allt lið hans, ok tortímt hafa þeir guðunum sjálfum, Karl. 231; fyrirbjóðu vér hverjum manni þeim at tortíma eðr þeirra varnaði aflögliga, D. N. i. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tryggd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tryggð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>doubt, suspicion, incredulity,</i> 623. 26; nú skulu vér hnekkja þeirri t. ok sýna einurð várrar frásagnar, Fms. viii. 48; skulu þeir vera vitnis-menn ok ef nokkur verðr t. þar á, ok skal fé virða, Jb. 406; hafa t. á e-m, <i>to suspect,</i> Str. 16, 76; t. leikr á e-u, Js. 26; e-m er t. á, Þiðr. 128, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tryggiliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tryggiliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>doubtfully, suspiciously,</i> Sks. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tryggiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tryggiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>doubtful, suspicious,</i> Nj. 103 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tryggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tryggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to mistrust, doubt, suspect;</i> ok bað hann ekki t. þess ins helga manns miskunn, Fms. v. 147; enn margir eru þeir menn er þetta gruna, ok tortryggva þessa hluti, x. 371; skal ek aldrigi tortryggva mátt hans, Blas. 48; verði hann tortryggðr um eiðinn, Grág. i. 56; ef sá tortryggvir boðit er málann á, ii. 245; nú vill maðr úskyldr kaupa ok tyrtryggir (sic) sá er næstr er kaupi, N. G. L. i. 92; ef sá tortryggir er fyrir varð, Gþl. 164.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tryggleiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tryggleiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>distrust,</i> Str. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tryggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-tryggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>doubtful, incredulous;</i> Högni var hljoðlyndr, tortryggr ok sannorðr, Nj. 91; hann er svá t. at hann trúir engum manni, Glúm. 397; hann ávítaði þá, þvíat þeir vóru tortryggvir, Hom. 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-tyna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-týna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, an etymologizing corruption of tortíma, but only in very late vellums and in mod. paper transcripts; Fms. v. 213 is an error, for Fb. ii. (l. c.) 389 has the true old form, cp. N. G. L. ii. 9, v. l. 18; the reading Landn. 254 must be due to the transcriber of the lost vellum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-unninn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-unninn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>hard to overcome,</i> Fms. viii. 220.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-velda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-velda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, <i>to make difficulties;</i> t. e-t fyrir e-m, Ld. 238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-veldi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-veldi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a difficulty;</i> engi torveldi, Fs. 50; starf ok t., Fms. vii. 221; hver t. þar er á, Fas. i. 266: neut., meira torveldi, Stj. 326; með miklum torveldum, Fms. x. 368.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-veldligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-veldligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>tor-velligr,</strong> adj. <i>‘hard to wield,’ hard, difficult,</i> Nj. 122, Fms. vii. 257, Ísl. ii. 223, Greg. 62, MS. 656 C. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-veldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-veldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., torvelzt, Eluc. 58 (mod. torveldari, -astr); [valda]:—<i>hard, difficult;</i> torveldar sendifarar, Fms. i. 15; þótti honum torvelt at rétta þeirra hlut, Orkn. 12; torvelt get ek yðr verða at …, 358, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-virdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-virðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>difficult to estimate,</i> Band. 31 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-theystr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-þeystr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. (opp. to auð-þeystr), <i>hard to stir,</i> Nj. 90 C; opp. to auð-þeystr, Stor. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tor-aeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tor-æri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bad season, famine</i>, = hallæri, Bs. i. 744.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tord-yfill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tord-yfill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[= A. S. <i>tord-wifel, tord;</i> Engl. <i>turd</i>; Swed. and mod. Dan. <i>skarn-basse</i>]:—<i>a dung-beetle;</i> vér höfum veiddan tordyfil einn, Dropl. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. and Engl. <i>turf;</i> Dan. <i>törv</i>], <i>a turf, sod;</i> hylja hræ grjóti, torfi, klæðum eðr snæ, Grág. ii. 88; til garðlags torf eðr grjót, 262; torf ok grjót, Nj. 64; toptin var full af torfi ok grjóti, Rd. 274; borgar-vegg af grjóti ok torfi ok viðum, Fms. i. 123; lét konungr bera til viðu ok torf ok fylla díkit, vii. 54; torfs-maðr, <i>a person who runs the gauntlet pelted with sods,</i> N. G. L. i. 253.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-bass"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-báss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a boose</i> or <i>shed to keep sods</i> (or <i>peat</i>?) <i>in,</i> Ísl. ii. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-bingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-bingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a pile of turfs</i> or <i>peat</i>, Ísl. ii. 112.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-faeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-færi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>tools for cutting sods and peat,</i> Háv. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a fence of sods,</i> D. N. v. 957.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-grof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-gröf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a turf-hole, peat-pit,</i> Grág. ii. 338; kirkja á tvítuga t. í Nesland, Vm. 39; eptir mýrinni fyrir sunnan Molastaða torfgrafir, Dipl. v. 25; Haraldr jarl ungi féll við torf-grafir nökkurar, Orkn. 476 (referring to the Orkneys).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-hraukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-hraukr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a peat-stack,</i> Sturl. i. 179.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-hrip"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-hrip
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a basket to carry peat,</i> Nj. 252.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a peat-shed.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-kast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-kast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a pelting with sods,</i> Sturl. iii. 225, cp. Eb. ch. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-krokr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-krókr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>box</i> (a sketch of which see Eggert Itin. tab. viii. fig. 2), <i>to carry peat and sods,</i> Sturl. i. 179 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-kostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-köstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a turf-stack, peat-stack,</i> Vm. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a game, <i>‘turf-laking,’ pelting,</i> Eb. 210; prob. = the Scot. game of bickers, see Sir W. Scott’s Waverley, the Appendix to the General Preface.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-ljar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-ljár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = torfskeri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>‘turf-men,’ dealers in turf,</i> N. G. L. iii. 15 (year 1282).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-mor"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-mór
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a turf-moor,</i> Grág. ii. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-myrr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-mýrr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>turf-moor,</i> a local name, Vm. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-naust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-naust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ship-shed</i> (naust) <i>built of turf</i> (or <i>a ‘turf</i> or <i>peat-shed?’</i>), Landn. 118.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-skeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-skeri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a turf-cutter,</i> Landn. 283, (mod. torf-ljár.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-skurdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-skurðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>cutting turf</i> or <i>peat,</i> Sturl. i. 79; Vetrliði skáld var at torfskurði með húskörlum sínum, Bs. i. 14; staðrinn í Runa á torfskurð í Bakkaland á Torfmýri svá sem þarf til eldiviðar, Vm. 5; t. er í Hólalaud frá Spákonu-felli, Pm. 67; skógr í Þverárhlíð at viða til sels, t. í Steindórs-staða land, D.I. i. 471.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-stada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-staða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a place where turf</i> or <i>peat is cut;</i> jörðin á torfstöðu á Hól ofan frá Öngulstöðum, Dipl. v. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-stakkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-stakkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a peat-stack,</i> Ísl. ii. 116; griðungrinn hefir brotið niðr torfstakka hans, Ld. 336.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-verk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-verk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cutting turf</i> or <i>peat,</i> Rd. 278, Vm. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-vidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-viðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = tyri-viðr, [A. S. <i>tyrwe</i>], <i>a tarred tree;</i> kasta loganda torfviði með brennu-steini, Róm. 277 (= Lat. ‘picem et sulphure taedam mixtam ardenti mittere,’ Sallust, Jug. ch. 57).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-virki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-virki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. a false reading for tjöru-virki, N. G. L. i. 251, cp. ii. 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-vollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-völlr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a place to dry peat,</i> Dipl. iv. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-volr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-völr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [<i>torvol,</i> Ivar Aasen], <i>a thin plank running along the eaves of a turf-thatched cottage,</i> so as to prevent the earth falling down, N. G. L. i. 101, Gþl. 331.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torf-ox"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torf-öx
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a turf-axe, for cutting turf</i> or <i>peat,</i> Háv. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>turf, a green spot;</i> á yztu torfur sinna herbergja, Fbr. 156; þar sem sær mætisk ok græn torfa, N. G. L. i. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torfa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., and <strong>Torfi,</strong> a, m., pr. names, Landn. (in Skáld torfa).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Swed. <i>torg;</i> Dan. <i>torv;</i> the other word markaðr is from the Lat., and torg is prob. a Slav. word; Russ. <i>torge</i>]:—<i>a market</i> or <i>mart;</i> menn konungs höfðu torg ok skemtun ok leika úti hjá herbergjunum, Fms. xi. 366; hann var úti staddr á torgi, þar var fjölmenni mikit, i. 80; hann leitaði eptir of matkaup, görðu þeir honum þann kost, at þeir mundi setja þeim torg framan til Föstu, Orkn. 344; setja e-m torg til matkaupa, Fms. vii. 78; Sigmundi konungi var hvervetna sett torg ok annarr farar-greiði, Fas. i. 143; hafa torg fyrir hvers manns dyrum, Rétt. 12; á bryggjum eðr á stræti eðr á torgi, Gþl. 178, Matt. xi. 16, xx. 3, xxiii. 7, Mark vii. 4, Luke vii. 32, Acts xvi. 19, xvii. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to eat up;</i> with dat., eg torga því ekki, <i>I cannot eat it up;</i> hann át sem hann torgaði, <i>he ate all he could.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torgar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torgar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. (name of an island in Norway), <i>a market</i> (?); see Gramm. p. xvii, col. 2, l. 12 from the bottom.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/torta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          torta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the podex</i> of a beast.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tortis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tortís
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a torch,</i> Mar., Karl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toru-gaetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          toru-gætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., older form = torgætir, Korm. ch. 12 (in a verse), Fms. iv. 124 (torgætr, Ó. H. l. c.), ix. 450, x. 62, 116, Eb. 92 new Ed.; jafn-torogætt, Bs. i. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tosa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tosa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>tæsan;</i> Engl. <i>tease</i>], <i>to drag a dead weight;</i> tosa við e-ð; perh. from the English.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          toskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., thus (not töskr) in Gm. (see Bugge, foot-note), in Edd. of Edda it is erroneously spelt with <i>ö;</i> [A. S. <i>tusc</i> or <i>tux;</i> Engl. <i>tusk;</i> Fris. <i>tosk</i> and <i>tusk</i>]:—<i>a tusk, tooth;</i> only remaining in the pr. name, Ratatoskr, Gm., Edda; see the remarks s. v. íkorni and rati.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tosti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tosti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a pr. name, a Scandin. and Swed. name, in Sköglar-tosti, the father of queen Sigrid the Proud, Hkr. i; hence the name came to England, as in earl Tostig, son of Godwin; it occurs several times on Swed. Runic stones: as appell. it means <i>a frog,</i> see Bosworth’s A. S. Diet.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tota"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tota
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a teat</i> or <i>teat-like protuberance,</i> e. g. of the toe of a shoe; stendr fram eins og tota; cp. A. S. <i>totodon,</i> p. 105 in Gregory’s Pastoral, edited by Mr. Sweet; cp. tottr, tútna (Dan. <i>tude</i> = <i>a spout</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          toti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = tota; in the saying, hverr vill sínum tota fram ota: a nickname, Fms. i. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/totta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          totta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [akin to tuttr, tottr], <i>to suck,</i> esp. to suck the last drop of a drained teat; totta mína pípu, <i>to suck my pipe,</i> Sig. Pét.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tottogo"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tottogo
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= tuttugu, D.I. i. 476.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tottr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>tommel-tot</i> = <i>tom-thumb</i>], a nickname, Sturl., Fms., of a dwarfish person.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/to"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tó
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a tuft of grass, grassy spot,</i> among rocks; þar var tó undir er hann fór ofan, Rd. 310; einn dag fóru þeir í bjarg at sækja sér hvannir í einni tó er síðan er kölluð Þorgeirs-tó, Fbr. 87; gammrinn settisk í eina tó, er varð í björgunum, Fas. ii. 231; hann hljóp ofan fyrir hamrana í tó eina, 251; gras-tó, <i>grass-turf,</i> af hömrunum ofan í grastóna, Fbr. 156; freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/to-vara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tó-vara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>‘tow-ware,’</i> i. e. socks and gloves, and the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/to-vinna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tó-vinna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>wool-dressing, spinning, carding.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. (qs. <strong>tófa</strong>); [this word, at present the general name for the fox, seems not to occur in old writers (cp. fóa, refr, melrakki), not even among the names of foxes, Edda ii. 490; but it occurs in the modern rhyme quoted by Maurer, 169; the etymology is not certain, between the two vowels some consonant has been absorbed, perh. <i>f</i>, qs. tófa, from the fox’s tufted tail; or, it may be akin to tæfa, týja (q. v.), Dan. <i>tæve</i> = <i>a dam with cubs.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tobak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóbak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>tobacco,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tofi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tófi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. and <strong>Tófa,</strong> u, f. freq. old Dan. and Swed. pr. names, Sighvat, Baut.; cp. Germ. <i>zôbe—a bondmaid.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., prop. <i>a simpleton</i> (Swed. <i>toket</i> = <i>silly, idiotic</i>); hence a pr. name, freq. in old Dan., whence mod. Dan. <i>Tyge</i>, and Latinised Tycho (Tycho Brahe); the name is connected with the ancient tale of the master-archer Tóki (the Norse form of the Tell legend in Switzerland), told in Saxo and partly in the Icel. Jómsv. S. (Pálna-tóki), an Indo-Germanic legend.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tól
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [A. S. <i>tôl;</i> Engl. <i>tool</i>], <i>tools</i>; tangir skópu ok tól görðu, Vsp.; hamar, töng ok steðja ok þaðan af öll tól önnur, Edda 9; brjóta borgina með þess-konar tölum sem þar til hæfði, Al. 11; skolpa ok nafra ok öll önnur þau tól er til skipsmíðar þarf at hafa, Sks. 31; tönn snúin svá sem hón sé með tólum gör, 131, passim; smiðar-tól, graf-tól (qq. v.); tóla-kista, <i>a tool-chest,</i> Fs. 176, Ísl. ii. 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(qs. tvalf), [Goth. <i>twa-lif;</i> A. S. <i>twelf;</i> Engl. <i>twelve;</i> Germ. <i>zwölf;</i> Dan. <i>tolv</i>]:—<i>twelve,</i> Grág. i. 16, ii. 20, 31, 45, Rb. 368, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-eyringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-eyringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a twelve-ounce ring,</i> Grág. ii. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-faldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-faldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>twelvefold,</i> Post. 513.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-fedmingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-feðmingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a twelve-fathom square,</i> Ám. 22; fylgir þar tólffeðmings skurðr torfs, Dipl. iii. 6, iv. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-fotungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-fótungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘twelve-foot</i> a kind of <i>grub</i> or <i>maggot.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-greindr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-greindr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>divided into twelve,</i> Stj. 286.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-manudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-mánuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a twelve-month;</i> nú líðr þessi t., Þiðr. 68; innan tólfmánuðar dags, D. N. iv. 323; tólfmánaðr stefna, N. G. L. i. 343.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-menningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-menningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a company of twelve</i> at a banquet; en þá er t. var skipaðr til at sitja, Glúm. 331.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-raedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-ræðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>consisting of twelve tens,</i> epithet of a hundred; tólfrætt hundrað, <i>a duodecimal hundred,</i> i. e. a hundred and twenty, Ó. H. (pref.), Grág. ii. 91, Sks. 56, Fb. i. 271 (see hundrað).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-tigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-tigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = tólfræðr, Sks. 56, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-aeringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-æringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a twelve-oared boat,</i> Sturl. ii. 162, Fas. ii. 509, N. G. L. ii. 138.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolf-aerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólf-ærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>twelve-oared,</i> N. G. L. i. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = tylpt, <i>a number of twelve, duo-decade, dozen;</i> in <strong>tólftar-kviðr,</strong> m. <i>a verdict of a jury of twelve neighbours,</i> Grág. i. 138, 168, 207, K. Þ. K. 168, Glúm. 365, cp. Eb. 19 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolfti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólfti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the twelfth,</i> Grág. i. 118, N. G. L. i. 348, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolftungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólftungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the twelfth part</i> of a thing (cp. þriðjungr, fjórðungr … áttungr), Sks. 59, Vm. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tólgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (mod. also <strong>tólg,</strong> f., or even <strong>tólk</strong>); [Engl. <i>tallow;</i> Germ., Dan. <i>talg;</i> akin to Goth. <i>tulgus</i> = στερεός]:—<i>tallow,</i> when melted and stiffened; til tólgs ok vax, Pm. 103; tólgar skjöldr, <i>a round piece of melted tallow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tom"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>emptiness, vacuity;</i> jörðin var eyði og tóm, Gen. i. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tom-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóm-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>slow, slovenly;</i> Sköfnungr er t. en þú óðlátr, Korm. 80; eigi vóru þér nú tómlátir Íslendingar, Fms. vii. 35; Þórir var inn tómlátasti, Fas. ii. 414; var hans saknað … þeir kváðu öngan skaða vera um svá tómlátan mann, Fs. 69; mjök fúsum manni þykkir flýtirinn jafnvel t. vera, Stj. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tom-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóm-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>slowly, leisurely,</i> Fms. ii. 275, ix. 357, Ísl. ii. 345, Gþl. 108; en er hann kom suðr um Staði þá fór hann allt tómligar, Hkr. i. 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tom-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóm-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>slowness, slovenliness, indolence;</i> þeir sögðu Þorleif mjök Íslenzkan fyrir t. sitt, Eb. 198; t. (<i>indolence</i>) góðs verks, Hom. 26; t. várt er latir erum, 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tom-stund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóm-stund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a leisure-hour, leisure</i> (= tóm), Nj. 77; gefit mér t. til ráða-görðar, Fms. vii. 258.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tomr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>tom</i>; North. E. and Scot. <i>toom</i>], <i>empty;</i> tómr laupr, Gþl. 524; it tóma haf, Sks. 199: <i>empty-handed,</i> missir hann ok ferr nú tómr aptr at landi, Hom.; með tvær hendr tómar, <i>empty-handed,</i> Sturl. iii. 258: <i>slovenly,</i> tómr maðr = <i>‘homo otiosus,’</i> Hom. 26: <i>vain,</i> vera kann, at þetta sé eigi tóm orð, Ld. 254; tóm er lækning sú er eigi græðir sjúkan, 623. 19; tóm dýrð, <i>vain-glory,</i> 655 xvi. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ton-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tón-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>without intonation,</i> Thom. 455.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Lat. <i>tonare</i>], <i>to intone,</i> of the priest in the service: <i>to set in tunes,</i> in a book, syngja sléttan söng eptir því sem tónat væri á kór-bókum, Bs. i. 847.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tonn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tónn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Lat.], <i>a tune;</i> syngja tíðir við tón, Sturl. iii. 210. <strong>tóni,</strong> a, m. = tónn, Sks. 633: as a nickname, Ann. 1393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/topi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tópi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Dan. <i>taabe</i> = <i>a fool;</i> cp. Germ. <i>toben</i>], <i>a ‘fool,’</i> obsol. in Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tora"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tóra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tóri, pret. tórði, part. tórt, <i>to lounge, linger;</i> látið þá tóra at eins, <i>let them be all but living,</i> Fas. i. 80; meðan eg tóri, <i>as long as I live,</i> freq. in mod. usage; also of a light, <i>to gleam faintly</i> (see etýra).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [akin to tó, q. v.], <i>a flock of wool;</i> in ó-tót and ó-tæti, <i>a ‘un-flock,’ a rag.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trad-gjof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trað-gjöf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>cramming,</i> giving sheep and cattle as much fodder as they can eat, Jb. 224.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trad-jola"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trað-jóla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, or <strong>troð-jóla,</strong> <i>to drop;</i> en það er til í tungu vorri, að sá sem týnt hefir nokkru, hann hafi ‘traðjólað’ því eða ‘troðjólað,’ sumir segja ‘taðjólað,’ allt í sömu merkingu, að hafa því niðrfellt, að troðast undir fótum eða velkjast á gólfi, Pál, Skýr. 265.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trada-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traða-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a place where to build a</i> tröð (II), Jm. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tradar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traðar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see tröð.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tradar-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traðar-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the enclosure of a</i> tröð, Gþl. 350 (where in the Norse sense).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tradar-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traðar-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>enclosure of pastures,</i> N. G. L. i. 239. traðar-veggr, m. <i>the wall of a pen,</i> in the Icel. sense, Sturl. ii. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tradk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traðk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (or better <strong>traðkr,</strong> m.), <i>a track, a path</i> or trodden <i>spot</i> in snow, or the like; kómu þeir á traðk mikinn ofarliga í dalnum, Grett. 111 new Ed.; traðkit var mikit, Finnb. 248; er þar umhverfis traðk mikit (traðkr, v. l.), Konr. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tradka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traðka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, with dat. <i>to tread on with the foot, to trample on:</i> metaph., t. réttindum e-s.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. trefr], in old writers only in pl. tröf, <i>a hem, fringe;</i>þá tók hón til trafanna es á klæðum þeim vóru er tjaldat var of kistuna, Bs. i. 347; hón hafði knýtt um sik blæju, ok vóru í mörk blá, ok tröf fyrir enda, <i>a kerchief with blue marks</i> or <i>stripes and fringe at the ends,</i> Ld. 244; at þeir göri tröf með dreglum um skikkjur sínar, Stj. 328 (= Lat. <i>fimbria</i> of the Vulgate); at snertum tröfum klæða sinna, … klæða-tröfum, <i>the hems of one’s garment,</i> Post. (Unger) 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trafali"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trafali
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [prob. from Engl. <i>travail</i>], <i>a hindrance, impediment;</i> vera e-m til travala.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trafn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trafn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>tramn,</strong> m. [Swed. <i>trem;</i> Dan. <i>treme</i> = <i>a beam</i>], <i>a beam, log,</i> Korm. (in a verse, the Ed. has traf<i>r</i>, but the rhyme with <i>‘hramni’</i> shews that the true form has <i>mn</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traktera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traktera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [for. word], <i>to treat</i>, H. E. i. 469, 528: <i>to entertain,</i> Bs. i. 220.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trakteran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trakteran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>treatment,</i> Stj. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traktr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traktr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>chant.</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tramar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tramar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. [Norse <i>tramen;</i> provinc. Dan. <i>tremmind</i> = <i>the evil one;</i> ‘trami um jag dä gär’ is a Gottland oath; provinc. Swed. <i>trommä,</i> see Bugge’s note, ad loc. citand.; but þramar, not tramar, may be the original of all these words, for the Icel., at least now, say, þremillinn! hver þremillinn!]:—<i>fiends, demons,</i> a απ. λεγ., Skm. 30; but in this passage ‘gramar’ would better suit the alliteration, which is otherwise somewhat lame; it is to be borne in mind that in ancient vellums <i>g</i> and <i>t</i> initial are often hard to distinguish (see gramr II).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trampa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trampa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to tramp,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trana"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trana
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f., see trani.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trandill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trandill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>trendel</i> = <i>an orb, sphere;</i> Engl. <i>trundle</i>], <i>a trundle</i> (?); as a nickname, Landn. (Nj.), Bs. i. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trani"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trani
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m.; this is the oldest form and gender, whence later, <strong>trana,</strong> u, f.; the masc. form occurs in Höfuðl. 10 (tranar); tranann, acc., Fms. x. 50, 353, 354; trananum, 304; traninn, 347, 350, Ó.T. 52; tranann, 32; but Tronona, trönu, 55, ll. 19, 23; tranann, trana, 64, l. c. (in an older vellum): in the verse of Hallfred (Fs. 209) Trönu should be Trana; cp. also Fagrsk. ch. 76, 80; [A. S. <i>crân;</i> Dan. <i>trane</i>]:—<i>a crane,</i> Fas. iii. 359, Art. 86, Str. 67, Edda (Gl.): metaph. as the name of <i>a ship,</i> Fms.: of <i>a sword,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trantr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trantr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a snout,</i> in vulgar use.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trapiza"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trapiza
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [a Gr. word, τράπεζα, from the Byzantine, through the Wærings]:—<i>a table</i> at the entrance of the hall, where the skapker (q. v.) was kept, and the horns were filled, and on which also stood the washing-basin, Fms. iii. 177, iv. 75, vi. 442, vii. 148, viii. 13, x. 331, Sd. 161.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trappa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trappa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>trappe;</i> Germ. <i>treppe</i>], <i>a step</i> in a staircase.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trassa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trassa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be sluttish;</i> lítt hafði hann verit upp á skartsemi ok hirti ekki hvernig það trassaðist, Safn i. 656.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trassi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trassi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a slovenly fellow,</i> esp. one negligent as to one’s dress or appearance: <strong>trassalegr</strong> and <strong>trassa-fenginn,</strong> adj. <i>slovenly:</i> <strong>trassa-skapr,</strong> m. <i>slovenliness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trauð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., in the phrase, við trauð ok nauð, <i>‘let or hindrance,’</i> cp. Dan. ‘med nöd og neppe,’ Bs. i. 200, Karl. 384.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traud-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trauð-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>dismal sayings, laments,</i> Gh. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trauda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trauða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to impede;</i> in the phrase, þat trauðar eigi, <i>that does not hinder,</i> Fb. i. 260, Fas. i. 564, ii. 201.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traudla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trauðla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(spelt <strong>traulla,</strong> Orkn. 204 in a verse, Fms. vii. 239, Korm. in a verse), adv. <i>scarcely, hardly,</i> = trauðliga.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traudliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trauðliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>scarcely</i>, Nj. 245 C, Róm. 312, Hkr. iii. 361.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trauðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unwilling, loth, reluctant,</i> Hkv. 2. 28, Skv. 3. 49; Kjartan var trauðr til ok hét þó ferðinni, Ld. 204; t. mun ek af hendi at láta sveit þessa, Eg. 65; em vér því trauðir at taka vandræði annarra, Nj. 181; t. em ek at fyrirláta þann átrúnað, sem …, Fms. i. 129; hann var t. til, <i>he was loth to do it,</i> Orkn. 40; trauðr em ek at týna þeim sigri, Ó. H. 74; Björn var t. til ok mæltisk undan, 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>tröst</i>; Engl. <i>trust;</i> derived forms from trúa, q. v., the <i>st</i> being inflexive]:—<i>trust,</i> with a notion of <i>protection, shelter, safe abode;</i> hann setti hann eptir til trausts Berg-Önundi, Eg. 368; em ek kominn at sækja heilræði at þér ok traust, Nj. 98; ef ek héta trausti mínu eðr umsjá, 260; hón hafði þenna mann sent honum til halds ok trausts, Ld. 46; í trausti konungs, Landn. 214, v. l.; er hann spurði at synir hans hötðu ekki traust í Englandi, Fms. i. 26; meðan ek em traust-lauss, slíkt traust sem þú hefir af Skota-konungi, iv. 222; þú skalt hafa tvá hluti landa ok þar með traust mitt, 229; en ek veita yðr mitt traust, vi. 54; með hamingju ok trausti hins heilaga Ólafs, 166; vera e-m traust ok hlífi-skjöldr, viii. 239; leita sér trausts til e-s, Fb. ii. 169; sitja í trausti e-s, 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traust-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traust-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Germ. <i>trostlos;</i> Dan. <i>tröstes-lös</i>], <i>without protection, helpless,</i> Fms. iv. 222, Sks. 252.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traust-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traust-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>strength, firmness,</i> Sks. 420, Bær. 9 (<i>valour</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traust-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traust-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>firmly,</i> Gþl. 105: <i>confidently,</i> Hom. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traust-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traust-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>safe, to be relied on,</i> Bær. 9; miklu væri traustligra (<i>much safer</i>) at týna barninu, 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trausta-tak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trausta-tak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a taking in trust,</i> only used in the phrase taka e-ð trausta taki, e. g. of going into the rooms of a friend when absent and there taking a book ‘in trust,’ knowing that he will have no objection.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trausti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trausti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a pr. name, Vígl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/traustr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          traustr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>trusty, sure, firm, strong, safe;</i> þeir höfðu skjöldu traustari enn Kvenir, Eg. 59; kvóðu silki-bandit vera nökkuru traustara enn líkindi þætti á fyrir digrleiks sakir … fjöturinn var sléttr ok blautr sem silki-ræma, en svá traustr ok sterkr sem nú skaltú heyra, Edda 19, 20; hvárt af osti eru gör akkeri vár, eðr reynask þau nökkuru traustari, Fms. vi. 253, traust brynja, Gd.; hlífar traustar, Edda (Ht.); so also Icel. say, íssinn er traustr, <i>the ice is safe;</i> ó-traustr, <i>unsafe.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trass"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tráss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Dan. <i>trods</i>], <i>obstinacy.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trassask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trássask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Germ. <i>trotz</i>], <i>to be obstinate, dogged;</i> að hann hafi trássað og sagt, hann skyldi vinna allt Ísland með sjöunda mann, Bs. ii. 271; trássast við e-t, <i>to neglect defyingly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tredja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treðja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "traddi, traddr, [cp. troða], <i>to tread,</i> occurs only in a few forms; þá er Jörmunrekr jóm of traddi, Hðm. 3; törgur tröddusk, Hkm.; hafit ér mey um tradda, Hðm. 18; þú lézk tradda grund, Fms. vi. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trefill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trefill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a dimin. [Dan. <i>trævler</i>], <i>a fringe, fringed kerchief;</i> hékk annarr t. fyrir enn annarr á bak, Sd. 186 (of rags).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trefja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trefja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = hefr, mod. form.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trefja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trefja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "trafði, trafiðr, <i>to tear into fringes;</i> a defect. verb, of which there only remains the part. trafiðr, Pr. 329.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treflugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treflugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>trævlet</i>], <i>fringed, with fringes,</i> Fb. iii. 375.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trefr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>fringes;</i> eigi sviðnuðu hinar minnstu trefr á skrúða hans, Bs. i. 42; blóðgar trefr, Fas. ii. 554; trefr af einu dýrligu klæði, i. 230; blæju ok trefr fyrir enda, Ld. 244, v. l.; sjúkir menn kómu við hans trefr … at snertum tröfum klæða þinna … trefum (dat.), Post. (Unger) 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treg-rof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treg-róf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a lamentation,</i> Gh. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trega"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trega
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "irreg. verb, pres. tregr, pret. tregði, part. tregað, with suffixed neg. tregr-að, Gh. 2: part. tregnar, Hðm. 1. The mod. form is <strong>trega,</strong> að, which, though but rarely, occurs in vellums, e. g. tregaði, Bs. i. 301, in a vellum of the earlier part of the 14th century; [A. S. <i>tregjan</i>]:—<i>to grieve,</i> used impers.; fjölð er þat er fíra tregr, <i>many are the woes of man,</i> Sdm. 30; tregr mik þat, Gkv. 3. 2; hví tregrað ykkr teiti at mæla, <i>how can ye be glad?</i> Gh. 2; (hana) tregði för friðils, Vkv. 27; þat mál er mik meirr tregi, 35; alla menn tregr fall grams, <i>the king’s death grieves all men,</i> Hkr. i. (in a verse); tregnar iðir, <i>dismal thoughts</i> (?), Hðm. 1; marga menn tregaði mjök andlát Þorláks biskups, <i>many were grieved over Th.’s death,</i> Bs. i. 301; munaðar-ríki hefir margan tregað, <i>brought many to grieve,</i> Sól. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tregda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tregða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>reluctance, difficulty, unwillingness;</i> ef konungr hefir nökkut tregður í at fara, Fms. vii. 116; hann hafði í nökkura tregðu um vígslu hans, Bs. i. 73; göra tregður í e-u, Mag. 134. <strong>tregða-laust,</strong> n. adj. <i>without cavil, willingly,</i> Bs. i. 388.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tregi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tregi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Ulf. <i>trigo</i> = Gr. λύπη; A. S. <i>trega</i>], <i>difficulty, reluctance;</i> vil ek nú biðja yðr alla at vér hafim önga trega í málum þessum, <i>to raise no objections,</i> Nj. 188; þá gékk at Þórir ór Garði ok leitaði at færa í alla trega þá er hann mátti, Grett. 150; at allir tregar myndi úr leggjask málum biskups, Thom. 381.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tregliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tregliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>with difficulty,</i> as opp. to smoothly; kómu þeir honum at kalla ok þó sem tregligast, <i>they moved her</i> (the ship) <i>with great difficulty,</i> Fms. iii. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tregligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tregligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; it tregligasta, <i>with the greatest difficulty,</i> Fb. i. 260; var Þorgils heldr tregligr í fyrstu, Sturl. iii. 222.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tregr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tregr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [O. H. G. <i>tragi</i>; Germ. <i>träg</i>], <i>dragging, slovenly, going with difficulty;</i> sagði at lömbunum væri tregast um átið fyrst er þau væri nýkefld, Eb. 244; tregum otrs-gjöldum, Bm.; opt eru tregar kálf-sugur, Hallgr.; mun honum þat tregt veita, <i>it will go hard with him,</i> Rd. 276; tregt hefir féit út greiðzk, Fb. ii. 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trekt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a funnel,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trekt-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trekt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a local name, <i>Utrecht,</i> Bs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tresk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tresk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n.(?), a doubtful word, <i>a veil</i> (?), <i>cushion, pillow,</i> or the like; svá at tár flugu tresk (tresc Ed.) í gögnum, Gkv. i. 16 (where the tresk seems to be acc., <i>the tears flew through the</i> t.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treyja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>tröje</i>], <i>a jerkin;</i> fór í treyju ok kipti skóm á fætr sér, Nj. 28; treyja með kaprúni af skrúði, Jb. 187; hann hafdi hvárki brynju né treyju, Sturl. i. 197; hann hjó á öxl Oddi, gengu í sundr treyjur tvær, ok brynjan lúðisk, iii. 205; vóru þrír tigir manna í hringa-brynjum ok tvær treyjur með, 184; hann hafði góða brynju ok styrkja treyja, Fms. ix. 527; Aron var í síðri treyju ok góðri stálhúfu, Bs. i. 624; græn treyja, D. N. iii. 160; söðul-treyja, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treyju-hosa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treyju-hosa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a kind of <i>hose;</i> svá at sundr tók treyju-hosuna, bryn-hosuna ok svá fótinn, Þiðr. 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treyju-sodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treyju-söðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>saddle</i> = trogsöðull, Grág. ii. 239 (Kb.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treyna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treyna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>treina,</strong> d, <i>to use sparingly,</i> esp. of food, so as to make it last longer; treyna sér e-t.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treyskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treyskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>trædsk;</i> Germ. <i>trotz</i>], <i>obstinate;</i> villan treysk, Pass. 50 (from the Dan.?)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treysta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treysta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [traust; Dan. <i>trouml;ste</i> = <i>to comfort</i>], <i>to make trusty, make strong and safe;</i> Höskuldr treysti mundriða í skildi, Nj. 66; hann setti þar forráða-menn ok treysti sér fólk, Hkr. i. 84: <i>to confirm, make firm,</i> at treysta vináttu Snorra, Sturl. ii. 260; hann treysti sálu þína, Barl. 94; þá treysta fól hinn heimska svá at hann skal ríkastr vera, Sks. 342; treysta herinn ok eggja, Ó. H. 214; t. heilsu hans, Greg. 49; treystr með holdi ok blóði Guðs, Fms. xi. 38; várir menn þurfu nú at þér treystið þá, viii. 317.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/treystir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          treystir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a strengthener.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., gen. trés, dat. acc. tré; pl. tré, gen. trjá; spelt treo, Stj. 14, 74, Barl. 138; dat. trjám; with the article tré-it, mod. tréð; [Ulf. <i>triu</i> = ξύλον; A. S. <i>treow;</i> Engl. <i>tree</i>; Dan. <i>træ;</i> Swed. <i>trä, träd</i>, the <i>d</i> representing the article; in Germ. this word is lost, or only remains in compds, see apaldr]:—<i>a tree,</i> Lat. <i>arbor;</i> askrinn er allra trjá mestr, Edda 10; hamra, hörga, skóga, vötn, tré ok öll önnur blót, Fms. v. 239; höggva upp tré, Gullþ. 50; rætr eins trés, Fms. x. 219; höggva tré í skógi, Grág. ii. 296, Glúm. 329; milli trjá tveggja, 656 B. 4; lauf af tré, Fs. 135; barr af limum trés þess, er …, Edda; tvau tré, Ask ok Emblu, id.; ymr it aldna tré, Vsp.: of trees used as gallows, ef ek sé á tré uppi, váfa virgil-ná, Hm. 158; skolla við tré, Fms. vii. (in a verse); cp. the Swed. allit. <i>galge ok gren</i>: hence of the cross, 655 xvi. A. 2, Fms. vi. 227, Vídal. passim; and so in mod. eccl. writers. Sayings, eigi fellr tré við it fyrsta högg, <i>the tree falls not at the first stroke,</i> Nj. 224; falls er ván at fornu tré, of a person old and on the verge of the grave, Ísl. ii. 415; tré tekr at hníga ef höggr tág undan, Am. 69.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tréna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become woody, dry,</i> Edda (pref.) 11, Fms. ii. 179, v. l.; in mod. usage of turnips or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trinitatis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trinitatis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[Lat. gen.], <i>Trinity-Sunday;</i> in Trinitatis-dagr, Fms. ix. 340, Vm., and so in mod. usage; fyrsti, annar … sunnudagr eptir Trinitatis, Icel. Almanack.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tripl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tripl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>treble,</i> Alg.: <strong>tripla,</strong> að, <i>to chant in treble tunes,</i> Bs. i. 847.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trippi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trippi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. Engl. <i>to trip</i>], <i>a young colt before it is broken in,</i> Fas. i. 9: freq. in mod. usage, ótamið trippi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tritill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trítill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>trilde</i>], <i>a top.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tritla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trítla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Dan. <i>trilde</i>], <i>to trot at a slow pace;</i> cp. Dan. <i>trilde-bör</i> = <i>a wheel-barrow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/triza"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tríza
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(proncd. <strong>tríssa</strong>), u, f. [mid. Lat. <i>tricca</i>], <i>a pull</i> (?); hann sér at í berginu vóru steinar sem tríza væri gör, Róm. 148: in mod. usage = Dan. <i>tridse.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trjona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trjóna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>tryne;</i> trana and trjóna seem to be akin]:—<i>a snout,</i> Lat. <i>rostrum,</i> Fms. vi. 143 (of a serpent); með gínandum trjónum, Landn. 257 (Hb.): of a hammer, trjónu-tröll, <i>the ‘snout-ogress,’</i> of the hammer of Thor, Haustl.: of projecting land, Selmeina trjóna, <i>the ness of Selund,</i> i. e. <i>Zealand,</i> Hkr. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a treading, trampling;</i> ef fellr í nauta-troð, <i>if trampled down by cattle,</i> N. G. L. i. 379.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trod-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troð-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>choke-full,</i> of animals, also of a bag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. treð, treðr, older form trøðr; tröðz, Grág. ii. 285: pret. trað, tratt (traðst), trað, pl. tráðu (mod. tróð, tróðst, pl. tróðu): subj. trœði; imperat. troð, troddú; part. troðinn: [Ulf. <i>trudan</i> = πατειν. τρυγαν, Luke vi. 44; A. S. <i>trêdan;</i> Engl. <i>tread;</i> Germ. <i>treten;</i> Swed. <i>tråda;</i> Dan. <i>træde</i>]:—<i>to tread;</i> vegr er vetki treyðr, Hm. 120; at vegrinn væri troðinn, <i>beaten.</i> Eg. 578; t. stafkarls-stíg, <i>to tread a beggar’s path,</i> Fms. vi. 304; troða skó, <i>to ‘tread shoes,’ wear them out,</i> Eb. 20; troðnir í sundr tvennir skór, Skíða R. 193; troða villu-stigu, Barl. 29; troða halir helveg, Vsp. 52; manna þeirra er mold troða, Fm. 23; troða goðveg, Hdl. 5; aur tráðu vér áðan, Fms. vi. (in a verse); ek trað hauðr um heiði hundvillr, Eb. (in a verse); hlynbjörn trað Áta jörð, Orkn. (in a verse); nú treðr þú mik undir fótum, Nj. 82; hann trað járnin, Fms. xi. 38; trað nipt Nara náttverð ara, Höfuðl.; reyks rösuðr trað Ingjald, Ýt.; mara trað hann, … trað hon fótleggina, Hkr. i. 20; tráðu (tróðu Ed.) þeir sér gadd hjá brekkunni, Fms. ix. 490, (tráðu, Fb. iii. 139, l. c.); niðr-troðinn ok svívirðr, Fms. x. 305; troða niðr dauðann, <i>to beat down under one’s feet,</i> Niðrst. 6; skulu ér nú því síðr troða fyrir yðr, sem ek var þá erfiðri, metaphor from beating down the snow, making a track, Nj. 229, Grett. 174 new Ed.; t. íllsakar við e-n, <i>to fight it out with one,</i> Nj. 219; en ef aðrir-tveggju troða þing ok vitni hins, <i>if they quash his suit and witnesses,</i> Js. 41; fót-troða, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trodningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troðningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a crowded throng:—a beaten truck.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trog"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trog
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>trog;</i> Engl. <i>trough</i> and <i>tray</i>: Dan. <i>trug</i>], <i>a trough,</i> Edda 31 (slátr-trog); sá ek konur tvær, þær höfðu trog í milli sín, ok jósu blóði héraðit allt, Glúm. 376; ljá sér trogs at sælda mjöl, Greg. 58; troll-kona, hón hafði í annarri hendi trog en annarri skálm, Grett. 140, Hkr. iii. 150; var sem trogi væri hvelft á síðurnar, Bs. i. 330; trogs-brot, Greg. 59; rjóma-trog or mjolkr-trog, <i>a milk-trough</i> in which the milk is kept for cream; renna úr trogunum, <i>to pour out the milk so that the cream remains;</i> slátr-trog, <i>a meat-trough.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trog-sodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trog-söðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>pummel-formed saddle,</i> Eb. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., the later but erroneous form is <strong>tröll;</strong> the rhymes require it to be troll; thus, tro<i>ll</i> and o<i>ll</i>u, Fms. vi. 339; tro<i>ll</i> and ko<i>ll</i>r, Sturl. ii. 136 (a ditty); tro<i>ll</i> and so<i>ll</i>inn, Rekst., Landn. 212 (in a verse); and so spelt in old vellums, trollz, Vsp. (Kb.) 39; in later vellums tröll, Mar. 1055; and so rhymed, tr<i>öll, öll,</i> Mkv.: [Dan.-Swed. <i>trold;</i> Low Germ. <i>droll</i>, whence the mod. Dan. <i>drollen;</i> cp. also trylla and Dan. <i>trylde</i> = <i>to charm, bewitch</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-aukinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-aukinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘troll-eked,’ possessed by a troll,</i> but only in heathen sense = hamramr, epithet of a werewolf; Þorgrímr var tröll-aukinn ok tók þó Kristni, Landn. (Hb.) 45, Fms. iii. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-domligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-dómligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>belonging to witchcraft,</i> Bær. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>trolddom</i>], <i>witchcraft.</i> Stj. 101: <i>monstrosity,</i> Mar. 105. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-karl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-karl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a giant, a male troll,</i> Fas. iii. 178.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-kerling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-kerling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = trollkona. Fas. ii. 519.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a giantess,</i> Fs. 145, Fb. i. 257, Grett. 140, Edda 53, Fas. ii. 151, Sturl. iii. 304: sendi drottning eptir Sturlu, bað hann koma til sín, ok hafa með sér tröllkonu-söguna, 305, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-kyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-kyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>of ‘troll-kind,’</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-marr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-marr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘troll-steed,’</i> i. e. <i>a wolf,</i> Hallfred.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-menni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-menni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a giant-like man,</i> Finnb. 344, Fas. iii. 259, 285.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-rida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-riða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ridden by a troll, witch-ridden;</i> yxn þeir er Þórólfr var ekinn á urðu trollriða. Eb. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-skapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-skapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = trolldómr, <i>the being a troll;</i> eigi er þat trollskapr at maðr þoli sár, Ísl. ii. 365, Fs. 43: <i>witchery,</i> berja grjóti í hel fyrir fjölkyngi ok trollskap, Landn. 236; hann verr hauginn með trollskap, Gullþ. 6, Karl. 241.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-skessa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-skessa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = trollkona.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-volkadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          troll-volkaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>witch-ridden,</i> = trollriða.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trolla-gangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trolla-gangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a troll-haunt,</i> Grett. 148 new Ed., Fms. ii. 185, x. 330, Ó. H. 187.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trolla-gros"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trolla-grös
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl., botan. <i>lichen rangiferinus,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trolla-hlad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trolla-hlað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a troll’s building, Cyclopic works, a giant’s causeway.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trolla-saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trolla-saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a tale of giants and trolls,</i> with the notion of coarse and vulgar fiction.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trolla-slagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trolla-slagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a song, see Lex. Runic.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trolla-urt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trolla-urt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., botan. <i>‘troll’s-wort,’ louse-wort, rhinanthus pedicularis,</i> Hjalt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
