        >
          tryggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>tryggva,</strong> ð, <i>to make firm and trusty;</i> at þeir tryggvi sættir sínar, Ó. H. 90; trygðu þeir Þórir þá sættir með sér, Eg. 169; þá frændr mundi seint at tryggja, 227; aldrei verðr tóan tryggð, a saying; or aldrei tryggist tóa, þó tekin sé úr henni róa, Hallgr.; er ek hræðumk at oss hafi ekki vel tryggt hafnirnar, Fms. viii. 328: <i>to ensure,</i> skeyta ok t., hón (the estate) var tryggð ok skeytt undir mik ok minn ættlegg, N. G. L. ii. 99, Munk. 79; t. e-m eign, D. N. i. 80; tryggja trygðir, N. G. L. ii: tor-t., q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tryggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., before a vowel tryggvan and tryggan; it was even sounded with <i>i</i>, as in Gothic, as is seen from rhymes, t<i>rigg</i>laust þ<i>rigg</i>ja, Haustl.; [Ulf. <i>triggvs</i> = πιστός]:—<i>trusty, faithful, true;</i> tryggr vinr, Ad. 10; trygg ok góð kona, Str. 15; t. höfðingi, Sks. 456; t. í trúnaði, Fms. vi. 52; þá mun fár vera tryggr, viii. 314; at eigi myndi allt tryggt vera, ix. 337; trygg ok staðföst ást, Str. 26; þú enn góði þræll ok inn tryggi, Hom. (St.); tryggr vinum ok frændum, Fs. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryggva-kaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tryggva-kaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= trygða-kaup, N. G. L. i. 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryggva-vattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tryggva-váttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., <strong>-vitni,</strong> n. <i>a faithful witness,</i> N. G. L. i. 223.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryggvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tryggvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a pr. name, <i>the Faithful,</i> Fms. i. (Ólafr Tryggvason); Sig-tryggr, Ú-tryggr, Tor-tryggr, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trygill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trygill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dimin. [trog], <i>a little trough, tray,</i> Ísl. ii. 350; blót-t., grautar-t., q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trylla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trylla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [troll; Dan. <i>trylde</i>], <i>to enchant, turn into a troll;</i> blótuðu þeir hann ok trylltu hann svá at hann varð engum mennskum manni líkr, Fas. ii. 242; þú þykki mér troll … ok væri þat svá at virða en trylla menn eigi, <i>thou art a troll</i> … <i>it would be better to put this construction upon it, and not call men trolls,</i> Ísl. ii. 366.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryllska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tryllska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>witchery, the being a witch,</i> N. G. L. i. 351.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryllskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tryllskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>bewitched, the being a troll</i> or <i>a witch;</i> ef konu er tryllska kennd, … skal hón hafa til sex kvenna vitni at hón er eigi tryllsk … ekki veldr hón því sjálf at hón er troll. N. G. L. i. 351.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryju-sodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trýju-söðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = trogsöðull, Grág. i. 175.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trýni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [trjóna], <i>the snout</i> of a dog, Fms. iii. 13; passim in mod. usage, hunds-trýnið; of a bear, Glúm. 330.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tryta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Ivar Aasen <i>tryta</i>], <i>to growl, murmur;</i> trýtti æ trönu-hvöt, Hðm.; the passage is somewhat corrupt, but the word is still used in Icel.; kerling trýtir æ sem tíðast at bera fyrir Thomam, bróður Christjan, þat er hón hefir bezt til, ertrnar, eplin ok ostana, Thóm. 360.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trytill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trýtill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a bird,</i> Ísl. Þjóðs. ii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trod-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tröð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. traðar, pl. traðir; [akin to troða]:—in the Norse, <i>a piece of fallow land</i> where cattle are kept grazing; ef maðr leggr tröð sína við akr eða eng annars manns, þá skal hann hverfa garði gildum um, Gþl. 407; af jörðu skal leggja fjórðung í tröð (trod Cod.), vetrar-myki alla skal reiða í tröð (treðe, v. l.) þar sem ómykjat er … en ef tröð er mykjat, N. G. L. ii. 110 (tröð, tröðin, i. 240, l. c.); this sense remains in ör-tröð, in ganga í ör-tröð, <i>a pasture overcrowded with sheep</i> or <i>cattle.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/trof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tröf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>fringes;</i> see traf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/troll-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tröll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and compds, see troll.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tronu-beina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          trönu-beina
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>‘crane-leg,’</i> a nickname, Rm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tuddi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tuddi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a bull</i> is in the east of Icel. called tuddi: hence <i>a mean fellow:</i> <strong>tudda-legr,</strong> adj. <i>mean, vile.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tudra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tuðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. in skinn-tuðra, <i>a flap of skin.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tuft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tuft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., see topt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tug-tugti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tug-tugti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>the twentieth,</i> Fb. ii. 469.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tug-tugu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tug-tugu
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>twenty,</i> D. N. ii. 67, 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tugga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tugga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n, f. [tyggja], <i>a chewed mouthful,</i> the word is freq. in mod. usage, but seems not to be found in old prose, although it occurs in poets (in poët. phrases), munins tugga, Gísl., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tugla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tugla-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see tygull.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>ten, decade;</i> as also in tví-tugr; see tigr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tumba"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tumba
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [a for. word; Fr. <i>tomber</i>], <i>to tumble,</i> Finnb. 352, Fas. iii. 503; þeir tumba báðir ofan fyrir fönnina, Háv. 9 new Ed.; hann tumbar af hestinum, Mag. 8, Bs. ii. 225, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tumi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tumi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a pr. name = Thomas, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>tynder;</i> Engl. <i>tinder;</i> Germ. <i>zunder;</i> early Dan. <i>tunder;</i> mod. Dan. <i>tönder</i>]:—<i>tinder,</i> Bs. ii. (in a verse), Fms. vii. 192, freq. in mod. usage: <strong>tundr-ör,</strong> f. <i>a tinder-arrow,</i> a burning shaft hurled in taking possession of land; for this heathen rite see Landn. 3, ch. 8, p. 193; cp. also Fms. vii. 192, where the tinder-arrow has magic power, like silver-buttons in mod. tales.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tundra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tundra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to ‘tinder,’ catch fire;</i> eldrinn tundraði skjótt, Fas. i. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tunga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. pl. tungna; [Goth. <i>tuggo;</i> common to all Teut. languages; cp. Lat. <i>lingua</i>]:—<i>a tongue,</i> Sól. 44, Grág. ii 11, passim: metaph. usages, hraðmælt tunga, Hm. 28; skæðar tungur, <i>evil tongues,</i> Nj. 264; hafa tungu fyrir e-m, <i>to have tongue for a person, be the spokesman,</i> Fms. vi. 223; harðr í tungu, Hallfred; skáldskapr var honum svá tiltækr, at hann kvað af tungu fram sem annað mál, Ó. H. 171; hann sá eld mikinn í tungna líkjum, Hom. 91; lof-tunga, <i>‘praise-tongue,’ flatterer,</i> a nickname.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tungl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tungl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Goth. <i>tuggl</i> in a gloss, to Gal. iv. 9; A. S. <i>tungol;</i> Hel. <i>tungal;</i> O. H. G. <i>zungal;</i> Swed. <i>tungel;</i> cp. also tingl]:—prop. <i>a luminary</i> (= Lat. <i>sidus</i>), which sense remains in the compd himin-tungl; in Icel. prose, ancient as well as modern, this word has altogether superseded the word ‘máni,’ which is only poetical.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tungl-aldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tungl-aldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>moon’s age,</i> a calendary term, Rb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tungl-aukan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tungl-aukan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>growth of the moon,</i> Rb. 428.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tungl-ar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
