              "__html": "and <strong>tottr</strong> (q. v.), a nursery word, <i>a tom-thumb,</i> cp. túta; tuttr litli, in the lullaby song of the giantess, Fas. ii. 234; cp. totr and tutr, Edda ii. 496: the word has therefore no relation to stuttr, like telpa qs. stelpa.",
            }
