          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [a word widely applied and common to all Teut. languages; the Goth. is not on record; A. S. <i>tûn;</i> Engl. <i>town;</i> O. H. G. <i>zûn;</i> Germ. <i>zaun;</i> Norse <i>tûn</i>]:—prop. <i>a hedge;</i> this sense is still used in the Germ. <i>zaun;</i> but in Scandin. the only remnant seems to be the compd tun-riða (see B).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tun-annir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tún-annir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>haymaking in the in-field;</i> um sumar um túnannir, i. e. in July, Eb. 248.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
