          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>two winters old.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tyggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tyggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "thus, not tiggi, as seen from rhymes, t<i>ygg</i>i, g<i>lygg</i>, h<i>nygg</i>r t<i>ygg</i>i, h<i>ygg</i> t<i>ygg</i>ja, Geisli 9, Lex. Poët.; [the word is therefore derived from tjúga (q. v.), toginn, (cp. Germ. <i>ziehen, ge-zogen</i>), and is akin to Germ. <i>-zog,</i> in <i>her-zog,</i> Lat. <i>duc-s</i>]:—<i>a leader, chief,</i> but only in poetry, Lex. Poët., freq. in old and mod. ballads.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tyggja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tyggja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>tyggva,</strong> Gkv. 2. 39), pres. tygg; pret. tugði; subj. tygdi; part. tuggit. A remnant of a strong inflexion is the pret. tögg, Fbr. 24; töggtu (2nd pers.), Am. 39; plur. tuggu (<i>mandebant</i>), Orkn. (Arnór, in a verse, MS.); part. tugginn: tyggja has since become a regular weak verb, like spyrja: [Dan. <i>tygge;</i> Engl. <i>to tug</i> at food]:—<i>to chew,</i> Lat. <i>mandere, manducare;</i> hvat er nú, dóttir, tyggr þú nokkut?—Tygg ek söl, segir hón, Eg. 604; tak pipar ok tygg, Pr. 475; töggtu tíðliga trúðir vel jöxlum, Am. 79; við hunang tuggin, Gkv. 2. 40; hann tögg með grimmum kulda-tönnum allar jarðir, Fbr. 24; tögg hold ok bein, Ann. 1362 (in a verse); eggin tögg af honum fætr báða, Úlf. 7. 74; úlfar tuggu hræ, Arnór; hræra sinn kjálka til at t. með, Stj. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tygi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tygi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>ga-teawa;</i> O. H. G. <i>ziug;</i> Germ. <i>zeug;</i> Dan. <i>töi</i>; Engl. <i>toy</i>]:—<i>gear, harness;</i> flestöll tygi þau er þeir höfðu átt, Fb. iii. 567; söðull með öllum tygjum, D. N. i. 321; þitt ess eðr tygi, Pr. 422; reið-tygi, <i>saddle-harness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tygi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tygi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [peril, a bad reading for rýgiligr]; t. orð, <i>haughty words, threats,</i> Bs. i. 653, 658 (but rýgiligr v. l. in both instances), Grett. 172 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tygill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tygill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. tuglar (like lykill, pl. luklar), a dimin.; [akin to tog; cp. Germ. <i>zügel</i>]:—<i>a string, strap, thong,</i> esp. of the strap with which a cloak was fastened round the neck; möttull á tuglum, Fms. vii. 201; tygill er menit var fest með, Ó. H. 135; á tuglunum taflpungsins var gullbaugr, Gullþ. 20; in Lv. 41 read, ok gullbaugr (for gullband) á tyglinum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tygja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tygja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to harness;</i> allir tyaðir panzerum, Fb. iii. 582; her-t., <i>to armour;</i> hertýjað, <i>clad in armour,</i> Ulf. 7. 111 (‘herdti að’ in the Edit.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tykta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tykta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, whence typta, Bs. i. 805, 846: [Germ. <i>züchtigen;</i> Dan. <i>tugte</i>]:—<i>to chastise,</i> H. E. i. 509.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tyktan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tyktan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>chastisement,</i> Stj. 167.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tylft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tylft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>tylpt,</strong> f. [tólf], <i>a number of twelve, a ‘duo-decade,’ dozen, a body of twelve,</i> Eg. 341, Nj. 150, Fms. viii. 140, Hkr. ii. 398; fernar tylftir, þrennar tylftir, of the courts, Nj. 150, 244, Grág. i. 4, 72 (twelve being a holy number): of the sea, tylft, <i>twelve miles,</i> Landn. 25, Rb. 482, Bs. ii. 5. <strong>tylftar-eiðr, -kviðr, -kvöð</strong> (see eiðr, kviðr, kvöð), Gþl. 121, 547, Js. 30, K. Þ. K. 168, Landn. 89.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tylla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tylla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [tolla], <i>to sit loosely;</i> tylla sér niðr; tylla sér á tá, <i>to stand on tiptoe.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tylli-saett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tylli-sætt
