        >
          tyrfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>tyri,</strong> n. <i>a resinous fir-tree</i> used for making a fire; með tyrvi eðr öðrum eldfimum viði, Sks. 427 B; lokar-spán af tyri, Fagrsk. 109; hence <strong>týru-tré,</strong> Fagrsk. l. c.; <strong>tyr-viðr,</strong> Hkr. i. 32, iii. 61; <strong>tyrvi-tré,</strong> Fms. vi. 153; cp. tjör-viðr; all various forms of the same = <i>tar-wood.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
