          className="link"
          href="/word/tyrfingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tyrfingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of the enchanted sword, Hervar. S.; prop. from its flaming like resinous-wood (tyrfi): a pr. name, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
