        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. (sounded tía), [akin to tæfa; Dan. <i>tæve;</i> cp. tóa]:—<i>a dam, mother with her young,</i> of a dog, cat, or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tyja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          týja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>tæja,</strong> <strong>tjóa,</strong> and <strong>tjá,</strong> the forms of this verb vary: <strong>tæja,</strong> t<i>æj</i>ar t<i>æj</i>a make a rhyme, Pd. 18; pres. tœr, pret. tœði, part. neut. tœð: <strong>týja,</strong> týr, týði: <strong>tjóa,</strong> pres. tjóar, pret. tjóaði or tjóði, see below B: and lastly, <strong>tjá,</strong> pres. té, tér (mod. tjái), pret. téði, part. téðr, téð: with neg. suff. tær-a, <i>does not,</i> Fms. vii. (in a verse): [Ulf. <i>taujan</i> = ποιειν; <i>tawidon</i> on the Golden horn; A. S. <i>tawjan;</i> O. H. G. <i>zawian;</i> Germ. <i>thun;</i> Dutch <i>touwen.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
