          className="link"
          href="/word/taegja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tægja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> pres. tæ, pret. táði, part. táð; [akin to tog, teygja]:—prop. <i>to ‘stretch out;’</i> tægja ull, <i>to pick</i> or <i>teaze the wool</i> before it is spun and carded; ullar-reitur eg um kveldið táði, Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
