            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>tœki</strong>), n. pl. [taka], <i>implements, outfit;</i> sel þú mér tæki at ek mega ríta, 623. 54; tól ok t., Stj. 22; arðr ok öll tæki at þeim arðri, Karl. 471: <i>means,</i> eg hefi engin tæki til þess.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeki-faeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæki-færi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>opportunity.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeki-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæki-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>due, proper;</i> t. tími, tíð, Stj. 429, Fms. ii. 142, MS. 623. 40; með-t., <i>acceptable.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>tœkr</strong>), adj. [taka], <i>acceptable, fair, legal,</i> of a tender made, Gþl. 500; þau handsöl er honum þykki tæk, K. Þ. K. í 70; þá eru tæk vitni þeirra, Ó. H. (pref.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [tól], <i>to manage;</i> faðir þinn þykkisk ekki mega um þik t. hér í híbýlum sínum, Eg. 194; var hann svá í lýzku ok athæfi, at trautt þótti mega um tæla, Fms. xi. 78, 92.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taela-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [tál], <i>to entice, betray;</i> t. menn með fjölkyngi, Clem. 56; t. þá með svikum, Fms. ii. 137; tæla þik, Sks. 537; tældr miklum tálum. Alm. 36; er Herodes konungr sá at hann var tældr af Austrvegs-konungum, Hom. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeli-grof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæli-gröf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a pitfall,</i> Sks. 42; B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taema"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>tœma</strong>), d, [tóm], in the phrase, tæma sik til e-s, <i>to give one’s leisure to, to attend,</i> Sks. 22, Stj. 144, Hom. 63; t. sik til at heyra Guðs orð, 656 B. 12; hann mátti eigi tæmask til frá kenningum við menn, <i>had no leisure, no time left,</i> Clem. 52; hugr tæmisk til hvíldar, <i>the mind takes to rest,</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taepi-djarfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæpi-djarfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>timid,</i> Fas. ii. 297.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taepi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæpi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>sparingly, scantily;</i> launa e-t t., Fas. iii. 8; ganga t. fram, 437: <i>scarcely,</i> það er t. svá mikit, Dan. <i>knapt.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taepi-tunga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæpi-tunga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘tip-tongue,’ lisping accent;</i> göra sér tæpitungu, <i>to lisp,</i> as in saying ‘telpa’ for ‘stelpa.’",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taepiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæpiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>scant, scarce;</i> hit tæpiligasta, Mag. 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taepr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæpr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>scant, too short, too narrow,</i> or the like; Kálfr gékk þá heldr tæpara, <i>stopped more cautiously,</i> Fb. ii. 360; ónýt er iðran tæp … ef þú í görðum glæp girnist að liggja, Pass. 8. 25; tók hann henni tæpt í mitt lær, Fas. ii. 234; spjótin tóku tæpt til hans, <i>the spears scarcely reached him,</i> Sturl. ii. 251: a path in the side of a mountain is said to be tæp: það er t. þriðjungr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taepta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæpta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [tæpr], <i>to tap, touch lightly, just reach with the point;</i> tæpti eg mínum trúar-staf á tréð sem drýpr hunang af, Pass. 32. 21; tæpta á e-u, <i>to utter faintly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [Dan. <i>tære;</i> Germ. <i>zehren</i>], <i>to consume, spend;</i> þú tærir út tveim höndum, Fms. xi. 423; t. penninga, Bs. i. 699: <i>to entertain,</i> konungr tók Sturlu vel ok tærði honum vel ok sæmiliga, Sturl. iii. 307.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. in the phrase, komast í tæri við e-n, <i>to come to have dealings with a person.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeri-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæri-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>cleanly, nice,</i> esp. as to eating.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeri-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæri-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>cleanliness, nicety.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeri-penningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæri-penningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>pocket-money,</i> D. N.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>pure, limpid,</i> of water; tært vatn, tær vatns-lind, lækr blár og tær, freq. in mod. usage, but not recorded in old writers; see tár.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/taeta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tæta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> (i. e. <strong>tœta</strong>), t, [akin to tó and tæja, or is it to be written tæta, from táta?]:—<i>to tear,</i> of wool, <i>to teaze</i> or <i>pick the wool;</i> t. sundr, <i>to tear to shreds,</i> the word occurs in Edda (in a verse), and is freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toenadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tœnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., <i>tœnað</i> and <i>bœn</i> make a rhyme, Likn. 8, Lil. 82; [tœja or týja]:—<i>help, assistance;</i> biðja tænaðar, Sturl. iii. 278; fullting eðr tænað, H. E. i. 502, Fms. x. 238, Bs. i. 215, 355; án manna tænaði, Mar. <strong>tænaðar-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a helper,</i> Stj. 157, Bs. i. 240.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see taða.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-alinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-alinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>fed on infield hay,</i> of a horse, Lv. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-annir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-annir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the season for mowing the infield,</i> beginning a little before the Icel. midsummer time, the middle of July, from the 12th to the 14th week of the summer, see Icel. Almanack; in 1872 it falls on the 13th of July; after the töðuannir follows the engja-sláttr, or mowing the open outfields, Nj. 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a stack-yard of infield hay,</i> Sturl. i. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-gjold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-gjöld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. a kind of <i>‘churn-feast’</i> in Icel., when all the infield-hay is dry, stacked, and housed, and a kind of porridge, called töðugjalda-grautr, is given with cream to the labourers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-gaeft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-gæft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>hay as good as if it were infield,</i> of hay grown in an outlying field.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-goltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-göltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a home-boar,</i> kept grazing at home, Fs. 141.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-verk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-verk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the making hay in the infield,</i> Finnb. 340.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/todu-vollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töðu-völlr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a manured infield,</i> Grág. ii. 259, Háv. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. tafar, [tefja], <i>a delay, hindrance;</i> mikil töf; vera e-m til tafar, <i>to be a hindrance to one.</i> <strong>tafar-laust,</strong> n. adj. <i>without delay.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tofl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töfl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [tafl], <i>a tablet, a piece in a game,</i> Fms. vi. 29, Fas. i. 285.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tofr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>töfra,</strong> <strong>töfrar,</strong> see taufr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tofring"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töfring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a delay,</i> D. N. v. 622.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toggla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töggla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to tug;</i> er tögglað hefir eyrendin fram, Skálda H. 7. 63; tögglast á e-u, <i>to harp on the same thing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/togr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tögr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>ten</i>, = tigr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tok-visi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tök-vísi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rapacity:</i> <strong>tök-víss,</strong> adj. <i>rapacious,</i> Hom. 19, MS. 645. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toku"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töku-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see taka.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tol-visi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töl-vísi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>skill in numbers, arithmetic,</i> Edda 110, Clem. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tol-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töl-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>skilled in arithmetic,</i> Clem. 33; as a nickname, Bjarni inn tölvísi, of a learned Icel. of the 12th century, Rb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>tealtjan;</i> Engl. <i>tilt</i>], <i>to ‘tilt,’ amble;</i> hence also <strong>tölt,</strong> n. <i>an ambling pace;</i> hóf-tölt, <i>‘hoof-tilt.’</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see tala.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolu-eyrir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölu-eyrir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an ounce’s worth on the standard of quantity</i> (not of weight), N. G. L. i. 244.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a teller;</i> nú eru eigi tölu-menn til, N. G. L. i. 49, 350.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolu-snjallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölu-snjallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>eloquent,</i> Róm. 325.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolu-sveinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölu-sveinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>chatterbox,</i> a nickname, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolu-verdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölu-verðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>worth counting, considerable,</i> Sturl. iii. 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tolugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tölugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>well-spoken,</i> Fas. iii. 269.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tong"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töng
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. tangar, pl. tangir and tengr: the gen. tangu, Þd., refers to a form <strong>tanga,</strong> u, f., dat. töngu, Sturl. i. 121 (vellum), but else töng; [A. S. <i>tanga;</i> Engl. <i>tongs;</i> Germ. <i>zange;</i> Dan. <i>tang;</i> cp. tangi]:—<i>a smith’s tongs;</i> tangir ok tól, Vsp.; dregit á með rauðum steini hamarr ok töng, fyrir því at smiðr var faðir hans, Þiðr. 98; hamar, töng ok steðja, Edda 9; tók Geirröðr með töng járnsíu glóandi, 61; skerðu til járnsins svá at vel megi ná með tönginni, … síðan tók Þormóðr töngina ok kipði braut örinni, Ó. H. 223; drógu tveir karlar beinit með töngu, Sturl. i. 121 (töng, Bs. i. 425, l. c.); eigi þykkjumk ek slíkar tengr séð hafa, <i>such tiny tongs,</i> i. e. <i>limbs so poorly knit,</i> Grett. 119; kalla má höndina long axla, Edda; tangar-armr, <i>the tongs-fork,</i> Þiðr. 96; spenni-t., klýpi-t., <i>‘clip-tongs,’ pincers:</i> in N. G. L. i. 349 for ‘töng’ eða reipi, read ‘taug’ eða reipi. <strong>tangar-hald,</strong> n. <i>a tongs-hold.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tonn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tönn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., this word (like nagl, q. v.) was originally a masc. <strong>tann</strong> or <strong>tannr,</strong> like maðr, mannr, of which gender there are remnants in pr. names, Hildi-tannr, gen. Hildi-tanns, Edda (in a verse); dat. Hildi-tanni, see hildr B; it then became fem. tönn, gen. tannar, dat. acc. tönn, gen. pl. tanna, dat. tönnum; nom. pl. tenn (as if from maðr), skakkar <i>tenn</i> rhymes with <i>menn,</i> Skíða R. 5, 9; litlar tenn, Al. 3; with article, tennrnar, Fms. xi. 139; brjóta tenn ór höfði manns, Grág. ii. 11; acc. tennar, Bs. i. 641, l. 21 (perh. an error); old poët. pl. <i>teðr</i> rhyming with <i>veðr,</i> Lex. Poët.; mod. plur. is tönnur: [a word common to all Indo-Germ. languages; Goth. <i>tunþus;</i> A. S. <i>tóð</i>; Engl. <i>tooth,</i> pl. <i>teeth</i>; O. H. G. <i>zand;</i> Germ. <i>zahn;</i> Dan. and Swed. <i>tand</i>; Lat. <i>dent-is;</i> Gr. ὀ-δόντ-ος]:—<i>a tooth,</i> including the sense of <i>tusk</i>; teðr hans, Eluc. 49; ór tönnum, Nj. 185; með tönnum, Eg. 233: phrases, glotta um tönn, or við tönn, <i>to grin scornfully,</i> Edda 30, Nj. 182, Ó. H. 114; rjóða tönn á e-m, <i>to redden one’s teeth, taste blood,</i> metaph. from a beast of prey; hefi ek nú nakkvat roðit tönn á þeim er ek tók höndum Hákon jarl, Ó. H. 32: allit., tönn ok tunga, hafa tönn og tungu á öllu, <i>to have tooth and tongue on everything,</i> of a quick-witted child learning to speak; tungan vefst um tönn, see tunga; tungan leikr við tanna sár, <i>the tongue touches on the tooth-wound,</i> a saying, Mkv.; tæja tanna, see tæja; fram-tennr, <i>the front teeth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tonnla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          tönnla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to attack with the teeth, backbite, quarrel;</i> … þér tönnlið ok upp etið hverr annan innbyrðis, Gal. v. 15; tönnlast og tyggjast, <i>to quarrel.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
