          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töttra-bassi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ragamuffin,</i> Glúm. 328.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/toturr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          töturr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. tötri, pl. tötrar; or better <strong>tötturr</strong> with <i>tt</i>, and so töttrar, Barl. 60, l. 5; töttrug, Hkv. 1. 43 (Bugge); <i>hvatt</i> and <i>tött</i>ra make a rhyme, Fms. vii. 153; [Engl. <i>tatters</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ubbi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ubbi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>Uffa</i>], a pr. name and a nickname, Skjöld. S., Skíða R.; Úlfr er ubbi var kallaðr, Fms. xi. 212.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/udr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          uðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a pr. name, = Unnr: as masc. Uðr, a son of the Night, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ugg-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ugg-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fearless, unconcerned, without apprehension,</i> Harms. 46: neut. ugglaust, as adv. <i>no doubt, undoubtedly, forsooth,</i> Rekst. 6, and freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ugg-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ugg-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [hence Engl. <i>ugly</i> (?)], <i>to be feared;</i> e-t þykkir uggligt, Fms. iii. 129, Greg. 25, Eb. (in a verse); þat þykki mér uggligt, at ek þurfa skamma hrið ráð at göra fyrir jarli þessum, Orkn. 418: in Fs. 22 read ú-glíkt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ugg-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ugg-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = uggligr, Fær. 116.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ugga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ugga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. uggi; pret. uggði; subj. yggði; imperat. uggi; part. uggat:—<i>to fear, suspect, apprehend;</i> ugga e-n, uggi eigi þú (<i>fear thou not</i>) Isungs-bana, Hkv. 1. 20; eigi uggi ek bræðr þína, Fas. i. 289; kann vera at þeir uggi oss, Rd. 226; ef maðr uggir. eigi andvitni mót, Gþl. 475; ugga sér e-t, <i>to apprehend;</i> ef hann yggði sér áljót eðr fjörrán, Grág. i. 493; þeir uggðu alls ekki at sér, <i>to apprehend no danger, be off one’s guard,</i> Nj. 252, Fms. i. 117, Ld. 262; er þat ugganda (gerund.), <i>it is to be feared,</i> Fms. ii. 286, xi. 98; þeim er ugganda (hugganda Cod.), at, = <i>‘metuendum est, ne,’</i> Hom. 13: with infin., ugga, at viðinn mundi skorta, Fms. vii. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/uggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          uggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a fin</i> of a rish; eyr-uggi, <i>a fore fin;</i> bak-uggi, <i>a back fin;</i> the word seems, strange to say, not to occur in old writers; cp. the following word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/uggidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          uggiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>uggaðr,</strong> part. <i>‘finned,’ provided with fins;</i> hjalt-u. (q. v.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/uggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          uggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>fear, apprehension;</i> mér er uggr á, at …, Fms. i. 285; hræzlu-uggr, Mar.; görðisk mönnum mikill uggr á um samþykki konunganna, Fms. vi. 221, x. 410; ala ugg of e-t, Edda (in a verse); ráða af hendi mér þenna ugg, Fms. i. 84: allit., með ugg ok ótta, Phil, ii. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/uggr-2"
