      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>Ulli,</strong> m. [akin to Goth. <i>wulþus</i> = <i>glory</i>], the name of one of the gods, the step-son of Thor, Edda, Gm. <strong>2. Ulli,</strong> a dimin. = Erlendr, Hkr. i, see Gramm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/um"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          um
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> an enclytic particle, see ‘of,’ p. 462, col. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/um-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          um
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>umb,</strong> <strong>of,</strong> prep. (sounded <strong>umm</strong>); <strong>umb</strong> is used in the oldest vellums (the Eluc., Greg., Miracle-book, Jb.), and occurs now and then in later vellums (e. g. Orkn. 218, Fms. x. 378, xi. 63, 64), perh. from being a transcript of an old vellum; in rhymes, <i>umb,</i> tr<i>umb</i>u, Fms. viii. (in a verse of A. D. 1184); for <strong>of</strong> see ‘of’ at p. 462, col. 2: [A. S. <i>ymbe;</i> Germ. <i>um;</i> um and yfir (q. v.) are identical.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/um-annan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          um-annan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>care about a thing, a looking after it,</i> Lv. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/um-band"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          um-band
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bandage,</i> Korm. 90, Ó. H. 219.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/um-bergis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          um-bergis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = umhverfis.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
