        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a charge, commission, administration</i> by a delegacy; hafa u. af eigandi, Grág. ii. 374; taka u. konungs, Fms. ix. 458; fá e-m u. sitt, Eg. 590, Ó. H. 105; göra e-t at umboði e-s, Ver. 31; stjórn ok u. af hans hendi, Eg. 18, Sd. 184 (of a minor’s property).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
