        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., esp. in plur. <i>repairs,</i> Gþl. 416; þurfa umbóta, Bs. i. 693: <i>a mending, bettering,</i> Fms. iv. 262, vi. 208, Sturl. iii. 3 C, Gþl. iv. (pref., where it means <i>an emendation</i>), <strong>umbótar-maðr,</strong> m. <i>one who mends matters,</i> Sturl. iii. 3, Fms. x. 110, Bs. i. 651.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
