              "__html": "n. pl. <i>a violent struggle, convulsion</i> (brjótask um), Finnb. 342, Fbr. 173: of physical changes, Sks. 148; sá ek þar búðar-toptir margar ok umbrot mikil, <i>I saw a great levelling,</i> i. e. <i>all turned upside down,</i> Nj. 162.",
            }
