        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the young</i> of a bird (Lat. <i>pullus</i>), Grág. ii. 347, Fms. vi. 153; fleygir ungar, Hom. 89; álku-ungi, Fs. 180; hænu-ungi, álptar-ungi, hrafns-ungi: also barns-ungi, dimin. <i>a little child, chicken.</i>",
            }
