        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘saying forth,’ pronouncing;</i> u. dóma, Sks. 646 B; uppsögu-váttr, Grág. i. 124: esp. a law term, <i>the public recital</i> (segja upplög) <i>of law by the Speaker,</i> in the Icel. alþing, which was to take place partly every year, partly every third year, Grág. i. 11; sem at kveðr í uppsögu, <i>as is said in the Speaker’s recital,</i> ii. 37; var þat uppsaga Þorgeirs, at allir menn skyldi vera skírðir á Íslandi, <i>it was Thorgeir’s ‘saw’</i> (i. e. <i>judgment, sentence</i>) <i>that all men should be Christians,</i> Bs. i. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
