        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>Upsala,</i> a famous town in Sweden, the residence of the king, and the central seat of the cultus of Odin, see Yngl. S. ch. 5 sqq., Ó. H. ch. 60; Uppsala-auðr, <i>the treasure of</i> U., <i>the public exchequer of the kings of Sweden,</i> Yngl. S. ch. 12, Ó. H. ch. 60; Uppsala-þing, 63, 64; Uppsala-lög, 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
