          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          út-leið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the outer course,</i> at sea, esp. along the shore of Norway, Eg. 78, Fms. i. 60, vii. 212, Ó. H. 75; opp. to innleið, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ut-leidis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          út-leiðis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>standing on the outer course;</i> snúa ú., Fms. viii. 186.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ut-leizla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          út-leizla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ‘leading out guests,’</i> i. e. a taking leave of them after a banquet; var veizlan hin vegsamligsta, ok útleizlan hin sköruligsta, Eg. 44: <i>a burial,</i> virðulig ú., Fms. ix. 245; jarðaðr með ágætri útleizlu, iii. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ut-lenda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
