        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a locality;</i> ok kveða ú rétt ok útmerki, <i>and name the dock and the place,</i> of a summons for launching a ship, Grág. ii. 400.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
