        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘out-north,’ north-west,</i> K. Þ. K. (Kb.) 36, Hb. 415. 12, Rb. 92, Sd. 156, Fs. 143, passim; opp. to landnorðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
