          className="link"
          href="/word/vaf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [vefja], <i>a wrapping, winding round,</i> in sí-vaf (see sí); var tekinn knífr ok vafðr … Þorsteinn stakk í augun knífinum upp at vafinu, Sturl. ii. 181: the phrase, vera mikill í vöfum, <i>to be bulky and heavy.</i>",
            }
