          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vafr-logi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘waver-lowe,’ flickering flame,</i> a mythical word; an enchanted princess or an enchanted land is surrounded by <i>a ‘waver-lowe,’</i> Edda (of Brynhild), Skm. 8 (of Skirnir and the giantess Gerda), Fsm. 32 (of Menglöd). In mod. Icel. legends, a kind of <i>ignis fatuus,</i> said to flicker over hidden treasures, is called either málmlogi or vafrlogi, Maurer’s Volks., Ísl. Þjóðs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
