        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vagar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vagar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vagir,</strong> f. pl. (from <strong>vög,</strong> f.), also <strong>vögur,</strong> pl. (from <strong>vaga,</strong> u, f.); pl. vegr, Fms. viii. 430: [vega; cp. vagn]:—a kind of <i>bier</i> or <i>hand-barrow,</i> the sing. being never used; tóku þau líkit ok lögðu í vagarnar, ok óku …, Nj. 153; Björn var úti á túnvelli ok smíðaði vögur (v. l. vagr, i. e. vagar), Eb. 90 new Ed.; tóku þeir hest ok lögðu á vögur, Bs. i. 335 (here the vagar seem to have been carried on horseback, as coffins are at the present day in Icel.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vagga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vagga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Dan. <i>vugge</i>], <i>a cradle;</i> fellr vaggan undir sveininum, Ld. 108; Guðríðr sat í dyrum inni með vöggu Snorra sonar síns, Fb. i. 545; börn í vöggu, Rb. 344; börn er þá lágu í vöggu, Fms. xi. 381, Am. 17, Str. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
