        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>watchfully,</i> Mar.: <i>on the alert,</i> Fms. iii. 189, Sks. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
