          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the rolling knuckle-bone,</i> Lat. <i>talus,</i> Gr. ἀστράγαλος; in Icel. these bones are dried and used for winding clews of yarn (þráðar-vala); in the old heathen times they seem to have been used for fortune-telling, whence the compds, <strong>völu-brjótr,</strong> m. <i>a knuckle-breaker,</i> a nickname, Sd.: <strong>völu-spakr,</strong> adj. <i>‘knuckle-wise’ prophetic</i> (?), Edda (in a verse): <strong>völu-mæltr,</strong> adj. <i>talking thick,</i> as if with a knuckle-bone rolling in one’s mouth: hvel-vala, <i>a rolling pebble,</i> Þd. (poët.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
