          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-gæfr-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., honum var vanngæft um fæðsluna, Sturl. i. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-gaett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-gætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>vann-g.</strong>), part. n., in the phrase, e-m verðr vanngætt til e-s, <i>difficult to keep</i> or <i>manage,</i> Fs. 93, Grett. 205 new Ed.; verðr mér vanngætt til skaps konungs, Ó. H. 114; vanngættra, 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-haefi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-hæfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [hóf], <i>difficulty, difficult management,</i> Fbr. 53, Korm. 81, Lv. 19 (vandæfi).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-haefr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-hæfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>difficult to manage,</i> Grág. i. 137, Glúm. 358.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-kvaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-kvæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. (speit <strong>vann-k.</strong>), <i>perplexity;</i> þetta v., Fms. iv. 199; vandkvæði vár, ii. 12; hitta, koma í vandkvæði, vi. 107, vii. 33; sitja í miklu v., Ó. H. 195 (vannqueði). Lv. 50; mesta v., Fms. viii. 146.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
