          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-laupr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a basket of wands (osier-twigs),</i> Stj. 247, 442, Greg. 6l, Post. 645. 86 (vannlaupr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fastidious, difficult to please,</i> Fms. vi. 386, passim in mod. usage; mostly in a good sense, <i>one who wants things to be well done,</i> ó-vandlátr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>vannliga</strong>), adv. <i>carefully;</i> gæta e-s v., <i>to watch closely,</i> Ó. H. 73; byrgja hauginn v., Fas. i. 387; læsa v., Eg. 239; spyrja v. frá e-n, 106; hvggja v. at e-n, 172, Nj. 6, MS. 623. 39, Sks. 19, Fms. vi. 216; hugsa vandliga, 400.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vand-lifr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vand-lífr
        </a>
        <p
