          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "vönd, vant, adj. <i>difficult, requiring pains and care;</i> nafn mitt er ekki vant, Fær. 208; er hverjum manni vandara at búa sik í konungs herbergi enn annars staðar, Fms. vi. 208; sýndisk henni vant at neita þessu boði, <i>it was a risk to refuse such an offer,</i> ii. 133, cp. vant; vant þykkir oss með slíku at fara, <i>a delicate thing,</i> Nj. 75; er hér ok vönd vistin, 61; vera vant við kominn, <i>to be in a perplexity,</i> Ld. 158; þeir sögðu vant at vera í stórum samdrykkjum, Lv. 24; bæði er, at ek trúi þér vel, enda er þér þá vant um, Fær. 92; vant er at vita hverir mér eru trúir, ef feðrnir bregðask, Fms. ii. 11: a saying, vant er við vándum at sjá (play on the words ‘vándr’ and ‘vandr’), Hrafn. 23; vant er ór vöndu at ráda; vant er vel boðnu at neita.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vandraeda-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vandræða-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without troubles,</i> Fms. ix. 425; skildu þeir allir vandræðalaust, <i>they parted without a quarrel,</i> Sturl. ii. 236.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vandraeda-likligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vandræða-líkligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>likely to cause trouble,</i> Fs. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vandraeda-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vandræða-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a troublesome person,</i> Fms. ii. 115, vi. 114, xi. 61, 78, Sturl. i. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vandraeda-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vandræða-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>troublesome,</i> Bs. i. 546.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vang-rod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vang-roð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a reddening of the field, a bloody fray,</i> Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vangi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vangi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., akin to vangr; [Ulf. <i>waggari</i> = παρακεφάλαιον; A. S., Old and North-west. E. <i>wang;</i> Germ. <i>wange;</i> O. H. G. <i>wanga</i>]:—<i>the cheek;</i> vangi is the whole side of the head, kinn the cheek; bleikt var hár bjartir vangar, Rm. 31; hann setti hnefann útan við vangann, Fms. ii. 330; hann leggr til hans í vangann ok út um annan, Al. 37; setr pústr undir hans vanga, Karl. 65; útan á kinnar vanga, Skíða R. 136; af mínum vanga, Kormak; Auðunn var högginn á vangann ok kinnina, Sturl. ii. 179; vanga högg, Fas. i. 60, freq. in mod. usage: ölr vanga, poët. = <i>the hair</i> (or <i>beards</i>?), Skálda (in a verse); vanga búnaðr, Stj. 396; vanga gull, 106, 136. <strong>vanga-filla,</strong> u, f. <i>the cheek-flesh,</i> Fb. i. 530, Fas. ii. 256, iii. 392.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>waggs</i> = παράδεισος; A. S. <i>wang;</i> Hel. <i>wang;</i> early Dan. <i>vang,</i> as in the ballad, Danmark deiligst <i>‘vang’</i> og <i>‘vænge’</i> lukt með bölgen blaa]:—<i>a garden, green home-field,</i> Edda (Gl.): in the allit. vé ok vangr, <i>house and home;</i> frá mínum vénm ok vöngum, <i>from my hearth and home,</i> Ls. 52; þar var arnar-flaug of vangi, Edda (in a verse); hún-vangr, <i>‘ship-field,’</i> i. e. <i>the sea</i>, Eb. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vani"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vani
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a custom, usage;</i> eptir vana, Fms. i. 76; forn lög ok vani, viii. 277, v. l.; háttr ok vani, Stj. 1; eiga vana til e-s, <i>to use,</i> Þorf. Karl. i. 404; lands-v., <i>the custom of the land;</i> ú-vani, <i>a bad habit;</i> á-vani, <i>an inveterate habit.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaningi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaningi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Vanr or Vanir = the gods of that name], name of the god Frey, Skm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vanka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vanka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (qs. vakka or vafka?), <i>to rove, stroll about as if disturbed in mind:</i> part. <strong>vankaðr,</strong> of a sheep with <i>the turning disease;</i> also in scorn of a person, þú ert vankaðr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vanki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vanki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the turning disease.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vann"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vann-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in vann-liga = vandliga, vann-laupr = vandlaupr, vann-stilltr = vandstiiltr, etc.; see vand-.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vanning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vanning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [venja], <i>exercise, training,</i> Sks. 351, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vanr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vanr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. <i>Vaïnomoïnen,</i> the son of Ukko, in the Finnish poem Kalevala]:—<i>one of the gods, Vanir,</i> used in sing. of Njörd; kalla Vanaguð Vana nið eðr Van, Edda i. 260; nama goðbrúðr una Vani (dat.), Skálda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vanr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vanr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> vön, vant, adj., compar. vanari, superl. vanastr, <i>wont, accustomed;</i> vanr e-u, <i>used to a thing;</i> varg-ljóðum vanr, Hkv.; vígi vanr, Stor. 23; tungan er málinu vön, Skálda (Thorodd); vanr góðu brauði, Sks. 321: with infin., hann hafði jafnan vanr verit at matask í litlu húsi, Fms. i. 35; hversu mikill skattr er vanr at koma af Finnmörk, Eg. 70; ganga til sætis þess er hann var vanr at sitja, Ó. H. 66; vanan skatt, <i>the wonted tax,</i> Bs. i. 757; er hann var vanr at hafa, Sks. 228 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vansa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vansa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to do too little;</i> ofsa eðr vansa, N. G. L. i. 184.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vansi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vansi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>lack, want;</i> vansi matar ok klæða, Barl. 82; skort eða vansa, 70; v. trúar, Sks.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vanta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vanta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [vanr], <i>to want, lack:</i> impers. with acc. of person and thing, e-n (acc.) vantar e-t (acc.), engan penning vantaði á, Nj. 190; vantaði þá eigi hesta né aðra hluti. Fms. iii. 77; mundi vanta þrjú hundruð, x. 64; vantaði tvá hesta, Grett. 111 A; at hann skyldi heldr vanta fé enn aðra menn, Band. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vappa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vappa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [an assimilated form, akin to vafra], <i>to waddle,</i> Eg. (in a verse); vappaðu með mér, vala, a ditty.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [cp. vörr = <i>a lip</i>], <i>the raised edge of a shovel.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
