        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>being unfairly treated;</i> vanhaldinn, Sturl. i. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-hendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-hendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [hönd], <i>outstanding,</i> of a score or quarrel against one; in the phrase, eiga varhent við e-n.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-hluta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-hluta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; verða varhluta fyrir e-m, <i>to get an unfair share, be wronged,</i> Ísl. ii. 255, Fbr. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-hugi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-hugi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a precaution;</i> in the phrase, gjalda varhuga við e-u, <i>to beware of,</i> Sighvat, Fms. ii. 166, iv. 172, viii. 341, Al. 154.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-hygd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-hygð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>var-ygð,</strong> f. <i>wariness, watchfulness,</i> Jb. 407; gæta e-s með varhygð, Fms. ix. 279, v. l.; heldr hugleysi enn varhygd, ii. 68 (v. l. varygð); sögðu at varygð gengi til, viii. 409; gjalda varygð við e-u, vi. 42; til varygðar, Fbr. 101. <strong>varhygðar-samr,</strong> adj. <i>wary, cautious.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-karr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-kárr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>cautious, wary,</i> <strong>var-kárni,</strong> f. <i>wariness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-launadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-launaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>insufficiently rewarded;</i> eiga e-m varlaunat, <i>to be in debt to one,</i> Grett. 153 A, Nj. 181.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-leika"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-leika
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; verða v., <i>to be worsted in a game,</i> Grett. 107.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>wariness,</i> Fb. i. 301.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-leitad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-leitað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. n. <i>insufficiently searched;</i> hafa v. e-s, Eb. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-maeltr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-mæltr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>cautious in one’s language.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-nagli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-nagli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., better <strong>varr-nagli,</strong> with a double <i>r,</i> [for it does not come from vara, <i>to beware,</i> the pun in Fas. i. 15 being a poetical conceit; the word is rather derived from varra or vörr, q. v.]:—<i>the bung for the hole in a boat’s bottom;</i> chiefly in the metaph. phrase, slá varnagla við e-u, <i>to take precaution against a future leakage, a future emergency.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-ordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-orðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wary in one’s words,</i> Lv. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-reka"
