          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-skinnsólpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= vararskinnsólpa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-ud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-úð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., qs. var-húð, var-ygð, = var-hygð, Glúm. 368; með v., Róm. 267; til varúðar, Eg. 371; gjalda varúð við e-u, <i>to beware of,</i> Hkr. i. 50; varúðar bending, flótti, Fms. i. 10, Mar.; varúðar mál, <i>warning words,</i> Sturl. iii. 183 C. <strong>varúðar-maðr,</strong> m. <i>a man to be on one’s guard against.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/var-udigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          var-úðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wary,</i> Lv. 80; kyrrlátir ok varúðgir, Fb. iii. 447.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [varr], <i>to warn;</i> vara sik, <i>to be on one’s guard, beware,</i> Fms. viii. 288; vara þú þik svá. Hkr. i. 253; v. e-n við e-u, <i>to bid one beware</i> of a thing; íll dæmi vari oss við syndum, Hom. 97; Hrafn hafði varat hann við úfriðinum, Sturl. iii. 186 (úfriðinn Cod.); þú hefir þat ráð upp tekit er ek varaða þik mest við, Eg. 82; varaða ek ykkr bæði við at þit skyldit, Sks. 544; vil ek vara yðr við, at þér flytið hann eigi, Fms. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vara-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vara-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vörr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>vörun,</strong> f. <i>a warning,</i> Nj. 260, Sturl. ii. 241.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varanligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varanligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>endurable.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varar-feldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varar-feldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [in this and the following compds varar may be derived either from vara or better from vör (q. v.), denoting goods as they were sold in harbour]:—<i>cloaks marketable in the trade,</i> Grág. i. 500; hafskip kom af Íslandi, þat var hlaðit af vararfeldum, Hkr. i. 176, Nj. 7, Korm. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varar-skinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varar-skinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>skin current in trade;</i> vararskinns-ólpa, Lv. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varar-vad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varar-váð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = vöruváð, Gullþ. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-berg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-berg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>vaðberg</strong>). n. <i>a ‘watch-rock,’ outlook;</i> in the phrase, vera á varðbergi (mod. vera á vaðbergi) <i>to be on the look-out;</i> váru opnar dyrnar ok engir menn á varðbergi, Mar. (655 xxxi. A. 2).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-hald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-hald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a holding ward, keeping watch and ward;</i> vera á varð-haldi. Nj. 264; varðhalds ok varhygðar, Jb. 407: plur., hafa fjölmennt ok varðhöld mikil, <i>to keep good watch and ward,</i> Orkn. 300; hafa á sér styrk varðhöld nótt ok dag, Fms. ii. 31. Eg. 46, Ld. 170; tvenn varð-höld, 656 C. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-helgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-helgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a sanctuary, asylum.</i> Fms. i. 80, v. l. (= griða-staðr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-hundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-hundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a watch-dog,</i> Sturl. ii. 67 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a watcb-house,</i> Gþl. 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-karl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-karl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a watch-carle, warder,</i> Clem. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-klokka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-klokka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a watch-bell,</i> Fms. ix. 369. v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-lokkur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-lokkur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. [Scot. <i>warlock</i>], <i>‘ward-songs,’ ‘guardian songs,’ charms</i> (or better, <i>‘weird-songs.’</i> cp. the other form, urðar lokkur); hvárki em ek fjölkunnig né visinda-kona, en þó kenndi Halldis fóstra mín mér á Íslandi þat kvæði, er hón kalladi varðlokkur, Þorf. Karl. 378; from this word comes the Scot. <i>‘warlock,’</i> though it has changed its sense to that of <i>the wizard</i> himself.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a watch-man, warder,</i> Fms. i. 41, ix. 217, Eg. 88, 121, 284, Grág., Stj., passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-run"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-rún
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., poët. <i>a giantess, an enchantress,</i> Hallfred.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-veita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-veita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, prop. two words, varð (acc.) veita, i. e. veita vörð, <i>to give ‘ward’ to, hold, keep, preserve;</i> hence in the oldest writers the word is used with dat. (as the verb veita), varðveita fénu, Gþl. 227; v. börnum þeirra ok fé, 258; geyma þeim ok v., Stj. 99; v. þessum steini, Fms. viii. 8; v. öllum fjár-hlutum hennar, Gþl. 227.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-veiting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-veiting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a keeping, observance,</i> Sks. 770.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-veizla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-veizla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a <i>keeping, custody;</i> dæma e-m varðveizlu fjár, Grág. i. 84; til framfærslu ok varðveizlu, 62; fá e-m fé til varðveizlu, Nj. 111; varðveiziu-handsal, Sturl. ii. 202.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vard-viti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varð-víti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘ward-fine,’ fine for neglect on watch;</i> sekr um varðvíti við konung, Gþl. 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Germ. <i>warte</i>], <i>a beacon;</i> hann bað þá göra þar vörðu til minnis, Orkn. 208.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Ulf. in <i>fra-wardian;</i> A. S. <i>wardian;</i> Engl. <i>ward, warrant;</i> Germ. <i>warten;</i> Fr. <i>guarder,</i> etc.; cp. vara]:—<i>to warrant, guarantee, answer for;</i> esp. as a law term, björn ok úlfr, þeirra verk skal engi maðr varða, N. G. L. i. 45; varðar hann þat alls ekki nema við Guð, … varða orð ok verk fyrir e-n, Grág. (Kb.) i. 139; handsala-menn þá er varða vildi, at …, Sturl. iii. 43; ek vil at Flosi einn varði við mik, <i>I shall be my sole surety,</i> Nj. 256; vill hann sjálfr varða (<i>bail</i>) fyrir honum, Þiðr. 75; ef maðr kaupir man at manni, þá skal sa varða, er sölumaðr er, við stinga ok við stjarfa, N. G. L. i. 29; skal bóndi hverr einum húsum varða, at eigi falli krossar, 11; bú hans varðar taki, <i>is bailable,</i> 47; varða taki fyrir e-n, <i>to be bail for a person,</i> 48; varði lóð þar til lokit er, Gþl. 331: ok varða við hey sínu við hey hans. Grág. (Kb.) ii. 96 (Jb. 243); ok skal varða við engi því, Kb. ii. 94: ok svá skulu þeir við varða, Jb. 277; einyrkjar skulu varða fjögur þing. Gþl. 438; skal hann varða þeim af þessum eignum fulla lögskyld, D. N. iii. 88; sá vita-vörðr skal varða þrjár … örtugar, N. G. L. ii. 37; þess viðar er hann hafði áðr varðat fyrir sína hönd, <i>secured, bought,</i> Rd. 253.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ward, keeper.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>security,</i> K. Á. 208.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardhalds-engill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðhalds-engill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
