            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardhalds-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðhalds-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. n. <i>without custody,</i> 623. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardhalds-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðhalds-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a watchman,</i> Stj. 188, Fb. i. 283.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = varða: þeir hlóðu þar varða er blótið hafði verit, Landn. 28 (Hb.); var varði stórr fyrir ofan tjaldit, Dropl. 33; reisa hávan varða, Orkn. 208 (in the verse, the prose uses the fem.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., in pr. names, Há-v., Hjör-v., Sig-v., Þor-v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardveizlu-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðveizlu-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>watchless,</i> Grág. i. 278: <i>unguarded,</i> Hkr. iii. 287.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vardveizlu-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varðveizlu-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a warder, keeper,</i> Grág. i. 420, K. Á. 190.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-dropi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-dropi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘wolf-dropping,’ wolf’s cub:</i> as a law phrase, <i>the son of an outlaw</i> (of a vargr), Grág. i. 178, Sdm. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-hamr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-hamr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wolf’s skin;</i> taka á sig vargham, <i>‘to wear a wolf’s skin,’</i> i. e. <i>to be wolfish and wild,</i> Clar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-ljod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-ljóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>wolf-songs, wolf-howling.</i> Hkv. 1. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-skinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-skinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wolf-skin;</i> in vargskinns-ólpa, -stakkr, <i>a cloak of wolf-skin,</i> Fms. x. 201, O. H. L. 69.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-stakkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-stakkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a cloak of wolf-skin,</i> Bret. 32 (as worn by the old berserkers); þeir höfðu vargstakka fyrir brynjur, Fs. 17; cp. Úlf-héðinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the worrying tree, the gallows,</i> Hðm. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-ulfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-úlfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘worrying-wolf,’ were-wolf;</i> bisclaret í Bretzku máli en Nordmandingar -kallaðu hann vargúlf, Str. 30; v. var eitt kvikindi meðan hann býr í vargsham, id. This word, which occurs nowhere but in the above passage, is perhaps only coined by the translator from the French <i>loup-garou</i> qs. <i>gar-ulf;</i> ver-úlfr would have been the right word, but that word is unknown to the Icel. or old Norse, the superstition being expressed by eigi ein-hamr, ham-farir, hamast (qq. v.), or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-ynja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-ynja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [A. S. <i>wyrgen,</i> Beowulf], <i>a she-wolf,</i> Lat. <i>lupa,</i> Róm. 381, Hbl. 39, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varg-old"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varg-öld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an age of wolves</i> (i. e. <i>of wars and worry</i>), Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to soil;</i> better verga, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vargr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vargr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>wearg;</i> Hel. <i>warag;</i> the root-word is preserved in Germ. <i>er-würgen,</i> whence virgull, q. v., and Engl. <i>worry;</i> vargr and úlfr are said to be from the same root]:—<i>a wolf;</i> berr björn, bítr vargr, N. G. L. i. 341; riða á vargi, Hkv. Hjörv.; trollkona sat á vargi, Fms. vi. 403; marga varga, Nj. 95; vaða vargar með úlfum, a saying, Fas. i. 11; sem menn viðast varga reka (prop. allit. varga vreka), <i>as wide as wolves are hunted,</i> Grág.: sem vargr í sauða-dun, Sd. 164: poët. <i>of any beast of prey,</i> varga vinr, Hkv. 1. 6 (of ravens); hann barg fjörvi varga, Vellekla: the saying, sjaldan vægir vargrinn, <i>the wolf spares not;</i> vargarnir etask þar til er at halanum kemr, Band.; vargs-hamr, -hár, -hold, <i>a wolf’s skin, hair, flesh,</i> Str. 32, Fas. i. 199, Fms. i. 273; vargs-líki, -rödd, Edda 8, Fas. i. 130; varga flokkr, <i>a flock of wolves,</i> iii. 77; varga matr, i. 139; varga-þytr, <i>a howling of wolves,</i> 205: varga leifar, <i>a ‘wolf’s homestead’</i>(see leif), i. e. <i>the wood, the wilderness,</i> Gkv. 2. 11: in Icel. vargr is used of <i>the fox.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>wariness, caution,</i> Fas. iii. 268; bjóða e-m vara á e-u, <i>to bid one beware of,</i> Grett. 148 A; betri er fyrri varinn, <i>fore-thought is better than after-thought,</i> Fs. 65 (see the foot-note).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. = farinn, see fara (A. VI. 2. β); it occurs in the latest vellums of the 15th century, Fb. iii. 240, Fas. i. 121, ii. 83; freq. in paper transcripts; cp. Lv. 80, Ld. 266, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>valla</strong>), adv. <i>hardly, scarcely;</i> varla samir mér þat, Nj. 133; kunna varla, Grág. i. 28; varla mannhæð, Sturl. i. 118; gat valla vakit þá, Fms. i. 9; gat varla gengit, Njarð. 380, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>insufficiently;</i> vera v. haldinn, Gþl. 259.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>requiring wariness, safe,</i> of a thing; það væri varligra, <i>it would be safer,</i> Fms. ii. 64; þat þótti varligra at …, x. 79; má þat kalla eigi varligt, vi. 7; þat mun mér ekki varligt, vii. 114, Ísl. ii. 223, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varmi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>heat;</i> older form, vermi, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "vörm, varmt, adj.; [A. S. <i>wearm;</i> Engl. and Germ. <i>warm;</i> Dan. <i>varm</i>]:—<i>warm;</i> varmar bráðir, Hkv. 2. 41; varma dingju, Hornklofi; varmr beðr, Lex. Poët.; með vörmu vatni, Stj. 237; görði varmt vatnið, 623. 34; tak kött ok drep ok stikk hendi í hann er hann er v., Pr. 470; var honum varmt mjök, <i>he was very warm,</i> Nj. 95; svá at af klæða-yl mátti hann eigi heitr verða eðr varmr, Stj. 548. Warm is used of blood-heat, and is distinguished from heitr, in mod. usage it is not much used, being replaced by ‘volgr’ (see válgr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varn-kynna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varn-kynna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= várkynna, Norske Saml. v. 119. <strong>varn-kynd</strong> = várkynd, Norske Saml. v. 123, 141.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>wearnian;</i> Engl. <i>warn</i>], <i>to warn off;</i> v. e-m e-s (= varða e-m e-t), <i>to warn a person off from a thing, deny him a thing;</i> varna e-m liðveizlu, Korm. 206; varna þeim kaups, 218; v. þér réttinda, <i>to deny thee justice,</i> Fms. i. 82; vár honum þess varnat, vii. 261; v. Birni konungsdóms, v. 246; varna henni máls, Nj. 48, Band. 23 new Ed.; varna e-m bóta, Ísl. ii. 327; skal þér eigi þessa varna, Ld. 250; varna honum gjaldsins, Rd. 234; konungr varnaði þess eigi með öllu, Eg. 106; ek vii allra bóta v. um sonu þína, Korm. 48; ef hann varnar gjalds (<i>if he refuses to pay</i>), verðr hann útlagr, Grág. ii. 281; ef menn varna þess at ganga þar í dóm, 322; hvat ek gaf eða hvers ek varnaði, Fms. vi. 220: with dat. less right, v. e-m lögligri atvinnu, Fb. i. 437: ellipt., ok honum er varnat (viz. þess), Grág. i. 405; hinum varðar útlegð ef þeir varna, 439; hann beiddi heima-mönnum griða, ok varnaði Egils, kvað hann eigi heima vera, <i>and denied Egil, saying he was not at home,</i> Sturl. iii. 173.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnadar-ar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnaðar-ár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a term in the Icel. calendar, <i>a year to beware of, an irregular year,</i> = rímspillir, Rb. 508.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnadar-bref"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnaðar-bréf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = Dan. <i>leide-brev, a letter of protection, safe-conduct,</i> H. E. i. 432, ii. 91 (N. G. L. iii. 27).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnadar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnaðar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a warder, guardian</i> (Germ. <i>vormund</i>), Eb. 156, Fms. x. 293: <i>a trustee, delegate,</i> höfðingjar eða varnaðar-menn þeirra, iv. 284.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. <i>safeguard, protection, keeping;</i> taka mál þeirra á sinn varnað, Fms. x. 24; ek hefi þá menn á mínum varnaði (<i>in my keeping</i>) er yðr megu svá styrkja, at …, 655 xiii. B. 2; Guð er vörn ok v. saklausra ok meinlausra, Str. 29; varnaðar-skjöldr, <i>a shield of defence,</i> MS. 4. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a warning, caution;</i> ok er þat boðit til varnanar at kasta hein of þvert gólf, Edda 59; ok er þat fyrir því varnanar vert af …, <i>to beware of,</i> 41; um guðsifja varnan, N. G. L. i. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vörn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnar-adili"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnar-aðili
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the defendant in a suit,</i> opp. to sóknar-aðili (see aðili), Grág., Nj., passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnar-eidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnar-eiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-gögn, -kviðr,</strong> m. <i>an oath, evidence, verdict for the defence,</i> Grág. i. 55, 61, 78, Nj. 225.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>defenceless,</i> Al. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varnar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varnar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a defender,</i> Fms. v. 273, xi. 32, Fb. iii. 445, N. G. L. i. 88, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = vanaðr, <i>wares,</i> Eg. 159, 467 (of a cargo); vil ek at þú takir mjöl ok við ok slíkt annat sem þér líkar af varningi, Nj. 4; varnings skipti, Krók. 60 C; kaupmanna v., <i>a merchant’s wares,</i> Fb. ii. 274; reiða ok annan varning, Fms. iv. 372 (varnað, Ó. H., l. c.); hann fékk sér varning frá skipi, Fs. 63; kistu er í er varningr, Fms. vi. 272; v. í mjöl ok í malt, D. N.; stykki varnings, D. N. ii. 468; Hjaltlenzkr v., Munk. 33. <strong>varnings-tíund,</strong> f. a kind of <i>tithe</i> or <i>duty.</i> Lange’s Norske Klost. Hist. 378 (foot-note <i>n</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a casting, throwing;</i> munn-varp, á-varp (qq. v.), and-varp, <i>a sigh.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varp-net"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varp-net
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a casting-net,</i> D. N. i. 594.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varp-skufla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varp-skúfla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n, f. <i>a shovel,</i> N. T.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varp-timi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varp-tími
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the egg season</i> (May).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a cast, net,</i> Boldt 79, 104, D. N. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varpa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Engl. <i>warp;</i> see verpa], <i>to throw, cast,</i> with dat.; varpa frá sér sverðinu, Finnb. 316, v. l.; varpaði honum til helvítis, Barl. 135; hann varpar sér undan, Nj. 91; Grettir varpaði sér um völlinn, Grett. 95 new Ed.; varpaða ek mér upp ór söðlinum, Pr. 414; varpa frá sér kyrtlinum, Fms. iii. 101; hann varpaði (<i>hurled off</i>) veslinu ok mælti, vii. 20; hann varpaði nókkut svá hettinum, <i>threw the hood aside, tossing, his head,</i> id.; varpa öndinni, <i>to draw a deep breath, sigh,</i> Fb. ii. 426; ofn er ór sér varpaði óhæfiligum hita, Barl. 162; jarð-varpa, a law phrase, <i>to throw to the earth:</i> koll-varpa, á-varpa, qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varpadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varpaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a thrower,</i> Lex. Poët.: in compds, auð-v., etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varpi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varpi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an edge, outskirt;</i> in hlað-varpi, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "vör, vart, adj.; [Goth. <i>wars;</i> A. S. <i>wear;</i> Engl. <i>ware;</i> Germ. <i>wahr;</i> Dan. <i>var,</i> etc.]:—<i>ware, aware;</i> verða varr við e-t, <i>to be aware, of, learn, hear,</i> Fms. i. 27, Eg. 58; hlaupa í hús inn ok verða ekki við menn varir, 230; þeir verða við þat varir, at …, Lv. 7; áðr Rútr varð varr við, Nj. 8; varð hann varr af túlki hvat þeir töluðu, Al. 104; er þeir urðu þessa varir, Fms. iv. 309; göra e-n varan við, <i>to warn a person,</i> Fær. 248; göra vart við e-t, <i>to make a thing noticed,</i> Ísl. ii. 329; göra vart við sik, <i>to shew oneself</i> (= segja til sín), Eg. 79.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varr-bal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varr-bál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘sea-flame,’</i> i. e. <i>gold</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varr-simi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varr-sími
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a streak of water, the wake of a ship;</i> stóð topt eptir í varrsímanum, Fms. ii. 178; varrsíma bar fjarri, Edda (Ht.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varr-skid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varr-skíð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = <i>a ship</i>, Lex. Poët., Fær. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varr-skogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varr-skógr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>knotty wood</i> (?), cp. A. S. <i>wearr,</i> B. K. 55, or qs. vár-skógr = <i>wood-cutting in the spring</i> (?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varr-sugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varr-súgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [vörr], <i>the track in the wake of a ship,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = vörr, <i>water,</i> esp. <i>the wake of a ship,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (not vari), <i>the lymph</i> or <i>watery substance of the blood;</i> ef blóð lifrinn skersk … vatn er menn kalla varra … ef varri er mestr hluti í blóði manns, Hb. (MS.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vart"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vart
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [see varr], <i>scantily;</i> vart búnar, Am. 26: lítils vart tuttugu vetr, <i>little short of twenty winters,</i> Clem. 26: <i>scarcely</i> = varla, vart tvá mánaði, Þorf. Karl. 430; vari tvau hundruð, Fms. viii. 426; vart hálfan mánuð, Al. 122.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., perh. <i>the gunwale of a ship,</i> Edda (Gl.); bera rönd á úrga vörtu, Orkn. (in a verse); cp. vartari.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. gen. pl. vartna, Mar.; [A. S. <i>weart;</i> Engl. <i>wart;</i> Germ. <i>warze;</i> Dan. <i>vort</i>]:—<i>a wart</i> on the body, Mar.; þat tekr af vörtur, Pr. 473; hafa vörtu á kinninni, ef maðr hefir vörtu svo hvorki hyli hár né klæði né maðr sjái hana sjálfr, það er auðs-merki, <i>a wart that one cannot see oneself is a mark of wealth</i> or <i>good luck,</i> Ísl. Þjóðs. ii. 555; geir-varta, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vartan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vartan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the threads holding together the woof in a loom,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vartari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vartari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a thong, strap,</i> Edda 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varud-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varúð-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>warily,</i> Bs. i. 133.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/varzla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          varzla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "qs. <strong>varðsla,</strong> u, f. <i>a watch;</i> síðan þeim var v. vituð, Fsm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vas"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vas
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = vés, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vasadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vasaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vásaðr,</strong> m. <i>the wet and sleety,</i> the name of Winter’s grandfather, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vasask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vasask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to bustle, meddle;</i> þetta mál kemr ekki til þín, nema þú vilir vasask í með þeim, Nj. 227; ek vil ekki vasask í slíku, Ísl. ii. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vasi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vasi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Dipl. v. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vasi-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vasi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [from Swed. <i>vase</i> = <i>a sheaf?</i>], only remaining in the compd <strong>vasi-kanpr,</strong> m. <i>a ‘sheaf-beard.’</i> i. e. <i>a rustic, farmer</i> (cp. breiðskeggr); hversu sem vasikanpinum þótti, <i>however the rustics might like it,</i> Fms. viii. 59, v. l.; ér húsbændr, vasikanparnir! 234, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vask-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vask-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>bravery, valour;</i> vaskleikr ok karlmennska, Fms. xi. 80, Fas. ii. 404, Str. 3, Bs. i. 526, Art. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vask-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vask-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>valiantly;</i> skipa liði vóru sem vaskligast, Fms. vii. 131; jafn-vaskliga sem þú, 127; vaskliga fórtú enn, Valla L. 220; hljóp á bak vaskliga, Flóv. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vask-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vask-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>valiant;</i> vaskligr maðr, Nj. 118, Eg. 568; inn vaskligi riddari, Ld. 78; maðr mikill ok styrkr, v. sýnum, Fms. vii. 238; allra manna vaskligastr, 199, 327; vænn ok inn vaskligsti, xi. 152, Njarð. 368; enir vaskligstu menn, Fas. ii. 509.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>wascan;</i> Engl. <i>wash;</i> Germ. <i>waschen;</i> Dan. <i>vaske</i>]:—<i>to wash,</i> but rare or at least hardly used in Icel., having been superseded by þvá, q. v.; in Dan. and Swed. it is freq.; in the Sagas only of washing the head with a kind of soap, see lauðr; vaska sér, <i>to wash one’s head,</i> Vígl. 30 (cp. the verse l. c.); vaska honum betr, Ísl. ii. 334, Bjarn. 68; þveginn ok vaskaðr, Sks. 362; vaskaði dasi, er ek dró þessa ár at borði, <i>the laggard had his head washed,</i> i. e. <i>sat snug at home, whilst I pulled this oar,</i> Fs. (in a verse); in all these instances of the head: metaph., vaska e-n í orðum, <i>to wash one in words,</i> MS. 4, 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "vösk, vaskt, adj.; [origin uncertain, prob. from verr = <i>a man</i>]:—<i>manly, valiant;</i> þú ert maðr vaskr ok vel at þér (of Gunnar), Nj. 49; margir verða vaskir í einangrinum, þó at lítt sé vaskir á milli, Eb. 60; Þórarinn mun vera enn vaskasti maðr, en slys mun þat þykkja er hann hjó hönd af konu sinni, id.; vaskr í vápnum, Str. 1; með enum vöskustum, Al. 136; þú ert enn vaskasti maðr, en Hákon er enn versti maðr, Fb. i. 142; Davíð var manna vaskastr til vápna, Sks. 686; hvat ek veit, segir Gunnarr, hvárt ek mun því úvaskari maðr enn aðrir menn sem mér þykkir meira fyrir enn öðrum mönnum at vega menn, Nj. 85.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vasla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vasla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vazla,</strong> að, <i>to wade in water.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vast,</strong> n. <i>a botch;</i> öllum þykir þetta vast, Skáld H. (fine).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vastra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vastra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to make a botch,</i> prob. qs. vafstr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. vötn; vant occurs in N. G. L. i. 363: the gen. sing. is, agreeably with the pronunciation, in old vellums invariably spelt <strong>vatz</strong> or <strong>vaz,</strong> vazt, Clem. 148, l. 32; the mod. sound is vass; in the Editions, however, the etymological form vatns has mostly been restored; all the South Teut. languages use a form with an <i>r</i>. The form <strong>vatr</strong> only occurs in two instances, perhaps used only for the rhyme’s sake, in hva<i>tr</i> vá<i>tr</i>i, a poem of the beginning of the 12th century; and hélt und <i>vatr</i> enn <i>vitri</i>, Sighvat; but v<i>at</i>n v<i>it</i>ni in another verse cf the same poet: [A. S. <i>wæter;</i> Engl. and Dutch <i>water</i>; Hel. <i>watar;</i> O. H. G. <i>wazar;</i> Germ. <i>wasser;</i> cp. Gr. υδατ-ος; Lat. <i>udus:</i> on the other hand, Icel. vatn; Swed. <i>vatten;</i> Dan. <i>vand,</i> qs. <i>vadn.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatn-fasta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatn-fasta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, <i>to fast on water,</i> K. Á. 78.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatn-thrunginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatn-þrunginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dropsical,</i> Thom. 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to water;</i> er allri hennar hjörð var vatnað, Stj. 171; vatna hestum sínum, Sturl. iii. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatnan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatnan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a watering,</i> = vatnfasta; vötnunar nótt, H. E. ii. 188.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [vega], <i>to lift;</i> er þú vattar streng, Lv. 100; hence the mod. járn-hatta, qs. járn-vatta, <i>to lift</i> (a heavy thing) <i>above one’s head, holding it with straight arms,</i> eg járn-hattaði hann.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vattar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vattar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vöttr, <i>a gauntlet.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vatz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vatz-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "the common spelling of vellums for vatns-, see vatn B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>weax;</i> Engl. <i>wax;</i> Germ. <i>wachs;</i> Dan. <i>vox</i>]:—<i>wax;</i> bráðna sem vax við eld, Rb. 356; steypa heitu vaxi í andlit sér, Fms. vii. 30; líkneski ór vaxi á innsigli, Eluc. 18; tvær merkr vax (gen.) fyrir eyri, Grág. i. 213, 504, Fms. vi. 153; vilju vér þakka öllum þeim mönnum er hingat hafa flutt lérept, lín, vax eðr katla, viii. 250.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax-blys"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax-blys
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wax-torch,</i> Bs. i. 804.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax-kerti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax-kerti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wax-candle,</i> Fms. v. 339; vaxkerta-ljós, Bs. i. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax-ljos"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax-ljós
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wax-light, taper,</i> Fb. ii. 390, K. Þ. K. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax-spjald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax-spjald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wax-tablet,</i> for writing, Lat. <i>cera,</i> Bs. i. 848; fá mér nú vaxspjöld mín, <i>give me my wax-tablets!</i> (of Sturla the historian), Sturl. iii. 307; lét Þorgils rita á vaxspjaldi ok sendi konungi, 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax-tollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax-tollr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a tithe in wax,</i> payable to a church; af þrem bæjum hálfan v., Vm. 35: = the mod. ljóstollr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vax-verd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vax-verð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the price of wax,</i> D. N. iv. 77.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaxa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaxa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. vex, pl. vöxum; pret. óx, pl. óxu, mod. uxu; subj. eyxi or yxi, which is the mod. form; imperat. vax; part. vaxinn: with the <i>v,</i> vóx, vóxu, vyxi: with suff. neg. vax-at-tu, <i>wax thou not,</i> Edda (in a verse): [Ulf. <i>wahsian, wobs,</i> = αὐξάνειν; A. S. <i>weaxan;</i> Hel. and O. H. G. <i>wahsan;</i> Engl. <i>wax;</i> Germ. <i>wachsen;</i> Dutch <i>wassen;</i> Dan. <i>voxe;</i> Swed. <i>wäxa;</i> cp. Gr. αὐξάνειν; Lat. <i>augere;</i> and Icel. <i>auka,</i> q. v.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaxt-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaxt-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fruitful,</i> Al. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaxta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaxta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see in gjaf-vaxta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaxtar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaxtar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen., see vöxtr, <i>growth.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaztir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vaztir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl., i. e. vatztir, not vastir, for <i>vazta</i> rhymes with b<i>azt</i>an, Edda; in sing. vözt, Edda (Gl.) i. 574: [from vatr = vatn]:—<i>a fishing-bank,</i> = mið; á þær vaztir (thus Cod. Reg., vastir Worm.) er hann var vanr at sitja, Edda i. 168; sitja á vöztum ok hafa vað fyrir borði, N. G. L. i. 65; finna hval á vöztum, 60; þenna dag var Ingjaldr róinn á vastir (late vellum), Gísl. 48; vazta (gen. pl.) undirkúla, Edda i. 350 (cp. the verse); hrein-vaztir, poët. <i>the reindeer’s abode, mountain,</i> Skálda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. = vrá, <i>a cabin, nook,</i> Hm. 25, Skv. 3. 29, Eb. 73 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>vó, vo</strong>), f. n., gen. vár, 655 i. 2; [A. S. <i>wâ;</i> Engl. <i>woe</i>]:—<i>woe, calamity, danger;</i> þat er lítil vá, <i>‘tis no great harm,</i> Hkv. a. 3, Hkr. i. 114 (in a verse); þú vaktir vá mikla, <i>thou workest mickle woe,</i> Am. 77; vá víkinga, <i>the woe of vikings,</i> Fms. xi. (in a verse); in prose only used in phrases or sayings, ok sofi yðr þó eigi öll vá héraðs-mönnum, Eb. 160: e-m bregðr vá fyrir grön, <i>a woe passes by one’s beard, to suffer a shock</i> or <i>a sudden fright;</i> brá þeim vá fyrir grön er þeir sá Birkibeina, Fms. viii. 350, v. l.; þá er oðrum vá fyrir dyrum er óðrum er inn komin, <i>woe is it at one’s own door when it had entered the neighbour’s house,</i> = Lat. <i>tua res agitur…,</i> Grett. 113 A; allit., vá ok vesöld, <i>woe and misery,</i> Stj. 40. Barl. 36, 61, 125; getnir til vár ok vesaldar, 655 i. 2;, see vár-kunn, vár-kynna.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-beida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-beiða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., found in but two instances, and possibly only a corruption of vádáði, [cp. A. S. <i>weâ-dæð</i>], <i>an evil-boding monster;</i> görit svá vel, skerit vábeiðu þessa (v. l. troll þetta), Eb. 116 new Ed., where it is spelt with <i>y,</i> but wrongly, as is seen from the parallel passage in a vellum of Eg. (in a verse), where the word also occurs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-brestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-brestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘woe-crash,’ a sudden crash</i> or <i>sound</i> in the earth or in the air, thought to bode strange and evil tidings, Fbr. 147; cp. Glúm, ch. 21, Ann. 1238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-bol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-böl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an affliction;</i> í sóttum eðr öðrum vábölum, 655 xi. 1; af ymsum vábölum sem verða kann, dýrbiti eðr öðru, Ó. T. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-fallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-fallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>making a dangerous fall, tottering.</i> Eg. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-folald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-folald
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. and <strong>vá-foli,</strong> a, m. <i>a vicious horse,</i> Nj. 168.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-gestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-gestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘woe-stranger,’ terrible stranger,</i> appearing all of a sudden like a wolf among sheep, Grett. 133 A, Fms. vii. 110, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-glati"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-glati
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>destruction, harm;</i> hvat sem e-m verðr at váglata (= váða), Grág. i. 431.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>undoubted, certain,</i> Geisli, Sighvat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>woful, awful, terrible;</i> kona váliga, Am. 52; snák váligrar brákar, Fms. vi. 362: <i>wicked,</i> in the phrase, spyrja er bezt til váligra þegna, <i>wicked men are best to hear of, not to see,</i> i. e. <i>the farther off the better,</i> Njarð. 370.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-litid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-lítið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. <i>harmless, doing small harm,</i> Ls. 33, Sturl. i. 21 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-ljugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-ljúgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = vánljúgr, <i>a disappointment;</i> nú er er mér orðinn v. at þeim átrúnaði, Fms. ii. 151: of a person, <i>‘hope-belying,’ disappointing hope.</i> Ad.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-lyndi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
