        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>shiftiness, fickleness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shifty;</i> válynd veðr, Vsp., cp. Sól. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-sjaldan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-sjaldan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>very seldom, rare indeed,</i> Sks. 318 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-skapadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-skapaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a <i>‘woe-shaper,’ woe-maker, the terrible,</i> Hým.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-skeyttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vá-skeyttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part., qs. var-skeyttr, van-skeyttr, a law phrase, <i>unconveyable, untransferable:</i> hence <i>fickle, shifty,</i> váskeytt er annars vinátta, a saying, Gþl. 61; þar er eigi váskeyttr vili sá er ymsu vindr fram, 677. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/va-stigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
