        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a case of cloth;</i> skinnbeðir, hægindi váðbeðr, Dipl. iii. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
