              "__html": "adj. <i>fraught with peril,</i> Fms. ix. 263, v. l.; var váðvænt at upp mundi reka, Bs. i. 320; strauma váð-væna, <i>dangerous currents,</i> Orkn. 406.",
            }
          }
        />
