          className="link"
          href="/word/vadi-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          váði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (<strong>vóði, voði</strong>), [prop. derivative from vá; Dan. <i>vaade</i>]:—<i>a danger, peril,</i> of extreme sudden danger; stýra til váða, Ó. H. 136, Fms. vii. 145; mér þykkir við váða búit, ef vér verðum rangsáttir, Ó. H. 92; heldr við váða, 168, Fms. ii. 116; þat var við váða sjálvan, vii. 64.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vafa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          váfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a ghost, spectre, shade,</i> Grett. 112 A; very freq. in mod. usage, but sounded <strong>vofa,</strong> Ísl. Þjóðs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vafa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          váfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "váfi, váfði; ófir = váfir, Pd. 3; (later <strong>vófa,</strong> mod. <strong>vofa</strong>):—<i>to swing, vibrate to and fro;</i> belgr váfir, Hm. 135; ef ek sé á tré uppi váfa virgil-ná, 158; ván mín váfir, <i>my hope wavers,</i> Fms. vii. 115 (in a verse); sá váfði milli himins ok jarðar, Post.: still used in the phrase, e-t vofir yfir, <i>is imminent,</i> of danger; cp. þó man ek yðr þat er yfir ófir, þegjum nú, segja, <i>then I will tell thee what is impending, though now I am silent,</i> Pd. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vafudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          váfuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the waverer,</i> one of the names of Odin, Gm., Edda; örváfaðr, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vafur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          váfur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>a wavering, tottering gait,</i> Eg. (in a verse); elli-váfur, see elli.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. (<strong>vóg, vog</strong>), [Germ. <i>wage</i>], <i>scales, a balance;</i> einar vágir skulu ganga uni land allt, Jb. 376; pundara né aðrar vágir, Gþl. 526; hann biðr Gilla taka vágina, Ld. 30; skipta með vágum, Fms. vi. 183; réttri vág, Al. 46; vág ok mæling, Stj. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the running of matter,</i> from a sore, Nj. 244, Bs. i. 319.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-gardr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-garðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a dyke,</i> D. I. i. 512.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-griss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-gríss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(sounded <strong>voggrís</strong>), m. <i>a small pimple.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-marr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-marr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wave-steed, ship,</i> poët., Skv. 2. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-meri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-meri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘wave-mare,’</i> a kind of <i>flounder.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-nagli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-nagli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>the core in a boil.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-rek"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-rek
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [the <strong>vág-</strong> may be but a popular attempt at etymology or a misapprehension of an older form vrek or vrak, cp. ‘quae cognominantur lingua Danica <i>wrech</i>,’ Thork. Dipl. i. 3; ‘wrek quoque quod specialiter nobis in toto regno retinuimus,’ 97; vágrek and reki (q. v.) would then be two forms of the same word, onlv that in the Icel. law the former word is used in a more special sense]:—in law phrase, <i>a ‘wave-wreck,’ flotsom;</i> þat heitir v. er kemr á land, manns-lík eða vara, eða fé, eða skipviðr, Grág. ii. 387; heita láta þeir v. er minnr er fjarat frá skutstafni, Ld. 76; skip braut … í Danmörk, Danir tóku upp fé allt ok kölluðu vágrek, Fms. i. 153; of hvalreka ok vágrek, Grág. ii. 212, 359, 389, Post. (Unger) 155.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-skorinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-skorinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>seamed with bays,</i> of a coast, Eg. 117, Hkr. i. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-theystr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-þeystr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>wave-sprayed.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vag-thrystr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vág-þrýstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘wave-pinched,’</i> of the planks of a ship, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaga-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vága
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, spelt <strong>vóga</strong> or <strong>voga</strong>; [Germ. <i>wagen;</i> Dan. <i>vove</i>]:—<i>to dare, venture;</i> þann þótti mikit voga, Bs. i. 868 (Laur. S.); þó skal nú nokkut til voga, Grett. 157 new Ed.; þó skal nú þar til voga, 143 A; menn hafa opt vogat við slíkan liðsmun, 72; at þú vogir at berjast við þá, Fas. i. 450 (paper MS.); the word is freq. in mod. usage, but hardly older than the 15th century.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vagan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vágan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vogan,</strong> f. <i>hazard, risk.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vágr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [no doubt different from the preceding word, prob. qs. vargr, absorbing v<i>a</i>r into v<i>á</i>: O. H. G. <i>warag;</i> mod. H. G. <i>ware, wærch,</i> Schmeller; Dan. <i>voer</i>]:—<i>matter,</i> from a sore; vella vági ok hryfi, Stj. 344; freyddi ór upp blóð ok vágr, Ísl. ii. 218; vágs litr, 677. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vagr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vágr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Ulf. <i>wegs</i> = σεισμός, pl. <i>wegos</i> = κύματα; A. S. <i>wæg;</i> Engl. <i>wave;</i> Dan. <i>vove;</i> Germ. <i>wogen;</i> the root word is vega, <i>to stir</i>]:—<i>a wave, sea;</i> but in this sense obsolete except in poetry; vind ek kyrri vági á, Hm. 155, Alm. 25; vágr vindlauss, <i>a windless wave,</i> Ýt.; þau á vági vindr of lék, Gkv. 1. 6; róa á vág, Hým. 17; vágs róði, Stor.; vágs hyrr, <i>‘wave-flame’</i> i. e. <i>gold,</i> Bragi: in prose the allit. vindr eða vágr, N. G. L. i. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vags-botn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vágs-botn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the bottom</i> or <i>bight of a bay,</i> Fms. vii. 184, viii. 126.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vags-bru"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vágs-brú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>Bay-bridge,</i> a local name, Fms. ix.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vakr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vákr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adj. [A. S. <i>wâc;</i> early Dan. <i>vaak;</i> cp. veykr], <i>weak</i> = veykr; íss mjök vakr, Fb. i. 235, Hb., MSS.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vala-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vála
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. <strong>vola,</strong> <i>to wail,</i> Barl. 20; veinandi ok válandi, Hom. 144.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>volæði,</strong> [prob. contr. = A. S. <i>wædl</i> = <i>ambitus,</i> and hence <i>begging, poverty</i>]:—<i>woe, misery, destitution;</i> taka barn af válaði, Ísl. ii. 326; þann svein hafði Eyvindr tekit af válaði, Hrafn. 25, Bs. i. 299; látum eigi hug várn styggjask við válað þeirra, Greg. 46; ok væri honum úkunnara válaðr hans, 24; ganga á válað, <i>to go begging,</i> Mag. 150; kennda ek þat váloðum, at þeir fagnaði válaði sínu, Post. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>wretched;</i> einn v. maðr hét Lazarus, Greg. 22, 46; þá komsk við inn válaði, Fms. vi. 234, viii. 251; slíkt er válaðs vera, Hm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a wailing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valgna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válgna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, i. e. <strong>volgna,</strong> <i>to become warm,</i> Fas. i. 84, passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., or better <strong>valgr,</strong> sounded <strong>volgr;</strong> [this word, so freq. in mod. usage, is not found in old writers (Fas. i. 84 is a paper MS.); they always use fjálgr (q. v.), identical in sense, but unknown in mod. Icel.; the mod. form, glóð-volgr, <i>ember-hot,</i> exactly answers to glóð-fjálgr’ of the Ýt.; in-fjálgr, Hkv., must be a false reading for ú-fjálgr = <i>ofjelg,</i> a word frequent in the mod. Norwegian dialects, meaning <i>‘un-warm,’</i> i. e. <i>cold, chilly, dismal,</i> see Ivar Aasen; in A. S. <i>wealg</i> occurs in a single instance, viz. in Gregory’s Pastorale of King Alfred, edited by Mr. Sweet]:—<i>warm, luke-warm;</i> en með því þú ert volgr, og hvorki kaldr né heitr, mun ek út-skirpa þér af mínum munni, Rev. iii. 16; it is in rendering this very passage that king Alfred (l. c.) uses <i>wealgh,</i> so there can be no doubt as to the identity of the A. S. and Icel. word: passim in mod. usage, volg mjólk, volgt blóð, glóð-volgr, spen-volgr; spenvolg mjólk, <i>milk warm from the cow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>volk,</strong> n. <i>a ‘walking’ tossing to and fro,</i> esp. on sea; hitta í storma eðr válk, Jb. 390; at eigi létti váru válki fyrr enn þat er útbyrðis, Fas. ii. 516; hann þolði í þessu válki hungr ok kulda, Fms. viii. 18; vás ok válk, Stj. 514: metaph. <i>worry,</i> válk ok vandræði, Al. 105: válka ok vandræða, N. G. L. i. 445, MS. 4. 13; háskum ok válkum, Sks. 634: sjó-válk, <i>sea-tossing;</i> hand-válk, <i>crumpling between the hands.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>volka</strong>), að, [A. S. <i>wealcan;</i> Engl. <i>walk;</i> Germ. <i>walken</i>]:—prop. <i>to roll</i> or <i>stamp,</i> but usually metaph.; Guð bölvi þér, at þú válkar mik svá lengi, MS. 4. 18; eigi hæfir gömlum karli at válka svá væna mey, Fas. iii. 62.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/valaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          válæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>volæði,</strong> n. <i>misery,</i> = válaðr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vama"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          váma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [cp. Dan. <i>væmme</i> = <i>to loath, væmmilig</i> = <i>loathful</i>], <i>a qualm, ailment;</i> þá hóf af mér allar vámur, Sturl. ii. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vamr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vámr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., <i>vómr</i> rhymes with <i>dómi,</i> Ísl. ii. 50 (in a verse): <i>a loathsome person,</i> a word of abuse, Edda i. 532; vöndr hrökk, vámr lá bundinn, Fms. vii. 356 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/van-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ván
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>vón, von</strong>), f., old nom. v́n with umlaut, Skálda (Thorodd); old dat. vánu, with compar., see below; ónu, Ls. 36; tungan er málinu <i>vn</i> en at tönnunum er bitsins <i>v</i>́<i>n,</i> Thorodd: <i>vón, spónum</i> make a rhyme, Gísl.; ón, Am. 67, Hom. 60: dat. ónu, Ls. 36: [Ulf. <i>wêns</i> = ἐλπίς; A. S. <i>wên,</i> cp. Engl. <i>ween;</i> Germ. <i>wahn;</i> the Dan. <i>haab,</i> Swed. <i>hopp</i> are mod. and borrowed from the Germ.]:—<i>a hope, expectation;</i> er mikil ván, at …, Fms. xi. 13; mér er ván, at …, <i>I expect, apprehend, that …,</i> Eg. 353; sem hann hafði áðr sagt á ván um, <i>given to understand,</i> Fms. xi. 87; eiga ván til e-s, 623. 17; allar þjóðir munu hafa ón mikla (<i>a high hope</i>) til namns hans, Hom. 60; slíks var ván, Nj. 5; engi ván er til þess, Eg. 157: sem ván var at, <i>as was to be expected.</i> Glúm. 337; vita sér engis ótta vánir, <i>to apprehend no danger,</i> Fms. xi. 46, Orkn. 414, Eg. 74; konungs var þangat ván, <i>the king was expected,</i> Fms. x. 323; þar var ván féfangs mikils, Eg. 265; ván er borin, <i>past hope,</i> Ld. 258; ván er þrotin, Eg. 719; ván rekin, id., Ld. 216; e-t stendr til vánar, <i>bids fair,</i> Eg. 173; e-t er at vánum, <i>it is what could be expected,</i> Nj. 255; but, eptir vonum, <i>as good as could be expected, very good indeed;</i> eiga e-t í vuniim, <i>to have a thing expected;</i> eiga barn í vánum, Grág.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/van-bidill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ván-biðill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
