        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a nickname, Landn.; whence local names, <strong>Vápnafjörðr, Vápnfirðingar,</strong> m. pl. <i>the men from W.,</i> id.; Vápnfirðinga Saga, Fms. ii. 239. <strong>Vápnlingar</strong> or <strong>Væpnlingar,</strong> m. pl. <i>descendants of</i> Vápni, Landn. 254.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
