          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vár
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>vor</strong>; [Lat. vēr; Dan.-Swed. <i>vaar, vår:</i> in mod. Danish this old word has been displaced by <i>for-aar</i> Germ. <i>früh-jahr</i>; although <i>vaar</i> is still used in special and poetical phrases]:—<i>the spring;</i> vetr, sumar, vár ok haust, Edda; hit næsta vár, … um várit, Fms. vi. 90; allt til várs, Nj. 11; í vár, <i>last spring,</i> Eg. 235; í vári, Eb. (in a verse), passim in old and mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
