        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a spring-parliament,</i> one of the quarter assizes held in Icel., see Íb. ch. 5, Grág. (Kb.), Þ.Þ. ch. 56–59; várþing, alþingi, leið, Grág. i. 4, 103, Ld. 50, Dropl. 5, 8, 13, Nj. 251, passim.",
            }
