      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m., gen. vegar; but vegs, Eg. 295, Bret. 262; vegsins, Hbl. 56; dat. vegi and veg; with the article veginum, Eg. 544; but veg, Fms. i. 9: pl. vegir and vegar, Eg. 544; acc. vega and vegu, the former is the better form, for the root is ‘vig,’ not ‘vigu;’ vega is also used in old adverbial phrases, as alla vega, marga vega: [Ulf. <i>wigs</i> = ὁδός; A. S., O. H. G. and Germ. <i>weg;</i> Engl. <i>way;</i> Dan. <i>vej;</i> Swed. <i>väg;</i> Lat. <i>via;</i> the root word is vega, q. v.]:—<i>a way, road;</i> vegir er renna til bæja, Gþl. 413; vegir allir, Eg. 543; þröngastir vegir, Fms. ix. 366, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
