        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fishing lake,</i> N. G. L. i. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veidi-van"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiði-ván
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the expectation of a catch,</i> Gþl. 456.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veidi-velar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiði-vélar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>hunting-gear, traps,</i> or the like, Gþl. 419, 456, Barl. 137, Post. (Unger) 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veidinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiðinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>expert in fishing</i> or <i>catching,</i> Sturl. i. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (mod. <strong>veiði</strong>), dat. and acc. veiði, pl. veiðar; a gen. veiði, veiði sinnar, Sks. 126 A, Str. 24, but esp. in compds, see below: [A. S. <i>wâde;</i> O. H. G. <i>waida;</i> Germ. <i>weide</i> = <i>a pasture</i>]:—<i>a catch, hunting, fishing,</i> Ó. H. 79, 85; öll veiðr fugla ok fiska, K. Þ. K. 172; at sú veiðr hafi þar jafnan síðan til legit, Fms. i. 272; fara á veiðar, <i>to go a hunting.</i> Fas. ii. 263, Str. 28; veiðrin (the fish) hvarf þegar, Fms. i. 253 C, Ó. H. 78; fyrir útan netlög á hverr maðr veiði sína, en þat er veiðr er menn færa á skipi til lands, en flutning ella, Grág. ii. 360: metaph., vel væri at þá veiði bæri eigi undan, Nj. 69; þeir menn er veiðr mundi í vera, Eg. 121; í honum er þó veiðrin meiri, Nj. 155, 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. veifar, <i>anything flapping</i> or <i>waving;</i> sels veifar, <i>a seal’s fins,</i> N. G. L. i. 340.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veifa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veifa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, (mod. að), part. veifat, Fms. vii. 154 (in a verse); [A. S. <i>wâfjan;</i> Engl. <i>wave</i>]:—<i>to wave, vibrate;</i> veifði hann slæðunum, Nj. 190; veifa svipu yfir höfuð sér, Lv. 30; veifa höfðinu, Þiðr. 235; Ormr veifði honum um sik sem hreyti-speldi, Fb. i. 532; í því veifði hann sverðinu at Grími, Dropl. 36; veifði hann ræði, <i>he pulled the oar,</i> Hým. 25; veifa vængjum, <i>to wave with the wings,</i> Fas. ii. 137 (in a verse); veifa e-m sem barni, Fms. vii. 32; þeim var veift sólar-sinnis, Þorf. Karl. 422; veifði hann Mjöllni fram, Hým. 36; veifa héðni um höfuð e-m, of an enchantress, Eb. 92, cp. Ísl. ii. 76; hón veifði kofra sínum, Vígl. 63 new Ed. In the fishing-places in the south of Icel. (Skaptafells sýsla) a man stands on the shore waving a flag to tell the fishermen if it is safe to land or not; this is called ‘veifa,’ or ‘veifa frá,’ <i>to wave off,</i> i. e. to signal them not to try (Mr. Jón Guðmundsson).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veifan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veifan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>waving;</i> in the compd <strong>veifanar-orð,</strong> n. <i>a ‘wafting word,’ rumour,</i> Hallfred.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veifi-skati"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veifi-skati
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a spendthrift;</i> but only in the phrase, engi v., <i>no spender, rather close-handed,</i> Ld. 26, Ölk. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. veigar, [A. S. <i>wæge;</i> Hel. <i>wêgi</i>], a kind of <i>strong beverage, drink;</i> öl heitir með mönnum … kalla veig Vanir, Alm. 35; dýrar veigar, Hdl. 49, Hkv. 2. 44; skírar veigar, Vtkv. 7; fagrar veigar, Fas. i. 494 (in a verse); kná-at sú veig vanask, Gm. 25; Fjölnis veig, <i>the drink of F.,</i> i. e. <i>poetry,</i> Kormak; Dvalins veig, <i>id</i>.; bjór-veig, <i>a draught of beer,</i> Hým. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veigadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veigaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>brocaded</i> (?); veigað handklæði, Vm. 15; dúkr v., 70, 123, Ám. 6, 71; typt klæði ok væiguð, N. G. L. i. 282 (vefgin, 211).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veik-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veik-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(spelt <strong>veyk-leikr,</strong> Fms. ii. 48), m. <i>weakness, infirmity,</i> Magn. 504, Barl. 196, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veik-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veik-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>weakly;</i> mér lízk siðr þeirra veykligr, Ld. 170 (so also Fms. ii. 30, l. c.; but veikligr, Fb. i. 312, l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>illness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veikindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veikindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>sickness, illness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veikjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veikjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to grow ill.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veiklast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiklast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to grow weak</i> or <i>faint.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., also <strong>veykr,</strong> see also <strong>vákr;</strong> the <i>ei</i> is the usual and the mod. form: [A. S. <i>wâc;</i> Engl. <i>weak</i>; Dan. <i>væg;</i> cp. Germ. <i>schwach</i>]:—<i>weak;</i> hornbogi veykr, Sks. 408 B; veikr stólpi, Bs. i. 724; veykr sproti, Stj. 641; lítil-magni ok veikr, Barl. 100; engi er svá veikr at aflit skorti, ef …, 119; of-veikr, of-veikr allvallds bogi! Fms. ii. 331 (of-veykr, Fb. l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veilindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veilindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a disease, ailment;</i> hvatki veilindi sem maðr hefir, Grág. i. 45, ii. 45; synda-v., Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ailing, diseased;</i> veill á fótum, <i>gouty,</i> Fms. vii. 229; höndina ina veilu, <i>an ailing hand,</i> Bs. i. 462; líkþráir ok veilir, Hom. 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veimil-tyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veimil-týta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [cp. Dan. <i>vimmel-skaft</i> = <i>the handle of an auger</i>], prop. <i>a ‘wimble-stick,’</i> i. e. <i>a crooked stick;</i> but only used,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vein"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vein
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wailing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veina"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veina
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Germ. <i>weinen</i>], <i>to wail,</i> Greg. 51, Fms. v. 122; þeir veinöðu ok mæltu, vei oss vesölum ! Stj,; veinaði sér sú sál, Hom. 155, Karl. 293; veina sik ílla, D. N. iv. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veinan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veinan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a wailing,</i> Ísl. ii. 133; veinun ok gaulun, Fms. v. 90; væl ok veinan, Orkn. 78; æ, þat er veinon kallað, Skálda 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veipa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veipa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Ulf. <i>waips</i> and <i>wipja</i> = στέφανος], a kind of <i>wimple</i> or <i>woman’s hood,</i> Edda ii. 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "interj., qs. vei sé, see vei.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veisa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veisa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a pool, pond of stagnant water, cesspool;</i> þá reið hann í eina hverja veisu, Fb, i. 354; stóðu Birkibeinar í veisu nökkurri, Fms, ix. 517, v. l.; fyrir ofan veisuna, viii. 191; var veisa ein yfir at fara, Grett. 161 A; veisu-galti, <i>a cesspool-bog,</i> a nickname, Þórð., freq. in mod. Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. veitr, qs. vreit, <i>a trench,</i> = veita, D. N. iv. 198.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., qs. vreita, dropping the <i>r,</i> [akin to reitr, rít, q. v., the root word; A. S. <i>wrîtan</i> = <i>to trench;</i> this is borne out by the mod. Norwegian forms as stated by Ivar Aasen, <i>veit</i> in Sogn, but <i>vreite</i> in Thelemarken; <i>reite</i> near Mandal]:—<i>a trench, ditch;</i> of vatn-veitur, <i>of water-trenches, aqueducts,</i> Grág. (Kb.) ii. 97; eigi skal hann annarra lönd meiða í veitunni, … of veitu-garða, <i>trench-ditches,</i> Grág. ii. 281; eigi á maðr at göra veitur í landi sínu svá at hann spilli landi eða engi manns þess er fyrir neðan býr, 282.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veita-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, [Dan. <i>yde</i>], <i>to grant, give;</i> veita far, <i>to give a man a passage,</i> Grág. ii. 268; veita e-m lið, <i>to give one help, assist</i> (lið-veizla), Fms. xi. 27, 121; veita hjálp, aðstoð, huggun, <i>to give help, comfort;</i> veita grið, trygðir, várar, etc., passim; veita manni fyrir Guðs sakir, <i>to give alms,</i> Gþl. 274; konungr veitti honum skatta alla, <i>condoned, remitted,</i> Fms. i. 120: absol. <i>to help, assist,</i> þeir veittu Giziri hvíta at hverju máli, Nj. 86; veita frændum þínum ok mágum, 226; hann veitti þeim Ingólfi (in a battle), Landn. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veitall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veitall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>giving freely, open-handed;</i> veitall af penningum, Fas. i. 443; ó-veitull af e-u, Bs. i. 415.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veitandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veitandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a giver,</i> Edda i. 456.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veitari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veitari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a giver, donor,</i> H. E. i. 499, Stj. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veiti-engi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiti-engi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(qs. vreiti-engi), n. <i>a trenched meadow,</i> Háv. 35 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veiting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f. <i>a grant, gift,</i> Bs. i. (Laur. S.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veiz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veiz
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= viz, see víðr; veiz eptir skyldu, <i>quite in order,</i> Thom. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veizla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veizla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [veita], <i>a grant, gift, allowance;</i> veizla eilífrar sælu, … hafa e-t at veizlu Guðs, Hom. (St.); veizla ölmusu-görða, Hom.; gefa stórar gjafir ok veizlur, Stj. 64.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veizlu-bunadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veizlu-búnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>preparation for a feast,</i> Fms. vi. 146.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veizlu-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veizlu-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a banquet-day,</i> Bs. i. 791, Sturl. ii. 58, Stj. 199.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veizlu-fall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veizlu-fall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the failure of a feast,</i> Fms. vi. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veizlu-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veizlu-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fee, money paid in lieu of</i> veizla (II), Fagrsk. ch. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veizlu-gjald"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veizlu-gjald
