          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. vel; pret. valði, valdi; subj. velði; part. valiðr, valdr, valinn; [Ulf. <i>waljan</i> = αἱρειν; O. H. G. <i>weljan;</i> Germ. <i>wählen;</i> Dan. <i>vælge;</i> Swed. <i>välja;</i> Old Engl. <i>wale;</i> cp. val-]:—<i>to choose, elect, pick out;</i> at ér velit þat er yðr gegnir, 623. 30; ok er gott um at velja, Nj. 3; velja um tvá kosti, Gísl. 16; konungr valði mjök menn með sér í hirð at afli ok hreysti, Fms. i. 43; þeir feðgar völðu mjök menn at afli til fylgðar við sik, Eg. 84; þeir bræðr völðu sér lið, 119; þeir höfðu valið lið, <i>picked troops,</i> Nj. 24; valiðs meistara, Post. (Unger) 108; velja við til, Grág. ii. 356; ef eigi er rjóðrum högginn skógrinn ok er valiðr, 294; valiðr til e-s, Fs. 71; rita tal allra valdra manna, Hom. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veljungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veljungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vælungr,</strong> m. a nickname, Sturl. iii. 187.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/velkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          velkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [válka], <i>to toss about;</i> þeir velktu Tuma lengi, görði honum þá kalt mjök, Sturl. ii. 66 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vell
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [vella], <i>gold,</i> prop. <i>molten,</i> i. e. <i>native, gold,</i> or = Germ. <i>‘ge-diegenes gold,’</i> (perh. the word comes from the superstition as to serpents brooding and hatching gold, cp. fóru þeir til bælis drekans, ok sá þeir þar mikit gull, ok ‘heitt sem nýrunnit í afli,’ Ingv. 24.) The word is only used in poets, and in the compds, vell-auðigr, vell-ríkr, q. v.: poët. compds, <strong>vell-bjóðr, -broti, -meiðir, -rýrir, -stærir, -vönuðr,</strong> all epithets of <i>a princely man.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vell-audigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vell-auðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>rich in gold,</i> prop. <i>‘swelling rich;’</i> maðr v., Eg. 251, Nj. 72, Sturl. i. 160 A, Orkn. 176: mod. <i>very wealthy,</i> hann er v., <i>he is immensely rich.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vell-ekla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vell-ekla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>lack of gold,</i> the name of a poem, Eg. 694, Hkr. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vell-rikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vell-ríkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = vellauðigr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vella"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, causal to the preceding, <i>to make to well up</i> or <i>boil</i>; vella mat, Fbr. 51 new Ed.; vella lauk ok grös, Fb. ii. 365; ok vellt þat saman, Ó. H. 223; velld tjara, Sks. 90 new Ed.; hann velldi þau sverð sjau vetr í afli, Karl. 40; velldr í viðsmjörvi, 623. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vella-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vella
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. vell; pret. vall; pl. ullu; subj. ylli; part. ollinn; [A. S. <i>weallan;</i> Engl. <i>to well</i>]:—<i>to well over, boil, be at boiling heat;</i> vellanda bik, Fms. vii. 232; rigndi blóði vellanda, Nj. 272; vellanda vatn, Bs. i. 40, Sks. 424; vellanda viðsmjör, 623. 12; vax heitt ok vellanda blý, <i>molten lead,</i> Hom. 100; vellanda gulli, <i>molten gold,</i> 625. 38; tók stálit at vella, Karl. 18; vellr nú ór járni allt þat er deigt er, Þiðr. 79; vellanda katli, Hm. 84; hafit vellr ok geisar, Rb. 444; keldur er æ ok æ vella ákafliga, Sks. 146; sé nú hve sá hverr velli, Gkv. 3. 9; hver vellanda, 6; það vellr og sýðr, of a boiling kettle; brunnr vellr af hita, Al. 51; vellandi reiði, Art.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vellan-fasti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vellan-fasti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., poët. <i>a fire, cooking fire, boiling heat,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vellan-katla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vellan-katla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. the name of a boiling well near the lake Thing-walla, Kristni S. ch. 11 (now prob. sunk beneath the level of the lake).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vellingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vellingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>pottage,</i> Stj. 160, 165.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vellir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vellir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a seether, boiler;</i> in eld-vellir = <i>smoke</i>, Hornklofi; lög-vellir = <i>a cauldron,</i> Hým.; reyk-vellir, <i>‘reek-weller’</i> = <i>fire,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/velta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          velta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, a causal to the preceding; in Runic inscriptions it is spelt ‘elta’ or ‘ailta,’ Rafn 188, 194 (see rati); [Ulf. <i>valtjan</i> = κυλίνδειν; A. S. <i>wæltan;</i> Germ. <i>wälzen;</i> Dan. <i>vælte;</i> see valtr]:—<i>to roll, set rolling,</i> a stone or the like, with dat.; velta búkum frá fótum jarli, Fb. i. 495; velta grjóti, Gs. 12; velta torfi, Grág. ii. 266; v. steini, N. G. L. ii. 122; steininum hafði velt verið af gröfinni, Luke xxiv. 2; þeir veltu honum, Eb. 115 new Ed.: impers., því næst velti (því), <i>then she capsized,</i> Fms. ix. 320.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/velta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          velta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "velt, pret. valt, pl. ultu; subj. ylti; part. oltinn, or vultu, voltinn; [Ulf. <i>valtjan;</i> cp. A. S. <i>walwjan</i> = κυλίνδειν; Lat. <i>volvere, volutare;</i> Engl. <i>wallow</i>]:—<i>to roll, roll over;</i> ultu þeir ofan fyrir brekkuna, Landn. 179; þat (the wheel) kann opt velta undan, Fms. i. 104; veltanda vatn, Akv.; þóttú yltir aptr fyrir bylgjunni, Hom.; ek hefi látið velta slíka sem þú ert, Eg. 338; sneri höllinni sem mylna ylti, Karl. 472; þó gékk hann heldr en valt, Sturl. iii. 158; tunnan valt og úr henni allt, ofan í djúpa keldu, in a ditty; dagarnir sex at vísu vultu, Lil.; er þú ert oltinn í svá mikla heimsku, Post. 645. 68, 83; í hverja synd ok vesöld þú ert voltinn, Stj. 36; þó at hann velti í mikla vesöld, Al. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/velti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          velti-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in compds, <strong>velti-flaug,</strong> f. <i>rotation;</i> <strong>velti-reið,</strong> f. of <i>a ship,</i> Lex. Poët.: in prose, <strong>velti-ár,</strong> n. of <i>an extra good year.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veltiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veltiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>rolling, voluble,</i> Lil.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/velting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          velting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rotation,</i> Stj. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veltir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veltir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (Lat. <i>volutor</i>), <i>one who makes to revolve.</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vend"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vend
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>wen</i>], name of the letter <i>v,</i> see introduction to this letter; ok er <i>v</i> þá vend kallað í Norrænu máli, Skálda (Edda ii. 400; ‘und,’ 365).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vend-raedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vend-ræði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = vandræði, Bs. i. 341.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vend-vaerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vend-værr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>difficult to appease,</i> Mork. 72.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, pret. venduðu, Edda i. 20 (pref.); [Ulf. <i>ga-wandian</i> = στρέφειν; A. S. <i>wentan;</i> Engl. <i>wend;</i> Germ. <i>wenden;</i> Dan. <i>vende</i>]:—<i>to wend, turn,</i> with dat.; vendi Sigurðr aptr herinum, Fms. viii. 152; venda sínum vegi, <i>to wend one’s way,</i> xi. 425; venda til hans allri hollustu, Mar.; venda góðvilja til e-s, Dipl. i. 2; venda ást ok vináttu, Sks. 741: with acc., venda bak móti e-m, Bret. 54; venda sína vináttu til e-s, Fms. ix. 51, v. l.; venda e-t til sín, Sks. 443 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vendi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vendi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [vandr], <i>carefully;</i> spyrja v. at e-u, Fms. i. 68; segja vendiliga frá tíðindum, <i>tell minutely,</i> Eg. 124; sjá v., Ld. 54: <i>quite, entirely,</i> svá var v. upp gengit allt lausa-fé hans, Hkr. i. 186; stefndi til sín öllum bygðar-mönnum ok þeim öllum vendiligast (<i>principally those who</i>) er first bygðu, Ó. H. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vendil-kraka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vendil-kráka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. a nickname, Yngl. S.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vendiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vendiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>careful,</i> H. E. i. 410.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vendill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vendill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(also <strong>Vandill</strong>), m. a pr. name, Rafn 178, Edda (Gl.), Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = venzlaðr, N. G. L. i. 30. <strong>2. vendr,</strong> part. <i>wont, accustomed;</i> v. á afrek, Skíða R. 19; ofstopa vendr, Landn. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vengi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vengi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = vangr, [like Dan. <i>vænge</i> and <i>vang</i>], <i>the ground;</i> ok vatt (á) vengi, <i>and threw it on the ground,</i> Gkv. 1. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = vani, <i>a custom, habit,</i> MS. 4. 7, 10; gjörn er hönd á venju, a saying (see hönd); at venju, <i>as usual,</i> Ver. 24; varga venja, Hom. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. ven; pret. vanði, later vandi; subj. venði; part. vandr, vaninn: [Dan. <i>vænne;</i> see vani]:—<i>to accustom;</i> venja e-n e-u or við e-t; venja hann við íþróttir ok hæversku, Fms. i. 78; gestrisni vanði hann sik, <i>he practised hospitality,</i> 655 v. B. 2; vandi Dofri hann við íþróttir, ættvísi ok vígfimi, <i>taught him, trained him in,</i> Bárð. 164.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venju-bragd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venju-bragð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a habit,</i> Bs. i. 781.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venju-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venju-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>usually,</i> Str. 68.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venju-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venju-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>usual,</i> Mar., Bs. i. 822; venju-ligra, <i>more usual,</i> Fs. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venzl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venzl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [vandi], <i>relationship</i> (<i>ties of blood</i> or <i>affinity</i>); fyrir venzla sakir, Nj. 79; er hann þó í venzlum við oss bundinn, Boll. 354; fyrir frændsemis sökum ok margra annarra venzla, Orkn. 452; at ek sé þar í meirum venzlum enn aðrir menn, Lv. 78; at hann mundi allítils virða við Sverri venzl né vígslur, Fms. viii. 266; ek vil biðja hennar mér til eigin-konu, ok staðfesta svá við yðr venzl með vináttu, Fas. iii. 59; þeim mönnum er minni venzl mundi á, Ó. T. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venzla-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venzla-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>bound by no ties, a stranger;</i> úskyldar konur ok venzla-lausar, Stj. 179, Fb. ii. 415; síðan venzlalausir menn eru í mót, Orkn. 104, = vandalauss.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venzla-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venzla-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a person bound by ties, a kinsman, relation;</i> vinir ok venzlamenn, Bs. i. 21; yðr venzlamönnum Þóris, Gullþ. 20; Kolbeini ok hans venzlamönnum, Sturl. ii. 1, Bs. i. 489, 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/venzladr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          venzlaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>related.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veptr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veptr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
