      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vera-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vera
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "older form <strong>vesa,</strong> the verb substantive; pres. em, ert, er, pl. erum, eruð, eru: pret. var, vart (mod. varst), var, pl. váru or vóru; a obsolete óru occurs, Sæm. (once), Orkn. 426. l. 11, Nj. 81, Thom. 28, 90, 102, 116, 150, 196, Ísl. ii. 482: pres. subj. sé, sér (Vþm. 4, 7), sé; the older form is sjá, en ek sjá, Clem. 138. l. 14; at ek sjá, … ok sé mér eigi reiðr, 145, Fms. viii. 299, x. 384, xi. 124, Eg. 127; for the forms sják, sjákk, see below: the mod. forms are sé, sért, sér (eg sé, þú sért; s<i>ert</i> and <i>ert</i> make a rhyme in Pass. 34. 5): imperat. ver, vertú; see Gramm. p. xxiii: there also occurs a subj. pres. verir, veri, Sdm. 22, Ls. 54; þatz án veri, Am. 36; skósmiðr þú verir, Hm. 126, but rarely.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verald-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verald-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>worldly, secular,</i> Fms. vii. 88, Anecd. 38, K. Á. 50, 220. Edda (pref.), Gþl. (pref. viii), N. T., Vídal., passim in eccl. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/veraldar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veraldar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
