            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the ‘ward,’ the bulwarks</i> of a ship which ward off the waves; hrími stokkin verða hrökk, Arnór, (also called varta.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. verð, verðr, verð; pret. varð, vart (mod. varðst), varð; pl. urðu; subj. yrði: imperat. verð; part. orðinn; pl. orðnir, spelt phonetically ornir, Niðrst. 6: in later vellums occur freq. the forms vurðu, vyrði, vorðinn, see Introd.; but the old poets use it for alliteration as if it began with a vowel: with neg. suff. verðr-at, Fm. 6; varð-at, Vþm. 38; urðu-a it, Gh. 3; urðu-t. Lex. Poët.: [Ulf. <i>wairþan</i> = γίγνεσθαι, ἔσεσθαι; A. S. <i>weorðan</i>; Old Engl. <i>worth,</i> as in the phrase <i>‘woe worth the day!’</i> Germ. <i>werden;</i> Dan. <i>vorde;</i> Swed. <i>varda.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the ‘Being,’ the Weird,</i> the name of one of the Norns, Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
