            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m., gen. verðar; older form virðr, Grág. ii. 92, Hm. 31: [cp. Ulf. <i>wairdus</i> = ξένος; Germ. <i>wirth;</i> the word remains in Dan. <i>nadver,</i> Swed. <i>natt-värd,</i> = <i>the Lord’s Supper</i>]:—<i>a meal,</i> prop. <i>a portion of food,</i> Hým. 16; fá árliga verðar, Hm. 32; sá er um verði (<i>during a meal</i>) glissir, 30; enn vari gestr er til verðar kemr, 4, 7; hrósa árligum verðinum, Hbl. 4; hverr bóandi er skyldr at gefa þriggja nátta verð hjóna sinna, K. Þ. K.; gefa einn karlmanns-verð fátækum manni, Dipl. ii. 14; þann inn helga verð, <i>the holy meal,</i> 625. 196; ef deildr er verðrinn, Bjarn. 27; ef hann er vís-vitandi at verði eðr at virði við hann, Grág. ii. 92; en at virði vrekask, Hm. 31; nátt-verðr, dag-verðr (dögurðr), máls-verðr, búðar-vörðr (qs. búðar-verðr); úlfs verðr, hrafns verðr, <i>wolf’s, raven’s meal,</i> i. e. <i>prey,</i> Lex. Poët.; sleipnis verðr, <i>‘horse’s meal,’</i> i. e. <i>hay,</i> Ýt.; verð-gjafi hrafns, or verð-bjóðr, <i>the raven’s meal-giver,</i> i. e. <i>a warrior,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. <i>-wairþs,</i> only in compds; A. S. <i>-weard;</i> Engl. <i>-wards;</i> Germ. <i>-wartz, -wartig;</i> Lat. <i>vertere, versus</i>]:—<i>-wards,</i> only in compds; austan-verðr, <i>eastwards;</i> norðan-verðr, sunnan-v., vestan-v., framan-v., innan-v., útan-v., ofan-v., önd-v., qq. v., etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>deservedly,</i> Stj. 43, 213, Barl. 115.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>deserved,</i> Barl. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>worthy,</i> with gen., K. Á. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verdung"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verðung
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [from verð = <i>pretium</i>], <i>a king’s body-guard, ‘king’s men,’ a body in the king’s pay,</i> = hirð, q. v.; the word is only used in poets, Edda (Gl.), Hkv. 1. 9, Helr, 11, Skv. 3. 41, Hallfred, Sighvat, passim, see Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [A. S. <i>wæreg</i>], <i>to soil;</i> ek hafða hreinan serk, en hennar var vergaðr, Trist. 11; hleypti þrællinn hjá Þórarni, svá klæði hans verguðusk (vörguðust Ed. less correct), Lv. 112.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vergr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vergr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>soiled, dirty;</i> teðja vel garða, vinna it vergasta, <i>to do thdirtiest work,</i> Akm. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [verja = <i>to wear</i>], <i>an outer garment, an outer frock;</i> í síðri verju, Fbr. 156; annat verja en annat hit, Sd. 157; úlfalda verjur (but see vera), Stj. 181.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. ver, pl. verjum; pret. varði; subj. verði; part. variðr, varðr, varinn: [Ulf. <i>warian</i> = κωλύειν; A. S. <i>werjan;</i> Chaucer <i>werye, were;</i> Germ. <i>wehren;</i> Dan. <i>værge</i>]:—<i>to defend;</i> verja sik … hvárt þú verr þik lengr eðr skemr, … verja sik vel ok fræknliga, Nj. 116; verja sik eðr gefask upp, 124; verja sik eðr Helga, 136; verja hendr sínar, 47, 84 (hönd III. 2); verja land fyrir e-m, Fms. i. 23; at jarl verði landit fyrir víkingum, 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verjandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verjandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a defender,</i> in law, Grág. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Ulf. <i>ga-waurki</i> = πραγματεία, κέρδος, and <i>waurstu</i> = ἔργον; A. S. <i>weorc;</i> Engl. <i>work;</i> cp. orka and yrkja, for-<i>urtir,</i> for-<i>átta,</i> qq. v.; Gr. ἔργον, qs. Ϝέργον, is from the same root]:—<i>work, business;</i> vera á verki, <i>to be at work,</i> Eg. 744; verks í gjarn, Fb. i. 521, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-bitinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-bitinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘wark-bitten,’ dead from sickness,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a work-day,</i> Rb. (1812) 48, Fb. ii. 334 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-efni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-efni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>work to be done, a task,</i> Bjarn. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-fakr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-fákr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= verkhestr, Fbr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-faeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-færi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an implement, tool,</i> esp. of household or farming implements, Vm. 72, Rd. 274; laust hann örninn með verkfærinu er hann hafði í hendi, Bs. i. 350, passim in mod. usage; búsgögn ok verkfæri, Jb. 166.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-faerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-færr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>able to work,</i> Eb. 256, Bs. i. 336.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-hestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-hestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a cart-horse</i> (mod. púls-hestr), Vm. 18, Landn. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., in verkhús-bryti, <i>a steward, foreman of work,</i> N. G. L. i. 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-kaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-kaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>wages,</i> Fms. ii. 42, Ísl. ii. 199, Greg. 4, Stj. 177; the mod. but less correct form mostly verðkaup, e. g. Luke vi. 35; yðar verðkaup er mikit á himni, 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a workwoman, maid-servant,</i> Bjarn. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-laginn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-laginn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>skilled, expert in work.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-lagni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-lagni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>skill in work.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-laun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-laun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>wages,</i> N. G. L. i. 73.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>painless,</i> Fms. ii. 188, viii. 444, Hkr. i. 35, Bs. 1. 462.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-leiga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-leiga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>wages,</i> Jb.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>working,</i> Sks. 627, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-lund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-lund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a mind for work;</i> in lítill verklundar-maðr, Grett. 129 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a workman, labourer, servant</i> (= vinnumaðr), Fms. ii. 230, vii. 217, Ísl. ii. 329, Landn. 162, Nj. 55, Hkr. ii. 356, Edda 48; hón var verkmaðr mikill, <i>a good worker,</i> Lv. 74; verkmanna dyrr, <i>the servants’ door,</i> Fs. 72.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-naud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-nauð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = verkanauð, Stj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-odi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-óði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>mad with pain,</i> Gísl. 133; var hón síðan verkóða nótt alla, Bs. i. 340; en er hann vaknaði þá var hann verkóði, 329.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-reki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-reki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>one who does another’s work,</i> Thom. 450.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-smid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-smíð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>craft, work,</i> in timber or metals, Ísl. ii. 321 (verksmíð mik<i>inn</i> is undoubtedly an error for mik<i>la</i>); engi var hann verksmíðar-maðr, <i>no craftsman,</i> Band. 3 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-stjori"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-stjóri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a ‘work-steerer,’ overseer,</i> Nj. 52, Stj. 255, Fb. ii. 206.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-stjorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-stjórn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>supervision, overseeing, of a work,</i> Bs. i. 711, Eg. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-vidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-viðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘work-timber,’</i> Gþl. 346.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-thjofr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-þjófr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘work-thief,’</i> a trifle that makes one lose much time.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-thraell"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-þræll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘work-thrall,’ slave,</i> Hkr. i. 25, Fbr. 83 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verk-onn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verk-önn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>business,</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to work,</i> esp. as a law term; verka til e-s, <i>to work towards, deserve,</i> Hom. 89, 117; þess manns er áðr hefir til úhelgi sér verkat, <i>to make oneself by one’s deeds,</i> Grág. ii. 10, Orkn. 216; til þessa hefir þú þér verkat, Bs. i. 452.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a work</i>, esp. <i>composition, verse-making;</i> fornskálda verka, Edda i. 612; smá hana með úfögrum verka, <i>with a libel,</i> Fms. ii. 248; enda varðar þeim er nemr þann verka, Grág. ii. 148; greypan verka, Fas. ii. (in a verse); Þorkell bað hann hætta verkanum, Fb. i. 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>virkja,</strong> t, <i>to feel ‘wark,’</i> i. e. <i>pain:</i> impers., eigi er sá heill er í augun verkir, a saying, Fbr. 75; virkir (sic) mik í höfuðit, Stj. 614; er hón víndrukkin eða virkir hana í höfuð, Karl. 56; sárit virkti hann mjök, Str. 5.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verknadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verknaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a work, business,</i> Eg. 714; taka upp verknað, <i>to take to some work</i>, Ld. 34; ek hefi haft um-önnun ok verknað hér, Lv. 74; Halla í verknaði (<i>a woman’s handiwork</i>) ok bókfræði, Bs. i. 138; ú-verknaðr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. verkjar, pl. verkir, [A. S. <i>wærc</i>; North. E. <i>wark</i>, in <i>head-wark, belly-wark,</i> etc.; Dan. <i>værk</i>]:—<i>a ‘wark,’ pain;</i> ala börn við sárleik ok verki, Ver. 5; una sér hvergi fyrir verkjum, Bjarn. (in a verse); var verkrinn at ákafari í augunum, … eptir þat tók ór verk allan ór augum hans, Bs. i. 336; hafði fár-verki, 339; vaknaði við þat at hón hafði æði-verk í augum … tók þá verk ór augum henni, 340; lýstr í sárit verkjum, Fms. viii. 339; ok kemr verkr á hendr henni, <i>if she is taken ill,</i> N. G. L. i. 358; augna-verkr, fóta-v., hand-v., iðra-v., sjó-v., bein-v., höfuð-v., bak-v., lenda-v., hlustar-v., fár-v., æði-v., of-verkr, etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [varmr], <i>to warm, heat;</i> sólina til at birta ok verma veröldina, Fb. i. 438; sól skal lýsa allan heim ok verma, Sks. 10 new Ed.; sól vermir döggina, Fms. v. 344; vermði hón vatn til at fægja sár, Ó. H. 222; liggja nær honum ok verma hann, Sks. 758. 1 Kings i. 4; Egill fór til elds at verma sik, Eg. 759, 762; konungr kom til eldanna ok vermðu menn sik þar um hríð, Fms. ix. 353.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vermar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vermar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men from</i> <strong>Verma-land</strong> in Sweden, Fms.: <strong>Vermskr,</strong> adj. <i>from the</i> (Swedish) <i>county</i> <strong>Vermaland,</strong> Eg 582: <strong>Verma,</strong> u, f. the name of a Norse river, Fb. i. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vermi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vermi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>warmth;</i> án verma eðr yl, Sks. 210 E; leita sér verma Nj. 267; hafa verma af eldinum, Eb. 100 new Ed., v. l. 9; hann skyldi eigi kala eptir þann verma er hann hafði fengit af reiðinni, Art. 15; at hann mætti fá verma af hennar heitu hörundi, Stj. 548; vermis-steinn, <i>a ‘warming stone,’</i> kept to warm milk and the like, see Lv. ch. 21 (cp. höfðu hvárki á því kveldi ljós né steina, Eb. ch. 54).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vermi-kveisa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vermi-kveisa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a colic.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vermir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vermir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = vermi; það er skamm-góðr vermir, <i>that is but a brief warmth,</i> i. e. <i>that will not last long,</i> said of a temporary contrivance.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vermsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vermsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [<i>vesl</i>, Ivar Aasen], <i>a spring that never freezes;</i> at hón hafi lagizk af vermslum nökkurum at drekka, Fms. vi. 350: hence the mod. Icel. kalda-vesla, qs. kalda-vermsl, <i>‘cold-warm,’</i> of wells that do not freeze all the winter, although icy-cold.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to protect, defend,</i> Stj. 3, 178.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vernd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vernd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [cp. verja, vörn; Swed. <i>värnd</i>], <i>defence, protection, keeping,</i> Fms. vi. 146, 260; til varðveizlu ok verndar, ii. 141; vernd ok hlíf, 184; ef einn maðr röskr er til verndar, Grett. 133 A: <i>an excuse,</i> veita e-u vernd, <i>to excuse,</i> Fms. v. 55; standa þar til verndar í móti, <i>to make excuses,</i> D. N. i. 157: as a law phrase = vörn, Band. 22 new Ed., Flóv. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vernda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vernda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [cp. Dan. <i>værne om noget</i>], <i>to protect,</i> Fms. vi. 70, Stj. 68, H. E. i. 509, passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verndan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verndan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an excuse, subterfuge,</i> Stat. 245.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verndar-bref"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verndar-bréf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a safe conduct,</i> H. E. i. 386, Dipl. ii. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verndar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verndar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>defenceless,</i> H. E. i. 237.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verndar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verndar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a protector,</i> Bs. i. 699, Barl. 144, H. E. i. 500.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verndar-stofa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verndar-stofa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a licensed ale-house,</i> Hkr. iii. 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verndari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verndari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a protector, defender,</i> Mar., Magn. 504.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to edge</i>; verpa skó, <i>to edge</i> or <i>border a shoe</i> (skó-varp).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verpa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. verp; pret. varp, pl. urpu; subj. yrpi; part. orpinn; vurpu, vyrpi, vorpinn: a medial form verpumk, Vþm. 7: [Ulf. <i>wairpan</i> = βάλλειν; A. S. <i>weorpan;</i> Engl. <i>warp;</i> O. H. G. <i>werfan;</i> Germ. <i>werfen</i>]:—<i>to throw,</i> with dat.; hvígi er hann skýtr eða verpr, Grág. (Kb.) i. 144; varp af sér klæðum, Fms. vi. 226, vii. 167; hann varp af sér skildinum, Nj. 95; hann verpr sér í söðulinn, 83; hestrinn féll ok varp honum af baki, <i>threw him off,</i> Fms. x. 408; þeir urpu sér jafnan meðal viðanna, Nj. 126; Gísli varp honum á lopt annarri hendi, Fms. vii. 32; mun þér orpit í þann eldinn, 37: absol., ef maðr höggr til manns eða verpr, Grág. (Kb.) i. 144: verpa mæðiliga öndinni (and-varp), <i>to draw a deep sigh,</i> Nj. 272; verpa braut, <i>to throw away,</i> Rb. 126, Mar., Th. 78; verpa til, <i>to add to</i>, Rb. 124; verpa e-u af sér, <i>to throw off,</i> 623. 36.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verpill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verpill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Germ. <i>würfel</i>], <i>a die</i>, Grág. ii. 198; verpils tala, <i>a cubic number,</i> Alg. 368; verpils vöxtr, <i>a cubic form,</i> 358; verpla-kast, <i>a cast of dice,</i> Grág. ii. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [Ulf. <i>wair</i> = ἀνήρ; A. S., Hel., and O. H. G. <i>wer</i> = <i>a man;</i> Lat. <i>vir;</i> the derivation from verja suggested in Edda 107 is fanciful]:—<i>a man:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verr-fedrungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verr-feðrungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a person worse than his father,</i> Lv. 78; Leifr strengði þess heit, at vera eigi v., Fs. 121.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar., and superl. <strong>verstr;</strong> [Ulf. <i>wairiza</i> = χείρων]:—<i>worse, worst;</i> ok heiti drengr at verri, N. G. L. i. 231, Nj. 68; ekki at verra dreng, Ld. 42; hafa verra af e-u, <i>to have the worse of it;</i> sjaldan vægir inn verri, Stj. 544; at versta kosti, <i>at the worst, at least,</i> N. G. L. i. 101; ef sá er inn bazti, þá er íllr inn versti, <i>if this be the best, then the worst is bad indeed,</i> a saying, Sighvat., and passim: cp. íllr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vers"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vers
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Lat. <i>versus</i>], <i>a verse;</i> ástráð Catonis, þat er hann réð syni sínum í versum, Skálda (Thorodd) 164; klausur eða vers, 174: of Latin composition, les fyrir oss þat er þú hefir diktað—Hann las þar af vers er hann hafði gört til Frú Abbadísar á Stað—Legg af héðan af versagörð, sagði erki-biskup, ok studera heldr í kirkjunnar lögum, Bs. i. 799, 800; kenna sönglist ok versgörð, 239; höfuð-staf þésins rit ek hvergi nema í vers-upphafi, Skálda 168. In mod. usage ‘vers’ is said of the ‘verses’ of hymns, but else ‘vísa’ or ‘erindi’ (eyrendi), Máriu-vers = <i>Ave Maria,</i> Bs. i. 352.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/versa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          versa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to put into verse</i> (Latin), opp. to dikta, of prose composition; framr í klerkdómi at dikta ok versa, Bs. i. 794; Galterus sá er versat hefir sögu þessa, Al. 30 (of the Alexandreis); bæði diktaði hann vel ok versaði, Bs. i. 239.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/versa-bok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          versa-bók
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a book in verse, poems;</i> þar er Cato með glósa, item níu versabækr aðrar, Vm. 61; versabók þá er heitir Ovidius, Bs. i. 238.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/versa-gradall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          versa-graðall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a gradual,</i> in a church, Dipl. v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/versa-gord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          versa-görð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>verse-making, Latin composition,</i> Skálda; versagörð ok bóka-list, Bs. i. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [verr, m., 2], in Róm-verskr, Vík-v., Hvin-v., qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/versna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          versna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(sounded and often spelt <strong>vesna</strong>), að, <i>to ‘worsen,’ get worse;</i> batna né versna, Grág. i. 206; at henni þykki versna at kyssa þik, Ísl. ii. 369, xi. 139; nú versnar mjök frásögnin, Ld. 274; þá er versnaði með þeim, Rd. 307; er vesnar af annarra orðum, Hom. 53; versnaði hlutr Ulfars, Eb. 154.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verold"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          veröld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. veraldar, dat. veröld and veröldu; [from verr = <i>a man,</i> and öld, q. v.; A. S. <i>weorold;</i> Engl. <i>world</i>; Hel. <i>werold;</i> Germ. <i>welt;</i> Swed. <i>wärld;</i> Dan. <i>verden</i> qs. <i>verlden,</i> with the suffixed article]:—<i>the world,</i> esp. in eccl. sense; til enda veraldar, Rb. 134; víða um veröldina, Fms. xi. 97; í veröldinni, Edda (pref.), K. Á. 132, Sks. 447 B; um veraldir veralda, rendering of <i>per secula seculorum,</i> Sks. 617 B, Niðrst. 8; of allar aldir veralda, sá er ríkir í veröld veralda, Hom. 112, 125; um eptir-komandi veraldir, <i>for ages to come,</i> Stj.: very freq. in mod. eccl. language, as in the Bible, Pass., Vídal.; veraldar auðæfi, ágirni, glys, girnd, <i>worldly riches, desires,</i> Greg. 30, Hom. 14, Fms. v. 217; veraldar válað, veraldar virðing, Greg. 27, Fms. v. 219; veraldar friðr, <i>a world-peace, universal peace,</i> Fagrsk. ch. 128; veraldar glys, góðs, lán, lifnaðr, spekt, starf, sæla, tign, <i>worldly toys, treasures, grants, life, wisdom, business, bliss, glory,</i> Hom. 27, 108, Bs. i. 862, Clem. 23, Sks. 615, MS. 625. 165, Fær. 145, Stj. passim; veraldar ljós, <i>the light of this world,</i> Stj.; veraldar lög, <i>the civil law,</i> H. E. i. 506; veraldar bygð, <i>the world</i> = ἡ οἰκουμένη, Stj. 464, 643, Rb. 394; veraldar kvikendi, Stj.; veraldar fólk, Magn. 466; veraldar höfðingi, <i>the great ones of the world,</i> K. Á. 46; veraldar maðr, <i>a man of this world, a secular person, layman,</i> Bs. i. 862, H. E., Stj., passim; veraldar-prestr and veraldar klerkr, <i>a secular clerk, a parson,</i> Bs. i. 840, H. E. i. 502, Karl. 275; veraldar ráð, <i>secular authority,</i> 868; veraldar metnaðr, -ríki, <i>worldly rank and power,</i> Greg. 77, Ver. 40, Anecd. 38, Fms. v. 343; veraldar sigr, x. 395; veraldar ríkr, <i>mighty,</i> Mar.; veraldar sjór, <i>the ‘world-sea,’ the ocean,</i> Stj. 1; veraldar vist, <i>the existence of the world,</i> MS. 1812. 48; veraldar-vitringr, <i>a philosopher</i> (= heimspekingr, q. v.); Phytagoras veraldar vitringr, Stj. 98, 271.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/verzla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          verzla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [verð], <i>to trade,</i> freq. in mod. usage. <strong>verzlan,</strong> f. <i>trade,</i> passim in mod. usage, but hardly used in old writers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vesa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vesa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "vas, vesi, vestu, vask; see vera, <i>to be.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vesal-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vesal-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shabby,</i> Fas. iii. 122.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vesal-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vesal-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>miserably;</i> láta v., Lv. 58; deyja v., Clem. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vesal-ligr"
