        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = veslingr, Hom. 31, Háv. 53, MS. 656 C. 24; hefn þú nú, Dróttinn, eigi má vesalingr minn, Bs. i. 533.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
