          vesall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., fem. vesul or vesöl, neut. vesalt. The forms vary, being contracted or uncontracted, veslir, etc., as well as vesalir, etc., whence lastly, vesælir, etc.:",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
