        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man from the West,</i> κατ. ἐξ. <i>one from the British Isles,</i> esp. <i>the Irish,</i> Landn. 36, whence <strong>Vestmanna-eyjar,</strong> <i>the Isles of the Westmen,</i> i. e. of the Irish who were slain there, see Landn.; Hildir ok Hallgeirr vóru Vestmenn, Landn. 344.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vest-myst"
