        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>vestr-ferð,</strong> f. <i>a journey to the west,</i> Sturl. ii. 144 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vestr-gautar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vestr-gautar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the Western Goths,</i> in Sweden, Ó. H. <strong>Vestra-Gautland,</strong> n. <i>West Gothland,</i> Orkn. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vestr-halfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vestr-hálfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>-álfa,</strong> u, f. <i>the western region,</i> Stj. 68: of the ancient Neustria, Fms. x. 235: of Western Africa, Al. 157, 158; ætlaði hann Cham vestrhálfu, Edda (pref.); þaðan (from Spain) fór hann í vestrálfu heimsins, Bret. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
