        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the Western-Wends,</i> Fms. xi. 398.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vestr-viking"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vestr-víking
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a freebooting expedition to the West,</i> i. e. to the British Isles (Normandy, etc.), Fms. i. 8, Eg. 513, Orkn., Korm. 2. Landn. 32, 108, 121, 133, 140, 174, 204, 205, 314; see víking.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vestr-aett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vestr-ætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the western quarter,</i> of the heavens; líta í v., Nj. 194; stefna í v., Fb. i. 539; fljúga ór v., Ísl. ii. 196.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vestri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vestri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. one of the dwarfs; see Norðri, Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vestraenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vestrænn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>westerly;</i> v. vindr, Fms. ix. 135, Merl. 2. 44.",
            }
