          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vetr-nætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the winter nights,</i> the three days which begin the winter season, (in Icel. Almanack, 1872, the 24th till the 26th of October are the ‘vetrnætr’): gener. <i>the season when winter begins,</i> fyrir vetrnætr, eptir vetrnætr, at vetrnöttum, etc., Grág. ii. 216, 220; for the feasts and sacrifices at that time (called vetrnátta blót), see Fms. i. 35, ii. 34, Gísl. 18, Eb. ch. 37; vetrnátta-helgr, <i>the first Sunday in the winter-season,</i> Sturl. iii. 167; vetrnátta skeið, <i>the season when winter sets in;</i> um vetrnátta skeið, Ld. 186, Gísl. 96. Fms. iii. 24, xi. 108 (cp. sumar-nætr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
