              "__html": "að, <i>to become winter;</i> líðr fram haustinu, tekr at vetra, <i>the winter began to set in, it became wintry,</i> Fms. viii. 435 (v. l.), Finnb. 310; rak á hríðir ek vetraði, Orkn. 190.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
