        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the aiding</i> or <i>abetting an assault, on the very spot,</i> which was a fineable offence, Sturl. ii. 234 (Cod. C. vættfang); um fjör-ráð ok vetfangs-bjargir, i. 145.",
            }
