          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          véar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl., is in Lex. Poët. entered among the names of <i>gods,</i> but scarcely rightly so, for the Hým. 39 is corrupt; ‘véar skulu’ probably is ‘Véorr skyli’ … drekka eitt öldr, <i>may W.</i> (i. e. <i>Thor</i>) <i>enjoy a banquet with Egir!</i> so also in the verse of Kristni S. ch. 8, véa is gen. pl. from vé = <i>aedes;</i> perh. tanna vé = <i>aedes dentium</i> = <i>the mouth</i> (?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
