        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n., mod. <strong>vælindi,</strong> <i>the gullet,</i> Skálda 169, and in mod. usage. <strong>vélendis-gangr,</strong> m. <i>belching,</i> a disease, Sturl. i. 20.",
