          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a pile of wood,</i> Fms. i. 291, ii. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-lagning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          við-lagning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>viðr-lagning,</strong> f. <i>an addition</i> = viðlag, Stj., Skálda: <i>addition,</i> in arithmetic, Alg.: in the calendar = sumarauki, Rb. 564, 568; viðrlagslaust, 542.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-latinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          við-látinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>ready to do a thing;</i> vera v. at greiða, <i>ready to pay,</i> Fær. 125; eg er ekki viðlátinn, <i>I have no time;</i> nú er svá við látið, at …, <i>now things stand so that …,</i> Orkn. 118.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-leggjanligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
