        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [an obscene word, not recorded in old writers, but etymologically remarkable, not being related to the prep. við, but akin to A. S. <i>wræne</i> = <i>libidinosus;</i> the preservation of the initial <i>v</i> by turning it into ‘við’ is similar to vágrek, q. v.]:—<i>an impotent person,</i> <strong>viðrinis-legr,</strong> adj. <i>impotent,</i> and metaph. <i>false, spurious.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
