        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘week’s meet,’</i> the ending of one week and beginning of another, Rb. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vikna-tal"
