          vil
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n. [vilja], <i>self-will, wilfulness, self-indulgence;</i> in vil ok dul, <i>wilfulness and conceit.</i> Sól. 34; fyrir dul ok vil, Gkv. 2. 38; vil er mest ok dul flestum, Hallfred; dul vættir ok vil at linna muni erfiði ok víl, Skálda (Thorodd), with a play on ‘vil’ and ‘víl,’ which are diametrically opposed.",
            }
          }
        />
