          className="link"
          href="/word/vildis-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vildis-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = vildarmaðr, Sturl. i. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vildr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vildr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., compar. vildri and vildari, <i>‘willed,’</i> i. e. <i>chosen, choice, good;</i> vildir menn = vildar menn. Dropl. 25; vildri hestar, Karl. 334; hinn vildasta vápnhest minn (cp. Dan. <i>vælig</i>), MS. 4. 6; vildra sverð, <i>a finer sword,</i> 30, Karl. 332; með hinum vildastum klæðum, Str. 12; skikkju muni vildri, <i>a cloak a good deal better,</i> Fms. vii. (in a verse); gangvera þeim sem þú hefir vildastan til …, vildasta yfirhöfn, Sks. 286; vildastan miklu, <i>the very best man,</i> Sighvat; ef ekki eru vildari föng á, <i>if there is no better choice,</i> Fær. 207, Bs. i. 66; kauss hann þann af sem honum þótti vildastr, Fms. ii. 165; honum var ekki vildara af ván, <i>he could expect nothing better</i>, Eg. 364; kvaðsk þat gjarna vilja ef Grími væri þat nokkoro vildara, … vildra ok öruggra, <i>better and safer,</i> Magn. 468.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. (see -gi), <i>very;</i> vilgis oft, <i>very often;</i> enda er úsýnt at vit finnimk svá vilgis opt at mitt sé vænna, Mork. 50; vilgi mjök, <i>very much;</i> hann langaði til engra dægra, hann kvíddi ok engu vilgi mjök, Bs. i. 393; ef þú ættir vilgi mikils vald, Hbl. 25; vilgi víðr, <i>very wide, immense,</i> Hd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vili"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vili
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (sounded vilji), gen. vilja; [Ulf. <i>wilja</i> = θέλημα; Dan. <i>villje</i>]:—<i>will, a wish, desire;</i> sigr-sæll er góðr vili, Bs. i. 746; göra e-t vilja hendi, <i>to do with willing hand, purposely,</i> Jb. 363 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vili-sess"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vili-sess
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the mind’s seat, the breast</i> or <i>heart</i> (?), Sdm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": ":—the FORMS of this verb,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilja-klaedi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilja-klæði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = vildar-klæði, Vm. 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilja-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilja-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>joyless, joy-bereft,</i> Vkv. 11 (29?); mér viljalaussi, Gkv. 2. 9: árna viljalauss á vegum, Gg. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilja-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilja-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>unwillingness,</i> Gþl. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilja-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilja-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>willing,</i> N. G. L. ii. 365.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (prop. a part.), <i>willing, inclined;</i> nú væra ek á þat viljaðr, at …, <i>I should like to …,</i> Sturl. i. 6l, 67; (á-viljaðr), Fb. i. 63; skal ek eigi verr v. (<i>less eager, less ready</i>), en hann, Fms. vii. 275; at allir mundi vel til viljaðir at styrkja hans ríki, viii. 104; engi skal vera v. betr enn ek (<i>more eager than I</i>) at vera úþarfr þeim búöndum, Ó. H. 209; augu jafnt viljuð til allrar umsjá, 655 xiii. A. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = vild, Skáld H. i. 20, 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>willing;</i> göra e-t v.: = viljugr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljanliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljanliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>willingly,</i> Fms. xi. 442, Skálda 208.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljanligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljanligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>willing,</i> Fms. ii. 33, K. Á. 74, Skálda 208.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar. viljastr, = vildari, vildastr, Sks. 286 B, Barl. 98; viljastr = vildastr, Barl. 12, 121, 126, 174; tvá menn þá sem viljastir eru (<i>the two best men</i>) á þeim fundi, N. G. L. i. 383.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viljugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viljugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>willing, ready,</i> Sks. 348; v. til e-s, Fms. v. 144: <i>to one’s liking,</i> honum var viljaðra en nokkurum öðrum gott at göra, Karl. 543; var mér ok viljugt at heyra ekki bréfit, Bs. i. 861; hvárt sem henni væri þat viljugt eða miðr, Fas. i. 17; þann veg sem honum væri viljugastr, Bs. i. 910.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilkit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilkit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. n. [this word is a απ. λεγ., formed from vilgi, by turning the indecl. <i>gi</i> into a regular adjective form, analogous to what has taken place in einginn or öngr from einn-gi, margr or manngr from mann-gi]:—<i>not wished for, dismal;</i> þótt vilkit sé, <i>though it is dismal news,</i> Skv. 1. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to bewilder;</i> ok er svá villt fyrir mér (<i>there is such bewilderment before me</i>) at ek veit eigi frá mér, Háv. 56.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a going astray, losing the way:</i> metaph. <i>error, falsehood,</i> villa ok fáfræði, Sks. 613 B; lögvilla (q. v.), hann snöri því í villu er hón hafði mælt, Nj. 161; Þorleifr spaki er með viti lagði þá villu, Fms. x. 379: eccl. <i>false doctrine, heresy,</i> Rb. 338; Djöfuls villa, 655. 56; villa Arii, <i>the Arian heresy,</i> Ann.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villatta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villátta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = villiátt, <i>a false direction, bewilderment;</i> ef maðr gengr á villáttur á mörk …, ganga á mörk ok villáttu, N. G. L. i. 393, 400.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in COMPDS: villiátt, villibráð, villidýr, villieldr, villifygli, villifærr, villigata, villigraðungr, villigöltr, villiráða, villisauðr, villiskógr, villiský, villistigr, villisvin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-att"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-átt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a false direction,</i> Sks. 1, 4, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-brad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-bráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [mid. H. G. <i>wilt-prât;</i> Germ. <i>wild-pret, -braten</i>]:—<i>venison,</i> Stj. 80, 160, Fas. iii. 274; in western Icel. a kind of <i>minced-meat</i> is called villibráð (= kæfa, q. v.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-dyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-dýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wild beast</i>, Sks. 50, Stj. 18, Barl. 81.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-eldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-eldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>wild-fire,</i> Edda 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-fygli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-fygli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wild fowl,</i> Karl. 472.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-faerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-færr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>bewildering, difficult to find the way:</i> þeim var villifært til bæjarins, Bjarn. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
