      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-saudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-sauðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wild sheep,</i> Karl. 246.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-skogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-skógr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wild forest,</i> Karl. 71.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-sky"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-ský
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a bewildering cloud,</i> Hom. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-stigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-stigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wild path,</i> Barl. 50, Stj. 637, Sks. 1, 616, Fms. viii. 48, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villi-svin"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villi-svin
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wild boar,</i> Fms. x. 88, Karl. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/villr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          villr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Ulf. <i>wilþeis</i> = ἄγριος; A. S., Engl., and Germ. <i>wild</i>; O. H. G. <i>wildi</i>; Dan.-Swed. <i>vild</i>]:—<i>wild</i>; hverfa af villum götum, <i>from wild (false) paths,</i> Sks. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a joy, comfort;</i> þat eina var veslum til vilnaðar, Al. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilnan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilnan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vilnun,</strong> f. = vilnaðr; styrkrleik vilnunar, … heilsu fyrir vilnun, Greg. 46; iðrask með vilnan, <i>to repent with hope,</i> Hom. 78; vera í góðri vilnun, <i>in good cheer,</i> Sks. 168 B; vænta sér engrar vilnunar, Al. 109: in mod. usage, <i>favour;</i> ör-vilnan, <i>despair.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilnask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilnask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to hope for a thing, deem</i> so and so <i>of it,</i> with gen.; vilnumk ek þess nú, at …, <i>would that,</i> Vkv. 29; þó vilnumk ek hins, at …, Fbr. 213; vilnaðisk hann jafnan Guðs miskunnar, en tortryggði aldri, Fms. v. 152; mun ek þess vilnask at hamingja mun fylgja, Fs. 23; vilnumk ek ok gleðjumk ek af Dróttins várs gæzku, 655 xxxiii. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilpa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilpa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a cesspool,</i> a word freq. in mod. usage, but not recorded in old writers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., part. from vilja, <i>wished, desired;</i> era sá vinr öðrum er vilt eitt segir, <i>he is no friend who only speaks as one wills,</i> Hm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vilza"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vilza
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>matter out of a sore;</i> vogr ok vilsa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vim
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vím,</strong> n. <i>giddiness, a swimming in the head, wavering,</i> as if out of one’s senses.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
