        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>biassed, partial in one’s friendship;</i> eigi var hann v. í dómum, <i>be was no respecter of persons in his judgment,</i> Orkn. 160; vinhallr undir höfðingja, Bs. i. 142; at erki-biskup hafi nökkut v. verit í málinu, Fms. viii. 100, ix. 331, v. l.",
            }
