              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘wind-vein,’</i> Al. 22: prop. <i>an artery,</i> according to vulgar belief that the arteries were ducts of air, and the veins of blood. See Liddell and Scott’s Lex. s. v. ἀρτηρία.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vind-old"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vind-öld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘wind-age,’ time of tempests,</i> Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a hank of yarn;</i> vindur er hafa skal í vef, Fbr. 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. vind, (vin’g = vind ek, Grett. in a verse, v<i>ing</i> ek háls af kjúkl<i>ing</i>um); pret. vatt (Dan. <i>vandt</i>), vazt, vatt, pl. undu (vundu); subj. yndi; part. undinn: reflex., pres. vizt, and pret. vazt, see below: [Goth., A. S., and Hel. <i>windan;</i> Engl. <i>wind;</i> Germ. <i>winden;</i> Dan. <i>vinde</i>]:—<i>to wring, twist,</i> Fas. ii. 525; vinda klæði, <i>to wring (wet) clothes,</i> Ld. 46; en er hann kom í eyna vatt hann klæði sín, Eg. 219; vóru allir vátir, settusk þeir niðr við eldinn ok tóku at vinda sik, Eb. 274; hann vatt þar ór skál fulla vatns, Stj. 392; hann tók til fjötursins ok vatt hann í sundr, Fms. xi. 289; hann vatt ljáinn í sundr milli handa sér, Fb. i. 522.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinda-spika"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinda-spíka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = vindáss, Fas. iii. 232, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vindandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vindandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [vend], a gramm. term, implying the use of the old letter ‘vend’ in spelling v-rungu, v-rangr, v-reiðr, see introduction to letter R; sem þá at <i>v</i> sé af tekit fþessu nafni ‘<i>v</i>rungu,’ því at Þýðerskir menn ok Danskir hafa <i>v</i> fyrir <i>r</i> í þessu nafni ok mörgum öðrum ok þat hyggjum vér fornt mál vera, en nú er þat kallat vindandin (vindandi in) forna í skáld-skap, því at þat er nú ekki haft í Norrænu-máli, Skálda 189 (in the treatise of Olave Hvíta-skáld).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wind;</i> in compds, blíð-vindi, þýð-vindi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vindill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vindill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vindull,</strong> m. <i>a wisp.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vindingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vindingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>windings,</i> = spjörr, <i>strips wound round the legs,</i> instead of hose, Art. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vindir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vindir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>Vindr,</strong> m. pl. <i>the Wends;</i> Vinda-höfðingi, -herr, -skip, -snekkja, Fms. ii. 299, 308, v. 134, xi. 375.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vindla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vindla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, (sec vindill), <i>to wind up;</i> þú sitr yfir ull-laupi konu þinnar ok vindlar ull, er hón kembir, Bret. (1849) ch. 13, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
