        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. vinar; dat. vin, Hm. 41, 42 (seldom vini); pl. vinir, acc. vini, 24 (vinu, Hkr. i. 183, in a verse, cannot be an acc. from vinr). As in sonr (q. v.) the nominative <i>r</i> is freq. dropped, and vinr and vin are both in old and mod. writers and speech used promiscuously: [in A. S. <i>wine;</i> Dan. <i>ven;</i> Swed. <i>vän</i>; vinr is ‘par excellence’ a Scandinavian word, frændi being used only in the sense of <i>a kinsman;</i> vinr is akin to vin, f., referring to a lost root verb vinan, van, vunun, to which also belongs the verb una, q. v.; analogous to vin and vinr are the Lat. <i>amicus</i> and <i>amoenus.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinstr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. vinstrar, = <i>the third stomach</i> in ruminating animals; eina vinstr, vinstrina, freq. in mod. usage, but not recorded in old writers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinstri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinstri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar. [Dan. <i>venstre;</i> Swed. <i>vänstre</i>], <i>the left;</i> um vinstri hönd, Nj. 28, Fms. vi. 165; til vinstri handar, 439; hvárki til hægri handar né vinstri, Stj. 438; á vinstri hlið, Fms. ii. 330; vinstri hönd, vinstra auga, eyra, vinstri fótr, etc.; görask vinstri handar menn e-s, <i>one’s left-hand men,</i> i. e. <i>adversaries,</i> Hom. 102; vinstra megin, Hrafn. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>venlig</i>], <i>friendly;</i> in ú-vinuligr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinza"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinza
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [Engl. <i>winnow;</i> from vindr], <i>to winnow corn;</i> ferr hón til iðju sinnar at vinza korn, Thom. 484.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vinzari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vinzari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [provinc. Dan. <i>vindser;</i> corrupt from bismer?], <i>a steelyard;</i> pundara rangan eða vinzara, N. G. L. i. 324.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vippa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vippa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [cp. Dan. <i>vippe</i> = Engl. <i>whip</i>], a nickname, Sturl. i. 118 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vipr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vipr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. viprar (?), not vipur, for the <i>r</i> is radical, as is seen from the spelling in vellums and also from Norse <i>vipre,</i> Ivar Aasen:—<i>a toy;</i> barna vipr, <i>a child’s toy;</i> þat þótti allt sem barna vipr er aðrar konur görðu hjá því sem hón görði, Mirm. 140 (Ed. Kölbing); þykkir honum allt sem ungmennis-leikr eðr barna vipr þat sem hann hafði áðr numit hjá klerkdómi meistara Peri, Clar.; þótti allt barna vipr þat er aðrar konur höfðu í skarti hjá henni, Ld. 122 (vipur einar, Fms. ii. 21, l. c., should be vip<i>rar</i> einar?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vipra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vipra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to draw the lips together;</i> vipra varirnar, Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vipta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vipta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vifta,</strong> u, f., in Darr. perh. read ‘vipt’ er orpin, [vefa], <i>the woof;</i> þarmar ór mönnum fyrir viptu ok garn, Nj. 275.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., in ú-virða, <i>disregard.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. virði, mod. virti; [cp. verð; this word and its derivatives are in mod. Norse proncd. and spelt with <i>y, vyrda;</i> Swed. <i>vörda</i>]:—<i>to fix the worth of a thing, to tax, value;</i> síðan vóru virð fé Hallgerðar, Nj. 24; búar skolu virða fúlgur ómagans tvennar, Grág. i. 259; þar skolu fylgja einn eyrir ok tuttugu, ok virða til friðs, D. I. i. 199; þrjár merkr ok virt til vaðmála, 203; búar skolu virða skip þat til vöru eðr til brends silfrs, Grág. (Kb.) ii. 68; virða e-t til smœrs, D. N. ii. 93.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. [from verð; cp. hirð, verðung], poët. <i>king’s men, men in the king’s pay, a body-guard;</i> the etymology implied in ‘virðar’ heita þeir menn er ‘meta’ mál manna, Edda 107, is scarcely true; heill skaltú, vísi, virða njóta, Hkv. 1. 54; vápn-söngr virða, Akv. 32; afkárr söngr virða, 38; efla víg með virðum, Skv. 1. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the worth of a thing;</i> in compds, and-virði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virði-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>worthily, honourably, respectfully;</i> kveðja e-n v., Ld. 32, passim: <i>magnificently,</i> skrýðask v., Fms. i. 147.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virði-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>worthy, worshipful;</i> v. herra N.M., <i>gracious lord</i>, the title of a king, Gþl. 130, Bs. i. 755, Stj. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdi-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virði-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>vain-glorious,</i> Þiðr. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a valuation, taxing;</i> ef eigi er rétt at virðingu farit, Grág. i. 189; kveðja búa til skiptinga eða virðinga, ii. 342; þau þrjú hundruð er hón átti þar í, eptir góðra manna virðingu, Dipl. iv. 16; at lögligri virðingu, Nj. 103.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdinga-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðinga-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of mickle worth, worshipful,</i> Ísl. ii. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a thing of special value,</i> Grág. i. 500; kirkja á þrjú hundruð í v., Vm. 9; Bjarni bauð úfrítt v., bæði fyrir vaðmál ok kúgildi, Dipl. iii. 13; tíu hundruð í v. ok sjau hundruð í flytjanda eyri, v. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-for"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-för
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an honourable journey,</i> Fms. vii. 99.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>greedy of honour, ambitious,</i> Valla L. 206: in mod. usage, <i>vain, fond of flattery.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-heimbod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-heimboð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an honourable invitation,</i> Sturl. i. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-hlutr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-hlutr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an honourable share, great credit,</i> Lv. 13.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a worthy lady,</i> Sturl. i. 19.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without honour, rank, distinction,</i> Hkr. ii. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an appraiser,</i> Grág. i. 208: <i>a man of distinction, rank,</i> Eg. 162, 466, Nj. 22, Fms. vi. 113; höfðingi ok v. mikill, Fs. 156; Helgi var v., Gullþ. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-munr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-munr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>disparity in rank,</i> Fms. iv. 28, 260, vi. 359.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-rad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-ráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a respectable estate, condition,</i> Þorf. Karl. 370: <i>an honourable offer,</i> Fms. vii. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-vaenligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-vænligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>honourable,</i> Fs. 44, Grett. 100 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdingar-vaenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðingar-vænn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>honourable,</i> Sturl. i. 105 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a taxer,</i> Edda, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = verðr (q. v.), <i>a meal;</i> in the allit. law phrase, at verði eðr at virði, <i>neither at meal nor mess,</i> Grág. ii. 92, cp. Hm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virdu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virðu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>virðti-liga</strong> = virðiligr, virðiliga, qq. v., Stj., Fb., Barl., passim, and so in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virgill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virgill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>virgull,</strong> m. [Goth. <i>wurgils;</i> the root is in Germ. <i>erwürgen</i>]:—<i>a halter;</i> höggva virgulinn sundr, Hom. 117; virgilinn, Bs. i. 225, Pr. 414; var virgill dreginn á háls honum, Fms. vii. 13; virgul (acc.), Fb. ii. 330; hvárki gálgi né virgill, Hom. 118 (virgull, Fms. v. l. c.): poët., virgill handar = <i>a bracelet,</i> Edda; hryn-virgill brynju, <i>a ring in chain-armour,</i> Eg. (in a verse). <strong>virgil-nár,</strong> m. <i>a corpse on a gallows,</i> Hm.; cp. gálg-nár, Grág.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virkda-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virkða-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a private chamber,</i> where one receives intimate friends, Clem. 130.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., gen. virkja, <i>a worker, doer;</i> in compds, íll-virki, spell-v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virki-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = verk, Anecd. 8 new Ed.: esp. in compds, íll-virki, stór-v., þrek-v., mann-v., qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, = verkja, <i>to pain;</i> sárið virkti, <i>the wound was painful,</i> Art. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>working;</i> in compds, stór-virkr, mikil-v., harð-v., góð-v., etc.; virkr dagr, <i>a work-day, week-day,</i> K. Á. 176, Rb. 78.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virkt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virkt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., older virkð, [verk = <i>work</i>], prop. <i>work,</i> but with the notion of <i>special care, tender care;</i> hann skalt þú varðveita með allri virkð, 623. 15; Ástríðr læknaði hann með mikilli virkð, Fms. x. 370; hann bað af þeim virkta vinum sínum ok frændum, <i>he bespoke their kindness towards his friends and kinsmen,</i> i. e. <i>he recommended his friends and kinsmen to their special charge,</i> Hkr. i. 160.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virkta-lid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virkta-lið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = virktamenn, Ísl. ii. 91.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/virkta-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          virkta-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a chosen man, favourite man;</i> virktamenn Sveins konungs, <i>the king’s best men,</i> Fms. xi. 366; þeir kváðu hann vera virktamann, <i>said he was a capital man,</i> Ó. H. 152; þræli þeim er lengi hefir hennar virkðamaðr verit, Clem. 130.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
