        >
          virtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>wyrt;</i> Engl. <i>wort;</i> Ivar Aasen <i>vyrt</i> or <i>vurt;</i> Swed. <i>vört</i>]:—<i>the sweet-wort, new beer,</i> not yet fully fermented; virtr ok vín (<i>ale and wine</i>) is an allit. phrase; á víni ok virtri, Sdm. 8; and so in the Faroe lays, <i>virtur og so vin,</i> A.A. 322.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
