      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>witless;</i> vitlaus hljóð, Skálda: <i>witless, foolish,</i> Fms. ix. 335, Barl. 127: <i>mad</i>, Boll. 350; v. snápr, Stj. 625, Bs. i. 371, Magn. 518, Eg. 217 (of a drunken person).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>madness,</i> Stj. 91, Fms. vii. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-leysingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-leysingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a witless, insane person, idiot,</i> Fms. i. 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-litill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-lítill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>small-witted, of little wit,</i> Grág. ii. 112, Fms. ii. 154, Hrafn. 10: compar. <strong>vit-minni,</strong> Lv. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-lostinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-lostinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘wit-struck,’ insane,</i> K. Á. 120.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wit, a clever person,</i> Bárð. 169.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-menni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-menni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = vitmaðr, Lv. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of much wit, clever,</i> Odd. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [cp. Ulf. <i>weit-wods</i> = μάρτυς, <i>weit-wodiþa</i> and <i>weit-wodei</i> = μαρτύριον, <i>weit-wodian</i> = μαρτυρειν; thus Icel. vitorð would be qs. vitoð]:—<i>private counsel, confidence;</i> vera á fleiri manna vitorði, <i>in the confidence of more men,</i> Nj. 231; var þetta fyrst á fárra manna vitorði (viti, v. l.), 229; ekki var margra manna vitorð á hans ætterni, Fms. x. 391; ekki var þat í vitorði alþýðu, vi. 134; af nökkuru vitorði, Róm. 286; þat var á margra manna vitorði með hverjum skildaga …, Ó. H. 95; vera í ráðum ok vitorðum með e-m um verk, Eg. 139; nema hann kalli þik til vitorðs með sér, <i>unless he takes thee into his counsel,</i> Sks. 361 B; fyrir útan vitorð e-s, <i>without one’s knowledge,</i> 745: allit., fyrir útan vitorð eðr vilja þess er átti, Grág. ii. 348; fékk hann ekki skírt sik frá vitorðinu, <i>he could not clear himself from the charge of cognisance,</i> Róm. 287: in mod. usage, vera í vitorði með e-m, as a law term mostly in a bad sense.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-samligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-samligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = vitrligr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-skertr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-skertr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘short of wit,’ insane.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-stola"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-stola
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘wit-stolen,’ insane,</i> Fas. iii. 300: freq. in mod. usage, = <i>wild, frantic;</i> cp. ham-stola.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-stolinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-stolinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. = vitstola, Fms. vi. 198, K. Á. 120, Stj. 153; vitstolnir menn ok vanaðir, N. G. L. ii. 300.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vit-vandr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vit-vandr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>requiring cleverness,</i> Konr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a verb whose present is in a preterite form, see Gramm. p. xxiii: pres. veit, veizt (veiztu), veit; plur. vitum, vituð, vitu, later and mod. vitið, vita; the latter form appears in vellums early in the 14th century, e. g. þér vitið, Fms. vi. 144, from the Hulda: pret. vissa, vissir, vissi (never visti, cp. Goth. <i>wissa,</i> mod. Dan. <i>vidste</i>): subj. pres. vita, pret. vissa; imperat. vit, vittú; part. vitaðr (vitinn, Hornklofi): with neg. suff. veit-at, <i>knows not,</i> Hm. 74; veit-k-a-ek, <i>‘wot I not I,’</i> Hkr. iii. 376; veizt-attu, Hbl. 4; vitum-a, <i>we know not,</i> Skv. 3. 18; vissi-t, <i>knew not:</i> [Ulf. <i>witan</i> = εἰδέναι, γιγνώσκειν; A. S. and Hel. <i>witan;</i> Engl. <i>wit;</i> Germ. <i>wissen;</i> Dan. <i>vide;</i> Swed. <i>vita;</i> Lat. <i>videre;</i> Gr. εἰδέναι.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vita-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vita-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a law phrase, <i>secure money,</i> i. e. secured by a verdict or the like; þat er allt vitafé er váttar vitu, ok allt þat er dómr dæmir manni, etc., Gþl. 508; sækja sem vitafé. 306; þat er v. er fest er fyrir váttum, N. G. L. i. 221: mod. vita-skuld.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vita-skuld"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vita-skuld
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an acknowledged debt;</i> at loknum öllum vita-várskuldum, <i>debts contracted in the spring,</i> Dipl. v. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitan-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitan-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>wittingly:</i> ekki mér vitanliga, <i>not in my knowledge.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitan-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitan-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>known;</i> ekki mér vitanligt <i>‘tis not known to me.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitand"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitand
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>vitend</strong> (mod. <strong>vitund</strong>), f. <i>intelligence, consciousness, a being privy to, conscious of;</i> var þat gört með yðvarri vitand ok ráði, Fms. vii. 305; í því ráði ok vitand hafði verit Hákon dúfa, ix. 452; þú Búi hefir hér vel verit í vetr, at várri vitnud, <i>in our opinion, to our knowledge.</i> Ísl. ii. 442; at minni vitund, Orkn. 254; at vér fám hvárki af þeim vitand né sýn, Fb. iii. 156; hin minnsta synd at vitan gör, <i>a willing, conscious sin.</i> Eluc. 675. 26; halda fyrir eins-eiði at sinni vitend (sic), N. G. L. ii. 68, 128; um sum íllvirki eigi tvímælis laust hvárt þér manit þurrt hafa um setið allar vitundir, Sturl. iii. 261; hyggr þú at hann muni at þér bera vitundina þá er hann skal sik undan sökum færa, Orkn. 454; með-vitund.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>knowing, witting:</i> göra e-t vitandi or ó-vitandi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitaz-gjafi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitaz-gjafi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (of a gen. <strong>vitaðr</strong> = <i>surety</i>), <i>a ‘sure giver,’</i> the name of a field, the crop of which never failed; þat var akr er kallaðr var Vitazgjafi þvíat hann varð aldregi úfrær, … eigi brásk hann Vitazgjafi enn, Glúm. 340, 343.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> a, m. <i>a signal;</i> þat þótti eigi góðs viti, <i>it boded nothing good,</i> Fs. 20; ílls-viti, <i>boding evil.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [vit B], <i>to call on, visit,</i> with gen.; vitja frænda sinna, Fms. i. 184; at þeir mundi koma ok vitja Gizorar, <i>pay G. a visit, attack him at home,</i> Sturl. iii. 183, Fms. vii. 37; þóttusk þeir vita, hvar hans var at vitja, <i>where he was to be found,</i> 203: <i>to come to look after</i> a previous agreement or promise, vitja þessa mála, Fær. 255; hann er kominn at vitja heita þeirra, er …, Fms. v. 43; vitja þeirra einka-mála, er …, vi. 288; vitja ráðsins, Ísl. ii. 241; þeir vitja graðungsins (<i>they went to fetch the bull</i> = Germ. <i>abholen</i>), en selja Kormaki bauginn, Korm. 218; at vitja gjafar þeirrar er hann hafði þegit, Eg. 35; ver hér í nótt ok vitja heilla, of soothsaying, Korm. 206.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitjan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitjan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vitjon,</strong> f. <i>a visit</i>, Fms. vii. 88; þú kennir eigi tíð vitjunar þinnar, Greg. 39, = þekkja ekki sinn vitjunar-tíma, N. T.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to bewitch;</i> in finn-vitka, q. v., and perh. in Hm.—skylit þann vitka vár, 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitkask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitkask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to recover one’s senses,</i> Ver. 31, MS. 625. 72; œrir vitkask, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>witiga</i> = <i>a prophet;</i> whence Engl. <i>wizard, witch;</i> O. H. G. <i>wizago;</i> of which word the mod. Germ. <i>weissager</i> is a corruption, as if from <i>sagen</i>]:—prop. <i>a wise man,</i> but only used of <i>a wizard;</i> eru völur allar frá Víðólfi, vitkar allir frá Vilmeiði, Hdl. 32; vitka líki (<i>in a warlock’s shape</i>) fórtu verþjóð yfir, Ls. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [Dan. <i>vidne</i>], <i>to witness, attest,</i> with acc.; vitna málit ok segja …, Al. 125; vitna með lyrittar-eiði, Gþl. 435; vitnað kaup, N. G. L. i. 24; vitna e-t undir e-n, <i>to call one as a witness,</i> ii. 259, Nj. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitna-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitna-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= vitnislaust, Sd. 140.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitneskja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitneskja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a sign, signal;</i> reisa upp háfa stöng til vitneskju, Al. 88; kvað þat vera myndu góða vitneskju (<i>a good sign</i>) er svá hafði at borizk, Ó. H. 26.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>witnes;</i> Engl. <i>witness;</i> Dan. <i>vidne</i> = <i>testis</i>]:—<i>witness, testimony</i> (prop. vitni is the act, ‘váttr’ the person, but sometimes the terms are confounded, as <i>witness</i> is in Engl.); bera vitni, <i>to bear witness;</i> bera vitni með e-m, Eg. 61, Fms. vi. 194; sama vitni berr Galenus, Lækn.; bera e-m gótt vitni, Nj. 11; eins þeirra vitni skyldi hrinda tíu Norðmanna vitni, Ó. H. 227: <i>an evidence, outward mark</i>, var þar orpinn haugr til vitnis, 655 xiv. B. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [vitt = <i>charms</i>], a poët. name of <i>the wolf,</i> no doubt from its being a charmed, bewitched animal (witches rode on wolves), Lex. Poët., Gm. 23, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-burdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-burðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a bearing witness, giving evidence,</i> K. Á. 50, Fms. x. 22: as a law term, Gþl. 475; gjalda samkvæði at v. þeim er hann hefir borit, Grág. i. 39; leita vitnisburða, Fms. vi. 194, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-bud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-búð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the ‘booth of witness,’ the Tabernacle,</i> Stj. 310.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-baerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-bærr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>able to bear witness;</i> vera v. um mál, Gþl. 400; skal hann með engu móti v., H. E. ii. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-fastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-fastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘proof-fast,’ that can be proved,</i> Fms. ii. 242.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-fjall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-fjall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = <i>the mount of the Covenant,</i> Hom. 107.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unattested;</i> vitnislausar sögur, Hkr. iii. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a witness,</i> = váttr, 655 xxiii. 1, D. N. i. 51, Grág. i. 219, Jb. 406.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-sannr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-sannr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>convicted by evidence,</i> Gþl. 393.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitnis-ork"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitnis-örk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the ark of the covenant,</i> = sáttmáls-örk, Stj. 311, Eluc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = vættr, <i>a wight,</i> Hkv. 1. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "vitr, vitrt, adj., the <i>r</i> is radical; compar. vitrari, superl. vitrastr:—<i>wise,</i> of a person; vitr ok víðfrægr, Symb. 32; þú ert okkar vitrari, Fms. i. 59; vitr maðr ok réttorðr, Fb. i. 516; manna vitrastr, Nj. 2; kvenna vitrust ok vænust, Fms. vi. 119; þeir sem vitrari váru, 13; honum virðisk mærin vitr ok hæversk, 57; at ráði allra vitrustu manna, Anal. 160; þeir er vitrir hugðusk vera, Barl. 127; vitr kona ertú, Ragna, Orkn. 254; hvat þá varð vitri (dat. fem.), Am. 12; Sigurðr jarl var manna vitrastr, Fms. i. 13; hann var vitr maðr ok forspár um marga hluti, Eb. 42; jafnan vægir inn vitrari, Fms. vi. 220; fár er svá vitr at allt sjái sem er, a saying, Orkn. 304; stór-vitr, all-vitr, al-vitr, ú-vitr, spak-vitr, mis-vitr, slæg-vitr, qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitr-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitr-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>wisdom;</i> at þú ráðir drauminn ok lýsir svá yfir vitrleik þínum, Fms. xi. 6; svá bar v. hans af öllum mönnum, Edda (pref.); skörungr at lærdómi ok vitrleik, Bs. passim; snilld ok v., Fms. i. 141; vitrleiki Einars, Lv. 53: of a dog, <i>cleverness,</i> Fms. x. 254: ironic., vitringinum Eyjólfi, <i>the wiseacre E.,</i> Nj. 235. <strong>vitrleiks-maðr,</strong> m. = vitringr, Gísl. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitr-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitr-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>wisely, with wisdom,</i> Fms. i. 203, Sks. 772, Fb. ii. 136, passim; ú-vitrliga.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Old Engl. <i>witterly</i>], <i>wise,</i> of a thing or action; v. stjörn. Fms. vi. 30; v. ráð, ix. 442, xi. 28; vitrligar ráðagörðir, Ld. 238; snjallara ok vitrligra, Fms. i. 104: er þat vitrligra, vi. 8; vitrlig andsvör, Barl. 125, passim; ú-vitrligr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitr-mall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitr-máll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wise in speech,</i> Clem. 128, Stj. 460.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>wit, wisdom, sagacity;</i> talði þá hafa litla vitru sýnda í sínum ráðum, Fms. viii. 168; fyrir vitru sakir ok dirfðar, iv. 263; bæði sakir vitru ok framburðar, Orkn. 62 (in Lex. Run.); at vitra ormsins efldi einfaldleik dúfunnar, Greg. 20; af heilagri vitru, Clem. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitran"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitran
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>vitrun,</strong> f. <i>a revelation;</i> Guðlig vitran, Magn. 492.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wise man, sage</i> (like A. S. <i>wita</i>), Barl. 127; hann var höfðingi mikill ok vitringr, Ld. 24; hinn mesti vitringr, Fb. ii. 80; freq. in mod. usage, lög-vitringr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vits-munir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vits-munir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>‘stores of wit,’ sense, sagacity, cleverness;</i> mun nú betra at hafa vitsmuni við, Nj. 76; lærdóm ok vitzmuni, Bs. i. 90; hefir hann komit á vitzmuni við mik, <i>outwitted me,</i> Lv. 48; með vitzmunum mínum ok hvatleika, Nj. 276; ok er hann var nökkurra vetra gamall, óxu þó eigi mjök v. hans, Sd. 176; heill í sínum vitzmunum, <i>in one’s full senses,</i> D. N. (phrase in wills); eigi er jafnkomit um vitzmuni með ykkr, Fb. ii. 43; freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [akin to vita], <i>witchcraft, charms;</i> engi maðr skal hafa í húsi sínu staf eðr stalla, vitt eðr blót, N. G. L. i. 383; engi maðr má trúa á vitt eðr blót, eor rót, 389; ok draptu á vitt (vætt Cod.) sem völur, Ls. 24; vitta-vættr, <i>a bewitched wight, a wizard, witch,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to bewitch, charm;</i> vitti hón ganda, Vsp., cp. vitka.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitta-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitta-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>full of charms;</i> belgr vittafullr, <i>a bag filled with charms,</i> Kormak., cp. Þorf. Karl. 374 (see taufr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vittlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vittlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a witling, simpleton,</i> Krók. 6 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vittugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vittugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>skilled in witchcraft;</i> nam hann vittugri valgaldr kveða, Vtkv. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vittull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vittull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wittol, simpleton;</i> in mann-vitull (q. v.), Ísl. ii. 340.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., in ú-vituligr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Engl. <i>witty</i>], <i>clever;</i> vitugr ok snjallr, Fms. viii. 390 (v. l.), Fagrsk. 14; svá vitugir, at þeir kunni at ráða fyrir orði ok eiði, Grág. ii. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vitund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vitund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>conscience</i> (see vitand).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vixtr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vixtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [see vitka], <i>bewitched;</i> at hann myndi vixtr vera, ok eigi svá vitandi sem hann skyldi (sem hann myndi vixtr verða eða óvitandi, v. l.), Fagrsk. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viz"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          viz
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>far, widely;</i> see víðr II.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vizka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vizka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., qs. vitska, [vit], <i>wisdom,</i> Fas. i. 392; sýnit vizku yðra, 623. 29; kraptr ok v., Barl. 99; gef honum vizku þíns helga anda, 100; skildi konungr þat af vizku sinni, at …, Ó. H. 98; er þat eigi undarligt at gæfa fylgi vizku, 123, passim; vizku-bragð, <i>a wise contrivance,</i> Fær. 157; mikill er vizku-munr orðinn, Nj. 36; vizku-tré, <i>the tree of knowledge,</i> 671. 6: freq. in mod. usage, Jesu óx aldr og vizka og náð, N. T., Pass., Vídal.: ú-vizka, <i>foolishness</i>; sér-vizka, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vizkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vizkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>clever, sensible</i>; vizkan (Cod. viþcan) mann, Fms. x. 405; kona knó ok vel vizk, Bs. i. 345.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vizku-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vizku-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>wisely,</i> Barl. 98.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vizku-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vizku-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wise,</i> Sturl. iii. 246, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vizku-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vizku-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wise man</i>, Fms. vi. 204, x. 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/via"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vía
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f., mostly in plur. <strong>víur,</strong> <i>the eggs</i> of flies in blown meat, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/via-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vía
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að. <i>to twitter,</i> of young birds in the nest; og víðka kokin vesallig, víandi láta mata sig, Bb. 2. 25.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vídd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>width, wideness, extension;</i> breidd, vídd, lengd, Fms. x. 272; svá vitt land at þat var mikil borgar-vidd, <i>of the size of a large town,</i> Fas. i. 289; víðr sem stakkgarðs-vídd, Bs. i. 669.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-blainn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-bláinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the wide blue,</i> poët. <i>the heaven,</i> Edda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-bygdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-bygðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>wide-peopled,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-daelskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-dælskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. from Viði-dalr, Sturl. iii. 263.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-fadmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-faðmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wide-fathoming;</i> víðfaðmara ríki, Fms. v. 344; víðfaðmi, nickname of an ancient conqueror (the Danish king Ivarr Víðfaðmi), Skjöld. S., Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-fedmir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-feðmir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>wide-fathomed,</i> name of one of the heavens, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-fleygr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-fleygr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wide-flying,</i> Sks. 78, Róm. 331.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-flogull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-flögull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. id., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-fraegja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-frægja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to make wide-known,</i> of praise, Bs. i. 329, Fms. i. 258; mun nafn þitt víðfrægjask um veröldina, Fms. i. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-fraegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-frægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>far-renowned, famous,</i> Symb. 32, Fms. vi. 431; ágætari ok víðfrægri, Fb. ii. 118.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-forli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-förli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a far-travelling,</i> Bret. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-forull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-förull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>far-travelling,</i> Fms. i. 100, Al. 11; as a nickname, inn víðförli, <i>the far-traveller,</i> Oddr, Þorvaldr, Eiríkr, Hrani inn víðförli, Fms. i. 60, 274, Fb, i. 29 sqq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-gymnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-gymnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the wide-grappling,</i> poët., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-gyrdill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-gyrðill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the wide girdle of the earth,</i> i. e. <i>the sea</i>, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-heimr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-heimr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the wide world, the heavens,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>width, extent,</i> Stj. 67, 89, 163, 174, 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-lenda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-lenda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to extend a territory,</i> Sks. 460.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-lendi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-lendi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>broad lands, wideness of land,</i> Stj. 618, Þiðr. 146, Hkr. ii. 171; mart er at segja af víðlendi ferðar Ólafs, <i>the extent of his travels,</i> Fms. x. 395: <i>the wide, open, flat country,</i> Eg. 294; víðlendis-ferð, O. H. L. ch. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-lendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-lendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>having broad lands,</i> of a king, Fms. i. 199, vi. 94, xi. 201, Al. 17, Stj. 610.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>widely,</i> H. E. i. 512.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wide</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-opnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-opnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘wide open,’</i> the hall of Hel, Edda ii. 494.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-raedr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-ræðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; verða víðrætt um e-t, <i>to talk far and wide of a thing,</i> Sd. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-raess"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-ræss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [rás], <i>running far, far-roaming,</i> of deer; dýr ólm ok víðræs, Art. 79; in Gkv. 2. 11, the true reading may be, á víðræsar varga leifar (an hypallage for víðræssa varga leifar), <i>into the realm of the wide-roaming wolves,</i> i. e. <i>into the wild forest</i> (see vargr, and leif I).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-syni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-sýni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a wide outlook.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vid-synn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víð-sýnn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>with wide prospect;</i> menn vóru úti staddir á haugum nökkurum þar sem víðsýnt var, Fms. vi. 120; á víðsýna vegu, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vida-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> adv.; víðar, víðast, <i>widely, far and wide, in many places;</i> sá víða ratar, Hm.; fara víða, Eg. 41; víða um lönd, 32; hann skal svá víða vargr heita, sem …, Grág. ii. 169; hann var víða blár, Fs. 141; víða ónumit land, 18; víða um heiminn, Anal. 39; um Agðir ok víðar, Eg. 32; um allt Hálogaland ok viðarr, Fas. ii. 161; sem víðast er veröld bygð, <i>the farthest,</i> Grág. ii. 169; víðast um veröldina, <i>‘widest in the world,’</i> cp. <i>the wide world,</i> Edda (pref.): with gen., víða veraldar, Stj. 43,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidatta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðátta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>wideness, openness,</i> of a district, Sks. 504; á víðáttu sléttra hafa, 506; víðátta jarðar, 549; víðáttu skáldskapr, <i>loose, libellous poetry,</i> Grág. ii. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viderni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðerni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>width, widening, extension;</i> innan þess víðernis, H. E. i. 467; mátti þat varla standa fyrir víðerni Kristninnar, <i>it could not hinder the widening of the Church,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = víðka, Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidi-haell-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víði-hæll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a peg of willow;</i> þeir hrukku fyrir sem viðihæll, <i>as a willow-twig,</i> Fms. iv. 250.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidi-rif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víði-rif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the picking willow-twigs for fodder,</i> Sturl. i. 195 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., poët. <i>the wide sea, the main,</i> Lex. Poët.; freq. also in mod. ballads, cp. Úlf. 2. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidir-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>wiðig;</i> Engl. <i>withy;</i> cp. Lat. <i>vitis</i>], <i>a willow,</i> Edda (Gl.); þat er vex á víði, Pr. 474: in Icel. esp. <i>willow-scrub, dwarf-willow, salix repens,</i> fjalla-grávíðir = <i>salix alpina glauca;</i> bein-víðir, q. v.; loð-víðir or kotuns-víðir, <i>the cotton-willow;</i> haga-grávíðir, <i>salix repens,</i> Eggert Itin. ch. 267; used for thatching (cp. taug-reptr, Hm.), but esp. as fodder; many local names are derived from this plant: <strong>Víði-dalr, -nes, -hjalli, -ker</strong> (see kjarr), <strong>-skógr,</strong> Landn., Fs., map of Icel.: <strong>Víð-dælir,</strong> <i>men from</i> Víðidalr (whence the family name <i>Vidalin,</i> descended from Arngrim lærdi).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(sounded <strong>víkka</strong>), að, <i>to widen,</i> Bb. 2. 25; dalrinn víðkar, Bárð. 173; víðkast, id., Stj. 163.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vidr-3"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "víð, vítt, adj., compar. víðari, superl. víðastr; [A. S. <i>wid</i>; Engl. <i>wide</i>; Germ. <i>weit;</i> Dan. <i>vid</i>]:—<i>wide, large,</i> of extension; víðr ok rúmr sjór, Stj. 78; víðir skógar, Eg. 130; víð mörk, 57; víðan skjöld, Stj. 461; víða öxi, Sturl. i. 63; pallar svá víðir, at …, Grág. i. 4, passim: allit. phrase, á víða vega, <i>wide abroad, broadcast,</i> Sdm. 46; víðs vegar, <i>in all directions,</i> being scattered about; flýja víðs vegar, Fms. ii. 217, vi. 87; dreifask víðs vegar, Eg. 530.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>wîf, wîf-man</i> = <i>woman;</i> Engl. <i>wife;</i> Germ. <i>weib;</i> supposed to have originally meant <i>a weaver,</i> from vefa, vífiðr]:—<i>a woman,</i> but only in poetry; for in Icel. prose, old as well as modern, the word is quite obsolete, Rm. 22; er vaknaði víf ór svefni, Skv. 1. 16; þá varð hilmi hugr á vífi, Hkv. 2. 13; hafða ok þess vætki vífs, Hm. 102; víf en fögru, Fms. vii. 61 (in a verse); vant er stafs vífi, Am. 12; velskúfaðra vífa, Orkn. (in a verse); hamra víf, <i>the wife of the rocks, a giantess;</i> gjörninga víf, <i>a witch;</i> ósk-víf, <i>a ‘wish-wife,’ chosen, wedded wife;</i> geir-víf, <i>spear-wife,</i> = <i>Bellona,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part., in the phrase, koma að vífandi, <i>to arrive as of a sudden,</i> or <i>by chance.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifi-lengjur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífi-lengjur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. = Lat. <i>ambages;</i> also <i>vain pretexts, subterfuges.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>wound round;</i> svell-vífiðr, <i>wrapt in ice,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>wifel;</i> Engl. <i>weevil;</i> Germ. <i>webel</i>], prop. <i>a beetle;</i> cp. tord-yfill qs. tord-vifill, this sense, however, is lost.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>given to women,</i> = kvennsamr, Fagrsk. ch. 66, Konr. 14, Krók. ch. 11, Völs. R. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>hesitation;</i> also víl, víla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifl-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a cudgel, bat,</i> used in washing; með víflinni, sem konur vóru vanar at hafa til þváttar, Rd. 297; kona fór með klæði til þváttar, hón hafði vífl í hendi, ok barði hann í hel með víflinni, Fms. v. 181; grið-kona hefir vífl í hendi, ok lýstr á helluna, viii. 243; vera sem vífl at brunni, <i>to be like a bat at the well,</i> i. e. <i>to be in a surly, beating mood,</i> Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to stutter;</i> það víflaðist fyrir honum, Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/viflur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víflur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>waverings, stutterings, confusion;</i> það kómu víflur á hann.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vifni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vífni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. the being vífinn, = kvennsemi, Merl. 2. 74.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [from vega B; Ulf. <i>waihjo</i> = μάχη], <i>a fight, battle;</i> this is the oldest sense of the word, prevalent in old poems and in compds; finnask at vígi, <i>to meet for battle,</i> Vþm. 17, 18; at vígum, Gm. 49; vígs ótrauðr, Skm. 24; varr við víg, Ls. 13; val þeir kjósa, ríða vígi frá, Vþm. 41; vápn til vígs at ljá, Fsm.; víga guð, víga Njörðr, víga Freyr, <i>the god of battle;</i> verja vígi brúar-sporðana, Fms. ii. 207; Heiðar-víg, <i>the battle on the Heath,</i> Heiðarv. S.; hvar sem hón (Freyja) ríðr til vígs, þá á hón hálfan val, Edda 16; verja þeim vígi þingvöllinn, Íb. 11; verja þeim vígi völlinn, Eb. 20; at vit myndim jafn-færir til vígs, Nj. 97; eiga víg saman, <i>to have a fight together,</i> Bret. 48; engi hestr mundi hafa við þeim í vígi, Nj. 89 (hesta-víg, <i>a horse-fight</i>); Tanni ræðsk í móti Bárða, teksk þar víg afburða-fræknligt, Ísl. ii. 369; hann á víg móti Tý, Edda 42; vígs atvist, <i>presence, abetting at a fight,</i> Grág. ii. 138 (as a law term); hence is derived",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-ass"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-áss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a war-beam,</i> for defence; þeir Brandr höfðu vígása í dyrum, Sturl. ii. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-bjartr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-bjartr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘war-bright,’ glorious,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-blaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-blær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘War-breeze,’</i> name of <i>a war-steed,</i> Hkv. 2. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-baetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-bætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = vígsbætr, Grág. ii. 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-bond"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-bönd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the gods of battle,</i> Vsp.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-dis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-dís
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘war-fairy,’</i> name of one of the Valkyrja; a pr. name of a woman, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vig-djarfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          víg-djarfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>daring, gallant, stout-hearted,</i> Hm., Al. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
