        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a small suppurating pimple;</i> perh. fem. is the better form; the word is freq. in mod. usage, and seems to occur in Harms. 44 (vos ok löstu, see Lex. Poët. s. v. vös).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
