        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a pret. 3rd pers. plur. of a lost vringa, <i>to wring,</i> Skálda (in a verse of Egil); this is the only authentic written instance of <i>vr.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
