        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaengr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vængr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., pl. vængir; [A. S. <i>winge;</i> Engl. <i>wing;</i> Dan. <i>vinge;</i> the root word is vega]:—<i>a wing;</i> báða vængi, Grág. ii. 170; breiða vængina út, Al. 21; þessa tvá vængi, 677. 3; enn af hans vængjum kveða vind koma, Vþm. 37; væng;i þeir skóku, Sól. 54; með vængjunum huldi hann landit allt, Fms. viii. 10: the phrase, heyra e-ð undir væng, <i>to hear a thing ‘under the wing,’</i> i. e. <i>to hear it by a side-wind, hear it whispered.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaeni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = vænd, <i>a prospect;</i> þótti honum væni á, at …, Fms. ix. 475; mikils ílls af væni, Edda 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaening"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘weening,’ imputation;</i> kvæðit var mjök kveðit, svá at hélt við væningar, of a love-song, Fms. v. 173.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaenir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vænir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>Venir,</strong> m. <i>Lake Wener,</i> in Sweden, Fas. ii. 4, 6, Hkr. i. 41; á ísi vatns þess er Veni heitir, Edda 82. One is tempted to think that in the verse of Bragi (Edda begin.) the word ‘vineyjar’ may cover this local name; perh. ‘Vaeneris (like mútaris, vartaris, see Gramm. p. xxvii, col. 1, ll. 21–25) víðri valrauf;’ <i>the ‘wide spoil of the Wener’</i> = the island of Zealand, for the legend can only have applied to Lake Wener, and not to Lake Malar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaenkask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vænkask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to bid fair, look well, take a good turn;</i> þykkir þeim vænkask um sinn hag. Fas. iii. 174; þykkir honum vænkask umb, Fms. xi. 135; ok vænkask nú mjök, Fs. 25; þótti mér nú ekki v. um, Pr. 412.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vænn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [ván], <i>promising, likely, to be expected;</i> er vænst at liðnar sé mínar lífs-stundir, Fms. ii. 2; segir ella vera vandræða vænt, 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaenta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vænta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, and <strong>vætta,</strong> the latter form being in old writers the most frequent, and in poets, e. g. in rhymes, v<i>ætt</i>i and h<i>ætt</i>a, s<i>ætt,</i> h<i>itt</i>a, and the like; [Dan. <i>vænte</i>]:—<i>to expect, hope for,</i> with gen.; báðu hann engrar vináttu vænta, Hkr. ii. 217; væntum vér oss góðra viðtakna, Fms. xi. 282; af þér vættu vér miskunnar, 623. 34; ok vættir þú þaðan fulltings, Blas. 48; ok vættir þangat Pálnatóka, Fms. xi. 20: vætta, opp. to kvíða, vætta fagnaðar en kvíða við harmi, Skálda; vænta at …, vænti ek, at þér muni vel fara, Nj. 154; vænti ek enn at koma muni betri dagar, Bs. i; dul vættir ok vil, at …, Skálda; þeir vættu at hann mundi lifna, 623. 36; hón vætti (<i>suspected</i>) at Grímr mundi eptir þeim leita, Landn. 214, v. l.; vætti ek (<i>I fear</i>) at þú fáir ekki ríkit, Hkr. i. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaentan-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væntan-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>to be expected.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaenting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vænting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>hope, expectation,</i> Stj. 487; hafa v. til e-s, Bs. i. 138; eptir-v., ör-v., <i>despair.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaepnlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væpnlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a family descended from Vápni, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaepntr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væpntr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [vápn], <i>armed;</i> ungir menn vel væpntir, Stj. 205; væpntr til bardaga, 226, Thom. passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaer"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vær
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pron. <i>we,</i> = vér, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaer-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vær-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>rest, tranquillity, peace;</i> húskarl þungan ok þrjótlyndan, var þar hvárki at sjá til værleiks né til verknaðar, Bs. i. 341.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>snugness, warmth;</i> en þar var görð laug til þess ef nökkverr vildi sækja væru þangat, 623. 33; at þeir hefði né eina veru (i. e. væru) af eldinum, Eb. 100 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaerd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          værð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>rest, tranquillity;</i> samfarar þeirra vóru eigi með værðum, <i>not quiet,</i> Sturl. i. 115, v. l.: freq. in mod. usage, of <i>snugness, comfort,</i> sofa með værð, <i>to deep softly;</i> ú-værð, <i>unrest, restlessness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>abode, shelter;</i> þeir áttu hvárki vist né væri í Víkinni, Fb. iii. 52; hvergi fékk hann vist né væri, Grett. 137 A; þeir skulu hér ekki eiga vist né væri, Fb. iii. 453; ú-væri, <i>unrest,</i> from itch.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaeringi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væringi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [from várar], prop. <i>a confederate,</i> but only remaining as the name of the <i>Warings</i> or Northern warriors who served as body-guards to the emperors of Constantinople, for whom see esp. Har. S. Hard. ch. 3 sqq., Ó. H. ch. 267, Nj. ch. 82; Væringja-lið, <i>the body of W.,</i> Nj. 121, Fms. vi. 135; Væringja-lög, <i>the league, guild of the W.;</i> ganga í V., Grett. 158 A; Væringja-seta, <i>the guard of the W.,</i> Ld. 314, Symb. 27, Hrafn. 5; þar var mikill fjöldi Norðmanna er þeir kalla Væringja, Fms. vi. 135.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          værr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., prop. <i>‘peaceful, safe,’ snug, comfortable, tranquil;</i> samfarar þeirra vóru eigi værar, Sturl. i. 115 C (of a wedded pair); svá er mörg við ver sinn vær, | at varla sér hón af honum nær, <i>so fond of her husband, that …,</i> Skálda (Thorodd); drekka í væru ranni, <i>in the snug hall,</i> Gm. 13; er þér nú værra, <i>dost thou feel more at ease</i>? (of pain), Gísl. 111; honum görðisk ekki mjök vært, Ld. 152.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaerur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          værur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. = úveri, <i>scab;</i> værur í höfði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaeskill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væskill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a weakling, a ‘reckling;’</i> hann er mesti væskill, a word of contempt. <strong>væskils-ligr,</strong> adj. <i>weakly, wretched.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaesodr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væsoðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. = væstr; sloðruðu þeir af heiðinni, ok urðu sem væsoðstir, Sturl. iii. 158; cp. eigi göra Húnar okkr vésaða, Fas. i. 502, but see vesask, p. 699, col. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [vás], <i>worn out by wet</i> or <i>toil</i>; þeir tóku land allmjök væstir, Grett. 116 A; væstir ok þrekaðir, Þorf. Karl. 390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaeta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [vátr], <i>to wet, make wet;</i> ef maðr fellir lík í vatn svá djúpt at væta verðr höfuð sitt, N. G. L. i. 80; hann hefir vætt klæði mín, Fms. i. 264; at væta allan senn dúkinn, vi. 322; þeir vættu eitt tjald ok ætluðu at slökva eldinn, x. 53; hvárt vættisk dyrðillinn? 315.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaeta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          væta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>wet, sleet, rain,</i> Stj. 17; væta var á mikil um daginn, Ó. H. 107; vóru vætur miklar bæði nætr ok daga, Fms. x. 14; væta ok þoka, Eg. 128; sem væta má granda, K. Á. 176; má skíra í hverskyns vætu er ná má, N. G. L. i. 12; ausa saur eða vætu, Jb. 101; vætu-lopt, <i>the atmosphere,</i> Stj. 17; vætu sumar, <i>a wet summer,</i> Ann. 1211.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaetki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vættki.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaetna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vetna,</strong> in hvat-vetna, hvar-vetna, hót-vetna, qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vættr C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaett"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vétt,</strong> n. [from vega, because it moved on hinges], <i>the lid of a chest</i> or <i>shrine</i> (mod. lok); skrúða-kista vánd með lausu vætti, Pm. 124; skrín … en yfir uppi vétt vaxit sem ræfr, eru á vettinu lamar á bak en hespur fyrir, Ó. H. 235; niðr í kistuna, skellt aptr vett ok settr láss fyrir, Pr. 412; hann tók upp vettit af hásætis-kistunni, Ó. T. 58; þér skuluð göra kistu ok skal ekki vætt yfir vera, Fb. iii. 300, Mag. 113.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaett-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [A. S. <i>wiht</i>; Engl. <i>weight;</i> Germ. <i>ge-wicht</i>; Dan. <i>vægt</i>]:—prop. <i>weight;</i> þat fé allt er at vættum skal kaupa, Grág. (Kb.) i. 238; göra aflaga um álnar eðr vættir, <i>measure or weight,</i> i. 463 A; reiða rangar vættir, 499, ii. 19; einir pundarar ok einar vættir, Gþl. 522; but",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaett-fangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætt-fangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vættvangr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaett-rim"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætt-rim
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vett-rim,</strong> f. [vætt, n.], <i>the ‘lid-ridge,’</i> i. e. <i>the ridge</i> which runs along the sword blade, leaving a hollow in the middle (in a scythe called smiðreim), Edda (Gl.); tók af oddinn af Hvítingi fyrir framan vettrimina, Korm. 88; sumar á vetrimum, Sdm. 6.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaett-vangr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætt-vangr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vétt-vangr,</strong> later <strong>vett-fangr,</strong> changing <i>v</i> into <i>f;</i> vatfangr, Nj. 100, is simply an error; [from vangr = <i>a field, spot;</i> the former part, vett or vætt, is less clear, but prob. from váttr, vætti, = <i>the place of witness</i> or <i>evidence,</i> or from vega = <i>locus actionis</i>?]:—a law term, <i>the place of summons, locus actionis,</i> where an act or deed, such as a battle, assault, manslaughter, has taken place, cp. Grág. i. 349, cited below; chiefly used of the summoning of witnesses; the vettvang was the space within a bow-shot (örskot) from the spot all around, see Grág. ii. 19 (Vígsl. ch. 14); ef maðr hefnir sín á öðrum vettvangi en til hans var hlaupit á, 91; á þeim vettvangi, 9; hvárt sem þeir eru á véttvangi eðr annars-staðar, 23; búa skal kveðja níu búa heiman frá vettvangi, i. 349 (in case of adultery); þá er næstir eru vetfangi, 461; á öðrum vettvangi, Kb. i. 158; skal kveðja heiman frá vettvangi, ii. 48; þat vórti þá lög, at vígsakar skyldi sækja á því þingi er næst var vettvangi, Jb. 8; kveðja um áljóts-ráð þau er á vettvangi eru ráðin, Giág.; á þeim vettvangi, Nj. 230; Helgi fékk bana á þeim vettvangi, or vættvangi, 218; vetfangi, 110; ef maðr er veginn á vetvangi, N. G. L. i. 163; hann kemr á vettfanginn, ok sér þar ný tiðendi, ok þó mikil, Ísl. ii. 371; Þórðr kom á vættfang, Sturl. ii. 92 C; sótti þá Saul fram af vætfanginum (<i>from the battle-place</i>) með ópi ok eggjan, Stj. 453 (1 Sam. xiv. 20); ríðr Sámr austr á heiðina ok at þar er vetfangit (sic) hafði verit, Hrafn. 28, and passim in the laws and Sagas.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> t, <i>to weigh as in weighing anchor, lift;</i> hand-vætta, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaetti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vætti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [váttr], <i>witness, testimony;</i> váttum er skylt at bera vætti þau öll er þeir hafa verit í nefndir, Grág. (Kb.) i. 58; nefndi vátta í þat vætti, at …, Nj. 217, 234, Grág. i. 17; enda skolu þat allt verða vætti hér, er austr er vitni nefnd, i. e. <i>the witnesses summoned in Norway are to be lawful evidence here</i> (in Icel.), 214; færa fram vætti sín eða kviðu, 410; sök sækja eðr verja, eðr vætti bera, Þórð. 94; hann skyldi vinna eið at baugi, nefna vátta í þat vætti, at …, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaettir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vættir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a weigher, holder,</i> Lex. Poët.; vættir gulls ens vegna, Gísl. (in a verse); in compds, <strong>vætti-draugr, vætti-njörðr</strong> e-s, <i>the wielder of a thing,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaettis-burdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vættis-burðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a bearing witness,</i> Grág. i. 39, Nj. 233.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaettis-vaetti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vættis-vætti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., Grág. i. 90, 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaettki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vættki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "spelt væt-ki, [vættr, and suffixed neg. -<i>ki</i>, qs. vættr-gi, see -gi], <i>‘no whit,’ nobody, nothing, naught;</i> vegr er vætki tröðr, Hm. 120; en vættki huggar, <i>naught comforts,</i> Harms. 38; hinn er vætki veit, Hm. 74; hinn er vetki veit, 26; svá ek þóttumk vætki vita, <i>methought I lay senseless,</i> Sól. 42; vætki of sýti’k, <i>I am naught concerned,</i> Hallfred; sá er vætki laug, Ad. 11; telr sér vætkis vant, Hsm.; sá er vætki sparði fjör, <i>who spared not life,</i> Hallfred; vildir ávalt vægja, en vætki halda, Am. 99; hræðisk Guð en vætki annat, <i>fears God, but naught else,</i> Bs. i. (in a verse): dulði þess vætki, <i>concealed it not,</i> Am. 10; hafða ek þess v. vífs, <i>I caught naught of her, missed her,</i> Hm. 101.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vættr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. vætti, Grett. 176 new Ed., Hom. 129 (Ed.); used neut., Hom. 195, l. 4: [A. S. <i>wiht;</i> Engl. <i>wight;</i> Germ. <i>böse-wicht</i>]:—<i>a ‘wight,’ being;</i> Brynhildar, armrar vættar, Gkv. 1. 22; vön sé sú vættr vers ok barna, 23; Brynhildar, armrar vættar, 22; þegi þú, rög vættr, Ls. 59, 61, 63; þá segi ek þér, vesöl vettr, Hom. 152; nú sá þér hverjar vættir er þess höfðu neytt, mýss ok ormar, Ó. H. 109.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vaettugi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vættugi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vettugi,</strong> <i>nothing, naught;</i> glysi þessu er vættugis er vert, Fms. vi. 263; vettugis vert, ii. 46; eyjar skika þann er vettugis er neytr. Fas. ii. 299, Fb. i. 523; varr at vettogi, Am. 38; var þeim vettugis vant, Vsp. 8; þeir verða stundum at vettogi ok annars þurfandi, <i>they often come to naught and to destruction,</i> Barl. 70; margr mundi vilja opt á einum degi at vettogi verða, <i>wish to be annihilated,</i> Hom. 69; sú festning dæmisk at vettugi, þótt hón á komi, N. G. L. i. 300; eigi er skírn þín betri enn vættugi, <i>better than naught,</i> Karl. 460; hafa at vettugi, Gþl. 254.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vodla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöðla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to twist up into a wisp;</i> vöðla e-n saman.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vodull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöðull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = vaðall, in <strong>Vöðla-þing.</strong>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vodvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöðvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [Germ. <i>waden—calf of the leg</i>], <i>a muscle;</i> skal hann sár bótum bæta eyri þar sem vöðva skerr, N. G. L. i. 67; kykva-vöðvi, Hkr. i. 99, Þiðr. 187; hjó á lærit, svá at ór tók allan vöðvann, Grett. 136 A; þat er margra manna siðr at vinda vöðva klæðum ok kalla þat soðit, Fas. ii. 525, the word is very freq. in mod. usage; afl-vöðvi, <i>the biceps-muscle;</i> vöðva-sár, <i>a flesh-wound,</i> N. G. L. i. 172, Grág. i. 18; vöðva-skeina, <i>a flesh-wound,</i> Fbr. 212.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voflur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöflur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>stammering, confusion;</i> það kómu vöflur á hann, <i>he became confounded,</i> from guilt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vog"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. vagar, vagir, plur. vegr, Fms. viii. 430; vögur (as from vaga), see vagar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [see vagga], apparently much the same as vöggu-barn, <i>an infant in the cradle;</i> a nickname, Landn. 314; a pr. name, Edda; litlu verðr Vöggr feginn, <i>‘with little are babies fain,’</i> 81 (a saying which originally may have meant that children are easily pleased); cp. lítil-þæg eru börnin.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voggu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöggu-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vagga, <i>a cradle.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voggu-barn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöggu-barn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an infant in a cradle.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voggu-bragr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöggu-bragr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., <strong>-kvæði, -ljóð,</strong> n. pl. <i>cradle-songs, lullabies.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voggu-mein"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöggu-mein
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ‘cradle-ailment,’</i> metaph. of <i>an old inveterate ailment;</i> það er gamalt v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vogn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (also <strong>vagna,</strong> u, f.), pl. vagnir, a kind of <i>whale, delphinus orca;</i> plur. vagnir, Sks. (Gronl. Hist. M. iii. 291, v. l.), Edda (Gl.), Lex. Poët.; vögnu láð, <i>the sea,</i> Ód.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vogn-brad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vögn-bráð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the blubber of the whale,</i> Fsm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vogn-hvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vögn-hvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>vögnu-hvalr,</strong> m. = vögn, described in Sks. 29 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vök
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. vakar, n. pl. vakar and vakir, with art. vökna = vökina, Bs. i. 346; [Dan. <i>vaage</i>]:—<i>a hole, opening in ice;</i> hann hratt hestinum í vök eina, Fms. i. 211; þeir riðu vakar nökkurar, x. 388; í vök þiðri, vii. 2; höggva vakir á ísinum, 272; stórar vakir. Sks. 178; ef menn finna hval í vökum, Grág. ii. 386; vakum, Sks. 175 B; ok fægja vökina eptir sér, Fms. viii. 416; í vökinni, vi. 337, Bs. i. 346; rekjald mikit í vök, Fs. 145; draga þeir skipit milli vakanna, 180; passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become wet;</i> búa um svá at aldri mátti vökna. Fms. vii. 225; áðr hón vöknaði, ii. 280; ek fleygði mér á ána, vöknaða ek þá allr, Karl. 167; þat vöknar allt ok klöknar, 545; freq. in mod. usage, eg hefi vöknað í fætrnar, <i>I have got wet in the feet.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökóttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>full of holes,</i> of ice, Fms. i. 210.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>moist;</i> vökvir eða vátir, Stj. 98; vökva jörð, <i>a moist soil</i>, Stj.; vera vökrar náttúru, MS. 732. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see vaka.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-lid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-lið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>watching people, scouts,</i> Fms. vii. 310.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a watchman,</i> Fms. iv. 299, Fas. i. 405.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>moist, juicy.</i> Stj. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-nott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-nótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a vigil, eve,</i> Bær. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>moist;</i> vökusamt vátlendi, Stj. 201.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-skarfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-skarfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., prop. a kind of <i>gull, the kittywake</i> (?), only used metaph. <i>a person wide awake;</i> hann er mesti vöku-skarfr!",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voku-skortr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöku-skortr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a lack of moisture,</i> Stj. 291.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [vaka], <i>wakeful, vigilant.</i> Art. 76, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. vöku, <i>moisture, juice;</i> vökva reyfisins, Stj. 397; vökva ok úhreinindi, MS. 677. 22; jarðligrar vöku, 415. 5; (sólin) slær ofan vöku sinni … skýtr tunglit sinni vöku á hafit. 732. 1, 4; af hafsins vökum ok vætum, Stj. 18; kviðr tekr við veku sem sær við vötnum, Eluc. 19; en sumt féll á hellu ok þornaði, því at þat fékk enga vækku (sic), Hom. 67.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokva-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to moisten, water;</i> áin Nilus vökvar þat ok frjóvar meðr sinni döggvan, Stj. 77; vökva mun hann fót sinn í viðsmjörvi, 348; gróðrseti ok veykvi, fági ok prýði, 677. 10, freq. in mod. usage; vökva sig, <i>to water oneself, to drink, slake one’s thirst.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokvan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökvan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a moistening, watering,</i> Stj. 88, Rb. 478; in mod. usage, vökvan = <i>beverage,</i> of milk.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vokvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vökvi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. = vökva, <i>a moisture, fluid,</i> Barl. 18, 118, H. E. i. 480, Fas. ii. 378, Pr. 474; and so in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voldugleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völdugleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>power, authority,</i> Stj. 83 (v. l.), 298.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voldugr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völdugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>voldugr;</strong> that v<i>ö</i>ld- is the better form is shewn by the old form v<i>a</i>ldugr, Barl., as also by the derivation from vald; [Ulf. <i>wulþags</i> = ἔνδοξος; Germ. <i>ge-waltig;</i> see valda]:—<i>mighty, powerful;</i> þrír völdugir konungar, Fms. i. 259; inn valdugasti, Barl. 102: vitr ok valdugr, 113; inn valdugi stjórnari, 106; eigi mundi hann vera svá voldugr, at …, Orkn. 138; vollduga menn ok vel guðhrædda, Stj. 298; ins voldugasta manns, 185; voldugari, 163 (völdugari, v. l.); mjök voldugir ok mikils ráðandi, Fb. ii. 535, Luke i. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/voldugskapr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völdugskapr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>authority,</i> Stj. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volduliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völduliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>proudly;</i> láta v., Finnb. 300, v. l.; konungr reið nú v. at borginni, Fms. vii. 87; ríkmannliga ok v., 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volduligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völduligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "spelt <strong>valduligr,</strong> adj. <i>powerful,</i> Barl. 187.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völlr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. vallar, dat. velli; pl. vellir, gen. valla, acc. völlu, mod. velli; [Icel. völlr and Germ. <i>wald</i> = <i>wood</i> seem to be the same word; the change in the sense from wood to field being much the same as in mörk]:—<i>a field;</i> knáttu Vanir völlu sporna, Vsp. 28; vaxinn völlum hæri, 36; völlu algræna, Akv. 13; þar vóru víða vellir sléttir, Fms. vii. 56; þeir sátu úti at skemtan sinni á völlum nökkurum, vi. 141; þar var torfa ristin ór velli … fastir í vellinum, Ld. 58; kasta sér niðr við vellinum, <i>flat on the ground,</i> Nj. 58; leggja e-n við velli, <i>to lay one level with the ground,</i> Fms. v. 236; or at velli, Nj. 117; hús min liggja við velli, <i>lies on the ground, is demolished,</i> Fms. iii. 144; hasla e-m völl, Eg. 273 (see hasla); lauss á velli, <i>loose in the ranks, not steady,</i> Eg. 293; fastr á velli, <i>firm, steady.</i> Fms. xi. 246; vígligr á velli at sjá, <i>warlike to look at,</i> Eg. 475; so, fríðr, mikill … á velli, <i>of fine, stout … appearance;</i> miklir at vallar-sýn. <i>big in outward appearance,</i> Nj. 66, v. l.; víg-völlr, <i>a battle-field;</i> þing-völlr, q. v.; þreskj-öldr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. valar, dat. veli; pl. velir, acc. völu; [Ulf. <i>walus</i> = ράβδος, Luke ix. 3; whence valtr, velta, cp. also vala: the root word is Goth. <i>walwian;</i> Lat. <i>volvere</i>]:—<i>a round stick, staff,</i> Bév. 9 b; bítað þeim vápn né (enn?) velir, Hm.; Gríðar völr, Edda; in many compds, snar-völr, rið-völr (q. v.), hjálmun-völr, stjórn-völr, <i>a helm, tiller;</i> vánar-völr, <i>a beggar’s staff;</i> víg-völr, <i>a weapon;</i> torf-völr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volsa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [akin to völdugr], <i>to make a great bustle, pride oneself;</i> menn þegar eg stolta sé sem völsa mikið í veröldinni; en vita hvorki <i>á</i> né <i>bé,</i> Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volsi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a. m. [evidently the same word as Gr. φαλλός], the name of a heathen phallus-idol, as to which see the curious story in Fb. ii. 331–336 (called Völsa-þáttr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volsungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völsungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of an ancient myth. king, whence Völsungar, see Völsunga Saga, the Edda, Hkv.; Völsunga drekka, <i>to drink of the Wolsungs,</i> i. e. <i>poison,</i> Bragi; the word is thought to be from a Slavonic idol Wolos. <strong>Völsunga-kviða,</strong> u. f. <i>the lay of the Wolsungs,</i> Sæm. 112.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>völtur,</strong> f. pl. [valtr, velta], <i>a roller,</i> a thing belonging to the fittings of a ship, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volu-spa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völu-spá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the song of the V.,</i> the name of an old lay, Edda; Völuspá in skamma = Hyndlu-ljóð, Edda i. 44.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>Wêland;</i> Germ. <i>Wieland;</i> hence too comes Engl. <i>gallant,</i> from Teut. Fr. <i>galant;</i> prop. an appellative (?), like höfundr]:—<i>Wayland the Smith,</i> Germ. <i>Welant,</i> a myth. hero common to all Teutonic people, Edda, Þiðr. 82, 185; the legends about him are contained in the old lay <strong>Völundar-kviða,</strong> Sæm. 88–94 (List of Authors A. II), and the Þiðr. S. ch. 57 sqq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völva
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., also spelt <strong>völfa,</strong> gen. völu, pl. völur; völfu. or also völfur or voluur; gen. pl. does not occur; the nom. Vala is erroneous: [the etymology as well as the origin of this word is uncertain; but may not the Norse Völva and the Gr. σίβυλλα be relations? the identity in sense at least is very striking; the Gr. word first occurs in Aristoph., and then in Plato; may it not have been adopted from some Scythian tribe, for a word like this, if Greek, could hardly fail to occur in Homer? in völva an initial s, we suppose, has been lost (qs. svölva); in the Greek the <i>ĭ</i> would be an inserted vowel]:—<i>a prophetess, sibyl, wise woman;</i> völva, seiðkona, spákona (qq. v.) are synonymous. The ancient Sagas contain many remarkable records of the heathen wise-women or sibyls, who were held in honour and reverence; at the great feasts and sacrifices in the autumn, the völva (often a woman of rank) went with her troop of maidens through the country, where she, so to say, crowned the feast; she was seated on a high seat (seiðhjallr) in the hall, where she wrought her spells and sang her ‘weird-songs’ (varðlokur), after which the guests went past her one by one, and she told each his fate, or whatever else one wanted to know, e. g. the course of the coming winter and the like. The former part of the Völuspá is evidently conceived as the inspired song of a völva, seated on her high seat, and addressing Odin, while the gods listen to her words; and the latter part of the poem appears to be a kind of necromancy, or the raising of a dead völva, as also is the lay Vegtamskviða; sú kona var þar í bygð er Þorbjörg hét, ok var kölluð lítil völva, hón hafði áttar sér níu systr, ok vóru allar spákonur, en hón var ein þá á lífi, þat var háttr Þorbjargar um vetrum, at hón fór á veizlur ok buðu þeir menn henni mest heim er forvitni var á at vita forlög sín eða árferð, Þorf. Karl. Names of such wise women, Gróa völva, Edda; Heimlaug völva, Gullþ.; Heiðr völva, Landn. 173; Huldr völva, Yngl. S., Hkr. i. 21; to which add the ‘Weleda’ of Tacitus: class. passages are Þorf. S. ch. 3 (exceedingly interesting), Örvar-Odds S. ch. 3 (Fas. ii. 506), Vd. ch. 10: völu vél-spá, Vsp.; eru völfur allar frá Víðólfi, Hdl.; völva ok vís kona. Vtkv.; þá kom til völva sú er Gróa hét, Edda 58; var á því landi spákona sú er sagði fyrir örlög manna, … þeir fara til móts við völunna, Fb. ii. 28; ek fór í skóg til þín í völvu líki, Fas. i. 135; þóttusk menn vita at þar mundi verst hafa völu-leiði, Ld. 328; þá reið Óðinn fyrir austan dyrr þar er hann vissi völu leiði, Vtkv.; úrsvöl Gýmis völva, of Rán the goddess, Edda (in a verse); at hás völva valdi því bölvi, Kormak; in a bad sense, völva and skollvis kona, Hkv. 1. 34; Tacitus (Germ. ch. 8, 46, and Hist. iv. 61, 65, v. 22, 24) speaks of these practices, as also does Plutarch, Caesar ch. 19,— τα μαντεύματα των ἱερων γυναικων.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/volvu-stadir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          völvu-staðir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "Icel. local name, Gullþ. S.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vomb"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vömb
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. vambar; [Ulf. <i>wamba</i> = κοιλία; A. S. <i>wamb;</i> Engl. <i>womb;</i> Scot. <i>wame;</i> Germ. <i>wamme, wanst;</i> Lat. <i>venter;</i> Gr. ὀμφαλός]:—<i>a womb, belly,</i> but mostly in a low sense, especially of beasts (the Engl. <i>womb</i> is in Icel. kviðr); þenja vömbina, <i>to fill the belly.</i> Fms. viii. 436: kýla vómb sína á miði ok mungáti, Fs. 4, Fas. i. 493; ok aum í vömb, Bjarn. (in a verse); sauðar-vömb, kýr-vömb, gor-vömb, Vambar-ljóð, the name of a lay, Maurer’s Volksagen 317.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vomm"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vömm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. vammar, pl. vammir, for the references see <strong>vamm,</strong> n.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vondla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöndla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to wind up into a</i> vöndull; v. e-t upp, Þorst. Síðu H. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vondr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. vandar, dat. vendi, pl. vendir, acc. vöndu, later and mod. vendi, Sks. 443 B; [from vinda, as svigi from sveigja; Ulf. <i>wandus</i> = ράβδος, 2 Cor. xi. 25; Engl. <i>wand;</i> Dan. <i>vaand</i>]:—<i>a wand, switch;</i> af korninu vex rót en vöndr af rótinni en af vendi aldin, Eluc. 14; Jacob tók græna vöndu, … birkti hann suma vönduna … mislita vönduna, Stj. 177, 178 (Genesis xxx); skjót at honnm vendi þessum, Edda 37; þá færi þit mér vóndu rétta ór skógi, 656 C. 42; smá-vendi (acc, pl.) af kvistum, Sks. 443 B; út mun ganga vöndr af kyni Jesse, 686 B. 13; tams vendi ek þik drep, Skm.; vatn hljóp ór hellunni er Moyses laust á vendi sínum, … vöndr Arons, Ver. 22; hann sat ok telgdi vönd einn með knífi, Hom. 116; hreinsa hveiti með vendi (vinza), Stj. 397; reiða vönd ok staura til garðs, N. G. L. i. 241; mál-vöndr, <i>a measuring-wand, yard;</i> poët. ben-vöndr, <i>a ‘wound-wand;’</i> hjalt-vöndr, <i>a ‘hilt-wand,’</i> i. e. <i>a sword;</i> blóð-v., morð-v., slíðr-vöndr, fólk-vöndr, hríð-vöndr, hvít-vöndr, benja-, brynju-, hjaldrs-vöndr, <i>id</i>.; ríkis-vöndr, <i>a sceptre,</i> Lex. Poët.: <i>a rod</i>, for punishing, strýkja með vendi, ljósta mar vendi, Kormak; vöndr hrökk, Mork. (in a verse); cp. vand-styggr, vandar-högg.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vondull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöndull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. vöndli, <i>a wisp,</i> of hay; gefa vöndul heys af kýrfóðri hverju, Bs. i. 137; tóku þeir vöndul heys fyrir hvern hest, Sturl. iii. 164; hafi vöndul fyrir hross, Jb. 430; á kirkja vöndul af sex sútum heys hverjum of alla sveit, Ám. 37.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vonn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vönn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. vannir (or vön?); [prob. some corruption for vin, f., q. v.]:—<i>a hunting track;</i> seldi ek þeim … útan garðs ok innan vönn ok veiði-staði er til hefir legit, D. N. ii. 159; en ef hann görir aðrar van(n)ir yfir land manns þar sem íkorna-skogr er, bæti mörk silfrs … ok landnám á ofan, N. G. L. ii. 143.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vonsundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vönsundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the wind,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vonudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vönuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a waner, diminisher;</i> in vell-v., hodd-v., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vördr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. varðar, dat. verði, pl. verðir, acc. vörðu (mod. verði); [varða; Ulf. <i>wards,</i> in <i>daura-wards</i> = θυρωρός, and <i>wardia</i> = κουστωδία, Matth. xxvii. 65; A. S. <i>weard;</i> Engl. <i>ward, warden;</i> Germ. <i>wart</i>]:—<i>a warden, warder,</i> Lat. <i>custos;</i> vörðr goða, of Heimdal, Gm.; hann hafði fengit njósn hvar verðir þeirra vóru, Fms. viii. 354: myrkvastofu-vörðr. Post. 645. 89, Stj. 200; Heimdalr, hann er vörðr goða, Edda; vita-vörðr, hús-vörðr, dyra-vörðr, land-vörðr. qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., pl. varðir and verðr, [Engl. <i>ward</i>], prop. <i>a woman under tutelage, a wife;</i> only in the allit. phrase, vörðr and verr, <i>wife and husband, a wedded pair;</i> eigut þær varðir vera, <i>these women have no husbands,</i> Gsp.; mik veiztu verða (i. e. varða, gen. pl.) ver-gjarnasta, Þkv, 13; þótt varðir vers (<i>wedded women</i>) fái sér hós eða hvars, Ls. 33; at ek þatki vannk er vörð (vörðr Ed.) né ver vinna knátti, <i>I had no intercourse of wife and husband with him,</i> i. e. no hjúskapar-far, Gkv. 3. 3; þá er Var ok Syn verðr (acc. pl.) at nefna, <i>then are V. and S. the fairies to be named,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vord-saetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörð-sætr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘watch-sitting,’</i> i. e. <i>fit to be watchman,</i> Gþl. 86.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vorn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. varnar, pl. varnir, [from verja; Dan. <i>værn</i>]:—<i>a defence;</i> til varnar, <i>for the sake of defence,</i> Sks. 397 B; með vörn, 226; þeir höfðu engan liðs-kost til varnar, Eg. 79; eigi mun þykkja of þunn-skipat til varnarinnar, … sýna vaskliga vörn, Bs. i. 525, 526, 531; at þessi vörn hafi allfræg verit, 532, Gísl. 72, Nj. 117, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vornudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörnuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a warning;</i> bjóða vörnuð, <i>to bid one beware,</i> Akv. 8, Sighvat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vorpu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörpu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>of stout, stalely appearance;</i> v. ok mikilúðligr, Fms. xi. 78; konungr spurði hverr sá væri inn vörpuligi maðr, Ld. 312, Finnb. 308 (v. l.), Ó. H. 155, Þorst. Síðu II. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vorpu-mannligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörpu-mannligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. id., Ísl. ii. 438, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vorpudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörpuðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a thrower, one who hurls,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/vorr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vörr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> f., gen. varrar, pl. varrar, varrir; in rhymes <i>rr</i>, v<i>örr</i> er hvöss á h<i>arr</i>a, Sturl. (in a verse); spr<i>arr</i>i v<i>arr</i>a, Hkr. i. (in a verse): the mod. form is <strong>vör,</strong> varar, dropping one <i>r</i> throughout: [Ulf. uses a diminutive, <i>wairilo</i> = χειλος; A. S. <i>weleras</i> = <i>labia,</i> a masc. formed by metathesis of <i>r</i> and <i>l</i>, qs. <i>werelas;</i> old Fris. <i>were</i>]:—<i>the lip,</i> Lat. <i>labium;</i> varrar jarls vóru ókyrrar, Fms. viii. 98; vörr in neðri, <i>the lower lip,</i> Dropl. 25; vörr in efri, <i>the upper lip;</i> bíta á vörrinni, Nj. 68; hann beit varrarnar, … rifja saman varrarnar, Edda 71; ef varrar eru eigi heilar, Skálda; skarð í vör (vörr), Sd. 175; hverjum vörrum skal ek hans blezaða fulltings biðja, Th. 6; varra-skrap, Sks. 438; varrar þínar, Stj. 644; báðar varrirnar, Bs. i. 360; varrarnar, Sks. 560.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
