        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. <i>the men from</i> <strong>Vörs,</strong> a county in Norway, Landn. <i>Vosse-vangen,</i> Fms. viii. 51; Vígfúss hersir á Vörs, Glúm.: hence <strong>Vörsa-bær,</strong> later <strong>Ossa-bær,</strong> a local name in the south of Icel., Landn. Nj.: <strong>Vörsa-krákr,</strong> m. a nickname, Orkn.: <strong>Vörskr,</strong> adj. <i>from</i> Vörs Landn. 263.",
            }
          }
        />
