        >
          vöttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. vattar, dat. vetti, pl. vettir, acc. vöttu; contr. for vantr: [Fr. <i>gant,</i> whence Engl. <i>gauntlet;</i> Dan. <i>vatner</i>]:—<i>a glove;</i> hafði maðr vöttu á höndum, Lv. 100; staf ok vöttum, Fms. iii. 176; hann dró þar á sik vöttu sína, Grett. 160 new Ed., and passim in mod. usage; the dimin. vetlingr has displaced the old word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
