          className="link"
          href="/word/voxtr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          vöxtr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. vaxtar, dat. vexti, pl. vextir, acc. vöxtu, mod. vexti; [Ulf. <i>wahstus</i> = αὔξησις, ἡλικία; Dan. <i>væxt</i>; from vaxa, q. v.]:—<i>‘waxing,’ size, stature;</i> mikil vexti, Bs. i. 646, Nj. 2; bergrísi at afli ok vexti, Eg. 22; menn litlir vexti, 25; vöxt ok afl, 29; göra klæði við vöxt e-s, 516: of size, öll skip sem vöxtr var at, Sturl. ii. 177; skip vel haffærandi at vexti, Fms. iv. 255; þat skip var gört eptir vexti Orms ins Skamma, vi. 308; þat vatn er vel mikit at vexti, Sks. 90; heimsins vöxt, 195; at mikilleik ok vexti, Ó. H. 235; lítils vaxtar, <i>of small size,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
