          ylgjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, = yglast (?), [ygla], <i>to frown, look fiercely;</i> nú tekr veðrit at ylgjask í norðrit, ok dregr upp ský dökkt ok dimt, Fms. xi. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ylgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ylgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. ylgjar, dat. acc. ylgi; pl. ylgjar: <i>a she-wolf,</i> Edda i. 478; ylgr gékk á ná, Jd.; kom þar ylgr ein, sjá en sama ylgr … tungan gékk ór ylginni, Fas. i. 125, 126; ylgjar-barn, ylgjar-áttbogi, <i>a wolf’s brood, breed;</i> ylgjar sultr, fyllr, tafn, Lex. Poët.; láta eigi ylgi (acc. sing.) fasta, Km.; ala blóði byrsta ylgi (acc. sing.), Edda (Ht.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ylja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ylja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to warm, heat;</i> hón (the sun) yljar ok vermir, Barl. 133.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yllir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yllir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [from ull = <i>wool</i>], the name of <i>a beam in the upright loom;</i> járn-varðr yllir, <i>the iron-mounted beam,</i> Darr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
