      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yppi-runnr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yppi-runnr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-þollr,</strong> m. <i>a praiser, extoller,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ypta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ypta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [formed from the pret. of yppa, q. v.], <i>to lift a little;</i> ypta hattinum, <i>to lift the hat;</i> ypta öxlum, <i>to shrug the shoulders.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yr-thjod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yr-þjóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = ver-þjóð, <i>the human kind;</i> hve hann (nom.) yrþjóð (acc.) auði gnegir, <i>how he bestows bounties on men,</i> Ad.; allri yrþjóð, … gramr varði yrþjóðum garð, vellekla.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [orð], in yrða á e-n, <i>to speak to a person,</i> perh. formed from the pret. ‘orti,’ see yrkja: in compd, full-yrða. <i>to assure, say for certain.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>words;</i> in compds, fagr-yrði, íll-yrði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>worded, spoken,</i> in compds.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> yr, urði, urinn, [a mod. verb formed from erja, arði, by the analogy of emja and ymja]:—<i>to rub, scrape, scratch,</i> esp. used in pret. part.; jörðin er öll upp urin, það er allt upp urið, of barren soil, as if shaven; the word occurs in Run. Gramm. Ísland, of 1651.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrjar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. a local name in Norway, Fms., Munch’s Norg. Beskr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [see verk], <i>a work;</i> the simple word occurs only in the passage, högum vér hálft yrkjum, Am. 61 (Bugge).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = yrki, <i>a work:</i> in <strong>yrkju-nautr,</strong> m. <i>a fellow-workman,</i> N. G. L. i. 157.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrkja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð and t, pret. orti, part. yrt and ort; [A. S. <i>wyrcan, wrohte;</i> Engl. <i>work, wrought;</i> Goth. <i>waurkjan;</i> O. H. G. <i>wurchian;</i> the initial <i>w</i> being dropped, see orka]:—<i>to work,</i> but chiefly used in a special sense <i>to till, cultivate;</i> enn sá maðr er engit á, hann skal þat láta fyrst yrkja … en ef hann yrkir eigi svá engit, … ok vili hann þó yrt hafa, Grág. ii. 280; ok svá þeir er á mörkina ortu, Eg. 14; ok Drottinn Guð tók manninn og setti hann í þann aldin-garð Eden, að hann skyldi yrkja hann og varðveita, Gen. ii. 15; at hann geti ortar vel engjar fyrir þær sakir, Grág. ii. 335; yrkja jörðina eðr vinna, Stj. 29; yrkja holt né haga, N. G. L. i. 249; yrkja ræfrar ok börku til húsa-þaks, <i>to work</i> (i. e. <i>to scrape</i>) <i>bark for thatching,</i> 242.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrkt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrkt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. n. = virkr, in the phrase, til þess er yrkt er, <i>till there is a working day</i> (<i>as opposed to a holiday</i>). N. G. L. i. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrmi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., in íll-yrmi, <i>a noxious reptile.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrmlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrmlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [ormr], <i>a ‘wormling,’ little snake, young snake,</i> Rm., Korm. 82, Fms. vi. 350, x. 325, Stj. 97.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrmt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yrmt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. n. <i>swarming,</i> like a brood of snakes or maggots: svá var yrmt fyrir á landinn af umsátum Hákonar, Mork. 92 (Fb. iii. 376); hér er víða yrmt (<i>swarming with vermin</i>), ok ætla ek hón muni hafa sólgit yrmling nokkurn lítinn, Fb. iii. 355.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ys-heimr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ys-heimr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the bustling world,</i> poët., Glúm. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ysja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ysja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the ‘bustler,’ noisy one</i>, name of a bondwoman, Rm.: as a nickname, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the noise of a swarm, bustle of a crowd</i> (whence the mod. <strong>ös,</strong> f. = <i>a crowd</i>); þá görðisk yss mikill á þinginu, Eg. 350; síðan skulu þér fylkja hváru-tveggja liðinn … ok görit sem mestan ysinn. Fms. viii. 434; þá varð yss mikill í skálanum, Háv. 31; hér var yss á fólki, Skíða R. 130, Fas. iii. 532; hann sá ys fólksins, Matt. ix. 23.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yssa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yssa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in yssu = össu, from assa (q. v.), Skáld H. 2. 27.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ysta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ysta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [ostr], <i>to curdle;</i> ysta mjólk, <i>to curdle milk,</i> in making cheese or ‘skyr.’",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ystingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ystingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>curdled milk, curds.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ytri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ytri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar. [Germ. <i>ausser;</i> Engl. <i>outer</i>], <i>outer, utter:</i> <strong>yztr,</strong> superl. <i>outermost, uttermost;</i> these words are now sounded and in the Editions spelt with a short vowel, but <strong>ýtri, ýztr</strong> are prob. the true old forms; thus <i>ný</i>tr, <i>ý</i>tra rhyme in Fms. xi. 307, in a verse of the beginning of the 12th century, (Aarb. for Nord. Oldk. 1866, p. 278); til þverár innar ytri, Landn. 222; Rangá hina ytri, Eg. 100; allt it efra, opp. to it ytra, 58; hann nam land allt it ytra, Landn. 253, Orkn. 6; á yztu síðu heimsins, Sks. 199; á hinu yzta skipinu, Fms. i. 158; yztu skipanna, <i>outermost of the ships,</i> vii. 256; róit á útborða hinum yztum, viii. 221; skalt þú hafa váskufl yztan (of clothes), Nj. 32; hann hafði yzta heklu blá, Ld. 274; Þórir vildi sitja yztr virðinga manna, Nj. 50; cp. hin yztu sæti, hinn yzta sess, Luke xiv. 9; hin yztu myrkr, N. T.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yxn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yxn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl., see uxi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yxna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yxna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a cow at heat;</i> kýr yxna, kú yxna, Grág. i. 426, Stj. 250, and in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yxni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yxni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>oxen,</i> Ísl. ii. 330, Sd. 158; see uxi (B): yxnis-fall, yxnis-húð, yxnis-maðr, yxnis-hvarf, Ísl. ii. 71, Sd. 158.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yzt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yzt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "better <strong>ýzt,</strong> adv. superl. from út, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yztr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          yztr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "superl., see ytri.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/y-bogi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ý-bogi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[ýr], a, m. <i>a yew-tree bow,</i> Gkv. 2. 18, Höfuðl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/y-drott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ý-drótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘yew-men,’ bowmen,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ydgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýðgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [-úðigr], <i>mind, disposition;</i> in compds, harð-ýðgi, grunn-ýðgi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [úfr, úfinn], <i>to open, rip up;</i> ýfa sár, <i>to open a sore rip up a wound;</i> hví skulu vér þá eigi fara ok ýfa þetta mál, Fas. ii. 489.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yfinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýfinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>ruffled, bristling:</i> metaph. <i>wroth, angry,</i> óðr ok ýfinn, Fms. xi. 292.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yfis-ord"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýfis-orð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>irritating words, taunts,</i> Valla L. 221.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ygis-hjalmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýgis-hjálmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = ægis-hjálmr, <i>a helm of terror</i> (see hjálmr 3), Ad. 4 (ygrs-hjálmr Cd. less correctly).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ygjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýgjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð. <i>to grow vicious,</i> of a bull; er hann (the bull) tók at ýgjask, Eb. 118 new Ed. (ægjask v. l.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ygligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýgligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>terrible, awful,</i> Fms. xi. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ygr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>fierce</i>; ýgr, æfr ok íllr viðreignar, Fms. xi. 8; ýgr ofkúgi, vii. 114 (in a verse); ýgja menn, i. 179 (in a verse); griðung ýgjan, <i>a vicious bull,</i> Grág. ii. 122; mann-ýgr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pret. úði, this is prob. the older form for úa, q. v. [vía may be a kindred word, <i>vi</i> = <i>y</i>]:—<i>to swarm;</i> hvert vatn úði af fiskum, Eg. 134 (v. l.), and in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (mod. <strong>ýkjur,</strong> f. pl.), [auka III. β], <i>‘eking,’ exaggeration;</i> lygiliga sagt eðr telr slikt með ýkjum, Al. 22.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a howl,</i> Fms. i. 138. <strong>ýlu-strá,</strong> n. <i>a scrannel-pipe, whistle made of straw.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yla-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [Engl. <i>howl;</i> Germ. <i>heulen;</i> Dan. <i>hyle</i>], <i>to howl, yelp,</i> of dogs, wolves; hvelpa sína … þeir ýla, Al. 31; æpa ok ýla, Fb. ii. 25; ýldu þeir sem hundar eða vargar, Fms. vii. 192; tóku þeir at ýla at honum svá sem vargar, Sks. 112; svá sem hundar ýla, Fas. ii. 211; ýla upp allir mjök hátt, Þorf. Karl. (of the Indians); djöflarnir tóku at ýla, Post. 645. 60; hér er komin Grýla, hón er að urra og ýla, Snót.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ylda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýlda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [úldinn], <i>decay, rottenness, stench,</i> Fms. x. 379; daun ok ýldu, Fb. iii. 447.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ylfra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýlfra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to howl piteously.</i> <strong>ýlfran,</strong> f. <i>a howling, wailing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>howling,</i> Al. 31, Fb. i. 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ylir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýlir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of one of the ancient months, answering to December; Ýlir kemr annan dag viku, Rb. 1812. 72; the word is prob. related to Jól, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ylun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýlun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>howling,</i> Post. 426.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. the name of <i>a giantess,</i> Fas. iii. 482; better <strong>Íma,</strong> q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ymir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýmir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of the huge <i>giant</i> of the Northern cosmogony, Vsp., Edda; Ýmis-blóð, <i>the blood of Y.</i> = <i>the sea</i>; Ýmis-hauss, <i>the skull of Y.,</i> i. e. <i>the heaven;</i> Ýmis-hold, <i>the flesh of Y.,</i> i. e. <i>the earth,</i> Edda (in a verse), Gm., Vþm.; Ýmis-niðjar, <i>the giants,</i> id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ymis-gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýmis-gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>wayward,</i> [cp. Dan. <i>vægel-sindel</i>], Hsm. 10. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ymis-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýmis-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>fickleness, mutability,</i> Stj. 53, 102, Fms. ii. 228.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ymis-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýmis-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(ýmiss-liga), adv. = ymist, Stj. 189.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ymis-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýmis-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(ymiss-ligr), adj. <i>various, diverse,</i> Edda (pref.) 147, 159, Skálda 193, Fms. viii. 1, Sks. 2, Bark 53, Stj. 3, 93, passim: in mod. = <i>sundry,</i> tala um ýmisligt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ymiss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýmiss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a pronom. adj., esp. used in plur.; in Norwegian MSS. often spelt with <i>i</i>, ímiss, ímser, etc.; imisir, N. G. L. ii. 391. [This word is a compd, the latter part being the adverb miss or mis, for which see p. 480; the prefixed syllable <i>ý</i> answers to Goth. <i>aiw-</i> = <i>unquam,</i> ποτέ; O. H. G. <i>eo, io</i>; Germ. <strong>je;</strong> A. S. <i>â;</i> Engl. <i>aye</i>; Hel. <i>io</i>; Icel. <i>æ;</i> see Grimm’s Gramm. iii. 51]; hence the oldest form has a double <i>ss,</i> being",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> or <strong>yr,</strong> prep. = ór (q. v.), a freq. spelling in vellums; slík duga betr en springi yr, Skálda (Thorodd).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. ýs, acc. dat. ý; [A. S, <i>eow</i> and <i>iw;</i> Engl. <i>yew;</i> O. H. G. <i>íwa;</i> Germ. <i>eibe</i>]:<i>—the yew-tree;</i> menn kalla ý einn við, Skálda 171; ýs angr, <i>the yew’s bale</i>, i. e. <i>fire,</i> Ó. H. (in a verse). The ‘yew’ has, strange enough, been omitted from the list of trees in Edda ii. 482, 483.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð, [úr, n.], <i>to drizzle;</i> ýrðisk dögg á reifit, Stj. 397; það ýrir úr honum, <i>it drizzles, rains:</i> the phrase, ýra e-u úr sér, <i>to dole out;</i> or, það ýrir í e-t, <i>to glitter,</i> like drops of dew; ýranda full, <i>a brimful beaker,</i> Ad. 6: of the glittering particles in iron or other ore, ýrt járn, <i>corned iron;</i> in the saying, ýrt járn kvað kerling, átti kníf deigan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yring"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýring
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a drizzling,</i> MS. II. 10; horna ýring, <i>the rain of the horns,</i> i. e. <i>mead,</i> Eg. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yrinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýrinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., contr. from yfrinn, q. v.; ýrinn yl, Sks. 17 new Ed.; mat ok mungat ýrit, N. G. L. i. 386; ýrinn saum, 198; þá mun ek ýrna fá aðra, Al. 51: skal smiða til krefja unz ýrnir eru, N. G. L. i. 101; hafa þeir ýrit at vinna, Fm. s. xi. 105. 2. as a verb, ýrit stinnt, Hkr. ii. 11 (œrit, Ó. H. 20, l. c.); see ærinn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ysa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýsa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [Ivar Aasen <i>hysa;</i> but the long vowel is attested by the Icel. pronunciation, as also by the alliteration in Fms. vi, see below]:—<i>a haddock,</i> Edda (Gl.); ófúsa dró ek ýsu, átta ek föng við löngu, Fms. vi. (in a verse); very freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yskja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýskja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, = æksja, <i>to wish,</i> Al. 33.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yskra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýskra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = öskra, eiskra, <i>to groan</i> from suppressed anger or fury.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [üt; Dan. <i>yde</i> = <i>to give</i>], <i>to push out, launch;</i> ok er hann rétti hönd sína til var sem ýtt væri stokknum at honum, Mar.; sízt honum var ytt af hlunni, Fms. vi. (in a verse); þrælarnir skolu róa at veiði-fangi, en Þórarinn bryti skal yta ok vera síðan hjá Þóreyju, <i>but Th. shall help them to launch, but then remain with Th.,</i> Fs. 144 (ýta þeim, 176, l. c.); var þá ýtt skipinu, Sturl. iii. 56; freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ytar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýtar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl., prop. <i>‘mariners’</i> (?), then <i>men,</i> poët., Edda (Gl.); ýta synir, <i>the sons of men,</i> Hm. 28, 68, 167; ýta kyn, <i>mankind,</i> Skálda (in a verse), Mkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/yti-blakkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýti-blakkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘launching horse,’</i> i. e. <i>a ship,</i> Rekst. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ytir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýtir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>yder</i>], <i>a giver,</i> poët., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ytri-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ýtri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>ýtstr,</strong> see ytri, yztr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thadan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þaðan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., in Norse vellums often spelt <strong>þeðan,</strong> N. G. L. i. 23; <strong>þanan,</strong> Hb. (1865), 6, 12, 14: [A. S. <i>þonan;</i> Dan. <i>deden</i>]:—<i>thence, from there;</i> skamt þaðan, Nj. 9; koma þaðan, Vsp. 19, 20. Vþm. 14; þaðan af falla ár þær er svá heita, Edda 24; fregna e-t þaðan, Bs. i. 652; þaðan eiga vötn öll vega, Gm. 26: without a strict notion of motion, börðusk þeir þaðan um daginn, Nj. 43; þú skalt stela þaðan mat á tvá hesta, 74; bíða þaðan, <i>to bide in a place,</i> Hkv. 1. 22, Ó. T. 6, MS. 623. 60; hann hafði þ. njósnir norðr í Noreg, ok fékk þ. þá eina spurn, Ó. H. 200; annat kann ek þér þ. segja, Edda 24; ok vættir þú þ. fulltings, Blas. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thadra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þaðra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. [Ulf. <i>þaþreh</i> = ἐκειθεν, not = ἐκει], <i>there,</i> an older form = þar; saðr var öngr fyrir þaðra, Sighvat; þar munu vér skína sem sól, ok þaðra mon Kristr sýna oss alla dýrð sína. Hom. (St.); kurum land þaðra, Am. 97; görisk svá brátt, at þaðra eru konur í borginni, Fms. xi. 99; þeir herja þaðra um eyjar ok annes, Fær. 83; þótti hann þaðra í sveitum gildr bóndi, Finnb. 360: also in later poets for the sake of rhyme, slíkt eru brögðin þaðra, Skíða R. 39, 152.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thafdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þafðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>stamped,</i> of cloth, Bragi; see þæfa, Eb. 70 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thag-maelska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þag-mælska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a keeping silent.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thag-maelskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þag-mælskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>silent, discreet,</i> Ad. 1, and freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þaga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>silence;</i> in endr-þaga, <i>silence in return.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thagall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þagall
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "mod. <strong>þögull,</strong> adj. (fem. þögul), <i>silent,</i> Hm. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thagat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þagat
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see þangat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thagga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þagga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að. <i>to silence;</i> betra er fyrr þagat (from þegja) en annarr hafi ‘þaggat,’ Skálda (Thorodd): the word is freq. in mod. usage, þagga niðr í e-m, <i>to hush one down, silence one.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thagna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þagna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to become silent</i>; konungr þagnar við. Nj. 6; konungr þagnar hvert sinn er Þórólfs er getið, Eg. 54; þá þagna þeir, Ld. 78, Fms. vi. 374; eptir þat þagnaði (þacnaðe Cod.) barnit, Bs. i. 342; síðan es hann þagnaði, <i>left speaking,</i> Íb. 7; hann sezt niðr ok þagnar, Skíða R. 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thagnar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þagnar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen., see þögn, <i>silence.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thagsi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þagsi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj.; the parent-word of the mod. Dan. <i>tavs</i> (<i>silent</i>) has hitherto not been found in the old Icel. literature; it should be þagsi, but most if not all words of that form were obsolete as early as the 12th and 13th centuries, and have disappeared in mod. Icel., as hugsi, staðsi, heitsi …; we believe it is preserved in the corrupted ‘þegn varð’ in the transcript of the Íb., where we propose to read, svá at allir menn myndi ‘þagsi verða’ (= Dan. <i>blive tavse</i>) meðan hann mælti at lögbergi, <i>so that all men would become silent whilst he spoke on the Law-bill,</i> Íb. 7. In an ancient vellum a <strong>,</strong> with the upper end of the <i>s</i> faint or blotted out, and an <i>n</i> or <i></i> would be distinguished with difficulty; and as to an Icel. transcriber þagsi was quite an unknown word, while ‘þegu,’ ‘þagu’ were familiar syllables, he would choose the latter; the vellum itself was lost soon after the copy had been taken in A. D. 1651. In Rb. (Ísl. i. 385) the word has been paraphrased into ‘þegja;’ see the Academy, vol. i, p. 278.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>þæc</i>; Engl. <i>thack, thatch;</i> Scot. <i>thak;</i> Germ. <i>dach;</i> Dan. <i>tag;</i> see þekja]:—<i>thatch, roof,</i> Edda 2, Nj. 115, Gkv. 3. 2, Fms. viii. 374; spán-þak, torf-þak, timbr-þak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thak-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þak-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>thatchless, roofless,</i> Art. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thak-naefrar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þak-næfrar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>bark used for thatching,</i> N. G. L. ii. 138.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thak-radr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þak-ráðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(Þakk-ráðr?), a pr. name = Germ. <i>Tancred,</i> Vkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thakin-naefrar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þakin-næfrar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. = þaknæfrar, Hm. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thakk-latr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þakk-látr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>thankful, grateful,</i> Fms. viii. 253, passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thakk-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
