        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to þollr], <i>a young pine,</i> Norse <i>telle,</i> Lex. Poët., passim, esp. in circumlocutions of women; auðar-þella, hör-þella, mjaðar-þella, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thelli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þelli
