              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> ð, <i>to blow up, inflate the bowels;</i> þ. sig upp; upp-þembðr, <i>puffed-up, inflated:</i>—<i>to ride at a dull pace.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
