            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>þengel,</i> from <i>þing</i>], prop. <i>captain of a</i> þing (?), <i>a king, prince,</i> only in poets, Edda i. 516, Hkv. 1. 22, Skv. 1. 25; manna-þengill, <i>the peace-maker of man,</i> of Heimdal, Gm.; stól-þengill, Fms. vi. (in a verse).",
            }
