        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/therrir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þerrir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>dryness,</i> of weather, <i>dry weather,</i> esp. such as is wanted in summer for drying hay; it is a household word in Icel.; eptir þat mun verða gott til þerra (gen. pl.) hinn næsta hálfan mánuð, Eb. 150; um kveldit görði þerri góðan ok þornaði heyit, 260; til þerris, <i>for drying,</i> Ld. 290; breiða klæði til þerris, Fms. iii. 184; ú-þerrir, <i>wetness, a wet season;</i> rifa-þerrir, <i>a scorching dry day.</i> <strong>þerra-leysi,</strong> n. <i>a lack of</i>þerrir, Bs. i. 144.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
