        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., poët. <i>a deal-steed,</i> i. e. <i>a ship,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thil-far"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þil-far
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the deck</i> of a ship, Fms. ix. 33, Fas. iii. 377, and in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thil-fjol"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þil-fjöl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a deal-board,</i> Fms. iii. 196.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thil-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þil-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., better þvertré, Sturl. ii. 109.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thili"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þili
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., mod. <strong>þil,</strong> [A. S. <i>þil</i>; akin to fjöl, q. v.], <i>a deal, wainscot, plank, partition;</i> þau þili héldusk, Fbr. 82; þilinn öðrum þiljum, 44 new Ed.; þeir brutu upp þilit, Eg. 235; síðan hneig hón upp at þilinu ok mataðisk eigi, Lv. 38; Njáll var komin í rekkju, heyrði hann at öx kom við þilit, Nj. 68; í dyri-stafi eða þili, Bs. i. 508 (Sturl. ii. 49, l. c. þil); milli þilis ok hans, Fs. 7; hvárt viltú heldr liggja við stokk eðr þil(i), Sturl. ii. 207: bekk-þili, skjald-þili, vegg-þili.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thili-vidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þili-viðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the wainscot;</i> vóru markaðar ágætar sögur á þiliviðinum ok svá á ræfrinu, Ld. 114.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thilir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þilir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. the name of a Norse people, <i>the men of</i> <strong>Þela-mörk</strong> (q. v.), a county in southern Norway (Thulenses?), Fms. passim, Fas. i. 382.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thilja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þilja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a deal, plank, planking,</i> esp. on a ship; þilja Hrungnis ilja, Edda. (Ht.); en er hann kom fram um siglu, þá skautzt niðr þilja undir fótum honum, Fms. viii. 74; þiljo eða þópto, Grág. ii. 171; brjóta árar eða þiljur, 356; sess-þiljur, <i>‘seat-deals,’ the thwarts</i> or <i>benches</i> in a boat or galley, Hornklofi.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thilja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þilja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þil; pret. þilði; part. þiliðr, þilðr, þilinn: mod. þiljaði, þiljað: [A. S. <i>þiljan</i>]:—<i>to cover with deals, to board, plank;</i> tóku frá vígin, háboruðu ok þildu á bitum, Fms. ix. 44; lét þ. skipin ok tjalda, iv. 236; hann þilði alla veggi hússins með þrennum þiljum, Stj. 562; fella innan kofann ok þilja sem vandlegast, Bs. i. 194: þilja allan garðinn af nýju, D. N. iv. 283; hann (the skáli) er þiliðr um endilangt, Fbr. 67 new Ed.; þilinn, 44, l. c.; gólf allt þilið með marmara-steini, Art. 6; þat grjót er höllin var þilin með, Karl. 60; þildir neðan vel, Sks. 88 new Ed.; tvitog-sessa tjölduð ok þiljuð, Hkr. ii. 294 (but better tjölduð ok þilið, Ó. H. 178, l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thind"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þind
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., not þynd, as it is sometimes spelt by modern writers, the <i>i</i> is determined by the old rhyme v<i>ind</i>r í sal þ<i>ind</i>ar, Edda l. c.; [from þenja, prop. <i>what is stretched out;</i> Lat. <i>tent-orium,</i> although different in sense, seems really to be the same word]:—<i>the diaphragm;</i> the word is very freq. in mod. usage, although not recorded in old writers except in this sole instance; salr þindar, <i>the breast,</i> Edda ii. 363 (in a verse), <strong>þindar-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>without a diaphragm, one who is never out of breath in running,</i> esp. used as an epithet of the fox.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [no Goth. <i>þigg</i> is recorded; A. S. and Hel. <i>þing;</i> Engl. <i>thing;</i> O. H. G., Germ., and Dutch <i>ding;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>ting.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-a"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-á
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þinghá (q. v.), Fb. ii. 184, Fms. viii, 183, v. l. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-bitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-bítr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Fas. i. 314.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-bod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-boð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [Swed. <i>ting-kafle</i>], <i>an ‘assembly-despatch,’</i> in the shape of a stick, cross, or axe; þar fór um landit þ. nökkut, at allir menn skyldi til þings koma, Fms. i. 149; skera (upp) þ., Ó. H. 105, 121, 151, N. G. L. i. 63; stefna þing, ok hafa upp hafit þ. fyrir fimmt, Gþl. 451, Js. 41; kross eðr þ, skal eigi yngri maðr bera enn tólf vettra, N. G. L. i. 139.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>presented at an assembly;</i> hvalr banvænn af þingbornu skoti, Grág. ii. 371.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-bok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-bók
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a protocol,</i> (mod.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-brekka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-brekka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the ‘parliament-brink,’</i> a law term; at all old places where parliament was held there was a ‘brink’ or high place where the law was read, speeches made, or proclamations and declarations issued to the assembled people (the <i>Tynwald</i> in the Isle of Man is just such a spot), this place was called the ‘thing-brink’ (at the alþing it was called the Lögberg or ‘Hill of laws’); lýsa í þingbrekku, … stefna um í þingbrekku til dóms, Grág. (Kb.) i. 99; ganga í þingbrekku ok nefna vátta, 107 hann skal til segja þrjú vór í þingbrekku, svá at meiri hlutr þing-heyjanda heyri, ii. 158; Egill Skallagrímsson gekk í þingbrekku um daginn eptir … þá stóð Egill upp ok mælti svá …, Eg. 734; þá gengr Glúmr í þingbrekku ok nefnir vátta, Glúm. 387; at þinglausnum í þingbrekku stóð Þorsteinn upp ok mælti, Þorst. Síðu H. 174; leiða í brekku, <i>to lead to the brink</i> or <i>hill of laws,</i> i. e. <i>to proclaim;</i> ef þræli er frelsi gefit ok er hann eigi leiddr í lög eða brekku, Grág. i. 358.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-byr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-býr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a house</i> or <i>town where a meeting is held,</i> D. N. i. 486.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a ‘meeting-day,’ a day on which a</i> þing <i>is held,</i> Gþl. 107; stefna e-m þingdag, <i>to summon,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-deila"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-deila
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a lawsuit in a public court,</i> Hrafn. 12, Fb. i. 443.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-deild"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-deild
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þingdeila, Nj. 86, Ld. 298.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-fastr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-fastr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>belonging to a certain county</i> (þing), Grág. i. 159.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-ferd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-ferð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a journey to a</i> þing. Eg. 765.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-festi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-festi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a law term, <i>domicile in</i> or <i>allegiance to a</i> ‘þing-<i>community.</i> In the Icel. Commonwealth every franklin had to declare his allegiance to one of the priests, and to say of what community he was a member; yet the word was political rather than strictly geographical, for the ‘þings,’ like the ‘godords,’ were not strictly geographical divisions, Grág. i. 164: hence the phrase, spyrja at þingfesti e-s. <i>to speer after a man’s</i> þingfesti, <i>call on him to declare it,</i> as also ganga við þ. e-s, <i>to acknowledge one’s</i> þ. (of the priest), Grág. (Kb.) i. 3, 43, 132, Nj. 87; því at einu er rétt at hafa þingfesti í öðrum fjórðungi heldr enn er maðr býr, ef goða er þat lofat þeim at lögbergi at taka þriðjungs-mann útan-fjórðungs, Grág. i. 165, which last passage is evidently a ‘novella.’",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-folk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-fólk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an assembly,</i> = þingheimr, Hkr. i. 261.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-faerr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-færr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>able to go to the</i> þing; þá var Gizurr biskup eigi þ., Sturl. i. 204 (Bs. i. 69); þ. hestr, Grág. i. 52; eiga þingfært, referring to outlaws (sekr maðr) who were not allowed to appear at a þing (cp. vargr í véum), Grág. ii. 78.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-for"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-för
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þingferð, Grág. i. 46, ii. 34; um þingfarir, <i>at the season of</i> alþing, Grett. 136 A (um þing Ed.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-ganga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-ganga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = þingför, N. G. L. i. 62, Js. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-gengt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-gengt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj., in the phrase, eiga þ. = eiga þingfært, Js. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-haugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-haugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a</i> ‘þing-<i>how,</i>’ <i>hill of laws,</i> a Norse local name, D. N. v. 957, perh. = þingbrekka.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-ha"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-há
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (also spelt þingá; see há):—a þing-<i>district</i> or <i>community,</i> originally <i>a shire having a meeting</i> or <i>parliament of its own,</i> the word is esp. freq. in Norway (in Icel. abbreviated into ‘þing’), Hkr. i. 147; konungr fór í allar þinghár ok kristnaði þar allan lýð, Ó. H. 102; krafði leiðangrs um ena nörðstu þinghá, 198; hann fær ór þinghá sinni sjau tigi manna, Hrafn. 11; á Hálogalandi í enni nyrztu þinghá, Fms. viii. 183; herboð fór á sjau nóttum frá hinum synnzta vita í hina nörztu þ. á Hálogalandi, Fagrsk. 20, D. N. passim; þinghá thus chiefly refers to the old small þing-communities, almost synonymous to fylki. <strong>þinghá-maðr,</strong> m. = þingheyjandi, Grág. i. 51 (see há).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-heimr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-heimr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the assembly at a</i> þing; lagði svá nær at allr þ. myndi berjask, Nj. 163, Eg. 765; ef þingheimrinn berðisk, Ísl. ii. 172, Fbr. 145, Al. 156.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-helgi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-helgi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>the consecrated precincts</i> or <i>boundary of a public assembly;</i> nú er sén ferð Tungu-Odds, ríðr Þórðr þá í móti honum, ok vill eigi at hann; nái þinghelginni, Ísl. ii. 172; at flokkr Hafliða væri kominn á Völluna efri ok ætlaði at bíða þar ok verja vígi alla þinghelgina, Sturl. i. 38.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-hestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-hestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a horse used on a journey to the</i> þing, Grág. i. 441.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-heyjandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-heyjandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a</i> ‘þing-<i>performer</i>,’ the law term for any person who visits a þing, on a summons to perform any public duty: every priest had to appear with a certain retinue of franklins, in order that there should always be present a sufficient number of neighbours, judges, witnesses, etc.; in return for such duty the persons attending received a fee, and were exempted from paying the þing-tax (þingfararkaup), which was defrayed by the franklins who stayed at home, Grág. i. 24, 46, 116, (Kb.) ii. 158; a priest had a right, at the spring meeting, to call on the ninth part of his liege-franklins to follow him to the alþing, Grág. i. 116.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-hringr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-hringr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the assembly standing in a circle,</i> N. G. L. i. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-hus"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-hús
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a house in which a meeting is held,</i> Fb. ii. 49 (where it is an error for hús-þing, Ó. H. 45, l. c.); the word is rare in old writers, because parliaments of old were held in the open air: the word is esp. used of <i>the Jewish synagogue,</i> Greg. 48, Mar.: also for <i>the Roman praetorium</i> or <i>a judgment-hall,</i> John xviii. 28; so also in mod. usage, cp. Jb. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-hottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-höttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Ann. Nord. Oldk. 171.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-kallandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-kallandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a herald,</i> 655 iv. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-kaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-kaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = þingfarar-kaup, Grág. ii. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-kostr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-kostr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = þingveizla, Eg. 733, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-lag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-lag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the public standard of value, as fixed</i> or <i>proclaimed at a</i> ‘þing;’ kyr ok ær at þinglagi því sem þar er í því héraði, K. Þ. K. 172 (cp. fjár-lag, verð-lag); þinglags-eyrir, Grág. (Kb.) ii. 246; þinglags-hestr, <i>a horse of average value,</i> D. I. i. 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-lausnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-lausnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>the dissolution of a parliament;</i> skal hann eigi fara af þingi fyrir þinglausnir, Grág. i. 25, Nj. 113; at þinglausnum, Þorst. Síðu H. 174; ok þegar at þinglausnum dró gékk hann í búðir, Lv. 56; þinglausna-dagr, <i>the last day of the parliament,</i> Grág. i. 6, Sturl. ii. 98 C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-logi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-logi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a law term, <i>a ‘meeting-belier,’ one who breaks his engagement to attend a meeting</i> or <i>court when summoned</i> (cp. A. S. <i>wærloga</i> = <i>a truce-breaker</i>): also used metaph., hann varð ok eigi þinglogi, <i>he was no engagement-breaker,</i> Fms. xi. 22, Sturl. i. 142 (in a verse); ok er at nefndum degi kom þá varð jarl eigi þ., 48; varða hrönnum höfn þingloga, i. e. <i>the haven belied them not, they got safe into harbour,</i> Hkv. 1. 29 (Bugge).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-lok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-lok
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. = þinglausnir, Eg. 353.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-lydr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-lýðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Germ. <i>dingleute</i>], = þingheimr, D. N. ii. 282.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a person present at an assembly, a member of parliament;</i> þeir gengu til lögbergs ok aðrir þingmenn, Nj. 15; þingmenn ok dómarinn, Gþl. 172, Bs. i. 755 (the members of the alþing), and passim (see þingfesti); þingmanna dagleið, <i>a day’s journey for a man travelling to the parliament,</i> Jb. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-mark"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-mark
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the boundary</i> or <i>precincts of a public assembly</i> (= þing-helgi); þá eru þeir af þingi er þeir eru ór þingmarki, Grág. i. 25; goð: skal kveða á þingmörk hver eru, ok skal hann svá þing helga sem alþingi, ok skal hann kveða á hve þing heitir, 100; gefa nafn þinginu ok kveða á þingmörkin, 116; allar sakir sem í þingmarki görask skal lýsa í þingbrekku, ii. 96; með þessum orðum ok þingmörkum helguðu laugfeðgar hans alþingi, Landn. (App.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-mal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-mál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a case presented at a public court,</i> N. G. L. i. 90.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-mariu-messa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-máríu-messa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the</i> ‘Þing-<i>Mary’s-mass,</i>’ = the 2nd July, from the alþing being held at that time, Icel. Almanack.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-mot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-mót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a public meeting,</i> MS. 656 B. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-nest"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-nest
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>provisions on a journey to the</i> þing, Eg. 733 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-reid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-reið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þingför, <i>a riding to attend parliament,</i> Grág. i. 491, Nj. 174, Ld. 236, Hrafn. 11, Landn. 330 (App.), passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-reitt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-reitt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj., eiga þingreitt = eiga þingfært, Grág. ii. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-rikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-ríkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>influential in the parliament,</i> Sturl. ii. 126.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-rof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-rof
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the dissolution of a public meeting,</i> N. G. L. i. 224.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-skaun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-skaun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a nickname, Fms. ix. 419.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-skil"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-skil
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>a debate</i> or <i>business at a meeting;</i> Þjaza þ., <i>the speech</i> or <i>counsel of Th.,</i> i. e. <i>gold,</i> Bm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-skipan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-skipan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>þing-skapan,</strong> f. = þingsköp, Ann. 1271 A), f. <i>the regulation of a</i> þing, Eg. 725.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-skot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-skot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an appeal to a</i> þing; öll þau mál er hingat eru skotin at þingskotum réttum, Gþl. 18.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-skop"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-sköp
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>the rules</i> or <i>regulations of a parliament;</i> enda er rétt at lýsa annan dag viku ef menn vilja þat í þingsköpum hafa, Grág. i. 18; þat er ok rétt at þeir hafi þ. þau er þingheyendr verða á sáttir, 103. Eg. 725; hann skal ok upp segja þingsköp hvert sumar, ok aðra þáttu alla, Grág. i. 12. <strong>þingskapa-þáttr,</strong> m. <i>the section of law referring to the</i> þingsköp, Grág. (Kb.) i. 38 sqq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-sokn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-sókn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þinghá, Grág. i. 286, 461, Landn. 259, N. G. L. passim, <strong>þingsóknar-maðr,</strong> m. = þinghá-maðr, N. G. L. i.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-stadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-staðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a place where a parliament is held,</i> Jb. 9, Fs. 110: as to a Runic stone erected in such a place, see Baut. 807.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-stefna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-stefna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n, f. <i>a summons to a</i> þing, Gþl. 24, Fs. 9; þingstefnu-vitni, -váttr, N. G. L. i. 32, 217, Gþl. 475.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-stod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-stöð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þingstaðr, Grág. i. 122, Eg. 741, Fær. 17, Glúm. 394, Ísl. ii. 193, Fms. xi. 85.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-tak"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-tak
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the act of passing a law by public meeting</i> (cp. vápna-tak, lófa-tak); lét hann í lögréttu þann sama Kristin-rétt lögleiða með réttu þingtaki, 671. 17, Rb. 62.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-taka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-taka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to accept as law,</i> of a public meeting, H. E. i. 422.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-veizla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-veizla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>entertainment at an assembly</i> (of the franklins by the priest), Eg. 733.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-vika"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-vika
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>the week during which the parliament sits,</i> Grág. i. 245 (the alþingi lasted two weeks).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-vist"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-vist
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a domicile in a</i> þing-<i>community</i>, Grág. i. 19, Eg. 733; see þingfesti.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-viti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-víti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fine for not appearing when summoned,</i> N. G. L. i. 56, Gþl. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-vaert"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-vært
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj., in the phrase, eiga þingvært, <i>to be allowed to be present at a</i> þing, of an outlaw, Grág. ii. 84.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thing-vollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þing-völlr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. the Manx <i>Tynwald,</i> Shetland <i>Tingwall</i>]:—<i>the ‘parliament-field,’ the place where a</i> þing <i>sat,</i> it answers in sense to mod. <i>‘parliament-house’</i> but parliaments and courts of old time were held in the open air on a plain, hence the name; áðr sól er komin á þingvöll, Grág. i. 33; þá er næstir búa þingvellinum, 115, Fb. i. 191; þat er forn réttr, at únnaðr ór fylkjum öllum skolo göra vébönd hér á þingvelli, N. G. L. i. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to hold a meeting;</i> þinga um mál manna, Eg. 340; konungar tóku þar veizlur ok þinguðu við bændr, Fms. vi. 191; konungr ferr suðr með landi ok dvalðisk í hverju fylki ok þingaði við bændr, en á hverju þingi lét hann upp lesa Kristin lög, Ó. H. 46; Satan hefir þá þingat við djöfla helvítis ok mælt …, Niðrst. 1; þat er siðr á Íslandi á haustum, at bændr þinga til fátækra manna (see hreppr), Fb. iii. 421.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-braud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-brauð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a parish-vicarage,</i> see B. I. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-deild"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-deild
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>litigation at a</i> þing, Íb. 8.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-domr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-dómr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a court at a</i> þing, <i>a public court,</i> Grág. i. 127.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-kvod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-kvöð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a summoning persons to an assembly,</i> to perform public duties there; vanda skal búa í þingakvöð, Grág. i. 142.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-lid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-lið
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = Þingamanna-lið; sá er vestr sat í Þinga-liði, Baut. 349.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. the name of <i>the house-carles</i> or <i>body-guard</i> of king Canute and his successors in England; it was a hired corps of soldiers, like the Wærings in Constantinople, Fb. i. 203, 205, Ó. H. 21, 25, Fms. vi. (in a verse). <strong>Þingamanna-lið,</strong> n. id., Valla L. 222, Orkn. 84 old Ed., Fb. i. l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-prestr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-prestr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a vicar of a parish</i> (B. I. 2), Sturl. i. 125, H. E. ii. 215.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-saga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-saga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = þingaþáttr, Mork. 174.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-tollr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-tollr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a church-toll,</i> H. E. ii. 509, D. I. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinga-thattr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinga-þáttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. (Hkr. l. c.), the name of the interesting record in Mork. 174.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., only poët., in heim-þingaðr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a debate, holding counsel,</i> Bs. i. 350.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingat
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>thither;</i> see þangat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingfarar-balkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingfarar-balkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the section of law referring to the parliament,</i> Jb. 5, Gþl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingfarar-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingfarar-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = þingfararkaup, Gþl. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingfarar-kaup"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingfarar-kaup
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a fee for travelling to the parliament,</i> as a law term, being a tax levied from every franklin, out of which those were paid who had to go up to the parliament on public business, whether as jurors, judges, or otherwise; every ‘þing-heyjandi’ received his fee from this source, the amount being regulated by the distance from the place of the assembly, or by the number of day’s-journeys each man had to travel, Grág. i. 24, cp. Jb. 52. A census was taken (about A. D. 1100) in Iceland of all the franklins who had to pay the þing-tax, which shewed that there were at that time 4,500 cottagers and proletarians not included, Íb. 17; a man who paid no such tax could neither sit as ‘neighbour’ or judge, Grág. i. 50; ef bóndi á fé minna, en hann eigi þingfarar-kaupi at gegna, ok …, K. Þ. K. 4. For Norway see Gþl. Þingfarab. ch. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingmenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingmenn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl., or <strong>Þingmanna-lið,</strong> n. <i>the Thingmen,</i> the king’s house-carles in England, Orkn. ch. 37, Hkr. ii. 15.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. adj. an error for vingott, Rd. 289, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/things-afglopun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þings-afglöpun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>contempt of court,</i> a law phrase, Grág. i. 5, Nj. 150.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/things-bod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þings-boð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a summons to a</i> þing, N. G. L. i. 55.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thingu-nautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þingu-nautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a member of a community</i> or þing; skyldu þingunautar eiga hvar saksóknir saman, Íb. 9, Grág. i. 84, 101, Fms. vii. 138.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinku-leysi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinku-leysi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>thoughtlessness, stupidity;</i> þrysvar hann drakk í þinku-leysi, Egilsson’s Poems.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þín, þitt, possess. pron.; older and better þínn, þín, þítt, see minn: [Goth. <i>þeins;</i> Engl. <i>thine;</i> Germ. <i>dein;</i> Dan. <i>din</i>]:—<i>thine, thy;</i> þínum drengskap, Nj. 16; dóttur þinnar, 23; þinnar íllsku, 82; föður þíns, 108; fá mér leppa tvá ór hári þínu, 116, and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinnig"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinnig
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>þinnog,</strong> adv. <i>thither,</i> = þannig, Sdm. 3, Hkv. 2. 48, Vtkv. 9.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [<i>telna,</i> Ivar Aasen; akin to þenja], <i>the edge-rope of a net;</i> hann hljóp yfir net-þinolinn, … hleypr hann yfir þinulinn, Edda 40; oddnets þinull, Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thinurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þinurr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [<i>tinar</i>, Ivar Aasen], a kind of <i>resinous fir-tree,</i> of which bows and hoops were made, Edda ii. 483; mold-þinorr, <i>the earth-tree,</i> of the tree Ygdrasil, Vsp. (the reading ‘Miðgarðs-orm,’ in the paraphrase Edda 44, refers to a form ‘mold-þinu<i>ll</i>’ = <i>earth-string,</i> i. e. <i>a serpent</i>).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thirfingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þirfingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [þjarfr], <i>an’unleavened’ fellow,</i> a word of abuse, Edda i. 530.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thirr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þirr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= þerna (q. v.), Edda i. 532 (562), Rm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thistill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þistill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [A. S. <i>þistel</i>; Engl. <i>thistle;</i> Germ. <i>distel;</i> Dan.-Swed. <i>tidsel, tistel</i>]:—<i>a thistle;</i> vertú sem þistill, Skm. 31; ‘carduus,’ þat köllu vér þistil, Stj. 635; þistla ok íllgresi, Sks. 549; þorna ok þistla, Eluc. 45; verða nökkut vínber saman lesin af þyrnum ellegar fíkjur af þistlum, Mattli. vii. 16; þyrna ok þistla skal hún bera þér, Gen. iii. 18: a local name, <strong>Þistils-fjörðr,</strong> Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>þið,</strong> the older and true form is <strong>it</strong> or <strong>ið</strong> (q. v.), the <i>þ</i> being borrowed from the preceding verb, as in ér, þer; thus, in alliteration, ið munuð <i>a</i>lla <i>ei</i>ða vinna, Skv. 1. 31, and spelt so in vellums, e. g. Sæm. (Kb.); þá er it finnisk, Fms. xi. 21; er it tókuð þá, 623. 24; meguð ið sjálfir, Fms. xi. 21; skuluð ið, Ísl. ii. 339 (Heiðarv. S.): but usually þit or þið, e. g. Fms. i. 189 (eleven times in one page); cp. ykkr, ykkar, p. 725.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þí
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= því, see þat C; and in compds, þí-líkr = þvílíkr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thi-likr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þí-líkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>such,</i> Stj., Bs.: = þvílíkr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thida"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þíða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a thaw, mild weather;</i> á Þorranum vóru hér svo miklar þiður, að grasið fór að spretta kringum bæi, en það fékk fljótan enda á Góunni, a letter from western Icel. of March 11, 1873; cp. valt er ‘Þorra þíð-vindi,’ Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thida-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þíða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, b<i>íð</i>a þ<i>íð</i>a rhyme together, Skáld H. 1. 2; originally a strong verb þíða, þeið, of which only remains the part. þiðinn, q. v.: <i>to melt, thaw,</i> of ice, snow; þíða snjó, Fms. iii. 180; Jökull kvazk eigi inn vilja at þiða á sér snjó, Fs. 55: síðan vóru eldar görvir ok þídd klæði, 52; hann færðisk at eldinum ok vildi þíða sik, id.; var eldr upp kveyktr ok þídd klæði þeirra, Fbr. 14 new Ed.; hann þíddi þann mikla þela, Hom. 107; þá tekr jörð at þíða frosnar grasrætr, Sks. 48; þíða (not þýða) allra hjörtu til ástar, Edda (pref.) 149.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þíðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þið, þítt, adj. <i>not ice-bound, thawed;</i> meðan áin er þíð, <i>whilst the river is open,</i> Grág. ii. 267; hvert þat er ísum þakt eða þítt, Sks. 182; á þíðum sjá, Fb. i. 489; í vök þíðri í Nið, Fms. vii. 2; thus written in the vellums l. c., not ‘þyðri’ as in the Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thin-likr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þín-líkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘thine-like,’ like thee,</i> Bjarn. 43 (MS. þuílíkt, Ed. þérlíkt).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thins-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þíns-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= þínlíkr, <i>like thee,</i> Fms. v. 336; ó-þínsligr, <i>unlike thee, unworthy of thee,</i> Ísl. ii. 198.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thisl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þísl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [O. H. G. <i>dihsila</i>; Germ. <i>deichsel;</i> old Swed. <i>þistl;</i> Lat. <i>tēmo</i> qs. <i>tesmo</i> (?); the inflexive <i>l</i> is a diminutive]:—<i>a cart-pole,</i> remains only in the poët. compd sár-þisl, <i>a ‘wound-stick,’</i> i. e. <i>a sword,</i> Ísl. ii. 389 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjaka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjaka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, a later form from þjökka, see below; þj<i>a</i>ka and t<i>a</i>ka make a rhyme, Pass. 23. 12: [Ivar Aasen <i>tjaaka</i>]:—prop. <i>to thwack, thump, smite,</i> hence <i>to afflict:</i> with acc., þóknist honum að þjaka, þitt hold örkumslum með, Pass. l. c.: with dat., þeir hafa bæði hrakt og hrjáð, hrundið og þjakað honum, Pass. 9. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjalar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjalar-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see þél.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjapel"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjapel
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [a for. word, <i>þ</i> = <i>z</i> or <i>c</i>; mid. H. G. <i>schappel;</i> old Fr. <i>chapel,</i> whence Fr. <i>chapeau</i>]:—<i>a wreath,</i> Al. 70.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjappa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjappa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to knead with the feet;</i> þ. moldinni saman; corrupt from þjaka (?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjarfr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjarfr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þjarf, þjarft, adj. [A. S. <i>þeorf;</i> old Fr. <i>derve</i>; Germ. <i>derb</i>]:—<i>unleavened,</i> of bread; þjarft brauð ok akr-súrur, Hom. 82; súrt brauð en eigi þjarft, 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjark"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjark
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a wrangling, strife, contest.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjarka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjarka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a quarrel,</i> Edda 110; þjörku-drjúgr, <i>pugnacious, quarrelsome,</i> Hom. (St.); göra þjörku, Am. 49.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjarkan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjarkan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>þjörkun,</strong> f. <i>a wrangling.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjarma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjarma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to handle roughly;</i> þ. at e-m, Fas. iii. 203.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjazi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjazi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. the giant of that name, the father of Skaði, see the Edda, Hdl., Ls., Hbl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þjáði, þjáð, [for the root see þýr, þjóna], <i>to constrain, enthral, enslave;</i> hann var þjáðr til vinnu, <i>he was worked as a bondsman,</i> Fms. i. 78; son (acc.) Loðinn vildi hann (nom.) þjá undir þrældóm, 289; sveinarnir vóru þjáðir ok undu þeir ílla, Eg. 235; þat fólk var lengi síðan þjáð í Vindlandi, Fms. vii. 195; hann vildi selja oss í þrældóm, ok hét oss afarkostum ok lima-láti ef vér vildim eigi þjásk, iii. 158; lét Rögnvaldr þjásk en Úlfr eigi, i. 289; mörg er þjóð of þjáð, Hkm. 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjalfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjálfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. the name of the servant and follower of Thor, Edda; and also as a pr. name, Baut.; the word prop. means <i>a delver, digger,</i> Germ. <i>delber, delben,</i> = <i>to delve, dig:</i> the names Þjálfi and Röskva (q. v.) indicate that Thor was the friend of farmers and the god of agriculture.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjalgr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjálgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [cp. Germ. <i>delken</i> = <i>to knead</i>], <i>‘kneaded,’ soft, manageable;</i> esp. in the compd ó-þjálgr, <i>refractory, unmanageable.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjall"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjáll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = þjálgr; ó-þjáll, <i>unhandy, unmanageable.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjalmi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjálmi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a rare word, the sense of which is somewhat doubtful, <i>a delve</i> (?); Manar þjálmi, <i>the delve of Mono,</i> i. e. <i>the sea;</i> hregg-þjálmi, <i>the delve of the gale,</i> i. e. <i>the sky;</i> þangs-þ., <i>the delve of the sea-weed,</i> i. e. <i>the sea, the surf,</i> Lex. Poët.: in prose the word occurs once,—hverja þjálma nær eðr firr Heinrekr egnir fyrir fætr Thome erkibiskupi, Thom. 361, where it seems to mean <i>a caltrop</i> or <i>a pit-fall</i> (?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þján
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [þjá], <i>bondage, servitude,</i> Hkr. iii. 315; þján útlendra höfðingja, Ó. H. 189; selja í þján ok þrældóm, Stj. 639; þján ek þrælkan, Fms. xi. 253.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjaning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjáning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>affliction;</i> leita Guðs í þinni þ., Karl. 542: freq. in mod. usage, also of <i>severe pain,</i> hann komst urn aptaninn í sælu-hús og þó með þjáningu, Espól. s. a. 1720; þjáninga-laust, -lítið, <i>painless, in little pain.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjo"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjó
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [A. S. <i>þeôh</i>; Engl. <i>thigh</i>], <i>the thigh,</i> but in usage generally <i>the podex,</i> in plur.; hann logar allr um þjóin, Mar.; þat skarðit sem er í milli þjóa þér, Ölk. 37; ef maðr höggr mann klámhögg um þjó þver, Grág. ii. 12; kláði hleypr um allan búkinn, einna mest um þjóin … draga striga-dúk milli þjóanna á sér, Fb. i. 212; hælarnir liggja uppi við þjóin, of a cripple, Ó. H. 246, Mar.: sing., fótrinn með öllu þjóinu, Fb. i. 262; bar oxina niðr hjá þjói hestsins, Sturl. iii. 314.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjo-breidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjó-breiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>broad-thighed,</i> Fms. vii. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjo-bugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjó-bugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the bight of a scythe;</i> ljórinn brotnaði í þjóbugnum.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjo-knappr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjó-knappr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘thigh-knobs,’ buttocks,</i> Korm. 120, Fms. ii. 6, Fs. 48, Fb. ii. 364, Fas. i. 93, Bs. i. (in a verse), Stj. 512.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjo-leggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjó-leggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the thigh bone,</i> Bs. i. 344, Grett. 176 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjóð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., dat. þjóðu, so always in old writers, mod. þjóð; [Ulf. renders ἔθνος by <i>þjuda;</i> A. S. <i>þeôd;</i> Hel. <i>þiôd;</i> O. H. G. <i>diot</i>]:—<i>a people, a nation;</i> þessar þjóðir er svá heita, Rusci, Polavi, Fms. i. 142; þú spenr allar þjóðir frá blótum, 623. 25; heiðnar þjóðir, <i>heathen people,</i> 625. 170, Post. 293, N. T.; öll Kristileg þjóð, N. G. L. ii. 22; Tyrkir, ok Blökumenn, ok mörg önnur íll þjóð, Fb. ii. 126; með mikinn her ok marga ílla þjóð, 127; með öllum þjóðinn, Stj. 67; vísaðu þeir mörgum þjóðum á réttan veg, Barl. 29; allar þjóðir þjóna yðru valdi, Róm. 117; af öllum þjóðum ok tungum, 119; hinn sjúki svaraði á þá tungu, sem hann hefði með þeirri þjóðu fæddr verit, Pr. 458; allar skepnur … allar þjóðir, 461; þjóð veit ef þrír’ro, a saying, Hm, 6l; þjóð eru þrír tigir, <i>thirty make a</i> þjóð, Edda. 108; allri þjóðu, Ýt.; heldr er honum þægr í hverri þjóðu (<i>among any people</i>), sá er á hann trúir, Post. (Unger) 290; hann er lofaðr af allri þjóðu Gyðinga, id.; mikla þjóð, <i>a mighty people,</i> Stj. 116; suðr-þjóðir, <i>the southerners,</i> Akv.: Lat. <i>turma</i> is rendered by þjóð, Róm. 269; fira þjóð, <i>a community of men,</i> Lex. Poët.; þyrja þjóð yfir, Skm.: in compds, sal-þjóð, <i>household,</i> Vkv.; sigr-þjóð, Hkv.; al-þjóð, <i>all people,</i> Ad.; ver-þjóð or yr-þjóð, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjod-a"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjóð-á
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a great river, chief river,</i> Ver. 17 (Gen. ii. 10); þrjár þjóðár falla þorp yfir meyja Mögþrasis, Vþm. 49 (certainly not = þjóðir; the passage reminds one of Gen. ii. 10); þjóðár fnæstu eitri, Þd.; nú heita þat þjóðár er svá eru stórar, at …, N. G. L. ii. 133; fyrr skolu allar þjóðár falla upp, en …, proverbs of an impossibility (cp. ἄνω ποταμων ἱερων χωρουσι παγαί), Kormak.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjod-braut"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjóð-braut
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a high road,</i> Grág. ii. 264, Landn. 81, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjod-drengr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjóð-drengr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a good man, brave fellow,</i> Flóv. 30.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
