          className="link"
          href="/word/thjod-smidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjóð-smiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a master-craftsman, great artist;</i> Þórðr var umsýslumaðr mikill ok inn mesti þ., of a shipwright, Þórð. 10 new Ed.; hann var hinn mesti þ., Fb. ii. 73, and in mod. usage; cp. þjóðhagr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
