          href="/word/thjofs-nautr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þjófs-nautr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an accomplice</i> (cp. Germ. <i>diebs-genosse,</i> Dan. <i>hæler</i>), such as a receiver of stolen goods, Grág. ii. 190; ef maðr flytr þjóf yfir óduldr, þá hefir hann fyrir-gört húð sinni ok heiti þ., Gþl. 418: the saying, þjófrinn þrífst en þjófs-nautrinn aldri, <i>the thief may thrive but the thief’s accomplice never,</i> i. e. he is even worse than the thief himself; ílla er þá ef ek em þjófsnautr, Nj. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thjofska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
