        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f., <strong>þjónasta,</strong> Hom. 134, [O. H. G. <i>dionost;</i> Hel. <i>þjonost;</i> Germ. <i>dienst;</i> Dan. <i>tjeneste</i>]:—<i>service, attendance,</i> Nj. 268, Eg. 28, 112, Fms. vi. 36, passim.",
