        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without sacrament,</i> of a sick person, N. G. L. i. 347, Fms. viii. 103: of a church, þá standi kirkjan þjónustulaus, <i>let the church stand without services,</i> K. Á. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
