        >
          þrasa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þrasi, [O. H. G. <i>drason</i>], <i>to talk big, make a bold show;</i> hví þrasir þú svá, Þórr? Ls. 59.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrasi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrasi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (= þrasir), a pr. name, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrasir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrasir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Ulf. <i>þrasa-balþei</i> = <i>pugnacity, temerity</i>], <i>a sturdy fighter;</i> in poët. compds, líf-þrasir (<i>one who is hard to kill</i>?), ör-þrasir, dólg-þrasir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
