          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thremjar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þremjar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. a part of the sword, but unknown what, Edda (Gl.); the sword is called þremja linnr, vöndr, svell, = <i>the snake, wand, ice, of the</i> þ., etc., Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threnning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrenning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a trinity,</i> esp. in eccl. sense, <i>the Trinity,</i> Fms. i. 281, x. 171, Skálda, and in mod. usage, Vídal., Pass., etc. (Heilög Þrenning); Þrenningar-messa = <i>Trinity-Sunday,</i> Fms. ix. 372.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrennr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrennr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (also <strong>þrinnr</strong>), <i>triple, threefold</i> (see tvennr); þrennr búningr, Dipl. iii. 4; einn Guð í þrenningu, þrennan í einingu, Fms. i. 281: plur. in distrib. sense, munnlaugar þrennar, Dipl. iii. 4; þrennar tylptir í fjórðungi hverjum, Nj. 150, Eg. 341; með þrennum greinum, Stj. 37; þessa ómaga þrenna, Grág. i. 275; þetta eru þrenn verð, <i>thrice the prize.</i> Ld. 30, 146, Hkr. iii. 408; þrenn mann-gjöld, Nj.; þrennar sátir, Orkn. 48; þrennar níundir, Hkv. Hjörv.; þrenni, indecl. (cp. tvenni), Anecd. 58; fjör þrenni, <i>three lives</i>, Rekst.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threp"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrep
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a ledge</i> or <i>shelf-like basis</i> or <i>footing,</i> in a wall or pavement; skal hann (the wall) taka í öxl manni af þrepi, Grág. ii. 262; sjándi hvar fjándinn sitr á þrepi einu, Mar., and so in mod. usage: metaph., en þó var sem nökkut þrep kenndisk á leggnum, of <i>a tumor,</i> Bs. i. 376.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threp-skjoldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrep-skjöldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a false form for þreskölddr, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threskja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreskja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, þriskja and þryskva are less correct forms; [Ulf. <i>þriskjan</i> = ἀλοαν; A. S. <i>þerscan;</i> Engl. <i>thresh;</i> O. H. G. <i>drescan;</i> Germ. <i>dreschen;</i> Swed. <i>törska;</i> Dan. <i>tærska;</i> Lat. <i>tero</i>; Gr. τείρω]:—<i>to thresh,</i> D. N. vi. 196; þriskja (sic) korn, Fms. viii. 96 (þryskva, v. l.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threskjoldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreskjöldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [this word is derived from þreskja and völlr, and prop. means <i>a threshing-floor,</i> because in ancient times the floor at the entrance was used for threshing, but it then came to mean <i>the block of wood</i> or <i>stone beneath the door, doorsill</i> or <i>threshold;</i> and that in ancient times it was so, is borne out by phrases as, Gríma <i>sat</i> á þreskeldi, Fbr.; or, stíga yfir þresköldinn, Eb. l. c.; or, þresköldrinn var hár fyrir durunum, O. H. L. 85; see the references. The latter part of the compd, <i>-öldr,</i> is from a time when the older <i>ld</i> had not as yet become assimilated into <i>ll.</i> The word is declined like völlr; nom. þreskjöldr, or, dropping the <i>j,</i> þresköldr: acc. þreskjöld or þresköld, Bs. i. 44, Fms. v. 140, Fbr. 14, Korm. 10, Eb. 220, Fs. 68, Edda ii. 122, Hkr. iii. 116, N. G. L. i. 18, 431: dat. þreskeldi, Fms. ii. 149, Fbr. 98 new Ed., N. G. L. i. 18, 431; in rhymes <i>eld</i>húss þresk<i>eld</i>i, Kormak: nom. plur. þreskeldir, Bs. i. 736; acc. þresköldu, Stj. 436 (spelt þrescavlldo): examples are wanting of gen. sing. and plur.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threttan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrettán
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>thirteen,</i> passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threttan-sessa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrettán-sessa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a thirteen-oared ship</i>, N. G. L. i. 99, Fms. ix. 470.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threttandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrettándi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>the thirteenth,</i> passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threttugandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrettugandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-undi,</strong> <i>the thirtieth,</i> Rb. 1812. 49, MS. 732. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threying"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreying
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a patient waiting;</i> göra sér e-ð til af-þreyingar, <i>in order to kill the time.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threyja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreyja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f: <i>endurance, patience;</i> eg hefi ekki þreyju til þess. <strong>þreyju-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>impatient.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threyja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreyja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þrey, þreyr, mod. þreyi, þreyir; pret. þreyði; [A. S. <i>þrowjan;</i> cp. the Engl. subst. <i>throe</i>]:—<i>to feel for, desire, yearn after;</i> enn inn átta (viz. vetr) allan þáðu, Vkv.; löng er nótt … hve um þreyja’k þrjár, Skm. 42; ek þrey um aldr, Fms. v. 231 (in a verse); ekki þreyr ek at þeim þegni, <i>I long not for him,</i> Fas. ii. 336; þreyja eptir einni konu, Ísl. ii. 250 (Cod. B, þrá Cod. A); ey þreyjandi, <i>ever panting,</i> Hdl. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threynging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreynging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>affliction;</i> see þröngving, Fb. ii. 195.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threyngja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreyngja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, <i>to throng;</i> see þröngva.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>wear and tear, exhaustion,</i> freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threyta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [þraut], <i>to prosecute a case stoutly, to strive, struggle,</i> in a race, task, labour; þreyta leik, rás, kapp-sigling við e-n, <i>to contend in a game, run a race with one,</i> or the like, Edda 34, Fms. vi. 269, 360; þ. á drykkjuna, <i>to contend in drinking, have a drinking-bout,</i> Edda 34; þ. rás, <i>to run a race,</i> id.: þ. e-t með kappmælum, <i>to dispute eagerly,</i> Fms. i. 11; þreyttu þeir þetta með kappmælum þar til er hvárir-tveggju vápnuðusk, vi. 136; er þér þreytið þetta mál svá mjök, vii. 169; meirr þreytti Rútr þat með kappi en með lögum … at þeir þreytti þat ekki með sér, Nj. 31; jarlarnir þreyttu þetta með sér, <i>it came to high words between them,</i> Hkr. i. 87; þ. lög inn e-t, <i>to contend at law,</i> Fms. vii. 132, 135; þeir þreyttu (<i>tried bard</i>) at komask í borgina, Edda; þreya heim, <i>to strive to get home,</i> K. Þ. K. 94; ef þú þreytir vel á jarðríki, <i>if thou strivest well in this life,</i> Mar.; þreyta hest sporum, <i>to prick the horse with the spurs,</i> Karl. 92.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threytir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreytir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a contender, one who strives,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threytleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreytleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>lassitude,</i> Greg. 43, Stj. 490, v. l.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/threyttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þreyttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. [Dan. <i>træt</i>], <i>exhausted, worn out,</i> Fb. i. 483: very freq. in mod. usage, sár-þreyttr, dauð-þreyttr, ó-þreyttr, <i>fresh,</i> etc.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thre-vetr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þré-vetr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (in mod. usage also <strong>þré-vetra,</strong> indecl.), <i>three winter’s</i> (i. e. <i>years</i>) <i>old</i>, Eg. 147, Hkr. iii. 188, Fms. i. 77, Ld. 56, Orkn. 278, Grág. i. 503, ii. 122, 258, Jb. 196.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "sounded þriðji, gen. dat. acc. þriðja; pl. þriðju: [A. S. <i>þrydda;</i> North. E. <i>thrid</i>]:—<i>the third,</i> Nj. 32, Eg. 168, 220, 279, 537, and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjunga-felag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjunga-félag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a joint-partnership,</i> as marriage, in which the wife is entitled to a third part of the joint property, D. N. i. 108.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjunga-skipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjunga-skipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a division into three parts.</i> Edda 145, Fms. ix. 336.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungar-fe"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungar-fé
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = þriðjungsauki; skyldi öll þessi kúgildi þriðjungar-fé vera, Dipl. i. 7; tíu kúgildi, þ., iii. 6; þá er Gísl skyldugr kirkju sex hundruð í þ., 7; gefandi Hamar ok Bakka ok tuttugu hundraða í þriðjungar-fé, iv. 8; tuttugu kúgildi þ., v. 5 (in all these instances of church donations, which were to increase by a third?).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the third part</i> of a thing, Nj. 3, Eg. 57, 266, Fms. i. 70, N. G. L. i. 421, Grág. i. 156, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungs-auki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungs-auki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>an increase by a third,</i> a law phrase, <i>a joint property,</i> where one partner (e. g. a wife) is entitled to a third part, N. G. L. i. 333.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungs-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungs-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a wife as partner in a</i> þriðjunga-félag, D. N. v. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungs-penningr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungs-penningr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of <i>coin,</i> D. N. iv. 328.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungs-tiund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungs-tíund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a kind of <i>tithe,</i> D. N. v. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridjungs-thing"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðjungs-þing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a meeting of a</i> þriðjung (II), N. G. L. ii. 323.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thridungr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þriðungr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= þriðjungr, Rb. 33, D. N. i. 108.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrif"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrif
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [Engl. <i>thrift</i>], <i>thriving condition, well-doing, prosperity;</i> standa e-m fyrir þrifum, <i>to stand in the way of one’s well-doing,</i> Fms. ii. 154; launa e-m þrif ok þroska, Al. 103; urðu þeir at öngum þrifum er honum hlýddu, Post. 656 C. 7; þurra aikvæmi mun litt at þrifum verða, Fb. i. 548; biðja annars heims þrifa, Hom. (St.); þar skulu nú þrif þín við liggja, Fms. viii. 385, v. l.; ó-þrif, <i>unthrift,</i> passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrif-gjafari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrif-gjafari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>þrif-gjafi,</strong> a, m. <i>a giver of good things, a bounteous giver,</i> Mar., Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrif-gjof"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrif-gjöf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a gift of grace;</i> þ. Guðs, Post. (Unger) 235.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrif-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrif-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>deftly;</i> frækiliga ok þ., Stj. 233; eta þ., <i>to eat briskly,</i> Mag.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrif-mannligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrif-mannligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = þrifligr, Mag. 88.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrif-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrif-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>profitably,</i> Hom. 10.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
