        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [þrífa], <i>to grasp at</i> (= gripla), Barl. 70, 123.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrifligleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrifligleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a thriving condition;</i> vænleikr ok þ., Stj. 225.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrifligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrifligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>thrifty, well-to-do;</i> maðr þ. í rauðum kyrtli, Grett. 67 new Ed., Fms. iii. 135, Fas. i. 314; þrifligra barn, Finnb. 214.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrifnadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrifnaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., older <strong>þrifnoðr,</strong> <i>thrift, wealth, prosperity;</i> engi maðr heldr sínum þrifnaði til allsendis, Fms. i. 295; urðu allir at minna þrifnaði en áðr, vii. 196; þar skal nú þrifnaðrinn þinn við liggja, viii. 385; ek hefi tekit hér þrifnað, Lv. 36; góðverk remma allan þrifnoð, MS. 673. 60; meiri verði þinn en þeirra þrifnoðr, Arnór.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrift"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrift
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>thrift;</i> fari sá útlægr ok komi alldregi í þrift, Js. 25; koma e-m í þrift, Fb. i. 136; komask í þrift, Fms. vi. 115.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrifu-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrifu-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = þrifliga, Stj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrima"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrima
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = þryma (?), <i>a peal of thunder,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrimarr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrimarr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>þrimir,</strong> m. [þremjar], <i>a sword,</i> poët., Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrimill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrimill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
