      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/throttigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þróttigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>powerful, mighty,</i> Fms. ii. 69, Fbr. 212; ósterkari ok ú-þróttkari, Hkr. i. 46.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/throttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þróttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. þróttar, [from þró-ast, cp. ótti from ógn-; cp. A. S. <i>þroht</i> = <i>labour</i>]:—<i>strength, might, valour, fortitude;</i> íll-menni ok þó engan þróttinn í, Fs. 51; svá var mikill þróttr hans, at hann hló meðan hann beið þessa kvöl, Fas. i. 219; ek vil biðja þik, at þú hafir þrótt við (<i>fortitude, firmness</i>) ok verði því meiri hefndin sem lengr er, Lv. 40; þverrðu þeir þrótt sinn at þriðjungi, Hðm. 16; sannlega er skekinn þróttr (<i>courage</i>) ór yðr, Grett. 112; mæla þróttar-orð, <i>a word of fortitude;</i> þróttar-steinn, <i>the stone of courage,</i> i. e. <i>the heart,</i> Þd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thruma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þruma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [cp. Engl. <i>thrum</i> = <i>end</i>], poët. <i>a land,</i> prop. <i>border-land, outskirts</i> (?), Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thruma-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þruma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. [þrymja; Grimm thinks this word akin to Germ. <i>donner,</i> by metathesis of <i>r,</i> and change of <i>n</i> into <i>m</i>]:—<i>a clap of thunder;</i> því næst sá hann eldingar ok heyrði þrumur stórar, Edda 58; þrumur ok eldingar, Stj. 287; reiði-þruma (q. v.), <i>a clap of thunder.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrumr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrumr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a slow person, moper,</i> Edda (Rask) 197, v. l. (for þumr): a nickname, Njarð. 364; cp. hann var þögull ok fálátr, því var hann kallaðr þrym-Ketill, Dropl, (major).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrumu-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrumu-steinn
