        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrudigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrúðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [A. S. <i>þrydge</i>], <i>doughty,</i> an epithet of Thor; Þórr, þrúðigr Áss, Þkv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrudna-thurs"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrúðna-þurs
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(?), m.; ek kenni þik hvar þú stendr þrúðna-þursinn, <i>the doughty giant,</i> or <i>the charmed, bewitched giant,</i> of Starkad with the charmed life, Fas. (Skjöld. S.) i. 373.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrudnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrúðnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in Vaf-þrúðnir (q. v.), <i>the doughty riddler, riddle-master.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrudr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrúðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., acc. and dat. Þrúði, the name of a goddess, the daughter of Thor and Sif, Edda, Lex. Poët.; also the name of a woman, <strong>Þrúðr;</strong> as also in compds, Her-þrúðr, Sig-þrúðr, Jar-þrúðr, Landn., Fms.; cp. the Germ. <i>drude</i> = <i>a witch</i> or <i>evil fairy,</i> Grimm’s Dict. s. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thruga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrúga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [Dan. <i>true</i>], <i>to press;</i> þrúga þeim til at greiða tíundir, D. N. iv. 141; hvárt hann vildi meðganga ó-þrúgaðr, <i>without compulsion,</i> Bs. i. 820; það þvingar, þrúgar með, það slær og lemr, Pass. 12. 13: the word is not freq. in Icel., but remains in the Dan.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thrugan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
