          þrysvar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv., the best vellum with <i>y,</i> Nj. 193, 269, Grág. i. 460 A, ii. 401 B, Vsp. 22 (Bugge), N. G. L. i. 339, Bs. i. 355, Stj. 619, Eluc. 11, Greg. 48 (þrusvar), Grett. 160 A; in mod. usage and in a few later vellums with <i>i</i>, þrisvar:—<i>thrice;</i> hvert mál (er) til skila fært ef þrisvar er reynt, Fms. v. 324; þrysvar varð allt forðum, Sturl. iii. 253, Grett. 160 (cp. Germ. <i>alle guten dinge sind drei,</i> Dan. <i>alle gode gange ere tre</i>): also double, <strong>þrysvar-sinnum,</strong> <i>thrice,</i> passim, see above.",
            }
          }
        />
