              "__html": "(i. e. <strong>Þrœnzkr</strong>), adj. <i>Throndish,</i> passim: Þr<i>ænz</i>kr and S<i>ænz</i>kan make a rhyme, Fms. iv. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
