            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>quarrels,</i> Björn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thraeta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þræta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., older and better <strong>þrætta,</strong> D. N. v. 57, B. K. 51, [Dan. <i>trætte</i>]:—<i>a quarrel, wrangling, litigation,</i> Nj. 16, Fms. vi. 373, viii. 157, 338, Sks. 650, passim; þrætu-bók, <i>a book of dialectics;</i> þrætu hagi, <i>a disputed pasture,</i> Ann. 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thraeta-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þræta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, or better <strong>þrætta,</strong> although it is now sounded with a single <i>t;</i> [but in Dan. <i>trætte;</i> cp. A. S. <i>þreâtian,</i> Engl. <i>threaten,</i> though different in sense; or is þrætta assimilated for þrapt, qs. þraptan, whence þrátta. þrætta (?); North. E. <i>threap</i>]:—<i>to wrangle, litigate;</i> nú þræta menn um lögmál, <i>to wrangle about the law,</i> Grág. i. 7; þ- um e-t, Fms. vi. 137: <i>to contradict,</i> Ld. 44, Th. 78; þræta e-s, <i>to deny a charge;</i> hann þrætti þessa áburðar, Bs. i. 704, Ld. 34; eigi muntú þessa þurfa at þræta, Fb. i. 556; þ. móti e-m, <i>to contradict,</i> Barl. 148.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thraetinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þrætinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>litigious, contradictory,</i> Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
