          className="link"
          href="/word/thurf-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurf-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>helping,</i> Barl. 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurfa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a verb whose present takes a preterite form, see Gramm. p. xxiii; pres. þarf, þarft, þarf; pret. þurfum, þurfut, þurfu (mod. þurfið, þurfa); subj. þyrfti; part. þurft: with neg. suff., þarft-attu, <i>thou needest not,</i> Kormak; þurfu-t, <i>they need not,</i> Lex. Poët.; [Goth. <i>þaurban</i> = ἀνάγκην ἔχειν, χρήζειν; A. S. <i>þurfan</i>; Germ. <i>durfen,</i> etc.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurfa-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurfa-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a poor man, needy person,</i> K. Þ. K. 142, Bs. i. 834, D. I. i. 218, MS. 623. 20; saðr þ., Clem. 135; þurfamanna-tíund, <i>the poor-rate,</i> K. Þ. K. 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>þurfa,</strong> adj. <i>wanting, in need of;</i> drykks of þurfi, Sól. 3; liðs þíns væra ek þá þurfi, Hbl.; laðar þurfi ek hefi lengi farit, Vþm. 8; miskunnar ertú þurfi, Fms. v. 153; hón sá at hann var beinleika þurfi, Bs. i. 535; annarra þurfi, 655 iii. 1; hann skal göra mönnum reiðu ef þurfa eru, N. G. L. i. 315 (þurfi, 417, l. c.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>þyrft,</strong> f. <i>need, want, necessity;</i> þeim aurum er til hans þyrfta var keypt, Grág. i. 412; til þyrftar ómögum, <i>for their maintenance,</i> 85, 128; of þurft fram, Hom. (St.); kveðr hverr sinnar þurftar, <i>everyone speaks his own needs,</i> a saying; þurpt sína ok nauðsyn, Fms. vii. 101; fylgja lögum eða svá laudsins þurft, ix. 252; hann miskunnaði hverjum sem helzt beiddi þurft til, Post. 304; þeir skygnðu um alla þ. í kenningum sínum, Hom. 46; hjalpa náungi þínum í hans þ. ok nauðsyn, Stj. 54.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurftar-lidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurftar-liðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘genitalia,’</i> Stj. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurftu-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurftu-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>useful, profitable,</i> Gþl. 174, Barl. 191, Fagrsk. 182.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurftugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurftugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Germ. <i>dürftig</i>], <i>needy, poor, indigent,</i> Barl. 35, Hrafn. 16, Glúm. 360; þ. yðars fulltings, Bs. i. 479; hann kvazk þess mjök þ. vera, Rd. 294; þurftugastr, Vm. 146; auðsóttr ok góðr bæna þurptugum, Al. 4; gefa fæzlu, drykk ok klæði þurftugum, Mar.; gömlum manni ok þurftugum, Hrafn. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, [Dan. <i>tørkne</i>], <i>to dry, make dry,</i> Eg. 204, Jb. 249, K. Þ. K. 83, Barl. 115, Pr. 474; hann tók dúkinn, ok þurkaði sér á miðjum, … þar kemr enn ef Guð lofar, at vér þykkjum þess verðir at þ. oss á miðjum dúki, Fms. vi. 322; þeir slógu fyrst hey mikit, síðan þurkuðu þeir ok færðu í stórsæti, Eb. 150; þ. heyit …, nema því heyi er Þórgunna þurkaði, 260.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurkan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurkan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a drying,</i> Stj. 62, Fb. i. 545.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Dan. <i>tørke</i>], <i>drought, dry weather,</i> freq. in mod. usage. <strong>þurka-samr,</strong> adj. <i>dry</i> (of a season), Rb. 572.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þurr, þurt, adj., the double <i>r</i> is radical, the latter being originally an <i>s</i>; for þurr is an assimilated form of <i>þurs;</i> before a consonant only one <i>r</i> is sounded (thus þurt not þurrt, þurðr not þurrðr); [Ulf. <i>þaursus</i> = ξηρός; O. H. G. <i>durri;</i> A. S. <i>þyrr</i>; Hel. <i>þurri;</i> Engl. <i>dry</i>; Germ. <i>dürr</i>; Dan. <i>tör;</i> Swed. <i>torr</i>; Lat. <i>torr-idus</i>]:—<i>dry;</i> hrár viðr eða þurr, Grág. ii. 298; viðr inn vind-þurri, Vkv.; þurr matr, þurran mat, <i>dry</i>, i. e. <i>vegetable food</i>, K. Þ. K. 138; fasta við þurt, … eta þurt, <i>to fast on vegetable food,</i> N. G. L.; þurr vóru öll eyja-sundin ok firðir, Fms. xi. 6; þurr jörð, Al. 77; fara þurrum fótum yfir …, ganga þurrum fótum um mitt hafit, Stj. 286, 287; fékk hann þar þurrari leið ok lengri, Hrafn. 4; á þurru landi, <i>on dry land</i>, Al. 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-fasta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-fasta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> u, f. <i>a dry-fast,</i> K. Á. 164, Bs. i. 874; þurrföstu-matr, K. Þ. K. 136.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-fjallr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-fjallr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dry-skinned</i>, Hm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-faetis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-fætis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>dry-foot,</i> Hkr. iii. 155.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>dryness,</i> Stj. 397.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-lendi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-lendi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the dry land</i>, Stj. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (<strong>-liga,</strong> adv.), <i>dry</i>; veðr gott ok þurligt, Háv. 26 new Ed.: metaph. <i>dry, surly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-lyndi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-lyndi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>dryness, surliness,</i> Hkr. iii. 253.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>dry, surly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurr-vidri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurr-viðri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>dry weather,</i> Fms. x. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurra-bud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurra-búð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘dry-booth,’ a cottage with no milk</i> or <i>cattle;</i> þurrabúðar-maðr (-fólk), <i>a dry-house cottager,</i> of fishermen, opp. to farming cottagers.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurs"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurs
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(sounded <strong>þuss</strong>), m., this interesting word occurs in no other Teut. language; [Dan. <i>tosse</i> = <i>a fool</i>]:—<i>a giant,</i> with a notion of surliness and stupidity; þursa líki þykki mér á þér vera, ertattu til brúðar borinn, Alm. 2; þurs (gen.) ráðbani, <i>slayer of the giants,</i> i. e. <i>Thor,</i> Hým. 19; með þursi þríhöfðuðum, Skm.; líkari eru þeir þursum at vexti ok sýn enn menskum mönnum, Eg. 110; þegja skal þurs ef hann sitr nökviðr við eld, Ísl. ii. 317 (see nökviðr); hann var kominn af þursum, Fas. i. 412; þursinn (<i>the goblin</i>) skautzt inn í bjargit, ii. 29; svá hefir Grettir sagt, at fyrir dalnum hafi ráðit blendingr, þurs einn, sá er Þórir hét, Grett. 137; vér skulum ginna þá sem þursa, Nj. 263; hrím-þurs, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thurs-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þurs-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>like a giant,</i> Fas. iii. 240: <i>of gaunt, demon-like appearance,</i> mikill maðr ok sterkr, svartr ok þ., Þorf. Karls. ch. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thursa-berg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þursa-berg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>‘giant-rock,’</i> a kind of <i>whetstone</i> or <i>hone</i>, cp. the legend of Hrungnir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thursa-skegg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þursa-skegg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., botan. <i>giant’s-beard,</i> a kind of <i>coral, corallina officinalis,</i> as also the name of a sea-weed, <i>fucus corneus,</i> Maurer’s Volksagen.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thursa-stafr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þursa-stafr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., see þurs,—the notion of the magical Rune is preserved in the phrase, rísta e-m þursa-staf, <i>to libel a person in a coarse, brutal manner;</i> það var mesta ofdirfð af ótilkjörnu flóni, | að rista þenna þursa staf Þorláks-syni Jóni, Grönd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thursi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þursi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a dunce,</i> = þurs (2).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thusa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þusa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> að, = þysja, <i>to rush</i>.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thussa-sprengir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þussa-sprengir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a nickname, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (sust, Fms. viii. 96, 436), <i>a flail;</i> sem verkmenn við þust, Fms. viii. 436; hefir hvárr þeirra þust (þusl Ed. wrongly) í hendi mikla, Gísl. 68 (lurk, 155, l. c.); sem þust korni eðr ofn rauðu gulli, Stj. 160; síðan tók hón þust ok barði korn af hálmi, 423.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thustr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þustr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [Lat. <i>fustis</i>], <i>a flail;</i> með hörðum þust, Post. 562.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thu"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þú
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen. <strong>þín,</strong> dat. <strong>þér,</strong> acc. <strong>þik,</strong> a pers. pron.; also spelt ðú, see the introduction, p. 729; for þik, also freq. þek in Norse vellums, mod. þig, see Gramm. p. xxi: [Goth. <i>þû, þeina, þus, þuk;</i> A. S. <i>þû;</i> Engl. <i>thou;</i> Germ., Dan., and Swed. <i>dû;</i> Lat. <i>tu</i>; Gr. τύ.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thua"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þúa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to ‘thou,’ to address a person by thou</i>, = Fr. <i>tutoyer;</i> þúa og þéra, þúa e-n, þú mátt ekki þúa hann, þú verðr að þéra hann.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thufa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þúfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., gen. pl. þúfna; [provinc. Germ. <i>daube;</i> in the Tyrol the cairns and pyramids by the way-side are so called by the peasants, Schmeller; <i>dobe</i> = <i>a paw,</i> Alsace]:—<i>a mound;</i> þúfu þá er griðkonan þerði fætr sína á, Fms. i. 254; settu þat á þúfur, hjá þúfunni, Fbr. 109, 110; Hjálmarr sat við þúfu eina ok var fölr sem nár, Fas. i. 426; opt veltir lítil þúfa miklu hlassi, <i>a little mound may overset a big load</i> (<i>cart</i>), Al. 132 (a saying); þar er þeir vóru staddir, vóru ber á einni þúfu, Fb. ii. 347: the phrases, fé-þúfa, see fé, p. 149, col. 1; bana-þúfa, hníga við bana-þúfu, <i>to bite the dust;</i> vera einum eingin heilla-þúfa, <i>to be a stumbling-mound to one.</i> <strong>þúfna-kollr,</strong> m. <i>the top of a mound.</i> <strong>þúfu-skítr,</strong> m. a nickname, Fms. viii. <strong>þúfu-titlingr,</strong> m. <i>a ‘mound-tit,’ a sparrow.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thus-hund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þús-hund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þúsund, Barl. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thus-hundrad"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þús-hundrað
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., prop. <i>a crowd of hundreds</i> = <i>a thousand;</i> sjau þús-hundrað manna, O. H. L. 66; þ. vetra, Fms. x. 400; sjau þúshundruð ára, Stj. 50; þúshundrat sjau tigir ok tvau ár, 103; tvau hundruð þúshund-raða, 285; þúshundruð vega, Str.; þúshundraðs-höfðingi, <i>a captain of a thousand,</i> Stj. 299; þúshundrað sinnum, <i>a thousand times,</i> Barl. 125.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thustna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þústna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to chafe, quarrel,</i> Orkn. 312. l. 8, Lex. Run.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thustr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þústr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [akin to þysja, þausnir?], <i>a strong gust of wind,</i> Magn. 486.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thusund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þúsund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f.; sérhverja þúsund, Stj. 298; á þúsund (dat.), Sks. 705; tvær, þrjár … þúsundir, 623. 53: in mod. usage it is mostly neut. (influenced by Latin?), but also fem. It is spelt <strong>þús-hund,</strong> Barl. 53; þús-hundum, Fms. vi. 409 (v. l.), Geisli 49; another form <strong>þús-hundrað</strong> (q. v.) is freq., esp. in Stj., Barl.; this double form -hund and -hundrað answers to the equally double form of ‘hundred,’ see p. 292, and is a proof that þúsund is a compound word, the latter part of which is ‘hund’ or ‘hundred;’ the etymology of the former part ‘þús’ is less certain; it is, we believe, akin to þysja, þyss, þaus-nir (a lost strong verb þúsa, þaus, þusu); þúsund would thus literally mean <i>a swarm of hundreds:</i> [in Goth. the gender varies, <i>þûsundi,</i> pl. <i>þusundjos</i> = χίλιοι, or <i>þusundja,</i> neut.; A. S. <i>þûsend;</i> Engl. <i>thousand;</i> O. H. G. <i>dusunta;</i> Germ. <i>tausend,</i> qs. <i>dausend;</i> Swed. <i>tusende</i> and <i>tusen;</i> Dan. <i>tusinde;</i> Dutch <i>tuysend:</i> this word is also common to the Slavon. languages: again, the Lapp, <i>duhat</i> and Finn. <i>tuhat</i> are no doubt borrowed from the Slavon. or Scandin.; the Gr., Lat., and Sansk. use other words]—<i>a thousand.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvag"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvag
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [þvá], prop. <i>‘wash,’</i> but only used of,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvaga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvaga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a dish-clout of knitted horse-hair,</i> used by dairy-women to clean and wipe tubs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvagla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvagla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to sound like washing water when stirred, to gurgle;</i> áðr þeir kæmi í búrit skalf hann af kulda svá at þvaglaði (svaglaði, v. l.) í kerinu, Sturl. iii. 192.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvalr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvalr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þvöl, þvalt, adj. [þvagla, þvál], <i>damp, steaming,</i> as if coming fresh from the washing-tub, used of cloth, fresh-cut hay, or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvara"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvara
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a stick with a scraper at the end used to stir up a cauldron;</i> Arnbjörn hélt á þvörunni ok laust með henni til Þorleifs ok kom á hálsinn, en með því at grautrinn var heitr brann Þorleifr á hálsinum, Eb. 198; varat af vöru sleikti um þvöru, Fs. 159 (183), proverbial of burning oneself by licking the scalding hot þvara, cp. Engl. ‘to burn one’s fingers.’",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [þverr], <i>a cross-stick;</i> ef þér kæmit í þverst þvari, <i>unless a bolt were thrown athwart thee, unless thou be thwarted,</i> Hkv. Hjörv. 18: in bryn-þvari, q. v.; ben-þvari, dólg-þvari, <i>a ‘wound-stick,’</i> i. e. <i>a weapon,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thva"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>þvó, þvo</strong>), pres. þvæ, þvær, þvær; plur. þvám, þváit, þvá: pret. þó (þvó), þótt, þó; plur. þógum, þógut, þógu: subj. þægi or þvægi; imperat. þvá (þvoðu); part. þveginn: the mod. pret. is weak, þvoði, Pass. 28. 7: [Ulf. <i>þwahan</i> = νίζειν; A. S. <i>þweân;</i> Hel. <i>þwahan;</i> provinc. Germ. <i>zwagen,</i> Schmeller; Dan. <i>tvætte;</i> Swed. <i>tvätla.</i>]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thval"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvál
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [þvæla; Swed. <i>tvål;</i> A. S. <i>þweal</i>], a kind of <i>soap</i> for washing, Edda ii. 514, 634.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-aptan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-aptan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>‘washing-night’</i> i. e. <i>Saturday evening,</i> Bs. i. 420, K. Þ. K.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-a"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-á
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>‘the wash,’ the wash-river,</i> a local name; Hallr var skírðr Laugardaginn fyrir Páska, ok hjún hans öll, þar í ánni, hón er síðan kölluð Þ., Bs. i. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-dagr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-dagr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>washing-day,</i> i. e. <i>Saturday,</i> Ld. 178, Grág. ii. 124, 399, Rb. 572.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-kona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-kona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a washer-woman,</i> O. H. L. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-nott"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-nótt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>washing-night,</i> i. e. <i>Saturday night,</i> Bs. i. 464.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-steinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-steinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a washing-stone, a rounded stone used in washing clothes,</i> Bs. i. 64.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvatt-vifl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvátt-vífl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., see vífl, Eb. 99 new Ed. (v. l. 5), Post. 231.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvattari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þváttari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a washer,</i> Greg. 52.",
            }
