              "__html": "m. <i>the cross daïs, the high-floor at the hall’s end</i> (see pallr), Fms. vi. 193, 440, Ld. 296, Eg. 549, 565, Grett. 103, 140 A, Sturl. i. 155, ii. 199.",
            }
