      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-syll"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-syll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a cross-sill,</i> Grett. 114 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-sok"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-sök
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a ‘cross-suit,’</i> a law phrase; fyrsta, önnur, þriðja þ., in payment of weregild, N. G. L. i. 76, 82 (nú eru uppnáma-menn allir taldir, en nú skal þat skilja hvessu þversakir skolu fara).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-taka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-taka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "tók, <i>to deny flatly,</i> Edda 21.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cross-tree,</i> Nj. 162, 202, Fms. x. 290, Sturl. ii. 109, Grett. 114, Hom. 96, 97, Dipl. iii. 8; í annan enda hússins var lopt uppi á þvertrjám, Ó. H. 153.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-ud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-úð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. (qs. þver-hygð), <i>discord;</i> tekr at görask nokkur þ. meðal N.M., Bs. i. 449; kom til þverúðar með þeim, Grett. 49 new Ed.; fór þá allt í þverúð með þeim, Kb. 114; at yrði ór höggnir allir þverúðar þreskeldir af beggja hendi, Bs. i. 736.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-vegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-vegr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = þverstigr; en allir aðrir vegir er renna til bæja manna, þat heita þvervegir, Gþl. 413: á þverveginn, <i>across, in diameter,</i> Fas. iii. 372.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-thili"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-þili
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a cross-deal, partition,</i> Gþl. 346, Fs. 143, Grett. 114.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thver-aeingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þver-æingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a man from</i> Þvera, the nickname of Einarr Th. (Landn., Glúm., Lv., Ó. H.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thverast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dep. <i>to move athwart, aside;</i> þveraðisk Steinarr fram á bakkann, Eg. 748; hann þveraðisk við ok gékk ekki nær þeim, Fms. viii. 358.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvera"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverá
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thverar-hlid"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverár-hlíð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thverr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "þver, þvert, adj., compar. þverari, þverast, but also þverstr; [Ulf. <i>þwairhs</i> = ὀργίλος, ὀργισθείς, <i>þwairgei</i> = ὄργη, ἔρις; A. S. <i>þweorh;</i> Engl. <i>a-thwart,</i> and also <i>queer;</i> Germ. <i>quer</i> (<i>kv</i> = <i>þv,</i> like kvistr, kvísl, for tvistr, tvísl); Dan. <i>tvær;</i> cp. Engl. <i>to thwart</i>]:—<i>athwart, across, transverse,</i> opp. to longways; tjalda um þveran skálann, Fms. i. 265; um þvert andlitið, Ó. H. 217; um þveran dal, Jb. 194; lá hvarr um þveran annan, <i>in heaps,</i> Fms. ix. 31; falla hvárr um þveran annan, pass.; járnspengr um þveran skjöld, Gþl. 105; þverrar handar hár, <i>a hand’s breadth,</i> Sd. 147; þremr þverum fingrum minni, Bs. i. 376; svá langt at þvers fótar sé, Karl. 112; ferr þú lítt þverr á fæti at fjándskap við oss, Ölk. 36: um þvert, <i>across;</i> geng ek um þvert frá leiki, <i>out of their way,</i> Sighvat: storm mikinn ok veðr þvert, <i>adverse winds,</i> Eg. 405; veðr hörð ok þver, Fms. x. 150; veðr þver af suðri, Grett. 86 A; sem sá í þveru veðri beitir löngum, Bs. i. 750; beittu þá sem þverast austr fyrir landit, Eg. 161.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thverra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, a causal to the preceding, <i>to make to decrease;</i> þverðu þeir þrótt sinn at þriðjungi, Hðm. 16; hann mátti ekki at vinna at þverra ágæti krapta hans, Greg. 79; þverrir þat nökkuð verðleik hans í Guðs augliti, Bs. i. 169; Sighvatr vildi eigi þverra kost sinn norðr þar, Sturl. ii. 65, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thverra-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þverr; pret. þvarr, pl. þurru; subj. þyrri; part. þorrinn; with neg. suff. þyrrit, Sighvat: mod. weak þverra, að, pres. þverrar, Lil. 58, but the word is little used: [þurr and þverra are kindred words]:—prop. <i>to be drained, ebb out,</i> but only used",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thverrir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þverrir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a diminisber,</i> Lex. Poët.; flug-þverrir, men-þ., seim-þ., veg-þ., epithets of a hero, id.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvest"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvest
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>þvesti,</strong> n. [no doubt akin to Ulf. <i>ga-þwastian</i> = <i>to make fast, þwastiþa</i> = το ἀσφαλές]:—prop. <i>the fast</i> or <i>firm parts, the lean of the flesh,</i> as opp. to the fat, <i>the lean of a whale’s flesh, the flesh underneath the blubber of a whale,</i> opp. to ‘rengi’ and ‘spik;’ at af teknu þvesti ok beinum, Vm. 107; þvest-slytti, <i>blubber,</i> Grett. (in a verse); the word is freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvinga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvinga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [O. H. G. <i>dwingan;</i> mid.H. G. <i>twinge;</i> Germ. <i>zwingen;</i> Dan. <i>tvinge;</i> þvinga and þungr (q. v.) are, we believe, kindred words]:—<i>to weigh down, oppress;</i> þvingar móðrinn harði, <i>a grief weighs me down,</i> Skáld H. 7. 9; mig hefir þvingað manna lát, 5. 14; sárliga þvinguð, Mirm. (Ed.) 210.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvingan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvingan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a weighing down, hardship,</i> Magn. 502; as opp. to skemtan, Stj. 2; þótti þat þ. at halda svá margar hátíðir, 49; til þvingunar ok ófrelsis, Bs. i. 720; ganga undir nýjar þvinganir, N. G. L. iii. 249.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvinnill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvinnill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a sea-king (akin to þvengr?), Edda (Gl.); þvinnils dýr = <i>a ship,</i> Kristni S. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "interj. <i>pish!</i> hvis, þvis! af tjöldin, Bs. i. 420.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = þveita, a kind of <i>axe,</i> Edda ii. 620.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thviti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þviti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [akin to þveita], <i>a stone,</i> prop. <i>a sling-stone</i> (?); tóku mikinn stein, sá heitir þviti, ok höfðu þann stein fytir festar-hælinn, Edda 20; en þviti heitir hæll er stendr í hválinum, Edda ii. 515; hramm-þ., <i>the ‘hand-stone,’</i> i. e. <i>a gem</i> or <i>a bracelet,</i> Höfuðl.: the word is still known as poët., e. g. liggðu þvita hulinn hér, honum einginn bifi! a mod. Icel. epitaph on a dog buried beneath a stone.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          því
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dat. from þat (q. v.), and as adverb, <i>‘for-thy,’ because,</i> see þat C.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvi-gi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          því-gi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<i>not therefore,</i> see þat; ok var hann at þvígi (<i>not therefore</i>) varðveittr at eigi gengi hundar á hann, Greg. 24.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvi-likr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          því-líkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘such-like,’ such;</i> mundi engi eiga þvílíkan hest, Nj. 89; með þvílíkum hætti sem fyrr segir, Hkr. ii. 92; þvílíkum stundum, sem …, Fms. x. 263; þá er hann þ. sem göngu-menn aðrir, Grág. i. 294; þílíkri líkamsins teiknan, Stj. 59; þvílíkast sem, <i>most like as if, just as if …,</i> Stj. 354, Barl. 88; annat þvílíkt, Fb. iii. 345.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvi-sa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          því-sa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, dat. = þessu, see þessi; á þvísa tré, Greg. 48; engi stóðsk þvísa fyrr, Bær. 19; á þvísa þingi, Harms. 32; þvísa landi, Íb. 14, Sighvat, Sks. 186; í þvísa ljósi, Grág. i. 28; næst þvísa = þessu næst, Gþl., Clem. 140.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvottr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvottr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see þváttr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvaela"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvæla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> d, [þvál], <i>to wash with lather</i> or <i>soap.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvaetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvætta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [Dan. <i>tvætte;</i> an iterative from þvá], <i>to wash;</i> skírðr ok þvættr, Barl. 159. v. l.: in mod. usage mostly vulgar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvaettari"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvættari
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a babbler,</i> the Bible.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvaetti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvætti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., in úr-þvætti, <i>the slops from wash, refuse.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thvaettingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þvættingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a wash:</i> metaph. <i>gabble, nonsense.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thybbinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þybbinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [þúfa], <i>obstinate, dogged.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-byrt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-byrt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. part., in the phrase, hafa þykkbyrt, <i>to have thick, stout armour,</i> Fms. vii. 264.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-bylt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-býlt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. part. <i>thick-set, studded with hamlets,</i> Orkn. 300.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-farit"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-farit
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. part.; hón heilsar þeim ok kvað þá þ. göra, <i>to make frequent visits,</i> Eb. 94.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-leikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-leiki</strong>), m. <i>thickness;</i> hann vildi forvitnask um þykkleik haussins, Eg. 769; þar við mátti ekki jafnask at hæð né þykkleik nökkurs manns hár, Fms. x. 177; þykkleiki mannsins, Stj. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-leitr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-leitr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>thick-faced,</i> Ld. 276.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>thickly.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [þykkr, m.], <i>threatening, sulky,</i> of weather; var veðr þykk-mikit, Sturl. ii. 65.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-roggvadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-röggvaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>thick-furred,</i> Lv. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-settr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-settr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>thick-set, thick-ranked,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-skipat"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-skipat
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>thickly-manned,</i> Bs. i. 526.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-skyjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-skýjaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>thick-clouded,</i> Sks. 227.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-varradr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-varraðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>thick-lipped,</i> Fms. ii. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykk-vaxinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykk-vaxinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>thick-set, stout of growth;</i> þjökk-vaxinn, Edda i. 258 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., in sundr-þykki, sam-þ.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkildi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkildi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a lump, thickness.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a thought, liking, sentiment, disposition;</i> fann hann, at stórlangt var í millum þeirra þykkju, <i>that their thoughts (likings) were wide apart,</i> Eb. 24; fóru þykkjur þeirra saman, <i>their sentiments went together,</i> Grett. 113 new Ed.; þer munut ráða … en ek mun ráða þykkju minni, Fbr. 15; var konungr mjök sér einn á þykkju (<i>self-willed</i>), þvi at hann vildi …, Bs. i. 781; honum þótti mestu varða um yðra þykkju (<i>goodwill</i>), Fms. iii. 138.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkja-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þykkir, pret. þótti, subj. þætti (i. e. þœtti), part. þótt: a middle form þykkjumk and þóttumk: the form with <i>kk</i> is the true old one, and is always so written in rhymes by old poets (with fékk, hykk, þekkir, etc.): in mod. usage one <i>k</i> has been lost, þykja, þykir, and so often in Editions, but erroneously; the ancients often sounded this word with <i>i</i>, þikkja, þikkir, but <i>y</i> is the older and better form: with neg. suff. þykkir-a, þótti-t, þóttisk-a-þú, Ls. 60; þykkj-at, Hkv. 2. 22; þikkir-a, Fms. vi. 447 (in a verse): [þykkja þótti and þekkja þátti are correlative verbs, one neut. the other transit.; so also Goth. <i>þagkjan þahta</i> = λογίζεσθαι, and <i>þugkjan þauhta</i> = δοκειν; A. S. <i>þencan þahte</i> and <i>þincan þuhte;</i> Germ. <i>denken dachte</i> and <i>dünken dünkte;</i> a trace of the neut. sense remains in Engl. <i>methinks, methought</i>.]",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkjask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkjask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, dep.; þ. við e-t or e-n, <i>to take offence at, get angry with;</i> Þórir bað konung eigi þ. við vist þeirra bræðra, Eg. 254, v. l.; þá þykktisk sá við er betr gékk ok sló sinn pústr hvárn þeirra, Vígl. 17; and so in mod. usage, þú mátt ekki þykkjast við þó eg segi þér satt, <i>thou must not take offence though I tell thee true.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkju-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkju-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>good-tempered, thoughtless, careless, easy,</i> Mag, 45.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkju-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkju-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>choleric of temper;</i> Halldórr var þ. sem aðrir Íslendingar, ok þótti ílla er hann fékk eigi þat er hann beiddi, Fb. i. 167; þ. ok þungr, Grett. 92 A.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to thicken</i> or <i>become stout;</i> loptið þröngvisk ok þykknar af vætum, Stj. 17; þá tók veðrit at þ., Fb. ii. 210; þar til er þykknaði (of a fluid), A.A. 275.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> m. [cp. A. S. <i>þaccian;</i> Old Engl. (Chaucer) <i>thack</i>; Engl. <i>thwack</i> = <i>to strike;</i> see also þjökka and þjaka]:—<i>a thwack, thump, blow, a hurt;</i> hann görði meyjunni þann þykk, at hón grét þegar, eu sveininn lék hann miklu harðara, Sd. 141; verðr nú við hann skapfátt ok veitir honum áverka svá næsta mikinn, at honum var þat gildr þykkr (<i>a severe hurt</i>) ok eigi banvænligr, Ísl. ii. 321 (Heiðarv. S.); þykkjar verðr, <i>worthy of a thwack,</i> Eg. (in a verse); fékk Gunnarr mikinn þykk af eins manns spjóti, Dropl. (major), cp. Njarð. 378.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thykkt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þykkt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> and <strong>þjokkt,</strong> f. <i>thickness;</i> breidd, lengd, þykkt, hæð, MS. 544. 156; á þykktina, <i>in the thickness,</i> Fms. ix. 522; eigi meirr en fimm menn á þyktina, Fms. vii. 275 (þjokktina, Hkr. iii. 400), Eg. 277.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thylja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þylja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þyl, þylr; pret. þulði or þuldi; subj. þylði; part. þulit; [þulr]:—<i>to say, read, chant,</i> in one continuous tone, without either stopping, or any intonation; mál er at þylja þular-stóli at, of a sage saying his saws, Hm. 111; hygg vísi at hve ek þylja fat, ef ek þögn of gat, of a bard chanting his lay, Höfuðl. 3; þyl ek grunnstrauma Grimnis, Þd.; vel samir enn of eina ölselju mér þ., Jd. 3; þylja um sigr, <i>to chant the victory,</i> Fms. vi. (in a verse); þær þyt þulu (þulðu?), <i>they sang their songs, accompanied the whirling mill with their song,</i> Gg. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [akin to þön, þenja?], <i>the withers</i> (?); en er hann sá uxann, þá var hlaupin ofan bógrinn ok slitin þynan (<i>wither-wrung</i>? but of an ox), fýstu flestir at drepa skyldi, Bs. i. 370: or is þyna = <i>the peritoneum,</i> mod. líf-hinna?",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyngd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyngð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [þungr], <i>heaviness, weight;</i> freq. in mod. usage, tvær vættir að þyngð; eðlis-þyngð, <i>specific gravity.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thynging"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þynging
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a burden, heaviness,</i> H. E. i. 407.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyngja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyngja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð and d, [þungr, Dan. <i>tynge</i>], <i>to weigh down, burden, make heavy,</i> Hom. 53; mun mér eigi þ. þetta erviði, <i>it will not encumber me,</i> Eluc. 3; augu þeirra þyngðusk (pass.) af tárum, 623. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyngjan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyngjan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þyngð, Mar., H. E. i. 408.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyngsl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyngsl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>þyngsli</strong>), n. pl. (<strong>þyngslir,</strong> f. pl., Barl. 44), <i>a burden;</i> göra e-m þ., <i>to be a burden to one,</i> B. K.; vera e-m til þyngsla, id.; meðr banni eðr öðrum þyngslum, at ganga undir þeirra álögur, MS. 126. 178.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thynna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þynna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., in half-þynna, a kind of <i>axe,</i> see p. 243.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thynna-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þynna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [þunnr], <i>to make thin;</i> þynna þoku frá augum e-m, Barl. 172, passim: impers., en sem þat kóf tekr at þynna, <i>the fog begins to lift,</i> Sks. 47, v. l. new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thynning"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þynning
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. a nickname, = þyna (?), Landn. 117.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a need, want,</i> see þurft.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. þyrli, [cp. Cumbrian <i>thyrel, a porridge-stick</i>], <i>a whisk</i> with a fringe at the end, with which to whip milk; flauta-þyrill, a <i>stick for whipping milk;</i> hárið er eins og þyrill, <i>hair rough like a</i> þyrill.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þyrr; pret. þurði; [see þori]:—<i>to sweep</i> or <i>rush along,</i> only used in poetry; kilir þurðu norðan, Ó. H. (in a verse); flaust þurðu und segli, Fms. x. (in a verse); Rögnvalds kind þurði und randir, … menn þurðut austan, Arnór; hrönn þurði at e-m, Þd. 12; láta mari þyrja fold fetum, <i>to let the steed sweep over the fields,</i> Akv. 13; mál kveð ek okkr fara úrig fjöll yfir, þyrja þjóð yfir, <i>to sweep over the people,</i> Skm. 10, of riding through the air.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrkingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrkingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [þurkr], <i>a dryness</i> in the mouth or throat.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [þyrill: Engl. <i>thrill, drill</i>; A. S. <i>þyrljan</i> = <i>to bore;</i> Old Engl. <i>thirl</i>; Germ. <i>drillen</i>]:—<i>to whirl,</i> as the wind does chaff or dry hay: vindr þyrlar heyinn í háfa lopt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrm-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrm-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = þyrmiliga, Bs. i. 821.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrm-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrm-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. = þyrmliga, Fms. xi. 146.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrma"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrma
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, prop. a law phrase-, or a religious term, <i>to deal reverently with, shew respect to;</i> with dat., var þá eigi þyrmt eiðunum, Edda 26; ef maðr þyrmir eigi griðum, Grág. ii. 166 B; þyrma særum, Róm. 288; þyrma lögum, Sks. 78 new Ed.; þat er ráð annat at þyrma hátíð, <i>to respect the holy-day,</i> by not fighting on that day, Fms. v. 170, N. G. L. i. 10; ok vill hann eigi þyrma Frjádögum né Kristnum dómi várum, of breaking the fast, 11; þyrma Jóla-helgi. 142; skulu vér þyrma kirkjum, <i>to respect the sanctuary of a church,</i> of an asylum, K. Á. 30; þyrma rétti heilagrar Kirkju, 40; þyrma konu and þyrma við konu, <i>to shew respect to a woman,</i> so as not to violate her, N. G. L. i. 16; mun engi maðr öðrum þyrma, Vsp. 46; Baldrs barmi þyrmðit manna-dólgi, <i>the brother of B. made no covenant with the foe of men,</i> Haustl.; at þú eigi vel eiðum þyrmir, Skv. 1. 47; þyrmða ek sifjum, svörmuu eiðum, 3. 28; þyrma véum, Hkm. 18; görisk sifja-spell ok þyrma menn engum hleytum, Sks. 338.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrmi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrmi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>meekly, gently, forbearingly;</i> hann keyrði hann niðr ok eigi þ., <i>threw him down, and that not gently,</i> Bjarn. 41; ú-þyrmiliga, Rd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrmir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrmir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., in Ú-þyrmir, <i>violator,</i> see p. 668.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrmslir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrmslir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl.; <strong>þyrmsl,</strong> n. pl.; <strong>þyrmslur,</strong> f. pl.:—<i>any sacred</i> or <i>lawful obligation of respect</i> or <i>forbearance due to others:</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrni-fotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrni-fótr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>thorn-foot,</i> a nickname. Eg.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrni-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrni-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>full of thorns,</i> Al. 52.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrni-hjalmr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrni-hjálmr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a thorn-helmet, a crown of thorns,</i> Hom. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrni-korona"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrni-kórona
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>-krúna,</strong> Karl. 545), u, f. <i>a crown of thorns,</i> Bs. i. 792, Mar., Pass.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrni-tre"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrni-tré
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a thorn-bush,</i> Karl. 545.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrnir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [see þorn; Dan. <i>tjörne</i>] <i>a thorn,</i> Karl. 546; klungr ok þyrni, Stj., Fms. v. 159: þyrnar ok íllgresi. Post.; fjaðrar hans vóru sem þyrnar, Post. 645. 69; þyna og þistla, the Bible, Matth. vii. 16; hag-þyrnir.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrpast"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrpast
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, dep. [þorp], <i>to crowd, throng;</i> þyrptust menn at honum, Fms. ii. 160; lið þeirra nam stað ok þyrptist saman við þessa sýn, viii. 405; ef aðrir menn þ. at manni, Sks. 302; þyrptisk þangat mikill fjöldi drukkinna manna, Fagrsk. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrping"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrping
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a crowd, throng,</i> freq. in mod. usage; það er þ. á hlaðinu.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrsklingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrsklingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [þorskr], <i>a small codfish,</i> Edda (Gl.), and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrsta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrsta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, [þorsti], <i>to thirst,</i> impers.; mig þyrstir, <i>‘it thirsts me,’ I thirst;</i> þá þyrstir hann (acc.) eigi, Eluc. 24, Stj. 132; hana þyrsti at meirr, Fms. vi. 352; til gullsins þyrsti þik, drekk þú nú gullit, Rb. 410; Bárðr sagði at hann þyrsti mjók, Eg. 207; slikt görir at er sölin etr, þyrstir æ því meirr, 605; þar þyrstir jörðina, Al. 50; þá er mik þyrsti þá gáfu þér mér at drekka, Barl. 35.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyrstr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyrstr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(<strong>þystr</strong>), adj. <i>thirsty,</i> Vþm. 8, Ls. 6, Eg. 204; (Þórr) er mjök þ. tekr at drekka ok svelgr allstórum, Edda 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thys-holl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þys-höll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a crowded hall,</i> Akv.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thys-mikill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þys-mikill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>making a great noise, uproarious,</i> Fms. x. 213.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thysja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þysja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "pres. þyss; pret. þusti; g<i>ust</i>r, þ<i>ust</i>u, Sighvat; in mod. usage <strong>þusa</strong> and <strong>þusti</strong>: [an older form for þyrja? cp. þausnir]:—<i>to rush;</i> þusti (þursti Ed.) þegar allr Grikkja-herr alvápnaðr ór herbúðunum í borgina, Fms. vi. 157; þá þysja Rómverjar þar at, Rom. 273; þustu þeir þá fram ór skóginum eptir þeim, Ó. H. 135; ok enn þustu at allir þeir er í öðrum stöðum höfðu setið, 68; þá þustu bændr at konungi ok báðu hann eta kjöt, Fms. i. 35; ok nú þyss sjá flokkr fram á leikvöllinn, Skálda 172.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þyss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. þys, <i>an uproar, tumult from a crowd</i>; þyss eru þrettán, Edda 108; kominn er þyss í þessa þjóð, Gísl. (in a verse); en er morna tók hætti þysnum í bænum, Fms. vi. 16; þyss sjá eða kliðr, Gísl. 56; fyrir þys þann (<i>riot</i>) er þeir höfðu gört at Hákoni jarli, Fms. i. 220; þá görðisk þyss mikill í bænum, vii. 173; þyss ok vápna-brak, 260; í þessum þys var Hákon særðr bana-sári, 290; en hann mátti einskis víss verða fyrir alþýðu-þys, þvíat hverr kallaði fyrir munn öðrum, 655 xvi. B. 3; fyrir þys alþýðu, Post. 227; manna þys, Skálda 169; hví gegnir þyss sjá manna, 623. 55; rekum þurt þys vándra hugrenninga, Hom. 148; skósveinn Gunnildar hljóp fram í þysinn (þysinum, v. l.), Fms. i. 45: in Róm. 285, Lat. <i>tumultus</i> is rendered by þyss.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thytr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þytr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [þjóta], <i>a noise, whistling sound,</i> as of wind, leaves, Edda (Gl.); þær þyt þulu, of the whirling of a mill, Gs. 3: er þungt at heyra þyt smábarna, <i>cries, wailings,</i> Fms. i. 263; vinda gnýr eða vatna þytr, Skúlda; lúðra-þytr, q. v.; íllviðra-þytr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thy"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þý
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., qs. þivi, [Ulf. <i>þjus</i> = οἰκέτης, <i>þiwan</i> = δουλουν, <i>þiwi</i> = παιδίσκη, <i>þiwis</i> = δουλος; A. S. <i>þeow</i>; Dan. <i>ty, tyende;</i> cp. þjó-na]:—<i>a serf, bondsman;</i> þý hans eðr ambátt, Gísl. 132 (for þýr).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thy-borinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þý-borinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>born of a bondwoman;</i> Ismael var þ., Post. 645. 62; hón er þ. at móðerni, Eg. 338; sunr þ., N. G. L. i. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyd-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýð-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = þýðleikr, 655 xxviii. 3.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>attachment, love;</i> þýða ok blíðlæti, Hom. 115; drag aldri þyðu eða samræði til hans úvina, Sks. 80 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyda-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, [O. H. G. <i>djuten:</i> Dutch <i>duiden;</i> Germ. <i>deuten;</i> Dan. <i>tyde;</i> the word is better derived from Goth. <i>þjuda</i> than from <i>þjuþ</i> = <i>bonum</i>]:—prop. <i>to associate, attach;</i> þýða sér, <i>to attach to oneself;</i> hann ferr víða um lönd ok þýddi sér fólkit, Fms. iii. 272.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyding"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðing
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an interpretation;</i> eptir réttri þýðingu, Stj. 200: <i>a sense, meaning,</i> önnur er þ. þinnar ræðu, Barl. 29.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>attachment, affection;</i> hón veik undan at hafa þýðleik né einn við þá, Clem. 129.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>affectionately, meekly;</i> eptir hirting, … að sér þýðlega vefr, af þerrar klár öll þeirra tár, ástar-koss margan gefr, Hallgr.; þýðlega þess eg bið, Pass. 7. 17.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>attached, affectionate,</i> Fb. i. 443, Sturl. iii. 60.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þýðing, <i>signification,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>kind, meek, amiable;</i> þyðr ok þekkr við sína menn, Fms. x. 420; þýðr ok þekkiligr, Bs. i. 76; fámæltr optast, ekki þýðr (<i>not affable, harsh</i>), Fms. vii. 102; þ. við alla vini sína ok alla góða menn, Bs. i. 128; Herrann beið þeirra hinn þýði, Pass. 6. 1.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydverska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðverska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f., or, dropping the <i>v</i>, <strong>Þýðerska, Þýverska,</strong> <i>the Teutonic land, Germany;</i> til annarra landa, Danmerkr ok Þýðersku (Þðerska ríkis, Þýðverska land, v. l.), Fms. ix. 487; landskjálpti inn mikli í Þýðersku, Ann. 1000 B; fór Sturla þá suðr í Þýðversku-land, Bs. i. 555; hann mælti Þýðesku, <i>spoke in German,</i> Greg. 75; raka jaðar-skegg á Þýðversku (Þýversku, v. l.), <i>in German fashion,</i> Sks. 66 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thydverskr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýðverskr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj., but better <strong>Þýðerskr,</strong> often spelt <strong>Þyeskr;</strong> the <i>v</i> and <i>r</i> are due to a wrong notion as to its origin, as if it came from <i>-verjar</i> (= <i>men</i>) instead of the inflex. <i>iskr</i>, as is seen from the German form; [O. H. G. <i>Diutisc;</i> mid.H. G. <i>Diutisch, Tiusch;</i> low Lat. <i>Theotiscus;</i> Hel. <i>Thiudisk;</i> mod. Germ. <i>Teutsch, Deutsch;</i> Engl. <i>Dutch;</i> these forms shew that <i>v</i> and <i>r</i> are in the Norse wrongly inserted; the old Icel. word was evidently borrowed from the Germ. through the trading people, perhaps in the 11th or 12th century; it does not therefore appear in a genuine Norse form, for then the inflexive <i>iskr</i> should have been assimilated to the preceding root word, so forming a monosyllable; the mod. form Þýzkr is in this respect correct; the root word is Goth. <i>þiuda</i> = þjóð, see Grimm’s Dict. s. v. ii. 1043; in Ulf. <i>þiuþisko</i> = ἐθνικως]:—<i>German;</i> Þýðerskir menn (Þýðverskir, Þýverskir, Þýðskir, v. l.), Fms. viii. 248; Vindum ok Þýðeskum mönnum, x. 45, v. l.; Þýðerska menn, 47; en Þýðeskir menn segja, Fas. i. 332; Þýverskir, Fb. i. 355. l. c.; Þýveskr, Ann. 1342 C; svá segir í kvœðum Þýðærskum, Þiðr. 304; frá sögn Þýðærskra manna, 334; Þýðeskum kvæðum, 231, 330, 352; Þýðeskra manna sögur, 180; í Þýðersk tunga, 1, 302, 304.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyfd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýfð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [þjófr], <i>theft,</i> Grág. i. 401, 429.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyfdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýfðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>covered with mounds, uneven, rough,</i> of a field, Fms. iii. 207; þýft tún, þýfðar engjar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyfga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýfga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to impute theft to a person;</i> þýfga e-n um e-t.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [þúfa], <i>a field covered with mounds</i> or <i>hillocks, uneven ground;</i> slá í þýfi, krappa-þýfi. <strong>þýfi-teigr,</strong> m. <i>a rough paddock,</i> Rm. 102.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyfi-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [þjófr], <i>stolen goods,</i> Jb. 419 C; Viðris þýfi, Stor. 1; báðum þótti um þýfið vænt. Stef. Ól. <strong>þýfi-gjöld,</strong> n. pl. <i>a fine for theft</i>, Grág. 1. 457.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyfska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýfska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>theft,</i> Gþl. 541: <i>stolen goods,</i> N. G. L. i. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyft"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýft
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þýfð, Gþl. 538, 541.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þýjar, dat. þýju, acc. þý; pl. þýjar; the <i>r</i> is a fem. inflexion, as in kýr, sýr; the root is þý, qs. þivi; see þý; [Goth. <i>þjus</i> and <i>þiwi;</i> cp. A. S. <i>þeowian</i> = <i>to serve;</i> Icel. þjó-na, qs. þjov-na, þjónn; as also Germ. <i>dienen</i>]:—<i>a bondwoman;</i> þræll ok þýr, Rm.; þræl eða þý (allit.), <i>man-servant and maid-servant,</i> Fms. iv. 204; þýjar barn, þýjar sonr, <i>a bairn, son of a bondwoman,</i> Fas. i. 495, iii. 434; meðan þú á kvernum kysstir þýjar, Hkv. 1. 35; hvöss eru augu í Hagals þýju (dat.), 2. 2; þræla þrjá tigu, þýjar (acc. pl.) sjau góðar, Am. 93; þýjar ok salkonur, Skv. 3. 45; en um Svanhildi sátu þýjar (nom. pl.), <i>waited on her,</i> Gh. 15; meldr Fróða þýja (gen. pl.), Edda (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thyzkr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þýzkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= Þýðverskr, only in late vellums; Þýzkan söðul, Fms. xi. 443.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaefa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þæfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a stamping.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaefa-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þæfa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>þœfa,</strong> ð, [þóf, hence the mod. Dan. <i>töve</i>], <i>to beat, stamp cloth;</i> þau klæði vóru þæfð með sand ok tjöru, Fas. i. 346; and in mod. usage, þæfa sokka, vetlinga, peisu; þæfa í tunnu, <i>to stamp in a tub,</i> a curious custom still used in Icel. of two men lying on their backs and treading a tub open at both ends, so as to pack the cloth tightly.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaefni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þæfni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. = þæfa, Lv. 45: <strong>þæfð,</strong> f. <i>id.,</i> Vápn. 16.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaefta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þæfta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, see þöfta.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaegd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þægð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [þiggja, þágu], <i>an acceptable thing, pleasure;</i> leggja þægð ok fýsi til e-s, 655 xxvii. 11; mér er engin þægð í því, <i>I do not want it, don’t do it to oblige me;</i> or göra e-m e-t til þægðar, <i>to do a thing to please another.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaegiliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þægiliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>agreeably.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaegiligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þægiligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>acceptable, agreeable,</i> Edda 81, Nj. 227, Fms. viii. 229, Al. 17, K. Á. 76, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaegindi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þægindi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>pleasure;</i> göra e-m e-t til þæginda, Fms. ii. 41.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaegja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þægja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "ð, [þiggja, þág], <i>to make acceptable, to gratify a person;</i> þægja e-m í, <i>to give a small gratification to a person:</i> pass., svá helgask ok þægjask öll góðverk í ást, <i>become acceptable,</i> Hom. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þægr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>acceptable, agreeable;</i> fórnir þægjar goðum várum, 623. 12; Guði þægr, <i>acceptable to God,</i> 655 x. 2, and passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thaeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þæri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>the lower part of a carcase, brisket;</i> var þar ekki kjöt á bæ hennar nema eitt sauðar-þæri, Bs. i. 611: of a cut-up fish, þorskr álnar í öxar-þærum, Grág. ii. 380 (Jb. 327); eyxar-þærum flattr, (Kb.) 357, l. c.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thofta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þöfta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "[þóf?], a απ. λεγ., <i>to throb, beat</i> (?) like a pulse; sýndisk honum höndin heit, ok rauk af, ok þöftu æðarnar, <i>the hand seemed to be warm and steamed, and the veins beat,</i> Fas. iii. 395.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thogn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þagnar, [þegja], <i>silence;</i> sögn eða þögn haf þú þér sjálfr í hug, Sdm.; gott þóttumk þat er ek þögn of gat, <i>silence, a hearing,</i> Höfuðl.; slegit hefir þögn á þegna, Sighvat; þá sló þögn á höfðingjana ok mælti einginn, Fagrsk. 61; þagnar mark, Stj. 250; þagnar tími, <i>a time of silence,</i> Bs. i. 891, Stj. 158, and passim, <strong>þagnar-gildi,</strong> n.; in the phrase, láta e-ð liggja (vera) í þagnargildi, <i>to leave a thing alone, not mention it.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thogn-horfinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þögn-horfinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>‘silence-bereft,’</i> i. e. <i>noisy</i>, an epithet of a mill, Gs. (απ. λεγ.); the passage is not quite clear, and an alliteration seems to be wanting.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thogull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þögull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>silent, of silent habits,</i> Hm. 6; hann var maðr þ., ríklundaðr ok úþýðr, Hkr. i. 28; hann var þögull, ekki nafn festisk við hann, Sæm. 96; hinn þögli áss, Edda 17; Viðars ins þögla, 60; horskr ok þögull, Hm.; sí-þögull, <i>mute;</i> see þagall.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thokk"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þökk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þakkar, pl. þakkir; [Ulf. <i>þagks</i> = χάρις, Luke xvii. 9; A. S. <i>þanc;</i> Engl. <i>thanks;</i> Germ. <i>dank;</i> Dan. <i>tak</i>]:—prop. <i>pleasure, liking,</i> akin to þekkr, þokki, cp. Lat. <i>gratia</i> and <i>gratus</i> with <i>grates</i> and Gr. χαρά with χάρις, göra e-t til þakka e-s, <i>to one’s liking, to please a person,</i> Eg. 63; leggja e-t vel í þökk við en, 153: but usually,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/tholl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þöll
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þallar (= þollr), <i>a young fir-tree;</i> hrörnar þöll er stendr þorpi á, Hm., Edda (Gl.): freq. in circumlocutory descriptions of women, bauga-þóll, auð-þöll, men-þöll, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thomb"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þömb
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þambar, [cp. þamba, þembi-; akin to þenja (?); cp. Lat. <i>tum-or, tum-idus</i>]:—<i>the womb, guts,</i> but with the notion of being blown-up; ok aum í vömb varð heldr til þörnb, Bjarn. (in a verse), where þömb seems to be a noun, not an adjective.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thon"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þön
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þanar, pl. þanir, [þenja], <i>a scaffold</i> or <i>platform on stakes,</i> on which nets and the like are stretched out for drying; þeir tóku gærur af þönum, Sturl. iii. 189; Loka lögvélar (i. e. the net) leika á þönum, Egilsson’s rendering of the verse in Herodotus i. 62; the word is freq.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thongla-bakki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þöngla-bakki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a local name, map of Icel.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thongull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þöngull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., dat. þöngli, [þang], <i>tangle, sea-weed,</i> Fms. vi. 376; þönglar stórir lágu í fjörunni í leirinum, Sveinn greip upp einn þöngulinn, Orkn. 336, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thonguls-hofud"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þönguls-höfuð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a tangle-head,</i> as opp. to the stalk, Ld. 324.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thorf"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þörf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. þarfar, pl. þarfir, [þurfa; Ulf. <i>þarba</i> = ὑστέρημα, <i>þarbos þulan</i> = ὑστερεισθαι; Dan. <i>tarv</i>]:—<i>need, necessity;</i> e-m er þörf e-s, Hm. 149; ef görask þarfar þess, Skm.; enga þörf ætla ek mér á því, Fms. vi. 36; bíða langa þörf e-s, Bs. i. 862: the phrases, vinna þörf, <i>to suffice,</i> Al. 125, 129, Grág. i. 445, 457; þola þörf e-s (Goth. <i>þarvos þulan</i>), Hm.; þá er þörf verðr, <i>when wanted,</i> K. Þ. K. 14; þörfum meirr, <i>more than needed, excessively,</i> Ld. 206, Jd. 32; e-t kemr vel í þarfar, <i>it comes to good use,</i> in a case of need or emergency, Fms. viii. 290: <i>business,</i> N. G. L. i. 80.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thorf-gi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þörf-gi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>not needed,</i> Skv. 3. 33, Hkv. Hjörv. 39.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/thorf-samliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          þörf-samliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
