        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an inciter, stirrer, ringleader,</i> Fms. viii. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aeska"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æska
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>œska,</strong> u, f., œrska, Barl. 199; <i>ærs</i>ka and <i>Irs</i>kum make a rhyme, Fms. vii. (in a verse); spelt eoska, 645. 110; [from œri, compar. of ungr, q. v.]:—<i>youth, childhood,</i> Lat. <i>juventus,</i> Fms. vii. 220; hvárki œska né elli, 677. 3; veldr elli mér enn œska þér, Korm.: frá æsku til elli, Mar.; í æsku, Fms. i. 155, Grág. i. 278, 281, Sks. 26; í æsku ok bernsku, 596. fyrir œsku sakir, Grág. i. 410.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aeski-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æski-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>to one’s wish,</i> Art. 77, 88, Pr. 406.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aeski-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æski-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. [Dan. <i>önskelig</i>], <i>to be wished;</i> æskligr sonr, <i>an adopted son,</i> Fms. ii. 196, x. 221: <i>desirable, to one’s wish,</i> æ byrr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aeskja"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æskja
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>œskja,</strong> t, from ósk; [Engl. <i>wish;</i> Germ. <i>wünschen;</i> Dan. <i>önske</i>]:—<i>to wish;</i> meiri laun en vér kunnim sjálvir at œskja oss, Ó. H. 209: þess œski ek þér, Clem. 147; þessa œskða ek, 655 xxviii; œskja sér e-s, 677. 23; æsktu sér slíks yfirboða, Bs. i. 136: æskjandi hlutr (gerund.), Eluc. 49; þann sigr sem ek æskta, Al. 170; æskja e-m e-s, <i>to wish for one,</i> Stj. 235; monda ek eigi kunna at œskja (øyskja Cod.) annan veg minn mann, Ó. H. 59; œskja sér eigi framarr, Fbr. 57.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
