        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>by birth, born;</i> vel æ., <i>well-born, of good family,</i> Eg. 337, Fms. i. 14; þar æ. í Þrándheimi, <i>a native of Th.,</i> ix. 231: <i>legitimate,</i> sonr æ., Js. 66; vera æ. til e-s, <i>to be born to, entitled to by birth;</i> æ. til lands þessa, <i>a rightful heir of the land,</i> Fms. vii. 18; æ. til konungdóms, 280.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
