          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. = ættarferð, Stj. 431, v. l. ættar-gipt, f. <i>the family luck,</i> Fas. ii. 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-gripr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-gripr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an heirloom,</i> Fr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-haugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-haugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a family cairn, a family tomb;</i> engi á at grafa í annars ættarhaug, N. G. L. i. 405 (cp. heimis-haugr, Hbl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-hogg"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-högg
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a family-blow, calamity, loss,</i> Þórð. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-laukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-laukr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the ‘leek of a family,’ the best of one’s family;</i> see laukr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-menn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-menn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. pl. = ættmenn, Bs. i. 731.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-mot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-mót
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a family likeness;</i> var þar ættarmót með okkr Tryggva konungi, Fms. vi. 388; það er annað ættarmót … við höfum báðir valtan fót, vitum ei nær við dettum, Hallgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-nafn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-nafn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an hereditary title;</i> nú vil ek beiða ættarnafns af yðr (viz. king’s title), Fms. vi. 54: <i>a family name,</i> but not in the mod. Engl. sense, which was unknown to the ancients.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-rettr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-réttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an hereditary right,</i> Fms. x. 390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-skard"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-skarð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a loss</i> (by death) <i>in a family,</i> Jb. 24, Sks. 343.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-skjoldr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-skjöldr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the shield, prop of a family,</i> Stor.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-skomm"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-skömm
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a family disgrace</i> (of a person), Bárð. 181.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-spillir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-spillir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a family spoiler, disgracer, laggard,</i> Fms. ii. 47.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-stofn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-stofn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a stem,</i> Hkr. iii. 170.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-svipr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-svipr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a family likeness,</i> Art. 71, Fb. iii. 379.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-tal"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-tal
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a pedigree,</i> Al. 29: the name of an historical work, Fagrsk. (begin.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettar-tala"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættar-tala
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>a genealogy, pedigree;</i> fyrir útan ættar-tölu ok konunga-æfi, Íb. (pref.), Fms. ix. 255, 273, x. 13, D. N. iii. 122, passim in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aetterni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ætterni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>family, descent, extraction;</i> ætterni mitt ok mik sjálfan it sama, Fm. 4; telja æ. til e-s, <i>to reckon one’s pedigree from,</i> Fms. x. 389; ekki var margra manna vitorð á hans æ. (<i>origin</i>), 391: þar var nokkvot æ. hans (<i>family</i>), id.; suðr í Fjörðum, þar er æ. hans allt, Eg. 50, Ó. H. 30. <strong>ætternis-stapi,</strong> a, m. a mythical name of a rock; for this legend see Gautr. S. ch. 1, 2, cp. Pliny’s Hist. Nat. iv. ch. 12.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettingi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættingi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a kinsman</i> (= áttungr II), Str. 16, 48, Stj. 332, Karl. 318, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a quarter of the heaven,</i> = átt (or ætt); af ættingi vestrs í ætting suðrs, 732. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aettum-godr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ættum-góðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = ættgóðr, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aetzka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ætzka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. [ætt], <i>relationship, kinship;</i> hann var nokkut í æzku við erkibiskup, Fms. ix. 390.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aetzkadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ætzkaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>native</i> (cp. Lat. <i>oriundus</i>); æzkaðr ór héraði því er heitir …, Greg. 58, Post. (Unger) 227 (ætzkaðr); þaðan æ., Hom. 107; hón var æzkuð ór Mostr, Hkr. i. 118; peir er æzkaðir váru um Kjöl norðan, 137; hann var etzcaðr (sic) of Ögðum, Ó. H. 49, 50.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aexa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æxa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>œxa,</strong> [causal of vaxa, óx], <i>to make to wax, cause to increase;</i> œxa sköp, Am. 2; æxtu öldrykkju, 75; með fé þat eða þat er hann hefir af því œxt, Grág. i. 96; nú hefir þeim fleirum œxt verit féit eða gefit, 173; vér höfum mikinn auð œxtan á smíðum várum, Post. 223.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aexla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æxla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= æxa, i. e. <strong>œxla</strong> (spelt eoxla, Rb. 104):—<i>to make to increase;</i> þat æxlti mjök úþokka þeirra, Ver. 16; æxla ríki sitt, Ing. 6; mínki heldr enn ægsli (sic) minn vöxt, Thom. 378; sem hér megu líkamligan eld œxla, Greg. 77; þeir æxltu (æxlztu) mikit rétt þeirra, Bs. i. 157; æxla göngu sína, Rb. 104.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aexling"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æxling
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>an increase,</i> Greg. 26; til æxlingar kvala sinna, Post. 209.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/aezli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          æzli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [áta, from eta, át; Dan. <i>aadsel;</i> cp. Germ. <i>aas</i>], <i>carrion;</i> örnu æzli fegna, Gkv. 2. 8; nú er örninn gamli floginn á æzlit, Eb. 188; þar sem nóg er æzlið, Fas. ii. 265 (Ed. ægslað, æxlið, v. l., erroneously).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oegi-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œgi-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>terribly, threateningly,</i> Róm. 325, Fms. x. 83 (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oegi-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œgi-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>terrible, awful,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oegir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œgir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>one who frightens,</i> Lex. Poët., Fms. vi. (in a verse), Gm. 45, Hkv. 1. 54; this word is no relation to the following word.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oegr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œgr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = ýgr (q. v.), <i>terrible;</i> lœkr, ‘œgr,’ Skálda 178, Lex. Poët.: <i>vicious</i>, Guð gaf ekki ægum uxa-horn, a saying, Vídal. ii. 83; cp. mannýgr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. (mod. <strong>auli</strong>) <i>an idiot, simpleton;</i> œli telsk þar er ólu ósnotran mann gotnar, Skálda (in a verse); in mann-æli, q. v.: the mod. form auli occurs in Skíða R. 185; þú ert mesti auli! aula-legr, aula-skapr, correct thus in p. 24. col. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oeri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "compar. <i>the younger:</i> <strong>œrstr,</strong> <i>the youngest;</i> see ungr B, p. 654.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oexl"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          œxl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. (mod. æxli), <i>an excrescence,</i> medic.; hón hafði œxl mikit … var hönd hans heil, en horfit æxlit, 655 xxii. B. 1; freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odlan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðlan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a gaining, acquiring;</i> öðlun góðra hluta, 656 B. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odlask-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðlask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "dep. að, i. e. øðlask, spelt æðlask, Post. (Unger) 215; [öðli, óðal; Cumbrian <i>to addle</i> or <i>eddle</i> = <i>to gain</i>]:—<i>to win, gain as property,</i> prop. of inheritance (óðal); þá öðlaðisk ok þá eiga gat, Rm. 42; ef þú vill öðlask ástir mínar, Þkv. 29; alls vér megum ríki öðlask með þeirra trausti, Fms. vi. 18; þar fyrir muntu öðlask eilífa sælu, Fb. i. 117; þeir skulu eigi öðlask himinríki, Barl. 42; very freq. in mod. usage, esp. in eccl. use, N. T., Vídal.; (in Eb. 7 new Ed., hann vildi eigi öðlask við frændr sína, the reading ‘áhlýðask’ is to be preferred); hann mun öðlask ríki þat er hann er til borinn, Fms. i. 77; ef vér megum öðlask þat barn, ii. 176; at hann öðlisk at taka eilíft líf, Hom. 5; biskup várn, hann skal oss þjónostu veita, en vér skolum hana svá öðrlask (sic), at vér skolum göra tíund alla ok fulla, N. G. L. i. 6; ok öðlask með því hálfa mörk silfrs konungi til handa, ii. 111: hann öðlaðisk fegrð ok grænleik Paradisar, Orkn. 172; ok öðlisk með því þá sekt er við liggr at lögum ok ekki framarr, N. G. L. ii. 254; í hverri er þessi orð öðlask at heyra, Sks. 173 new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = óðal (q. v.), <i>a patrimony,</i> whence <i>origin, extraction;</i> ef ek öðli (ǿþli Cod.) ættak sem Ingunnar-Freyr eði svá sælligt setr, Ls. 43; segja til nafns sins ok alls öðlis (æþlis Cod.), <i>to tell one’s name and whereabouts,</i> Hbl. 9: allit., ætt ok öðli, passim; Danskr at øðli, <i>Danish by extraction,</i> Hom.; cp. the forms orðla, orðlum, N. G. L.; for further references, see eðii (the later form); the old form remains in aldar-öðli, see óðal in the Addenda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odlingr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðlingr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [from óðal, öðli; the etymology in Edda 105 is erroneous]:—prop. <i>an allodial owner</i> or <i>possessor of</i> ódal. but only used of <i>a noble captain, prince;</i> Valdimarr var þá sjautján vetra gamall, hann var œðlingr, … öðlingr ok hafði ríki á Jótlandi, Fms. xi. 350; hann var öðlingr af Serklandi, Orkn. 368; the word is very freq. in poetry.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odru"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðru-
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>öðru-megin,</strong> <i>on the other side;</i> see annarr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odru-viss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðru-víss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>-vísi,</strong> adv. <i>otherwise;</i> see vísa.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/odu-skel"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öðu-skel
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., see aða.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to turn in inverse order;</i> öfga vápni at manni. <i>to turn the butt-end of a weapon to a man,</i> N. G. L. i; allir stafir þessa nafns (i. e. ave from Eva = Eve) eru öfgaðir … ‘Eva’ öfgast ok ‘ave’ er sagt, Mar. (of an anagram).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofgar"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfgar
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. pl. <i>an exaggeration, false report;</i> það eru engar öfgar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofig-hlyri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfig-hlýri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. a kind of <i>fish</i>, = Dan. <i>pigvar.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofig-maeli"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfig-mæli
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = öfugyrði.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofig-streymi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfig-streymi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an eddy, cross current,</i> used of the tide or current running against the wind or another current, and making rough water.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofig-uggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfig-uggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a (fabulous) trout with inverted fins;</i> such fish are by the vulgar believed to be found in mountain lakes, and to be poisonous, see Ísl. Þjóðs.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofig-yrdi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfig-yrði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>a froward word, evil word.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofigr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>öfugr,</strong> adj., afigr, N. G. L. i. 376; in old writers contracted, öfgu, öfgir, etc., but in mod. usage uncontractcd throughout: [from af- and vegr; Ulf. <i>ibuks</i> = εἰς τα ὀπίσω; Swed. <i>afvig;</i> Dan. <i>avet;</i> Old Engl. <i>awk</i> (which survives in <i>awk-ward</i>), meaning <i>left,</i>—Fr. <i>gauche</i>]:—<i>turning the wrong way, tail</i> or <i>back foremost;</i> kálvar á beinum fram eða augu í huakka aptan, ok afgu líki öllu, N. G. L. i. 376; hljóp Gunnarr aptr yfir öfugr, Nj. 46: þat gékk öfugt um húsit ok annsælis, Eb. 268, Grett. 151; þat var bragð hans at hann gékk öfigr, Finnb. 246; öfigr féll hann aptr á bak, Skíða R.; hann stökkr út af vegginum öfugr, Fær. 112; skáru af fitjar ok bundu öfgar undir fætr sér, Ó. H. 152; Þórlaug drap við hendi öfgri, <i>the back of the hand,</i> Lv. 38; hjó hann öfgri hendi til Knúts konungs, Fms. xi. 367; þat er misvígi, ef maðr er viginn öfgum vápnum, <i>with the butt-end of a weapon,</i> N. G. L. i. 80: æfin hefir öfug verit, Fs. 8, v. l.; varð þat öfgu heilli, Róm. 181; mæla öfugt orð til e-s, Sturl. ii. 201; hvárigir lögðu öðrum öfugt orð, Grett. 113 new Ed.; öldr-mál öfug, Sdm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oflgask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öflgask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [afl, öfligr], <i>to get strong;</i> þá öflgaðisk (<i>waxed</i>) ágirni til fjár, Edda (pref.); ö. í móti, ö. gegn e-m, Sýrir öflgask í móti mér, <i>rise strong against me,</i> Stj.; láta önga íllsku öflgask í gegn sínum rétt-trúuðum mönnum, Fms. ii. 238; engir sterkir borgar-veggir mega móti ö. tilkvámu Guðs postola, Karl. 131.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oflugr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öflugr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. (afligr, aflugr, Sks. 605, MS. 4. 72), compar. öflgari, öflgastr (mod. öflugri, öflugastr); uncontr. aflugum, aflugasti, MS. 4. 72, contr. öflgir, etc., but in mod. usage uncontr. throughout; [afl]:—<i>strong, powerful;</i> mikill vexti ok öflugr, Nj. 152; öflgir ok ástkir Æsir, Vsp.; öflgur, Gs. 11; þó var Þjazi þeim öflgari. 9; öflugr ok ríkr, vaskr ok ö., Str.; öflug kenning, Hom. 17; öflgan hita, Sks. 11 new Ed.; leggja öflga hönd á e-n, <i>a violent hand,</i> Bs. i. 905; með öfigum tíri, <i>with mighty glory,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oflun"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öflun
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a gain, acquisition;</i> see aflan, p. 7.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oflunar-madr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öflunar-maðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a good steward,</i> Sturl. iii. 130.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofri"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfri
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "i. e. <strong>øfri,</strong> compar., and <strong>øfstr,</strong> superl., are older forms for efri, efstr; see p. 116, col. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., also spelt afund; [Dan. <i>avind</i>; Swed. <i>afund;</i> prob. from af- and unna, and thus prop. meaning <i>a disowning, a grudge</i>]:—<i>a grudge, envy, ill-will,</i> Sks. 609, Al. 153, Hom. 20, 52, 86; rægðr fyrir öfundar sakir, Ver. 52; sakir öfundar við Noregs konung, Fms. x. 9; gjalda e-m öfund, Ls. 12; öfundar-eyrir, öfundar-fé, <i>money which is a cause of envy,</i> in the proverb, afgjarnt verðr öfundar fé, Fas ii. 332; hann taldi þat sízt öfundar eyri, ok allir mundu honum þar bezt sæmdar unna, Fs. 12; e-m leikr, vex öfund á e-u, Fms. vi. 342, Fb. i. 91.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-fullr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-fullr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>full of envy,</i> Hom. 113, Sks. 235.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-girni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-girni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>envy.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-gjarn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-gjarn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>envious, spiteful,</i> Ýt.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-kennt"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-kennt
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>envied, exposing one to ill-will,</i> Fms. vi. 145.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-lauss"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-lauss
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unenvied,</i> Grág. i. 452: gjöfin var eigi öfundlaus, Ó. H. 173: the saving, aumr er öfundlauss maðr, <i>wretched indeed must the person be whom nobody envies.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-samr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-samr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>envious.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-sjukr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-sjúkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>envious, jealous,</i> Fms. iii. 153, vi. 96, Sks. 437, Rom. 382.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofund-syki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfund-sýki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>envy,</i> Magn. 506, Barl. 42.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofunda"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfunda
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to envy, bear malice;</i> with acc, ö. e-n, e-t, Fb. i. 91. Fms. xi. 427, Barl. 50, Nj. 47, Ld. 94, and so in mod. usage: with dat. (a Latinism <i>invidere a-i</i>), Stj., Hom.: impers., mik öfundar e-t, Barl. 116.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ofusa"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öfusa
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>thanks, gratitude;</i> see aufusa, p. 32, col. 2.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/og-mundr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ög-mundr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a pr. name. [Germ. <i>Egmond, Egmont</i>], Landn. Korm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/og-valdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ög-valdr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a pr. name, whence <strong>Ögvalds-nes,</strong> a local name in Norway, Fms. xii.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oglir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öglir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. [cp. Lat. <i>aquila</i>], poët. a kind of <i>hawk:</i> öglis barn, Haustl.; öglis land, -stétt, <i>the falcon’s land</i> or <i>seat,</i> i. e. <i>the hand,</i> Eb. (in a verse); öglis landa eik, Ó. H. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ogn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ögn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. agnar, pl. agnar, agnir; [Ulf. <i>ahana</i> = ἄχυρον, Luke iii. 17; A. S. <i>egle</i>; O. H. G. <i>agana;</i> Germ. <i>agen;</i> Dan. <i>avne;</i> Gr. ἄχυρον]:—<i>chaff, husks;</i> safna hveitinu í korn-hlöðu, en agnirnar brenna í eilífum eldi, Luke iii. 17; skilja korn frá ögnum, Eluc. 37; blanda agnar ok sáðir við brauð, … gras ok agnar, … sekki með heyi eðr ögnum, Sks. 73, 74, 89, new Ed.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ogr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ögr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., or better, <strong>augr,</strong> m., mod. Norse <i>auger,</i> a kind of fish, <i>a carp,</i> also called karfi, Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ogr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ögr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an inlet, a small bay</i> or <i>creek,</i> Edda (Gl.); ögrin fógru með vötn ok lón, Eggert.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ogr-stund"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ögr-stund
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. [perh. from ögr, n.], <i>a brief moment,</i> such as is required for crossing a creek; cp. vika and the remarks on that word, a απ. λεγ., Vkv. (fine).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ogra"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ögra
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to tease;</i> in the phrase, ögra e-m með e-u, <i>to tease a person with a thing.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ogur"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ögur
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "in Hbl., read kögur (q. v.), and see Addenda.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/okkla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ökkla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., pl. ökklu, this (like hjarta, lunga, auga) is in good old vellums the constant form, whence mod. <strong>ökli,</strong> a, m.; [A. S. <i>aucleow;</i> Engl. <i>ankle;</i> Germ. <i>enkel;</i> Swed. <i>ankel</i>]:—<i>the ankle;</i> öklu hans ok iljar, Post. (Unger) 24; gögnum fótlegginn við ökklat, Fms. ix. 528 (thus also Fb. iii. 158, l. c.); óðu þeir í ökla (= öklu), Fb. iii. 304; á legginn við ökklat, D. N. iv. 90; fótrinn fyrir ofan ökkla, Nj. 219; jafnhátt ökla, Fb. i. 524; auklun vóru af eiri, leggirnir af silfri, Al. 116; ökla-eldr, Fb. i. 416. <strong>ökla-liðr,</strong> m. <i>an ankle-joint,</i> Gullþ. 75.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/okkr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ökkr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>a lump, heavy clod,</i> also <i>a tumour, protuberance,</i> Fél.; cp. ökvask.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oku-thorr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öku-þórr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., one of the names of Thor, Edda 14, 28, but not found in the poems themselves; the öku- is not to be derived from aka, but is rather of Finnish origin, <i>Ukko</i> being the thunder-god of the Chudic tribes.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/okul-braekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ökul-brækr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(Ísl. ii. 417, Fas. iii. 41) and <strong>ökul-skúaðr</strong> (Fms. ix. 512); better, hökul-brækr, hökul-skúaðr, qq. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/okvask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ökvask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to form a clod</i> or <i>lump;</i> vegrinn blautr ok aukkast (thus the Cod.) leirinn við fætrna, <i>the road was wet, and the loam stuck to the feet,</i> Thom. 359.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/okvinn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ökvinn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>clodded, lumpy;</i> ökkvinn hleifr, Rm. 4 (opp. to hleifa þunna, 28): hleifr þykkr ok ökvinn, þrunginn sáðum, Völsa-þ. <strong>ökvinn-kálfa,</strong> u, f. <i>with the lumpy calves</i> of the bondwoman, Rm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/okvisi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ökvisi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m., see aukvisi, p. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ol-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öl
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., dat. ölvi, gen. pl. ölva; [A. S. <i>ealu;</i> Engl. <i>ale</i>; Dan. <i>öl</i>]:—<i>ale</i>; öl is the general name, used even by the ancients of any intoxicating drink, cp. such phrases as <i>‘ale’-cups heavy with ‘wine,’</i> Am., and in ölvaðr; bjór (q. v.) is a Southern Teutonic word, whence the saying, öl heitir með mönnum en með Ásum bjórr, <i>‘tis called ale among men, beer among the gods,</i> Alm.; of-drykkja öls, … öl alda sona, Hm. 11; öl var drukkit sumt var ólagat, 65; bergja ölvi, Ls. 9: sjálft barsk þar öl, Ls. (prose); því næst var öl inn borit, Eg. 551; er þetta öl var til handa borit, Bs. i. 197; bera öl um eld, Fagrsk. 150; the saying, öl er annarr maðr, Fms. ii. 33, xi. 112; ölit mælti með þeim, Fb. ii. 442: in plur., tveir vóru að hvölfa elfum ölva í iðra sá, Stef. Ól. At banquets women used to serve the cups, in Walhalla the Walkyrja, hence the poets have the compds, <strong>öl-gefn, öl-gefjon, öl-gerðr, öl-nanna, öl-saga, öl-selja,</strong> <i>the goddess, fairy of the ale,</i> i. e. <i>a woman,</i> Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
