        >
          ör-leikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>liberality;</i> fyrir örleiks sakir ok allrar atgörfi, Gullþ. 4, Fms. ii. 242, iv. 370, xi. 203, Sks. 442.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lendask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lendask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "d, <i>to be exiled,</i> Stj. 111; ok örlendz þar, <i>and do emigrate thither,</i> 162.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lendis"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lendis
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>abroad,</i> Gþl. 148; sac erlendis.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lendr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lendr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "see erlendr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-liga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-liga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>largely, abundantly,</i> Fas. i. 213, Sks. 442, Stj. 348.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-ligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-ligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>bountiful;</i> með örligri miskunn, 655 xxx. 11.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lygi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lygi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. another form for örlög, [mid. H. G. <i>urliugi;</i> cp. Dutch <i>orlog</i> = <i>war;</i> whence again mod. Dan. <i>orlog</i> = <i>warfare at sea</i>]:—<i>fate, doom,</i> generally conceived as coming in or by <i>war;</i> heyja eyrlygi, Eg. (in a verse); heyr undr mikit, heyr örlygi (<i>‘hear words of doom’</i>), heyr mál mikit, heyr manns bana! Gísl. 15, (these alliterative words are evidently a fragment of an old lay, see Mr. Dasent’s Transl. p. 30, l. c.) In Edda (Gl.) ‘örlygi’ is entered among the names of <i>‘battles:’</i> in a verse of Bragi, örlygis-draugr, <i>a battle-worker, warrior;</i> these are the only places in which we find the word, while in Dutch and Low Germ. it is common, but see örlög.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lygr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lygr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a pr. name, see the preceding word, Landn.: whence <strong>Örlygs-staðir,</strong> a local name, Sturl.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lyndi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lyndi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t. <i>a bountiful mind;</i> heyrð er bæn þín ok örlyndi, <i>thy prayers and thine ‘alms,’</i> Post. 290 (Acts x. 4); eigi hefir þú enn tapat örlyndinni. Bs. i. 53.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lyndligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lyndligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>relating to charities;</i> ö. boðorð, Hom. (St.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-lyndr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lyndr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>charitable, bounteous, open-handed,</i> Fms. i. 219, ii. 21, Nj. 16, Al. 5, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-laeti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-læti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>liberality, charitableness,</i> Fms. ii. 118.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-log"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-lög
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. [from ör-, = Germ. <i>ur-,</i> and lög; see örlygi], <i>the primal law, fate, weird, doom,</i> = Gr. μοιρα; þær lög lögðu … örlög seggja, Vsp. 20; ek sé Baldri örlög fólgin, 36; örlög sín viti engi fyrir, Hm. 55; þvíat þú öll um sér örlög fyrir, Skv. 1. 28; aldar örlög hygg ek at hón öll viti, Ls. 21, 29; dæma örlög manna, Fas. iii. 32, Edda 8; Nornir ráða örlögum manna, 11; stýra örlögum, Al. 79, 141; urðu þau örlög Hákonar jarls, at Karkr jarl skar hann á háls, Nj. 156; Afríkar skulu nú fá örlög sín, Karl. 366; hann var manna vitrastr svá at hann sá fyrir örlög manna, Nj. 162; spyrja at örlögum sínum, Fs. 19; þat er örlögin höfðu fyrir skipat, Al. 19; drýgja örlög, <i>to ‘dree’ one’s weird,</i> Vkv. 3; er þat líkast at liðin sé mín örlög, <i>my worldly-worked life at an end,</i> Fs. 84; örlög-símu, örlög-þættir, <i>the ‘weird-thrums,’ threads of the Norns</i> spun at one’s birth, Skv. 2. 14, Hkv. 1. 3; örlaga bönd, Skald H. 3. 4. <strong>örlög-lauss,</strong> adj. <i>‘weirdless,’</i> one whose life is still a blank, Vsp. 17; örlaga-nornir, örlaga-dísir (in mod. poetry), <i>the weird-sisters, the Parcae.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-magna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-magna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>quite exhausted, powerless.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-magnask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-magnask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, <i>to be quite exhausted, faint from exhaustion.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-malr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-malr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>an arrow-case, quiver,</i> Fas. ii. 506.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-maligr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-máligr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hasty of speech,</i> Glúm. 364.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-mul"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-mul
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. (mod. <strong>örmull,</strong> m.), [ör- and mol, moli; old Swed. <i>or-mylja</i> = <i>a digger, remover of mark-stones,</i> Schlyter]:—prop. <i>atoms, particles, remnants;</i> at eigi finnisk örmol þeirra, 623. 35; var hón svá vandliga niðr brotin, nema nokkur örmol megi finnask í á þeirri er fellr …, Al. 93; brann upp allt Dana-virki, ok sá engi merki eptir né örmol, <i>no trace nor remnants were seen,</i> Fms. xi. 35; þeir sásk aldri síðan, ok engi örmul fundusk af Háreki, Nj. 279; segisk at enn megi finnask mörk ok örmul af örkinni, Stj. 59; ok sást engi örmul (örmull Cod.) síðan til þess, Ann. 1422.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-maeddr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-mæddr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>utterly exhausted,</i> Fél. iv. 232.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-maelir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-mælir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. = örmalr, <i>a quiver,</i> Barl. 137.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-nefni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-nefni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. [= Germ. <i>ur-name</i>], <i>a local name,</i> prop. <i>an old name,</i> Stj. 394, Brandkr. 61; svá sem örnefni eru við kennd, Fms. i. 241; þeir hendu þrælana fleiri þar sem síðan eru örnefni við kennd, Eg. 596; hét Örlygr á Patrek biskup til landtöku sér, at hann skyldi af hans nafni örnefni gefa þar sem hann tæki land, Landn. 43, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-ordr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-orðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>hasty of speech, frank, out-spoken,</i> Eb. 104, Ó. H. 114, Finnb. 284, Bjarn. 34.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-of-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-óf
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "= örhóf, <i>immensity;</i> örófi vetra áðr væri jörð of sköpuð, Vþm.; öróf manna ok vápna, Mork. 139; ræna örófi fjár, Jomsv. S. ch. 33; öróf fjár, Fas. ii. 538, MS. 656 B.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-reyta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-reyta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to strip utterly;</i> aldrei má ö. dún úr hreiðrum, Fél. iv. 220.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-saudi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-sauði
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>sheepless,</i>, = sauðlauss, Grág. i. 426.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-sekr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-sekr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘sackless,’</i> as a law term, = sykn, <i>‘out of guilt,’ free;</i> en þeir örsekkir er upp halda árum sínum, N. G. L. i. 65; en ef hann kömr á alla staði þá er hann orsækkr (sic), 379, Gþl. 462; at orsekkju, N. G. L. i. 147 (last line); skal hafa eikju hverr er vill at orsekju, 243, ii. 44 (but osekkir two lines below), and so passim in the Norse laws.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-skammi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-skammi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>shameless, unblushing,</i> Al. 87.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-skammr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-skammr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>quite short, quite brief;</i> örskamma stund.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-skemd"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-skemd
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>a great shame, disgrace,</i> Stj. 54, H. E. i. 461; at eigi mætti hans ö. opinber verða, Post. (Unger) 55.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-skipti"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-skipti
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. pl. <i>eccentricity, strange affairs;</i> hence örskipta-maðr, <i>an eccentric, overbearing person,</i> Lv. 27 (cp. the context); inir mestu örskipta menn, <i>violent men,</i> Eb. 110, Fb. i. 250; segja frá nokkurs-konar örskiptum frá kynslum eða undrum, <i>to relate strange things, wonders and marvels,</i> Þiðr. 4.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-skot"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-skot
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. = ördrag, <i>an arrow-shot,</i> of distance, Al. 13, Karl. 286; örskots-lengð, Grág. i. 91. <strong>örskots-helgr,</strong> f. a law phrase, <i>an asylum</i> or <i>sanctuary within arrow-shot.</i> Grág. passim; cp. esp. the interesting record Landn. 5, ch. 4 (287, 288); the örskotshelgr is in Grág. Vsl. ch. 51 set at two hundred (i. e. 240) fathoms.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-skreidr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-skreiðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>swift-sliding,</i> of a ship, Fms. i. 100, iii. 43.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-stiklandi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-stiklandi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>swift-stalking, rapid,</i> Ó. H. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-stuttr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-stuttr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. = örskammr.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-taka"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-taka
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> tók, <i>to take utterly, take all,</i> leaving nothing; en tjald ok kríu ætti við að halda ok ö. aldrei egg þeirra, Fél. iv. 214.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-trod"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-tröð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>an over-stocking</i> of a pasture; ganga í örtröð, see tröð.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-ugga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-ugga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að; örugga sik, <i>to cheer one’s heart, take heart,</i> Pr. 420, Stj. 154.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-uggleikr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-uggleikr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>security, confidence, safety,</i> Stj., Sks. 271, Eluc. 48; traust ok ö., 655 xix. i: <i>fearlessness,</i> Fbr. 20.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-uggliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-uggliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>unfailingly, without fear, boldly,</i> Stj. 151; bað þá fylgjask vel ok ö., Fms. viii. 92, Anecd. 32.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-uggr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-uggr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>‘out of all concern,’ out of danger, safe, secure,</i> Greg. 24, Fms. vi. 152: <i>fearless, undaunted,</i> hugdjarfr sem inn öruggazti berserkr, i. 259; öruggr í framgöngu, vi. 421; verit öruggir ok óttalausir, Ó. H. 240; drengr góðr ok ö. í öllu, Nj. 30, passim.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vasi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vasi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>ör-vasa,</strong> adj. [from ör- and vesa = <i>to be</i>?], prop. <i>decrepit, ‘stone-old,’ worn out;</i> gamall ok örvasi, Glúm. 337, Stj. 225, 548; móður mjök gamla ok örvasa, Fms. i. 76; örvasa af elli, Fb. i. 77; á örvasa aldri, <i>in one’s old age,</i> Fms. ii. 42, Sks. 162 new Ed; enn er Haraldr var orðinn örvasi, Hkr. i. 67; örvasar ok ómagar, N. G. L. i. 180.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vafadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-váfaðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>a waver, shaker of spears and shafts.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-verdr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-verðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>unwordy;</i> hróðrs örverðr, Ad.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-verpi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-verpi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>decrepitude,</i> (from verpa I. 4); in the saying, karli hverjum kemr at örverpi, Fms. iii. 96.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vilna"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vilna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, mod. sounded <strong>örvingla,</strong> [ör- and vil], <i>to despair,</i> with gen.; ö. sér e-s, flestir örvilnuðu sér lífs, <i>they despaired of life,</i> 656 C. 21: chiefly used,",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vilnan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vilnan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "(mod. <strong>örvinglan</strong>), f. <i>despair.</i> Fms. i. 138, Sks. 609, Stj. 51.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vita"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vita
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "and <strong>ör-viti</strong> (<strong>er-vita,</strong> Hkv. l. c.), adj. <i>out of one’s senses, frantic;</i> ærr ok ervita, Hkv. 2. 32; œrr ok örviti, Ls. 21; þá hljóp ek upp örviti, Fms. vii. 158, Mork. 191, l. c.; örvita hræðsla, <i>mad fear,</i> Mar. 1045; hón örvita, Greg. 12; banvænn ok nær örviti, <i>sinking fast and well-nigh senseless,</i> Fms. i. 86; dauðvána ok örviti, vi. 31.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vinan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vínan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>vinegar;</i> drykkiar-ker fullt örvínans, … þá es Jesús hafði tekit örvínan, Hom. St. (John xix. 28 sqq.), now obsolete.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaena"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-væna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "u, f. <i>anything beyond hope;</i> mér er Sveins á engri stundu örvæna, <i>no hour at which I may not expect Sweyn,</i> Orkn. 412 (örvænt, v. l.); margir menn mæla, at eigi sé örvæna at ek koma þar, <i>that it is not past hope, that …, it may well be that …,</i> Ld. 204.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaeni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-væni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. <i>expectation;</i> vissi engi hans nátt stað, ok engi hans örvæni, <i>nobody knew his whereabouts,</i> Fagrsk. ch. 58.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaenliga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vænliga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adv. <i>feignedly;</i> láta örvænliga, sem hann hafi aldri getið sinna eyrinda fyrir þér, <i>to make believe, feign,</i> Fas. iii. 83.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaenn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vænn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>beyond expectation, past hope;</i> fyrir hann var einskis örvænt orðs né verka, <i>anything could be expected from him, he was able to do anything.</i> Ísl. ii. 326; þó er eigi örvænt (<i>‘tis not unlikely</i>) at ek hafa ámæli af konu minni, Nj. 65; eigi er örvænt at skjótt steypi hans ríki, Fms. i. 207.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaenta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vænta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, <i>to despair,</i> with gen., Ísl. ii. 160, Fms. x. 219, 352: enskis ílls örvænti ek fyrir yðr, <i>there is no wicked thing that may not be expected from you,</i> Ísl. ii. 160, freq. in mod. usage.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaentan"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-væntan
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>despair, hopelessness,</i> Mar.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaenting"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vænting
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f. <i>despair.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-vaetta"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-vætta
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "t, = örvænta; örvætta sér sigrs, Fms. x. 352.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-theysir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-þeysir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the swift furtherer,</i> Þd.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-thjadr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-þjáðr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "part. <i>utterly exhausted, worn out.</i> Pass.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-thrasir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-þrasir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>the sturdy, the stubborn</i> (?), the name of an old giant, the father of the Norns, Vþm.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-thrifrada"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-þrifráða
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>without expedients, confounded;</i> Vagn verðr eigi ö., hann ferr um endi-langa Danmörk, Fb. i. 172, O. H. L. 14.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/or-aefi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ör-æfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n., qs. ör-hœfi, Mork. l. c.; in old writers used in sing.; [from its use in old writers it seems as if it were derived from ör- neg. and höfn, <i>a haven</i>]:—<i>an open, harbourless coastland,</i> in old writers used almost exclusively in this sense; fyrir hafnleysis sakir ok öræfis, Landn. 276; ef skip er í öræfi komit, Jb. 381; hann lét göra þar virki ok höfn er áðr var öræfi, Fms. vii. 100; örhœli ok hafnleysur, Mork. l. c.; ok veita strandir þar í mörgum stöðum hafnir er fyrr var örœfi, Sks. 11 new Ed.; sandar, örœfi ok brim mikit fyrir útan, Hkr. i. 229.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ord-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örð
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. arðar, [erja, arði], <i>a crop, produce;</i> örð sér (<i>sows</i>) Yrsu burðar, <i>the crop of the son of Yrsa,</i> i. e. <i>gold,</i> Edda (in a verse); þá á leiguliði einnar arðar mála, … þá á leiguliði tvegeja mála atða, þá örð (not jörð) eina er lands-dróttinn andask á ok aðra næstu eptir, N. G. L. i. 233, Gþl. 329; þat eru þrjár arðir, 314; nú verðr maðr útlagr á jörðu manns. þá skal hann leigu hafa ef úreidd var, ok örð alla rótfasta, N. G. L. i. 40.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ordga"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örðga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [örðigr], <i>to raise, lift up, erect;</i> Drottinn örðgar upp bundna, ok leysir fjötraða, 655 xiii. A. 3; konungr leit yfir lýðinn, örðgaði augum, <i>lifting the eyes,</i> with the notion of a fierce look, Fms. vii. 156 (aurgaði v. l., arþgaði, Mork. 190, l. c.); örðgask upp sem leo, <i>to rise to one’s feet like a lion,</i> Stj. 337.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ordig-skeggi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örðig-skeggi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>örðum-skeggi,</strong> a nickname (cp. bratt-skeggr), Landn., Nj.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ordigr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örðigr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>örðugr,</strong> adj. [Lat. <i>arduus,</i> but not borrowed from that word]:—<i>erect, upright, rising on end, breasting;</i> ríss hestrinn örðigr (<i>rears</i>) undir honum. Fms. xi. 280; selrinn ríss upp örðigr, Bs. i. 335; liggja örðigr við hægindit í sænginni, <i>to lie leaning high against the pillow in the bed,</i> Bs. ii. 320; reisa kistuna örðiga til hálfs, Pr. 413; Höskuldr sneri at Odda örðigum, <i>H. turned breasting O. boldly,</i> Lv. 82; Bersi ferr örðigr ok leggsk hart, <i>B. rose to breast the waves bravely,</i> of a swimmer, Korm. 116: of a ship cutting the waves, Edda (in a verse): of a steep brink, örðugt upp á-móti, <i>hard to breast.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ordug-leiki"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örðug-leiki
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. <i>a difficulty.</i>",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orend-laust"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örend-laust
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>örend-reki,</strong> see eyrendlaust, eyrendreki.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orfi"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örfi
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "or <strong>örvi,</strong> f. [örr, adj.], <i>liberality;</i> ágætr af örfi sinni ok atgervi, Þórð. (1860) 95.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orfuni"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örfuni
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "a, m. [A. S. <i>yrfa</i>], <i>a bull, head of cattle,</i> Edda (Gl.)",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orga-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örga
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, = örðga (q. v.), Hkr. 687 new Ed.; hence prob. per metathesis the mod. ögra, q. v.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orglask"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örglask
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. örðglast, [örðigr], <i>to rise to one’s feet</i> (= örðgast), Fms. iv. 58, Fas. ii. 331, iii. 574, Fb. i. 543, Karl. 191.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ork"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örk
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "f., gen. arkar and erkr, pl. arkir; [A. S. <i>earc, arc;</i> Engl. and Dan. <i>ark</i>]:—<i>an ark, chest;</i> örk ein mikil ok fornlig stóð í elda-húsinu, … örkina, … örkinni, Fær. 186, Eb. ch. 50; örku-fótr, Ó. H. 152; gengr Vígdís inn til erkr þeirrar er Þórðr átti, Ld. 48.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orkn-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örkn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "n. a kind of <i>seal</i>, [cp. Lat. <i>orca,</i> supposed to be the grampus]; sá hón örkn mikit liggja á steini, Bs. i. 335, Bjarn. (in a verse), Edda (Gl.): also called <strong>örkn-selr,</strong> m., Sks. 176, where it is described; perh. the mod. urta, urtu-selr, is corrupted from örkn. <strong>örkn-höfði,</strong> a nickname, Sturl. i. (in a verse).",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, qs. örðla; in the mod. phrase, það örlar á e-u, <i>a thing rises</i> or <i>shews itself,</i> esp. in a bad sense, of enmity, envy, or the like.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ormull"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örmull
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., or sounded <strong>urmull,</strong> = ömul, q. v.; það er enginn örmull eptir af því, <i>not a rag left.</i> <strong>2. urmull</strong> (prob. the same word), a <i>swarm;</i> þar er mesti urmull.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orn"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örn
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m., gen. arnar, dat. erni, pl. ernir, acc. örnu; in mod. usage the word has become fem. örn, arnar, örn, pl. nom. acc. arnir; örn is like björn, an enlarged form from ari, q. v.: [A. S. <i>earn;</i> Chaucer <i>erne;</i> Dan. <i>örn</i>]:—<i>an eagle;</i> erninum, Bs. i. 350; örno ok hrafna, Grág. ii. 346, K. Þ. K. 136; snapir örn á aldinn mar, a saying, Hm. 62; seðja örnu, Hkv. 1. 35; gunni at heyja ok glaða örnu, id.; drúpir örn yfir, Gm.; er á asklimum ernir sitja, Hkv. 2. 48; falla forsar, flýgr örn yfir, Vsp. 58: mythical, örn gól árla, Hkv. Hjörv. 6 (an eagle telling the fate to a young hero): the eagle is the bird of the giants, jötunn í arnarham, Vþm., cp. the legend of giant Þjazi: <strong>arnar-flaug,</strong> f. <i>eagle’s flight,</i> as an ‘omen’ boding battle; nú er arnar-flaug; of vangi, Edda (in a verse): <strong>arnar-leir,</strong> m., Gd. 2; see leir II.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orn-fljotr"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örn-fljótr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "adj. <i>eagle-swift,</i> Rekst.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orna-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örna
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "gen. pl. <i>business;</i> see eyrendi β.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/ornir"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örnir
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. <i>eagle,</i> the name of a giant, Lex. Poët.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/oron"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          öron
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. a kind of fish, <i>a mackerel</i> (?), (= ölun); tunna öron, D. N. iii. 688.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orr-2"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örr
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "<strong>1.</strong> n., later or with a single <i>r,</i> and so in mod. usage; [Dan. <i>ar, arret</i>]:—<i>a scar;</i> ok sá þó á örrit alla æfi, Bs. i. 330; hann þreifaði of örr sára Dróttins, Greg. 14; greri ær (sic) hvít á hvarmum báðum, Hom. 116; mun örr þat sjá á fæti mér meðan ek lifi, Fb. i. 401, Karl. 61; meðal herða honum var örr gróit í kross, Fms. viii. 275 (eyrr, v. l.; aurr, Fb. ii. 636, l. c.); hann hafði örr í andliti, Ld. 274. <strong>örra-beinn,</strong> adj. <i>‘scar-leg,’</i> a nickname, Fs. 128, Landn.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          className="link"
          href="/word/orrek"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örrek
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
