          className="link"
          href="/word/orvandill"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          örvandill
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "m. the name of a giant, see the tale in Edda; the Gr. Ωρίων and the Norse <i>Örvandil</i> may be the same word, their etymology is to be sought for beyond both Greek and Norse; Örvandils tá, <i>the toe of O.,</i> Edda (Örvan-tá, Ub. l. c.); see stjarna.",
            }
          }
        />
