          className="link"
          href="/word/osla"
          onClick={[Function]}
          onMouseEnter={[Function]}
          onTouchStart={[Function]}
        >
          ösla
        </a>
        <p
          dangerouslySetInnerHTML={
            {
              "__html": "að, [akin to vaða-óð, qs. vaðsla or from usli = <i>fire</i> (?)], <i>to wade, splash in water;</i> hón öslar aptr til meginlands, Fas. ii. 182: very freq. in mod. usage, e. g. of children dabbling in water: in poets also of ships, skeiðir úðr undan bar ösluðu súða ljónin, Sig. Breiðf.",
            }
          }
        />
      </li>
      <li>
